text: ['({T}: Add {B} or {R}.)\\nSmoldering Marsh enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\\nCanopy Vista enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R} or {G}.)\\nCinder Glade enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\\nSunken Hollow enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W} or {U}.)\\nPrairie Stream enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures able to block Breaker of Armies do so.', "All creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.\\nAwaken 3—{5}{B}{B} (If you cast this spell for {5}{B}{B}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", "As Ulamog's Despoiler enters the battlefield, you may put two cards your opponents own from exile into their owners' graveyards. If you do, Ulamog's Despoiler enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a colorless creature card from your hand.\\nExile target creature if its power is less than or equal to the revealed card's power.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDestroy target creature.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDraw two cards.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control six or more lands, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.', "Boiling Earth deals 1 damage to each creature your opponents control.\\nAwaken 4—{6}{R} (If you cast this spell for {6}{R}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Converge — Create a 1/1 white Kor Ally creature token for each color of mana spent to cast this spell.', 'Converge — Creatures your opponents control get -X/-0 until end of turn, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.\\nDraw a card.', 'Converge — Draw X cards, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell. Then discard two cards.', 'Converge — Gain control of target creature if its power is less than or equal to the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.', 'Converge — Prism Array enters the battlefield with a crystal counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.\\nRemove a crystal counter from Prism Array: Tap target creature.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Scry 3. (Look at the top three cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Converge — Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell. That creature gains trample until end of turn.', 'Converge — Radiant Flames deals X damage to each creature, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.', 'Converge — Search your library for a creature, instant, or sorcery card with mana value less than or equal to the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell, exile that card, then shuffle. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost.', 'Converge — Tajuru Stalwart enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.', 'Converge — You draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.', 'Counter target instant spell.', "Counter target spell.\\nAwaken 3—{4}{U}{U} (If you cast this spell for {4}{U}{U}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-0.', 'Defender', 'Defender\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.', "Destroy all nonland creatures.\\nAwaken 4—{5}{W}{W}{W} (If you cast this spell for {5}{W}{W}{W}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', "Destroy target creature or planeswalker.\\nAwaken 4—{5}{B}{B} (If you cast this spell for {5}{B}{B}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target tapped creature.\\nAwaken 3—{5}{W} (If you cast this spell for {5}{W}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nAs an additional cost to cast this spell, put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard.\\nProcessor Assault deals 5 damage to target creature.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice From Beyond: Search your library for an Eldrazi card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nChoose one or both —\\n• Return target spell or creature to its owner's hand.\\n• Brutal Expulsion deals 2 damage to target creature or planeswalker. If that creature or planeswalker would die this turn, exile it instead.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nColorless spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nCounter target creature spell with mana value 4 or less. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {4}. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nCreate two 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nCreatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn. Colorless creatures you control also gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nDeathtouch\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\n{3}{U}{B}: Draw a card. Each opponent exiles the top card of their library.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nExile target creature and target land.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nExile target creature with power 3 or less.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nExile target nonbasic land. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for any number of cards with the same name as that land and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlash\\nFlying\\nWhen Ulamog's Nullifier enters the battlefield, you may put two cards your opponents own from exile into their owners' graveyards. If you do, counter target spell.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature.\\nWhenever you sacrifice a creature, draw a card.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Eldrazi Skyspawner enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nWhenever Silent Skimmer attacks, defending player loses 2 life.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nGain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nHaste\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you control no other colorless creatures, return Dust Stalker to its owner's hand.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\nBenthic Infiltrator can't be blocked.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\nOther colorless creatures you control get +1/+0.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\nWhen Dominator Drone enters the battlefield, if you control another colorless creature, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\nWhen Salvage Drone dies, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\n{2}: Sludge Crawler gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nOther colorless creatures you control get +0/+1.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nSerpentine Spike deals 2 damage to target creature, 3 damage to another target creature, and 4 damage to a third target creature. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nSkitterskin can't block.\\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Skitterskin. Activate only if you control another colorless creature.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTap up to two target creatures. Those creatures don\'t untap during their controller\'s next untap step. Create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTarget creature you control fights target creature an opponent controls. If the creature an opponent controls would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTarget opponent exiles a card from their graveyard. You create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."\\nDraw a card.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTarget player reveals their hand. You choose a card from it with mana value 3 or greater and exile that card.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTouch of the Void deals 3 damage to any target. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTrample', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nVile Aggregate's power is equal to the number of colorless creatures you control.\\nTrample\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Blisterpod dies, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Brood Butcher enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."\\n{B}{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Brood Monitor enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Catacomb Sifter enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."\\nWhenever another creature you control dies, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Drowner of Hope enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."\\nSacrifice an Eldrazi Scion: Tap target creature.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Eyeless Watcher enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Incubator Drone enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Mind Raker enters the battlefield, you may put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard. If you do, each opponent discards a card.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Murk Strider enters the battlefield, you may put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard. If you do, return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Ulamog's Reclaimer enters the battlefield, you may put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard. If you do, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Wasteland Strangler enters the battlefield, you may put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard. If you do, target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhenever a land enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, that player exiles the top two cards of their library and you draw two cards.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell, Kozilek's Sentinel gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell, Molten Nursery deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{1}: Target colorless creature gains haste until end of turn.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{1}{G}, Put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player\'s graveyard: Create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{2}, Put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard: Draw a card, then discard a card.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice another colorless creature: Barrage Tyrant deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{2}{U}, Put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard: Tap target creature.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{T}: Nettle Drone deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell, untap Nettle Drone.', "Draw two cards.\\nAwaken 4—{5}{U} (If you cast this spell for {5}{U}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has haste.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -6/-0 and loses flying.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Angelic Gift enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has flying.', 'Endless One enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1.\\nWhenever equipped creature becomes blocked by one or more colorless creatures, it gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature has "{2}, {T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target creature. If a colorless creature is dealt damage this way, tap it."\\nEquip {2}', 'Exile target permanent.', 'Fertile Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Fertile Thicket enters the battlefield, you may look at the top five cards of your library. If you do, reveal up to one basic land card from among them, then put that card on top of your library and the rest on the bottom in any order.\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'First strike\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Ondu Greathorn gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Stasis Snare enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls until Stasis Snare leaves the battlefield. (That creature returns under its owner's control.)", 'Flying', 'Flying, deathtouch\\nWhenever you gain life, Malakir Familiar gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying, first strike\\nWhenever Drana, Liberator of Malakir deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on each attacking creature you control.', 'Flying, haste\\nAkoum Firebird attacks each combat if able.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {4}{R}{R}. If you do, return Akoum Firebird from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Flying\\nConverge — Skyrider Elf enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Akoum Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target. If that land is a Mountain, Akoum Hellkite deals 2 damage instead.', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Wave-Wing Elemental gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, other creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn. If that land is a Swamp, those creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn instead.', "Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, tap target creature an opponent controls. If that land is an Island, that creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may return target nonland permanent card from your graveyard to your hand. If that land is a Plains, you may return that nonland permanent card to the battlefield instead.', 'Flying\\nWhen Angel of Renewal enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life for each creature you control.', 'Flying\\nWhen Courier Griffin enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', "Flying\\nWhen Pilgrim's Eye enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Angelic Captain attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each other attacking Ally.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Windrider Patrol deals combat damage to a player, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.', "Gideon's Reproach deals 4 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.", 'Haste\\nRally — Whenever Munda, Ambush Leader or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may look at the top four cards of your library. If you do, reveal any number of Ally cards from among them, then put those cards on top of your library in any order and the rest on the bottom in any order.', 'Haste\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell.', 'If damage would be dealt to Undergrowth Champion while it has a +1/+1 counter on it, prevent that damage and remove a +1/+1 counter from Undergrowth Champion.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Undergrowth Champion.', "Kor Castigator can't be blocked by Eldrazi Scions.", 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Belligerent Whiptail gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Scythe Leopard gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Snapping Gnarlid gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Territorial Baloth gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Tunneling Geopede deals 1 damage to each opponent.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Valakut Predator gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Create a 1/1 white Kor Ally creature token.\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n• You gain 2 life.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.\\n• Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\n• Target creature can't block this turn.", 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• You may tap or untap target creature.\\n• Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, create a 5/5 red and green Elemental creature token.\\nWhenever Omnath, Locus of Rage or another Elemental you control dies, Omnath deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, create a 3/1 red Elemental creature token with trample and haste. Exile that token at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {3}{G}. If you do, put two +1/+1 counters on Murasa Ranger.', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Looming Spires enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Looming Spires enters the battlefield, target creature gets +1/+1 and gains first strike until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {R}.', "Lumbering Falls enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Lumbering Falls becomes a 3/3 green and blue Elemental creature with hexproof until end of turn. It's still a land.", "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Geyserfield Stalker gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", 'Mortuary Mire enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Mortuary Mire enters the battlefield, you may put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library.\\n{T}: Add {B}.', 'Outnumber deals damage to target creature equal to the number of creatures you control.', "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn by creatures target opponent controls.\\nAwaken 2—{4}{W} (If you cast this spell for {4}{W}, also put two +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.\\nAwaken 4—{4}{W}{U} (If you cast this spell for {4}{W}{U}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", "Put two +1/+1 counters on target permanent.\\nAwaken 4—{6}{G} (If you cast this spell for {6}{G}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Quarantine Field enters the battlefield with X isolation counters on it.\\nWhen Quarantine Field enters the battlefield, for each isolation counter on it, exile up to one target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Quarantine Field leaves the battlefield.', 'Rally — Whenever Chasm Guide or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain haste until end of turn.', "Rally — Whenever Firemantle Mage or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain menace until end of turn. (A creature with menace can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Rally — Whenever Grovetender Druids or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a 1/1 green Plant creature token.', 'Rally — Whenever Hero of Goma Fada or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Kalastria Healer or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Rally — Whenever Kor Bladewhirl or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Kor Entanglers or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, tap target creature an opponent controls.', 'Rally — Whenever Lantern Scout or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Makindi Patrol or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Ondu Champion or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain trample until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Resolute Blademaster or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain double strike until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Tajuru Beastmaster or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Rally — Whenever Tajuru Warcaller or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reckless Cohort attacks each combat if able unless you control another Ally.', 'Return any number of target Ally creature cards with total mana value 8 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\nAwaken 3—{4}{U} (If you cast this spell for {4}{U}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', "Roil's Retribution deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of target attacking or blocking creatures.", 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Sacrifice Felidar Cub: Destroy target enchantment.', 'Sandstone Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sandstone Bridge enters the battlefield, target creature gets +1/+1 and gains vigilance until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', 'Scry X, where X is the highest mana value among permanents you control, then draw three cards.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to three basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. You gain 7 life.', "Shambling Vent enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.\\n{1}{W}{B}: Shambling Vent becomes a 2/3 white and black Elemental creature with lifelink until end of turn. It's still a land.", "Skyline Cascade enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Skyline Cascade enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\\n{T}: Add {U}.", 'Stonefury deals damage to target creature equal to the number of lands you control.', "Take an extra turn after this one. Exile Part the Waterveil.\\nAwaken 6—{6}{U}{U}{U} (If you cast this spell for {6}{U}{U}{U}, also put six +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", "Tap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\\nAwaken 3—{4}{U} (If you cast this spell for {4}{U}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to that creature this turn by colorless sources.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -5/-5 until end of turn.', "Target opponent discards two cards.\\nAwaken 3—{5}{B} (If you cast this spell for {5}{B}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Trample', "Trample\\nHexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Grove Rumbler gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Makindi Sliderunner gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Oran-Rief Hydra. If that land is a Forest, put two +1/+1 counters on Oran-Rief Hydra instead.', 'Until end of turn, colorless creatures you control gain "{T}: This creature deals damage equal to its power to target creature."', 'Up to two target creatures each get +1/+2 until end of turn. You gain 2 life.', "Veteran Warleader's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.\\nTap another untapped Ally you control: Veteran Warleader gains your choice of first strike, vigilance, or trample until end of turn.", 'Vigilance, lifelink\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 40 or more life, you win the game.', 'Vigilance, trample\\nConverge — Woodland Wanderer enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.', 'Vigilance\\nSacrifice two Eldrazi Scions: Return Deathless Behemoth from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only as a sorcery.', "When Aligned Hedron Network enters the battlefield, exile all creatures with power 5 or greater until Aligned Hedron Network leaves the battlefield. (Those creatures return under their owners' control.)", 'When Carrier Thrall dies, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Greenwarden of Murasa enters the battlefield, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.\\nWhen Greenwarden of Murasa dies, you may exile it. If you do, return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Halimar Tidecaller enters the battlefield, you may return target card with awaken from your graveyard to your hand.\\nLand creatures you control have flying.', 'When you cast this spell, create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', 'When you cast this spell, exile two target permanents.\\nIndestructible\\nWhenever Ulamog, the Ceaseless Hunger attacks, defending player exiles the top twenty cards of their library.', 'When you cast this spell, target opponent exiles the top four cards of their library, then you may put any number of land cards that player owns from exile onto the battlefield under your control.', "When you cast this spell, you may put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard. If you do, you gain 5 life.", 'When you cast this spell, you may put two cards your opponents own from exile into their owners\' graveyards. If you do, create three 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When you cast this spell, you may search your library for a colorless creature card with mana value 7 or greater, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.\\nThe first creature spell you cast each turn costs {2} less to cast.', 'Whenever Bane of Bala Ged attacks, defending player exiles two permanents they control.', 'Whenever Zulaport Cutthroat or another creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Whenever a creature attacks this turn, it gains lifelink until end of turn.\\nAwaken 4—{4}{W} (If you cast this spell for {4}{W}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Whenever another creature you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Rot Shambler.', "Whenever equipped creature attacks, you may return a land you control to its owner's hand. If you do, the creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\nEquip {2}", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only Zada, Hedron Grinder, copy that spell for each other creature you control that the spell could target. Each copy targets a different one of those creatures.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control. If you do, that land becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste that's still a land.", 'Whenever you gain life, Kalastria Nightwatch gains flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever you gain life, Nirkana Assassin gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodbond Vampire.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {W}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Your opponents can't cast spells with even mana values. (Zero is even.)\\nYour opponents can't block with creatures with even mana values.", '[+1]: Untap up to one target creature and up to one target land.\\n[−2]: Reveal the top four cards of your library. You may put a creature card and/or a land card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may have it fight target creature." Then create three 8/8 blue Octopus creature tokens.', '[+1]: Until end of turn, Gideon, Ally of Zendikar becomes a 5/5 Human Soldier Ally creature with indestructible that\'s still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn.\\n[0]: Create a 2/2 white Knight Ally creature token.\\n[−4]: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control get +1/+1."', '[+1]: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.\\n[−3]: Destroy target creature.\\n[−8]: Target opponent gets an emblem with "Whenever a player draws a card, you lose 2 life."', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Put two +1/+1 counters on Voracious Null. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}{R}: Lavastep Raider gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{4}{B}: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "{4}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{4}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{8}: Oran-Rief Invoker gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{8}: Valakut Invoker deals 3 damage to any target.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell with mana value 7 or greater, you may sacrifice Sanctum of Ugin. If you do, search your library for a colorless creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Steppe: You gain 2 life for each creature you control.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Fen: Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Gorge: It deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}{U}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Cataract: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{6}, {T}, Sacrifice Spawning Bed: Create three 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an Ally spell.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Ally Encampment: Return target Ally you control to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless spells. Activate only if you control seven or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{W}, {T}: You gain 1 life.']
flavor: ['"A hedron holds magic for a thousand years—or less, if need be."', '"As long as there is a single shred of life, there is hope."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"As long as we have walked this world, we have known it as a harsh and unforgiving place."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"Come on, you twisted things! Don\'t you want to get acquainted?"', '"Despite their bravado, mortals are fragile. If Zendikar is to endure, its lords must save it."\\n—Drana, Kalastria bloodchief', '"Do you see? All of Tazeem strains at its tether."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem roilmage', '"Eldrazi? Ha! Try walking through Zulaport at night with your pockets full. Now *that\'s* dangerous."', '"Even in the hands of amateurs, Nahiri\'s hedrons can harm the Eldrazi."\\n—Ugin', '"Fear of the unknown can be a wonderfully innocent thing, relatively speaking."\\n—Anowon, the Ruin Sage', '"For the lands you have lost and the beauty that remains, for freedom and the future, we must hold nothing back!"\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Great steel is born in the hottest forges. Great soldiers are born in war."', '"Have you ever seen a world fall to its knees? Watch, and learn."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"He told us not to worry, and he walked into the cavern. The swirling mass of Eldrazi parted to admit him, then closed in his wake."\\n—Akiri, kor line-slinger', '"I always thought the great insects of Tazeem were frightening until I saw the Eldrazi. Now I welcome the sight of mantises perched in the treetops."\\n—Ryza, Oran-Rief scout', '"I can give you strength, but you\'ll have to bring your own courage."', '"I can\'t control its mind—I\'m not even sure it has one. But I can dominate its will."', '"I said we should destroy the Eldrazi. Ugin wanted to return them to stasis. Ugin\'s arguments were . . . unconvincing."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"I watched it pass at a distance. When I looked back to my companions, Najet was dead."\\n—Akiri, kor line-slinger', '"I will not live as a slave. If you would be free, then fight alongside me."', '"I will secure my revenge on Zendikar one soul at a time."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"If I die, feed me to a shambler. At least that way I\'ll be doing some good."\\n—Ryza, Oran-Rief scout', '"If you\'re not prepared to fight, you\'d best be prepared to die."', '"In its time of hardship, all of Zendikar cries out in pain. Are you listening?"', '"In my downtime I used to paint the vistas. Now the vistas disappear faster than my downtime."', '"In the dark places of our world, something horrible is growing. I fear our foes may be more numerous than we had imagined."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"It may be unconventional, but I\'ll take any steady mount in a storm."', '"It might fight the Eldrazi, but don\'t mistake it for a companion, Gideon. It\'s not interested in your concept of strength through unity."\\n—Najiya, leader of the Tajuru', '"It\'s hard to find their weak points, but I very much enjoy the discovery process."', '"Kalitas may have returned to mindless servitude beneath the Eldrazi, but we say never again."\\n—Drana, Kalastria bloodchief', '"Later we will mourn those we have lost. First we must end their suffering."\\n—Drana, Kalastria bloodchief', '"Let the vampires join us. In this war, we no longer have the luxury of choosing our comrades."\\n—General Tazri, allied commander', '"May your horns get lodged in an Eldrazi\'s bony face, ornery brute!"\\n—Bruse Tarl, Goma Fada nomad', '"My mount needs neither reins nor bridle. We both share a common purpose."', '"Nissa is not the only one with a deep connection to Zendikar\'s primal elements."\\n—Kiora', '"No matter how big your champion, theirs is bigger. No matter how great your numbers, theirs are greater. No matter how voracious your appetite, they are hungrier. That is why the Eldrazi will win."\\n—Kalitas, thrall of Ulamog', '"No more fear. No more failure. No more death. No more!"', '"No, don\'t! Nal, it\'s me—"', '"Our people and our very lands disappear as if they never were. We no longer fight for glory, or honor. We battle now for the right to exist."\\n—General Tazri, allied commander', '"Over and over it rose. Over and over we fell."\\n—Ganda, Goma Fada deserter', '"Put a minotaur at the head of an army and suddenly all the soldiers act like they have horns."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Quiet now, you dreadful vermin."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem roilmage', '"Quiet the waves? Why would I want to do that?"', '"Sea Gate has fallen. Survivors are on the move. Will send another griffin when we find refuge. Stay hidden. Stay safe."\\n—Message from Tars Olan, kor world-gift', '"She knows every step of this coastline, both above and below the surface, and she has hideouts all along the way. She will get you there."\\n—Jori En, expedition leader', '"Some Eldrazi, their purpose is obvious: suck the life out of the land, birth new Eldrazi. Others aren\'t so obvious, and those are the ones that make me really nervous."\\n—Chadir the Navigator', '"Some detours just aren\'t worth it."\\n—Raff Slugeater, goblin shortcutter', '"Suddenly, Gideon was there with us, clearing the way so that we could escape."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"Take what solace you can in the knowledge that you will not be here to witness Zendikar\'s demise."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"The Eldrazi may not be intimidated, but if it boosts the goblins\' confidence, I see no reason to discourage it."\\n—Jalun, Affa sentry', '"The elements understand better than anyone that actions speak louder than words."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"The land is not dead, merely sick. I will nurse it back to health."', '"The land will not wait for the enemy to arrive."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"The seas are no less imperiled than the dry lands. This fight is mine as much as it is yours."\\n—Kiora, to Gideon Jura', '"The seedlings scream for us to loose them upon the Eldrazi, and we shall oblige."', '"The taste of freedom is sweeter than blood."', '"The wind in one\'s hair, the sun on one\'s back, the joy of open skies . . . the next generation of kor must know this kind of peace."', '"The world was not hostile to us—we were beneath its notice, and presented no danger."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"There are some who have lost everyone and everything. They actively seek out the Eldrazi, eager for the smallest measure of vengeance."\\n—Munda, ambush leader', '"These days, soldiers never stick around long enough for a proper healing. They just want me to knit them up so they can hurry back to the fight."', '"These days, there\'s no shortage of food for the nulls of Guul Draz."\\n—Drana, Kalastria bloodchief', '"They are deadly, and they are loyal. We can spare them a little blood."\\n—Harak, Malakir bloodwitch', '"They come because I call. They stay because I listen."', '"They seek to break us. Let us show them our strength!"', '"This world tires of its long occupation."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"This world will be ruled by its rightful sovereigns, not these hideous pretenders."', '"Time and again, I have demonstrated my skills as a healer. Why, then, are you so ill at ease?"', '"We are nothing but dust to them—our bodies, our actions, even our words."\\n—Jori En, expedition leader', '"We came into this world together. We fight for this world together. We\'ll leave this world together."', '"We came to a place where the skin of Zendikar was peeled back and its bones lay bare to the sky."\\n—Greenweaver Mina', '"We can use their hunger to lead them into danger. If we\'re already prey, we may as well be bait!"\\n—Yon Basrel, Oran-Rief survivalist', '"We returned to the field and found poor Len, every detail of his final moment perfectly cast in that awful dust."\\n—Javad Nasrin, outrider captain', '"Whatever volcanoes dream of, it seems like they always wake up grumpy."\\n—Raff Slugeater, goblin shortcutter', '"When a limb is gangrenous, you cut it off. This is no different."\\n—Greenweaver Mina', '"While we delay, they\'re on the move. They will not wait as we bicker. We are losing this war by moments as our goal slips beyond our reach."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Whiptails can sense a traveler\'s footsteps from a great distance. Measuring that distance has been . . . difficult."\\n—Jalun, Affa sentry', '"With precise coordination and enough blood spilled, one can be driven off, even brought down. But two . . . that\'s a lot of blood."\\n—Munda, ambush leader', '"You have a family. Mine died at Sea Gate. You go to yours, and I\'ll go to mine."', '"You speak to me of the threat of Ulamog. But do not forget: they came as three."\\n—Ugin, to Jace Beleren', '"You\'ve begun to understand the hedrons\' true purpose," said Ugin. "The Eldrazi can be imprisoned.""And how did that work out last time?" asked Jace.', '"Zendikar has given us the weapons to wage war on the appropriate scale."\\n—Najiya, leader of the Tajuru', '"Zendikar is always angry, though I\'ve never seen that anger so precisely directed."\\n—Nablus, North Hada trapper', '"Zendikar will not surrender, and neither can we."', '"Zendikar will triumph this day, and our armies will fly with angels."', "A blisterpod's corpse is a scion's cradle.", "A few bands of kor sought refuge from the Eldrazi in Zendikar's vast cave networks, relying on their ability to survive in harsh vertical landscapes.", 'A force as voracious as time itself.', 'After a battle, it breaks the hillsides into manageable pieces to prepare for next time.', "After many years as a lullmage, Noyan Dar turned his talents from allaying Zendikar's fury to the considerably easier task of rousing it.", 'After watching the kor in battle, Gideon understood the difference between working together and working as one.', 'Akoum can make any intruder look small.', "All of Zendikar's beings sense the upheaval that accompanies the Eldrazi.", 'Also called "pathway stones," hedron shards can immobilize Eldrazi on contact.', "As Ulamog's brood reduces the earth to dust, geopedes burst from their tunnels in search of solid ground.", "As the Eldrazi spread, no secret that could give Zendikar's defenders an advantage was considered too dangerous to seek.", 'As the great scourge passed by, Zendikar shivered, then lay silent.', 'As the hand closed, there was first terror, then numbness, and finally nothingness.', 'As the soldiers beneath her raised their voices, the angel spread her wings, their span seeming to cover the sky.', 'Divining the future is easy when you hold the power to sway it.', "Dust and memory are all that remain in Ulamog's wake.", 'Each time it is sent to find a safe haven, it takes longer to return.', "Eldrazi are not the leopard's preferred prey, but they are better than no prey at all.", "Emrakul has not been seen in months. Though her brood's numbers have dwindled in her absence, each drone is still a deadly threat.", "Every Eldrazi in Ulamog's lineage is an extension of the titan's will.", 'Everyone who could still lift a weapon had a part in retaking Sea Gate.', 'Felidars that make it through their first year of life can easily live to see a hundred years more.', 'For vampires, blood carries more than life. Memories long eroded from the minds of bloodchiefs can be reclaimed from the veins of their sired kin.', 'Goblins were first to see the potential of hedrons in the fight against the Eldrazi, for the magical stones came ready-made with pointy bits.', 'Having gone to the trouble of stealing a bident from a god on another world, Kiora was eager to test its capabilities.', 'Hedron lanterns fend off more than just the darkness.', 'Her connection to the plane restored, Nissa felt the power of Zendikar surge through her.', 'Her rallying cry reaches far beyond the Tajuru elves, inspiring all those who hear it.', "If you can see it, it's too late.", 'In times of infestation and war, Zendikar favors the blades that strike in unison.', 'It consumes any dreams of victory.', "It didn't do much, but the residents of Sea Gate gave it a wide berth all the same.", 'It embodies all possible meanings of the word "infinite."', 'It knows nothing of Eldrazi or Planeswalkers, just that there are new intruders in its territory.', 'It moves through the tunnels as slowly and surely as the shifting stones.', 'It surveys the withering landscape, waiting for a victory only it can see.', 'Like a living organism, Zendikar rids itself of infection, and it does so abruptly and ruthlessly.', 'Mystics of the Stone Havens call upon the spirits of fallen heroes to defend the refuges.', 'Neither subtle nor pretty.', 'Nirkana assassins craft incurable concoctions by mixing basilisk marrow and deathwillow sap with the vital fluids of a dozen other poisonous species.', 'On Murasa, even the trees grow trees.', 'On the continent of Tazeem, rushing waters plunge through narrow canyons into mist-cloaked lakes.', 'On the volcanic continent of Akoum, bizarre vegetation clusters around gas vents, and jagged mountain peaks rise high into the air.', 'Once, water ran here. Now only dust and ash fall from the clifftops.', 'Saved from certain death by the kor, he considers himself bound to them by an unbreakable blood oath.', 'Silence rules Bala Ged, broken only by the skittering of Eldrazi.', 'Some wounds never heal.', 'Terrible fury. Excellent aim.', 'The Eldrazi continue to sweep through the wastes, compounding destruction that already seemed absolute.', "The Eldrazi don't merely extinguish life—they supplant it.", 'The Eldrazi hunger without limit and consume without pause.', 'The Eldrazi may be ruthless, but Zendikar is relentless.', 'The Eldrazi rampaged across Zendikar in a tide of chittering, heaving flesh.', 'The battle served as a grim reminder of what a final victory for the Eldrazi would mean.', "The continent of Bala Ged was ravaged by massive Eldrazi of Ulamog's lineage, its lush jungles and cascading rivers reduced to dust.", 'The continent of Guul Draz is a geothermal swampland reeking of heat and decay.', 'The continent of Murasa lies beneath a blanket of dense vegetation, its enormous branches tangled so thickly that some inhabitants never see the ground.', 'The continent of Ondu is a vast plateau crisscrossed by deep trenches and meandering rivers.', "The elf's blade carved deep into the Eldrazi drone's fleshy lattices. Without a sound, the drone lost equilibrium and tumbled from the sky.", 'The fires of Zendikar are always hungry, and there is much on which they can feed.', 'The gods known to the merfolk as Ula, Emeria, and Cosi were nothing more than false memories of a monstrous trinity: the Eldrazi titans Ulamog, Emrakul, and Kozilek.', 'The high-pitched whirl of a hook is the only battle cry she needs.', "The kor's pride in their independence has given way to a strong sense of community that embraces all of Zendikar.", 'The land is dying, but it will not go peacefully.', 'The last hedron slotted into place, locking Ulamog in an infinite loop of binding energy.', 'The native creatures of Zendikar have adapted to live under rocks and crawl through underbrush in order to avoid the most voracious predators. The Eldrazi have yet to make such adjustments.', 'The only traces it leaves are silent gusts and prodigious amounts of wreckage.', "The refuge's defenses allow new recruits to see lesser Eldrazi up close, steeling their stomachs for what's to come.", 'The tenderness of a mother. The pity of a mantis.', 'The touch of an Eldrazi brings life and death in turn.', 'The unofficial motto of every expedition house is "ready for anything," a phrase whose significance has been amplified since the emergence of the Eldrazi.', 'The wastes spread as quickly as the wind.', 'There are more sights on Zendikar than the eyes can see.', 'They came from all walks of life, from every part of Zendikar, and they returned with one unifying cause.', 'Though Gideon arrived at Sea Gate too late to prevent the massacre, he still had enough time to lead its survivors to relative safety.', 'Though losses run high among the scouts of the Stone Havens, they never flinch from their duty.', 'To survive imminent doom, it sometimes takes a foolhardy soul who acts first and fears later.', "Ulamog's processors trail behind him, converting ruined matter into furious energy.", "Ulamog's progeny swarm the land, draining Zendikar's mana to feed the titan's insatiable hunger.", 'Vastly outnumbered, the Zendikari found creative ways to even the odds.', "Weather on Zendikar is unpredictable—unless you're the one telling it what to do.", 'Whatever it is searching for, it will stop at nothing to find it.', "When Emeria's worshippers learned that she was no more than a twisted memory of Emrakul, they abandoned their temples to the god. The deserted shrines now serve as breeding grounds for the mantas.", "When Malakir's surgeons failed, its death-shamans took over.", 'With a single act of bravery, she went from expendable to indispensable.', 'Working with his noble mount, he notices every form on the horizon, every scent in the air, every tremor in the earth.', 'Young Eldrazi crawl forth from the dust, compelled by a greater will.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Alejandro Mirabal', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Andreas Rocha', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Brad Rigney', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'Jama Jurabaev', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'James Zapata', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Severin Brassell', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Noah Bradley', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Philip Straub', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Ryan Barger', 'Sam Burley', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Tianhua X', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Wesley Burt', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yohann Schepacz', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
