rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If X is 0, you can’t choose any targets.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Rolling Thunder is copied, the copy will retain the original damage divsion. The spell or ability will likely allow you to choose new targets, but you can’t change the way damage is divided.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If some, but not all, of the targets become illegal by the time Rolling Thunder tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies, but no damage is dealt to illegal targets. If all the targets are illegal, the spell won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Rolling Thunder has and how the damage is divided as you cast the spell. Each target must receive at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A card with devoid is just colorless. It\'s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Adverse Conditions tracks the creatures, but not their controller. If either of the creatures changes controllers before its first controller\'s next untap step has come around, then it won\'t untap during its new controller\'s next untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object\'s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it\'s just the new color, not that color and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t get any Eldrazi Scions."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "You can cast Adverse Conditions with no targets. When it resolves, you\'ll get an Eldrazi Scion. However, if you cast Adverse Conditions with any targets and all of those targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t get the Eldrazi Scion in that case."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A card with devoid is just colorless. It\'s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner\'s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object\'s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent\'s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can\'t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating this ability, players can\'t respond until after you have paid its costs and completed activating it. Specifically, no one can try to remove the card from exile to stop you from activating the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it\'s just the new color, not that color and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t get any Eldrazi Scions."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A land that becomes a creature may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature nor when it entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of a spell with awaken), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Lumbering Falls has been made a 0/0 creature with three +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 6/6 creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'This land is colorless until the last ability gives it colors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A land that becomes a creature may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature nor when it entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of a spell with awaken), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Shambling Vent has been made a 0/0 creature with three +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 5/6 creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'This land is colorless until the last ability gives it colors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant. Activating the last ability more than once won\'t cause you to gain additional life if Shambling Vent deals damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A “nonland creature” is a creature that isn\'t also a land."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Awaken doesn\'t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won\'t affect the illegal targets in any way."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn\'t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won\'t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can\'t cast the spell if you can\'t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you\'re casting the spell for its awaken cost)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that\'s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you\'ll get both effects."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Cards that are face down in exile have no characteristics. Such cards can\'t be put onto the battlefield with Oblivion Sower\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Oblivion Sower\'s ability allows you to put any land cards the player owns from exile onto the battlefield, regardless of how those cards were exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Drana\'s last ability triggers after combat damage has been dealt, so only attacking creatures that survive the combat damage step in which Drana deals combat damage will have +1/+1 counters put on them."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "The +1/+1 counter won\'t change how much damage Drana or any other attacking creature with first strike or double strike deals during that combat damage step. However, the +1/+1 counters that are put on attacking creatures without first strike will affect the damage those creatures deal during the regular combat damage step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the target card becomes illegal before the last ability resolves, it won\'t resolve. You can\'t exile Greenwarden of Murasa in that case, even if you want to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "You decide whether to exile Greenwarden of Murasa as the last ability resolves. Players can respond to this ability triggering, but once it starts resolving and you decide to exile Greenwarden of Murasa, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Skyline Cascade\'s triggered ability doesn\'t tap the creature. It can target any creature, tapped or untapped. If that creature is already untapped at the beginning of its controller\'s next untap step, the effect won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "The triggered ability tracks the creature, but not its controller. If the creature changes controllers before its first controller\'s next untap step has come around, then it won\'t untap during its new controller\'s next untap step."}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A colorless creature given first strike by Swarm Surge won’t lose first strike if it stops being colorless later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A creature doesn’t necessarily have to be dealt lethal damage by Serpentine Spike to be exiled. After being dealt damage, if it would die for any reason that turn, it’ll be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Each target must be a different creature. You can’t cast Serpentine Spike without three different creatures available.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If one or two of those targets become illegal by the time Serpentine Spike resolves, you can’t change how much damage will be dealt to the remaining legal targets.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A creature doesn’t necessarily have to be dealt lethal damage by Touch of the Void to be exiled. After being dealt damage, if it would die for any reason that turn, it’ll be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'An Eldrazi card is one with the creature type Eldrazi. Just having “Eldrazi” in its name or being an Eldrazi-themed card doesn’t count.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Barrage Tyrant deals the damage, not the sacrificed creature. For example, if the sacrificed creature had lifelink, you won’t gain life.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Dominator Drone’s last ability checks to see if you control another colorless creature at the moment it enters the battlefield. If you don’t, the ability won’t trigger at all. If you do, the ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If you no longer control another colorless creature, the ability will be removed from the stack and have no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in their library when the ingest ability resolves, nothing happens. That player won’t lose the game (until they have to draw a card from an empty library).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The card exiled by the ingest ability is exiled face up.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Dust Stalker’s last ability checks to see if you control another colorless creature as the end step begins. If you do, the ability won’t trigger. If you don’t, the ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If you somehow control another colorless creature at that time, the ability won’t do anything. You won’t return Dust Stalker to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Dust Stalker’s last ability doesn’t depend on Dust Stalker being colorless. If it gains one or more colors, the ability will still look for another creature you control that’s colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Like most abilities, Dust Stalker’s last ability functions only while Dust Stalker is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The target opponent chooses which card to exile as Grave Birthing resolves.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast Grave Birthing targeting an opponent with an empty graveyard. Even though that player won’t exile a card from their graveyard, you’ll still get an Eldrazi Scion and draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Eldrazi Scion to activate Drowner of Hope’s last ability, not just one created by Drowner of Hope.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice the same permanent to pay two different costs. Notably, if you sacrifice an Eldrazi Scion to activate the last ability of Drowner of Hope, you won’t add {C} to your mana pool.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner’s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent’s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can’t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes illegal before the triggered ability resolves, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t “process” a card in exile.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Players can respond to the triggered ability, but once it starts resolving and you decide whether to put a card from exile into the player’s graveyard, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner’s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent’s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can’t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Players can respond to Processor Assault only after it’s been cast and all of its costs have been paid. No one can try to remove the card from exile to stop you from casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You must put exactly one card an opponent owns from exile into that player’s graveyard to cast Processor Assault. You can’t cast it without doing so, and you can’t put multiple exiled cards into their owners’ graveyards this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner’s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent’s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can’t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Turn Against can target any creature, even one that’s untapped or one you already control.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Herald of Kozilek’s last ability can’t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic component of that mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Herald of Kozilek’s last ability doesn’t change the mana cost or converted mana cost of any spell. It changes only the total cost you actually pay.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a colorless spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you choose the value of X before calculating the spell’s total cost. For example, if that spell’s mana cost is {X}, you could choose 5 as the value of X and pay {4} to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast a spell, or if the cost to cast a spell is increased by an effect, apply those increases before applying cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The cost reduction can apply to alternative costs.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Smothering Abomination is the only creature you control as its first triggered ability resolves, you must sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing Smothering Abomination will cause its last ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You choose which creature you control to sacrifice as the first triggered ability resolves. Players can respond to this ability triggering, but once you choose a creature to sacrifice, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell is returned to its owner’s hand, it’s removed from the stack. The spell isn’t countered, but it won’t resolve. If a copy of a spell is returned to a hand this way, the copy will cease to exist the next time state-based actions are performed.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The second mode will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would be put into the graveyard this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. The exile effect applies to that permanent even if Brutal Expulsion deals no damage to it (due to a prevention effect) or Brutal Expulsion deals damage to a different creature or planeswalker (due to a redirection effect).'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If that player has one card in their library when Sire of Stagnation’s triggered ability resolves, that card will be exiled. If their library has zero cards, no cards are exiled. In both cases, you’ll still draw two cards. That player won’t lose the game (until they attempt to draw a card from an empty library).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The cards are exiled from the library face up.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the creature an opponent controls survives the fight but would die later in the turn for another reason, it will be exiled instead, whether your creature dealt it damage or not.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the creature you control becomes an illegal target (perhaps due to being destroyed by another spell or ability), Unnatural Aggression will resolve, but the target creature an opponent controls will neither deal nor receive any damage. If that creature would die later in the turn for another reason, it will be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in their library when the ingest ability resolves, nothing happens. That player won’t lose the game (until they have to draw a card from an empty library).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability that defines Vile Aggregate’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Vile Aggregate is on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The card exiled by the ingest ability is exiled face up.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in their library when the ingest ability resolves, nothing happens. That player won’t lose the game (until they have to draw a card from an empty library).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The card exiled by the ingest ability is exiled face up.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Once you legally activate the ability, it doesn’t matter what happens to the other colorless creature. The ability will resolve and create a regeneration shield even if you don’t control another colorless creature at that time.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Skitterskin’s activated ability doesn’t depend on Skitterskin being colorless. If it gains one or more colors, you can still activate the ability if you control another creature that’s colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a spell doesn’t change if its controller paid an alternative cost (such as an evoke cost) to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You may leave any cards with that name in the player’s graveyard, hand, or library. You don’t have to exile them.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You must target a creature and a land in order to cast Grip of Desolation. A permanent that’s both a land and a creature can be chosen for both targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A creature that’s an Eldrazi but not a Scion (or vice versa) can block Kor Castigator.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A creature with lifelink dealing combat damage is a single life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, the ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it causes your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Drana’s Emissary or 7 life from Nissa’s Renewal.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If Omnath dies at the same time as any other Elementals you control, Omnath\'s last ability will trigger for each of them (and once for itself)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land\'s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Omanth doesn\'t have the land type Locus."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land\'s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A “nonland permanent card” is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you return an Aura to the battlefield this way, you choose what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. This doesn’t target any player or permanent, so you could attach an Aura to a permanent with hexproof controlled by an opponent, for example. If there’s nothing the Aura can legally enchant, it stays in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Guardian of Tazeem’s landfall ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. If the land that caused it to trigger was an Island, that creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability tracks the creature, but not its controller. If the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step has come around, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Undergrowth Champion is dealt damage from multiple sources at the same time (for example, if it’s blocked by multiple creatures), its prevention effect will apply once to all that damage. You’ll remove only one +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Undergrowth Champion while it has a +1/+1 counter on it, you’ll still remove a +1/+1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, Akoum Firebird is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, Akoum Firebird doesn’t have to attack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Players can respond to the triggered ability, but once it starts resolving and you decide whether to pay {4}{R}{R}, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers only if Akoum Firebird is in your graveyard at the moment the land enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Although Noyan Dar’s ability is very similar to awaken, it is not the same ability. Any card that refers to a “card with awaken” doesn’t include Noyan Dar.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability will resolve before the instant or sorcery spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'An effect that gives a creature -1/-1 is different from putting a -1/-1 counter on that creature. Notably, if the target of Hagra Sharpshooter’s ability has any +1/+1 counters on it, those counters will remain.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'An “Ally spell” is any spell with the subtype Ally. Mana produced by the second ability can’t be spent to pay the costs of abilities of Allies you control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The last ability can only target an Ally on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Any permanent can have a +1/+1 counter put on it. Those counters won’t have any effect unless that permanent is or becomes a creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast Earthen Arms for its awaken cost, a land you control can be both targets.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Stasis Snare leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Stasis Snare’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Stasis Snare leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Check the power of each creature as Aligned Hedron Network’s ability resolves to determine if it’s exiled. It doesn’t matter who controls the creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Aligned Hedron Network exiles multiple creatures, those cards all return to the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Aligned Hedron Network leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, no creatures will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Aligned Hedron Network’s owner leaves the game, the exiled cards will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the cards isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In some very rare situations, Aligned Hedron Network may enter the battlefield as a creature with power 5 or greater. If this happens, Aligned Hedron Network will exile itself along with other creatures with power 5 or greater. Those cards will immediately return to the battlefield. If this causes a loop with Aligned Hedron Network continually exiling and returning itself, the game will be a draw unless a player breaks the loop somehow.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The exiled cards return to the battlefield immediately after Aligned Hedron Network leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanents will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanents will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Quarantine Field exiles multiple permanents, those cards all return to the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Quarantine Field leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, no permanents will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Quarantine Field’s owner leaves the game, the exiled cards will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the cards isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The exiled cards return to the battlefield immediately after Quarantine Field leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Use the number of isolation counters on Quarantine Field as its triggered ability is put on the stack to determine how many targets you may choose. Once the targets are chosen, the number of targets the ability has is locked in. Changing the number of isolation counters on Quarantine Field won’t change how many nonland permanents are exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Encircling Fissure prevents all combat damage that would be dealt by any creature controlled by the target opponent, even if that creature wasn’t on the battlefield or wasn’t a creature as Encircling Fissure resolved.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Exiling Part the Waterveil is part of its effect. If Part the Waterveil doesn’t resolve, including if it was cast for its awaken cost and the land you control became an illegal target, it will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast Rising Miasma for its awaken cost, creatures will get -2/-2 before the land you targeted is turned into a creature. Unless it was already a land creature before Rising Miasma started resolving, it won’t get -2/-2.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Ondu Rising creates a delayed triggered ability. Any creature that attacks that turn will cause that ability to trigger, including creatures controlled by a teammate and creatures you didn’t control or that didn’t exist as Ondu Rising resolved. Notably, this includes the land creature created if Ondu Rising is cast for its awaken cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Rush of Ice can target a creature that’s already tapped. It still won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Rush of Ice tracks the creature, but not its controller. If the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step has come around, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Awaken doesn’t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t affect the illegal targets in any way.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn’t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won’t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can’t cast the spell if you can’t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you’re casting the spell for its awaken cost).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that’s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you’ll get both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards exiled by Ulamog’s first and third abilities are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the player has less than twenty cards in their library, exile all of them. That player won’t lose the game until they have to draw a card from an empty library.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Ulamog’s first ability resolves independently of Ulamog once they’ve both been put on the stack. If Ulamog is countered, that triggered ability will still resolve. That triggered ability will always resolve before Ulamog does.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Check the creature’s power as Exert Influence resolves to see if it’s less than or equal to the number of colors spent to cast Exert Influence. If it’s greater, Exert Influence will finish resolving with no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Once you’ve gained control of a creature with Exert Influence, it doesn’t matter what happens to its power. Raising it won’t cause the control-changing effect to end.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can’t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can’t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Check the target creature’s power as Titan’s Presence resolves to see if it’s less than or equal to revealed creature card’s power. If it’s greater, Titan’s Presence will finish resolving with no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The colorless creature card stays revealed until Titan’s Presence leaves the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The colorless creature card you reveal doesn’t have to still be in your hand as Titan’s Presence resolves. If it’s not, use its power as it last existed in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Conduit of Ruin’s last ability can’t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic component of that mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Conduit of Ruin’s last ability doesn’t change the mana cost or converted mana cost of any spell. It changes only the total cost you actually pay.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Conduit of Ruin’s last ability will look at the entire turn, even if Conduit of Ruin wasn’t on the battlefield for some of it. Notably, if you cast Conduit of Ruin in a turn, then no other creature spell you cast that turn can be your first.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the first creature spell you cast in a turn has converge, you can’t ignore the cost reduction of Conduit of Ruin’s last ability in order to spend more colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the first creature spell you cast in a turn has {X} in its mana cost, you choose the value of X before calculating the spell’s total cost. For example, if the first creature spell you cast in a turn has a mana cost of {X}{G}, you could choose 2 as the value of X and pay {G} to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast a spell, or if the cost to cast a spell is increased by an effect, apply those increases before applying cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you control more than one Conduit of Ruin, the last ability of each of them applies only to the first creature spell you cast each turn, not to different spells; the first creature spell you cast each turn will cost {4} less.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The cost reduction can apply to alternative costs (such as dash costs).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The first creature spell you cast each turn doesn’t necessarily have to be the first spell you cast. You could cast a sorcery spell and then cast a creature spell that would get the discount.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures you control as Outnumber resolves to determine how much damage Outnumber deals.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures you control as the ability resolves to determine how much life you gain. Angel of Renewal will count toward this number if it’s still on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures you control as the last ability resolves to determine how much life to gain.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Count the number of lands you control as Stonefury resolves to determine how much damage is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Count the number of other attacking Allies as the ability resolves to determine the size of the bonus. Attacking Allies controlled by a teammate will count toward this total.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Once the ability resolves, the bonus won’t change later in the turn, even if the number of other attacking Allies does.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Effects that increase or reduce the cost to cast a spell don’t affect that spell’s converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'For creatures on the battlefield with {X} in their mana costs, the value for X is 0. Mistcutter Hydra (a creature with mana cost {X}{G}) could block, but Endless One could not.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine if the spell’s converted mana cost is even or not. For example, your opponent could cast Endless One (with mana cost {X}) with X equal to 5, but not with X equal to 6.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a face-down creature spell or a face-down creature is 0. Void Winnower will stop face-down creature spells from being cast and face-down creatures from blocking.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Yes, your opponent can’t even. We know.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner’s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent’s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can’t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner’s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent’s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can’t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Felidar Sovereign’s triggered ability checks to see if you have 40 or more life as your upkeep begins. If you don’t, the ability won’t trigger at all. If you do, the ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If you don’t have 40 or more life at that time, the ability won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, your life total is the same as your team’s life total. As such, the ability triggers if your team has 40 or more life.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Gideon’s first ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human, Soldier, and Ally. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: planeswalker is only a type (not a creature type), and Human, Soldier, and Ally are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Gideon’s first ability doesn’t count as a creature entering the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Specifically, your rally abilities won’t trigger. (Of course, Gideon’s second ability will cause rally abilities to trigger.)'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Gideon becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any).'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon after his first ability has resolved, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Bane of Bala Ged attacks a planeswalker, the defending player may exile that planeswalker. Bane of Bala Ged will still be attacking and may be blocked as normal. If it’s not blocked, it won’t deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the defending player controls only one permanent, that permanent will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The permanents are exiled before blockers are chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If X is 0, you won’t scry at all. Any abilities that trigger whenever you scry won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Use the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control as Ugin’s Insight resolves to determine how many cards you scry.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature can’t legally block Breaker of Armies but could block another attacking creature, it may do so. Likewise, if a creature the defending player controls can’t block Breaker of Armies unless its controller pays a cost, its controller may decline to pay that cost and block a different attacking creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If more than one Breaker of Armies is attacking, the controller of each creature that could block them chooses which one that creature blocks. In this case, creatures that can block multiple creatures must block as many attacking Breaker of Armies as possible.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare blockers step, a creature the defending player controls is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having it block, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, the creature doesn’t have to block.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature with a rally ability enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other Allies, that ability will trigger once for each of those creatures and once for the creature with the ability itself.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Multiple instances of menace on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When an Ally enters the battlefield under your control, each rally ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature with a rally ability enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other Allies, that ability will trigger once for each of those creatures and once for the creature with the ability itself.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Vigilance matters only as attackers are declared. Giving a creature vigilance after that point won’t untap it, even if it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When an Ally enters the battlefield under your control, each rally ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature with a rally ability enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other Allies, that ability will trigger once for each of those creatures and once for the creature with the ability itself.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When an Ally enters the battlefield under your control, each rally ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant. There usually isn’t much benefit in having the rally ability resolve more than once in a turn, other than that new creatures will be affected by the ability resolving an additional time.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a creature with a rally ability enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other Allies, that ability will trigger once for each of those creatures and once for the creature with the ability itself.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When an Ally enters the battlefield under your control, each rally ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as awaken costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery card this way, it goes to your graveyard as normal. It doesn’t return to exile.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast the exiled card, you do so as part of the resolution of Bring to Light. You can’t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) are not.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you don’t cast the card, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can’t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can’t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can\'t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can\'t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana."}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can’t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can’t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast Roilmage’s Trick even if your opponents control no creatures. You’ll simply draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can’t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can’t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can choose any value for X. The value chosen for X doesn’t directly affect the number of +1/+1 counters Skyrider Elf enters the battlefield with, but it does let you pay more mana and thus spend more colors of mana to cast it. For example, you can choose 0 for the value of X and pay {G}{U} to cast Skyrider Elf for two +1/+1 counters. You can also choose 3 for the value of X, making its mana cost {3}{G}{U}, and pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} for five +1/+1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can’t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can’t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If an effect gives the enchanted creature flying after Tightening Coils became attached to it, the creature will have flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If some, but not all, of the targets become illegal by the time Roil’s Retribution tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies, but no damage is dealt to illegal targets. If all the targets are illegal, the spell won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Roil’s Retribution has and how the damage is divided as you cast the spell. Each target must receive at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, that player doesn’t control another Ally but Reckless Cohort is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having Reckless Cohort attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If they don’t, Reckless Cohort doesn’t have to attack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Reckless Cohort can attack if you control another Ally. It just isn’t forced to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Reckless Cohort checks whether you control another Ally as attacking creatures are declared. At that time, if you don’t, Reckless Cohort attacks if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Lithomancer’s Focus will prevent damage to the creature from any colorless source that turn, even if that source didn’t exist or wasn’t colorless as Lithomancer’s Focus resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Mana produced by Beastcaller Savant can be spent on any part of a creature spell’s total cost, including additional costs (such as kicker costs) and alternative costs (such as dash costs). It can’t be spent to pay the costs of abilities of creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Mana produced by Beastcaller Savant can’t be used to activate an ability or cast an instant or sorcery spell that creates creature tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Putting a land onto the battlefield this way is not the same as playing a land. Swell of Growth doesn’t affect how many lands you can play from your hand during your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability that defines Veteran Warleader’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Veteran Warleader is on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'To activate the last ability, you can tap any other untapped Ally you control, including one that hasn’t been under your control since the beginning of your most recent turn. (Note that ability doesn’t use the tap symbol.)'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Vigilance matters only as attackers are declared. Giving a creature vigilance after that point won’t untap it, even if it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You choose which ability Veteran Warleader gains as the last ability resolves, not as you activate it.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The emblem created by Ob Nixilis Reignited’s last ability is both owned and controlled by the target opponent. In a multiplayer game, if you own Ob Nixilis Reignited and use him to give one of your opponents an emblem, the emblem remains even if you leave the game.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'With Kiora’s second ability, you could put no cards, a creature card, a land card, or a creature card and a land card into your hand.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can activate Kiora’s first ability with no targets just to put a loyalty counter on her.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You will have the emblem by the time the Octopus creature tokens enter the battlefield—they’ll be looking to fight!'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You can cast Tandem Tactics with no targets. When it resolves, you’ll gain 2 life. However, if you cast Tandem Tactics with any targets and all of those targets are illegal as it tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain 2 life in that case.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'You don’t have to reveal a basic land card from among the five cards you look at, even if one is there. If you don’t, you won’t put a card on top of your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Inspired Charge is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get +2/+1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Activating Coralhelm Guide\'s ability after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Any creature you control that couldn\'t be targeted by the original spell (due to shroud, protection abilities, targeting restrictions, or any other reason) is just ignored by Zada\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Rolling Thunder does), the copies have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copies will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery spell that has multiple targets, but it\'s targeting only Zada with all of them, Zada\'s ability will trigger. The copies will similarly each be targeting only one of your other creatures. You can\'t change any of the copy\'s targets to other creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The copies that the ability creates are created on the stack, so they\'re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (like Zada\'s ability itself) won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'You control all the copies. You choose the order the copies are put onto the stack. The original spell will be on the stack beneath those copies and will resolve last.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Zada\'s ability triggers whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only Zada and no other object or player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Angelic Gift tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another creature you control dies at the same time as Zulaport Cutthroat, its ability triggers for that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'Once you begin to cast Bone Splinters, no player may take actions until you’re done. Notably, opponents can’t try to remove the creature you wish to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abgeklärte Vögtin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {W} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann dir Stärke verleihen, aber Mut musst du selbst mitbringen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05d194d8-a73d-442a-a4b4-7c46a0a81bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 402925}, \'multiverseid\': 402925}, {\'name\': \'Protectora serena\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {W}. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo puedo darte fuerza, pero el valor tendrás que ponerlo tú".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7148c74-04b4-4c0e-91cb-a12a62029739\', \'multiverseId\': 405018}, \'multiverseid\': 405018}, {\'name\': \'Intendante sereine\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {W}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Je peux vous rendre plus fort, mais le courage ne peut venir que de vous. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cdac561-0bca-4586-ba39-49a2002ddfab\', \'multiverseId\': 403224}, \'multiverseid\': 403224}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana Serena\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {W}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso donarvi la forza, ma il coraggio dovrete procurarvelo da soli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'978276fc-737d-4290-aba2-b8cedf32402b\', \'multiverseId\': 403523}, \'multiverseid\': 403523}, {\'name\': \'物静かな使用人\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは{W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「体力は私が面倒みる。勇気は自分でなんとかしてね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2608da-3b42-414d-93fc-3c5ba8239125\', \'multiverseId\': 403822}, \'multiverseid\': 403822}, {\'name\': \'고요한 간사\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 당신은 {W}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"당신께 힘을 드릴 수 있어요. 하지만 당신의 용기를 보여 줘야 해요."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50b7af6-ff6a-42d0-ac62-d08c83ed27fb\', \'multiverseId\': 404121}, \'multiverseid\': 404121}, {\'name\': \'Guardião Sereno\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {W}. Se fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu posso lhe dar força, mas você precisa trazer sua própria coragem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f032f2-ea2c-4e0c-ace6-5a99fe592b3c\', \'multiverseId\': 404420}, \'multiverseid\': 404420}, {\'name\': \'Невозмутимая Служительница\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, вы можете заплатить {W}. Если вы это делаете, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Я могу наделить тебя силой, но смелость ты должен найти в себе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5771b8b-4e73-43f5-90c6-aa92e52c2ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 404719}, \'multiverseid\': 404719}, {\'name\': \'安详监管人\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{W}。若你如此作，则在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我能赋予你力量，但你得具备勇气。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d5984a-7856-470d-bcf0-52835e1faeda\', \'multiverseId\': 402327}, \'multiverseid\': 402327}, {\'name\': \'安詳監管人\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，你可以支付{W}。若你如此作，則在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／僧侶／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我可以賦予你力量，但你必須具備勇氣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'523f717b-7f6e-4bf7-bcf4-d119249fbd4f\', \'multiverseId\': 402626}, \'multiverseid\': 402626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkömmling von Emrakul\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Verursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Emrakul wurde seit Monaten nicht gesehen. Doch auch wenn seine Bruten in seiner Abwesenheit weniger geworden sind, so bleibt doch jede einzelne Drohne eine tödliche Bedrohung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402986&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d83bc4f-2655-415d-a7f7-52f94e2c4d8b\', \'multiverseId\': 402986}, \'multiverseid\': 402986}, {\'name\': \'Vestigio de Emrakul\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Arrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Hace meses que nadie ve a Emrakul. Aunque las filas de su especie han mermado desde su ausencia, cada zángano sigue siendo una amenaza letal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba92c107-0f46-4288-82d2-f3ae514b2f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 405079}, \'multiverseid\': 405079}, {\'name\': "Vestige d\'Emrakul", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Piétinement", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Cela fait des mois que personne n\'a vu Emrakul. Sa progéniture a beau avoir décliné en son absence, chaque drone représente toujours une menace mortelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403285&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc240e0-8561-45d3-84ac-3806b95ef167\', \'multiverseId\': 403285}, \'multiverseid\': 403285}, {\'name\': \'Vestigio di Emrakul\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Travolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "Sono passati mesi dall\'ultimo avvistamento di Emrakul. Anche se le file della sua covata si sono assottigliate in sua assenza, ogni parassita costituisce ancora una minaccia mortale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f745b853-94e6-4922-b43c-db26d052747c\', \'multiverseId\': 403584}, \'multiverseid\': 403584}, {\'name\': \'エムラクールの名残\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）トランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'エムラクールは何ヶ月も目撃されていない。その間に血統の数は減ったが、ドローンがいまだ脅威であることに変わりはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b7ac56-d919-4bb5-a76d-f69c389a4897\', \'multiverseId\': 403883}, \'multiverseid\': 403883}, {\'name\': \'엠라쿨의 잔재\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)돌진\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'엠라쿨이 지난 몇 달간 보이지 않았다. 엠라쿨이 자리를 비운 사이 그녀의 새끼들 수는 줄었지만, 드론들은 여전히 매우 위협적인 존재이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6e0f513-7f76-41db-9bb2-4b3031e3c021\', \'multiverseId\': 404182}, \'multiverseid\': 404182}, {\'name\': \'Vestígio de Emrakul\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Atropelar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'Emrakul não é vista há meses. Embora sua linhagem tenha diminuído em número em sua ausência, cada zangão ainda é uma ameaça mortal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61318be1-4e3a-4560-9600-4332af28713a\', \'multiverseId\': 404481}, \'multiverseid\': 404481}, {\'name\': \'Частица Эмракул\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Пробивной удар\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Эмракул не видели уже много месяцев. За это время численность ее выводка сократилась, но каждый дрон все еще несет смертельную опасность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c42e7e-30aa-46ee-9748-1fb23d0cca28\', \'multiverseId\': 404780}, \'multiverseid\': 404780}, {\'name\': \'伊莫库残肢\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）践踏\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'伊莫库已有多月未现身。虽然她孳生的巢群数量在日渐减少，但每一个奴兽都是致命的威胁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50149d13-5dbc-4a5d-81cd-6d8133418745\', \'multiverseId\': 402388}, \'multiverseid\': 402388}, {\'name\': \'伊莫庫殘肢\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）踐踏\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'伊莫庫已有數月未現身。雖然她孳生的巢群數量在日漸減少，但每一個奴獸都是致命的威脅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26bdd15d-3a43-45cf-9328-2e5cab3dc97d\', \'multiverseId\': 402687}, \'multiverseid\': 402687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Elfenklinge drang tief in das Fleisch der Eldrazi-Drohne. Lautlos trudelte die Drohne aus dem Gleichgewicht und stürzte vom Himmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f125e0-9d3a-444f-b2f1-aaacc8e3491b\', \'multiverseId\': 402894}, \'multiverseid\': 402894}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La hoja del elfo penetró profundamente en las carnes membranosas del zángano eldrazi. Sin emitir sonido alguno, el zángano perdió el equilibrio y cayó de los cielos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b334cf91-1cd6-4aff-8a8d-751ec038f9ea\', \'multiverseId\': 404987}, \'multiverseid\': 404987}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La lame de l\'elfe se planta profondément dans le treillis charnu du drone. Sans un bruit, celui-ci perdit l\'équilibre et tomba du ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14350e0a-78b2-4edd-9a50-6f6c130ca500\', \'multiverseId\': 403193}, \'multiverseid\': 403193}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "La lama elfica si conficcò profondamente nei reticoli carnosi del parassita Eldrazi. Senza un suono, il parassita perse l\'equilibrio e cadde dal cielo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b6e007-ef67-4c1f-af21-9d9b3aaf7929\', \'multiverseId\': 403492}, \'multiverseid\': 403492}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'そのエルフが刃をドローンのゴム状組織に深く刺し入れると、均衡を崩したドローンは音もなく空から落下した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1615c4f-057c-45d5-a83a-84c982660a54\', \'multiverseId\': 403791}, \'multiverseid\': 403791}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'엘프의 칼날이 엘드라지 드론의 격자 무늬 살을 깊숙이 파고 들었다. 드론은 소리 없이 균형을 잃고 하늘에서 추락했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acfb9b22-e014-403f-b77e-7c02e31a8d54\', \'multiverseId\': 404090}, \'multiverseid\': 404090}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A lâmina da elfa penetrou fundo na trama carnosa do zangão Eldrazi. Sem um som sequer, o zangão perdeu o equilíbrio e caiu dos céus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64690ce8-80e9-47fa-b9df-27c81aee4a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 404389}, \'multiverseid\': 404389}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Клинок эльфа оставил глубокий разрез в кожистых перепонках дрона Эльдрази. Не издав ни звука, дрон, кувыркаясь, обрушился вниз.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f55b2fd-d80e-4a1a-8ef8-d489750d7d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 404688}, \'multiverseid\': 404688}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'妖精的利刃深深地刺入奥札奇奴兽的肉身格栅。奴兽悄无声息地失去平衡，从天落下。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'033868aa-29f9-4519-96e2-16228f9febde\', \'multiverseId\': 402296}, \'multiverseid\': 402296}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'妖精的利刃深深地刺入奧札奇奴獸的肉身格柵。奴獸悄無聲息地失去平衡，從天落下。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e58d56-3590-45f5-b32d-e9e7171cf6f6\', \'multiverseId\': 402595}, \'multiverseid\': 402595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akoum-Feuervogel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, EileDer Akoum-Feuervogel greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {4}{R}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe den Akoum-Feuervogel aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402701&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61044f35-d406-4def-a0a1-4bcc7b6c11cb\', \'multiverseId\': 402701}, \'multiverseid\': 402701}, {\'name\': \'Pájaro de fuego de Akoum\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.El Pájaro de fuego de Akoum ataca cada turno si puede.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {4}{R}{R}. Si lo haces, regresa el Pájaro de fuego de Akoum de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f3a4879-8c37-4fed-97e0-0325f778bc2f\', \'multiverseId\': 404794}, \'multiverseid\': 404794}, {\'name\': "Oiseau de feu d\'Akoum", \'text\': "Vol, céléritéL\'Oiseau de feu d\'Akoum attaque à chaque tour si possible.Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {4}{R}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez l\'Oiseau de feu d\'Akoum sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403000&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bc92d54-23a2-4a1f-9dcf-333a626193e3\', \'multiverseId\': 403000}, \'multiverseid\': 403000}, {\'name\': \'Pirofenice di Akoum\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapiditàLa Pirofenice di Akoum attacca ogni turno, se può farlo.Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {4}{R}{R}. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia la Pirofenice di Akoum dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Fenice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d4d437-d344-410e-a989-efdb5cd149ab\', \'multiverseId\': 403299}, \'multiverseid\': 403299}, {\'name\': \'アクームの火の鳥\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻毎ターン、アクームの火の鳥は可能なら攻撃する。上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{4}{R}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からアクームの火の鳥を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d91d8cfa-a41a-401c-b5e6-9b65a8b88b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 403598}, \'multiverseid\': 403598}, {\'name\': \'아쿰 불새\', \'text\': \'비행, 신속아쿰 불새는 가능하면 매 턴마다 공격한다.대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {4}{R}{R}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 아쿰 불새를 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 불사조\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a46f5b5-a87e-4327-a69a-3ebafe8d9343\', \'multiverseId\': 403897}, \'multiverseid\': 403897}, {\'name\': \'Pássaro de Fogo de Akoum\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpetoPássaro de Fogo de Akoum ataca a cada turno se estiver apto.Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {4}{R}{R}. Se fizer isso, devolva Pássaro de Fogo de Akoum de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fênix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e71c4e52-d928-4f75-a5ce-025272a73e30\', \'multiverseId\': 404196}, \'multiverseid\': 404196}, {\'name\': \'Акумская Огненная Птица\', \'text\': \'Полет, УскорениеАкумская Огненная Птица атакует в каждом ходу, если может.Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {4}{R}{R}. Если вы это делаете, верните Акумскую Огненную Птицу из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Феникс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4888a61-679d-4580-a51f-0bccd27a7193\', \'multiverseId\': 404495}, \'multiverseid\': 404495}, {\'name\': \'阿库姆火鸟\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷阿库姆火鸟每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{4}{R}{R}。若你如此作，则将阿库姆火鸟从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～凤凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e375170-0a47-4b74-9e65-b5b41cd83fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 402103}, \'multiverseid\': 402103}, {\'name\': \'阿庫姆火鳥\', \'text\': \'飛行，敏捷阿庫姆火鳥每回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{4}{R}{R}。若你如此作，則將阿庫姆火鳥從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳳凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dbce17a-fd36-47df-84a1-7eda40a73c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 402402}, \'multiverseid\': 402402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akoum-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'FliegendLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt der Akoum-Höllendrache einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Falls das Land ein Gebirge ist, fügt der Akoum-Höllendrache dieser Kreatur oder diesem Spieler stattdessen 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402702&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e347fd-469b-4bd7-adbe-346b276a51f9\', \'multiverseId\': 402702}, \'multiverseid\': 402702}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Akoum\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Engendro de Akoum hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Si esa tierra es una montaña, en vez de eso, el Engendro de Akoum hace 2 puntos de daño a esa criatura o a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e82aacc-9622-46da-8896-7f60c11e11a7\', \'multiverseId\': 404795}, \'multiverseid\': 404795}, {\'name\': "Escouflenfer d\'Akoum", \'text\': "VolToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, l\'Escouflenfer d\'Akoum inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur. Si ce terrain est une montagne, l\'Escouflenfer d\'Akoum inflige 2 blessures à cette créature ou à ce joueur à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403001&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50217035-4ae9-484e-b352-4442a66ae8ea\', \'multiverseId\': 403001}, \'multiverseid\': 403001}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Akoum\', \'text\': \'VolareTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Nibbio Infernale di Akoum infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Se quella terra è una Montagna, il Nibbio Infernale di Akoum infligge invece 2 danni a quella creatura o a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b69b6f-0bdc-4b40-b234-2aea889d9d55\', \'multiverseId\': 403300}, \'multiverseid\': 403300}, {\'name\': \'アクームのヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。アクームのヘルカイトはそれに１点のダメージを与える。その土地が山であるなら、代わりにアクームのヘルカイトはそのクリーチャーかプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'015ca859-8879-415d-b32d-e293d6391a44\', \'multiverseId\': 403599}, \'multiverseid\': 403599}, {\'name\': \'아쿰 지옥룡\', \'text\': \'비행대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 아쿰 지옥룡은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 그 대지가 산이면, 아쿰 지옥룡은 대신에 그 생물 또는 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9e1c8d-601a-442a-9a17-000e20355603\', \'multiverseId\': 403898}, \'multiverseid\': 403898}, {\'name\': \'Dragoa Avérnea de Akoum\', \'text\': \'VoarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Dragoa Avérnea de Akoum causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo. Se o terreno for uma Montanha, em vez disso, Dragoa Avérnea de Akoum causa 2 pontos de dano àquela criatura ou àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cedf80cd-7e5b-4ecb-a8af-1144a1d88e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 404197}, \'multiverseid\': 404197}, {\'name\': \'Акумский Змей\', \'text\': \'ПолетЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Акумский Змей наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку. Если та земля является Горой, вместо этого Акумский Змей наносит 2 повреждения тому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f49364-e574-40c7-92e5-76eedfbb51a9\', \'multiverseId\': 404496}, \'multiverseid\': 404496}, {\'name\': \'阿库姆残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，阿库姆残虐者对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。若该地是山脉，则改为阿库姆残虐者对该生物或牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140dac7b-7383-4dd2-8145-2dfd543674ee\', \'multiverseId\': 402104}, \'multiverseid\': 402104}, {\'name\': \'阿庫姆殘虐者\', \'text\': \'飛行地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，阿庫姆殘虐者對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。若該地是山脈，則改為阿庫姆殘虐者對該生物或玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'263574e7-3d0f-4037-99a9-c9c2e176c0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 402403}, \'multiverseid\': 402403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akoum-Steinweckerin\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe einen 3/1 roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel, der Trampelschaden verursacht und Eile hat. Schicke diesen Spielstein zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402703&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65085c84-9d19-477f-9fb6-dee25db8635a\', \'multiverseId\': 402703}, \'multiverseid\': 402703}, {\'name\': \'Despiertatierra de Akoum\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {2}{R}. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Elemental roja 3/1 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa. Exilia esa ficha al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63051a43-b1c3-42a2-90b0-7397dad53d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 404796}, \'multiverseid\': 404796}, {\'name\': "Éveilroc d\'Akoum", \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {2}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 3/1 rouge Élémental avec le piétinement et la célérité. Exilez ce jeton au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403002&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cea007e6-147c-4998-a229-a84a9b486bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 403002}, \'multiverseid\': 403002}, {\'name\': \'Suscitapietre di Akoum\', \'text\': "Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {2}{R}. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Elementale 3/1 rossa con travolgere e rapidità. Esilia quella pedina all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e433fe3e-90d2-4be8-b852-d7247f5834ee\', \'multiverseId\': 403301}, \'multiverseid\': 403301}, {\'name\': \'アクームの石覚まし\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{2}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の３/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a62f87c8-de7f-4afc-8c0f-94d1acf5f167\', \'multiverseId\': 403600}, \'multiverseid\': 403600}, {\'name\': \'아쿰 바위술사\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {2}{R}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 돌진과 신속을 가진 3/1 적색 정령 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 토큰을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd977e15-b1eb-4fac-852e-274f29dc4406\', \'multiverseId\': 403899}, \'multiverseid\': 403899}, {\'name\': \'Desperta-pedra de Akoum\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {2}{R}. Se fizer isso, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura vermelha 3/1 do tipo Elemental com atropelar e ímpeto. Exile aquela ficha no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b5e41f-ed00-409b-a1c9-2dc289f2d832\', \'multiverseId\': 404198}, \'multiverseid\': 404198}, {\'name\': \'Акумская Пробудительница Камней\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {2}{R}. Если вы это делаете, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 3/1 красный Элементаль с Пробивным ударом и Ускорением. Изгоните ту фишку в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea6795e-01d2-439b-b3a7-55a0865eb1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 404497}, \'multiverseid\': 404497}, {\'name\': \'阿库姆醒岩师\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{2}{R}。若你如此作，则将一个3/1红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的元素衍生生物放进战场。在下一个结束步骤开始时，放逐该衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902f2d3e-9b0f-4b8c-b580-7436ce5398ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402105}, \'multiverseid\': 402105}, {\'name\': \'阿庫姆醒岩師\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{2}{R}。若你如此作，則將一個3/1紅色，具踐踏與敏捷異能的元素衍生生物放進戰場。在下一個結束步驟開始時，放逐該衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3186a5be-9dfd-40dd-b665-7e7d69019316\', \'multiverseId\': 402404}, \'multiverseid\': 402404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführer des Untergangs\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Zehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)Andere farblose Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402915&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'300dd5e8-fcf7-46e7-b85b-3ed5afad37ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402915}, \'multiverseid\': 402915}, {\'name\': \'Guía de la perdición\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)Las demás criaturas incoloras que controlas obtienen +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e34e75-f20e-4455-b3cd-7aefeda4d7f5\', \'multiverseId\': 405008}, \'multiverseid\': 405008}, {\'name\': \'Guide de ruine\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Ingestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)Les autres créatures incolores que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae92a44-2ac4-4475-bc2c-b2891fd08b18\', \'multiverseId\': 403214}, \'multiverseid\': 403214}, {\'name\': \'Guida della Distruzione\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ingerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)Le altre creature incolori che controlli prendono +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3e113cc-d873-402a-9c89-018195a9d7cf\', \'multiverseId\': 403513}, \'multiverseid\': 403513}, {\'name\': \'破滅を導くもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）あなたがコントロールする他の無色のクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eee82ac-f42c-4fe3-89dd-e07047a6d7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 403812}, \'multiverseid\': 403812}, {\'name\': \'파멸의 길잡이\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)당신이 조종하는 다른 무색 생물들은 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb8a0dcd-de4f-4fee-bb40-625101975fad\', \'multiverseId\': 404111}, \'multiverseid\': 404111}, {\'name\': \'Guia Ruinoso\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ingerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)As outras criaturas incolores que você controla recebem +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adadc65c-397b-4a91-8a95-cb2fcba2c80b\', \'multiverseId\': 404410}, \'multiverseid\': 404410}, {\'name\': \'Проводник Гибели\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Заглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)Другие бесцветные существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35949348-d0a6-4a40-af25-de46bda7ee15\', \'multiverseId\': 404709}, \'multiverseid\': 404709}, {\'name\': \'毁灭向导\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）由你操控的其他无色生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d71407-29ff-439d-a458-a19a54ea20a4\', \'multiverseId\': 402317}, \'multiverseid\': 402317}, {\'name\': \'毀滅嚮導\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）由你操控的其他無色生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45319595-28e8-4775-a073-bb1e7f6c5707\', \'multiverseId\': 402616}, \'multiverseid\': 402616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffslustiger Peitschenschwanz\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Angriffslustige Peitschenschwanz Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'„Peitschenschwänze können die Schritte von Reisenden über große Entfernungen spüren. Diese Entfernungen zu messen erwies sich als … schwierig."—Jalun, Wachposten in Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5baab00-3258-46ac-b248-545132cb5999\', \'multiverseId\': 402714}, \'multiverseid\': 402714}, {\'name\': \'Colalátigo beligerante\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Colalátigo beligerante gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'"Los colalátigos pueden oír los pasos de un viajero a gran distancia. Medir exactamente a cuánto ha resultado... complicado".—Jalun, centinela de Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a9fd36-0afb-4c0d-9c60-baa81f6da6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 404807}, \'multiverseid\': 404807}, {\'name\': \'Queue en fouet belligérant\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Queue en fouet belligérant acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "« Les queues en fouet peuvent détecter les pas d\'un voyageur à une grande distance. Mesurer cette distance s\'est avéré... compliqué. »—Jalun, sentinelle d\'Affa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403013&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'300c07ed-fc96-47b9-950b-a5dedcee5921\', \'multiverseId\': 403013}, \'multiverseid\': 403013}, {\'name\': \'Codafrusta Bellicoso\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Codafrusta Bellicoso ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'"I codafrusta possono percepire i passi di un viandante da una distanza notevole. Misurare con esattezza questa distanza si è rivelato... difficile."—Jalun, sentinella di Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac54392-86e7-4b8a-96a7-97e9fa81a3a3\', \'multiverseId\': 403312}, \'multiverseid\': 403312}, {\'name\': \'好戦的な鞭尾\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、好戦的な鞭尾は先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'「鞭尾は旅人の足音をとても遠くから聞き分ける。どれくらい遠くかというと……よくわからない。」――アーファの歩哨、ジャルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43cae92e-d670-46c5-bd48-5a21442b0cff\', \'multiverseId\': 403611}, \'multiverseid\': 403611}, {\'name\': \'적대적인 꼬리채찍\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 적대적인 꼬리채찍은 턴종료까지 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': \'"꼬리채찍은 아주 먼 거리에서도 여행자의 발자국 소리를 들을 수 있어. 그 거리를 정확히 가늠하긴 . . . 매우 어려워."—아파 보초병 잘런\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ddaafd-0cb6-4345-90d3-3c5c7f7083a2\', \'multiverseId\': 403910}, \'multiverseid\': 403910}, {\'name\': \'Cauda-de-chicote Belicoso\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Cauda-de-chicote Belicoso ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'"Os caudas-de-chicote conseguem sentir os passos de um viajante a uma grande distância. Medir essa distância tem sido... difícil."— Jalun, sentinela de Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b03697e4-8b38-4b34-a200-522338309ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 404209}, \'multiverseid\': 404209}, {\'name\': \'Воинственный Кнутохвост\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Воинственный Кнутохвост получает Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': \'«Кнутохвосты могут почувствовать шаги путника на огромном расстоянии. Точно измерить это расстояние оказалось... сложной задачей».— Джалун, стражник из Аффы\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'649e85b3-a593-47c0-b600-84759a8e03c3\', \'multiverseId\': 404508}, \'multiverseid\': 404508}, {\'name\': \'好斗鞭尾亚龙\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，好斗鞭尾亚龙获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'「鞭尾亚龙可以感知远方旅人的脚步。具体能感知多远...实在是很难测算。」～艾法哨兵佳伦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa13994-0eb6-4397-8144-d936a258f586\', \'multiverseId\': 402116}, \'multiverseid\': 402116}, {\'name\': \'好鬥鞭尾亞龍\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，好鬥鞭尾亞龍獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': \'「鞭尾亞龍可以感知遠方旅人的腳步。至於能感知到多遠...實在是很難測量。」～艾法哨兵佳倫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87f998b-ca73-4b8e-9ccb-f834bc3c9c56\', \'multiverseId\': 402415}, \'multiverseid\': 402415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ans Licht bringen\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturen-, Spontanzauber- oder Hexerei-Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um Ans Licht bringen zu wirken. Schicke die Karte ins Exil und mische danach deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402728&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f71c3b-410a-4824-84ab-1a58fe974b00\', \'multiverseId\': 402728}, \'multiverseid\': 402728}, {\'name\': \'Traer a la luz\', \'text\': \'Converger — Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura, instantáneo o conjuro con coste de maná convertido menor o igual a la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar Traer a la luz. Exilia esa carta y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6813fb-2d98-4a01-9527-b316b3aec634\', \'multiverseId\': 404821}, \'multiverseid\': 404821}, {\'name\': \'Éclater au grand jour\', \'text\': "Convergence — Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature, d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal au nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer Éclater au grand jour, exilez cette carte, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b027d0d3-f308-48b5-9299-7f36d9bbea11\', \'multiverseId\': 403027}, \'multiverseid\': 403027}, {\'name\': \'Portare alla Luce\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura, istantaneo o stregoneria con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore al numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare Portare alla Luce, esilia quella carta, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af4fd56-6364-464c-8beb-7f47fb533fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 403326}, \'multiverseid\': 403326}, {\'name\': \'白日の下に\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― あなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストが白日の下にを唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚かインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カードを１枚探し、そのカードを追放し、その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。あなたはそのカードを、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe5b4e8d-9c1e-4a22-8acf-2b168e8560bd\', \'multiverseId\': 403625}, \'multiverseid\': 403625}, {\'name\': \'빛을 보다\', \'text\': \'화합 — 당신의 서고에서 전환마나비용이 빛을 보다를 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수 이하인 생물, 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드 한 장을 찾아, 그 카드를 추방한 다음, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cabb8822-aad4-4c8c-85f6-fc433c96e261\', \'multiverseId\': 403924}, \'multiverseid\': 403924}, {\'name\': \'Trazer à Luz\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Procure em seu grimório um card de criatura, mágica instantânea ou feitiço com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior ao número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Trazer à Luz, exile aquele card e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce295fef-8f0c-42b6-ad39-cb0867d49c9e\', \'multiverseId\': 404223}, \'multiverseid\': 404223}, {\'name\': \'Залить Светом\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту существа, мгновенного заклинания или волшебства с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не больше, чем число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Залить Светом, изгоните ту карту, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36f2bf36-6e00-45c5-a8c0-b530c338d60a\', \'multiverseId\': 404522}, \'multiverseid\': 404522}, {\'name\': \'得见天光\', \'text\': \'聚辉～从你的牌库中搜寻一张生物、瞬间或法术牌，且其总法术力费用须等于或小于施放得见天光时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量，放逐该牌，然后将你的牌库洗牌。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62da37f1-2f9d-487b-916c-2ff93e58e7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 402130}, \'multiverseid\': 402130}, {\'name\': \'得見天光\', \'text\': \'聚輝～從你的牌庫中搜尋一張生物、瞬間或巫術牌，且其總魔法力費用須等於或小於施放得見天光時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量，放逐該牌，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d27591-5d17-472e-a814-de6dd5512fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 402429}, \'multiverseid\': 402429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Antizipieren\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zukunft vorauszuahnen ist einfach, wenn man die Macht besitzt, sie zu beeinflussen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402710&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9580a659-deec-4100-acfd-ae2c65a306ca\', \'multiverseId\': 402710}, \'multiverseid\': 402710}, {\'name\': \'Anticipar\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Adivinar el futuro no tiene misterio cuando posees el poder para sojuzgarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd948ef5-2081-4826-8d74-a068b3da6c39\', \'multiverseId\': 404803}, \'multiverseid\': 404803}, {\'name\': \'Anticipation\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Prédire l\'avenir est une chose aisée quand on a le pouvoir de l\'influencer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403009&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'045f2c1d-d533-446f-a5d7-c657436a1fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 403009}, \'multiverseid\': 403009}, {\'name\': \'Anticipare\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi una di quelle carte alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Prevedere il futuro è facile quando possiedi il potere di influenzarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c1c2f3-c472-415c-9d9a-fc3ccbd13cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 403308}, \'multiverseid\': 403308}, {\'name\': \'予期\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'影響力を持つ者にとって、未来の予測は簡単である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691fce27-9bf3-4cc3-b2f7-7ab646ca7c80\', \'multiverseId\': 403607}, \'multiverseid\': 403607}, {\'name\': \'예측\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'미래를 지배할 힘이 있다면 미래를 점치는 일은 어렵지 않다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf41391-b95b-4e3e-a83f-098914095f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 403906}, \'multiverseid\': 403906}, {\'name\': \'Antecipar\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Prever o futuro é fácil quando se tem o poder de alterá-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf482c9e-0d35-4006-bce2-17ad7309f1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 404205}, \'multiverseid\': 404205}, {\'name\': \'Предвосхищение\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Предсказывать будущее легко, если в твоих силах изменить его.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060d0a26-38d2-4bfa-8277-aa3fd7e04994\', \'multiverseId\': 404504}, \'multiverseid\': 404504}, {\'name\': \'预先考虑\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'当你握有支配未来的能力时，预测便信手拈来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a74526dd-b2d0-4297-bbb3-3e3dfb984d64\', \'multiverseId\': 402112}, \'multiverseid\': 402112}, {\'name\': \'預先考慮\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'當你握有支配未來的能力時，預測便信手拈來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f20884f-4269-46bd-8fee-7bce503419ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402411}, \'multiverseid\': 402411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufleben Ondus\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur in diesem Zug angreift, erhält sie Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.Erwecken 4 — {4}{W} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {4}{W} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8680b3-486d-4db5-bf32-bce0b1f78d09\', \'multiverseId\': 402873}, \'multiverseid\': 402873}, {\'name\': \'Sublevación de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura ataque este turno, gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.Despertar 4—{4}{W}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {4}{W}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f38d27f2-1b70-4f17-818f-352e9754fc46\', \'multiverseId\': 404966}, \'multiverseid\': 404966}, {\'name\': \'Éveil du Ondou\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature attaque ce tour-ci, elle acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.Éveil 4 — {4}{W} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {4}{W}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307b13f1-99a3-42fe-a414-2660296426e2\', \'multiverseId\': 403172}, \'multiverseid\': 403172}, {\'name\': \'Ascesa di Ondu\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura attacca in questo turno, ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.Risveglio 4—{4}{W} (Se lanci questa magia per {4}{W}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fc5d9ee-c924-4122-892a-1ebdd8b1e9ed\', \'multiverseId\': 403471}, \'multiverseid\': 403471}, {\'name\': \'オンドゥの蜂起\', \'text\': \'このターン、クリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。覚醒４―{4}{W}（この呪文を{4}{W}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49093600-1b2d-49c0-8a0d-0ee9100e378d\', \'multiverseId\': 403770}, \'multiverseid\': 403770}, {\'name\': \'온두 봉기\', \'text\': \'이번 턴에 생물이 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 생명연결을 얻는다.각성 4—{4}{W} ({4}{W}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b4c7bb-ada3-441d-9278-668fd7528509\', \'multiverseId\': 404069}, \'multiverseid\': 404069}, {\'name\': \'Ascensão de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura ataca neste turno, ela ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.Despertar 4 — {4}{W} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {4}{W}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800d516d-1cbb-43c6-915f-220e976c65ad\', \'multiverseId\': 404368}, \'multiverseid\': 404368}, {\'name\': \'Подъем Онду\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо атакует в этом ходу, оно получает Цепь жизни до конца хода.Пробуждение 4 — {4}{W} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {4}{W}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8785c87-8b88-4b89-9536-d0b7ef3822a4\', \'multiverseId\': 404667}, \'multiverseid\': 404667}, {\'name\': \'昂度奔扬\', \'text\': \'本回合中，每当一个生物攻击时，它获得系命异能直到回合结束。醒转4～{4}{W}（如果你支付{4}{W}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2012eb7-f7ad-4082-9938-bf222485a278\', \'multiverseId\': 402275}, \'multiverseid\': 402275}, {\'name\': \'昂度奔揚\', \'text\': \'本回合中，每當一個生物攻擊時，它獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。醒轉4～{4}{W}（如果你支付{4}{W}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ed3fe53-dcce-4f6e-ad38-442f1cfcc87f\', \'multiverseId\': 402574}, \'multiverseid\': 402574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufseherin aus Guul Draz\', \'text\': \'FliegendLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls das Land ein Sumpf ist, erhalten diese Kreaturen stattdessen +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bef2d779-164c-472c-9033-02adf0430fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 402804}, \'multiverseid\': 402804}, {\'name\': \'Supervisora de Guul Draz\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Si esa tierra es un pantano, en vez de eso, esas criaturas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b823b8-9e5f-4065-95dd-2e76cc6b9472\', \'multiverseId\': 404897}, \'multiverseid\': 404897}, {\'name\': \'Brigadière de Guul Draz\', \'text\': "VolToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si ce terrain est un marais, ces créatures gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403103&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c7a640-c349-4830-9029-18b15b71faec\', \'multiverseId\': 403103}, \'multiverseid\': 403103}, {\'name\': \'Sovrintendente di Guul Draz\', \'text\': \'VolareTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Se quella terra è una Palude, quelle creature prendono invece +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc59520-6a16-4de9-85a6-761c6a7cac16\', \'multiverseId\': 403402}, \'multiverseid\': 403402}, {\'name\': \'グール・ドラズの監視者\', \'text\': \'飛行上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。その土地が沼であるなら、代わりに、ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a164cb30-0789-4849-aa48-79930f8ae820\', \'multiverseId\': 403701}, \'multiverseid\': 403701}, {\'name\': \'굴 드라즈 감독관\', \'text\': \'비행대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다. 그 대지가 늪이면, 그 생물들은 대신에 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0202d6c-e196-4db5-a2e8-ce9316d5f13a\', \'multiverseId\': 404000}, \'multiverseid\': 404000}, {\'name\': \'Supervisora de Guul Draz\', \'text\': \'VoarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 até o final do turno. Se o terreno for um Pântano, em vez disso, aquelas criaturas recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'027d66d4-ea2a-4d4a-817f-9eb3fa435a70\', \'multiverseId\': 404299}, \'multiverseid\': 404299}, {\'name\': \'Надзирательница из Гуул-Драза\', \'text\': \'ПолетЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, другие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0 до конца хода. Если та земля является Болотом, те существа получают +2/+0 до конца хода вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50bb4bdc-2362-4e4d-954f-ba4631aee9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 404598}, \'multiverseid\': 404598}, {\'name\': \'古坠兹督军\', \'text\': \'飞行地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。若该地是沼泽，则改为这些生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01f5e8e-8131-4d61-90ab-d98946b5d0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 402206}, \'multiverseid\': 402206}, {\'name\': \'古墜茲督軍\', \'text\': \'飛行地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。若該地是沼澤，則改為這些生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf779351-6129-4438-8e50-6c7c63a3166c\', \'multiverseId\': 402505}, \'multiverseid\': 402505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufsteigendes Miasma\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.Erwecken 3 — {5}{B}{B} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{B}{B} wirkst, lege außerdem drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2c90a57-20f4-4f27-8d69-3760b159e54f\', \'multiverseId\': 402908}, \'multiverseid\': 402908}, {\'name\': \'Se avecina el miasma\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.Despertar 3—{5}{B}{B}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{B}{B}, pon además tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf0291f-5a32-49ff-bea9-863633e64c77\', \'multiverseId\': 405001}, \'multiverseid\': 405001}, {\'name\': \'Miasmes ascendants\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.Éveil 3 — {5}{B}{B} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{B}{B}, mettez aussi trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9220bbb8-b2e8-4ccf-96c3-4b0f111f3e70\', \'multiverseId\': 403207}, \'multiverseid\': 403207}, {\'name\': \'Miasma Ascendente\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.Risveglio 3—{5}{B}{B} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{B}{B}, metti anche tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d29823e1-8642-4fd9-940c-2e86587a9705\', \'multiverseId\': 403506}, \'multiverseid\': 403506}, {\'name\': \'湧き上がる瘴気\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。覚醒３―{5}{B}{B}（この呪文を{5}{B}{B}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4016727a-9409-4a8b-80d8-48da196be6e3\', \'multiverseId\': 403805}, \'multiverseid\': 403805}, {\'name\': \'치솟는 독안개\', \'text\': \'모든 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.각성 3—{5}{B}{B} ({5}{B}{B}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410cfc8f-b62d-4e1c-9b37-bcb7355eca1c\', \'multiverseId\': 404104}, \'multiverseid\': 404104}, {\'name\': \'Miasma Ascendente\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.Despertar 3 — {5}{B}{B} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{B}{B}, coloque também três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ee336d0-ac8c-439e-8c65-c8fd546ee8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 404403}, \'multiverseid\': 404403}, {\'name\': \'Клубящиеся Миазмы\', \'text\': \'Все существа получают -2/-2 до конца хода.Пробуждение 3 — {5}{B}{B} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{B}{B}, также положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c93e9b6-a61c-4178-9435-96c8f6c2d0a7\', \'multiverseId\': 404702}, \'multiverseid\': 404702}, {\'name\': \'扬起沼气\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。醒转3～{5}{B}{B}（如果你支付{5}{B}{B}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49436b30-7a27-44cb-9aa8-e7c8ab17a3ad\', \'multiverseId\': 402310}, \'multiverseid\': 402310}, {\'name\': \'揚起沼氣\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。醒轉3～{5}{B}{B}（如果你支付{5}{B}{B}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ceb834f-7f9d-44a7-a22a-6b1038d91f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 402609}, \'multiverseid\': 402609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge der Pilger\', \'text\': \'FliegendWenn das Auge der Pilger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'Jedes Mal, wenn es losgeschickt wird, einen Zufluchtsort zu finden, vergeht mehr Zeit bis zu seiner Rückkehr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78aa1995-42a9-461a-9711-79952188be7f\', \'multiverseId\': 402881}, \'multiverseid\': 402881}, {\'name\': \'Ojo del peregrino\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Cuando el Ojo del peregrino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Cada vez que lo envían a buscar un lugar seguro, tarda más en regresar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9399c3-3213-4d3a-8052-84747f42fc71\', \'multiverseId\': 404974}, \'multiverseid\': 404974}, {\'name\': \'Œil du pèlerin\', \'text\': "VolQuand l\'Œil du pèlerin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "Quand il est envoyé à la recherche d\'un refuge, il met chaque fois plus de temps à revenir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c01ef4ce-80ba-4f2e-bd60-35def356bc24\', \'multiverseId\': 403180}, \'multiverseid\': 403180}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Pellegrino\', \'text\': "VolareQuando l\'Occhio del Pellegrino entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla tua mano e rimescolare il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni volta che viene inviato a cercare un rifugio sicuro, impiega sempre di più a tornare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b62ae6b9-05b7-4a1d-a133-0fe2b3cceb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 403479}, \'multiverseid\': 403479}, {\'name\': \'巡礼者の目\', \'text\': \'飛行巡礼者の目が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'避難所を探して戻るまでの時間が、その度に長くなっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'988dc3fb-0d84-41ef-9e4f-f3646df042e6\', \'multiverseId\': 403778}, \'multiverseid\': 403778}, {\'name\': \'순례자의 눈\', \'text\': \'비행순례자의 눈이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 날틀\', \'flavor\': \'안전한 피난처를 찾으러 보낼 때마다, 돌아오는 데 더 오래 걸린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319e83e6-d183-4575-aab6-83c2e115e1a8\', \'multiverseId\': 404077}, \'multiverseid\': 404077}, {\'name\': \'Olho do Peregrino\', \'text\': \'VoarQuando Olho do Peregrino entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo na sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'A cada vez que é enviado para encontrar um refúgio seguro ele demora mais para voltar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3e89891-e0bd-4659-a4ac-0de3292776ea\', \'multiverseId\': 404376}, \'multiverseid\': 404376}, {\'name\': \'Око Пилигрима\', \'text\': \'ПолетКогда Око Пилигрима выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, показать ее, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Топтер\', \'flavor\': \'С каждым разом, когда его посылали на поиски безопасного убежища, ему требовалось все больше времени.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670ad577-4065-47e0-b699-e11001b03944\', \'multiverseId\': 404675}, \'multiverseid\': 404675}, {\'name\': \'朝圣客之眼\', \'text\': \'飞行当朝圣客之眼进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～振翼机\', \'flavor\': \'每次派它去寻找安全的庇护地，它都要更长的时间才能回来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f42d69-5835-449a-ac88-db497d57c5e5\', \'multiverseId\': 402283}, \'multiverseid\': 402283}, {\'name\': \'朝聖客之眼\', \'text\': \'飛行當朝聖客之眼進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～振翼機\', \'flavor\': \'每次派它去尋找安全的庇護地，它都要更長的時間才能回來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af62efb5-9576-4c48-9302-94a0184c064e\', \'multiverseId\': 402582}, \'multiverseid\': 402582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Jenseits\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Bringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."{1}{G}, opfere Aus dem Jenseits: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Eldrazi-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a58de60f-b07f-4c44-b26c-75336e9fed50\', \'multiverseId\': 402790}, \'multiverseid\': 402790}, {\'name\': \'Desde el más allá\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".{1}{G}, sacrificar Desde el más allá: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Eldrazi, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcaac7e1-b307-47c4-96c9-96698790f7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 404883}, \'multiverseid\': 404883}, {\'name\': "Aux portes de l\'au-delà", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Au début de votre entretien, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »{1}{G}, sacrifiez Aux portes de l\'au-delà : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'eldrazi, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5df0f28-0092-4a5d-a28e-911c2815647f\', \'multiverseId\': 403089}, \'multiverseid\': 403089}, {\'name\': \'Da Altrove\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)All\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".{1}{G}, Sacrifica Da Altrove: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Eldrazi, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b9d734-c60f-41d7-8f8f-19605d6f1abb\', \'multiverseId\': 403388}, \'multiverseid\': 403388}, {\'name\': \'彼方より\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）あなたのアップキープの開始時に、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。{1}{G}, 彼方よりを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーからエルドラージ・カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f3ab272-a924-4dfd-855b-e2e5073e82ee\', \'multiverseId\': 403687}, \'multiverseid\': 403687}, {\'name\': \'저편의 존재\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신의 유지단 시작에, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.{1}{G}, 저편의 존재를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 엘드라지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d20f66-5adc-4fb7-bd84-5861ea6166ce\', \'multiverseId\': 403986}, \'multiverseid\': 403986}, {\'name\': \'Do Além\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)No início de sua manutenção, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".{1}{G}, Sacrifique Do Além: Procure um card do tipo Eldrazi em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe o seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbf61d48-89a3-48ed-b4ff-05bf61216e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 404285}, \'multiverseid\': 404285}, {\'name\': \'С Той Стороны\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)В начале вашего шага поддержки положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».{1}{G}, пожертвуйте С Той Стороны: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Эльдрази, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b268db90-fe1b-42da-aef4-d0f587fc609c\', \'multiverseId\': 404584}, \'multiverseid\': 404584}, {\'name\': \'异境造物\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）在你的维持开始时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」{1}{G}，牺牲异境造物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张奥札奇牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'871da5ec-a17b-4f96-b40c-8550d1e5ad95\', \'multiverseId\': 402192}, \'multiverseid\': 402192}, {\'name\': \'異境造物\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）在你的維持開始時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」{1}{G}，犧牲異境造物：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張奧札奇牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f0b959-8481-48ea-8d61-e5485c3ff217\', \'multiverseId\': 402491}, \'multiverseid\': 402491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausdünner der Leere\', \'text\': \'Deine Gegner können keine Zaubersprüche mit geraden umgewandelten Manakosten wirken. (Null zählt als gerade.)Deine Gegner können nicht mit Kreaturen mit geraden umgewandelten Manakosten blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Hast du jemals gesehen, wie eine ganze Welt auf die Knie fällt? Sieh zu und lerne."—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'446d425e-f572-4655-8b02-be58b7c782d0\', \'multiverseId\': 402990}, \'multiverseid\': 402990}, {\'name\': \'Aventador del vacío\', \'text\': \'Tus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos con costes de maná convertidos pares. (Cero es par.)Tus oponentes no pueden bloquear con criaturas que tengan costes de maná convertidos pares.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Alguna vez has visto derrumbarse un mundo entero? Mira y aprende".—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a230c980-ea17-45b8-8aa4-7be43c5b5d46\', \'multiverseId\': 405083}, \'multiverseid\': 405083}, {\'name\': \'Vanneur du vide\', \'text\': \'Vos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts avec un coût converti de mana pair. (Zéro est pair.)Vos adversaires ne peuvent pas bloquer avec des créatures ayant un coût converti de mana pair.\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'« Avez-vous déjà vu un monde se mettre à genoux ? Regardez bien. »—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27624b88-a16e-419f-81ef-d78c3e14dfe7\', \'multiverseId\': 403289}, \'multiverseid\': 403289}, {\'name\': \'Setacciatore del Vuoto\', \'text\': \'I tuoi avversari non possono lanciare magie con costo di mana convertito pari. (0 è pari.)I tuoi avversari non possono bloccare con creature con costo di mana convertito pari.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai mai visto un mondo intero cadere in ginocchio? Guarda e impara."—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7fe31d-a4e7-40da-b9f7-a50c8a67980c\', \'multiverseId\': 403588}, \'multiverseid\': 403588}, {\'name\': \'虚空の選別者\', \'text\': \'あなたの対戦相手は点数で見たマナ・コストが偶数の呪文を唱えられない。（０は偶数である。）あなたの対戦相手は点数で見たマナ・コストが偶数のクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「世界そのものが跪く様を見たことはあるか？その目に焼き付けておけ。」――オブ・ニクシリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57b94c2e-07bd-48cb-9dab-313b040106de\', \'multiverseId\': 403887}, \'multiverseid\': 403887}, {\'name\': \'공허 선별자\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대는 전환마나비용이 짝수인 주문을 발동할 수 없다. (0은 짝수로 취급한다.)당신의 상대는 전환마나비용이 짝수인 생물들로 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'"세상이 쓰러지는 모습을 본 적이 있느냐? 지켜보아라. 그리고 깨달아라."—오브 닉실리스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2cecac-e7d2-4023-a4d6-8a398f9cde8d\', \'multiverseId\': 404186}, \'multiverseid\': 404186}, {\'name\': \'Peneirador do Vácuo\', \'text\': \'Seus oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas com custos de mana convertidos pares. (Zero é par.)Seus oponentes não podem bloquear com criaturas com custos de mana convertidos pares.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Você já viu um mundo cair de joelhos? Olhe e aprenda."— Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ff3845-b7f1-468d-b137-af36b4a35841\', \'multiverseId\': 404485}, \'multiverseid\': 404485}, {\'name\': \'Веятель Пустоты\', \'text\': \'Ваши оппоненты не могут разыгрывать заклинания с четной конвертированной мана-стоимостью. (Ноль является четным числом.)Ваши оппоненты не могут блокировать существами с четной конвертированной мана-стоимостью.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты когда-нибудь видел, как целый мир становится на колени? Смотри и учись».— Об-Никсилис\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e60c0bb-6f1d-40a2-b725-72a65c121923\', \'multiverseId\': 404784}, \'multiverseid\': 404784}, {\'name\': \'虚空筛除体\', \'text\': \'所有对手都不能施放总法术力费用为偶数的咒语。（零是偶数。）所有对手都不能以总法术力费用为偶数的生物进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「你曾否见过连世界本身都屈膝下跪？凝神见证吧。」～欧尼希兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0da7db1-fe51-4850-a1d5-b5875bb93675\', \'multiverseId\': 402392}, \'multiverseid\': 402392}, {\'name\': \'虛空篩除體\', \'text\': \'所有對手都不能施放總魔法力費用為偶數的咒語。（零是偶數。）所有對手都不能以總魔法力費用為偶數的生物進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「你曾否見過連世界本身都屈膝下跪？凝神見證吧。」～歐尼希茲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0781f1-f13c-498a-b253-30413571b5bd\', \'multiverseId\': 402691}, \'multiverseid\': 402691}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgerichtetes Polyedernetzwerk\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Ausgerichtete Polyedernetzwerk ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 5 oder mehr ins Exil, bis das Ausgerichtete Polyedernetzwerk das Spiel verlässt. (Diese Kreaturen kehren unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Mit dem letzten Polyeder an seinem Platz war Ulamog innerhalb eines unendlichen Kreislaufs bindender Energien gefangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402704&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db69791f-c90c-4a4d-9b87-9644f99e4123\', \'multiverseId\': 402704}, \'multiverseid\': 402704}, {\'name\': \'Edros alineados\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Edros alineados entren al campo de batalla, exilia todas las criaturas con fuerza de 5 o más hasta que los Edros alineados dejen el campo de batalla. (Esas criaturas regresan bajo el control de sus propietarios.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El último edro se colocó en su sitio y atrapó a Ulamog dentro de un bucle de energía infinita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2854769-6706-4185-857d-2284104b6888\', \'multiverseId\': 404797}, \'multiverseid\': 404797}, {\'name\': "Réseau ordonné d\'hèdrons", \'text\': "Quand le Réseau ordonné d\'hèdrons arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 5 jusqu\'à ce que le Réseau ordonné d\'hèdrons quitte le champ de bataille. (Ces créatures sont renvoyées sous le contrôle de leurs propriétaires.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le dernier hèdron se mit en place, emprisonnant Ulamog dans une boucle d\'énergie infinie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403003&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c15f44-368e-4dcd-a61c-97c25eddb145\', \'multiverseId\': 403003}, \'multiverseid\': 403003}, {\'name\': \'Rete di Edri Allineati\', \'text\': \'Quando la Rete di Edri Allineati entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore a 5 finché la Rete di Edri Allineati non lascia il campo di battaglia. (Quelle creature tornano sotto il controllo dei rispettivi proprietari.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'ultimo edro scivolò al suo posto, rinchiudendo Ulamog in un circuito infinito di energia vincolante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7177138-7659-4e30-a7e2-bf836c2e88aa\', \'multiverseId\': 403302}, \'multiverseid\': 403302}, {\'name\': \'連結面晶体構造\', \'text\': \'連結面晶体構造が戦場に出たとき、パワーが５以上のすべてのクリーチャーを、連結面晶体構造が戦場を離れるまで追放する。（それらのクリーチャーはオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻る。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'最後の面晶体を定位置に設置すると、ウラモグは無限循環する拘束エネルギーに閉じ込められた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'861e84b0-b918-4b6c-b696-dfb00776d066\', \'multiverseId\': 403601}, \'multiverseid\': 403601}, {\'name\': \'정렬된 다면체 연결망\', \'text\': \'정렬된 다면체 연결망이 전장에 들어올 때, 공격력이 5 이상인 모든 생물들을 정렬된 다면체 연결망이 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다. (그 생물들은 소유자의 조종하에 되돌아온다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'마지막 다면체를 끼워 넣자 울라목이 영원한 구속의 에너지 고리에 갇혔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d22da059-7219-4284-987e-7d1ffdc7866f\', \'multiverseId\': 403900}, \'multiverseid\': 403900}, {\'name\': \'Rede de Edros Alinhados\', \'text\': \'Quando Rede de Edros Alinhados entrar no campo de batalha, exile todas as criaturas com poder igual ou superior a 5 até que Rede de Edros Alinhados deixe o campo de batalha. (Aquelas criaturas retornam sob o controle de seus donos.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O último edro se encaixou em seu lugar, prendendo Ulamog em um circuito infinito de energia de contenção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c48f3ab-375a-4a7c-b506-d760db777bee\', \'multiverseId\': 404199}, \'multiverseid\': 404199}, {\'name\': \'Упорядоченная Сеть Эдров\', \'text\': \'Когда Упорядоченная Сеть Эдров выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все существа с силой 5 или больше, пока Упорядоченная Сеть Эдров не покинет поле битвы. (Те существа возвращаются под контролем своих владельцев.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Последний эдр встал на место, поймав Уламога в бесконечную петлю связующей энергии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f71aeb7d-bbb8-460e-95da-fea55b77fe79\', \'multiverseId\': 404498}, \'multiverseid\': 404498}, {\'name\': \'晶石网阵\', \'text\': \'当晶石网阵进战场时，放逐所有力量等于或大于5的生物，直到晶石网阵离开战场为止。（这些生物会在其拥有者的操控下移回。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'最后一块晶石落位，将钨拉莫封锁在无尽的束缚能量圈中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dc6a074-67f7-4eb8-8858-a757e1c779e9\', \'multiverseId\': 402106}, \'multiverseid\': 402106}, {\'name\': \'晶石網陣\', \'text\': \'當晶石網陣進戰場時，放逐所有力量等於或大於5的生物，直到晶石網陣離開戰場為止。（這些生物會在其擁有者的操控下移回。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'最後一塊晶石落位，將鎢拉莫封鎖在無盡的束縛能量圈中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6209a384-094c-40c1-84d3-16e9629e2d23\', \'multiverseId\': 402405}, \'multiverseid\': 402405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgestoßener Drachenmeister\', \'text\': \'Falls du zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments sechs oder mehr Länder kontrollierst, bringe einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Welt wird von ihren rechtmäßigen Herrschern regiert werden und nicht von diesen widerlichen Kreaturen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402757&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73052a80-6375-43af-87a0-e5032c943dce\', \'multiverseId\': 402757}, \'multiverseid\': 402757}, {\'name\': \'Paria maestro de dragones\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas seis o más tierras, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo será gobernado por sus legítimos soberanos, no por esos farsantes espantosos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c6489d-8d72-4504-aee0-b417ceec2131\', \'multiverseId\': 404850}, \'multiverseid\': 404850}, {\'name\': \'Proscrite maître-dragon\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins six terrains, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce monde sera dirigé par ses souverains légitimes, pas par ces imposteurs monstrueux. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ecd0dd-8d01-4e17-a542-7c9e57a72670\', \'multiverseId\': 403056}, \'multiverseid\': 403056}, {\'name\': \'Dragoniere Reietto\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli sei o più terre, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Drago 5/5 rossa con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo mondo sarà governato dai suoi legittimi sovrani, non da questi ripugnanti usurpatori."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'207c6a34-b0d1-4e87-aea2-60a891af4c58\', \'multiverseId\': 403355}, \'multiverseid\': 403355}, {\'name\': \'竜使いののけ者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが６つ以上の土地をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界は、あの醜悪な詐称者どもによってではなく、正当なる支配者に統治されるであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b0cea73-5bfa-4bb0-bcfa-49d1186069f4\', \'multiverseId\': 403654}, \'multiverseid\': 403654}, {\'name\': \'추방당한 용조련사\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 대지를 여섯 개 이상 조종한다면, 비행을 가진 5/5 적색 용 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"이 세계는 적법한 지배자가 다스려야 해. 이런 흉측한 포식자들은 어림도 없지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8918c239-d90d-4e41-99b8-1b1128b13445\', \'multiverseId\': 403953}, \'multiverseid\': 403953}, {\'name\': \'Pária Mestre de Dragões\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controlar seis ou mais terrenos, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura vermelha 5/5 do tipo Dragão com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo será governado por seus legítimos soberanos, e não por esses impostores horrendos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e679d8-3bf7-45ff-b729-2b4dc83d6bca\', \'multiverseId\': 404252}, \'multiverseid\': 404252}, {\'name\': \'Изгнанный Повелитель Драконов\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, если под вашим контролем есть не менее шести земель, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 5/5 красный Дракон с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«В нашем мире воцарятся его законные повелители, а не эти отвратительные самозванцы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f98ca6e6-baa3-4435-a4bb-07129c24e4b6\', \'multiverseId\': 404551}, \'multiverseid\': 404551}, {\'name\': \'受逐召龙师\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你操控六个或更多地，则将一个5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「这个世界将由适格的君王所统治，而不是这些丑陋的觊觎者。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1a4580c-c759-4eeb-beff-87d5aecd563f\', \'multiverseId\': 402159}, \'multiverseid\': 402159}, {\'name\': \'受逐召龍師\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，若你操控六個或更多地，則將一個5/5紅色，具飛行異能的龍衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「這個世界將由適格的君王所統治，而不是這些醜陋的覬覦者。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e384e61-96ac-44bd-875a-e7c31dc618b3\', \'multiverseId\': 402458}, \'multiverseid\': 402458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausmerzer-Drohne\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Zehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Stille herrscht in Bala Ged. Nur manchmal ist das Krabbeln eines dahinjagenden Eldrazi zu hören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402749&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eea51ce-0274-48e1-8409-baca782817aa\', \'multiverseId\': 402749}, \'multiverseid\': 402749}, {\'name\': \'Zángano supervisor\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'El silencio reina en Bala Ged; solo queda roto por el sonido de los Eldrazi al deslizarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e26615c-e73c-483d-a3c4-7621205701a3\', \'multiverseId\': 404842}, \'multiverseid\': 404842}, {\'name\': \'Drone du sacrifice\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Ingestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Le silence qui règne sur Bala Ged n\'est brisé que par les frémissements des Eldrazi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41cff66d-20c9-4d44-b9b0-62bfd23a0043\', \'multiverseId\': 403048}, \'multiverseid\': 403048}, {\'name\': \'Parassita Vagliatore\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ingerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il silenzio regna su Bala Ged, rotto solo dal brulicare degli Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dcee24f-1a10-4877-ac95-9631d456c2e0\', \'multiverseId\': 403347}, \'multiverseid\': 403347}, {\'name\': \'淘汰ドローン\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'バーラ・ゲドは静寂に包まれており、ときおりエルドラージの通る音がするのみであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c5381e-7499-4ac1-ae13-bf1dea7e6d68\', \'multiverseId\': 403646}, \'multiverseid\': 403646}, {\'name\': \'선별하는 드론\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'발라 게드는 엘드라지의 공격이 있을 때를 제외하고는 항상 침묵이 지배한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5322e8-ccd8-4f6a-9894-5d1e58fed177\', \'multiverseId\': 403945}, \'multiverseid\': 403945}, {\'name\': \'Zangão Seletor\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ingerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'O silêncio reina em Bala Ged, sendo quebrado apenas pela agitação dos Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c25fb5-45f4-4b4c-8b5c-93d2ceee0206\', \'multiverseId\': 404244}, \'multiverseid\': 404244}, {\'name\': \'Дрон-Выбраковщик\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Заглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'В Бала-Геде царит тишина, нарушаемая лишь шумом рыскающих Эльдрази.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19267423-5e3f-409e-b027-d77442f40ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 404543}, \'multiverseid\': 404543}, {\'name\': \'牲祭奴兽\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'巴勒格一片寂静，只剩奥札奇来去的声音。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1618960d-9c2a-4210-aa92-02c67999969c\', \'multiverseId\': 402151}, \'multiverseid\': 402151}, {\'name\': \'牲祭奴獸\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'巴勒格一片寂靜，只剩奧札奇來去的聲音。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144f2cc0-2b08-47d7-9875-739524679a63\', \'multiverseId\': 402450}, \'multiverseid\': 402450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannzauber\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sagte, wir sollten die Eldrazi zerstören. Ugin wollte sie zurück in ihre Stasis versetzen. Ugins Argumente waren … nicht überzeugend."—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402755&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96922bd7-9cec-460f-8581-3c6c99650efe\', \'multiverseId\': 402755}, \'multiverseid\': 402755}, {\'name\': \'Esfumar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo instantáneo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo dije que debíamos destruir a los Eldrazi. Ugin quería devolverlos a un estado de estasis. Los argumentos de Ugin fueron... poco convincentes".—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5884f784-d4f3-41cb-8629-3727d8383101\', \'multiverseId\': 404848}, \'multiverseid\': 404848}, {\'name\': \'Dispersement\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort d\'éphémère ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai dit qu\'il fallait détruire les Eldrazi. Ugin voulait les renvoyer en stase. Ses arguments n\'étaient... pas très convaincants. »—Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403054&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'733d25b3-411e-47d4-b37c-75cc4ec6bbcb\', \'multiverseId\': 403054}, \'multiverseid\': 403054}, {\'name\': \'Sfatare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia istantaneo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Io ero convinto che avremmo dovuto distruggere gli Eldrazi. Ugin voleva farli tornare in stasi. Le sue argomentazioni si sono dimostrate... poco convincenti."—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a47d19ea-6db7-4d90-b981-827b48d1ab78\', \'multiverseId\': 403353}, \'multiverseid\': 403353}, {\'name\': \'払拭\', \'text\': \'インスタント・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「エルドラージは滅ぼさねばならないと言ったはずだ。ウギンは再度封印しようと言うが、その主張には説得力がない。」――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d6c4ee-579a-444b-ad6d-01507d6ce3dd\', \'multiverseId\': 403652}, \'multiverseid\': 403652}, {\'name\': \'주문해제\', \'text\': \'순간마법 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"난 엘드라지를 물리쳐야 한다고 말했어. 하지만 우진은 그 놈들이 갇혀 있던 상태로 되돌리길 원했지. 우진의 주장은 . . . 설득력이 없었어."—제이스 벨레렌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0bda100-7590-4ec3-ba85-df1be13458da\', \'multiverseId\': 403951}, \'multiverseid\': 403951}, {\'name\': \'Delir\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica instantânea alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu disse que devíamos destruir os Eldrazi. Ugin queria colocá-los novamente em estase. Os argumentos dele... não foram convincentes."— Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd296396-b7cd-4343-af7c-c980bf0bc93e\', \'multiverseId\': 404250}, \'multiverseid\': 404250}, {\'name\': \'Рассеять\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое мгновенное заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я сказал, что мы должны уничтожить Эльдрази. Уджин хотел вновь погрузить их в сон. Но доводы Уджина оказались... неубедительными».— Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e78d4562-b0af-4d12-b561-5fe1d8766da5\', \'multiverseId\': 404549}, \'multiverseid\': 404549}, {\'name\': \'云散\', \'text\': \'反击目标瞬间咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我认为应该消灭奥札奇。乌金想让它们回归静态。乌金的理由...说服不了我。」～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54f4477-6f3c-4d47-a291-c7355ec9242a\', \'multiverseId\': 402157}, \'multiverseid\': 402157}, {\'name\': \'雲散\', \'text\': \'反擊目標瞬間咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我認為應該消滅奧札奇。烏金想讓它們回歸靜態。烏金的理由...說服不了我。」～傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34bbc14-4f8d-40d5-960b-d9a537b9fa50\', \'multiverseId\': 402456}, \'multiverseid\': 402456}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benthischer Infiltrator\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Zehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)Der Benthische Infiltrator kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb78d85-9290-46d3-b1e2-5cfe5adec9f7\', \'multiverseId\': 402715}, \'multiverseid\': 402715}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrador bentónico\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)El Infiltrador bentónico no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'993b5cf6-d071-4c6b-9d10-084c8863ddd5\', \'multiverseId\': 404808}, \'multiverseid\': 404808}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrateur benthique\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Ingestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)L\'Infiltrateur benthique ne peut pas être bloqué.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403014&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520665d9-905b-48b6-96b1-540d5a0f87b4\', \'multiverseId\': 403014}, \'multiverseid\': 403014}, {\'name\': \'Incursore Bentonico\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ingerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)L\'Incursore Bentonico non può essere bloccato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d904bfb-b867-4858-bafb-d6523d6ef341\', \'multiverseId\': 403313}, \'multiverseid\': 403313}, {\'name\': \'水底の潜入者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）水底の潜入者はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b30b32a9-e19f-4de5-a8b2-46917be83ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 403612}, \'multiverseid\': 403612}, {\'name\': \'심해 침투원\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)심해 침투원은 방어당할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8507f010-f16a-45e1-b419-92a32b2405ae\', \'multiverseId\': 403911}, \'multiverseid\': 403911}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrador Bêntico\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ingerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)Infiltrador Bêntico não pode ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887ed581-1271-430c-8042-ab6c39b966fd\', \'multiverseId\': 404210}, \'multiverseid\': 404210}, {\'name\': \'Глубоководный Шпион\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Заглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)Глубоководный Шпион не может быть заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c9eb153-b649-4394-836e-205cfe03d91e\', \'multiverseId\': 404509}, \'multiverseid\': 404509}, {\'name\': \'深海渗透体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）深海渗透体不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e01cd4df-7857-46af-a280-b0411c817a31\', \'multiverseId\': 402117}, \'multiverseid\': 402117}, {\'name\': \'深海滲透體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）深海滲透體不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f11d2b7-766d-4b79-9051-09a5d9db9fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 402416}, \'multiverseid\': 402416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergungsdrohne\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Zehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)Wenn die Bergungsdrohne stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bb7fd6-5d15-4cba-acf6-6c56ec747168\', \'multiverseId\': 402918}, \'multiverseid\': 402918}, {\'name\': \'Zángano recuperador\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)Cuando el Zángano recuperador muera, puedes robar una carta. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b718d886-41b0-4f4c-a841-d0a3862deb60\', \'multiverseId\': 405011}, \'multiverseid\': 405011}, {\'name\': \'Drone de récupération\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Ingestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)Quand le Drone de récupération meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403217&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a327b11-0068-4e07-9e1b-29c4772ee69c\', \'multiverseId\': 403217}, \'multiverseid\': 403217}, {\'name\': \'Parassita di Recupero\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ingerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)Quando il Parassita di Recupero muore, puoi pescare una carta. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f17769-8342-4e0b-92c4-319e4d1f988e\', \'multiverseId\': 403516}, \'multiverseid\': 403516}, {\'name\': \'回収ドローン\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）回収ドローンが死亡したとき、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f0007a-61b8-4798-be07-52afd92ff014\', \'multiverseId\': 403815}, \'multiverseid\': 403815}, {\'name\': \'인양 드론\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)인양 드론이 죽을 때, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab934ea-65c3-4799-a45e-bcc730585cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 404114}, \'multiverseid\': 404114}, {\'name\': \'Zangão de Recuperação\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ingerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)Quando Zangão de Recuperação morre, você pode comprar um card. Se fizer isso, descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12cb4cb-14df-4457-8770-65dd6b021a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 404413}, \'multiverseid\': 404413}, {\'name\': \'Утильный Дрон\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Заглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)Когда Утильный Дрон умирает, вы можете взять карту. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d19af10-8a82-4aff-a107-96a2ebc5b7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 404712}, \'multiverseid\': 404712}, {\'name\': \'回收奴兽\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）当回收奴兽死去时，你可以抓一张牌。若你如此作，则弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b4802d-b7a7-4af6-a9de-6408688cdb3a\', \'multiverseId\': 402320}, \'multiverseid\': 402320}, {\'name\': \'回收奴獸\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）當回收奴獸死去時，你可以抽一張牌。若你如此作，則棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ace0279-eaca-4009-8116-23fddcfd60ba\', \'multiverseId\': 402619}, \'multiverseid\': 402619}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berührung der Leere\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Die Berührung der Leere fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls eine Kreatur, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Wunden heilen nie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18c56bc-4579-492c-a63f-cb26205302f8\', \'multiverseId\': 402971}, \'multiverseid\': 402971}, {\'name\': \'Caricia del vacío\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)La Caricia del vacío hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Si una criatura que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas heridas no sanan nunca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50edb7ba-26e0-421f-886c-2055c200adbe\', \'multiverseId\': 405064}, \'multiverseid\': 405064}, {\'name\': \'Toucher du vide\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Le Toucher du vide inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur. Si une créature ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Certaines blessures ne guérissent jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403270&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6ecb22-f364-494c-83ef-9650dde8dafd\', \'multiverseId\': 403270}, \'multiverseid\': 403270}, {\'name\': \'Tocco del Vuoto\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Il Tocco del Vuoto infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Se una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Alcune ferite non guariscono mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aaa47a8-5d8f-4797-b8d9-a1e13fb3c159\', \'multiverseId\': 403569}, \'multiverseid\': 403569}, {\'name\': \'虚空の接触\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。虚空の接触はそれに３点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'決して癒えない傷もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74060f77-ae35-4d7a-bd3e-4f4666c5ebef\', \'multiverseId\': 403868}, \'multiverseid\': 403868}, {\'name\': \'공허의 손길\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 공허의 손길은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 이렇게 피해를 입은 생물이 이번 턴에 죽으려고 하면, 대신에 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'어떤 상처는 영원히 낫지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda1c9b3-9098-4b03-a65e-886f073c736f\', \'multiverseId\': 404167}, \'multiverseid\': 404167}, {\'name\': \'Toque do Vazio\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Toque do Vazio causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo. Se uma criatura que sofreu dano dessa maneira morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas feridas jamais se curam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d7b8bef-6113-4a14-a22d-ee0b0ae610df\', \'multiverseId\': 404466}, \'multiverseid\': 404466}, {\'name\': \'Прикосновение Пустоты\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Прикосновение Пустоты наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку. Если существо, которому таким образом были нанесены повреждения, должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые раны не заживают никогда.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39323ecb-001e-4eb5-b078-04f6b3c53f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 404765}, \'multiverseid\': 404765}, {\'name\': \'虚空之触\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）虚空之触对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些伤口永远不会愈合。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c61b87-8ed9-4638-8da1-24c949ae0db5\', \'multiverseId\': 402373}, \'multiverseid\': 402373}, {\'name\': \'虛空之觸\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）虛空之觸對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到傷害的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'有些傷口永遠不會癒合。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7a4e94-9a52-4e67-afca-10fe3b967629\', \'multiverseId\': 402672}, \'multiverseid\': 402672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestienrufer-Experte\', \'text\': \'Eile{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie kommen, weil ich rufe. Sie bleiben, weil ich zuhöre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d84d068d-28a5-485c-941e-cb0ea2c7c8b0\', \'multiverseId\': 402713}, \'multiverseid\': 402713}, {\'name\': \'Sabio llamabestias\', \'text\': \'Prisa.{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Vienen porque los llamo. Se quedan porque los escucho".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7506fa-7966-445e-a611-3e25e1ae9d72\', \'multiverseId\': 404806}, \'multiverseid\': 404806}, {\'name\': \'Savant meneur des bêtes\', \'text\': \'Célérité{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils viennent parce que je les appelle. Ils restent parce que je les écoute. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403012&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99d96d86-9332-4c7e-ac93-3241dfeac422\', \'multiverseId\': 403012}, \'multiverseid\': 403012}, {\'name\': \'Evocabestie Sapiente\', \'text\': \'Rapidità{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vengono perché io le chiamo. Restano perché io le ascolto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e373f51-a65f-4c34-8e6d-6117983a327c\', \'multiverseId\': 403311}, \'multiverseid\': 403311}, {\'name\': \'獣呼びの学者\', \'text\': \'速攻{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「私が呼べば来る。私が聴けば留まる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156bd122-b26c-4151-9d5d-2e19f3afce48\', \'multiverseId\': 403610}, \'multiverseid\': 403610}, {\'name\': \'야수소환술 석학\', \'text\': \'신속{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다. 이 마나는 생물 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 주술사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 부르니 그들이 온다. 내가 귀 기울이니 그들이 머무른다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92109f38-4173-4f52-98fa-7a3ec717df5b\', \'multiverseId\': 403909}, \'multiverseid\': 403909}, {\'name\': \'Sábio Convocador de Feras\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Elas vêm porque eu chamo. Elas ficam porque eu escuto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9800db1-6a93-4196-a549-aaa9e46d8bdd\', \'multiverseId\': 404208}, \'multiverseid\': 404208}, {\'name\': \'Мудрый Призыватель Зверей\', \'text\': \'Ускорение{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинания существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Шаман Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Они приходят, потому что я зову. Они остаются, потому что я слушаю».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5663810d-6be0-42ac-a0d6-819baeb855f5\', \'multiverseId\': 404507}, \'multiverseid\': 404507}, {\'name\': \'召兽学者\', \'text\': \'敏捷{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。 此法术力只能用来施放生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭师／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「因我呼唤，它们前来。因我倾听，它们留下。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84cbd8e5-cc71-41aa-bd93-b35a2c7728c8\', \'multiverseId\': 402115}, \'multiverseid\': 402115}, {\'name\': \'召獸學者\', \'text\': \'敏捷{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。此魔法力只能用來施放生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭師／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「因我呼喚，牠們前來。因我傾聽，牠們留下。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d8425d6-1b50-44f3-b098-7c7662fe5699\', \'multiverseId\': 402414}, \'multiverseid\': 402414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bezwinger der Heere\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen, die den Bezwinger der Heere blocken können, tun dies.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Nicht Wenige haben alles und jeden verloren. Sie spüren den Eldrazi nach und sind darauf aus, sich, wenn irgend möglich, zu rächen."—Munda, Guerillaführer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402726&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135daa9b-c8bf-4555-8325-f72d05c3dfe2\', \'multiverseId\': 402726}, \'multiverseid\': 402726}, {\'name\': \'Aplastaejércitos\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas que puedan bloquear al Aplastaejércitos lo hacen.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay quienes lo han perdido todo y a todos. Ansiosos de venganza, aunque sea la más nimia, van en busca de los Eldrazi".—Munda, líder de la emboscada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8951840f-f196-46f7-8d37-388335e1765a\', \'multiverseId\': 404819}, \'multiverseid\': 404819}, {\'name\': "Briseur d\'armées", \'text\': "Toutes les créatures capables de bloquer le Briseur d\'armées le font.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« Certains n\'ont plus rien, ni personne. Ils traquent les Eldrazi et cherchent à se venger coûte que coûte. »—Munda, chef d\'embuscade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403025&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b08ae70-f0f7-4b98-88b9-5e8523687152\', \'multiverseId\': 403025}, \'multiverseid\': 403025}, {\'name\': \'Demolitore di Eserciti\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature in grado di bloccare il Demolitore di Eserciti lo fanno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni hanno perso tutti e tutto. Vanno di proposito in cerca degli Eldrazi, desiderosi del benché minimo briciolo di vendetta."—Munda, capo dell\\\'agguato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a6f5b2d-1a90-4259-bf50-9011017c9f55\', \'multiverseId\': 403324}, \'multiverseid\': 403324}, {\'name\': \'軍団を破壊するもの\', \'text\': \'軍団を破壊するものをブロックできるすべてのクリーチャーは、これをブロックする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「何もかも失った人々がいる。彼らはエルドラージを探し、ほんの少しでも報復したいと考えている。」――待ち伏せ隊長、ムンダ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b4c2510-e107-4019-9ec6-b3c494c7f8f7\', \'multiverseId\': 403623}, \'multiverseid\': 403623}, {\'name\': \'군대 파괴자\', \'text\': \'군대 파괴자를 방어할 수 있는 모든 생물은 군대 파괴자를 방어해야 한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'"가족, 친구, 그리고 모든 것을 잃은 자들이 있다. 이들이 복수를 위해 엘드라지를 찾고 있다."—매복조 대장 문다\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'970dba7f-6a38-4eda-abc5-e95f8c9f5cbe\', \'multiverseId\': 403922}, \'multiverseid\': 403922}, {\'name\': \'Subjugador de Exércitos\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas aptas a bloquear Subjugador de Exércitos o fazem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Há quem tenha perdido tudo e todos. Esses procuram espontaneamente os Eldrazi em busca de vingança, por menor que seja."— Munda, líder de emboscadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06f08fd-5760-4a1e-8794-2e0a7588cd71\', \'multiverseId\': 404221}, \'multiverseid\': 404221}, {\'name\': \'Губитель Армий\', \'text\': \'Все существа, способные блокировать Губителя Армий, блокируют его.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«Среди нас есть те, кто потерял все без остатка. Они разыскивают Эльдрази в надежде на хотя бы толику возмездия».— Мунда, командир засады\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d046b0d2-fa80-4f3c-ac04-eb315de394eb\', \'multiverseId\': 404520}, \'multiverseid\': 404520}, {\'name\': \'灭军恶体\', \'text\': \'所有能够阻挡灭军恶体的生物皆须阻挡之。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「丧亲失故、一无所有之人，都会找上奥札奇复仇，机会再小都不会放过。」～伏击领袖蒙达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34c566f2-5a08-499e-8fce-03310d377bca\', \'multiverseId\': 402128}, \'multiverseid\': 402128}, {\'name\': \'滅軍惡體\', \'text\': \'所有能夠阻擋滅軍惡體的生物皆須阻擋之。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「喪親失故，一無所有之人，都會找上奧札奇復仇，機會再小都不會放過。」 ～伏擊領袖蒙達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af46ccec-abc3-43c7-bd08-e0ee29c367d0\', \'multiverseId\': 402427}, \'multiverseid\': 402427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasenkokon\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Blasenkokon stirbt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Leiche eines Blasenkokons ist die Wiege einer Brut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402722&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6599d14e-c4df-4587-816f-bd6609b2679e\', \'multiverseId\': 402722}, \'multiverseid\': 402722}, {\'name\': \'Portador de vástagos\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Portador de vástagos muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'El cadáver de un portador es la cuna de un vástago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27cf1239-62f9-4200-a44c-ebf74197f334\', \'multiverseId\': 404815}, \'multiverseid\': 404815}, {\'name\': \'Phlyctocosse\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Phlyctocosse meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Le cadavre d\'un phlyctocosse est le berceau d\'un scion.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403021&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd90095e-3b3d-488b-bf4f-123efa176380\', \'multiverseId\': 403021}, \'multiverseid\': 403021}, {\'name\': \'Spora Vescicolare\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando la Spora Vescicolare muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il cadavere di una spora vescicolare è la culla per un discendente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b55a2f6f-1689-4e33-86da-3cb41ff03366\', \'multiverseId\': 403320}, \'multiverseid\': 403320}, {\'name\': \'膨れ鞘\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）膨れ鞘が死亡したとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'膨れ鞘の屍骸は末裔を育む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c83fa93-1a54-4357-bf44-5e7fea94ed8a\', \'multiverseId\': 403619}, \'multiverseid\': 403619}, {\'name\': \'자손부화낭\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)자손부화낭이 죽을 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'자손부화낭의 시체는 엘드라지 자손의 요람이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6622f1ad-c6f7-4a4d-bc63-4898f2e4dd9d\', \'multiverseId\': 403918}, \'multiverseid\': 403918}, {\'name\': \'Casulário\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Casulário morrer, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'O cadáver de um casulário é o berço de um rebento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3841f875-0762-497c-b2a3-b96667491dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 404217}, \'multiverseid\': 404217}, {\'name\': \'Пузырчатый Кокон\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Пузырчатый Кокон умирает, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Труп пузырчатого кокона — колыбель для отпрыска.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c854c001-3149-448d-b449-65f46fd82107\', \'multiverseId\': 404516}, \'multiverseid\': 404516}, {\'name\': \'迅孳种\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当迅孳种死去时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'迅孳种的尸体孕育着孽裔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'add0aa80-f15f-4ef0-90e0-6125a282e0d3\', \'multiverseId\': 402124}, \'multiverseid\': 402124}, {\'name\': \'迅孳種\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當迅孳種死去時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'迅孳種的屍體孕育著孽裔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'271ebbf0-163e-4be8-8d58-0d0b13fa9f56\', \'multiverseId\': 402423}, \'multiverseid\': 402423}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Beobachter\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Blinde Beobachter ins Spiel kommt, bringe zwei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder von Ulamog abstammende Eldrazi ist eine Erweiterung seines Willens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402772&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104eb203-f0eb-4523-92e2-21dbe7c805a8\', \'multiverseId\': 402772}, \'multiverseid\': 402772}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante sin ojos\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Vigilante sin ojos entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los Eldrazi de la estirpe de Ulamog son una extensión de la voluntad del titán.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a3c7a4-5964-4717-bb45-2a5303af91a8\', \'multiverseId\': 404865}, \'multiverseid\': 404865}, {\'name\': \'Gardien anophtalme\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Gardien anophtalme arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Chaque Eldrazi de la lignée d\'Ulamog est une extension de la volonté du titan.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a050e4c-87d7-435b-ad11-610aca389176\', \'multiverseId\': 403071}, \'multiverseid\': 403071}, {\'name\': "Osservatore Senz\'Occhi", \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando l\\\'Osservatore Senz\\\'Occhi entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "Ogni Eldrazi della covata di Ulamog è un\'estensione della volontà del titano.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88870f95-7b0d-44f0-a874-9ee1f98fc843\', \'multiverseId\': 403370}, \'multiverseid\': 403370}, {\'name\': \'目なしの見張り\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）目なしの見張りが戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの血族に連なるエルドラージはみな、その意思を受け継いでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb15125-2064-4a27-8a2f-3651a18d57b3\', \'multiverseId\': 403669}, \'multiverseid\': 403669}, {\'name\': \'눈없는 감시자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)눈없는 감시자가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'울라목 혈족의 모든 엘드라지는 확장된 거신의 의지이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd123a1d-4e2d-491a-8aeb-59a5390da0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 403968}, \'multiverseid\': 403968}, {\'name\': \'Vigia sem Olhos\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Vigia sem Olhos entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura incolores 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'Cada Eldrazi da linhagem de Ulamog é uma extensão da vontade do titã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42d261b-22e0-470d-89d1-d3b929637eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 404267}, \'multiverseid\': 404267}, {\'name\': \'Безглазый Наблюдатель\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Безглазый Наблюдатель выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Они имеют способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый Эльдрази из рода Уламога претворяет в жизнь волю титана.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ffcb273-28be-4254-8368-ca4cb9ae5225\', \'multiverseId\': 404566}, \'multiverseid\': 404566}, {\'name\': \'无目看守\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当无目看守进战场时，将两个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫孳生的每一个奥札奇都承袭了这个巨物的意志。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b7fbe6d-3669-4714-a083-a09c35ef2a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 402174}, \'multiverseid\': 402174}, {\'name\': \'無目看守\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當無目看守進戰場時，將兩個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它們具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫孳生的每一個奧札奇都承襲了這個巨物的意志。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f45236-14a1-46d8-8f62-e95b3b749f10\', \'multiverseId\': 402473}, \'multiverseid\': 402473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutbund-Vampirin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Blutbund-Vampirin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Lasst die Vampire sich uns anschließen. In diesem Krieg haben wir nicht länger den Luxus, uns unsere Kameraden auszusuchen."—Generalin Tazri, Kommandeurin der Verbündeten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff72526-5606-4adf-869b-fe02562b8003\', \'multiverseId\': 402723}, \'multiverseid\': 402723}, {\'name\': \'Vampira vínculo de sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Vampira vínculo de sangre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja que los vampiros se unan a nosotros. En esta guerra, ya no podemos darnos el lujo de elegir a nuestros compañeros".—General Tazri, comandante aliada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0315696b-cc7e-4ca4-9b72-e8801ce791bf\', \'multiverseId\': 404816}, \'multiverseid\': 404816}, {\'name\': \'Vampire bridesang\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Vampire bridesang.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et shamane et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Laissez les vampires se joindre à nous. Dans cette guerre, nous ne pouvons plus nous permettre de choisir nos frères d\'armes. »—Générale Tazri, commandante alliée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403022&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e7f6156-ef58-412e-bf40-a1feb8402046\', \'multiverseId\': 403022}, \'multiverseid\': 403022}, {\'name\': \'Vampira dei Legami di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Vampira dei Legami di Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciate che i vampiri si uniscano a noi. In questa guerra, non possiamo più permetterci il lusso di scegliere i nostri compagni."—Generale Tazri, comandante alleata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea3dc41-e704-42a2-87d5-7567d8acaa24\', \'multiverseId\': 403321}, \'multiverseid\': 403321}, {\'name\': \'血の絆の吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、血の絆の吸血鬼の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼も仲間に加えよう。この戦いは、もはや同志を選べる段階ではない。」――同盟の統率者、タズリ将軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e47e3d-fa86-4bd5-b01e-bf757a19bba2\', \'multiverseId\': 403620}, \'multiverseid\': 403620}, {\'name\': \'피로 결속된 흡혈귀\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 피로 결속된 흡혈귀에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 주술사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"흡혈귀들도 우리 편으로 받아 주어라. 이 전쟁에서 원하는 동료를 선택하는 호사 따윈 더이상 없어."—동맹군 총사령관 타즈리 장군\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46790a4d-9e49-447a-8507-3471feb0caf5\', \'multiverseId\': 403919}, \'multiverseid\': 403919}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro do Elo de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Vampiro do Elo de Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Xamã Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Deixem que os vampiros se unam a nós. Nessa guerra, não podemos mais nos dar ao luxo de escolher nossos camaradas."— General Tazri, comandante aliada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80f031e-8fbc-4d0d-8a40-c8e2c0a520fb\', \'multiverseId\': 404218}, \'multiverseid\': 404218}, {\'name\': \'Вампир Кровавой Связи\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Вампира Кровавой Связи.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Шаман Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть вампиры присоединятся к нам. В этой войне роскошь выбирать себе товарищей нам больше не по карману».— Генерал Тазри, командир союзников\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809188f3-e283-4d18-b638-b064b10f51e6\', \'multiverseId\': 404517}, \'multiverseid\': 404517}, {\'name\': \'生脉吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，在生脉吸血鬼上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／祭师／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「让吸血鬼加入我们吧。在这场战争中，我们已经没有挑选战友的余地了。」～盟军指挥官塔兹莉将军\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90167b3-3e5d-4909-9483-9f04afb9c8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402125}, \'multiverseid\': 402125}, {\'name\': \'生脈吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，在生脈吸血鬼上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／祭師／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「讓吸血鬼加入我們吧。在這場戰爭中，我們已經沒有挑選戰友的餘地了。」～盟軍指揮官塔茲莉將軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a9396c-98b4-45a3-990b-b94b21a87645\', \'multiverseId\': 402424}, \'multiverseid\': 402424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {W}.)Das Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht zwei oder mehr Standardländer kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kontinent Murasa liegt unter einem dichten Blätterdach verborgen, die Vegetation so verwachsen, dass seine Einwohner niemals den Boden erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402734&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c754e18c-83ba-4548-8b5d-ad87d9898a95\', \'multiverseId\': 402734}, \'multiverseid\': 402734}, {\'name\': \'Panorámica de la enramada\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {W} a tu reserva de maná.)La Panorámica de la enramada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque llanura\', \'flavor\': \'El continente de Murasa se oculta bajo una espesa capa de vegetación. Las enormes ramas que lo cubren están tan enredadas que algunos de sus habitantes jamás llegan a ver el suelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7070c4-1a79-4977-a5c9-2ddd13cccd41\', \'multiverseId\': 404827}, \'multiverseid\': 404827}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W} à votre réserve.)La Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Le continent de Murasa est protégé par une épaisse couche de végétation, dont les énormes branches s\'enchevêtrent si étroitement que certains habitants ne voient jamais le sol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef398173-9105-4de9-b3d5-b35587866355\', \'multiverseId\': 403033}, \'multiverseid\': 403033}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Fronde\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.)Il Panorama di Fronde entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': \'Il continente di Murasa giace sotto una coltre di fitta vegetazione, dagli enormi rami aggrovigliati così strettamente che alcuni dei suoi abitanti non vedono mai il suolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f67c89c-ba70-4d91-b75e-8507d2841e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 403332}, \'multiverseid\': 403332}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{W}を加える。）あなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサ大陸は密生する植生に覆われている。巨大な木々の曲がりくねった枝が稠密に重なっており、ここに住む人々の中には、地面を見たことのない者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f0d55c-2bd7-4d57-a733-c507d1286615\', \'multiverseId\': 403631}, \'multiverseid\': 403631}, {\'name\': \'숲 전망대\', \'text\': \'({T}: {G} 또는 {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)숲 전망대는 당신이 다른 기본 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 숲 들\', \'flavor\': \'무라사 대륙 위에는 무성한 수풀 장막이 놓여 있다. 거대한 가지들이 두껍게 얽혀 있어, 이곳의 주민은 지상을 볼 수 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c8d28da-4571-480c-8e66-812798a14540\', \'multiverseId\': 403930}, \'multiverseid\': 403930}, {\'name\': \'Vista do Dossel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.)Vista do Dossel entra no campo de batalha virada a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Planície\', \'flavor\': \'O continente de Murasa fica sob um manto de densa vegetação, seus galhos enormes tão densamente emaranhados que alguns habitantes jamais veem o chão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01c7de5d-db61-4b91-9e56-d7ef664421af\', \'multiverseId\': 404229}, \'multiverseid\': 404229}, {\'name\': \'Дорога Среди Крон\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {G} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны.)Дорога Среди Крон выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Лес Равнина\', \'flavor\': \'Весь континент Мураса покрывают дремучие леса. Огромные ветви деревьев переплетаются так плотно, что некоторые обитатели крон живут и умирают, ни разу не увидев земли.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7efe8337-3a3b-49f9-a1fe-9b49006e4b91\', \'multiverseId\': 404528}, \'multiverseid\': 404528}, {\'name\': \'林冠远景\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}或{W}到你的法术力池中。）除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则林冠远景须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地～树林／平原\', \'flavor\': \'姆拉撒大陆上覆厚密植被，庞巨盘枝交错横生，尚有居民从未见过其下大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d6ec22-209e-48a6-b966-82bb3e5dddc9\', \'multiverseId\': 402136}, \'multiverseid\': 402136}, {\'name\': \'林冠遠景\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}或{W}到你的魔法力池中）。除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則林冠遠景須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'地～樹林／平原\', \'flavor\': \'姆拉撒大陸上覆厚密植被，龐巨盤枝交錯橫生，尚有居民從未見過其下大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98dd7e87-03dd-4f6d-8819-2393baaf0813\', \'multiverseId\': 402435}, \'multiverseid\': 402435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bombardierender Tyrann\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.){2}{R}, opfere eine andere farblose Kreatur: Der Bombardierende Tyrann fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Schrecklicher Zorn. Exzellente Zielgenauigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402712&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfb3e6b-1587-4e67-ad5f-f510bf588b79\', \'multiverseId\': 402712}, \'multiverseid\': 402712}, {\'name\': \'Tirano bombardeador\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.){2}{R}, sacrificar otra criatura incolora: El Tirano bombardeador hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Una furia terrible. Una puntería excelente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0615f64-53da-4e33-9777-ec1751a7df8b\', \'multiverseId\': 404805}, \'multiverseid\': 404805}, {\'name\': \'Tyran du barrage\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.){2}{R}, sacrifiez une autre créature incolore : Le Tyran du barrage inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, autant de blessures que la force de la créature sacrifiée.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Colère terrible. Visée impeccable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403011&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b0a511-fcdb-4793-9595-c33d2f288195\', \'multiverseId\': 403011}, \'multiverseid\': 403011}, {\'name\': \'Tiranno del Bombardamento\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.){2}{R}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura incolore: Il Tiranno del Bombardamento infligge danno pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Furia tremenda. Mira eccellente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'226679b1-f0e5-4ee7-9051-7245763f1090\', \'multiverseId\': 403310}, \'multiverseid\': 403310}, {\'name\': \'連射する暴君\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）{2}{R}, 他の無色のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。連射する暴君はそれに、生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'激しい怒り。見事な狙い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f687377-4289-40ba-88c8-4153856ac13c\', \'multiverseId\': 403609}, \'multiverseid\': 403609}, {\'name\': \'투척하는 폭군\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.){2}{R}, 다른 무색 생물을 희생한다: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 투척하는 폭군은 그 목표에게 희생된 생물의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'지독한 분노. 완벽한 조준.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616df50f-e855-4baf-b622-29b322b9f254\', \'multiverseId\': 403908}, \'multiverseid\': 403908}, {\'name\': \'Tirano da Barragem\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.){2}{R}, Sacrifique outra criatura incolor: Tirano da Barragem causa à criatura ou ao jogador alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Fúria terrível. Mira excelente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e50fbec2-a832-4e40-a684-21da8f9fd1c2\', \'multiverseId\': 404207}, \'multiverseid\': 404207}, {\'name\': \'Тиран-Метатель\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.){2}{R}, пожертвуйте другое бесцветное существо: Тиран-Метатель наносит целевому существу или игроку количество повреждений, равное силе пожертвованного существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Ужасная ярость. Великолепная меткость.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e06b85-a560-4073-835f-1d84ecfb1d39\', \'multiverseId\': 404506}, \'multiverseid\': 404506}, {\'name\': \'猛掷暴君\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）{2}{R}，牺牲另一个无色生物：猛掷暴君对目标生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲之生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'狂躁暴怒。弹无虚发。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed9271e3-8df6-43c2-bb61-2d5b473a1ffa\', \'multiverseId\': 402114}, \'multiverseid\': 402114}, {\'name\': \'猛擲暴君\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）{2}{R}，犧牲另一個無色生物：猛擲暴君對目標生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於所犧牲之生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'狂躁暴怒。彈無虛發。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50fa7585-05c2-40a2-af1b-27a89dc84ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 402413}, \'multiverseid\': 402413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bosheit des Sumpflands\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten ab.Erwecken 3 — {5}{B} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{B} wirkst, lege außerdem drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402846&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8089d82-3f4e-4eb8-b570-b8796a7e8932\', \'multiverseId\': 402846}, \'multiverseid\': 402846}, {\'name\': \'Crueldad del cenagal\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo descarta dos cartas.Despertar 3—{5}{B}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{B}, pon además tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc9f03a3-c030-4535-9cc7-dd52e838ab37\', \'multiverseId\': 404939}, \'multiverseid\': 404939}, {\'name\': \'Malice des fondrières\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.Éveil 3 — {5}{B} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{B}, mettez aussi trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75fd99cc-e462-436f-a236-42778c7518c6\', \'multiverseId\': 403145}, \'multiverseid\': 403145}, {\'name\': \'Ostilità del Pantano\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio scarta due carte.Risveglio 3—{5}{B} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{B}, metti anche tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b192bb-62a6-4a03-a7b8-34f00cd22738\', \'multiverseId\': 403444}, \'multiverseid\': 403444}, {\'name\': \'ぬかるみの敵意\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚捨てる。覚醒３―{5}{B}（この呪文を{5}{B}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef8199b7-78e0-4b1b-ab75-67f37f114218\', \'multiverseId\': 403743}, \'multiverseid\': 403743}, {\'name\': \'진창의 악의\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 카드 두 장을 버린다.각성 3—{5}{B} ({5}{B}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95b3630c-dce6-4553-a9bd-4558679a2d13\', \'multiverseId\': 404042}, \'multiverseid\': 404042}, {\'name\': \'Maleficência do Lodo\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo descarta dois cards.Despertar 3 — {5}{B} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{B}, coloque também três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9942634c-55c4-46e0-ada9-c3f1ceb854f6\', \'multiverseId\': 404341}, \'multiverseid\': 404341}, {\'name\': \'Болотная Злоба\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент сбрасывает две карты.Пробуждение 3 — {5}{B} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{B}, также положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a145844b-8e25-450b-8495-edbad8f33c8b\', \'multiverseId\': 404640}, \'multiverseid\': 404640}, {\'name\': \'泥沼恶意\', \'text\': \'目标对手弃两张牌。醒转3～{5}{B}（如果你支付{5}{B}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc87006c-9dbb-481a-b1c0-577b42b9346c\', \'multiverseId\': 402248}, \'multiverseid\': 402248}, {\'name\': \'泥沼惡意\', \'text\': \'目標對手棄兩張牌。醒轉3～{5}{B}（如果你支付{5}{B}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f9ef33-8497-4b9c-9934-8269723c1a66\', \'multiverseId\': 402547}, \'multiverseid\': 402547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brillantes Spektrum\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Ziehe X Karten, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um das Brillante Spektrum zu wirken. Wirf dann zwei Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Zendikar gibt es mehr Sehenswertes, als das Auge erfassen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402727&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d7f4c4-b894-41e0-9319-baa1a17769b3\', \'multiverseId\': 402727}, \'multiverseid\': 402727}, {\'name\': \'Espectro brillante\', \'text\': \'Converger — Roba X cartas, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar el Espectro brillante. Luego, descarta dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Hay más vistas fascinantes en Zendikar de las que abarcan los ojos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'270b9444-bf6c-422d-a6d5-2dda6a01b432\', \'multiverseId\': 404820}, \'multiverseid\': 404820}, {\'name\': \'Spectre brillant\', \'text\': \'Convergence — Piochez X cartes, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer le Spectre brillant. Défaussez-vous ensuite de deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Il y a bien plus à voir sur Zendikar que ce qui s\'offre à nos yeux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403026&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e25d9c-6e8f-40eb-b708-9ac7ed77d29f\', \'multiverseId\': 403026}, \'multiverseid\': 403026}, {\'name\': \'Iridescenza Splendente\', \'text\': "Convergenza — Pesca X carte, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare l\'Iridescenza Splendente. Poi scarta due carte.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Zendikar offre più panorami di quanti siano visibili agli occhi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7635352-dc3d-4479-9e8b-420dbe603d24\', \'multiverseId\': 403325}, \'multiverseid\': 403325}, {\'name\': \'輝く光波\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― カードをＸ枚引く。Ｘは輝く光波を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数に等しい。その後カードを２枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカーには目に見える以上の光景がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dad8681-fecc-4240-b079-059b19e8071c\', \'multiverseId\': 403624}, \'multiverseid\': 403624}, {\'name\': \'영롱한 빛무리\', \'text\': \'화합 — 카드 X장을 뽑는다. X는 영롱한 빛무리를 발동하기 위해 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수이다. 그 후 카드 두 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'젠디카르에는 눈에 보이는 것보다 더 많은 것들이 존재한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e527c7c-05a9-4912-a293-b7c91cb98974\', \'multiverseId\': 403923}, \'multiverseid\': 403923}, {\'name\': \'Espectro Brilhante\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Compre X cards, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Espectro Brilhante. Depois, descarte dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Há mais para se ver em Zendikar do que os olhos podem perceber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89420b4a-ee7d-413a-b86f-e792b8ca5562\', \'multiverseId\': 404222}, \'multiverseid\': 404222}, {\'name\': \'Сияющий Спектр\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Возьмите Х карт, где Х — число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Сияющего Спектра. Затем сбросьте две карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'На Зендикаре больше диковин, чем открыто взору.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6861cab8-75c3-4c6c-be96-5284daecda0f\', \'multiverseId\': 404521}, \'multiverseid\': 404521}, {\'name\': \'聪智光谱\', \'text\': \'聚辉～抓X张牌，X为施放聪慧光谱时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。然后弃两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡的风景远超双目所及。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d1b3748-3dcd-434e-903a-4bf007b5593a\', \'multiverseId\': 402129}, \'multiverseid\': 402129}, {\'name\': \'聰智光譜\', \'text\': \'聚輝～抽X張牌，X為施放聰慧光譜時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。然後棄兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'贊迪卡的風景遠超雙目所及。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c99eb91-678c-4ec8-9b89-da183be2526c\', \'multiverseId\': 402428}, \'multiverseid\': 402428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brodelnde Erde\', \'text\': \'Die Brodelnde Erde fügt jeder Kreatur, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.Erwecken 4 — {6}{R} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {6}{R} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56da026f-1615-4b10-896e-66f3f92c2888\', \'multiverseId\': 402724}, \'multiverseid\': 402724}, {\'name\': \'Terreno hirviente\', \'text\': \'El Terreno hirviente hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura que controlan tus oponentes.Despertar 4—{6}{R}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {6}{R}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f900573-fd32-4863-8af9-e8bdd7050f74\', \'multiverseId\': 404817}, \'multiverseid\': 404817}, {\'name\': \'Terre bouillonnante\', \'text\': "La Terre bouillonnante inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent.Éveil 4 — {6}{R} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {6}{R}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403023&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440a655c-5e33-472a-902d-c0773afa73f5\', \'multiverseId\': 403023}, \'multiverseid\': 403023}, {\'name\': \'Terra Ribollente\', \'text\': \'La Terra Ribollente infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari.Risveglio 4—{6}{R} (Se lanci questa magia per {6}{R}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ae87e6e-644b-43e4-a1c5-e9e39c267896\', \'multiverseId\': 403322}, \'multiverseid\': 403322}, {\'name\': \'沸き立つ大地\', \'text\': \'沸き立つ大地はあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。覚醒４―{6}{R}（この呪文を{6}{R}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b93d76-9016-4845-9e7b-948abecef3e3\', \'multiverseId\': 403621}, \'multiverseid\': 403621}, {\'name\': \'끓는 대지\', \'text\': \'끓는 대지는 상대가 조종하는 각 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.각성 4—{6}{R} ({6}{R}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab552952-b6fe-4755-97ee-00a5b9517cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 403920}, \'multiverseid\': 403920}, {\'name\': \'Terra Fervente\', \'text\': \'Terra Fervente causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura que seus oponentes controlam.Despertar 4 — {6}{R} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {6}{R}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebd45237-6775-4968-95a3-c637a8c4ce5f\', \'multiverseId\': 404219}, \'multiverseid\': 404219}, {\'name\': \'Кипящая Земля\', \'text\': \'Кипящая Земля наносит 1 повреждение каждому существу под контролем ваших оппонентов.Пробуждение 4 — {6}{R} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {6}{R}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1954e3af-1ac5-4657-a960-4bb333551785\', \'multiverseId\': 404518}, \'multiverseid\': 404518}, {\'name\': \'沸腾大地\', \'text\': \'沸腾大地向由对手操控的每个生物各造成1点伤害。醒转4～{6}{R}（如果你支付{6}{R}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'290982f3-9478-45ec-a0ac-164bc55f50d0\', \'multiverseId\': 402126}, \'multiverseid\': 402126}, {\'name\': \'沸騰大地\', \'text\': \'沸騰大地向由對手操控的每個生物各造成1點傷害。醒轉4～{6}{R}（如果你支付{6}{R}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24d4f186-353d-4414-ab15-cc24f29cce06\', \'multiverseId\': 402425}, \'multiverseid\': 402425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brut-Zerfleischer\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Brut-Zerfleischer ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."{B}{G}, opfere eine Kreatur: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402729&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145ae46d-d35a-4916-be2d-12cbe45394d5\', \'multiverseId\': 402729}, \'multiverseid\': 402729}, {\'name\': \'Carnicero de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Carnicero de la progenie entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".{B}{G}, sacrificar una criatura: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f07c20f8-aed4-4f06-a57e-edf568137275\', \'multiverseId\': 404822}, \'multiverseid\': 404822}, {\'name\': \'Boucher de progéniture\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Boucher de progéniture arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »{B}{G}, sacrifiez une créature : La créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403028&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04f7dba2-1776-4dc1-b80e-479618d6a323\', \'multiverseId\': 403028}, \'multiverseid\': 403028}, {\'name\': \'Macellaio della Covata\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando il Macellaio della Covata entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".{B}{G}, Sacrifica una creatura: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81fe256-dda3-4eb0-a765-57087a4867c0\', \'multiverseId\': 403327}, \'multiverseid\': 403327}, {\'name\': \'血統の解体者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）血統の解体者が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。{B}{G}, クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e473a448-1f22-47be-b360-2cf8a9c33b95\', \'multiverseId\': 403626}, \'multiverseid\': 403626}, {\'name\': \'무리 도살자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)무리 도살자가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.{B}{G}, 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dff4ccaf-ffce-431d-afa3-ee45295f3832\', \'multiverseId\': 403925}, \'multiverseid\': 403925}, {\'name\': \'Carniceiro da Prole\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Carniceiro da Prole entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".{B}{G}, Sacrifique uma criatura: A criatura alvo recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e60c9c18-1481-49cf-a3d8-f6462e86262a\', \'multiverseId\': 404224}, \'multiverseid\': 404224}, {\'name\': \'Мясник Выводка\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Мясник Выводка выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».{B}{G}, пожертвуйте существо: целевое существо получает -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343fd644-cd9e-48d9-a3e3-8c3955d4c55c\', \'multiverseId\': 404523}, \'multiverseid\': 404523}, {\'name\': \'孳巢屠夫\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当孳巢屠夫进战场时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」{B}{G}，牺牲一个生物：目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1479bb8b-c3ab-4a98-a185-3c3909e5b2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 402131}, \'multiverseid\': 402131}, {\'name\': \'孳巢屠夫\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當孳巢屠夫進戰場時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」{B}{G}，犧牲一個生物：目標生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec91652-7bfb-4125-81d9-f99e19c2cd96\', \'multiverseId\': 402430}, \'multiverseid\': 402430}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutale Vertreibung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Bestimme eines oder beides —• Bringe einen Zauberspruch oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.• Die Brutale Vertreibung fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls diese bleibende Karte in diesem Zug auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402732&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcadf3c5-b73b-4669-bfcc-8c6fffd977c2\', \'multiverseId\': 402732}, \'multiverseid\': 402732}, {\'name\': \'Expulsión brutal\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Elige uno o ambos:• Regresa el hechizo o la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.• La Expulsión brutal hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o el planeswalker objetivo. Si ese permanente fuera a ir a un cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'007fd5d3-81a5-4e78-93aa-cb6445c5ce56\', \'multiverseId\': 404825}, \'multiverseid\': 404825}, {\'name\': \'Expulsion brutale\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —• Renvoyez le sort ciblé ou la créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.• L\'Expulsion brutale inflige 2 blessures à la créature ciblée ou au planeswalker ciblé. Si ce permanent devait être mis dans un cimetière ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403031&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39a8e2cc-85fe-4602-80dc-041fb021960f\', \'multiverseId\': 403031}, \'multiverseid\': 403031}, {\'name\': \'Espulsione Brutale\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Scegli uno o entrambi —• Fai tornare una magia o una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.• L\'Espulsione Brutale infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se quel permanente sta per essere messo in un cimitero in questo turno, invece esilialo.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddecd1f2-38f1-4971-aa91-8d4947ba9017\', \'multiverseId\': 403330}, \'multiverseid\': 403330}, {\'name\': \'粗暴な排除\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。• 呪文１つかクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。• クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。粗暴な排除はそれに２点のダメージを与える。このターンにそのパーマネントが墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b05b025-ad49-47dd-93a6-49fae3d5970c\', \'multiverseId\': 403629}, \'multiverseid\': 403629}, {\'name\': \'잔혹한 추방\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)하나 혹은 둘 다를 선택한다 —• 주문 또는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.• 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 잔혹한 추방은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다. 그 지속물이 이 턴에 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신에 그 지속물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29312870-fcad-4b3f-ac11-91f9236523c9\', \'multiverseId\': 403928}, \'multiverseid\': 403928}, {\'name\': \'Expulsão Brutal\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Escolha um ou ambos —• Devolva a mágica ou criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.• Expulsão Brutal causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo. Se aquela permanente seria colocada em um cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5697df83-5d14-4429-894c-fc329593bd99\', \'multiverseId\': 404227}, \'multiverseid\': 404227}, {\'name\': \'Жестокое Изгнание\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Выберите одно или оба —• Верните целевое заклинание или существо в руку его владельца.• Жестокое Изгнание наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker-у. Если тот перманент должен быть положен на кладбище в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'201a6fb5-4aa0-4b07-8188-38ef11be1380\', \'multiverseId\': 404526}, \'multiverseid\': 404526}, {\'name\': \'野蛮驱逐\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）选择一项或都选～• 将目标咒语或生物移回其拥有者手上。• 野蛮驱逐对目标生物或鹏洛客造成2点伤害。如果本回合中该永久物将被置入坟墓场，则改为将其放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d72abd1b-3458-47b6-8302-92952ea4ac0b\', \'multiverseId\': 402134}, \'multiverseid\': 402134}, {\'name\': \'野蠻驅逐\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）選擇一項或都選～• 將目標咒語或生物移回其擁有者手上。• 野蠻驅逐對目標生物或鵬洛客造成2點傷害。如果本回合中該永久物將被置入墳墓場，則改為將其放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9833e60-8375-4517-952b-f23fe8390f28\', \'multiverseId\': 402433}, \'multiverseid\': 402433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutjägerwurm\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Die natürliche Fauna Zendikars hat sich angepasst und versteckt sich unter Steinen oder im Unterholz, um den gefährlichsten Räubern zu entgehen. Die Eldrazi müssen sich erst noch anpassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75027d47-9fe4-4a68-b56f-c24808a09dba\', \'multiverseId\': 402731}, \'multiverseid\': 402731}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe cazaprogenie\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Las criaturas nativas de Zendikar se han adaptado a vivir bajo las rocas y a deslizarse entre la maleza para evitar a los predadores más voraces. Los Eldrazi aún no han evolucionado en este sentido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f17545a-14fa-405a-b0c1-422aad6aea95\', \'multiverseId\': 404824}, \'multiverseid\': 404824}, {\'name\': \'Guivre traque-progéniture\', \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "Les créatures originaires de Zendikar s\'étaient adaptées pour vivre sous les rochers et ramper dans les taillis afin d\'échapper aux prédateurs les plus voraces. Les Eldrazi, eux, n\'avaient pas encore eu le temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9149e3d1-e54d-4687-89d0-178917926008\', \'multiverseId\': 403030}, \'multiverseid\': 403030}, {\'name\': \'Wurm Razziacovata\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Le creature native di Zendikar si sono adattate a vivere sotto le rocce e a strisciare nel sottobosco per evitare i predatori più voraci. Gli Eldrazi non hanno ancora preso queste precauzioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f95cd02-1212-4521-a6c3-aec1131a73ec\', \'multiverseId\': 403329}, \'multiverseid\': 403329}, {\'name\': \'血統絶やしのワーム\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカー固有の生物は、貪欲な捕食者を避けるため、岩の下に棲み薮の中を這うようになった。エルドラージはそのような順応を行わない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f824a75f-2070-45fc-bb62-d3f3b71ae4b5\', \'multiverseId\': 403628}, \'multiverseid\': 403628}, {\'name\': \'무리사냥꾼 웜\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': \'젠디카르 태생의 생물들은 잔혹한 포식자를 피하기 위해 바위 아래에서 살면서 덤불 사이를 기어 다니는 삶에 적응했다. 엘드라지는 아직 이런 삶에 적응되지 않았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2c10b0-c5a4-480e-b7a6-0dbaba5307f9\', \'multiverseId\': 403927}, \'multiverseid\': 403927}, {\'name\': \'Vorme Caçador da Prole\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'As criaturas nativas de Zendikar se adaptaram a viver sob as rochas e rastejar pela vegetação rasteira para evitar os predadores mais vorazes. Os Eldrazi ainda precisam fazer tais ajustes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92e3d77a-3f4d-488f-a0bf-42a210469aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 404226}, \'multiverseid\': 404226}, {\'name\': \'Вурм-Пожиратель Выводков\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': \'Уроженцы Зендикара научились прятаться под камнями и пробираться через подлесок, чтобы не попадаться самым прожорливым из хищников. Эльдрази же еще не успели приспособиться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ff195e-74de-41d4-96bb-98ac3431d162\', \'multiverseId\': 404525}, \'multiverseid\': 404525}, {\'name\': \'猎巢亚龙\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡的原生物种为了躲避贪餍的捕食者，已经适应了在石块下生活并在灌丛中穿梭；但奥札奇还未适应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91e50023-488f-439d-b7d7-a2320e2bdc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 402133}, \'multiverseid\': 402133}, {\'name\': \'獵巢亞龍\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': \'贊迪卡的原生物種為了躲避貪饜的捕食者，已經適應了在石塊下生活並在灌叢中穿梭；但奧札奇尚未適應。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff2afcc2-d6a3-4d0b-811d-54b24df7101e\', \'multiverseId\': 402432}, \'multiverseid\': 402432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutknecht\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Brutknecht stirbt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Später können wir um die trauern, die wir verloren haben. Zuerst müssen wir sie jedoch von ihrem Leid erlösen."—Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402735&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a836a6-2fc7-417c-bd33-ce69e8d079ab\', \'multiverseId\': 402735}, \'multiverseid\': 402735}, {\'name\': \'Esclavo portador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Esclavo portador muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lloraremos después por los que hemos perdido. Primero tenemos que acabar con su sufrimiento".—Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a0cf85d-c561-4704-938d-1d6939dc6c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 404828}, \'multiverseid\': 404828}, {\'name\': \'Serviteur propagateur\', \'text\': \'Quand le Serviteur propagateur meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Nous ferons le deuil de nos morts plus tard. Nous devons d\'abord abréger leurs souffrances. »—Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403034&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9826aa4-9c90-47ca-9daa-9ccfa7c18765\', \'multiverseId\': 403034}, \'multiverseid\': 403034}, {\'name\': \'Schiavo Infetto\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Schiavo Infetto muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Un giorno piangeremo coloro che abbiamo perso. Prima dobbiamo porre fine alle loro sofferenze."—Drana, capo sanguinario Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399ca3f3-d20e-49cc-838f-bb762e6a9173\', \'multiverseId\': 403333}, \'multiverseid\': 403333}, {\'name\': \'捕らわれの宿主\', \'text\': \'捕らわれの宿主が死亡したとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「亡くした者を嘆くのは後。彼らの苦痛を終わらせるのが先です。」――カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7f619c-af61-46a3-a5df-3e70d79cd5f8\', \'multiverseId\': 403632}, \'multiverseid\': 403632}, {\'name\': \'보인자 노예\', \'text\': \'보인자 노예가 죽을 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"죽은 자들은 나중에 애도하자. 먼저 그들의 고통을 끝내야만 한다."—칼라스트리아의 혈족장 드라나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f1710f-01c0-4b88-9062-c6f637321428\', \'multiverseId\': 403931}, \'multiverseid\': 403931}, {\'name\': \'Cativo Portador\', \'text\': \'Quando Cativo Portador morrer, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos chorar por nossas perdas mais tarde. Primeiro precisamos acabar com seu sofrimento."— Drana, grã-vampira Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9e72ac-b92a-4a4b-8a0a-870dca8753a6\', \'multiverseId\': 404230}, \'multiverseid\': 404230}, {\'name\': \'Раб-Носитель\', \'text\': \'Когда Раб-Носитель умирает, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Оплакивать погибших мы будем потом. Сперва надо положить конец их страданиям».— Драна, кровавый вождь Каластриев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb8d265-8fbf-4f1a-98a3-6094e34daed7\', \'multiverseId\': 404529}, \'multiverseid\': 404529}, {\'name\': \'带原鬼卒\', \'text\': \'当带原鬼卒死去时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「日后我们会悼念逝去的同胞。现在的要务是结束他们的痛苦。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ae280d-1f3d-4c75-a136-0296c3eab102\', \'multiverseId\': 402137}, \'multiverseid\': 402137}, {\'name\': \'帶原鬼卒\', \'text\': \'當帶原鬼卒死去時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「日後我們會悼念逝去的同胞。現在的要務是結束他們的痛苦。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0f10ba-c7a3-4278-9a92-21ecfe2811fe\', \'multiverseId\': 402436}, \'multiverseid\': 402436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutüberwacher\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Brutüberwacher ins Spiel kommt, bringe drei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zärtlichkeit einer Mutter. Das Mitleid einer Gottesanbeterin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02699528-6092-415b-bb5e-c7e8662462d6\', \'multiverseId\': 402730}, \'multiverseid\': 402730}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Vigilante de la progenie entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla tres fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'La ternura de una madre. La piedad de una mantis religiosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952094c9-c652-4242-aea6-74e2ba6e3633\', \'multiverseId\': 404823}, \'multiverseid\': 404823}, {\'name\': \'Surveillant de progéniture\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Surveillant de progéniture arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille trois jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "La tendresse d\'une mère. La compassion d\'une mante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403029&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'805afcad-dd0b-4c83-89ff-b1be93c88d5c\', \'multiverseId\': 403029}, \'multiverseid\': 403029}, {\'name\': \'Sorvegliante della Covata\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando la Sorvegliante della Covata entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia tre pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "L\'affetto di una madre. La misericordia di una mantide.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf6ab37e-9348-4ee4-832c-dec6ca5435cc\', \'multiverseId\': 403328}, \'multiverseid\': 403328}, {\'name\': \'血統の観察者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）血統の観察者が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'母親の愛情。蟷螂の同情。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0a56dd5-0ac6-4972-89f3-fe54a9dd3f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 403627}, \'multiverseid\': 403627}, {\'name\': \'무리 감시자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)무리 감시자가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 세 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'어머니의 자애. 사마귀의 비애.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe83bbfc-f6cf-4fde-8dc5-46f24d05b337\', \'multiverseId\': 403926}, \'multiverseid\': 403926}, {\'name\': \'Monitorador da Prole\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Monitorador da Prole entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha três fichas de criatura incolores 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'A ternura de uma mãe. A piedade de um louva-a-deus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5d3437-956a-419e-a745-461060f099c3\', \'multiverseId\': 404225}, \'multiverseid\': 404225}, {\'name\': \'Смотритель Выводка\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Смотритель Выводка выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы три фишки существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Они имеют способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Нежность матери. Милосердие богомола.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1cd20f6-c0dc-4bb3-9be0-0b3711cf49a5\', \'multiverseId\': 404524}, \'multiverseid\': 404524}, {\'name\': \'孳巢监卫\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当孳巢监卫进战场时，将三个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'母性的温柔。螳螂的怜悯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0cf13cd-5ec7-440b-b0d9-d34a061b7c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 402132}, \'multiverseid\': 402132}, {\'name\': \'孳巢監衛\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當孳巢監衛進戰場時，將三個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它們具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'母性的溫柔。螳螂的憐憫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'564238e1-5112-4ebb-a9c2-c93967764e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 402431}, \'multiverseid\': 402431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brüter-Drohne\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn die Brüter-Drohne ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Berührung eines Eldrazi bringt abwechselnd Leben und Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f0c0003-e039-4064-8245-e8113c8e4b19\', \'multiverseId\': 402812}, \'multiverseid\': 402812}, {\'name\': \'Zángano incubador\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Zángano incubador entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'La caricia de un Eldrazi trae vida y muerte, una tras otra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b82e90c-2730-4351-b658-c5a7694b9a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 404905}, \'multiverseid\': 404905}, {\'name\': \'Drone incubateur\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Drone incubateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Le toucher d\'un Eldrazi apporte successivement la vie et la mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c182ea9-5bb5-4359-99dc-d4bc4c0cf377\', \'multiverseId\': 403111}, \'multiverseid\': 403111}, {\'name\': \'Parassita Incubatore\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando il Parassita Incubatore entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il tocco di un Eldrazi dona prima vita, poi morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3570ef0-c605-499a-a763-b029e1c39ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 403410}, \'multiverseid\': 403410}, {\'name\': \'培養ドローン\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）培養ドローンが戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの接触は生と死を一度にもたらす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550cbcf3-3e8f-4c95-999a-e5f0cecf7d54\', \'multiverseId\': 403709}, \'multiverseid\': 403709}, {\'name\': \'부화 드론\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)부화 드론이 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지는 생명과 죽음을 순서대로 가져온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e916149d-c883-4cf7-b429-68262a70f885\', \'multiverseId\': 404008}, \'multiverseid\': 404008}, {\'name\': \'Zangão Incubador\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Zangão Incubador entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'O toque de um Eldrazi traz alternadamente a vida e a morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51e867cb-ee6e-4e41-a85d-7165570950d9\', \'multiverseId\': 404307}, \'multiverseid\': 404307}, {\'name\': \'Дрон-Инкубатор\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Дрон-Инкубатор выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Прикосновение Эльдрази несет жизнь и вслед за ней — смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71f61dd-665d-481d-9248-f60f2c07d9dd\', \'multiverseId\': 404606}, \'multiverseid\': 404606}, {\'name\': \'抚育奴兽\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当抚育奴兽进战场时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇一触为生，二触为灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345c7128-d728-4d54-9caf-607b73720bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 402214}, \'multiverseid\': 402214}, {\'name\': \'撫育奴獸\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當撫育奴獸進戰場時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇一觸為生，二觸為滅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e441f5f-dc36-4e19-96c8-b369dda862a2\', \'multiverseId\': 402513}, \'multiverseid\': 402513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Wasserschleier teilen\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug. Schicke Den Wasserschleier teilen ins Exil.Erwecken 6 — {6}{U}{U}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {6}{U}{U}{U} wirkst, lege außerdem sechs +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d47906f6-a900-47e3-b0c7-b34818679c99\', \'multiverseId\': 402879}, \'multiverseid\': 402879}, {\'name\': \'Dividir el Velo Acuoso\', \'text\': \'Juega un turno adicional después de este. Exilia Dividir el Velo Acuoso.Despertar 6—{6}{U}{U}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {6}{U}{U}{U}, pon además seis contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c841a06c-93b5-4ba7-b5bc-1f3f250fabcd\', \'multiverseId\': 404972}, \'multiverseid\': 404972}, {\'name\': "Ouvrir le Voile d\'Eau", \'text\': "Jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci. Exilez Ouvrir le Voile d\'Eau.Éveil 6 — {6}{U}{U}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {6}{U}{U}{U}, mettez aussi six marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4971a2c8-7788-4ebd-a491-78e115ab63c7\', \'multiverseId\': 403178}, \'multiverseid\': 403178}, {\'name\': "Aprire il Velo d\'Acqua", \'text\': "Gioca un turno extra dopo questo. Esilia Aprire il Velo d\'Acqua.Risveglio 6—{6}{U}{U}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per {6}{U}{U}{U}, metti anche sei segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50178956-967f-4b1f-961c-ec7047948bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 403477}, \'multiverseid\': 403477}, {\'name\': \'水の帳の分離\', \'text\': \'このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。水の帳の分離を追放する。覚醒６―{6}{U}{U}{U}（この呪文を{6}{U}{U}{U}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを６個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972b8b4b-26f0-4b65-8dad-7aa16704ed23\', \'multiverseId\': 403776}, \'multiverseid\': 403776}, {\'name\': \'물의 장막 가르기\', \'text\': \'이번 턴 후에 추가로 턴을 얻는다. 물의 장막 가르기를 추방한다.각성 6—{6}{U}{U}{U} ({6}{U}{U}{U}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 여섯 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b00e78f-fd8e-4b8d-9f8f-9fac4e55ce0a\', \'multiverseId\': 404075}, \'multiverseid\': 404075}, {\'name\': "Repartir o Véu d\'Água", \'text\': "Jogue um turno extra após este. Exile Repartir o Véu d\'Água.Despertar 6 — {6}{U}{U}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {6}{U}{U}{U}, coloque também seis marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)", \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb408757-c979-4e16-a0cb-704ad039fb6c\', \'multiverseId\': 404374}, \'multiverseid\': 404374}, {\'name\': \'Разрыв Водяной Завесы\', \'text\': \'Сделайте дополнительный ход вслед за этим. Изгоните Разрыв Водяной Завесы.Пробуждение 6 — {6}{U}{U}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {6}{U}{U}{U}, также положите шесть жетонов +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3a53b5-4255-464d-8866-8edf069d3e89\', \'multiverseId\': 404673}, \'multiverseid\': 404673}, {\'name\': \'分开水帘\', \'text\': \'于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。放逐分开水帘。醒转6～{6}{U}{U}{U}（如果你支付{6}{U}{U}{U}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置六个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a70b7d-8c7e-4c79-b3b7-b19fe30aa43d\', \'multiverseId\': 402281}, \'multiverseid\': 402281}, {\'name\': \'分開水簾\', \'text\': \'於本回合後進行額外的一個回合。放逐分開水簾。醒轉6～{6}{U}{U}{U}（如果你支付{6}{U}{U}{U}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置六個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72c1543-e5c2-4063-a6f9-2bdee4788aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 402580}, \'multiverseid\': 402580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Endlose\', \'text\': \'Der Endlose kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Er verkörpert alle möglichen Bedeutungen des Wortes „endlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40240b8a-a940-422f-88bb-4a268942c5f3\', \'multiverseId\': 402768}, \'multiverseid\': 402768}, {\'name\': \'Aquel que no tiene fin\', \'text\': \'Aquel que no tiene fin entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Encarna todos los significados posibles de la palabra "infinito".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bea3e74-8aca-4586-90b7-a1f8cbe14238\', \'multiverseId\': 404861}, \'multiverseid\': 404861}, {\'name\': \'Interminable\', \'text\': "L\'Interminable arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il incarne tous les sens possibles du mot « infini ».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b316bbae-c62e-408c-9987-5904c9e2fc96\', \'multiverseId\': 403067}, \'multiverseid\': 403067}, {\'name\': "L\'Illimitato", \'text\': "L\'Illimitato entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Incarna tutti i possibili significati della parola "infinito".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12efd610-7814-4523-9343-94cded7de0b3\', \'multiverseId\': 403366}, \'multiverseid\': 403366}, {\'name\': \'果てしなきもの\', \'text\': \'果てしなきものは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'それは「無限」の持つあらゆる意味を体現している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'398926d5-7b9b-4ce4-add9-a902dc48d8c5\', \'multiverseId\': 403665}, \'multiverseid\': 403665}, {\'name\': \'끝없는 자\', \'text\': \'끝없는 자는 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 "무한"이라는 의미가 무엇인지를 온몸으로 보여준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c20422-4e25-4211-8ea0-6ed686395a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 403964}, \'multiverseid\': 403964}, {\'name\': \'O Infindável\', \'text\': \'O Infindável entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Ele personifica todos os significados possíveis da palavra "infinito".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7fc122-c852-4d92-a6fa-b3a953edeb80\', \'multiverseId\': 404263}, \'multiverseid\': 404263}, {\'name\': \'Бесконечный\', \'text\': \'Бесконечный выходит на поле битвы с Х жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Он воплощает в себе все возможные значения слова «бесконечность».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bb6cf81-9ef5-444a-9d0d-58b730ba223e\', \'multiverseId\': 404562}, \'multiverseid\': 404562}, {\'name\': \'无尽巨物\', \'text\': \'无尽巨物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'它代表着「无限」的所有含义。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69aeee0f-c249-443f-b274-819962958a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 402170}, \'multiverseid\': 402170}, {\'name\': \'無盡巨物\', \'text\': \'無盡巨物進戰場時上面有X個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'它代表著「無限」的所有含義。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a39e6adf-6728-4d62-9009-5656465c30e0\', \'multiverseId\': 402469}, \'multiverseid\': 402469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Monster erschlagen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem er die Kor in der Schlacht gesehen hatte, verstand Gideon den Unterschied zwischen einfacher Zusammenarbeit und dem Handeln als eine Einheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de47d2c6-d152-494c-aa9e-c2ea6c72f4a7\', \'multiverseId\': 402939}, \'multiverseid\': 402939}, {\'name\': \'Abatir al monstruo\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de observar a los kor en la batalla, Gideon comprendió la diferencia entre trabajar juntos y trabajar como uno solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a43fd3-fc09-439c-a284-d752370c5f4f\', \'multiverseId\': 405032}, \'multiverseid\': 405032}, {\'name\': \'Pourfendre le monstrueux\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "C\'est en observant les kor au combat que Gideon comprit la différence entre travailler ensemble et travailler comme un seul homme.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9dcabe1-a93d-4be5-bfea-a399b358181e\', \'multiverseId\': 403238}, \'multiverseid\': 403238}, {\'name\': \'Punire i Mostruosi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Vedendo combattere i kor, Gideon capì la differenza tra lavorare insieme e lavorare come un sol uomo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baa9f9af-7d10-47e9-8a97-96fd8f0ba88d\', \'multiverseId\': 403537}, \'multiverseid\': 403537}, {\'name\': \'大物潰し\', \'text\': \'パワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'コーたちの戦いぶりを見てギデオンは、協力することと一体となることの違いを悟った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f630e26-07e0-4853-aa35-60fdf9f2558d\', \'multiverseId\': 403836}, \'multiverseid\': 403836}, {\'name\': \'괴물의 격파\', \'text\': \'공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'전장에서 코르를 지켜보고 난 후, 기디온은 함께 싸우는 것과 혼자 싸우는 것의 차이를 이해하게 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77878b8-8ebe-4a73-abd3-fc814ec462af\', \'multiverseId\': 404135}, \'multiverseid\': 404135}, {\'name\': \'Golpear o Monstruoso\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Depois de ver os kor em batalha, Gideon entendeu a diferença entre trabalhar em conjunto e trabalhar como se fossem um só.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a2549b-bc9f-4641-b184-1571944b64f2\', \'multiverseId\': 404434}, \'multiverseid\': 404434}, {\'name\': \'Сразить Чудовище\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с силой 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Увидев, как коры сражаются, Гидеон понял разницу между словами «действовать вместе» и «действовать, как одно целое».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d84adef-e09b-4eed-990e-7cd5a285043f\', \'multiverseId\': 404733}, \'multiverseid\': 404733}, {\'name\': \'击灭恶物\', \'text\': \'消灭目标力量等于或大于4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在见识过寇族的战斗后，基定明白了齐心协力与齐心如一是不同的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f98d4892-eb12-441e-9c80-2b0e07063855\', \'multiverseId\': 402341}, \'multiverseid\': 402341}, {\'name\': \'擊滅惡物\', \'text\': \'消滅目標力量等於或大於4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在見識過寇族的戰鬥後，基定明白了齊心協力與齊心如一是不同的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b68228-c689-4ebb-a120-679d98d442ff\', \'multiverseId\': 402640}, \'multiverseid\': 402640}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Wildnis absuchen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte oder eine Länderkarte offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„In meiner Freizeit habe ich Aussichtspunkte markiert. Nun verschwinden die Aussichtspunkte schneller als meine Freizeit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a0b59c-19e0-485c-b509-26a0e8070970\', \'multiverseId\': 402924}, \'multiverseid\': 402924}, {\'name\': \'En busca de lo salvaje\', \'text\': \'Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura o de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando tenía tiempo libre, solía pintar paisajes. Ahora los paisajes desaparecen más rápido que mi tiempo libre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9e8bb2-d6cb-466c-8196-e4d59fa53d14\', \'multiverseId\': 405017}, \'multiverseid\': 405017}, {\'name\': \'À la recherche des étendues sauvages\', \'text\': "Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature ou de terrain parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Quand j\'avais du temps libre, je peignais des paysages. Maintenant, les paysages disparaissent plus vite que mon temps libre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0771405b-d7fd-4c2b-9af4-e7cfefb7f4fe\', \'multiverseId\': 403223}, \'multiverseid\': 403223}, {\'name\': \'Ricerca delle Terre Selvagge\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura o terra scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Nel tempo libero dipingevo paesaggi. Ora i paesaggi scompaiono più in fretta del mio tempo libero."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85467398-2bfd-476d-9819-f94bd388b81a\', \'multiverseId\': 403522}, \'multiverseid\': 403522}, {\'name\': \'未開地の捜索\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを見る。あなたはその中からクリーチャー・カード１枚か土地・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「休みにはよく風景画を描いていたんだが、近頃では休みより早く風景が消えてしまうんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ebbb2d0-a499-4d97-9b27-a69ab335182b\', \'multiverseId\': 403821}, \'multiverseid\': 403821}, {\'name\': \'야생을 찾아서\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 본다. 당신은 그 중에서 생물 또는 대지 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"할 일이 없을 때는 아름다운 경치를 그리곤 했었지. 이제는 그런 것들이 내 휴식시간보다 빨리 사라지고 있어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73115958-68a8-444e-a420-bf71290c53a5\', \'multiverseId\': 404120}, \'multiverseid\': 404120}, {\'name\': \'Buscar o Mundo Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de criatura ou terreno dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"No meu tempo livre, eu costumava pintar paisagens. Agora as paisagens desaparecem mais rápido que o meu tempo livre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177062a3-eac9-4a50-8a4d-bcd2607ce253\', \'multiverseId\': 404419}, \'multiverseid\': 404419}, {\'name\': \'Поиски Дебрей\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа или земли и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Раньше в свободное время я писала пейзажи. А теперь пейзажи пропадают быстрее, чем кончается мое свободное время».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26cadd50-8cc7-43d0-9198-2d4094dd8a55\', \'multiverseId\': 404718}, \'multiverseid\': 404718}, {\'name\': \'探寻野境\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中的一张生物或地牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「休工时，我常会描绘风景。如今，风景消逝的速度赶上了我休工的时间。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7cfe928-7282-4978-b47a-ef52456b7679\', \'multiverseId\': 402326}, \'multiverseid\': 402326}, {\'name\': \'探尋野境\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以展示其中的一張生物或地牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「休工時，我常會描繪風景。如今，風景消逝的速度趕上了我休工的時間。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5375914-df4f-4c2c-93c3-b8021edb48d7\', \'multiverseId\': 402625}, \'multiverseid\': 402625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Leere\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.){1}{G}, lege eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers: Bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eldrazi löschen Leben nicht einfach aus … sie ersetzen es.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf033385-b7de-4c41-960b-30fbd3b43e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 402989}, \'multiverseid\': 402989}, {\'name\': \'Asistente del vacío\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.){1}{G}, poner una carta del exilio que controla un oponente en el cementerio de ese jugador: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi no se limitan a extinguir la vida: la suplantan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a734e7a-90bd-4c7b-b318-e752eeb96e72\', \'multiverseId\': 405082}, \'multiverseid\': 405082}, {\'name\': \'Suivant du vide\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.){1}{G}, mettez une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': "Les Eldrazi ne se contentent pas d\'effacer toute vie, ils la supplantent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca088c33-b8d0-410c-be90-d147b28c9c84\', \'multiverseId\': 403288}, \'multiverseid\': 403288}, {\'name\': \'Servitore del Vuoto\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.){1}{G}, Metti una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\\\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Eldrazi non si limitano a sopprimere la vita: la soppiantano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e12b00-3c1d-4e8a-bb51-761b18497e91\', \'multiverseId\': 403587}, \'multiverseid\': 403587}, {\'name\': \'虚空の従者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）{1}{G}, 追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置く：無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージは生命を消し去るだけではない。それに取って代わるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a637ed8e-9dda-44f0-b9a3-8bfdafffa011\', \'multiverseId\': 403886}, \'multiverseid\': 403886}, {\'name\': \'공허의 수행원\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.){1}{G}, 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣는다: 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지는 단순히 생명을 없애는 게 아니라 그것을 대체한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f1f9c0c-6a0c-4f4b-b398-63834d00b51a\', \'multiverseId\': 404185}, \'multiverseid\': 404185}, {\'name\': \'Assistente do Vazio\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.){1}{G}, Coloque um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': \'Os Eldrazi não extinguem meramente a vida — eles a suplantam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5703841-6aa3-4f0a-954e-7f083acaaa62\', \'multiverseId\': 404484}, \'multiverseid\': 404484}, {\'name\': \'Блюститель Пустоты\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.){1}{G}, положите принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока: положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази не просто уничтожают жизнь — они занимают ее место.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'338d717a-d1f9-4ca3-a6d1-b4824b1cf589\', \'multiverseId\': 404783}, \'multiverseid\': 404783}, {\'name\': \'虚空侍从\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）{1}{G}，将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场：将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇不只是灭绝生命～它们取而代之。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bf1c535-f603-4457-8043-34051c51e5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 402391}, \'multiverseid\': 402391}, {\'name\': \'虛空侍從\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）{1}{G}，將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場：將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇不只是滅絕生命～它們取而代之。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'536ef79b-73fb-4862-b7e3-dc0a45ca331d\', \'multiverseId\': 402690}, \'multiverseid\': 402690}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dominierende Drohne\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Zehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)Wenn die Dominierende Drohne ins Spiel kommt und falls du eine andere farblose Kreatur kontrollierst, verliert jeder Gegner 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402756&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b4010b-a525-4c6c-8a0d-81a4edc8eb14\', \'multiverseId\': 402756}, \'multiverseid\': 402756}, {\'name\': \'Zángano dominador\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)Cuando el Zángano dominador entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otra criatura incolora, cada oponente pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfaf7052-7f7b-4a8e-b4a9-0f2aea21048d\', \'multiverseId\': 404849}, \'multiverseid\': 404849}, {\'name\': \'Drone dominateur\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Ingestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)Quand le Drone dominateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez une autre créature incolore, chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57c19816-6104-48a6-ac43-d57bf7735995\', \'multiverseId\': 403055}, \'multiverseid\': 403055}, {\'name\': \'Parassita Dominante\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ingerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)Quando il Parassita Dominante entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un\'altra creatura incolore, ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6bf0a7-d885-458b-b0c7-c485806954ba\', \'multiverseId\': 403354}, \'multiverseid\': 403354}, {\'name\': \'威圧ドローン\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）威圧ドローンが戦場に出たとき、あなたが他の無色のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a946121-3ceb-4326-91b9-cb187cae01f9\', \'multiverseId\': 403653}, \'multiverseid\': 403653}, {\'name\': \'지배자 드론\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)지배자 드론이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 다른 무색 생물을 조종하고 있으면 각 상대는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc4aa9f-8076-4dfb-acdf-6fc03de87d33\', \'multiverseId\': 403952}, \'multiverseid\': 403952}, {\'name\': \'Zangão Dominador\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ingerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)Quando Zangão Dominador entra no campo de batalha, se você controla outra criatura incolor, cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a325f45f-dc43-4e1a-82fa-e8cdad0958f2\', \'multiverseId\': 404251}, \'multiverseid\': 404251}, {\'name\': \'Дрон-Доминатор\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Заглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)Когда Дрон-Доминатор выходит на поле битвы, если вы контролируете другое бесцветное существо, то каждый оппонент теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0dab091-e59e-4cd3-a6fd-55a2ed0d9158\', \'multiverseId\': 404550}, \'multiverseid\': 404550}, {\'name\': \'主宰奴兽\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）当主宰奴兽进战场时，若你操控另一个无色生物，则每位对手各失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4387023-049b-40c6-8c2a-ee8dc2e03824\', \'multiverseId\': 402158}, \'multiverseid\': 402158}, {\'name\': \'主宰奴獸\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）當主宰奴獸進戰場時，若你操控另一個無色生物，則每位對手各失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda3eaf8-0f30-468c-a584-b88b12759bde\', \'multiverseId\': 402457}, \'multiverseid\': 402457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drana, Befreierin von Malakir\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, ErstschlagImmer wenn Drana, Befreierin von Malakir, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege auf jede angreifende Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich lasse mich nicht versklaven. Wenn ihr frei sein wollt, dann kämpft an meiner Seite."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402758&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec906f7a-8026-428d-b67e-59e32c81510c\', \'multiverseId\': 402758}, \'multiverseid\': 402758}, {\'name\': \'Drana, libertadora de Malakir\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero.Siempre que Drana, libertadora de Malakir haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura atacante que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"No viviré como esclava. Si quieres ser libre, lucha a mi lado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1088548e-e8b3-4620-a5a1-5fbfb0730861\', \'multiverseId\': 404851}, \'multiverseid\': 404851}, {\'name\': \'Drana, libératrice de Malakir\', \'text\': \'Vol, initiativeÀ chaque fois que Drana, libératrice de Malakir inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature attaquante que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne vivrai pas en esclave. Si vous voulez être libres, battez-vous à mes côtés. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275a6a5e-f0cc-4a3f-868a-52931d75037d\', \'multiverseId\': 403057}, \'multiverseid\': 403057}, {\'name\': \'Drana, Liberatrice di Malakir\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvvisoOgniqualvolta Drana, Liberatrice di Malakir infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura attaccante che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Non vivrò come una schiava. Se volete essere liberi, allora combattete al mio fianco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402cde83-afeb-4658-a575-fe2c7b31b189\', \'multiverseId\': 403356}, \'multiverseid\': 403356}, {\'name\': \'マラキールの解放者、ドラーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃マラキールの解放者、ドラーナがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたがコントロールする各攻撃クリーチャーの上に、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「我は奴隷として生きはせぬ。自由になるつもりなら、我と共に戦うがよい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7303dd14-ffbb-4927-9bb1-d277ef9abcc8\', \'multiverseId\': 403655}, \'multiverseid\': 403655}, {\'name\': \'말라키르의 해방자 드라나\', \'text\': \'비행, 선제공격말라키르의 해방자 드라나가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 각 공격생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 흡혈귀 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"난 노예로 살지 않겠어. 너도 자유를 원한다면 나와 함께 싸우자."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336fe4b6-1129-4aeb-8b0a-e73c4d793f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 403954}, \'multiverseid\': 403954}, {\'name\': \'Drana, Libertadora de Malakir\', \'text\': \'Voar, iniciativaToda vez que Drana, Libertadora de Malakir, causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura atacante que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não viverei como escrava. Se vocês preferem ser livres, lutem ao meu lado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf1028c-99e1-4fc4-bbf3-4c5013f66c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 404253}, \'multiverseid\': 404253}, {\'name\': \'Драна, Освободительница Малакира\', \'text\': \'Полет, Первый ударКаждый раз, когда Драна, Освободительница Малакира наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое атакующее существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не стану жить в рабстве. Если хочешь быть свободным, сражайся вместе со мной».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991be972-4a9f-4b0f-9f9a-84ef23000fc3\', \'multiverseId\': 404552}, \'multiverseid\': 404552}, {\'name\': \'马拉奇解放者哲娜\', \'text\': \'飞行，先攻每当马拉奇解放者哲娜对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，在每个由你操控且正进行攻击的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～吸血鬼／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我不愿苟活为奴。如果你希冀自由，就与我并肩作战。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db3e4d0f-e7fa-4f0a-8978-f4efeead19f8\', \'multiverseId\': 402160}, \'multiverseid\': 402160}, {\'name\': \'馬拉奇解放者哲娜\', \'text\': \'飛行，先攻每當馬拉奇解放者哲娜對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在每個由你操控且正進行攻擊的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～吸血鬼／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我不願苟活為奴。如果你希冀自由，就與我並肩作戰。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2afdead-b993-4ec0-8ce3-0d94eb11f567\', \'multiverseId\': 402459}, \'multiverseid\': 402459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dranas Gesandte\', \'text\': \'FliegendZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Freiheit schmeckt noch süßer als Blut."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402759&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb797536-64cb-4403-ae11-815e9cd65aec\', \'multiverseId\': 402759}, \'multiverseid\': 402759}, {\'name\': \'Emisaria de Drana\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"El sabor de la libertad es más dulce que la sangre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'009852e1-3415-430a-94b2-93cf97d5ce81\', \'multiverseId\': 404852}, \'multiverseid\': 404852}, {\'name\': \'Émissaire de Drana\', \'text\': \'VolAu début de votre entretien, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et clerc et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Le goût de la liberté est plus doux que celui du sang. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e8a7cf-dbc6-48d4-a01c-82bc5d21174d\', \'multiverseId\': 403058}, \'multiverseid\': 403058}, {\'name\': \'Emissaria di Drana\', \'text\': "VolareAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Chierico Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Il sapore della libertà è più dolce di quello del sangue."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c27738-d394-4d26-bff8-ab12054c9b9b\', \'multiverseId\': 403357}, \'multiverseid\': 403357}, {\'name\': \'ドラーナの使者\', \'text\': \'飛行あなたのアップキープの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「自由の味って、血よりも甘いのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5546fdcd-e3ce-4414-8e31-3a5779d9bb11\', \'multiverseId\': 403656}, \'multiverseid\': 403656}, {\'name\': \'드라나의 사절\', \'text\': \'비행당신의 유지단 시작에, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 성직자 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"자유의 맛은 피보다 달다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'149f89ae-05bc-4c04-9ec7-aea31a35d7f8\', \'multiverseId\': 403955}, \'multiverseid\': 403955}, {\'name\': \'Emissário de Drana\', \'text\': \'VoarNo início de sua manutenção, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Clérigo Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"O gosto da liberdade é mais doce que o sangue."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334fb6fa-e7ba-462b-a47a-d09d05c1a8c4\', \'multiverseId\': 404254}, \'multiverseid\': 404254}, {\'name\': \'Посланница Драны\', \'text\': \'ПолетВ начале вашего шага поддержки каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Священник Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Вкус свободы слаще крови».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23405f4b-530c-4e02-8982-7ec9dbae7300\', \'multiverseId\': 404553}, \'multiverseid\': 404553}, {\'name\': \'哲娜的密使\', \'text\': \'飞行在你的维持开始时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／僧侣／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「自由的味道比鲜血更甜美。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d014fd8-c929-4df8-b627-689f04d3b10f\', \'multiverseId\': 402161}, \'multiverseid\': 402161}, {\'name\': \'哲娜的密使\', \'text\': \'飛行在你的維持開始時，每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／僧侶／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「自由的味道比鮮血還甜美。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'417c7869-f72c-4e48-8c55-cd2df387c4c6\', \'multiverseId\': 402460}, \'multiverseid\': 402460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drohende Felsspitzen\', \'text\': \'Die Drohenden Felsspitzen kommen getappt ins Spiel.Wenn die Drohenden Felsspitzen ins Spiel kommen, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd38f2f-1019-48b2-a26d-e0bf09c0fcf0\', \'multiverseId\': 402839}, \'multiverseid\': 402839}, {\'name\': \'Agujas amenazantes\', \'text\': \'Las Agujas amenazantes entran al campo de batalla giradas.Cuando las Agujas amenazantes entren al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.{T}: Agrega {R} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfde4ef5-5c1a-4361-b783-acfd6908c311\', \'multiverseId\': 404932}, \'multiverseid\': 404932}, {\'name\': \'Cimes surgissantes\', \'text\': "Les Cimes surgissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.Quand les Cimes surgissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.{T} : Ajoutez {R} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef9e0af-c824-4e4f-86b1-8951598d4a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 403138}, \'multiverseid\': 403138}, {\'name\': \'Picchi Incombenti\', \'text\': \'I Picchi Incombenti entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.Quando i Picchi Incombenti entrano nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.{T}: Aggiungi {R} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10da065-b809-4b8d-a6cd-e5a1ac612703\', \'multiverseId\': 403437}, \'multiverseid\': 403437}, {\'name\': \'そびえる尖頂\', \'text\': \'そびえる尖頂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そびえる尖頂が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91e066ef-1eed-46ab-8b78-24c5d000ef83\', \'multiverseId\': 403736}, \'multiverseid\': 403736}, {\'name\': \'희미한 뾰족산\', \'text\': \'희미한 뾰족산은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.희미한 뾰족산이 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 선제공격을 얻는다.{T}: {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02de6169-89fe-4f0c-a4e5-c4f43006f85a\', \'multiverseId\': 404035}, \'multiverseid\': 404035}, {\'name\': \'Pináculos Indistintos\', \'text\': \'Pináculos Indistintos entra no campo de batalha virado.Quando Pináculos Indistintos entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.{T}: Adicione {R} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'486c0a7d-b790-4e37-9c84-a0da872715ff\', \'multiverseId\': 404334}, \'multiverseid\': 404334}, {\'name\': \'Нависающие Глыбы\', \'text\': \'Нависающие Глыбы выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.Когда Нависающие Глыбы выходят на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +1/+1 и Первый удар до конца хода.{T}: добавьте {R} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73c20eba-23a8-41b4-ac51-db4d09f37df2\', \'multiverseId\': 404633}, \'multiverseid\': 404633}, {\'name\': \'掷影尖峰\', \'text\': \'掷影尖峰须横置进战场。当掷影尖峰进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+1且获得先攻异能。{T}：加{R}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'139c1877-b482-4b20-9a9b-cc643a3d92b1\', \'multiverseId\': 402241}, \'multiverseid\': 402241}, {\'name\': \'擲影尖峰\', \'text\': \'擲影尖峰須橫置進戰場。當擲影尖峰進戰場時，直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+1且獲得先攻異能。{T}：加{R}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7bfd0b-6978-4745-8560-330849952c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 402540}, \'multiverseid\': 402540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämpfendes Pulsieren\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ruhig jetzt, grässlicher Abschaum."—Noyan Dar, Turbulenzmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402750&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9c545f4-e621-47ca-909c-ae097bb69826\', \'multiverseId\': 402750}, \'multiverseid\': 402750}, {\'name\': \'Pulso ralentizado\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Detente, alimaña asquerosa".—Noyan Dar, mago de la Turbulencia de Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6efeabba-adb4-4f19-b0d1-2416ac80622e\', \'multiverseId\': 404843}, \'multiverseid\': 404843}, {\'name\': \'Pulsation débilitante\', \'text\': \'Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Silence, répugnante vermine. »—Noyan Dar, mage du Roulis de Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b66c0f-a2bc-4af0-aa8c-8063452cb552\', \'multiverseId\': 403049}, \'multiverseid\': 403049}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Smorzante\', \'text\': \'Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zitto ora, spregevole parassita."—Noyan Dar, mago del Torbido di Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc1f030-a686-4cb8-b2a7-91e8ab00f9a8\', \'multiverseId\': 403348}, \'multiverseid\': 403348}, {\'name\': \'鈍化する脈動\', \'text\': \'あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「静かにしろ、この害虫どもが。」――タジームの乱動魔道士、ノヤン・ダール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfc79247-b362-49c8-a254-7c2d9b8ac357\', \'multiverseId\': 403647}, \'multiverseid\': 403647}, {\'name\': \'억제하는 파동\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물들은 -1/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"진정해라, 이 끔찍한 벌레놈들아."—타짐의 탁류마도사 노얀 다르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db8623f-b6e3-41ba-a5d9-a3f934b6c43b\', \'multiverseId\': 403946}, \'multiverseid\': 403946}, {\'name\': \'Pulso Amortecedor\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que seus oponentes controlam recebem -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora fiquem quietos, vermes medonhos."— Noyan Dar, mago do turbilhão de Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d919f0-adc3-4551-ba65-bc0600462563\', \'multiverseId\': 404245}, \'multiverseid\': 404245}, {\'name\': \'Подавляющее Биение\', \'text\': \'Существа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Спокойно, спокойно, мерзкий паразит».— Нойен Дар, маг Великого Вала из Тазима\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91abda5a-ba9e-4f94-8060-7403bb04bd7e\', \'multiverseId\': 404544}, \'multiverseid\': 404544}, {\'name\': \'抑制鼓动\', \'text\': \'由对手操控的生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「安静，你们这些丑陋的恶种。」～塔晋狂搅法师诺言达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5880325-756e-4017-9a39-37b578d3a8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402152}, \'multiverseid\': 402152}, {\'name\': \'抑制鼓動\', \'text\': \'由對手操控的生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「安靜，你們這些醜陋的惡種。」～塔晉狂攪法師諾言達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8212da2b-6b72-4ba2-a927-79fa6f848037\', \'multiverseId\': 402451}, \'multiverseid\': 402451}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402885&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f47cf0c1-bf60-4c94-86f3-c0b2baf33a68', 'multiverseId': 402885}, 'multiverseid': 402885}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403782&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fc19d6b-7d81-4fa4-9e48-68e77492eec9', 'multiverseId': 403782}, 'multiverseid': 403782}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402889&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78823061-efe2-4c7d-baf1-95c269d7d05d', 'multiverseId': 402889}, 'multiverseid': 402889}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403181&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c4fda5a-778e-4bc2-982c-aa5d2d24fdc0', 'multiverseId': 403181}, 'multiverseid': 403181}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402590&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ce056a7-1040-40f4-a306-ee1d4d9e025e', 'multiverseId': 402590}, 'multiverseid': 402590}]", '[{\'name\': \'Einblick des Ugin\', \'text\': \'Wende Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich den höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten ist, die du kontrollierst. Ziehe dann drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du sprichst zu mir über die Gefahr durch Ulamog. Aber du darfst nicht vergessen: Sie kamen zu dritt."—Ugin zu Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9404d85-4bfa-4b26-9e39-8c94fe2171e7\', \'multiverseId\': 402975}, \'multiverseid\': 402975}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de Ugin\', \'text\': \'Adivina X, donde X es el coste de maná convertido más alto entre los permanentes que controlas. Luego roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Me hablas de la amenaza que supone Ulamog, pero no olvides que eran tres".—Ugin, a Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c060c9d6-9983-4d9d-9019-51ce0e23e0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 405068}, \'multiverseid\': 405068}, {\'name\': "Perspicacité d\'Ugin", \'text\': \'Regard X, X étant le coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez, puis piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Tu me parles de la menace d\'Ulamog. Mais n\'oublie pas qu\'ils sont trois. »—Ugin, à Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403274&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'685104bb-9922-426d-b5b6-6ed3b90c396c\', \'multiverseId\': 403274}, \'multiverseid\': 403274}, {\'name\': \'Visione di Ugin\', \'text\': \'Profetizza X, dove X è il costo di mana convertito più alto tra i permanenti che controlli, poi pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi parli della minaccia costituita da Ulamog. Ma non dimenticare: sono venuti in tre."—Ugin a Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df91984-dad2-49b2-80ab-75510cb852b0\', \'multiverseId\': 403573}, \'multiverseid\': 403573}, {\'name\': \'ウギンの洞察力\', \'text\': \'占術Ｘを行う。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールするパーマネントの点数で見たマナ・コストの中で最も大きいものに等しい。その後カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「おぬしはウラモグの脅威と言う。だが、あれは３体で来たのだ。それを忘れるでない。」――ウギンからジェイス・ベレレンへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9da8b0f-2271-4763-90eb-698baaf7f5d1\', \'multiverseId\': 403872}, \'multiverseid\': 403872}, {\'name\': \'우진의 통찰력\', \'text\': \'점술 X를 한 후, 카드 세 장을 뽑는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 지속물들의 전환마나비용 중 가장 높은 비용이다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자네는 울라목의 위협에 대해서 말하는군. 하지만 명심하게. 그 놈들은 셋이서 왔다는 것을."—우진이 제이스 벨레렌에게\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f788e26c-f9ab-4404-882d-a25209209cbd\', \'multiverseId\': 404171}, \'multiverseid\': 404171}, {\'name\': \'Visão de Ugin\', \'text\': \'Use vidência X, sendo X o custo de mana convertido mais alto dentre os das permanentes que você controla, e depois compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Você me fala da ameaça de Ulamog. Mas não se esqueça: eles vieram em três."— Ugin, para Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eb0ef76-0292-4b23-8ef5-8e508c74b925\', \'multiverseId\': 404470}, \'multiverseid\': 404470}, {\'name\': \'Проницательность Уджина\', \'text\': \'Предскажите Х, где Х — наибольшее значение конвертированной мана-стоимости среди перманентов под вашим контролем, затем возьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты рассказываешь мне об угрозе, которую несет Уламог. Но не забывай: они пришли втроем».— Уджин, обращаясь к Джейсу Белерену\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0a877b-7310-4431-b51b-d7c97e77a7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 404769}, \'multiverseid\': 404769}, {\'name\': \'乌金的洞察\', \'text\': \'占卜X，X为由你操控的永久物间最高之总法术力费用，然后抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你对我讲述了钨拉莫的威胁。但别忘了，它们一来就是三个。」～乌金告诉杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5b7418-71d9-4066-b96b-d79dbf36efc2\', \'multiverseId\': 402377}, \'multiverseid\': 402377}, {\'name\': \'烏金的洞察\', \'text\': \'占卜X，X為由你操控的永久物間最高之總魔法力費用，然後抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你對我講述了鎢拉莫的威脅。但別忘了，它們一來就是三個。」～烏金告訴傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64cb8fdc-4e5c-430a-8bcb-8c8688ef19c7\', \'multiverseId\': 402676}, \'multiverseid\': 402676}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einfluss ausüben\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, falls ihre Stärke kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um Einfluss ausüben zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann sein Bewusstsein nicht kontrollieren — vielleicht hat es gar keines. Aber ich kann seinen Willen beherrschen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402770&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940e3e6b-2f61-43b7-8e63-fc1884f348fb\', \'multiverseId\': 402770}, \'multiverseid\': 402770}, {\'name\': \'Influir\', \'text\': \'Converger — Gana el control de la criatura objetivo si su fuerza es menor o igual a la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar Influir.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedo controlar su mente; quizás ni siquiera la tenga. Pero puedo controlar su voluntad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'798ffc3d-880c-4bae-acc7-b357dbb5ba71\', \'multiverseId\': 404863}, \'multiverseid\': 404863}, {\'name\': "Exercice d\'influence", \'text\': "Convergence — Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée si sa force est inférieure ou égale au nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer l\'Exercice d\'influence.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne peux pas contrôler son esprit... Je ne suis même pas sûre qu\'il en ait un. Mais je peux soumettre sa volonté. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6fa42bd-9800-4c56-a11d-b033c0945613\', \'multiverseId\': 403069}, \'multiverseid\': 403069}, {\'name\': \'Esercitare Influenza\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio se la sua forza è pari o inferiore al numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare Esercitare Influenza.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso controllare la sua mente. Non sono neanche sicura che ne abbia una. Ma posso dominare la sua volontà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66301194-b070-452b-b62b-0d8a7721f0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 403368}, \'multiverseid\': 403368}, {\'name\': \'影響力の行使\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーが影響力の行使を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数以下であるなら、それのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「心を操るわけではありません。そもそも、あれに心があるかどうかも分かりません。私はあれの意思を支配するんです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54e5268-2f7e-4a64-bb7e-87d984661921\', \'multiverseId\': 403667}, \'multiverseid\': 403667}, {\'name\': \'영향력 행사\', \'text\': \'화합 — 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물의 공격력이 영향력 행사를 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수 이하이면 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그 놈의 정신을 조종할 수 없어. 조종할 정신이 있기나 한 건지 모르겠군. 하지만 그 놈의 의지는 지배할 수 있지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf49244-ab3b-4d03-a09b-dabdcf58fcc6\', \'multiverseId\': 403966}, \'multiverseid\': 403966}, {\'name\': \'Exercer Influência\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo se o poder dela for igual ou inferior ao número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Exercer Influência.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não posso controlar a mente dele — sequer tenho certeza de que ele possua uma. Mas eu posso dominar a vontade dele."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a72c210-59cd-41fb-bf28-ec3a875a0449\', \'multiverseId\': 404265}, \'multiverseid\': 404265}, {\'name\': \'Проявление Влияния\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Получите контроль над целевым существом, если значение его силы не превышает число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Проявления Влияния.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не могу управлять его разумом. Не уверена даже, что у него вообще есть разум. Но я могу подавить его волю».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03cbbd9b-659f-4566-b78b-9d954e8b2efb\', \'multiverseId\': 404564}, \'multiverseid\': 404564}, {\'name\': \'加以感化\', \'text\': \'聚辉～如果目标生物的力量等于或小于施放加以感化时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量，则获得该生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我无法操控它的心灵，我甚至不确定它是否有心灵。但我能主宰它的意志。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af2b3601-4ca5-46e9-8f05-b1c7f5866da9\', \'multiverseId\': 402172}, \'multiverseid\': 402172}, {\'name\': \'加以感化\', \'text\': \'聚輝～如果目標生物的力量等於或小於施放加以感化時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量，則獲得該生物的操控權。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我無法操控它的心靈，我甚至不確定它是否有心靈。但我能主宰它的意志。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec88807-c0c0-4351-a19f-fb6922a528cf\', \'multiverseId\': 402471}, \'multiverseid\': 402471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einkreisende Kluft\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug von Kreaturen, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert, zugefügt würde.Erwecken 2 — {4}{W} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {4}{W} wirkst, lege außerdem zwei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93864fdc-b855-4caf-a6a9-06cda479e769\', \'multiverseId\': 402767}, \'multiverseid\': 402767}, {\'name\': \'Fisura circular\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que fueran a hacer este turno las criaturas que controla el oponente objetivo.Despertar 2—{4}{W}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {4}{W}, pon además dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5d1c9c-0bec-4f2f-8b51-9aa85484bd46\', \'multiverseId\': 404860}, \'multiverseid\': 404860}, {\'name\': \'Fissure encercleuse\', \'text\': "Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures que l\'adversaire ciblé contrôle.Éveil 2 — {4}{W} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {4}{W}, mettez aussi deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b81076aa-38af-486d-9234-2387ba5c511a\', \'multiverseId\': 403066}, \'multiverseid\': 403066}, {\'name\': \'Frattura Accerchiante\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno da creature controllate da un avversario bersaglio.Risveglio 2—{4}{W} (Se lanci questa magia per {4}{W}, metti anche due segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f21ffd26-24be-4175-83fb-db76930cdb25\', \'multiverseId\': 403365}, \'multiverseid\': 403365}, {\'name\': \'取り囲む地割れ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。このターン、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。覚醒２―{4}{W}（この呪文を{4}{W}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'560a656d-e958-4d7f-9987-107fce9e9471\', \'multiverseId\': 403664}, \'multiverseid\': 403664}, {\'name\': \'포위하는 균열\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 이 턴에 그 상대가 조종하는 생물들이 입히려고 하는 모든 전투피해를 방지한다.각성 2—{4}{W} ({4}{W}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e716213-726c-498f-bd18-a0eaf8f0aab9\', \'multiverseId\': 403963}, \'multiverseid\': 403963}, {\'name\': \'Fissura Circundante\', \'text\': \'Previna todo o dano de combate que seria causado neste turno por criaturas que o oponente alvo controla.Despertar 2 — {4}{W} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {4}{W}, coloque também dois marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2aa1ad-e74e-4955-aab3-eae644a957e7\', \'multiverseId\': 404262}, \'multiverseid\': 404262}, {\'name\': \'Окружающая Трещина\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены в этом ходу существами под контролем целевого оппонента.Пробуждение 2 — {4}{W} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {4}{W}, также положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e6620f-833d-48e2-a293-e7c243a275c8\', \'multiverseId\': 404561}, \'multiverseid\': 404561}, {\'name\': \'周遭生裂\', \'text\': \'于本回合中，防止由目标对手操控的生物将造成之所有战斗伤害。醒转2～{4}{W}（如果你支付{4}{W}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置两个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7bee93-ced1-4017-ac3e-fb59088d8836\', \'multiverseId\': 402169}, \'multiverseid\': 402169}, {\'name\': \'周遭生裂\', \'text\': \'於本回合中，防止由目標對手操控的生物將造成之所有戰鬥傷害。醒轉2～{4}{W}（如果你支付{4}{W}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置兩個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad15830c-424a-4cd6-a10b-8bdc53896032\', \'multiverseId\': 402468}, \'multiverseid\': 402468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisschwall\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.Erwecken 3 — {4}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {4}{U} wirkst, lege außerdem drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b24dda2-6ced-4b89-976c-bd38ed6ffd8c\', \'multiverseId\': 402917}, \'multiverseid\': 402917}, {\'name\': \'Torrente de hielo\', \'text\': \'Gira la criatura objetivo. No se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.Despertar 3—{4}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {4}{U}, pon además tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4fe5df-b9c7-40da-9eb1-80528b94dac2\', \'multiverseId\': 405010}, \'multiverseid\': 405010}, {\'name\': \'Déferlante de glace\', \'text\': "Engagez la créature ciblée. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.Éveil 3 — {4}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {4}{U}, mettez aussi trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403216&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52aef149-93d1-4327-bd39-734f3ae1a1b7\', \'multiverseId\': 403216}, \'multiverseid\': 403216}, {\'name\': \'Raffica di Ghiaccio\', \'text\': \'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.Risveglio 3—{4}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per {4}{U}, metti anche tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ee1b69-05ab-46a5-a831-976da6d4c7db\', \'multiverseId\': 403515}, \'multiverseid\': 403515}, {\'name\': \'氷の猛進\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。それは、そのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。覚醒３―{4}{U}（この呪文を{4}{U}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f3249f-e157-44dc-82c6-3d4d14ecc7ae\', \'multiverseId\': 403814}, \'multiverseid\': 403814}, {\'name\': \'냉기의 돌진\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 탭되며 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.각성 3—{4}{U} ({4}{U}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85dac643-9578-49e6-9dce-6b117d6daa73\', \'multiverseId\': 404113}, \'multiverseid\': 404113}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Gélido\', \'text\': \'Vire a criatura alvo. Ela não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.Despertar 3 — {4}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {4}{U}, coloque também três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac516f6-ad48-4cba-937d-b57fac06c914\', \'multiverseId\': 404412}, \'multiverseid\': 404412}, {\'name\': \'Ледяной Поток\', \'text\': \'Поверните целевое существо. Оно не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.Пробуждение 3 — {4}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {4}{U}, также положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a75e0b-d319-4a5e-a0ea-129c41cd76e3\', \'multiverseId\': 404711}, \'multiverseid\': 404711}, {\'name\': \'寒冰涌现\', \'text\': \'横置目标生物。它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。醒转3～{4}{U}（如果你支付{4}{U}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67cd4601-887e-4a16-b952-3833543f2f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 402319}, \'multiverseid\': 402319}, {\'name\': \'寒冰湧現\', \'text\': \'橫置目標生物。它於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。醒轉3～{4}{U}（如果你支付{4}{U}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4676e2fb-f5ce-4d09-b729-3a105c8153ac\', \'multiverseId\': 402618}, \'multiverseid\': 402618}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eldrazi-Himmelsbrüter\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)FliegendWenn der Eldrazi-Himmelsbrüter ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4014e945-7d2b-46a8-99cd-127394a7175e\', \'multiverseId\': 402765}, \'multiverseid\': 402765}, {\'name\': \'Engendrador celeste eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Vuela.Cuando el Engendrador celeste eldrazi entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6160dd93-4460-4615-8033-ac7ad252d1d7\', \'multiverseId\': 404858}, \'multiverseid\': 404858}, {\'name\': \'Engendreur céleste eldrazi\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)VolQuand l\'Engendreur céleste eldrazi arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403064&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a95ee2eb-18f9-43e4-b5ff-22f2083eeded\', \'multiverseId\': 403064}, \'multiverseid\': 403064}, {\'name\': \'Seminacieli Eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)VolareQuando il Seminacieli Eldrazi entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12cce172-05b7-45d8-942d-8175a4dda2da\', \'multiverseId\': 403363}, \'multiverseid\': 403363}, {\'name\': \'空中生成エルドラージ\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）飛行空中生成エルドラージが戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1eb2a85-6612-4ebb-bfe1-8bac3fc48494\', \'multiverseId\': 403662}, \'multiverseid\': 403662}, {\'name\': \'엘드라지 하늘부화꾼\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)비행엘드라지 하늘부화꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20aa8da8-6b14-4b35-9680-554f5c090976\', \'multiverseId\': 403961}, \'multiverseid\': 403961}, {\'name\': \'Reprodutor Celeste Eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)VoarQuando Reprodutor Celeste Eldrazi entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba434984-fd0d-4362-9301-f790b8387756\', \'multiverseId\': 404260}, \'multiverseid\': 404260}, {\'name\': \'Эльдрази-Небородитель\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)ПолетКогда Эльдрази-Небородитель выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1036391a-48c5-46f4-9e61-1b4686e6804e\', \'multiverseId\': 404559}, \'multiverseid\': 404559}, {\'name\': \'空孳奥札奇\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）飞行当空孳奥札奇进战场时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d5247b-ac44-46a3-b113-c256a0c4fb7e\', \'multiverseId\': 402167}, \'multiverseid\': 402167}, {\'name\': \'空孳奧札奇\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）飛行當空孳奧札奇進戰場時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb031cfa-4f53-45fd-9a7a-d1964b857734\', \'multiverseId\': 402466}, \'multiverseid\': 402466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eldrazi-Zerstörer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Egal wie groß euer Champion ist, ihrer ist größer. Egal wie viele Kämpfer ihr habt, sie haben mehr. Egal wie unstillbar euer Appetit ist, sie sind noch hungriger. Und darum werden die Eldrazi gewinnen."—Kalitas, Ulamogs Knecht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402764&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df497b4b-aa32-47cb-8708-fb1a4bb163a1\', \'multiverseId\': 402764}, \'multiverseid\': 402764}, {\'name\': \'Devastador eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Da igual lo grande que sea tu campeón; el suyo es mayor. Da igual cuántos soldados integren tus filas; en las suyas hay más. Da igual el hambre que tengas; ellos siempre tienen más. Por todo eso, los Eldrazi ganarán".—Kalitas, esclavo de Ulamog\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b2e944-d662-4778-8e26-b67cb077ac6c\', \'multiverseId\': 404857}, \'multiverseid\': 404857}, {\'name\': \'Dévastateur eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« Peu importe la puissance de votre champion, le leur est invincible. Peu importe la taille de votre armée, la leur est infinie. Peu importe l\'étendue de votre appétit, le leur est insatiable. Et c\'est pourquoi les Eldrazi vaincront. »—Kalitas, serviteur d\'Ulamog", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403063&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d0c37a-42be-4ea7-a444-d9eb8d5eb14c\', \'multiverseId\': 403063}, \'multiverseid\': 403063}, {\'name\': \'Devastatore Eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Per quanto il tuo campione possa essere grande, il loro è più grande. Per quanto le tue schiere possano essere numerose, le loro sono più numerose. Per quanto sia vorace il tuo appetito, loro sono più affamati. Per questo gli Eldrazi vinceranno."—Kalitas, schiavo di Ulamog\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc22fba7-e2de-4efa-b4be-8ebf738eabe6\', \'multiverseId\': 403362}, \'multiverseid\': 403362}, {\'name\': \'エルドラージの壊滅させるもの\', \'text\': \'トランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「お前らの英雄がどれほど大きくともあちらの方がより大きい。お前らの仲間がどれほど多くともあちらの方がより多い。お前らの食欲がどれほどあろうともあちらの方がより貪欲だ。そういうわけで、エルドラージが勝つのだ。」――ウラモグの奴僕、カリタス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f3eb74-a243-4781-b78f-ddcf5a511ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 403661}, \'multiverseid\': 403661}, {\'name\': \'엘드라지 파괴자\', \'text\': \'돌진\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'"당신의 투사가 아무리 크다고 한들 그들보다는 작다. 아무리 많은 군사가 있어도 그들의 수에 미치지 못한다. 그들은 당신들보다 훨씬 더 승리에 굶주려 있다. 이것이 엘드라지가 이길 수 밖에 없는 이유다."—울라목의 노예 칼리타스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d6899e-87da-4e0e-ae45-0a3a953e0038\', \'multiverseId\': 403960}, \'multiverseid\': 403960}, {\'name\': \'Devastador Eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Não importa quão grande seja o seu campeão: o deles é maior. Não importa quão numerosos sejam vocês: eles são mais. Não importa quão voraz seja o seu apetite: eles têm mais fome. É por isso que os Eldrazi vão vencer."— Kalitas, servo de Ulamog\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72a8764-1b44-4fca-a4ce-fdbb3f303ed6\', \'multiverseId\': 404259}, \'multiverseid\': 404259}, {\'name\': \'Эльдрази-Опустошитель\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«Как бы ни силен был ваш поединщик, они будут сильнее. Как бы ни велика была ваша армия, они будут многочисленнее. Как бы ни ненасытен был ваш аппетит, они будут голоднее. И поэтому Эльдрази победят».— Калитас, раб Уламога\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2300357d-31cf-4b7d-aff5-b16e1af7d417\', \'multiverseId\': 404558}, \'multiverseid\': 404558}, {\'name\': \'毁世奥札奇\', \'text\': \'践踏\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「斗士再强，也强不过它们。人数再多，也多不过它们。胃口再大，也大不过它们。所以奥札奇必胜。」～钨拉莫鬼卒卡力塔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4535c91-e6dd-43ee-8d4b-bdcfcb9d0d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 402166}, \'multiverseid\': 402166}, {\'name\': \'毀世奧札奇\', \'text\': \'踐踏\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「鬥士再強，也強不過它們。人數再多，也多不過它們。胃口再大，也大不過它們。所以奧札奇必勝。」～鎢拉莫鬼卒卡力塔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b64b2cc-1548-44b9-aaef-135efb46fdbb\', \'multiverseId\': 402465}, \'multiverseid\': 402465}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elementare Einflößung\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um die Elementare Einflößung zu wirken. Diese Kreatur verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zendikar hat uns die Waffen gegeben, um angemessen zurückzuschlagen."—Najiya, Anführerin der Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931b124c-d4f9-4490-8d06-09e820d703da\', \'multiverseId\': 402813}, \'multiverseid\': 402813}, {\'name\': \'Imbuir de los elementos\', \'text\': \'Converger — Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar Imbuir de los elementos. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar nos ha dado las armas para hacer la guerra a la escala apropiada".—Najiya, líder de los Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'684a10df-4912-415b-9f71-b3527aab046d\', \'multiverseId\': 404906}, \'multiverseid\': 404906}, {\'name\': \'Imprégnation élémentaire\', \'text\': "Convergence — Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer l\'Imprégnation élémentaire. Cette créature acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Zendikar nous a donné des armes pour être de taille à partir en guerre. »—Najiya, chef des Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcc8ebfb-dfd2-4a40-9bb9-1410da435d4d\', \'multiverseId\': 403112}, \'multiverseid\': 403112}, {\'name\': \'Infondere gli Elementi\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare Infondere gli Elementi. Quella creatura ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar ci ha concesso le armi per affrontare la guerra su una scala appropriata."—Najiya, capo dei Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f2b643-edaf-4d90-bc24-7d9e92ce4e02\', \'multiverseId\': 403411}, \'multiverseid\': 403411}, {\'name\': \'大自然の注入\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。Ｘは大自然の注入を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数に等しい。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーは戦争を妥当な規模で遂行するための武器を与えてくれた。」――タジュールの指導者、ナジヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50ffd94-56a4-405d-b178-845994aecaf3\', \'multiverseId\': 403710}, \'multiverseid\': 403710}, {\'name\': \'정령 주입\', \'text\': \'화합 — 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 올려놓는다. X는 정령 주입을 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수이다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르는 적절한 규모로 전쟁을 수행할 수 있도록 우리에게 무기를 제공해 주었다."—타주루 지도자 나지야\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca3f538-a490-418b-bec8-18a31405d8b5\', \'multiverseId\': 404009}, \'multiverseid\': 404009}, {\'name\': \'Infundir com os Elementos\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Infundir com os Elementos. Aquela criatura ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar nos deu as armas para guerrear na escala certa."— Najiya, líder dos Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1bd478-e4ab-4fad-a150-4c0099b9ecf6\', \'multiverseId\': 404308}, \'multiverseid\': 404308}, {\'name\': \'Насыщение Стихиями\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Положите Х жетонов +1/+1 на целевое существо, где Х — число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Насыщения Стихиями. То существо получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Зендикар дал нам оружие, чтобы вести войну в необходимом масштабе».— Наджия, таджурская предводительница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba8201e-a0eb-49de-8594-aefc7d2aaec8\', \'multiverseId\': 404607}, \'multiverseid\': 404607}, {\'name\': \'元素注入\', \'text\': \'聚辉～在目标生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为施放元素注入时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。该生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「赞迪卡赋予了我们足以均势抗敌的武器。」～特裘如领袖娜吉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdec8169-3910-47aa-ada6-375e16f23d85\', \'multiverseId\': 402215}, \'multiverseid\': 402215}, {\'name\': \'元素注入\', \'text\': \'聚輝～在目標生物上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為施放元素注入時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。該生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「贊迪卡賦予了我們足以均勢抗敵的武器。」～特裘如領袖娜吉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'addaef4c-ccf9-42aa-b3fb-8004771b6617\', \'multiverseId\': 402514}, \'multiverseid\': 402514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Emerias Hirtin\', \'text\': \'FliegendLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, aus deinem Friedhof zurück auf deine Hand bringen. Falls das Land eine Ebene ist, kannst du die bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist, stattdessen zurück ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402766&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df338273-016d-4690-93e4-c45d1beadae6\', \'multiverseId\': 402766}, \'multiverseid\': 402766}, {\'name\': \'Pastora de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes regresar de tu cementerio a tu mano la carta de permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Si esa tierra es una llanura, en vez de eso, puedes regresar al campo de batalla esa carta de permanente que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5786a1fe-deb8-4b6e-b1a7-ee746ff68a41\', \'multiverseId\': 404859}, \'multiverseid\': 404859}, {\'name\': "Bergère d\'Éméria", \'text\': "VolToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de permanent non-terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Si ce terrain est une plaine, vous pouvez renvoyer cette carte de permanent non-terrain sur le champ de bataille à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403065&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f01383b6-f31f-4b3d-a74c-d008e2d37dca\', \'multiverseId\': 403065}, \'multiverseid\': 403065}, {\'name\': \'Pastore di Emeria\', \'text\': \'VolareTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi riprendere in mano una carta permanente non terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se quella terra è una Pianura, puoi invece rimettere quella carta permanente non terra sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd80945e-f12c-40f8-9ac6-00d64379630f\', \'multiverseId\': 403364}, \'multiverseid\': 403364}, {\'name\': \'エメリアの番人\', \'text\': \'飛行上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの墓地から土地でないパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。その土地が平地であるなら、あなたはその土地でないパーマネント・カードを代わりに戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b099a8e4-56f7-4fdd-82d1-45e6063a3856\', \'multiverseId\': 403663}, \'multiverseid\': 403663}, {\'name\': \'에메리아 목동\', \'text\': \'비행대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있는 대지가 아닌 지속물 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 그 대지가 들이라면, 대신에 당신은 그 대지가 아닌 지속물 카드를 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32cda0b-ab71-44fc-8fe1-5749f1e4764f\', \'multiverseId\': 403962}, \'multiverseid\': 403962}, {\'name\': \'Pastora de Emeria\', \'text\': \'VoarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode devolver o card de permanente alvo que não seja um terreno de seu cemitério para sua mão. Se aquele terreno for uma Planície, você pode, em vez disso, devolver aquele card de permanente que não seja um terreno para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b727321-b477-4c88-9894-a31ad52fb91a\', \'multiverseId\': 404261}, \'multiverseid\': 404261}, {\'name\': \'Пастырь Эмерии\', \'text\': \'ПолетЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете вернуть целевую не являющуюся землей карту перманента из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Если та земля является Равниной, вы можете вместо этого вернуть ту не являющуюся землей карту перманента на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ecf531-7678-4bfd-9fa7-595942960c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 404560}, \'multiverseid\': 404560}, {\'name\': \'伊美黎牧者\', \'text\': \'飞行地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将目标非地的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。若该地是平原，则改为你可以将该非地的永久物牌移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6fbb47-2ecc-4232-bdac-701e19880dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 402168}, \'multiverseid\': 402168}, {\'name\': \'伊美黎牧者\', \'text\': \'飛行地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以將目標非地的永久物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。若該地是平原，則改為你可以將該非地的永久物牌移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25429ad0-f2a5-461a-80c7-24e8a867e8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 402467}, \'multiverseid\': 402467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Erneuerung\', \'text\': \'FliegendWenn der Engel der Erneuerung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Nie wieder verzagen. Nie wieder versagen. Nie wieder sterben. Nie wieder!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402707&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b37723f8-70ba-414b-9735-c2b53659c4c8\', \'multiverseId\': 402707}, \'multiverseid\': 402707}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la renovación\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Cuando el Ángel de la renovación entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida por cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"No más miedo. No más fracasos. No más muertes. ¡Basta!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a1957f-5279-4687-b26d-aff94c782fda\', \'multiverseId\': 404800}, \'multiverseid\': 404800}, {\'name\': \'Ange du renouveau\', \'text\': "VolQuand l\'Ange du renouveau arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et allié\', \'flavor\': "« La peur. L\'échec. La mort. Plus jamais ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403006&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac9d7a32-06b6-4815-9d4e-eafdbe841307\', \'multiverseId\': 403006}, \'multiverseid\': 403006}, {\'name\': \'Angelo del Rinnovamento\', \'text\': "VolareQuando l\'Angelo del Rinnovamento entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mai più paura. Mai più fallimento. Mai più morte. Mai più!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fee991e-274b-4460-9d59-92c865e54ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 403305}, \'multiverseid\': 403305}, {\'name\': \'回生の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行回生の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'恐怖も、敗北も、死も、これ以上は許さない！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bbfef3e-21a2-4980-9e5d-030196bb5232\', \'multiverseId\': 403604}, \'multiverseid\': 403604}, {\'name\': \'회복의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행회복의 천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개당 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"더 이상 두려움은 없다. 더 이상 실패는 없다. 더 이상 죽음도 없다. 더 이상은!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5740ff92-aaf1-4405-9647-3a7710e2ce82\', \'multiverseId\': 403903}, \'multiverseid\': 403903}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Renovação\', \'text\': \'VoarQuando Anjo da Renovação entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Chega de medo. Chega de fracassos. Chega de morte. Chega!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'378ee669-ab06-4211-8037-bc03aa6a0ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 404202}, \'multiverseid\': 404202}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Обновления\', \'text\': \'ПолетКогда Ангел Обновления выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Долой страх. Долой поражения. Долой смерть. Долой!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aedf8e9-5e74-4ea9-8bb6-14c8e6eee1ec\', \'multiverseId\': 404501}, \'multiverseid\': 404501}, {\'name\': \'新机天使\', \'text\': \'飞行当新机天使进战场时，你每操控一个生物，便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「不复恐惧。不复失败。不复死亡。不复受难！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e838d4-0206-4a38-9ff4-63f392983aad\', \'multiverseId\': 402109}, \'multiverseid\': 402109}, {\'name\': \'新機天使\', \'text\': \'飛行當新機天使進戰場時，你每操控一個生物，便獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「不復恐懼。不復失敗。不復死亡。不復受難！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a77422-3ad6-4abf-a88d-0a7fecac2bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 402408}, \'multiverseid\': 402408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entschlossener Klingenmeister\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn der Entschlossene Klingenmeister oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Doppelschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Guter Stahl wird in den heißesten Schmieden gestählt. Gute Soldaten im Krieg."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d85a575b-e61d-4201-b077-ab1363d02545\', \'multiverseId\': 402902}, \'multiverseid\': 402902}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de filo decidido\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Maestro de filo decidido u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"El mejor acero nace de las forjas más ardientes. Los mejores soldados nacen de la guerra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38af0ed0-2dc5-47f5-956f-19c194cc086e\', \'multiverseId\': 404995}, \'multiverseid\': 404995}, {\'name\': "Maître d\'épée déterminé", \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que le Maître d\'épée déterminé ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Les meilleures armes naissent dans les forges les plus chaudes. Les meilleurs soldats naissent dans les guerres les plus meurtrières. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'642642c2-5cac-40ae-aae3-2fe01c8d5dac\', \'multiverseId\': 403201}, \'multiverseid\': 403201}, {\'name\': \'Maestro di Spada Risoluto\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta il Maestro di Spada Risoluto o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il miglior acciaio nasce nelle forge più calde. I migliori soldati nascono in guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4cec466-ea6c-4e67-b8e6-9102da146521\', \'multiverseId\': 403500}, \'multiverseid\': 403500}, {\'name\': \'毅然たる刃の達人\', \'text\': \'結集 ― 毅然たる刃の達人か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「優れた鋼は高温の炉から生まれる。優れた兵士は戦争から生まれる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8a9eb5-59f7-4774-9e2f-ddab0f551e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 403799}, \'multiverseid\': 403799}, {\'name\': \'단호한 검성\', \'text\': \'결집 — 단호한 검성이나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 이단공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"최고의 강철은 가장 뜨거운 용광로에서 태어난다. 최고의 전사는 전장에서 태어난다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2384a84f-bbc5-454d-a624-b8280f8a8cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 404098}, \'multiverseid\': 404098}, {\'name\': \'Espadachim-mestre Resoluto\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Espadachim-mestre Resoluto ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"O melhor aço nasce nas forjas mais quentes. Os melhores soldados nascem na guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6bbd17c-9fe1-4207-8878-8d796761db02\', \'multiverseId\': 404397}, \'multiverseid\': 404397}, {\'name\': \'Непоколебимый Мастер Меча\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Непоколебимый Мастер Меча или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Лучшая сталь рождается в самых жарких печах. Лучшие солдаты рождаются в войнах».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'869ae614-3f75-4ea4-b15e-7f6224fe1251\', \'multiverseId\': 404696}, \'multiverseid\': 404696}, {\'name\': \'坚毅大剑师\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当坚毅大剑师或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「炽炉锻良材，战场造勇将。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63f061d-9198-4347-8232-ba8f9bcc1a03\', \'multiverseId\': 402304}, \'multiverseid\': 402304}, {\'name\': \'堅毅大劍師\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當堅毅大劍師或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「熾爐鍛良材，戰場造勇將。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74f2734-1e60-4e33-bdcc-bfe531f2ed40\', \'multiverseId\': 402603}, \'multiverseid\': 402603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdrückende Abscheulichkeit\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)FliegendOpfere zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Kreatur.Immer wenn du eine Kreatur opferst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6ec4dc-d3e5-4ba8-8dee-3343543f224a\', \'multiverseId\': 402941}, \'multiverseid\': 402941}, {\'name\': \'Abominación asfixiante\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\nVuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica una criatura.\\nSiempre que sacrifiques una criatura, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e202e9d-61c3-4a88-8ef4-93cd463b1f16\', \'multiverseId\': 405034}, \'multiverseid\': 405034}, {\'name\': \'Abomination étouffante\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)VolAu début de votre entretien, sacrifiez une créature.À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez une créature, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548be990-5734-43f1-bbbf-01f8cd32d65c\', \'multiverseId\': 403240}, \'multiverseid\': 403240}, {\'name\': \'Abominio Asfissiante\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)VolareAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica una creatura.Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi una creatura, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228217ef-8b98-4b23-9723-f99ba326cdea\', \'multiverseId\': 403539}, \'multiverseid\': 403539}, {\'name\': \'息詰まる忌まわしきもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）飛行あなたのアップキープの開始時に、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。あなたがクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703a0a1e-df90-45cf-90fd-86bcb75c4493\', \'multiverseId\': 403838}, \'multiverseid\': 403838}, {\'name\': \'숨막히는 흉물\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)비행당신의 유지단 시작에, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.당신이 생물 한 개를 희생할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02027c6c-bd8d-4b6a-984b-ee885695df14\', \'multiverseId\': 404137}, \'multiverseid\': 404137}, {\'name\': \'Abominação Sufocante\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)VoarNo início de sua manutenção, sacrifique uma criatura.Toda vez que você sacrificar uma criatura, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72f311c0-c52c-41d9-97f1-0a7239cb7688\', \'multiverseId\': 404436}, \'multiverseid\': 404436}, {\'name\': \'Мерзостный Душитель\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)ПолетВ начале вашего шага поддержки пожертвуйте существо.Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете существо, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8ab8ac-190e-42bc-bec9-211bb2a22603\', \'multiverseId\': 404735}, \'multiverseid\': 404735}, {\'name\': \'窒息憎恨体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）飞行在你的维持开始时，牺牲一个生物。每当你牺牲一个生物时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd09553-c86a-4ae2-8013-50b6d46d6cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 402343}, \'multiverseid\': 402343}, {\'name\': \'窒息憎恨體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）飛行在你的維持開始時，犧牲一個生物。每當你犧牲一個生物時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d72fe47-1ac1-4782-a2c7-ca9f91a2a29c\', \'multiverseId\': 402642}, \'multiverseid\': 402642}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfahrene Kriegsführerin\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft der Erfahrenen Kriegsführerin sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.Tappe einen anderen ungetappten Verbündeten, den du kontrollierst: Die Erfahrene Kriegsführerin erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges entweder Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit oder verursacht Trampelschaden (du entscheidest).\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac8b6dc-81ca-40af-83ed-1816bd332a1f\', \'multiverseId\': 402987}, \'multiverseid\': 402987}, {\'name\': \'Líder de guerra veterana\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia de la Líder de guerra veterana son iguales a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.Girar otro Aliado enderezado que controlas: La Líder de guerra veterana gana a tu elección la habilidad de dañar primero, vigilancia o arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano aliado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acee19ab-f5f8-408d-b1d6-e627b0ceeddc\', \'multiverseId\': 405080}, \'multiverseid\': 405080}, {\'name\': \'Chef de guerre vétérane\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance de la Chef de guerre vétérane sont chacune égales au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.Engagez un autre allié dégagé que vous contrôlez : la Chef de guerre vétérane acquiert, selon votre choix, l\'initiative, la vigilance ou le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat et allié\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403286&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebbada3-d875-4870-850e-fd0b608f689b\', \'multiverseId\': 403286}, \'multiverseid\': 403286}, {\'name\': \'Condottiera Veterana\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione della Condottiera Veterana sono pari al numero di creature che controlli.TAPpa un altro Alleato STAPpato che controlli: La Condottiera Veterana ha a tua scelta attacco improvviso, cautela o travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2c7ad1d-c505-423e-9fe4-d0ae956a7036\', \'multiverseId\': 403585}, \'multiverseid\': 403585}, {\'name\': \'古参の戦導者\', \'text\': \'古参の戦導者のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの総数に等しい。あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態の他の同盟者を１体タップする：ターン終了時まで、古参の戦導者は先制攻撃か警戒かトランプルのうち、あなたが選んだ１つを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b7120f-891a-4753-94e6-51ce7de127d4\', \'multiverseId\': 403884}, \'multiverseid\': 403884}, {\'name\': \'숙련된 전장사령관\', \'text\': \'숙련된 전장사령관의 공격력과 방어력은 각각 당신이 조종하는 생물의 수와 같다.당신이 조종하는 다른 언탭된 동맹을 탭한다: 숙련된 전장사령관은 턴종료까지 선제공격, 경계 또는 돌진 중에서 당신이 선택한 능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사 동맹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bbf913a-6930-412c-b88b-7e35ce19c0df\', \'multiverseId\': 404183}, \'multiverseid\': 404183}, {\'name\': \'Líder de Guerra Veterano\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Líder de Guerra Veterano são ambos iguais ao número de criaturas que você controla.Vire outro Aliado desvirado que você controla: Líder de Guerra Veterano ganha o que você escolher entre iniciativa, vigilância ou atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado Aliado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e244ae-b232-4333-895c-8c1516ec1e35\', \'multiverseId\': 404482}, \'multiverseid\': 404482}, {\'name\': \'Опытная Военачальница\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Опытной Военачальницы равны количеству существ под вашим контролем.Поверните другого неповернутого Союзника под вашим контролем: Опытная Военачальница получает по вашему выбору Первый удар, Бдительность или Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат Союзник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef94b793-4250-4ddc-b9c4-3240a559b845\', \'multiverseId\': 404781}, \'multiverseid\': 404781}, {\'name\': \'老练领战人\', \'text\': \'老练领战人的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的生物数量。横置另一个由你操控且未横置的伙伴：选择先攻，警戒或践踏。老练领战人获得该异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ce5e56-2477-4aaa-92d8-77c5990133cb\', \'multiverseId\': 402389}, \'multiverseid\': 402389}, {\'name\': \'老練領戰人\', \'text\': \'老練領戰人的力量和防禦力各等同於由你操控的生物數量。橫置另一個由你操控且未橫置的伙伴：選擇先攻，警戒或踐踏。老練領戰人獲得該異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bf53611-042f-4393-a80b-6823837289b3\', \'multiverseId\': 402688}, \'multiverseid\': 402688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ernte des Altars\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um die Ernte des Altars zu wirken.Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde meine Rache an Zendikar auskosten — eine Seele nach der anderen."—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402706&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2304209-9def-443b-b939-c8c90b6e75a3\', \'multiverseId\': 402706}, \'multiverseid\': 402706}, {\'name\': \'Cosecha del altar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar la Cosecha del altar, sacrifica una criatura.Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Me vengaré de Zendikar alma por alma".—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be9478c-517a-4d98-9e22-8b1bb20b3e07\', \'multiverseId\': 404799}, \'multiverseid\': 404799}, {\'name\': "Fenaison de l\'autel", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer la Fenaison de l\'autel, sacrifiez une créature.Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'assouvirai ma vengeance sur Zendikar une âme après l\'autre. »—Ob Nixilis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403005&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea2b660-d4ea-467e-b5f3-9f3bbdf60396\', \'multiverseId\': 403005}, \'multiverseid\': 403005}, {\'name\': "Raccolto dell\'Altare", \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare il Raccolto dell\'Altare, sacrifica una creatura.Pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi prenderò la mia vendetta contro Zendikar, un\\\'anima alla volta."—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e56a01d3-475b-4c64-ae1b-34e740c3f88f\', \'multiverseId\': 403304}, \'multiverseid\': 403304}, {\'name\': \'祭壇の刈り取り\', \'text\': \'祭壇の刈り取りを唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我はゼンディカーで復讐を遂げる。１人ずつ確実に。」――オブ・ニクシリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6f852f-ff00-4e3c-9ba0-31336d7d3bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 403603}, \'multiverseid\': 403603}, {\'name\': \'제단의 수확\', \'text\': \'제단의 수확을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"한 번에 한 놈씩 해치우며 젠디카르에 대한 복수를 할 것이다."—오브 닉실리스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c40f2c-6c80-4637-87b7-b904c2cceb12\', \'multiverseId\': 403902}, \'multiverseid\': 403902}, {\'name\': \'Colheita do Altar\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Colheita do Altar, sacrifique uma criatura.Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vou garantir minha vingança contra Zendikar uma alma por vez."— Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aae014f-8b05-43ad-9619-f02ea6064059\', \'multiverseId\': 404201}, \'multiverseid\': 404201}, {\'name\': \'Алтарная Жатва\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Алтарной Жатвы пожертвуйте существо.Возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я отомщу Зендикару — по одной душе за раз».— Об-Никсилис\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94c56e1-d0a3-46fc-a8d1-9628c4cc2f66\', \'multiverseId\': 404500}, \'multiverseid\': 404500}, {\'name\': \'祭坛夺命\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放祭坛夺命的额外费用。抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我要亲手结束每一条性命，以此向赞迪卡报仇。」～欧尼希兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2564ab8e-6299-413a-9c34-59f31cd47da4\', \'multiverseId\': 402108}, \'multiverseid\': 402108}, {\'name\': \'祭壇奪命\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放祭壇奪命的額外費用。抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我要親手結束每一條性命，以此向贊迪卡報仇。」～歐尼希茲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f419b88-693f-42d6-8d8a-b8a8c07c9bca\', \'multiverseId\': 402407}, \'multiverseid\': 402407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ertränker der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Ertränker der Hoffnung ins Spiel kommt, bringe zwei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."Opfere eine Eldrazi-Brut: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402760&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce7637d-a7ed-43b7-b82d-49b6abbba405\', \'multiverseId\': 402760}, \'multiverseid\': 402760}, {\'name\': \'Ahogador de esperanzas\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Ahogador de esperanzas entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".Sacrificar un Vástago Eldrazi: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d5edeb-b6a7-4a8d-bdec-bbf8eb7418bf\', \'multiverseId\': 404853}, \'multiverseid\': 404853}, {\'name\': "Noyeur d\'espoir", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Noyeur d\'espoir arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »Sacrifiez un eldrazi et scion : Engagez la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b05e4a-cfdf-4cb7-af36-7178d8050762\', \'multiverseId\': 403059}, \'multiverseid\': 403059}, {\'name\': \'Annegatore di Speranze\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando l\\\'Annegatore di Speranze entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".Sacrifica un Discendente Eldrazi: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'538b0e79-8b3b-4a07-827d-46e9fdb78e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 403358}, \'multiverseid\': 403358}, {\'name\': \'希望を溺れさせるもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）希望を溺れさせるものが戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。エルドラージ・末裔を１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f902f2f5-a153-48c4-89fa-4382ff0088b5\', \'multiverseId\': 403657}, \'multiverseid\': 403657}, {\'name\': \'희망을 질식시키는 자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)희망을 질식시키는 자가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.엘드라지 자손을 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f98ea4-c9dc-46f7-a05f-3e30a1ec8ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 403956}, \'multiverseid\': 403956}, {\'name\': \'Afogador da Esperança\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Afogador da Esperança entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura incolores 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."Sacrifique um Rebento Eldrazi: Vire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fa063d-9272-4fe1-8357-9618cda6a313\', \'multiverseId\': 404255}, \'multiverseid\': 404255}, {\'name\': \'Топитель Надежды\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Топитель Надежды выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Они имеют способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».Пожертвуйте Эльдрази Отпрыска: поверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ef5b72-8234-4301-a259-0e4de4aa5dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 404554}, \'multiverseid\': 404554}, {\'name\': \'绝望恶体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当绝望恶体进战场时，将两个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」牺牲一个同时为奥札奇与孽裔的永久物：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb07ac2d-7153-4fc2-a7ea-a84f2b4d884d\', \'multiverseId\': 402162}, \'multiverseid\': 402162}, {\'name\': \'絕望惡體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當絕望惡體進戰場時，將兩個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它們具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」犧牲一個同時為奧札奇與孽裔的永久物：橫置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f161168e-0161-4ba5-9df4-ae30d5e9ef76\', \'multiverseId\': 402461}, \'multiverseid\': 402461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Existenzauslöschung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Leute und Ländereien verschwinden, als hätten sie niemals existiert. Wir kämpfen nicht länger für Ruhm und Ehre. Wir kämpfen um das Recht zu existieren."—Generalin Tazri, Kommandeurin der Verbündeten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4df79f-899d-4447-8bde-c3872997bfff\', \'multiverseId\': 402922}, \'multiverseid\': 402922}, {\'name\': \'Borrar de la existencia\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestro pueblo y nuestras propias tierras desaparecen como si nunca hubieran existido. Ya no luchamos por la gloria ni por el honor, sino por el simple derecho a existir".—General Tazri, comandante aliada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbdb39f-2f10-40f9-8744-2df7be225008\', \'multiverseId\': 405015}, \'multiverseid\': 405015}, {\'name\': "Abolition de l\'existence", \'text\': \'Exilez le permanent ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nos peuples et nos terres disparaissent comme s\'ils n\'avaient jamais existé. Nous ne nous battons plus pour la gloire ou l\'honneur. Nous combattons maintenant pour notre droit d\'exister. »—Générale Tazri, commandante alliée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0cab398-9a27-47a9-93df-ce9a06e11d35\', \'multiverseId\': 403221}, \'multiverseid\': 403221}, {\'name\': "Bandire dall\'Esistenza", \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il nostro popolo e le nostre terre scompaiono come se non fossero mai esistiti. Non combattiamo più per la gloria o per l\\\'onore. Ora combattiamo per il diritto a esistere."—Generale Tazri, comandante alleata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294919e5-1517-47b2-9ff7-f4375882fb07\', \'multiverseId\': 403520}, \'multiverseid\': 403520}, {\'name\': \'存在の一掃\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「人々も土地も消えてしまった。まるで初めから存在していなかったかのように……。もはや栄光や名誉を云々する段階ではない。存在する権利のために戦うのだ。」――同盟の統率者、タズリ将軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db3f533-8f9c-4101-b79b-895a7cddee94\', \'multiverseId\': 403819}, \'multiverseid\': 403819}, {\'name\': \'존재 제거\', \'text\': \'지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리 종족과 대지가 마치 존재하지 않았던 것처럼 사라지고 말았다. 우리는 더 이상 영광이나 명예를 위해 싸우지 않는다. 이제는 생존 그 자체를 위해 싸운다."—동맹군 총사령관 타즈리 장군\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63285d83-ff6e-4e26-93c1-e492d58712cf\', \'multiverseId\': 404118}, \'multiverseid\': 404118}, {\'name\': \'Varrer da Existência\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nosso povo e nossa própria terra desaparecem como se jamais tivessem existido. Não lutamos mais por glória ou honra. Agora lutamos pelo direito de existir."— General Tazri, comandante aliada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68f02ad7-94d7-4835-9041-40b09a692171\', \'multiverseId\': 404417}, \'multiverseid\': 404417}, {\'name\': \'Стирание из Бытия\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Наши сородичи и наши земли исчезают, словно их не было на свете. Теперь мы сражаемся не за честь и не за славу. Мы сражаемся за право существовать».— Генерал Тазри, командир союзников\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2698503-0a81-4154-95cd-3ea9d303ff58\', \'multiverseId\': 404716}, \'multiverseid\': 404716}, {\'name\': \'扫除存在\', \'text\': \'放逐目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的人民和身处的大地荡然无存。荣耀和荣誉都已不再是我们战斗的目标。我们如今为生存的权利而战。」～盟军指挥官塔兹莉将军\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84257e01-0b6b-4ebf-93ec-354170c30377\', \'multiverseId\': 402324}, \'multiverseid\': 402324}, {\'name\': \'掃除存在\', \'text\': \'放逐目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的人民和身處的大地蕩然無存。榮耀和榮譽都已不再是我們戰鬥的目標。我們如今為生存的權利而戰。」～盟軍指揮官塔茲莉將軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb4b7db7-f89a-41e8-8526-d492c8951a7e\', \'multiverseId\': 402623}, \'multiverseid\': 402623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Herrscher\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, LebensverknüpfungFalls du zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments 40 Lebenspunkte oder mehr hast, gewinnst du die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Blick streift über die verdorrende Landschaft. Ruhig wartet er auf einen Sieg, den nur er kommen sieht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402775&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'944b3b88-b377-43ae-acd4-2f0add3c6b66\', \'multiverseId\': 402775}, \'multiverseid\': 402775}, {\'name\': \'Felidar soberano\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, vínculo vital.Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si tienes 40 o más vidas, ganas el juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': \'Sobrevuela el paisaje devastado a la espera de una victoria en la que solo él cree.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea1baeb-6edd-4883-98b9-1e0810edb2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 404868}, \'multiverseid\': 404868}, {\'name\': \'Souverain félidar\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, lien de vieAu début de votre entretien, si vous avez au moins 40 points de vie, vous gagnez la partie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': \'Il examine le paysage étiolé et attend une victoire que lui seul peut percevoir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403074&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2923a0-8cc4-451e-a358-0ef90d2627f9\', \'multiverseId\': 403074}, \'multiverseid\': 403074}, {\'name\': \'Sovrano dei Felidar\', \'text\': "Cautela, legame vitaleAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se hai 40 o più punti vita, vinci la partita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Osserva il paesaggio inaridito, attendendo una vittoria che solo lui può vedere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52df1a30-1cfd-4df4-8014-8bd258fccf66\', \'multiverseId\': 403373}, \'multiverseid\': 403373}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの君主\', \'text\': \'警戒、絆魂あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライフが40点以上である場合、あなたはこのゲームに勝利する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'枯れ行く風景を眺めながら、目に見える勝利を待ち望んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c1bdd2-1364-496a-a289-9290fbef0dd3\', \'multiverseId\': 403672}, \'multiverseid\': 403672}, {\'name\': \'펠리다르 지배자\', \'text\': \'경계, 생명연결당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신의 생명점이 40 이상이라면, 당신은 게임에서 승리한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 야수\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 메말라 가는 대지를 살펴보며 승리의 순간만을 기다린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bccfc3-ce91-4863-9dee-3a34a94a3028\', \'multiverseId\': 403971}, \'multiverseid\': 403971}, {\'name\': \'Soberano Felidar\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, vínculo com a vidaNo início de sua manutenção, se você tiver 40 ou mais pontos de vida, você vence o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Ele observa a paisagem que definha, à espera de uma vitória que só ele consegue ver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b81cd4-8c99-4885-b3dd-732c5c1c9d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 404270}, \'multiverseid\': 404270}, {\'name\': \'Фелидар-Владыка\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Цепь жизниВ начале вашего шага поддержки, если у вас 40 жизней или больше, вы выигрываете партию.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Он наблюдает за опустошенной землей в ожидании победы, что будет видна лишь ему.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e85fc94-dedb-4ca3-9d7d-ef8f13b0ba45\', \'multiverseId\': 404569}, \'multiverseid\': 404569}, {\'name\': \'晶角兽君王\', \'text\': \'警戒，系命在你的维持开始时，若你的总生命为40或更多，你便赢得此盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'它俯瞰凋零的大地，静待只有它能看到的胜利出现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'122619fb-6ed2-4dea-9704-824a243f661f\', \'multiverseId\': 402177}, \'multiverseid\': 402177}, {\'name\': \'晶角獸君王\', \'text\': \'警戒，繫命在你的維持開始時，若你的總生命為40或更多，你便贏得此盤遊戲。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／野獸\', \'flavor\': \'牠俯瞰凋零的大地，靜待只有牠能看到的勝利出現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18720d67-7dd2-4c45-ad64-155d1fa19eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 402476}, \'multiverseid\': 402476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Junges\', \'text\': \'Opfere das Felidar-Junge: Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Felidar, die es durchs erste Lebensjahr schaffen, erleben meist noch einhundert weitere Jahre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402774&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce7c1e2-b160-4a00-bb93-cae843f83901\', \'multiverseId\': 402774}, \'multiverseid\': 402774}, {\'name\': \'Cachorro de felidar\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Cachorro de felidar: Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': \'Los felidar que sobreviven a su primer año de vida pueden llegar fácilmente a centenarios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b1908d-e7fc-424a-b21f-62ca6b47cda4\', \'multiverseId\': 404867}, \'multiverseid\': 404867}, {\'name\': \'Jeune félidar\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez le Jeune félidar : Détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': "Les félidars qui survivent à leur première année d\'existence vivent facilement un siècle de plus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d2827f-1260-4acd-b312-3a4da060682b\', \'multiverseId\': 403073}, \'multiverseid\': 403073}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo di Felidar\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica il Cucciolo di Felidar: Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'I felidar che superano il loro primo anno di vita possono facilmente vivere per vederne altri cento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a1c5a0-3b43-46d4-b185-b9cee8b43029\', \'multiverseId\': 403372}, \'multiverseid\': 403372}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの仔\', \'text\': \'フェリダーの仔を生け贄に捧げる：エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'生まれて最初の１年間を生き延びたフェリダーは、その後の100年を難なく過ごす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10f3c85-b0b6-4484-b373-ec7892972de9\', \'multiverseId\': 403671}, \'multiverseid\': 403671}, {\'name\': \'새끼 펠리다르\', \'text\': \'새끼 펠리다르를 희생한다: 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 야수\', \'flavor\': \'펠리다르는 태어난 후 1년만 무사히 넘기면 100년을 넘게 사는 것은 아주 쉽다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8580c8d7-3c4e-42f0-9768-2440da110179\', \'multiverseId\': 403970}, \'multiverseid\': 403970}, {\'name\': \'Filhote Felidar\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Filhote Felidar: Destrua o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Os felidares que superam o primeiro ano de vida podem facilmente viver mais cem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98fb20a7-508a-4ab5-8a33-8416029e771a\', \'multiverseId\': 404269}, \'multiverseid\': 404269}, {\'name\': \'Детеныш Фелидара\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Детеныша Фелидара: уничтожьте целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Если фелидар дожил до своего первого дня рождения, то запросто проживет еще сотню лет.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6606de1d-a3e7-420d-9c48-e3be841b551e\', \'multiverseId\': 404568}, \'multiverseid\': 404568}, {\'name\': \'晶角幼兽\', \'text\': \'牺牲晶角幼兽：消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'活过周岁的晶角兽可安度百年。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11bc9e63-4be6-4708-832e-8edfc6c21584\', \'multiverseId\': 402176}, \'multiverseid\': 402176}, {\'name\': \'晶角幼獸\', \'text\': \'犧牲晶角幼獸：消滅目標結界。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／野獸\', \'flavor\': \'活過週歲的晶角獸可安度百年。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a643567-8e5f-4d3c-a02b-4ca45afb7457\', \'multiverseId\': 402475}, \'multiverseid\': 402475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felsenhammer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, kannst du ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurückbringen. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Kreatur +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.Ausrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Weder subtil noch schön.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde1a74c-9f1c-44d1-af9b-ddfa5602ea41\', \'multiverseId\': 402937}, \'multiverseid\': 402937}, {\'name\': \'Martillo aplastador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, puedes regresar una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario. Si lo haces, la criatura obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.Equipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Ni sutil ni bonito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2217a3c-5a91-4704-8d12-096146b7bac0\', \'multiverseId\': 405030}, \'multiverseid\': 405030}, {\'name\': \'Marteau monolithique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, la créature gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.Équipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Ni délicat, ni élégant.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403236&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfae6dc1-9c3d-4098-ab64-7b94e604e38b\', \'multiverseId\': 403236}, \'multiverseid\': 403236}, {\'name\': \'Martello del Lastrone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, puoi far tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario. Se lo fai, la creatura prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.Equipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Né discreto, né grazioso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ddd0de2-4d16-4fb2-b4b3-b2c836fcaf1c\', \'multiverseId\': 403535}, \'multiverseid\': 403535}, {\'name\': \'板岩の槌\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールする土地を１つオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'繊細でも美麗でもない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a4bb36-4334-4156-9c31-7aab7cd1149a\', \'multiverseId\': 403834}, \'multiverseid\': 403834}, {\'name\': \'석판 망치\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 대지를 소유자의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.장착 {2}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'섬세하지도 아름답지도 않다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244b2faa-5571-45d7-a240-d56e1f323d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 404133}, \'multiverseid\': 404133}, {\'name\': \'Martelo de Pedregulho\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada ataca, você pode devolver um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono. Se fizer isso, a criatura recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.Equipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Nem sutil, nem bonito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e0dd4ae-7a97-46cf-b3a4-2502d506b73a\', \'multiverseId\': 404432}, \'multiverseid\': 404432}, {\'name\': \'Молот-Глыба\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, вы можете вернуть землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца. Если вы это делаете, то существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода.Снарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Ни изящества, ни деликатности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84587ee4-67d2-45a8-ae40-c8efebc2964c\', \'multiverseId\': 404731}, \'multiverseid\': 404731}, {\'name\': \'巨石锤\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，你可以将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。若你如此作，则该生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'既不精致又不美观。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8bc6de-51cf-45f8-a0ae-0e2924695ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 402339}, \'multiverseid\': 402339}, {\'name\': \'巨石鎚\', \'text\': \'每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，你可以將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。若你如此作，則該生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'既不精緻又不美觀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98fb2b38-1038-4d76-bbc1-ab9f71cf29a9\', \'multiverseId\': 402638}, \'multiverseid\': 402638}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felswand-Beobachtungsposten\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Späher, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl die Späher der Steinzuflucht hohe Verluste zu beklagen haben, schrecken sie nie vor der Erfüllung ihrer Pflicht zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402739&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'231e6136-9fea-4e68-a0e9-620b068d4e90\', \'multiverseId\': 402739}, \'multiverseid\': 402739}, {\'name\': \'Centinela del acantilado\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador kor aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque los exploradores de los Refugios Pedregosos sufren muchas pérdidas, siempre cumplen su deber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0ca2d1-439a-4364-9766-1ba023575e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 404832}, \'multiverseid\': 404832}, {\'name\': \'Vigie à flanc de falaise\', \'text\': "{4}{W} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et éclaireur et allié\', \'flavor\': \'Les éclaireurs des Refuges de pierre subissent de lourdes pertes, mais ne fuient jamais leurs responsabilités.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403038&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61c75bb7-fc8f-42d6-9436-18aa23c0dc65\', \'multiverseId\': 403038}, \'multiverseid\': 403038}, {\'name\': \'Vedetta dei Dirupi\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Esploratore Kor\', \'flavor\': \'Anche se le perdite sono molte tra i ranghi degli esploratori dei Rifugi Rocciosi, essi non esitano mai davanti al dovere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7d956b-d75b-40e0-800c-7e1285c6af04\', \'multiverseId\': 403337}, \'multiverseid\': 403337}, {\'name\': \'絶壁の見張り\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・スカウト・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'石の安息所では斥候に損害が出続けているが任務を拒む者はいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b40c2fc8-d891-46f7-a816-98f64cbf9ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 403636}, \'multiverseid\': 403636}, {\'name\': \'절벽 보초\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 정찰병 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'전사한 바위 피난처의 정찰병들이 늘고 있지만 이들은 결코 자신의 임무에서 물러서지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c466725-2b26-4d03-b0eb-a25560476088\', \'multiverseId\': 403935}, \'multiverseid\': 403935}, {\'name\': \'Vigia da Beira do Penhasco\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Batedor Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Embora haja muitas perdas entre os batedores dos Refúgios de Pedra, eles jamais hesitam no cumprimento do dever.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a3f0570-4d79-4e1d-a994-5ce39de0ca8a\', \'multiverseId\': 404234}, \'multiverseid\': 404234}, {\'name\': \'Скальная Дозорная\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Разведчик Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Разведчики из Каменных Убежищ несут большие потери, но никому не приходит в голову уклоняться от своего долга.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d21b10-1d12-4307-a84c-068233032e53\', \'multiverseId\': 404533}, \'multiverseid\': 404533}, {\'name\': \'峭壁警戒员\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'虽然石庇所斥候伤亡惨重，但他们仍能坚守岗位，毫不退缩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164217dd-9e66-4b84-a2a4-2e4005e18d7c\', \'multiverseId\': 402141}, \'multiverseid\': 402141}, {\'name\': \'峭壁警戒員\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'雖然石庇所斥候傷亡慘重，但他們仍能堅守崗位，毫不退縮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a9e45e-eb07-412a-ae3c-1134e44d2daf\', \'multiverseId\': 402440}, \'multiverseid\': 402440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fesselnde Fangarme\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine KreaturDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -6/-0 und verliert Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nach all den damit verbundenen Mühen, diesen Zweizack von einer Göttin einer anderen Welt zu stehlen, wollte Kiora nun seine Fähigkeiten testen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6abb9c3-7801-44d5-aa5b-b3884a3a9a99\', \'multiverseId\': 402969}, \'multiverseid\': 402969}, {\'name\': \'Tentáculos estranguladores\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.La criatura encantada obtiene -6/-0 y pierde la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Kiora se había esforzado mucho en robarle un bidente a un dios de otro mundo y tenía ganas de probar su poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295f6880-d5c0-4086-8645-ae99cd92f9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 405062}, \'multiverseid\': 405062}, {\'name\': \'Annelures constrictives\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créatureLa créature enchantée gagne -6/-0 et perd le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Kiora ayant dérobé un bident à un dieu d\'un autre monde, elle avait hâte de le voir à l\'œuvre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403268&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7dbbd2-0ee8-4d21-8fba-932e8355900b\', \'multiverseId\': 403268}, \'multiverseid\': 403268}, {\'name\': \'Spire Serrate\', \'text\': \'Incanta creaturaLa creatura incantata prende -6/-0 e perde volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Visto che si era presa la briga di rubare il bidente alla dea di un altro mondo, Kiora era impaziente di metterne alla prova le capacità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795ea7d3-3b70-44c9-a412-79ca0ac05976\', \'multiverseId\': 403567}, \'multiverseid\': 403567}, {\'name\': \'巻き締め付け\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）エンチャントされているクリーチャーは－６/－０の修整を受けるとともに飛行を失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'苦労して別世界の神から二叉槍を奪ったキオーラは、その力を試したくて仕方がなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd433415-bec8-4171-9671-4fb0af5e8ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 403866}, \'multiverseid\': 403866}, {\'name\': \'옥죄이는 똬리\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여부여된 생물은 -6/-0을 받고 비행을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'키오라는 자신의 능력을 시험해 보기 위해 다른 세상의 신이 가진 쌍지창을 훔쳤다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2322ad-dc2e-4b08-b112-24e02f677131\', \'multiverseId\': 404165}, \'multiverseid\': 404165}, {\'name\': \'Espirais Esmagadoras\', \'text\': \'Encantar criaturaA criatura encantada recebe -6/-0 e perde voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Depois de se dar ao trabalho de roubar um bidente de um deus em outro mundo, Kiora estava ansiosa para testar suas capacidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a474c1a1-3e28-4d54-a623-c00e192edd70\', \'multiverseId\': 404464}, \'multiverseid\': 404464}, {\'name\': \'Сминающие Кольца\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существоЗачарованное существо получает -6/-0 и теряет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Киоре, потратившей так много сил на кражу двузубца у бога из иного мира, не терпелось испытать его в действии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c2409bf-89c3-465d-9067-af19eb92cab0\', \'multiverseId\': 404763}, \'multiverseid\': 404763}, {\'name\': \'盘绕紧缚\', \'text\': \'结附于生物所结附的生物得-6/-0且失去飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'奇奥拉大费周章从另一个世界的神明处偷来了双叉戟，她迫不及待想检验它的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169c4317-f629-4544-a179-44ae04cb1f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 402371}, \'multiverseid\': 402371}, {\'name\': \'盤繞緊縛\', \'text\': \'結附於生物所結附的生物得-6/-0且失去飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'奇奧拉大費周章從另一個世界的神明處偷來了雙叉戟，她迫不及待想檢驗它的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12d4703-5b19-4d2f-8653-45f9b14146b4\', \'multiverseId\': 402670}, \'multiverseid\': 402670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuermantel-Magier\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn der Feuermantel-Magier oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Bedrohlichkeit. (Eine Kreatur mit Bedrohlichkeit kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Kommt schon, ihr abscheulichen Wesen! Wollt ihr euch nicht miteinander vertraut machen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402777&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac353f4c-971e-4c60-af57-cc0fdc4562ca\', \'multiverseId\': 402777}, \'multiverseid\': 402777}, {\'name\': \'Mago manto ígneo\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Mago manto ígneo u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno. (Una criatura con la habilidad de amenaza no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Vengan, criaturas asquerosas! ¿No quieren que nos conozcamos?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50482a19-4300-4bfe-971d-fd1b6b4b4772\', \'multiverseId\': 404870}, \'multiverseid\': 404870}, {\'name\': \'Mage ganguefeu\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que le Mage ganguefeu ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Une créature avec la menace ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Approchez, choses immondes ! Ne voulez-vous pas faire ma connaissance ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a9125d-0a62-4916-b29e-df383c07b9d9\', \'multiverseId\': 403076}, \'multiverseid\': 403076}, {\'name\': \'Mago della Cappa Infuocata\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta il Mago della Cappa Infuocata o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno. (Una creatura con minacciare non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Avanti, bestie deformi! Non volete fare amicizia?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'455a1409-a4fc-482c-a247-9b5eaad84480\', \'multiverseId\': 403375}, \'multiverseid\': 403375}, {\'name\': \'炎套の魔道士\', \'text\': \'結集 ― 炎套の魔道士か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは威迫を得る。（威迫を持つクリーチャーは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「来いよ捻くれ者！よろしく頼むぜ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a127d5-e1cf-412a-8b9a-75af19fe8dec\', \'multiverseId\': 403674}, \'multiverseid\': 403674}, {\'name\': \'화염망토 마도사\', \'text\': \'결집 — 화염망토 마도사나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 호전적을 얻는다. (호전적이 있는 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물로만 방어할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"덤벼라, 이 뒤틀린 녀석들아! 나랑 한 판 붙어 보자."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cddfcfc1-f5c3-40c7-a12d-2837785c6353\', \'multiverseId\': 403973}, \'multiverseid\': 403973}, {\'name\': \'Mago do Manto Ígneo\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Mago do Manto Ígneo ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham ameaçar até o final do turno. (Uma criatura com ameaçar só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Venham, monstros deformes! Vocês não querem me conhecer melhor?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0894d71-28de-4845-9f9c-e2a60a33191a\', \'multiverseId\': 404272}, \'multiverseid\': 404272}, {\'name\': \'Маг Огненного Одеяния\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Маг Огненного Одеяния или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Угрозу до конца хода. (Существо с Угрозой не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Ну давайте, уродливые твари! Кто хочет познакомиться?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a9ccd32-5371-4dc1-964b-76bac9ec2839\', \'multiverseId\': 404571}, \'multiverseid\': 404571}, {\'name\': \'焰篷法师\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当焰篷法师或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得威慑异能直到回合结束。（具威慑异能的生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「来啊，你们这些扭曲的怪物！你们不想有个伴吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1cb9b79-d43c-402a-a5c5-9a9578df06d8\', \'multiverseId\': 402179}, \'multiverseid\': 402179}, {\'name\': \'焰篷法師\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當焰篷法師或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得威懾異能直到回合結束。（具威懾異能的生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「來啊，你們這些扭曲的怪物！你們不想有個伴嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff91ada-04f1-4c03-9fa1-ae38415ea334\', \'multiverseId\': 402478}, \'multiverseid\': 402478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fokus des Lithomagiers\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Verhindere allen Schaden, der dieser Kreatur in diesem Zug von farblosen Quellen zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst in den Händen von Amateuren können Nahiris Polyeder den Eldrazi Schaden zufügen."—Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402838&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8a760c-7f6c-477a-85d8-04f28fb74d68\', \'multiverseId\': 402838}, \'multiverseid\': 402838}, {\'name\': \'Concentración del litomante\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Prevén todo el daño que las fuentes incoloras fueran a hacerle a esa criatura este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso en manos de un aficionado, los edros de Nahiri pueden dañar a los Eldrazi".—Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6597e66f-ef68-4d2c-b082-43238774e19b\', \'multiverseId\': 404931}, \'multiverseid\': 404931}, {\'name\': \'Focus du lithomancien\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à cette créature ce tour-ci par des sources incolores.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Même entre les mains d\'un amateur, les hèdrons de Nahiri peuvent blesser les Eldrazi. »—Ugin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c555dd6e-3a34-4b7a-a44b-01f3e3889469\', \'multiverseId\': 403137}, \'multiverseid\': 403137}, {\'name\': \'Concentrazione del Litomante\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a quella creatura in questo turno da fonti incolore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino nelle mani di un principiante, gli edri di Nahiri possono ferire gli Eldrazi."—Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87790690-7b36-4bd7-83c0-c0d93b190421\', \'multiverseId\': 403436}, \'multiverseid\': 403436}, {\'name\': \'石術師の焦点\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。このターン、無色の発生源からそのクリーチャーに与えられるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「たとえ素人が使っても、ナヒリの面晶体ならエルドラージに痛手を与えられる。」――ウギン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c607a3-8766-4614-b7d3-8ace91034cd3\', \'multiverseId\': 403735}, \'multiverseid\': 403735}, {\'name\': \'암석술사의 집중\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 이 턴에 무색 원천이 그 생물에게 입히려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나히리의 다면체만 있으면 풋내기라도 엘드라지를 공격할 수 있다네."—우진\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01442cb9-c376-4455-917d-fde8c01f0a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 404034}, \'multiverseid\': 404034}, {\'name\': \'Foco do Litomante\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Previna todo o dano que seria causado àquela criatura neste turno por fontes incolores.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Mesmo nas mãos de amadores, os edros de Nahiri podem ferir os Eldrazi."— Ugin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d121e9-6793-4a61-a9f7-1f4e7529d5cd\', \'multiverseId\': 404333}, \'multiverseid\': 404333}, {\'name\': \'Цель Литоманта\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода. Предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны нанести тому существу в этом ходу бесцветные источники.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Эдры Нахири могут навредить Эльдрази даже в руках дилетантов».— Уджин\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef677791-b729-44bd-8071-eb3ed03016d8\', \'multiverseId\': 404632}, \'multiverseid\': 404632}, {\'name\': \'砾岩术士凝神\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。于本回合中，防止无色来源将对该生物造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「即便在外行人手中，娜希丽的晶石也能伤到奥札奇。」～乌金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8fd3940-4820-4949-9254-a882059a3ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 402240}, \'multiverseid\': 402240}, {\'name\': \'礫岩術士凝神\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。於本回合中，防止無色來源將對該生物造成的所有傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「即便在外行人手中，娜希麗的晶石也能傷到奧札奇。」～烏金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'445eab75-6f88-4bcb-8dbc-ee95725c0503\', \'multiverseId\': 402539}, \'multiverseid\': 402539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fruchtbares Dickicht\', \'text\': \'Das Fruchtbare Dickicht kommt getappt ins Spiel.Wenn das Fruchtbare Dickicht ins Spiel kommt, kannst du dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek anschauen. Falls du dies tust, zeige bis zu eine Standardland-Karte darunter offen vor. Lege dann diese Karte oben auf deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402776&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df1e5360-6e11-4301-8aea-0d9021e0b0f5\', \'multiverseId\': 402776}, \'multiverseid\': 402776}, {\'name\': \'Maleza fértil\', \'text\': \'La Maleza fértil entra al campo de batalla girada.Cuando la Maleza fértil entre al campo de batalla, puedes mirar las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Si lo haces, muestra hasta una carta de tierra básica que se encuentre entre ellas y luego pon esa carta en la parte superior de tu biblioteca y el resto en el fondo en cualquier orden.{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff0d2ea-4be2-4146-aa95-38325f04a3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 404869}, \'multiverseid\': 404869}, {\'name\': \'Halliers fertiles\', \'text\': "Les Halliers fertiles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.Quand les Halliers fertiles arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez regarder les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si vous faites ainsi, révélez jusqu\'à une carte de terrain de base parmi elles, puis mettez cette carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c46507f-9bb7-48ee-b5cc-d654ead6c88b\', \'multiverseId\': 403075}, \'multiverseid\': 403075}, {\'name\': \'Boschetto Fertile\', \'text\': \'Il Boschetto Fertile entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.Quando il Boschetto Fertile entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi guardare le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Se lo fai, rivela fino a una carta terra base scelta tra esse, poi metti quella carta in cima al tuo grimorio e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d74c6b-45ba-4ec5-9c23-0b9662586b85\', \'multiverseId\': 403374}, \'multiverseid\': 403374}, {\'name\': \'肥沃な茂み\', \'text\': \'肥沃な茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。肥沃な茂みが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを見てもよい。そうしたなら、その中の基本土地・カードを最大１枚公開し、そのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に、残りを一番下に望む順番で置く。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc1aae46-38c6-424f-b325-7a9918135907\', \'multiverseId\': 403673}, \'multiverseid\': 403673}, {\'name\': \'비옥한 덤불\', \'text\': \'비옥한 덤불은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.비옥한 덤불이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 다섯 장을 볼 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 중에서 기본 대지 카드를 최대 한 장까지 공개한 다음 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 놓고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.{T}: {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7237677a-427a-4d96-81d4-a76264350dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 403972}, \'multiverseid\': 403972}, {\'name\': \'Arvoredo Fértil\', \'text\': \'Arvoredo Fértil entra no campo de batalha virado.Quando Arvoredo Fértil entra no campo de batalha, você pode olhar os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Se fizer isso, revele até um card de terreno básico dentre eles e depois coloque aquele card no topo de seu grimório e o restante no fundo em qualquer ordem.{T}: Adicione {G} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'425939aa-2995-4e3f-b13b-e818269c620e\', \'multiverseId\': 404271}, \'multiverseid\': 404271}, {\'name\': \'Плодородные Заросли\', \'text\': \'Плодородные Заросли выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.Когда Плодородные Заросли выходят на поле битвы, вы можете посмотреть пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Если вы это делаете, покажите не более одной находящейся среди них карты базовой земли, затем положите ту карту на верх вашей библиотеки, а остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.{T}: добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb04eb9-1242-49fe-af85-298296e36f90\', \'multiverseId\': 404570}, \'multiverseid\': 404570}, {\'name\': \'茂密灌丛\', \'text\': \'茂密灌丛须横置进战场。当茂密灌丛进战场时，你可以检视你牌库顶的五张牌。若你如此作，则展示其中至多一张基本地牌，然后将该牌置于你的牌库顶，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库底。{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3065c3e6-99ae-4b8a-af52-0da76ccb2687\', \'multiverseId\': 402178}, \'multiverseid\': 402178}, {\'name\': \'茂密灌叢\', \'text\': \'茂密灌叢須橫置進戰場。當茂密灌叢進戰場時，你可以檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。若你如此作，則展示其中至多一張基本地牌，然後將該牌置於你的牌庫頂，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫底。{T}：加{G}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d067c167-c5bc-488d-bc62-17abc72b78ba\', \'multiverseId\': 402477}, \'multiverseid\': 402477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnishirte\', \'text\': \'Wenn du den Fäulnishirten wirkst, kannst du zwei Karten, die deine Gegner besitzen, aus dem Exil auf die Friedhöfe ihrer Besitzer legen. Falls du dies tust, bringe drei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'349927a4-1bbc-4526-815b-302503ae753b\', \'multiverseId\': 402716}, \'multiverseid\': 402716}, {\'name\': \'Pastor de parásitos\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances el Pastor de parásitos, puedes poner en los cementerios de sus propietarios dos cartas del exilio de las que tus oponentes sean propietarios. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla tres fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1b705d-e9ac-4c2f-9eb7-dff39b368df5\', \'multiverseId\': 404809}, \'multiverseid\': 404809}, {\'name\': \'Berger du fléau\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez le Berger du fléau, vous pouvez mettre deux cartes que vos adversaires possèdent dans les cimetières de leurs propriétaires depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez sur le champ de bataille trois jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a48395-8852-4375-846c-a5d1b0de2639\', \'multiverseId\': 403015}, \'multiverseid\': 403015}, {\'name\': \'Mandriano della Sventura\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci il Mandriano della Sventura, puoi mettere due carte possedute dai tuoi avversari dall\\\'esilio nei cimiteri dei rispettivi proprietari. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia tre pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a87606-bfa0-4e60-a1aa-32194b02310c\', \'multiverseId\': 403314}, \'multiverseid\': 403314}, {\'name\': \'荒廃を招くもの\', \'text\': \'あなたが荒廃を招くものを唱えたとき、あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを２枚を、それらのオーナーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa0e3c7-f3e8-4841-ac3f-5c6a9e1d12f6\', \'multiverseId\': 403613}, \'multiverseid\': 403613}, {\'name\': \'역병 목동\', \'text\': \'역병 목동을 발동할 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 두 장을 소유자의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 세 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740d79a5-9e7d-4d7f-9e21-ef498090a510\', \'multiverseId\': 403912}, \'multiverseid\': 403912}, {\'name\': \'Pastor da Desgraça\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjura Pastor da Desgraça, você pode colocar dois cards exilados de seus oponentes nos cemitérios de seus donos. Se fizer isso, coloque no campo de batalha três fichas de criatura incolores 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912e7ca3-85a4-425e-bc78-79aa85c20997\', \'multiverseId\': 404211}, \'multiverseid\': 404211}, {\'name\': \'Пастух Чумы\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете Пастуха Чумы, вы можете положить две принадлежащие вашим оппонентам карты из изгнания на кладбища их владельцев. Если вы это делаете, положите на поле битвы три фишки существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Они имеют способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45a832d-e57e-4d18-a3c0-b02ba72c6687\', \'multiverseId\': 404510}, \'multiverseid\': 404510}, {\'name\': \'枯萎牧体\', \'text\': \'当你施放枯萎牧体时，你可以将两张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入其拥有者的坟墓场。若你如此作，则将三个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b48d4a-25c4-4ae9-add1-e375985fa9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 402118}, \'multiverseid\': 402118}, {\'name\': \'枯萎牧體\', \'text\': \'當你施放枯萎牧體時，你可以將兩張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入其擁有者的墳墓場。若你如此作，則將三個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它們具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e542246a-1b9f-4558-b584-99e60902a3cf\', \'multiverseId\': 402417}, \'multiverseid\': 402417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnisschlurfer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Fäulnisschlurfer.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls ich sterbe, verfüttert mich an einen Schlurfer. Dann tue ich wenigstens noch etwas Gutes."—Ryza, Oran-Rief-Späher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32dfa9b8-5e09-4471-a6bc-e14806917e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 402913}, \'multiverseid\': 402913}, {\'name\': \'Reptador pútrido\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que controles muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Reptador pútrido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si muero, echadme de comer a un reptador. Así al menos haré algún bien".—Ryza, exploradora de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3ad569-1c9b-4dbf-ae32-d656705c614b\', \'multiverseId\': 405006}, \'multiverseid\': 405006}, {\'name\': \'Escogriffe putride\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Escogriffe putride.", \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': "« Si je meurs, donnez mon corps à manger à un escogriffe. Au moins, de cette façon je serai utile. »—Ryza, éclaireuse d\'Oran-Rief", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403212&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1465585-ce1c-4f34-962e-877875cf2ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 403212}, \'multiverseid\': 403212}, {\'name\': \'Errante della Putrefazione\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Errante della Putrefazione.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': \'"Se muoio, dammi in pasto a un errante. Almeno così mi sarò resa utile."—Ryza, esploratrice di Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf939f9-0eee-45a4-a3e6-71300d80c810\', \'multiverseId\': 403511}, \'multiverseid\': 403511}, {\'name\': \'腐敗のシャンブラー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、腐敗のシャンブラーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': \'「私が死んだら、シャンブラーに食わせてやって。そうすれば私も少しは役に立つでしょう。」――オラン＝リーフの斥候、ライザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6b8d43-c1bb-46ec-adef-95627e9ad8f1\', \'multiverseId\': 403810}, \'multiverseid\': 403810}, {\'name\': \'부패한 어기적괴물\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 부패한 어기적괴물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 진균\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 죽거든 어기적괴물의 먹이로 던져 주게나. 그렇게 하는 편이 조금이나마 쓸모가 있을 테니."—오란리프 정찰병 라이자\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e646e7a-8012-4567-ba4f-18bfcd6dd0db\', \'multiverseId\': 404109}, \'multiverseid\': 404109}, {\'name\': \'Trôpego Putrefato\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura que você controla morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Trôpego Putrefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se eu morrer, me dê de comida a um trôpego. Pelo menos assim eu vou estar fazendo algum bem."— Ryza, batedora de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8280b70-f439-48c8-9f98-778e93b9e956\', \'multiverseId\': 404408}, \'multiverseid\': 404408}, {\'name\': \'Гнилостный Шаркун\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Гнилостного Шаркуна.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень\', \'flavor\': \'«Если я погибну, скормите меня шаркуну. Так от меня будет хоть какой-нибудь толк».— Риза, оран-рифская разведчица\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03da3031-2ec6-4c15-a20c-65455f9e7670\', \'multiverseId\': 404707}, \'multiverseid\': 404707}, {\'name\': \'腐臭跛行兽\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，在腐臭跛行兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我死了，就把我喂给跛行兽吧。至少那样，我还算是做了件有用的事。」～欧兰黎斥候莱莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed665252-3064-4a39-a3e0-e22a47f124ad\', \'multiverseId\': 402315}, \'multiverseid\': 402315}, {\'name\': \'腐臭跛行獸\', \'text\': \'每當另一個由你操控的生物死去時，在腐臭跛行獸上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我死了，就把我餵給跛行獸吧。至少那樣，我還算是做了件有用的事。」～歐蘭黎斥候萊莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f8fc46b-57ad-4f03-9423-ea1c143569eb\', \'multiverseId\': 402614}, \'multiverseid\': 402614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürchterlicher Fehlschlag\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 4 oder weniger. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind nichts als Staub für sie — unsere Körper, unsere Taten, selbst unsere Worte."—Jori En, Expeditionsführer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52f4716d-7120-47b1-bb7f-3f919dd123b8\', \'multiverseId\': 402811}, \'multiverseid\': 402811}, {\'name\': \'Fracaso rotundo\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 4 o menos. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para ellos no somos nada más que polvo: nuestros cuerpos, nuestras acciones, incluso nuestras palabras".—Jori En, líder de expedición\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f32cb280-35a9-4a2f-8750-e0c666bc0f95\', \'multiverseId\': 404904}, \'multiverseid\': 404904}, {\'name\': \'Mauvaise posture\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Contrecarrez un sort de créature ciblé avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 4. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nous ne sommes que poussière à leurs yeux... Nos corps, nos actes et même nos paroles. »—Jori En, chef d\'expédition", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e06b202-f002-4034-a217-bf95d64bb74f\', \'multiverseId\': 403110}, \'multiverseid\': 403110}, {\'name\': \'Esito Orripilante\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Neutralizza una magia creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 4. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non siamo altro che polvere per loro. I nostri corpi, le nostre azioni, persino le nostre parole."—Jori En, capo spedizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df58b2f-729c-4557-8cd1-edb2fd6bf227\', \'multiverseId\': 403409}, \'multiverseid\': 403409}, {\'name\': \'手酷い失敗\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）点数で見たマナ・コストが４以下のクリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。その呪文がこれにより打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつらにとって、私たちは塵のようなもの。肉体も、行動も、言葉でさえも。」――探検隊長、ジョリー・エン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'017ef90d-58d5-4b41-90d6-e7f682abfcab\', \'multiverseId\': 403708}, \'multiverseid\': 403708}, {\'name\': \'끔찍한 실패\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)전환마나비용이 4 이하인 생물 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물 주문을 무효화한다. 이렇게 그 주문이 무효화되면 그 카드를 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 그들에게 먼지 같은 존재야. 우리의 몸, 행동, 심지어 말도 아무 소용 없어."—탐험대 대장 조리 엔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d53a2e7d-82e3-45db-a117-3045906023dc\', \'multiverseId\': 404007}, \'multiverseid\': 404007}, {\'name\': \'Terrivelmente Errado\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Anule a mágica de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 4. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não passamos de pó para eles — nossos corpos, nossas ações, até mesmo nossas palavras."— Jori En, líder de expedição\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e20792f-4343-4ca4-93f9-86cf1ef63861\', \'multiverseId\': 404306}, \'multiverseid\': 404306}, {\'name\': \'Нелепое Искажение\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Отмените целевое заклинание существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 4. Если то заклинание отменяется таким образом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы для них всего лишь прах — наши тела, наши действия и даже наши слова».— Джори-Эн, глава экспедиции\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492da340-e947-4ea0-b410-e74892b51194\', \'multiverseId\': 404605}, \'multiverseid\': 404605}, {\'name\': \'可怖扭曲\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）反击目标总法术力费用等于或小于4的生物咒语。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「对它们而言，我们的一切都不过是尘土～躯体、行动，甚至是言语。」～探险队长裘黎恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c180f624-a0c4-4b17-8068-2fc922ef1fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 402213}, \'multiverseid\': 402213}, {\'name\': \'可怖扭曲\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）反擊目標總魔法力費用等於或小於4的生物咒語。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「對它們而言，我們的一切都不過是塵土～軀體、行動，甚至是言語。」～探險隊長裘黎恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da9fb430-4f1e-4732-9277-60d82e748d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 402512}, \'multiverseid\': 402512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebietstreuer Baloth\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Gebietstreue Baloth +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Er weiß nichts von Eldrazi oder Planeswalkern. Er weiß nur, dass es neue Eindringlinge in seinem Revier gibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e907ff5d-4850-49ed-ae44-3f3baccbf962\', \'multiverseId\': 402967}, \'multiverseid\': 402967}, {\'name\': \'Báloth territorial\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Báloth territorial obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'No sabe nada de los Eldrazi ni de los planeswalkers. Solo entiende que hay intrusos nuevos en su territorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c526641-919c-4a7f-b424-cf69d5701c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 405060}, \'multiverseid\': 405060}, {\'name\': \'Baloth territorial\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Baloth territorial gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'Il ne connaît ni les Eldrazi, ni les Planeswalkers. Il sait simplement que des intrus se trouvent sur son territoire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403266&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e9db8de-de6f-4a3d-a4a9-c53157286f5a\', \'multiverseId\': 403266}, \'multiverseid\': 403266}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Territoriale\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Baloth Territoriale prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Non sa nulla di Eldrazi o Planeswalker, sa solo che ci sono nuovi intrusi nel suo territorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411575cd-36f4-4021-bf6a-0739f70a3a55\', \'multiverseId\': 403565}, \'multiverseid\': 403565}, {\'name\': \'領地のベイロス\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、領地のベイロスは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージとかプレインズウォーカーとかわかるはずもなかったが、縄張りに新しい侵入者が現れたことには気づいていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af7dd938-dc66-44ca-94c5-c336059df844\', \'multiverseId\': 403864}, \'multiverseid\': 403864}, {\'name\': \'영역을 지키는 발로스\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 영역을 지키는 발로스는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 엘드라지나 플레인즈워커에 대해서는 아는 게 없지만, 영역에 새로운 침입자가 있다는 건 확실히 안다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc57b910-81cc-4e7b-a70b-1b9eb0ba194b\', \'multiverseId\': 404163}, \'multiverseid\': 404163}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Territorial\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Baloth Territorial recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não sabe nada sobre Planeswalkers nem Eldrazi. Só sabe que há novos intrusos em seu território.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f33c2aa-f11e-4f7b-87c6-44d47504170e\', \'multiverseId\': 404462}, \'multiverseid\': 404462}, {\'name\': \'Территориальный Балот\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Территориальный Балот получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Он ничего не знает ни об Эльдрази, ни о Planeswalker-ах. И те и другие — лишь новые незваные гости в его угодьях.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b6f9ec-46e3-4810-9d0f-42f6056585c5\', \'multiverseId\': 404761}, \'multiverseid\': 404761}, {\'name\': \'据地巴洛西\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，据地巴洛西得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'它才不管是奥札奇或是鹏洛客，只知道领地内有入侵者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3073f638-3656-43ea-b56a-a8f7353a8920\', \'multiverseId\': 402369}, \'multiverseid\': 402369}, {\'name\': \'據地巴洛西\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，據地巴洛西得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'牠才不管是奧札奇或是鵬洛客，只知道領地內有入侵者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ab6d96-84fb-43e9-ba97-3121a33dc6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402668}, \'multiverseid\': 402668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenübertretung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst eine Karte davon, deren umgewandelte Manakosten 3 oder mehr betragen, und schickst diese Karte ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Angst vor dem Unbekannten kann so wunderbar unschuldig sein — relativ gesehen."—Anowon, der Weise der Ruine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c1ba7e-6794-4a1a-801b-f4c1f136f6ff\', \'multiverseId\': 402972}, \'multiverseid\': 402972}, {\'name\': \'Transgredir la mente\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)El jugador objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta con coste de maná convertido de 3 o más y exilias esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El miedo a lo desconocido puede ser maravillosamente inocente, en términos relativos".—Anowon, el Sabio de las Ruinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1adaf2cd-972f-4cfd-93b3-0d302939e1e0\', \'multiverseId\': 405065}, \'multiverseid\': 405065}, {\'name\': "Transgression de l\'esprit", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Le joueur ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte ayant un coût converti de mana supérieur ou égal à 3 et vous exilez cette carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La peur de l\'inconnu est une chose merveilleusement innocente, en comparaison. »—Anowon, le sage des ruines", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403271&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73dadf45-d330-46ba-9efe-35e862f7aa4f\', \'multiverseId\': 403271}, \'multiverseid\': 403271}, {\'name\': \'Violare la Mente\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Un giocatore bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta da quella mano con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 3 ed esilia quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La paura dell\\\'ignoto può essere straordinariamente innocente, relativamente parlando."—Anowon, il Saggio delle Rovine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4102ef0-348d-4170-a3a6-bcea39ac8453\', \'multiverseId\': 403570}, \'multiverseid\': 403570}, {\'name\': \'精神背信\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以上のカードを１枚選び、そのカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「未知に対する恐怖とは、いかにも無邪気と言わざるを得ん。ま、比較すればの話だがな。」――遺跡の賢者、アノワン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ec95e6-e12c-44dd-aece-1feafbe49885\', \'multiverseId\': 403869}, \'multiverseid\': 403869}, {\'name\': \'정신을 범하다\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 당신은 그 중에서 전환마나비용이 3 이상인 카드 한 장을 골라 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"알려지지 않은 존재에 대한 두려움은 지극히 자연스러운 현상일세."—폐허의 현자 아노원\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0834648b-d381-47de-870f-1b1b807e08f9\', \'multiverseId\': 404168}, \'multiverseid\': 404168}, {\'name\': \'Transgredir a Mente\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)O jogador alvo revela sua própria mão. Você escolhe um card da mão dele com custo de mana convertido igual ou superior a 3 e o exila.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O medo do desconhecido pode ser, relativamente, uma coisa maravilhosamente inocente."— Anowon, o Sábio da Ruína\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2329aea-38a2-404d-a698-96557e6159c6\', \'multiverseId\': 404467}, \'multiverseid\': 404467}, {\'name\': \'Нарушение Рассудка\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Целевой игрок показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете из нее карту с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или больше и изгоняете ту карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Страх неизвестного по сравнению с этим может оказаться удивительно невинной чертой».— Ановон, мудрец руин\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d00e631-ad1a-410d-971c-2498facfda56\', \'multiverseId\': 404766}, \'multiverseid\': 404766}, {\'name\': \'违背心智\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）目标牌手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张总法术力费用等于或大于3的牌，并放逐该牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「对未知事物的恐惧与之相较，实在显得天真无邪。」～遗迹智者亚诺文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89342cdd-c7ac-4a24-81df-de71cef6a7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 402374}, \'multiverseid\': 402374}, {\'name\': \'違背心智\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）目標玩家展示其手牌。你選擇其中一張總魔法力費用等於或大於3的牌，並放逐該牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「對未知事物的恐懼與之相較，實在顯得天真無邪。」～遺跡智者亞諾文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90aaa8d6-62e8-41bf-8733-724d6ee02a18\', \'multiverseId\': 402673}, \'multiverseid\': 402673}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßige Null\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf die Gefräßige Null. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser Tage herrscht kein Mangel an Futter für die Nullen von Guul Draz."—Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e1c112-0ad9-4e69-b5d6-3d9a0fa8757a\', \'multiverseId\': 402992}, \'multiverseid\': 402992}, {\'name\': \'Nulo voraz\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Nulo voraz. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoy día siempre hay sustento para los nulos de Guul Draz".—Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b1fb7a3-3e8d-49dc-8187-0d79ed31a270\', \'multiverseId\': 405085}, \'multiverseid\': 405085}, {\'name\': \'Infécond vorace\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Infécond vorace. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Ces derniers temps, les inféconds de Guul Draz ont toujours quelque chose à se mettre sous la dent. »—Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403291&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df0a1493-b087-4b02-a2d9-ccfdb33466f1\', \'multiverseId\': 403291}, \'multiverseid\': 403291}, {\'name\': \'Nullo Vorace\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 sul Nullo Vorace. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Di questi tempi, non c\\\'è carenza di cibo per i nulli di Guul Draz."—Drana, capo sanguinario Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1c8b6d-5a02-4793-b55c-bd9599b287a5\', \'multiverseId\': 403590}, \'multiverseid\': 403590}, {\'name\': \'大食の虚身\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, 他のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：大食の虚身の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「グール・ドラズの虚身どもは、近頃はエサに困らぬからな。」――カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f7f142-a3d2-498d-9f56-0514397c8f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 403889}, \'multiverseid\': 403889}, {\'name\': \'굶주린 결손자\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, 다른 생물을 희생한다: 굶주린 결손자에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"요즘에는 굴 드라즈의 결손자들이 굶을 일이 없다."—칼라스트리아의 혈족장 드라나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35c61d7-77ee-4e4b-a3c2-1716aaaa2c16\', \'multiverseId\': 404188}, \'multiverseid\': 404188}, {\'name\': \'Nulo Voraz\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Sacrifique outra criatura: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Nulo Voraz. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoje em dia não há escassez de comida para os nulos de Guul Draz."— Drana, grã-vampira Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70719a9a-2329-4f66-8b27-8649a9a48a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 404487}, \'multiverseid\': 404487}, {\'name\': \'Прожорливое Ничтожество\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, пожертвуйте другое существо: положите два жетона +1/+1 на Прожорливое Ничтожество. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«В наши дни для ничтожеств Гуул-Драза нет недостатка в корме».— Драна, кровавый вождь Каластриев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f874f1b-91c2-4807-b37f-f5e6e7975fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 404786}, \'multiverseid\': 404786}, {\'name\': \'贪餍躯壳\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，牺牲另一个生物：在贪餍躯壳上放置两个+1/+1指示物。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「如今，古坠兹的躯壳不愁没有食物。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7012df86-ee0e-4e6a-99ab-d17c1ea7c883\', \'multiverseId\': 402394}, \'multiverseid\': 402394}, {\'name\': \'貪饜軀殼\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，犧牲另一個生物：在貪饜軀殼上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「如今，古墜茲的軀殼不愁沒有食物。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2330b9fa-fb8c-40a2-add0-3d49a8c54685\', \'multiverseId\': 402693}, \'multiverseid\': 402693}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gegeneinander ausspielen\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe diese Kreatur. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nein, nicht! Nal, ich bin\\\'s do…"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddd90fcc-0b94-4e88-aaf6-be3741c07bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 402974}, \'multiverseid\': 402974}, {\'name\': \'Traicionar\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Gana el control de la criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡No lo hagas! Nal, ¡soy yo! ¡Soy y—".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6b7469-134e-4369-a7d4-83b909fa6494\', \'multiverseId\': 405067}, \'multiverseid\': 405067}, {\'name\': \'Reniement\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Acquérez le contrôle de la créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Non, je t\'en prie ! Nal, c\'est moi... »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403273&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6fefd05-e466-4b26-8aa7-e0a9c69ea5ab\', \'multiverseId\': 403273}, \'multiverseid\': 403273}, {\'name\': \'Rivoltarsi\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No, non farlo! Nal, sono io..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c26b55d-bc4e-4112-9919-b8fb9319a536\', \'multiverseId\': 403572}, \'multiverseid\': 403572}, {\'name\': \'敵対\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「待て、やめろ！ナール、俺だ……。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ac7a07-8250-4e12-8c64-83afff8e1082\', \'multiverseId\': 403871}, \'multiverseid\': 403871}, {\'name\': \'등 돌리기\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 생물은 언탭되고 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"안돼, 멈춰! 날, 나란 말이야—"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a280aeeb-559f-45ea-a02c-ee475533dd31\', \'multiverseId\': 404170}, \'multiverseid\': 404170}, {\'name\': \'Voltar-se Contra\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não. Não! Nal, sou eu..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad03c22d-c957-441c-9be0-4ea6ee12ce2e\', \'multiverseId\': 404469}, \'multiverseid\': 404469}, {\'name\': \'Восстать Против\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Получите контроль над целевым существом до конца хода. Разверните то существо. Оно получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Нет! Постой! Нэл, это же я!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3caf56-7f50-4aa9-b9e2-fd40ef5690b1\', \'multiverseId\': 404768}, \'multiverseid\': 404768}, {\'name\': \'倒戈相向\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）获得目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「不，住手！纳尔，是我啊～」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e57abf5-26a5-41bf-9b4c-6ed0915f41a9\', \'multiverseId\': 402376}, \'multiverseid\': 402376}, {\'name\': \'倒戈相向\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）獲得目標生物的操控權直到回合結束。重置該生物。它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「不，住手！納爾，是我啊—」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a859388e-47ae-4000-9b02-e8924da3eaf0\', \'multiverseId\': 402675}, \'multiverseid\': 402675}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gepanzerter Zerstampfer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Fluchsicher\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Er mag gegen die Eldrazi kämpfen, aber begehe nicht den Fehler, ihn als Verbündeten anzusehen, Gideon. An deinem Vereint-sind-wir-stark-Konzept ist er nicht interessiert."—Najiya, Anführerin der Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6b33fb-bd96-45b9-b559-5916385c9a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 402893}, \'multiverseid\': 402893}, {\'name\': \'Aplastador blindado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, antimaleficio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Tal vez luche contra los Eldrazi, pero no lo confundas con un camarada, Gideon. No está interesado en tu concepto de que la unidad hace la fuerza".—Najiya, líder de los Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7560404-853e-4c2a-886c-1a029943eb36\', \'multiverseId\': 404986}, \'multiverseid\': 404986}, {\'name\': \'Écrabouilleur à plaques\', \'text\': \'Piétinement, défense talismanique\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "« Peut-être combat-il les Eldrazi, mais ne croyez pas pour autant qu\'il est votre allié, Gideon. Vos idées de synergie ne l\'intéressent pas. »—Najiya, chef des Tajuru", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75e6a3be-a563-477f-8b20-21795e2dd23b\', \'multiverseId\': 403192}, \'multiverseid\': 403192}, {\'name\': \'Distruttore Corazzato\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, anti-malocchio\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Non pensare che sia nostro alleato solo perché combatte gli Eldrazi, Gideon. Non è interessato al tuo concetto di forza attraverso l\\\'unione."—Najiya, capo dei Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7539a8dc-c662-4266-a73b-0e50ef54f476\', \'multiverseId\': 403491}, \'multiverseid\': 403491}, {\'name\': \'板金鎧の破壊屋\', \'text\': \'トランプル、呪禁\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「あれはエルドラージと戦うかもしれないが、仲間というわけではないよ、ギデオン。お前がよく言う団結とかには何の興味もないんだ。」――タジュールの指導者、ナジヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6978a9b-464f-4eb7-a90c-c5be2dbdebc3\', \'multiverseId\': 403790}, \'multiverseid\': 403790}, {\'name\': \'갑피 두른 파괴자\', \'text\': \'돌진, 방호\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'"엘드라지와 싸우는 데 써먹을 수 있겠군. 하지만 동료라고 착각하지는 마, 기디온. 이 녀석은 단합의 힘 따위에는 관심도 없으니깐."—타주루 지도자 나지야\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea11d8a-8f5c-4db0-a087-294b6d0113d0\', \'multiverseId\': 404089}, \'multiverseid\': 404089}, {\'name\': \'Esmagador Blindado\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, resistência a magia\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele pode enfrentar os Eldrazi, mas não o tome erroneamente por camarada, Gideon. Ele não está interessado no seu conceito de força através da união."— Najiya, líder dos Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a95a961a-cace-4b80-bb0f-764cabf20a81\', \'multiverseId\': 404388}, \'multiverseid\': 404388}, {\'name\': \'Панцирный Крушитель\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар, Порчеустойчивость\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Он дерется с Эльдрази, но не принимай его за союзника, Гидеон. Ему нет дела до твоей идеи силы в единении».— Наджия, таджурская предводительница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03dceaa8-06df-48be-9e2b-e702f492e7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 404687}, \'multiverseid\': 404687}, {\'name\': \'板甲碾破兽\', \'text\': \'践踏，辟邪\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「基定啊，它可能会对抗奥札奇，但可别把它当做同伴。它对于你众志成城的理念不感兴趣。」～特裘如领袖娜吉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ef51afb-c183-43bc-a521-ca85c4175f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 402295}, \'multiverseid\': 402295}, {\'name\': \'板甲碾破獸\', \'text\': \'踐踏，辟邪\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'「基定啊，牠可能會對抗奧札奇，但可別把牠當做同伴。牠對於你眾志成城的理念不感興趣。」～特裘如領袖娜吉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f8b7cf-2947-449b-aca9-141956aa50bb\', \'multiverseId\': 402594}, \'multiverseid\': 402594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesandte der Expedition\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Das inoffizielle Motto jedes Expeditionsgildenhauses lautet „Auf alles gefasst". Nie war dieser Satz so wahr, wie seit dem Erscheinen der Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402771&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d010afec-180f-48b0-84ec-01d35ab8b2f7\', \'multiverseId\': 402771}, \'multiverseid\': 402771}, {\'name\': \'Enviada de la expedición\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'El lema no oficial de toda expedición es "hay que estar preparado para todo", una frase cuyo significado ha cobrado aún más sentido desde la aparición de los Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e1a6128-f62b-40b6-b26f-5cbd55431aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 404864}, \'multiverseid\': 404864}, {\'name\': "Représentante d\'expédition", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Prêt à tout », la devise non-officielle des corps expéditionnaires, a pris un sens plus fort depuis l\'apparition des Eldrazi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf035d0-2de0-48b2-8f28-509e8bde5703\', \'multiverseId\': 403070}, \'multiverseid\': 403070}, {\'name\': \'Inviata della Spedizione\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Il motto ufficioso di ogni casa di spedizioni è "pronti a tutto", una frase che ha visto ampliare il proprio significato a partire dalla comparsa degli Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1824d363-b90a-4820-a6ea-5ebe074d664a\', \'multiverseId\': 403369}, \'multiverseid\': 403369}, {\'name\': \'探検隊の特使\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'どの探検隊も「何事にも準備万端」を標榜する。エルドラージが現れてからは特にそうだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d6982a-0de5-478c-bf24-00e52687a7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 403668}, \'multiverseid\': 403668}, {\'name\': \'탐사대 사절\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'모든 탐사단의 비공식적인 신조는 "모든 것에 대비하라"이다. 엘드라지가 등장한 이후 이 신조의 중요성이 더욱 강조되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55708adf-b714-482c-9f10-20dbe63e6357\', \'multiverseId\': 403967}, \'multiverseid\': 403967}, {\'name\': \'Enviada da Expedição\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'O lema não oficial de todas as casas expedicionárias é "prontos para qualquer coisa", uma expressão cujo significado foi ampliado desde o aparecimento dos Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d21cec-0503-47d7-a3a4-a371ed4b0073\', \'multiverseId\': 404266}, \'multiverseid\': 404266}, {\'name\': \'Посланница Экспедиции\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Неофициальный девиз каждого из экспедиционных домов — «Будь готов ко всему». Эта фраза стала еще актуальнее с появлением Эльдрази.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7f87fd-30b8-4dd9-8ed7-f645e9af3299\', \'multiverseId\': 404565}, \'multiverseid\': 404565}, {\'name\': \'探险队使节\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「有备无患」是每个探险队订立的非正式准则。奥札奇出现后，更加强调了这句话的重要性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e199fb9-4973-4707-9f80-f4aa3e0d3ac6\', \'multiverseId\': 402173}, \'multiverseid\': 402173}, {\'name\': \'探險隊使節\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「有備無患」是每個探險隊訂立的非正式準則。奧札奇出現後，更加強調了這句話的重要性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f323210b-fb90-464a-a778-7038510ff141\', \'multiverseId\': 402472}, \'multiverseid\': 402472}]', "[{'name': 'Gespenstischer Wachposten', 'text': 'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit', 'type': 'Kreatur — Kor, Geist', 'flavor': 'Die Mystiker der Steinzuflucht rufen die Geister gefallener Helden an, auf dass sie die Refugien verteidigen mögen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402792&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '657ebedb-6d64-4cc2-a836-6779b0787eee', 'multiverseId': 402792}, 'multiverseid': 402792}, {'name': 'Centinela fantasmal', 'text': 'Vuela, vigilancia.', 'type': 'Criatura — Espíritu kor', 'flavor': 'Los místicos de los Refugios Pedregosos invocan a los espíritus de los héroes caídos para que defiendan estas guaridas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404885&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee166725-deec-4adf-b022-145ee7b2cf5f', 'multiverseId': 404885}, 'multiverseid': 404885}, {'name': 'Sentinelle fantomale', 'text': 'Vol, vigilance', 'type': 'Créature : kor et esprit', 'flavor': 'Les mystiques des Refuges de pierre font appel aux esprits des héros tombés pour défendre les abris.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403091&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44d3834b-72f3-42e7-b8a5-943a12ffefc4', 'multiverseId': 403091}, 'multiverseid': 403091}, {'name': 'Sentinella Spettrale', 'text': 'Volare, cautela', 'type': 'Creatura — Spirito Kor', 'flavor': 'I mistici dei Rifugi Rocciosi evocano gli spiriti degli eroi caduti per difendere le loro fortezze.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403390&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e25318f5-8817-43d4-8527-7f87b4f8127c', 'multiverseId': 403390}, 'multiverseid': 403390}, {'name': '幽霊の歩哨', 'text': '飛行、警戒', 'type': 'クリーチャー — コー・スピリット', 'flavor': '石の安息所では神秘家が死んだ英雄たちの霊魂に呼びかけ、砦を守ってもらう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0d96c50-5931-44f1-a04d-959251b8c26e', 'multiverseId': 403689}, 'multiverseid': 403689}, {'name': '유령 보초', 'text': '비행, 경계', 'type': '생물 — 코르 신령', 'flavor': '바위 피난처의 신비주의자들은 죽은 영웅들을 소환하여 피난처를 방어한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403988&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f43f8222-c42d-43a1-aa1f-c9fa62af0657', 'multiverseId': 403988}, 'multiverseid': 403988}, {'name': 'Sentinela Fantasmagórica', 'text': 'Voar, vigilância', 'type': 'Criatura — Kor Espírito', 'flavor': 'Os místicos dos Refúgios de Pedra invocam os espíritos de heróis que tombaram para defender os refúgios.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404287&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea0e79ca-a4bf-4074-a932-e99b2faa7fa0', 'multiverseId': 404287}, 'multiverseid': 404287}, {'name': 'Призрачный Дозорный', 'text': 'Полет, Бдительность', 'type': 'Существо — Кор Дух', 'flavor': 'Мистики из Каменных Убежищ взывают к духам павших героев и просят защитить свои пристанища.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404586&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd95435d4-0d8b-4c12-9d54-c5b45c2d4eae', 'multiverseId': 404586}, 'multiverseid': 404586}, {'name': '魂魅哨兵', 'text': '飞行，警戒', 'type': '生物～寇族／精怪', 'flavor': '石庇所的秘教徒召集阵亡勇士的灵魂来守卫避难所。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402194&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dfbdf02-5ed1-4470-9acc-150ca60696f7', 'multiverseId': 402194}, 'multiverseid': 402194}, {'name': '魂魅哨兵', 'text': '飛行，警戒', 'type': '生物～寇族／精靈', 'flavor': '石庇所的秘教徒召集陣亡勇士的靈魂來守衛避難所。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402493&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '005f85cc-1a08-4618-98bc-a4bb621bd53b', 'multiverseId': 402493}, 'multiverseid': 402493}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geysirfeld-Schleicher\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Geysirfeld-Schleicher +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402791&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'103167ef-c448-40e9-9648-12fb7f6a529e\', \'multiverseId\': 402791}, \'multiverseid\': 402791}, {\'name\': \'Acechador del valle de géiseres\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Acechador del valle de géiseres obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'921ecbb4-7f67-4abd-8b48-4f6bca7408b3\', \'multiverseId\': 404884}, \'multiverseid\': 404884}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur du champ de geysers\', \'text\': "Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Pisteur du champ de geysers gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4a2b67-ff0e-469f-9199-b93bc2c3089f\', \'multiverseId\': 403090}, \'multiverseid\': 403090}, {\'name\': \'Inseguitore del Campo di Geyser\', \'text\': "Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, l\'Inseguitore del Campo di Geyser prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e555c4-217a-4e53-81f8-637c017327d0\', \'multiverseId\': 403389}, \'multiverseid\': 403389}, {\'name\': \'間欠泉の忍び寄り\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、間欠泉の忍び寄りは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcf4d579-e9f9-4f08-91aa-8098ece829e9\', \'multiverseId\': 403688}, \'multiverseid\': 403688}, {\'name\': \'분출지 추적자\', \'text\': \'호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 분출지 추적자는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c08693-e214-4d02-a871-c38c1c517c03\', \'multiverseId\': 403987}, \'multiverseid\': 403987}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador do Campo de Gêiseres\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Espreitador do Campo de Gêiseres recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f15d41f-9dea-4027-9072-be7e3ee981e5\', \'multiverseId\': 404286}, \'multiverseid\': 404286}, {\'name\': \'Охотник с Гейзерного Поля\', \'text\': \'Угроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Охотник с Гейзерного Поля получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2042554f-f769-4fe2-84eb-1645dc3d6820\', \'multiverseId\': 404585}, \'multiverseid\': 404585}, {\'name\': \'热泉原伏击客\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，热泉原伏击客得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106cfe0f-37a3-40dc-b1f6-67c62a15aff9\', \'multiverseId\': 402193}, \'multiverseid\': 402193}, {\'name\': \'熱泉原伏擊客\', \'text\': \'威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，熱泉原伏擊客得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5527d083-961c-43e1-9a8b-be7d7c3bdf12\', \'multiverseId\': 402492}, \'multiverseid\': 402492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gezeitentreiber\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Andere farblose Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Er war vollkommen inaktiv, aber die Bewohner von Seetor machten trotzdem einen großen Bogen um ihn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b85181-54f5-472e-915c-1e3140f5e0ef\', \'multiverseId\': 402968}, \'multiverseid\': 402968}, {\'name\': \'Errante de la marea\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Las demás criaturas incoloras que controlas obtienen +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'No sirvió de mucho, pero los residentes de Portal Marino le dejaron espacio de sobra en la bahía.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e40ce68-3d9c-4aae-89e1-6f309bb1acc7\', \'multiverseId\': 405061}, \'multiverseid\': 405061}, {\'name\': \'Dériveur du ressac\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Les autres créatures incolores que vous contrôlez gagnent +0/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Bien qu\'il semblât inoffensif, les habitants de Porte des Mers gardèrent leurs distances.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403267&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d72d83e7-9e7d-47c0-a0f5-e8b05a05d244\', \'multiverseId\': 403267}, \'multiverseid\': 403267}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondo delle Maree\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Le altre creature incolori che controlli prendono +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Non fece granché, ma gli abitanti di Portale Marino si tennero ugualmente alla larga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1927af6f-4f55-4a70-9d19-061a79119179\', \'multiverseId\': 403566}, \'multiverseid\': 403566}, {\'name\': \'波に漂うもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）あなたがコントロールする他の無色のクリーチャーは＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'それは大したことをしたわけではないが、海門の住人は誰も近寄らなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c87519-a924-4339-a975-1f3b115e3501\', \'multiverseId\': 403865}, \'multiverseid\': 403865}, {\'name\': \'물결 떠돌이\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신이 조종하는 다른 무색 생물들은 +0/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'별 소용은 없었지만, 그래도 바다 관문의 거주자들은 그 놈 가까이 가지 않았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca65ba76-8c97-4d24-921c-84017f030673\', \'multiverseId\': 404164}, \'multiverseid\': 404164}, {\'name\': \'Errante da Maré\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)As outras criaturas incolores que você controla recebem +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não fazia muita coisa, mas os habitantes do Portão Marinho mantiveram distância mesmo assim.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4b2728-b2c6-4675-a14c-c4e49e0c4973\', \'multiverseId\': 404463}, \'multiverseid\': 404463}, {\'name\': \'Скиталец Приливов\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Другие бесцветные существа под вашим контролем получают +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'В общем-то, он ничего не делал, но жители Мореграда все равно держались от него подальше.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9559c85b-e364-4393-ac06-f9c56a38926c\', \'multiverseId\': 404762}, \'multiverseid\': 404762}, {\'name\': \'潮汐漂体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）由你操控的其他无色生物得+0/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'虽然它威胁不大，但海户的居民还是和它保持距离。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7585ee24-a571-4ceb-b7c4-e1a513e2b243\', \'multiverseId\': 402370}, \'multiverseid\': 402370}, {\'name\': \'潮汐漂體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）由你操控的其他無色生物得+0/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'雖然它威脅不大，但海戶的居民還是和它保持距離。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb572ad-ac54-44f3-a079-159321cd8c72\', \'multiverseId\': 402669}, \'multiverseid\': 402669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideon, Verbündeter von Zendikar\', \'text\': \'+1: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird Gideon, Verbündeter von Zendikar, zu einer 5/5 Mensch-Soldat-Verbündeter-Kreatur mit Unzerstörbarkeit, die immer noch ein Planeswalker ist. Verhindere allen Schaden, der ihm in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.0: Bringe einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Verbündeter-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.-4: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93ef586-d4f2-4ccb-8b35-bdfb39297900\', \'multiverseId\': 402794}, \'multiverseid\': 402794}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, aliado de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'+1: Hasta el final del turno, Gideon, aliado de Zendikar se convierte en una criatura Soldado Humano Aliado 5/5 con la habilidad de indestructible que sigue siendo un planeswalker. Prevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer a él este turno.0: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Caballero Aliado blanca 2/2.-4: Obtienes un emblema con "Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb210829-b867-4c42-981d-98ff2243c18c\', \'multiverseId\': 404887}, \'multiverseid\': 404887}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, allié de Zendikar\', \'text\': "+1 : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, Gideon, allié de Zendikar devient une créature 5/5 Humain et Soldat et Allié avec l\'indestructible qui est toujours un planeswalker. Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient lui être infligées ce tour-ci.\\n0 : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier et Allié.\\n−4 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063a6ea4-c66e-4d34-ac32-ac274806e4ee\', \'multiverseId\': 403093}, \'multiverseid\': 403093}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Alleato di Zendikar\', \'text\': \'+1: Fino alla fine del turno, Gideon, Alleato di Zendikar diventa una creatura Alleato Soldato Umano 5/5 con indistruttibile che è ancora un planeswalker. Previeni tutto il danno che gli verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.0: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Alleato Cavaliere 2/2 bianca.-4: Ottieni un emblema con "Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'591dd873-c389-4d0a-a547-1d952f64833e\', \'multiverseId\': 403392}, \'multiverseid\': 403392}, {\'name\': \'ゼンディカーの同盟者、ギデオン\', \'text\': \'＋１：ターン終了時まで、ゼンディカーの同盟者、ギデオンは破壊不能を持つ５/５の人間・兵士・同盟者・クリーチャーになる。これはプレインズウォーカーでもある。このターン、これに与えられるすべてのダメージを軽減する。０：白の２/２の騎士・同盟者・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。－４：あなたは「あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — ギデオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc86eab1-032e-41b5-aae7-d2a7eaf09408\', \'multiverseId\': 403691}, \'multiverseid\': 403691}, {\'name\': \'젠디카르의 동맹 기디온\', \'text\': \'+1: 턴종료까지, 젠디카르의 동맹 기디온은 무적을 가진 5/5 인간 병사 동맹 생물이 된다. 젠디카르의 동맹 기디온은 여전히 플레인즈워커이다. 이 턴에 젠디카르의 동맹 기디온이 입으려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.0: 2/2 백색 기사 동맹 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.−4: 당신은 "당신이 조종하는 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 기디온\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'529bb08e-7996-4bf0-8dca-57703bbc8c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 403990}, \'multiverseid\': 403990}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Aliado de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'+1: Até o final do turno, Gideon, Aliado de Zendikar, torna-se uma criatura 5/5 do tipo Humano Soldado Aliado com indestrutível que ainda é um planeswalker. Previna todo o dano que seria causado a ele neste turno.0: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Cavaleiro Aliado.-4: Você recebe um emblema com "As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40804721-c2d2-406c-95a8-4e3690353203\', \'multiverseId\': 404289}, \'multiverseid\': 404289}, {\'name\': \'Гидеон, Союзник Зендикара\', \'text\': \'+1: до конца хода Гидеон, Союзник Зендикара становится существом 5/5 Человек Солдат Союзник с Неразрушимостью, которое остается planeswalker-ом. Предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены ему в этом ходу.0: положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь Союзник.−4: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Гидеон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6298e5b6-4fd9-4922-94e8-0c4027196fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 404588}, \'multiverseid\': 404588}, {\'name\': \'赞迪卡伙伴基定\', \'text\': \'+1：直到回合结束，赞迪卡伙伴基定成为5/5，具不灭异能的人类／士兵／伙伴生物，且仍然是鹏洛客。防止本回合中将对他造成的所有伤害。0：将一个2/2白色骑士／伙伴衍生生物放进战场。−4：你获得具有「由你操控的生物得+1/+1」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～基定\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952784ae-818c-47f5-bb45-881c238aac70\', \'multiverseId\': 402196}, \'multiverseid\': 402196}, {\'name\': \'贊迪卡伙伴基定\', \'text\': \'+1：直到回合結束，贊迪卡伙伴基定成為5/5，具不滅異能的人類／士兵／伙伴生物，且仍然是鵬洛客。防止本回合中將對他造成的所有傷害。0：將一個2/2白色騎士／伙伴衍生生物放進戰場。-4：你獲得具有「由你操控的生物得+1/+1」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～基定\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4fa271-f248-44ca-a5cc-ec922b2ce3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 402495}, \'multiverseid\': 402495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideons Tadel\', \'text\': \'Gideons Tadel fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Plötzlich war Gideon mitten unter uns und schlug eine Schneise, sodass wir entkommen konnten."—Die Kriegstagebücher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402795&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f18ed9-c985-451a-8201-37267cfaf0de\', \'multiverseId\': 402795}, \'multiverseid\': 402795}, {\'name\': \'Reproche de Gideon\', \'text\': \'El Reproche de Gideon hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"De pronto, Gideon estaba a nuestro lado, despejando el camino para que pudiéramos escapar".—Los diarios de guerra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2843c0a3-bbfa-491f-8d15-ecd209d883d6\', \'multiverseId\': 404888}, \'multiverseid\': 404888}, {\'name\': \'Reproche de Gideon\', \'text\': \'Le Reproche de Gideon inflige 4 blessures à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Gideon apparut soudainement parmi nous, dégageant le passage pour nous permettre de fuir. »—Les journaux de la Guerre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403094&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8caba7-6ff3-4583-b648-cfc715b15aec\', \'multiverseId\': 403094}, \'multiverseid\': 403094}, {\'name\': \'Disapprovazione di Gideon\', \'text\': \'La Disapprovazione di Gideon infligge 4 danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"All\\\'improvviso, Gideon era lì con noi, aprendoci una via di fuga."—I Diari di Guerra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'235d5a2a-ece0-4c15-99d9-fe8af349c992\', \'multiverseId\': 403393}, \'multiverseid\': 403393}, {\'name\': \'ギデオンの叱責\', \'text\': \'攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ギデオンの叱責はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「気が付くとギデオンがいて、脱出口を切り開いていた。」――戦争日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2491e45-5922-4dc6-a070-349fd54fde12\', \'multiverseId\': 403692}, \'multiverseid\': 403692}, {\'name\': \'기디온의 책망\', \'text\': \'공격생물이나 방어생물을 목표로 정한다. 기디온의 책망은 그 생물에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"순간, 기디온이 나타나 우리가 도망갈 수 있도록 길을 열어주고 있었다."—전쟁 일지\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd76ccb-6348-46a8-9b73-9913ed27b981\', \'multiverseId\': 403991}, \'multiverseid\': 403991}, {\'name\': \'Repreensão de Gideon\', \'text\': \'Repreensão de Gideon causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"De repente, Gideon estava lá conosco, abrindo caminho para que pudéssemos escapar."— Os Diários da Guerra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d65a60-2ba9-4ca9-87bb-ce4fcb4a111e\', \'multiverseId\': 404290}, \'multiverseid\': 404290}, {\'name\': \'Укор Гидеона\', \'text\': \'Укор Гидеона наносит 4 повреждения целевому атакующему или блокирующему существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Гидеон вдруг оказался среди нас, расчищая путь к отступлению».— Военные дневники\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5af2a7a-5846-4bb2-864a-e75b8d0b56d0\', \'multiverseId\': 404589}, \'multiverseid\': 404589}, {\'name\': \'基定的怒责\', \'text\': \'基定的怒责对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「蓦然间，基定现身与我们并肩作战，为我们清出逃亡之路。」～《战场札记》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282e4e9f-a83c-41fa-ba67-3760a5f8112b\', \'multiverseId\': 402197}, \'multiverseid\': 402197}, {\'name\': \'基定的怒責\', \'text\': \'基定的怒責對目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物造成4點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「驀然間，基定現身與我們並肩作戰，為我們清出逃亡之路。」～《戰場札記》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1be0f7-9fc9-4f45-9f08-a4a4d6c9c18f\', \'multiverseId\': 402496}, \'multiverseid\': 402496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Kriegsbemalung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine KreaturDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Eile.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Eldrazi scheinen wenig beeindruckt, aber wenn es den Goblins Selbstvertrauen verleiht, sollen sie sich doch Farbe ins Gesicht schmieren."—Jalun, Wachposten in Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659deaa7-cc1d-4fb9-8eb1-5cd4d2ce1800\', \'multiverseId\': 402796}, \'multiverseid\': 402796}, {\'name\': \'Pintura de guerra trasga\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.La criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede que no intimide mucho a los Eldrazi, pero si aumenta la confianza de los trasgos, no veo razón para prohibirla".—Jalun, centinela de Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dffd7ef9-26bf-4f80-b24e-b3dec6bfe5b5\', \'multiverseId\': 404889}, \'multiverseid\': 404889}, {\'name\': \'Peinture de guerre gobeline\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créatureLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Cela n\'impressionnera sans doute pas les Eldrazi, mais si cela redonne confiance aux gobelins, pourquoi s\'en priver ? »—Jalun, sentinelle d\'Affa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403095&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8841e322-84ee-42fb-acce-35a81ca6f20f\', \'multiverseId\': 403095}, \'multiverseid\': 403095}, {\'name\': \'Pittura di Guerra dei Goblin\', \'text\': \'Incanta creaturaLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Magari gli Eldrazi non si scomporranno, ma se accresce la fiducia dei goblin, non vedo motivo di dissuaderli."—Jalun, sentinella di Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0cfb27-decf-43b0-a8d2-6b89ec211c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 403394}, \'multiverseid\': 403394}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの戦化粧\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）エンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「あれを目の当たりにしてもエルドラージは怯えないだろうが、ゴブリンどもが勢いづくのならば邪魔する理由は何もない。」――アーファの歩哨、ジャルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0994f9a-ef40-4107-a051-9b1de74a9e84\', \'multiverseId\': 403693}, \'multiverseid\': 403693}, {\'name\': \'고블린 출진 물감\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 신속을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"엘드라지는 쉽게 겁먹지 않을 거야. 하지만 고블린들의 자신감을 강화한다면 그 놈들을 주눅들게 만들 수도 있어."—아파 보초병 잘런\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a9d4801-0478-4f1f-bfdf-548497c3d668\', \'multiverseId\': 403992}, \'multiverseid\': 403992}, {\'name\': \'Pintura de Guerra Goblin\', \'text\': \'Encantar criaturaA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Eldrazi podem não se intimidar, mas, se isso aumenta a autoconfiança dos goblins, não vejo motivo para desencorajá-los."— Jalun, sentinela de Affa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516b8aeb-a762-46bc-ab78-272a0a237860\', \'multiverseId\': 404291}, \'multiverseid\': 404291}, {\'name\': \'Боевая Раскраска Гоблинов\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существоЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Ускорение.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Эльдрази этим не напугать, но гоблины начинают держаться намного увереннее, так что я им не мешаю».— Джалун, стражник из Аффы\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f62ccd1b-027b-4515-9a8e-61533e8a7f98\', \'multiverseId\': 404590}, \'multiverseid\': 404590}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪战绘\', \'text\': \'结附于生物所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「奥札奇可能不会被吓到，但假若这能激起鬼怪的信心，我看也未尝不可。」～艾法哨兵佳伦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf614317-8dfa-4538-bc60-a887fd418ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 402198}, \'multiverseid\': 402198}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪戰繪\', \'text\': \'結附於生物所結附的生物得+2/+2且具有敏捷異能。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「奧札奇可能不會被嚇到，但假若這能激起鬼怪的信心，我看也未嘗不可。」～艾法哨兵佳倫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7cce932-3dcb-4d09-8556-7309b4fff217\', \'multiverseId\': 402497}, \'multiverseid\': 402497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabgeburt\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt eine Karte aus seinem Friedhof ins Exil. Du bringst einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402797&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f97dd02-4c00-4194-92b6-8b0b68ea9f22\', \'multiverseId\': 402797}, \'multiverseid\': 402797}, {\'name\': \'Eclosión sepulcral\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)El oponente objetivo exilia una carta de su cementerio. Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd82edda-5811-485a-b336-cfbad4ce049d\', \'multiverseId\': 404890}, \'multiverseid\': 404890}, {\'name\': \'Gestation de la tombe\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)L\'adversaire ciblé exile une carte depuis son cimetière. Vous mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403096&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86d3287-1295-45ff-9eef-3e6b2783c59a\', \'multiverseId\': 403096}, \'multiverseid\': 403096}, {\'name\': \'Nascita Sepolcrale\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Un avversario bersaglio esilia una carta dal suo cimitero. Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab89c06-640e-4dfe-8c85-807057c73262\', \'multiverseId\': 403395}, \'multiverseid\': 403395}, {\'name\': \'墓の出産\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地からカードを１枚追放する。あなたは無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b3f598-c999-48f3-9dfe-b057c8bb5dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 403694}, \'multiverseid\': 403694}, {\'name\': \'무덤 부화\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 자신의 무덤에서 카드 한 장을 추방한다. 당신은 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294255b1-551e-4e26-b220-00d605328380\', \'multiverseId\': 403993}, \'multiverseid\': 403993}, {\'name\': \'Nascimento Tumular\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)O oponente alvo exila um card do próprio cemitério. Você coloca no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07db90da-abb0-4adc-a954-f501a9bcc8b3\', \'multiverseId\': 404292}, \'multiverseid\': 404292}, {\'name\': \'Могильное Порождение\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Целевой оппонент изгоняет карту из своего кладбища. Вы кладете на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».Возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d59ef4-8c5c-48a9-834d-68b583257bc3\', \'multiverseId\': 404591}, \'multiverseid\': 404591}, {\'name\': \'生自墓穴\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）目标对手从其坟墓场放逐一张牌。你将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f4f899-55f2-4748-a666-ecdb0df7b025\', \'multiverseId\': 402199}, \'multiverseid\': 402199}, {\'name\': \'生自墓穴\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）目標對手從其墳墓場放逐一張牌。你將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09e569c-c014-4ecc-96c3-391a0beaf720\', \'multiverseId\': 402498}, \'multiverseid\': 402498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grausames Gemetzel\', \'text\': \'Farblose Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl Gideon zu spät in Seetor eintraf, um das Massaker zu verhindern, so kam er doch rechtzeitig, um die Überlebenden in Sicherheit zu bringen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402802&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597c675f-fd40-4c7f-a714-f24563ead280\', \'multiverseId\': 402802}, \'multiverseid\': 402802}, {\'name\': \'Masacre horripilante\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas incoloras que controlas ganan "{T}: Esta criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque Gideon llegó demasiado tarde a Portal Marino para impedir la masacre, tuvo tiempo de guiar a los supervivientes a un lugar algo más seguro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d14f5b1-0ef9-432b-af8c-9b3a5721cbc8\', \'multiverseId\': 404895}, \'multiverseid\': 404895}, {\'name\': \'Horrible massacre\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures incolores que vous contrôlez acquièrent « {T} : Cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à la créature ciblée. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Bien que Gideon soit arrivé trop tard à Porte des Mers pour empêcher le massacre, il put conduire les survivants en un lieu plus sûr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e0948a-c09d-4f57-896d-1493b51a9113\', \'multiverseId\': 403101}, \'multiverseid\': 403101}, {\'name\': \'Massacro Raccapricciante\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, le creature incolori che controlli hanno "{T}: Questa creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon raggiunse Portale Marino troppo tardi per evitare il massacro, ma ebbe comunque il tempo di condurre i superstiti in un luogo relativamente sicuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39cc93c2-b3bd-4f80-b91f-40b96ec0a36d\', \'multiverseId\': 403400}, \'multiverseid\': 403400}, {\'name\': \'陰惨な殺戮\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールする無色のクリーチャーは「{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ギデオンの海門への到着は虐殺を防ぐには手遅れだったが、それでも生き残った人々を比較的安全な場所に誘導することはできた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e399d839-b952-4605-8ff6-d6695b74d8e2\', \'multiverseId\': 403699}, \'multiverseid\': 403699}, {\'name\': \'섬뜩한 도살\', \'text\': \'턴종료까지, 당신이 조종하는 무색 생물들은 "{T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다."를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'기디온이 바다 관문에 도착했지만 그 대학살을 막기엔 너무 늦었다. 하지만 생존자들을 보다 안전한 장소로 이끌 시간은 충분했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6307cdb1-9359-480e-b9ba-310e7a634cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 403998}, \'multiverseid\': 403998}, {\'name\': \'Massacre Horrendo\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, as criaturas incolores que você controla ganham "{T}: Esta criatura causa dano igual a seu poder à criatura alvo."\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Embora Gideon tenha chegado tarde demais ao Portão Marinho para impedir o massacre, teve tempo suficiente para levar os sobreviventes para um lugar relativamente seguro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d80e09e-0c4c-4628-b3c9-91eaf939c75d\', \'multiverseId\': 404297}, \'multiverseid\': 404297}, {\'name\': \'Жестокая Резня\', \'text\': \'До конца хода бесцветные существа под вашим контролем получают способность «{T}: это существо наносит целевому существу повреждения, равные своей силе».\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Гидеон прибыл в Мореград слишком поздно и не успел остановить резню, но ему хватило времени отвести уцелевших в относительно безопасное место.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7901310e-9f1c-4e7b-9268-f1a81ae1f092\', \'multiverseId\': 404596}, \'multiverseid\': 404596}, {\'name\': \'阴森屠戮\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，由你操控的无色生物获得「{T}：此生物对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。」\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'基定赶到海户时，已来不及阻止屠杀，但他仍有时间把幸存者带到相对安全的地带。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e29810-3477-4114-8933-67988b0aca9b\', \'multiverseId\': 402204}, \'multiverseid\': 402204}, {\'name\': \'陰森屠戮\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，由你操控的無色生物獲得「{T}：此生物對目標生物造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。」\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'基定趕到海戶時，已來不及阻止屠殺，但他仍有時間把倖存者帶到相對安全的地帶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea532e1-e397-4fb5-9b21-d550ab9ccfd2\', \'multiverseId\': 402503}, \'multiverseid\': 402503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Griff der Verödung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als sich die Hand schloss, war da zuerst Todesangst, gefolgt von Taubheit, und letztendlich nur noch das Nichts.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402799&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d0f492-f766-441f-b6a0-4f8d86be76bf\', \'multiverseId\': 402799}, \'multiverseid\': 402799}, {\'name\': \'Yugo de la desolación\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Exilia la criatura objetivo y la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que la mano se cerraba, hubo terror, adormecimiento, y, por fin, la nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06d677f-06c8-4ce8-b7a0-358afae7c8e7\', \'multiverseId\': 404892}, \'multiverseid\': 404892}, {\'name\': \'Poigne de la désolation\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Exilez la créature ciblée et le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand le poing se serra, apparut d\'abord la terreur, puis la torpeur, et enfin le néant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aca91c2d-817d-45fa-a886-7878405087d7\', \'multiverseId\': 403098}, \'multiverseid\': 403098}, {\'name\': \'Morsa della Desolazione\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Esilia una creatura bersaglio e una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la mano si chiuse, prima venne il terrore, poi il torpore, infine il nulla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa7f8fb-7199-4d06-be0e-b4a5cb2ce690\', \'multiverseId\': 403397}, \'multiverseid\': 403397}, {\'name\': \'荒廃の一掴み\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）クリーチャー１体と土地１つを対象とし、それらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その手が閉じると、初めは恐怖を感じたが、すぐに何も感じなくなり、最後は無になった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2695fe1d-8ed6-489d-88fa-5b8b4af91162\', \'multiverseId\': 403696}, \'multiverseid\': 403696}, {\'name\': \'고적한 움켜쥠\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)생물과 대지를 각각 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'그 손을 움켜쥐자 처음에는 공포가, 그 다음에는 무감각이 엄습했고, 마침내는 아무것도 남지 않게 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b24e0d3-a48c-4ba7-88f2-592e5a7c8b65\', \'multiverseId\': 403995}, \'multiverseid\': 403995}, {\'name\': \'Garras da Desolação\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Exile a criatura alvo e o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a mão se fechou, a princípio houve terror, depois torpor e por fim o nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7150d6-b5f9-4d33-a4ab-b0184b97857c\', \'multiverseId\': 404294}, \'multiverseid\': 404294}, {\'name\': \'Хватка Разорения\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Изгоните целевое существо и целевую землю.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Рука сжалась, и после этого был ужас, за ним онемение, а потом — небытие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e490c322-5517-427c-bc3c-59765602d4b6\', \'multiverseId\': 404593}, \'multiverseid\': 404593}, {\'name\': \'荒芜之攫\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）放逐目标生物与目标地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'巨拳渐握，先是恐惧，进而麻痹，最后便是空无。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7805de-fb95-495b-972b-95288d287e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 402201}, \'multiverseid\': 402201}, {\'name\': \'荒蕪之攫\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）放逐目標生物與目標地。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'巨拳漸握，先是恐懼，進而麻痺，最後便是空無。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3e10ba-ed57-451d-948c-4648097daa9c\', \'multiverseId\': 402500}, \'multiverseid\': 402500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grünwächter aus Murasa\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Grünwächter aus Murasa ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.Wenn der Grünwächter aus Murasa stirbt, kannst du ihn ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c544148-fcea-4290-9906-d764c261b187\', \'multiverseId\': 402798}, \'multiverseid\': 402798}, {\'name\': \'Verdiguardián de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Verdiguardián de Murasa entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.Cuando el Verdiguardián de Murasa muera, puedes exiliarlo. Si lo haces, regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e271d965-83f6-4afb-a660-395dc70f39ea\', \'multiverseId\': 404891}, \'multiverseid\': 404891}, {\'name\': \'Gardien vert de Murasa\', \'text\': "Quand le Gardien vert de Murasa arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.Quand le Gardien vert de Murasa meurt, vous pouvez l\'exiler. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez la carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae42cd5d-c835-4355-b022-8b3167b864a9\', \'multiverseId\': 403097}, \'multiverseid\': 403097}, {\'name\': \'Custode dei Germogli di Murasa\', \'text\': \'Quando il Custode dei Germogli di Murasa entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.Quando il Custode dei Germogli di Murasa muore, puoi esiliarlo. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01acdf4-a9d4-46d0-bfc4-9cc33fdd8eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 403396}, \'multiverseid\': 403396}, {\'name\': \'ムラーサの緑守り\', \'text\': \'ムラーサの緑守りが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。ムラーサの緑守りが死亡したとき、あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはムラーサの緑守りを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03c4aadb-bd6a-45bc-982e-d9f3c405aa80\', \'multiverseId\': 403695}, \'multiverseid\': 403695}, {\'name\': \'무라사의 녹음수호자\', \'text\': \'무라사의 녹음수호자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.무라사의 녹음수호자가 죽을 때, 당신은 이 생물을 추방할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27aea7a7-ddf0-4a66-878e-7d281b270c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 403994}, \'multiverseid\': 403994}, {\'name\': \'Guardião da Flora de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Quando Guardião da Flora de Murasa entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.Quando Guardião da Flora de Murasa morre, você pode exilá-lo. Se fizer isso, devolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c68c15d-563b-445c-b19c-58280fffddc6\', \'multiverseId\': 404293}, \'multiverseid\': 404293}, {\'name\': \'Зеленый Страж Мурасы\', \'text\': \'Когда Зеленый Страж Мурасы выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.Когда Зеленый Страж Мурасы умирает, вы можете изгнать его. Если вы это делаете, верните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5d515c-9d9e-43d1-92c0-aef20cda7e26\', \'multiverseId\': 404592}, \'multiverseid\': 404592}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒育碧灵\', \'text\': \'当姆拉撒育碧灵进战场时，你可以将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。当姆拉撒育碧灵死去时，你可以将它放逐。若你如此作，则将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59cb7676-f077-45e5-a480-17b3e35ea5bd\', \'multiverseId\': 402200}, \'multiverseid\': 402200}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒育碧靈\', \'text\': \'當姆拉撒育碧靈進戰場時，你可以將目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。當姆拉撒育碧靈死去時，你可以將它放逐。若你如此作，則將目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1278c0-bb07-425d-ad06-68a8eb780359\', \'multiverseId\': 402499}, \'multiverseid\': 402499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Haindiener-Druiden\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Haindiener-Druiden oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe einen 1/1 grünen Pflanze-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Sprösslinge flehen uns an, sie auf die Eldrazi loszulassen, und wir erfüllen ihren Wunsch."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b60f014-ae82-4591-a7f2-d9a24ae0db82\', \'multiverseId\': 402801}, \'multiverseid\': 402801}, {\'name\': \'Druidas cuidarboleda\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que los Druidas cuidarboleda u otro Aliado entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Planta verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Los retoños nos suplican que los liberemos contra los Eldrazi. Debemos obedecer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bdca5dd-f203-441c-a6d8-44c09b99f919\', \'multiverseId\': 404894}, \'multiverseid\': 404894}, {\'name\': \'Druides couvebosquets\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que les Druides couvebosquets ou qu\'un autre allié arrivent sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Plante.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Les arbrisseaux nous supplient de les lâcher sur les Eldrazi, et nous serons ravis de leur rendre ce service. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c37bbe2-3170-47f6-a681-84740bfab931\', \'multiverseId\': 403100}, \'multiverseid\': 403100}, {\'name\': \'Druidi Guardaselve\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta i Druidi Guardaselve o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Pianta 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"I virgulti c\\\'implorano a gran voce di scatenarli sugli Eldrazi e noi li asseconderemo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983c0855-a9d6-4428-b546-067a47112be1\', \'multiverseId\': 403399}, \'multiverseid\': 403399}, {\'name\': \'林番のドルイド\', \'text\': \'結集 ― 林番のドルイドか他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、緑の１/１の植物・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「若木がエルドラージに向けて放たれたいと訴えている。我らはその願いに応えねばならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48da2b1a-4d31-4737-a750-7e62ef89854b\', \'multiverseId\': 403698}, \'multiverseid\': 403698}, {\'name\': \'숲 간수인 드루이드\', \'text\': \'결집 — 숲 간수인 드루이드나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {1}을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 녹색 식물 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"묘목들이 엘드라지로부터 벗어나게 해 달라고 우리에게 외친다. 우리는 기꺼이 그렇게 할 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfd3788-6e49-4e85-ab72-58f8eb35d385\', \'multiverseId\': 403997}, \'multiverseid\': 403997}, {\'name\': \'Druidas Zeladores do Bosque\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Druidas Zeladores do Bosque ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Planta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"As sementes gritam para que as soltemos em cima dos Eldrazi, e nós atenderemos ao pedido."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c010d3-036c-49db-b440-b1e8851abb9a\', \'multiverseId\': 404296}, \'multiverseid\': 404296}, {\'name\': \'Друиды-Хранители Рощи\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Друиды-Хранители Рощи или другой Союзник выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленое Растение.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Ростки кричат, требуя выпустить их в бой с Эльдрази. Мы выполним их просьбу».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acbea04c-1f17-47ff-b97f-5e9f69228980\', \'multiverseId\': 404595}, \'multiverseid\': 404595}, {\'name\': \'育林德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当育林德鲁伊或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则将一个1/1绿色植物衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「这些幼苗要我们放手让它们去攻打奥札奇，我们就如其所愿。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'057808b6-2ea4-43df-a8c8-c85643b3c7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 402203}, \'multiverseid\': 402203}, {\'name\': \'育林德魯伊\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當育林德魯伊或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，則將一個1/1綠色植物衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「這些幼苗要我們放手讓他們去攻打奧札奇，我們就如其所願。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3124435e-d8fc-4d67-bfe6-e712851122b6\', \'multiverseId\': 402502}, \'multiverseid\': 402502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hainpolterer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht TrampelschadenLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Hainpolterer +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Land wird nicht warten, bis seine Feinde eintreffen."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f23b995-a8f1-412b-b898-143b89995c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 402800}, \'multiverseid\': 402800}, {\'name\': \'Merodeador de la arboleda\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Merodeador de la arboleda obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra no esperará a que llegue el enemigo".—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5ff30b-6a35-4d52-8808-9e9cca4211bc\', \'multiverseId\': 404893}, \'multiverseid\': 404893}, {\'name\': \'Grondeur du bosquet\', \'text\': "PiétinementToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Grondeur du bosquet gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« La nature n\'attendra pas que l\'ennemi arrive. »—Nissa Revane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403099&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3306bd45-c89a-49a2-aad0-4769786159ef\', \'multiverseId\': 403099}, \'multiverseid\': 403099}, {\'name\': \'Fracassatore Boschivo\', \'text\': \'TravolgereTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Fracassatore Boschivo prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa terra non aspetterà che il nemico arrivi."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7157df7-0ad8-4465-93f8-238fab01d84b\', \'multiverseId\': 403398}, \'multiverseid\': 403398}, {\'name\': \'林の喧騒者\', \'text\': \'トランプル上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、林の喧騒者は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「土地は敵が来るのを待ちはしない。」――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444e2219-acd3-4fb5-9c02-1d261a9ee79f\', \'multiverseId\': 403697}, \'multiverseid\': 403697}, {\'name\': \'수풀 난동꾼\', \'text\': \'돌진대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 수풀 난동꾼은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"대지는 적이 도착할 때까지 기다리지 않는다."—니사 레베인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba59191-7730-4d0c-8a14-a4f161aa8d3e\', \'multiverseId\': 403996}, \'multiverseid\': 403996}, {\'name\': \'Troante do Bosque\', \'text\': \'AtropelarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Troante do Bosque recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"A terra não vai esperar que o inimigo chegue."— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d01367e6-b10a-4502-beb6-c527f0a23db5\', \'multiverseId\': 404295}, \'multiverseid\': 404295}, {\'name\': \'Громила из Рощи\', \'text\': \'Пробивной ударЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Громила из Рощи получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Земля не будет ждать, пока явятся враги».— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f39deb-6e61-4489-a76a-e351e7a9839a\', \'multiverseId\': 404594}, \'multiverseid\': 404594}, {\'name\': \'林地隆响灵\', \'text\': \'践踏地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，林地隆响灵得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「大地可不等敌人到来。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ff6c62-a15c-4d1f-809e-43eece5775a3\', \'multiverseId\': 402202}, \'multiverseid\': 402202}, {\'name\': \'林地隆響靈\', \'text\': \'踐踏地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，林地隆響靈得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「大地可不等敵人到來。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94aabd80-54af-4a5c-9336-22e21647fc08\', \'multiverseId\': 402501}, \'multiverseid\': 402501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Halimar-Gezeitenruferin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Halimar-Gezeitenruferin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte deiner Wahl mit Erwecken aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.Landkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wogen glätten? Warum sollte ich das tun wollen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402806&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c9ff5d9-08a4-4876-9667-950201144e57\', \'multiverseId\': 402806}, \'multiverseid\': 402806}, {\'name\': \'Convocamareas de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Convocamareas de Halimar entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta objetivo con la habilidad de despertar de tu cementerio a tu mano.Las criaturas tierra que controlas tienen la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Calmar las olas? ¿Por qué querría hacer eso?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800b4774-2a30-4ff5-bf90-48f03730cd09\', \'multiverseId\': 404899}, \'multiverseid\': 404899}, {\'name\': \'Meneuse de vague de Halimar\', \'text\': "Quand la Meneuse de vague de Halimar arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte avec l\'éveil ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.Les créatures-terrains que vous contrôlez ont le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Apaiser les vagues ? Pourquoi ferais-je une chose pareille ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e924c193-6e92-42c0-aec6-feb27691dbb9\', \'multiverseId\': 403105}, \'multiverseid\': 403105}, {\'name\': \'Convocamaree di Halimar\', \'text\': \'Quando la Convocamaree di Halimar entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta bersaglio con risveglio dal tuo cimitero.Le creature terra che controlli hanno volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Calmare le onde? Perché mai dovrei fare una cosa del genere?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0dd99a9-2f0d-4669-9b27-8ef87f8e5bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 403404}, \'multiverseid\': 403404}, {\'name\': \'ハリマーの潮呼び\', \'text\': \'ハリマーの潮呼びが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地から覚醒を持つカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。あなたがコントロールする土地・クリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「波を鎮めろ？どうして私がそんなことすると思うの？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43e8f8f-f8bf-404b-871c-62ed545e71c8\', \'multiverseId\': 403703}, \'multiverseid\': 403703}, {\'name\': \'할리마르 파도소환사\', \'text\': \'할리마르 파도소환사가 전장에 들어올 때, 추가로 당신의 무덤에 있는 각성을 가진 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.당신이 조종하는 대지 생물들은 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"파도를 진정시키라고? 내가 왜 그래야 하지?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada7b472-c119-48f2-b652-34b95e0244a4\', \'multiverseId\': 404002}, \'multiverseid\': 404002}, {\'name\': \'Convocadora das Marés de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Quando Convocadora das Marés de Halimar entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card alvo com despertar do seu cemitério para a sua mão.As criaturas terreno que você controla têm voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Acalmar as ondas? Por que eu faria isso?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6995d213-910c-49cd-b2b7-22a85c5ad050\', \'multiverseId\': 404301}, \'multiverseid\': 404301}, {\'name\': \'Халимарская Хозяйка Приливов\', \'text\': \'Когда Халимарская Хозяйка Приливов выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевую карту с Пробуждением из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.Земли существа под вашим контролем имеют Полет.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Унять волны? И зачем мне это делать?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d6c9f70-cce3-4594-8a6e-0665d93e4b78\', \'multiverseId\': 404600}, \'multiverseid\': 404600}, {\'name\': \'哈利玛唤潮师\', \'text\': \'当哈利玛唤潮师进战场时，你可以将目标具醒转异能的牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。由你操控的地生物具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「平息浪潮？我为什么要这么做？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1545d970-c826-4ffe-9ac0-3c32a2d7eda3\', \'multiverseId\': 402208}, \'multiverseid\': 402208}, {\'name\': \'哈利瑪喚潮師\', \'text\': \'當哈利瑪喚潮師進戰場時，你可以將目標具醒轉異能的牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。由你操控的地生物具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「平息浪潮？我為什麼要這麼做？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8ee39f6-b66d-4189-9a60-4716449deb88\', \'multiverseId\': 402507}, \'multiverseid\': 402507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Held aus Goma Fada\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn der Held aus Goma Fada oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie wollen unseren Willen brechen. Lasst uns ihnen unsere wahre Stärke zeigen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9393e322-5b14-4dae-ba8a-4108fb0c71ad\', \'multiverseId\': 402810}, \'multiverseid\': 402810}, {\'name\': \'Héroe de Goma Fada\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Héroe de Goma Fada u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Quieren acabar con nosotros. ¡Demostrémosles de lo que somos capaces!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1935206a-cc5e-43de-a566-3acbd595b479\', \'multiverseId\': 404903}, \'multiverseid\': 404903}, {\'name\': \'Héros de Goma Fada\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que le Héros de Goma Fada ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils cherchent à nous miner. Montrons-leur notre force ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffebbf9d-dae8-4f8d-9d31-7544f2cf793f\', \'multiverseId\': 403109}, \'multiverseid\': 403109}, {\'name\': \'Eroe di Goma Fada\', \'text\': "Radunare — Ogniqualvolta l\'Eroe di Goma Fada o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tentano di piegarci. Mostriamo loro la nostra forza!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee1780a-6156-40d1-a3bb-03f2807eec79\', \'multiverseId\': 403408}, \'multiverseid\': 403408}, {\'name\': \'ゴーマ・ファーダの英雄\', \'text\': \'結集 ― ゴーマ・ファーダの英雄か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「敵がやって来るぞ。我らの力を見せてやるのだ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9f238a-0aac-4dc2-8ef1-b09f5e8b1f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 403707}, \'multiverseid\': 403707}, {\'name\': \'고마 파다의 영웅\', \'text\': \'결집 — 고마 파다의 영웅이나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"그들이 우리를 파괴하려고 한다. 그들에 맞서 우리의 힘을 보여주자!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ea4f3b-da65-41e4-9ec7-eba6bccbcfed\', \'multiverseId\': 404006}, \'multiverseid\': 404006}, {\'name\': \'Herói de Goma Fada\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Herói de Goma Fada ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles querem nos abater. Vamos mostrar nossa força a eles!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad82720-4e39-4843-b1f3-3e836f3ca9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 404305}, \'multiverseid\': 404305}, {\'name\': \'Герой из Гома-Фада\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Герой из Гома-Фада или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Они хотят сломить нас. Покажем же нашу силу!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe85c0e5-faa8-4ffd-aad4-71a132ba082d\', \'multiverseId\': 404604}, \'multiverseid\': 404604}, {\'name\': \'哥马法达勇士\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当哥马法达勇士或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「它们打算击溃我们。让它们瞧瞧我们的厉害！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343bf5d8-1062-4f81-832d-d5313ee87261\', \'multiverseId\': 402212}, \'multiverseid\': 402212}, {\'name\': \'哥馬法達勇士\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當哥馬法達勇士或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／騎士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「他們打算擊潰我們。讓他們瞧瞧我們的厲害！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f4988c-af1a-4588-bdcb-7765f67b2289\', \'multiverseId\': 402511}, \'multiverseid\': 402511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herbeirufen der Brut\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Bringe zwei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Überall im Land wimmelt es von Ulamogs Abkömmlingen, die Zendikars Mana absaugen, um den riesigen Hunger des Titanen zu stillen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402733&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fad1d5-db6e-4f88-a356-5d0202c8b086\', \'multiverseId\': 402733}, \'multiverseid\': 402733}, {\'name\': \'Llamar a los vástagos\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La progenie de Ulamog se extendió por Zendikar y absorbió su maná para apaciguar el hambre insaciable del titán.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c1cae1-8ed5-4cce-9219-c68b02a8f15c\', \'multiverseId\': 404826}, \'multiverseid\': 404826}, {\'name\': \'Appel des scions\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La progéniture d\'Ulamog pullule et draine le mana de Zendikar pour apaiser la faim insatiable du titan.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403032&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b8ad0f-6abd-447b-a30f-488c811bfbd7\', \'multiverseId\': 403032}, \'multiverseid\': 403032}, {\'name\': \'Invocare i Discendenti\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La prole di Ulamog brulica sulla terra, prosciugando il mana di Zendikar per nutrire la fame insaziabile del titano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2566b18b-ac33-461f-8fe7-eb00300d741f\', \'multiverseId\': 403331}, \'multiverseid\': 403331}, {\'name\': \'末裔の呼び出し\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの子孫が大地にあふれ、巨人の飢餓を満たすためにゼンディカーのマナを貪る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a80530-29d8-42fb-be91-5ec2ae2bafb9\', \'multiverseId\': 403630}, \'multiverseid\': 403630}, {\'name\': \'자손 부르기\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'대지를 뒤덮은 울라목의 자손이 거신의 끝없는 배고픔을 채우기 위해 젠디카르의 마나를 바닥내고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d78ce3c-1d38-4690-b781-f926df0841f4\', \'multiverseId\': 403929}, \'multiverseid\': 403929}, {\'name\': \'Chamado aos Rebentos\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura incolores 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A prole de Ulamog assola a terra, drenando o mana de Zendikar para alimentar a fome insaciável do titã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a182c2-d577-4d5f-a219-c4221dc7cdce\', \'multiverseId\': 404228}, \'multiverseid\': 404228}, {\'name\': \'Созыв Отпрысков\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Они имеют способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Отпрыски Уламога заполонили землю и вытягивают из нее ману, чтобы утолить ненасытный голод титана.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e6f181-087f-4d01-ad53-593cf8ceaf5d\', \'multiverseId\': 404527}, \'multiverseid\': 404527}, {\'name\': \'召唤孽裔\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）将两个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫的后代布满大地，它们汲取赞迪卡的法术力来满足这个巨物的无尽饥渴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c18ce0a-d224-4d86-8e4e-d0ff3f88c838\', \'multiverseId\': 402135}, \'multiverseid\': 402135}, {\'name\': \'召喚孽裔\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）將兩個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它們具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫的後代布滿大地，它們汲取贊迪卡的魔法力來滿足這個巨物的無盡飢渴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c12ea96-7fe5-4284-a0e3-999558ba5c59\', \'multiverseId\': 402434}, \'multiverseid\': 402434}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelskaskaden\', \'text\': \'Die Himmelskaskaden kommen getappt ins Spiel.Wenn die Himmelskaskaden ins Spiel kommen, bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Diese Kreatur enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99296a80-c0fb-4534-a0fe-dbac511a1c05\', \'multiverseId\': 402935}, \'multiverseid\': 402935}, {\'name\': \'Cascada del horizonte\', \'text\': \'La Cascada del horizonte entra al campo de batalla girada.Cuando la Cascada del horizonte entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.{T}: Agrega {U} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ebd0a6-ac8a-4960-9314-02cc212604e0\', \'multiverseId\': 405028}, \'multiverseid\': 405028}, {\'name\': "Cascade d\'horizon", \'text\': "La Cascade d\'horizon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.Quand la Cascade d\'horizon arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.{T} : Ajoutez {U} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403234&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0bf0673-3da2-4590-84df-5d3779a22e77\', \'multiverseId\': 403234}, \'multiverseid\': 403234}, {\'name\': "Cascata dell\'Orizzonte", \'text\': "La Cascata dell\'Orizzonte entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.Quando la Cascata dell\'Orizzonte entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.{T}: Aggiungi {U} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a2d1f26-1d8f-4dca-94d0-add3c64df490\', \'multiverseId\': 403533}, \'multiverseid\': 403533}, {\'name\': \'天空の滝\', \'text\': \'天空の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。天空の滝が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32118ab2-229b-4522-96e7-cdeab20f3f52\', \'multiverseId\': 403832}, \'multiverseid\': 403832}, {\'name\': \'마천루 폭포\', \'text\': \'마천루 폭포는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.마천루 폭포가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.{T}: 당신의 마나풀에 {U}를 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'718f71e4-7bd2-4e64-8d10-bd12b27c6482\', \'multiverseId\': 404131}, \'multiverseid\': 404131}, {\'name\': \'Cascata Celeste\', \'text\': \'Cascata Celeste entra no campo de batalha virada.Quando Cascata Celeste entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla não é desvirada durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.{T}: Adicione {U} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8032327a-b022-4055-9d78-8063c5475f57\', \'multiverseId\': 404430}, \'multiverseid\': 404430}, {\'name\': \'Небесный Каскад\', \'text\': \'Небесный Каскад выходит на поле битвы повернутым.Когда Небесный Каскад выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо под контролем оппонента не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.{T}: добавьте {U} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ccfa99-dcef-4998-b182-885307108769\', \'multiverseId\': 404729}, \'multiverseid\': 404729}, {\'name\': \'天际瀑布\', \'text\': \'天际瀑布须横置进战场。当天际瀑布进战场时，目标由对手操控的生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。{T}：加{U}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de758d9e-81cd-47ad-ab67-8eec03d073f6\', \'multiverseId\': 402337}, \'multiverseid\': 402337}, {\'name\': \'天際瀑布\', \'text\': \'天際瀑布須橫置進戰場。當天際瀑布進戰場時，目標由對手操控的生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。{T}：加{U}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c06e2df-b176-42a3-8cb0-7c0d1616f789\', \'multiverseId\': 402636}, \'multiverseid\': 402636}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelsreiter-Elfin\', \'text\': \'FliegendKonvergenz — Die Himmelsreiter-Elfin kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel für jede unterschiedliche Farbe von Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Es mag ungewöhnlich scheinen, aber in einem Sturm ist mir jedes Reittier recht, das nicht vor Blitzen scheut."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'863d386a-3a78-47c5-8eab-0d59449f277b\', \'multiverseId\': 402936}, \'multiverseid\': 402936}, {\'name\': \'Elfa jinete celeste\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Converger — La Elfa jinete celeste entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella por cada color de maná usado para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Será poco convencional, pero toda montura estable es válida en una tormenta".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da01758-b581-49a1-80b4-12db2e1fa11e\', \'multiverseId\': 405029}, \'multiverseid\': 405029}, {\'name\': \'Cavalière céleste elfe\', \'text\': \'VolConvergence — La Cavalière céleste elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque couleur de mana dépensé pour la lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est peut-être surprenant, mais je conduirai n\'importe quelle monture fiable dans un orage. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a5b016-c884-4384-b9f9-828712bfb07a\', \'multiverseId\': 403235}, \'multiverseid\': 403235}, {\'name\': \'Elfa Cavalcacielo\', \'text\': "VolareConvergenza — L\'Elfa Cavalcacielo entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni colore di mana speso per lanciarla.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Forse è poco convenzionale, ma in una tempesta mi affido a qualsiasi cavalcatura che sia salda."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0829e2c3-268c-4326-8c97-8d55b3ea616f\', \'multiverseId\': 403534}, \'multiverseid\': 403534}, {\'name\': \'空乗りのエルフ\', \'text\': \'飛行収斂 ― 空乗りのエルフは、これを唱えるために支払われたマナの色１色につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「これは型破りかもしれないが、嵐の中でも騎乗できるなら何でも使うさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f73eb1-8a99-48bb-ac8f-dae996e6c478\', \'multiverseId\': 403833}, \'multiverseid\': 403833}, {\'name\': \'하늘기수 엘프\', \'text\': \'비행화합 — 하늘기수 엘프는 발동 비용으로 지불한 마나의 각 색마다 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"다소 이상하게 들리겠지만, 나는 폭풍 속에서도 고요하게 비행하지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaaf98e9-acf6-4f56-a89d-919e3a3a51a0\', \'multiverseId\': 404132}, \'multiverseid\': 404132}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Cavaleiro Celeste\', \'text\': \'VoarConvergir — Elfo Cavaleiro Celeste entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada cor de mana gasto para conjurá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Pode não ser convencional, mas eu aceito qualquer montaria estável em uma tempestade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0e293d-a7d0-490a-be45-adbbad3cebbb\', \'multiverseId\': 404431}, \'multiverseid\': 404431}, {\'name\': \'Эльфийский Небесный Всадник\', \'text\': \'ПолетСхождение — Эльфийский Небесный Всадник выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 за каждый цвет маны, потраченной на его разыгрывание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Зверь непривычный, но во время бури я рада любому надежному скакуну».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703d70d2-0353-41e8-966f-9fc6767569c2\', \'multiverseId\': 404730}, \'multiverseid\': 404730}, {\'name\': \'驭空妖精\', \'text\': \'飞行聚辉～驭空妖精进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为施放它时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然有点不同寻常，但能在风暴中飞得稳的坐骑我都不嫌弃。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f691530-2e0c-4c92-b3dd-a21bbb85fd5f\', \'multiverseId\': 402338}, \'multiverseid\': 402338}, {\'name\': \'馭空妖精\', \'text\': \'飛行聚輝～馭空妖精進戰場時上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量為施放它時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「雖然有點不同尋常，但能在風暴中飛得穩的坐騎我都不嫌棄。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cdca4d9-d3c3-4424-9c89-e9d4dde9b5d4\', \'multiverseId\': 402637}, \'multiverseid\': 402637}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlischer Hauptmann\', \'text\': \'FliegendImmer wenn der Himmlische Hauptmann angreift, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 für jeden anderen angreifenden Verbündeten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Soldaten unter ihr ein Kampflied anstimmten, breitete sie ihre Schwingen aus, die den ganzen Himmel zu verdecken schienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402708&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7f341c0-4a93-4dab-b511-1f059c054432\', \'multiverseId\': 402708}, \'multiverseid\': 402708}, {\'name\': \'Capitana angelical\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Siempre que la Capitana angelical ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada otro Aliado atacante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Los soldados bajo su protección alzaron la voz; entonces el ángel desplegó las alas y su envergadura pareció abarcar el cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97e6fc3-6e4e-4e6a-8960-7f46da01b90b\', \'multiverseId\': 404801}, \'multiverseid\': 404801}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine angélique\', \'text\': "VolÀ chaque fois que la Capitaine angélique attaque, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque autre allié attaquant.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et allié\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que montaient les clameurs des soldats, l\'ange déploya ses ailes. Leur envergure sembla couvrir le ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403007&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8056b1c6-c9fc-4b43-8310-189ec61d002a\', \'multiverseId\': 403007}, \'multiverseid\': 403007}, {\'name\': \'Capitano Angelico\', \'text\': \'VolareOgniqualvolta il Capitano Angelico attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni altro Alleato attaccante.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Angelo\', \'flavor\': "Quando i soldati sotto di lei levarono le loro voci, l\'angelo spiegò le sue ali e la loro apertura pareva abbracciare il cielo intero.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28259d82-7050-4fe8-b617-a0d6d099bf87\', \'multiverseId\': 403306}, \'multiverseid\': 403306}, {\'name\': \'天使の隊長\', \'text\': \'飛行天使の隊長が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは他の攻撃している同盟者１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'天使の下にいる兵士達が声を上げると彼女は翼を大きく広げた。それはあたかも全天を覆うようだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e605243-895b-4964-85c0-c2d6442c111f\', \'multiverseId\': 403605}, \'multiverseid\': 403605}, {\'name\': \'천사 대장\', \'text\': \'비행천사 대장이 공격할 때마다, 천사 대장은 공격하는 다른 동맹의 수만큼 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'아래의 병사들이 함성을 외치자 그 천사는 날개를 활짝 폈다. 그 날개가 마치 하늘을 온통 덮는 듯 보였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efec75e3-2c81-4fe3-b81c-1727c3fabd75\', \'multiverseId\': 403904}, \'multiverseid\': 403904}, {\'name\': \'Capitã Angelical\', \'text\': \'VoarToda vez que Capitã Angelical ataca, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada outro Aliado atacante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Quando as vozes dos soldados abaixo se alçaram, o anjo abriu as asas, sua envergadura parecendo encobrir o céu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615d9f28-f301-4d29-ab8b-6ea7e2b9742f\', \'multiverseId\': 404203}, \'multiverseid\': 404203}, {\'name\': \'Ангел-Капитан\', \'text\': \'ПолетКаждый раз, когда Ангел-Капитан атакует, он получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждого другого атакующего Союзника.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Солдаты внизу закричали, и ангел раскинул крылья, словно заслонив ими все небо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdecbb4-67a9-46fa-a83c-ca23a384938a\', \'multiverseId\': 404502}, \'multiverseid\': 404502}, {\'name\': \'天使队长\', \'text\': \'飞行每当天使队长攻击时，每有一个进行攻击的其他伙伴，它便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'随着身下将士呼号渐起，天使伸展六翼正欲振翅高飞，万里长空几被飞羽全数遮挡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df910eb-197f-41f7-ab55-d17147541626\', \'multiverseId\': 402110}, \'multiverseid\': 402110}, {\'name\': \'天使隊長\', \'text\': \'飛行每當天使隊長攻擊時，每有一個進行攻擊的其他伙伴，它便得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'隨著身下將士呼號漸起，天使伸展六翼正欲振翅高飛，萬里長空幾被飛羽全數遮擋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6284fe63-3e8a-4b5d-b056-6356b1af530c\', \'multiverseId\': 402409}, \'multiverseid\': 402409}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlisches Geschenk\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine KreaturWenn das Himmlische Geschenk ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.Die verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Heute wird Zendikar triumphieren und unsere Armeen werden mit Engeln fliegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f2b548b-743a-4ff5-90f9-3871b689e745\', \'multiverseId\': 402709}, \'multiverseid\': 402709}, {\'name\': \'Don angelical\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.Cuando el Don angelical entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.La criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoy Zendikar triunfará, y nuestros ejércitos volarán junto a los ángeles".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6feddd63-fd4c-4d12-9121-4184bc9102a6\', \'multiverseId\': 404802}, \'multiverseid\': 404802}, {\'name\': \'Don angélique\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créatureQuand le Don angélique arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.La créature enchantée a le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce jour verra la victoire de Zendikar, et nos armées voleront avec les anges. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403008&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8242352-d5bd-4ba4-8353-40f32d5caa7b\', \'multiverseId\': 403008}, \'multiverseid\': 403008}, {\'name\': \'Dono Angelico\', \'text\': \'Incanta creaturaQuando il Dono Angelico entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.La creatura incantata ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar oggi trionferà e i nostri eserciti voleranno con gli angeli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ee928b-fb89-4e3d-b1e1-b7519226aa00\', \'multiverseId\': 403307}, \'multiverseid\': 403307}, {\'name\': \'天使の贈り物\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）天使の贈り物が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。エンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「ついにゼンディカーに勝利が訪れ、我が軍は天使と共に空を舞うであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f60fac4-0d06-4f11-bf45-b89bf0985e9f\', \'multiverseId\': 403606}, \'multiverseid\': 403606}, {\'name\': \'천사의 선물\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여천사의 선물이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.부여된 생물은 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르가 승리한 후 우리 군대는 천사와 함께 하늘을 비행할 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4a5a322-5f12-4349-9976-86ea58cc57bd\', \'multiverseId\': 403905}, \'multiverseid\': 403905}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva Angelical\', \'text\': \'Encantar criaturaQuando Dádiva Angelical entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.A criatura encantada tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar triunfará hoje, e os nossos exércitos voarão com os anjos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2b17017-54ae-4121-b5da-bed265e19aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 404204}, \'multiverseid\': 404204}, {\'name\': \'Ангельский Дар\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существоКогда Ангельский Дар выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.Зачарованное существо имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Сегодня Зендикар одержит победу, и наши армии воспарят вместе с ангелами».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d04127-a549-43f9-92e9-c04b3488efbe\', \'multiverseId\': 404503}, \'multiverseid\': 404503}, {\'name\': \'天使赋礼\', \'text\': \'结附于生物当天使赋礼进战场时，抓一张牌。所结附的生物具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「赞迪卡今日必得胜，全军与天使共翱翔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4146918-697b-4436-8e20-816dc47ee93b\', \'multiverseId\': 402111}, \'multiverseid\': 402111}, {\'name\': \'天使賦禮\', \'text\': \'結附於生物當天使賦禮進戰場時，抽一張牌。所結附的生物具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「贊迪卡今日必得勝，全軍與天使共翱翔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7841f9-5379-49ab-9e27-5e0d4c1fde22\', \'multiverseId\': 402410}, \'multiverseid\': 402410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hirnraspler\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Hirnraspler ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers legen. Falls du dies tust, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'Er verzehrt jeden Traum vom Sieg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64c696c-e27b-4ecb-87c5-643de053f308\', \'multiverseId\': 402845}, \'multiverseid\': 402845}, {\'name\': \'Hurgamentes\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Hurgamentes entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador sea propietario. Si lo haces, cada oponente descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Devora cualquier sueño de victoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac301a66-a9f6-4276-a534-c2729c6b679b\', \'multiverseId\': 404938}, \'multiverseid\': 404938}, {\'name\': "Ratisseur d\'esprit", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Ratisseur d\'esprit arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': \'Il consume tout rêve de victoire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403144&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c1aec2-2c84-4862-86c9-d51095894524\', \'multiverseId\': 403144}, \'multiverseid\': 403144}, {\'name\': \'Squartapensieri\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando lo Squartapensieri entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore. Se lo fai, ogni avversario scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Consuma qualsiasi sogno di vittoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0d895c-9133-434e-9587-e648d3629fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 403443}, \'multiverseid\': 403443}, {\'name\': \'精神を掻き寄せるもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）精神を掻き寄せるものが戦場に出たとき、あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'こいつは勝利の夢を喰らうんだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a229a5b-b3ad-4c29-8fe2-3acf97771ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 403742}, \'multiverseid\': 403742}, {\'name\': \'정신 수집꾼\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)정신 수집꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': \'그 놈은 승리에 대한 희망을 모조리 빼앗아 간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4394cedb-ff4c-40b5-9c4f-55326ec4a319\', \'multiverseId\': 404041}, \'multiverseid\': 404041}, {\'name\': \'Purgador de Mentes\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Purgador de Mentes entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele. Se fizer isso, cada oponente descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': \'Ele consome quaisquer sonhos de vitória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2fe02f8-9418-4ff2-8625-c39fbbf8d8bb\', \'multiverseId\': 404340}, \'multiverseid\': 404340}, {\'name\': \'Чистильщик Разума\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Чистильщик Разума выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока. Если вы это делаете, каждый оппонент сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': \'Он пожирает даже мечты о победе.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664f1bb1-935f-4952-be69-5ed05b824421\', \'multiverseId\': 404639}, \'multiverseid\': 404639}, {\'name\': \'掠灵恶体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当掠灵恶体进战场时，你可以将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场。若你如此作，则每位对手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'它吞噬所有胜利的梦想。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d700363e-173c-4c16-a63b-da1699034aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 402247}, \'multiverseid\': 402247}, {\'name\': \'掠靈惡體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當掠靈惡體進戰場時，你可以將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場。若你如此作，則每位對手各棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': \'它吞噬所有勝利的夢想。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfffbdcf-0728-4a67-a626-89c38de9b203\', \'multiverseId\': 402546}, \'multiverseid\': 402546}]', '[{\'name\': \'In alle Winde verwehen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.Erwecken 3 — {4}{U}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {4}{U}{U} wirkst, lege außerdem drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3f2c39-02c4-4224-8c81-e6c3db9ecb82\', \'multiverseId\': 402921}, \'multiverseid\': 402921}, {\'name\': \'Arrojar al viento\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.Despertar 3—{4}{U}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {4}{U}{U}, pon además tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e8b1f7-1806-4969-926a-a7c52f7e1e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 405014}, \'multiverseid\': 405014}, {\'name\': \'Disperser aux quatre vents\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.Éveil 3 — {4}{U}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {4}{U}{U}, mettez aussi trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a9b40c-335a-4349-9e8f-7edc9d546fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 403220}, \'multiverseid\': 403220}, {\'name\': \'Spargere ai Venti\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.Risveglio 3—{4}{U}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per {4}{U}{U}, metti anche tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ef5fd2-2e9d-4e8a-af5c-91df7af35c65\', \'multiverseId\': 403519}, \'multiverseid\': 403519}, {\'name\': \'風への散乱\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。覚醒３―{4}{U}{U}（この呪文を{4}{U}{U}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e852b1ba-8dea-4297-8900-eb8179ad0be1\', \'multiverseId\': 403818}, \'multiverseid\': 403818}, {\'name\': \'바람으로 흩날리다\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.각성 3—{4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81404dd9-09da-432f-a794-327298c40e50\', \'multiverseId\': 404117}, \'multiverseid\': 404117}, {\'name\': \'Espalhar ao Vento\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.Despertar 3 — {4}{U}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {4}{U}{U}, coloque também três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bfa4231-0bdc-4321-9832-cb243dd11713\', \'multiverseId\': 404416}, \'multiverseid\': 404416}, {\'name\': \'Развеять по Ветру\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.Пробуждение 3 — {4}{U}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {4}{U}{U}, также положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2acc5be5-5396-4cc4-9080-a6e06b6d1ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 404715}, \'multiverseid\': 404715}, {\'name\': \'散入风中\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。醒转3～{4}{U}{U}（如果你支付{4}{U}{U}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d590c0-d847-404d-a984-e201feff9094\', \'multiverseId\': 402323}, \'multiverseid\': 402323}, {\'name\': \'散入風中\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。醒轉3～{4}{U}{U}（如果你支付{4}{U}{U}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f42ebd3e-d5d4-4a36-b633-5ae7e9862aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 402622}, \'multiverseid\': 402622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierter Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Für die verlorenen Länder und die gebliebene Schönheit, für die Freiheit und die Zukunft müssen wir alles geben!"—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402814&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70fc4118-a1d2-4c4c-baaa-d88d26a34bed\', \'multiverseId\': 402814}, \'multiverseid\': 402814}, {\'name\': \'Carga inspirada\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Por las tierras perdidas, por la belleza que queda, por la libertad y por el futuro, ¡luchemos hasta la victoria!".—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8738bdc0-80be-48de-8429-3264cf915866\', \'multiverseId\': 404907}, \'multiverseid\': 404907}, {\'name\': \'Charge inspirée\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Pour les terres que vous avez perdues et la beauté qui survit, pour la liberté et l\'avenir, nous devons tout donner ! »—Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b4d96f7-c9ac-459d-af57-4cc39397240d\', \'multiverseId\': 403113}, \'multiverseid\': 403113}, {\'name\': \'Carica Ispirata\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per le terre che avete perso e la bellezza che rimane, per la libertà e il futuro, dobbiamo dare tutto quello che abbiamo!"—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5349f29b-a730-46a2-993a-be408d8550f3\', \'multiverseId\': 403412}, \'multiverseid\': 403412}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する突撃\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「失った土地、残された美、そして自由と未来のために、一歩たりとも引き下がるな！」――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47bf5272-96a5-4cc1-b561-961ae67cbcd1\', \'multiverseId\': 403711}, \'multiverseid\': 403711}, {\'name\': \'영감을 얻은 돌진\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"잃어 버린 대지와 남아 있는 아름다움을 위해, 자유와 미래를 위해 절대 물러 서지 않겠다!"—기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8761c5e-35fa-4a83-8cdc-72af0fcfd2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 404010}, \'multiverseid\': 404010}, {\'name\': \'Ataque Inspirado\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pelas terras que vocês perderam e pela beleza que resta, pela liberdade e pelo futuro, precisamos dar tudo de nós!"— Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ea6d9c-02e4-4297-b85b-66a25feb0986\', \'multiverseId\': 404309}, \'multiverseid\': 404309}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновенный Натиск\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«За потерянные вами земли и за оставшуюся в мире красоту! За свободу и за будущее! Вперед, и не жалейте сил!»— Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2467639-abd2-44b5-94a5-d7f159978070\', \'multiverseId\': 404608}, \'multiverseid\': 404608}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞冲锋\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「为了失去的土地和残存的美景，为了自由和未来，全力出击！」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e096793-507e-4520-a68c-bdf97be124bc\', \'multiverseId\': 402216}, \'multiverseid\': 402216}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞衝鋒\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「為了失去的土地和殘存的美景，為了自由和未來，全力出擊！」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1d7d27-8e33-4553-b38b-6c4464a0840b\', \'multiverseId\': 402515}, \'multiverseid\': 402515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Irdene Waffen\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.Erwecken 4 — {6}{G} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {6}{G} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402763&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45598aa9-e20c-4e2f-9ebc-a2f86095ff13\', \'multiverseId\': 402763}, \'multiverseid\': 402763}, {\'name\': \'Brazos pétreos\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el permanente objetivo.Despertar 4—{6}{G}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {6}{G}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7d2581-7a0f-4130-baf3-b1c52c158bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 404856}, \'multiverseid\': 404856}, {\'name\': \'Bras de terre\', \'text\': "Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur le permanent ciblé.Éveil 4 — {6}{G} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {6}{G}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ae8c478-9b29-4ef6-be17-d0a5f92e76e7\', \'multiverseId\': 403062}, \'multiverseid\': 403062}, {\'name\': \'Braccia di Pietra\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un permanente bersaglio.Risveglio 4—{6}{G} (Se lanci questa magia per {6}{G}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b6a449-d5e3-40ac-b0e1-ad9e8ae2bef2\', \'multiverseId\': 403361}, \'multiverseid\': 403361}, {\'name\': \'大地の武装\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。覚醒４―{6}{G}（この呪文を{6}{G}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf16022d-8e2c-4762-8fef-fd767c4b8e54\', \'multiverseId\': 403660}, \'multiverseid\': 403660}, {\'name\': \'대지의 무기\', \'text\': \'지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.각성 4—{6}{G} ({6}{G}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dddf65-cc36-409b-a1ad-2145cc42b439\', \'multiverseId\': 403959}, \'multiverseid\': 403959}, {\'name\': \'Armas Terrenas\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na permanente alvo.Despertar 4 — {6}{G} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {6}{G}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b907465-c282-4731-a09a-2331339c6fc6\', \'multiverseId\': 404258}, \'multiverseid\': 404258}, {\'name\': \'Земляные Руки\', \'text\': \'Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевой перманент.Пробуждение 4 — {6}{G} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {6}{G}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b370491d-9d82-4436-bbf4-b211eaa6ecbf\', \'multiverseId\': 404557}, \'multiverseid\': 404557}, {\'name\': \'土石武装\', \'text\': \'在目标永久物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。醒转4～{6}{G}（如果你支付{6}{G}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13911de6-dff9-4e6c-9c1e-51093f704058\', \'multiverseId\': 402165}, \'multiverseid\': 402165}, {\'name\': \'土石武裝\', \'text\': \'在目標永久物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。醒轉4～{6}{G}（如果你支付{6}{G}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05c47231-1d1c-48b7-b69f-9500f8769914\', \'multiverseId\': 402464}, \'multiverseid\': 402464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jaddiholz-Ableger\', \'text\': \'VerteidigerLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze\', \'flavor\': \'In Murasa wachsen selbst auf Bäumen Bäume.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c40c71c-73a6-4853-baf5-69c17ccb85fa\', \'multiverseId\': 402825}, \'multiverseid\': 402825}, {\'name\': \'Brote jaddi\', \'text\': \'Defensor.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta\', \'flavor\': \'En Murasa, hasta a los árboles les crecen árboles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b35b04fc-2c10-49b0-9f93-92614adb30bc\', \'multiverseId\': 404918}, \'multiverseid\': 404918}, {\'name\': \'Rejeton jaddi\', \'text\': "DéfenseurToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante\', \'flavor\': \'À Murasa, les arbres poussent même sur les arbres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8a8a15-68ce-4320-90f4-b10cce7a9783\', \'multiverseId\': 403124}, \'multiverseid\': 403124}, {\'name\': \'Ramificazione di Jaddi\', \'text\': \'DifensoreTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pianta\', \'flavor\': \'A Murasa, gli alberi crescono anche sugli alberi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ee7c7e-3cd8-497f-be00-451e4822dd49\', \'multiverseId\': 403423}, \'multiverseid\': 403423}, {\'name\': \'ジャディの横枝\', \'text\': \'防衛上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサでは、木々も木々を育む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9854031-1857-4855-849e-65653f42b769\', \'multiverseId\': 403722}, \'multiverseid\': 403722}, {\'name\': \'자디 곁가지\', \'text\': \'수비태세대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 식물\', \'flavor\': \'무라사에서는 나무들도 나무를 키운다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1a48a6-23b1-4827-9cea-289378ce72b2\', \'multiverseId\': 404021}, \'multiverseid\': 404021}, {\'name\': \'Ramificação de Jaddi\', \'text\': \'DefensorAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta\', \'flavor\': \'Em Murasa, até nas árvores crescem árvores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7583dc-dd9e-4c36-8373-19076d4992cb\', \'multiverseId\': 404320}, \'multiverseid\': 404320}, {\'name\': \'Потомок Джадди\', \'text\': \'ЗащитникЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Растение\', \'flavor\': \'В Мурасе даже на деревьях растут деревья.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b1acf8-23a1-4f3c-957a-0f4c301dda89\', \'multiverseId\': 404619}, \'multiverseid\': 404619}, {\'name\': \'贾笛旁枝灵\', \'text\': \'守军地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～植物\', \'flavor\': \'在姆拉撒，就连树也能生出树来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeba6972-a17c-4e29-b005-5d24f57f7110\', \'multiverseId\': 402227}, \'multiverseid\': 402227}, {\'name\': \'賈笛旁枝靈\', \'text\': \'守軍地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～植物\', \'flavor\': \'在姆拉撒，就連樹也能生出樹來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87142b0d-ee55-450e-bf03-a1e3234b29fb\', \'multiverseId\': 402526}, \'multiverseid\': 402526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kalastria-Heiler\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn der Kalastria-Heiler oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Wieder und wieder habe ich mein Können als Heiler demonstriert. Warum also bist du so beunruhigt?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f870ff5b-bed8-4514-8147-c01045a85822\', \'multiverseId\': 402826}, \'multiverseid\': 402826}, {\'name\': \'Sanador de Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Sanador de Kalastria u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"He demostrado mis habilidades curativas en incontables ocasiones. ¿Por qué estás tan nervioso?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bc2bd13-0012-421e-9f24-d17b8f39a26f\', \'multiverseId\': 404919}, \'multiverseid\': 404919}, {\'name\': \'Guérisseur des Kalastria\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que le Guérisseur des Kalastria ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et clerc et allié\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai maintes fois prouvé mes talents de guérisseur. Alors pourquoi êtes-vous si mal à l\'aise ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c0c7049-0efe-4388-8938-1ebc78686d99\', \'multiverseId\': 403125}, \'multiverseid\': 403125}, {\'name\': \'Guaritore di Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta il Guaritore di Kalastria o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Chierico Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho più volte dimostrato il mio talento come guaritore. Perché, dunque, sei così a disagio?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52657e03-40e5-459b-8c17-235c7bfb6be7\', \'multiverseId\': 403424}, \'multiverseid\': 403424}, {\'name\': \'カラストリアの癒し手\', \'text\': \'結集 ― カラストリアの癒し手か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「何回も癒しの能力を使っているが、どうしてお前らは、そう簡単に重症を負うんだ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56e2cc78-4028-48bc-a717-e63df3c77562\', \'multiverseId\': 403723}, \'multiverseid\': 403723}, {\'name\': \'칼라스트리아 치유사\', \'text\': \'결집 — 칼라스트리아 치유사나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 성직자 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"난 치유사로서 내 능력을 계속해서 입증해 왔네. 그런데 자넨 왜 이렇게 안절부절 못하는 거지?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228fbeb0-6e5b-4b5f-9288-f67fb23295c3\', \'multiverseId\': 404022}, \'multiverseid\': 404022}, {\'name\': \'Curandeiro Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Curandeiro Kalastria ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Clérigo Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Repetidas vezes demonstrei minha habilidade como curandeiro. Por que, então, você está tão tenso?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9ffaff-4b1d-4288-bfa3-71fb5d117786\', \'multiverseId\': 404321}, \'multiverseid\': 404321}, {\'name\': \'Целитель из Рода Каластрия\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Целитель из Рода Каластрия или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Священник Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Я множество раз демонстрировал свое мастерство целителя. Отчего же вам так не по себе?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4101399a-bc08-409f-b420-2a7167f26732\', \'multiverseId\': 404620}, \'multiverseid\': 404620}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇治疗师\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当卡列奇治疗师或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／僧侣／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我一次又一次展现了治疗师的本领。既然如此，你有什么好不自在的？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e21a7f-be5d-412c-a2a6-bda365481561\', \'multiverseId\': 402228}, \'multiverseid\': 402228}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇治療師\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當卡列奇治療師或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／僧侶／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我一次又一次展現了治療師的本領。既然如此，你有什麼好不自在的？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687b1695-34e9-4e4e-90db-1782f275c222\', \'multiverseId\': 402527}, \'multiverseid\': 402527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kalastria-Nachtwache\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält die Kalastria-Nachtwache Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Kalitas mag in die Knechtschaft der Eldrazi zurückgekehrt sein, aber wir sagen ‚Nie wieder!\\\'"—Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402827&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39bbb500-d262-4344-9120-01eb8bb1d922\', \'multiverseId\': 402827}, \'multiverseid\': 402827}, {\'name\': \'Guardia nocturna de Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, la Guardia nocturna de Kalastria gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede que Kalitas haya regresado a su servidumbre insensata bajo el yugo de los Eldrazi, pero nosotros decimos: nunca jamás".—Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74eff65c-d95f-411f-a37e-0c02aaf2c69a\', \'multiverseId\': 404920}, \'multiverseid\': 404920}, {\'name\': \'Garde de nuit des Kalastria\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, la Garde de nuit des Kalastria acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Kalitas est peut-être redevenu un esclave stupide au service des Eldrazi, mais nous ne voulons plus jamais ça. »—Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582ab796-a300-4629-9bd7-583780f422bf\', \'multiverseId\': 403126}, \'multiverseid\': 403126}, {\'name\': \'Guardia Notturna di Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, la Guardia Notturna di Kalastria ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Kalitas sarà anche tornato all\\\'incosciente schiavitù sotto gli Eldrazi, ma noi diciamo: mai più."—Drana, capo sanguinario Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d62dd8f-c73b-4737-a376-6924c356beaf\', \'multiverseId\': 403425}, \'multiverseid\': 403425}, {\'name\': \'カラストリアの夜警\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、カラストリアの夜警は飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「カリタスはエルドラージの操り人形に成り果てたが、そのようなことは二度とさせぬ。」――カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0442517c-0319-47b0-948d-528585c5ee9a\', \'multiverseId\': 403724}, \'multiverseid\': 403724}, {\'name\': \'칼라스트리아 야간감시자\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 칼라스트리아 야간감시자는 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"칼리타스가 엘드라지 밑으로 다시 들어갔을 수도 있다. 하지만 두 번 다시 그런 일은 없을 것이다."—칼라스트리아의 혈족장 드라나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'763944a5-18ce-404a-abd9-6b19761bfe74\', \'multiverseId\': 404023}, \'multiverseid\': 404023}, {\'name\': \'Vigias Noturnos Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, Vigias Noturnos Kalastria ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Kalitas pode ter voltado à servidão mentecapta aos Eldrazi, mas nós não retornaremos jamais."— Drana, grã-vampira Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ab5b7a-92e1-42b7-84d4-38a6a0641603\', \'multiverseId\': 404322}, \'multiverseid\': 404322}, {\'name\': \'Ночной Дозор Каластриев\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, Ночной Дозор Каластриев получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Калитас вновь стал бездумным рабом Эльдрази. Пусть! Мы больше не покоримся».— Драна, кровавый вождь Каластриев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae5bc13-7c69-4659-ad23-a688334ad9bf\', \'multiverseId\': 404621}, \'multiverseid\': 404621}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇夜巡卫\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，卡列奇夜巡卫获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「卡力塔或已成为奥札奇手下毫无思想的奴隶，但我们不会让这类事情再次发生。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69a0bfd-c945-483a-a9e5-c51270ad9c19\', \'multiverseId\': 402229}, \'multiverseid\': 402229}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇夜巡衛\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，卡列奇夜巡衛獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「卡力塔或已成為奧札奇手下毫無思想的奴隸，但我們不會讓這類事情再次發生。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95602e5-e86c-4865-8bc5-d1eee496fe49\', \'multiverseId\': 402528}, \'multiverseid\': 402528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Katakomben-Durchkämmer\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Katakomben-Durchkämmer ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402736&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c69be272-ed8b-4f9e-8e6e-2cf9f8a2680a\', \'multiverseId\': 402736}, \'multiverseid\': 402736}, {\'name\': \'Cernedor de catacumbas\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Cernedor de catacumbas entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".Siempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d58f04-0a7f-4eab-b574-291592039a6a\', \'multiverseId\': 404829}, \'multiverseid\': 404829}, {\'name\': \'Épurateur de catacombes\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand l\'Épurateur de catacombes arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403035&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43bff1b-9fb4-4227-b84f-fe0df7e63f11\', \'multiverseId\': 403035}, \'multiverseid\': 403035}, {\'name\': \'Setacciatore delle Catacombe\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando il Setacciatore delle Catacombe entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".Ogniqualvolta un\\\'altra creatura che controlli muore, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6eaedda-d33d-470a-bf11-ebb7f80046e9\', \'multiverseId\': 403334}, \'multiverseid\': 403334}, {\'name\': \'地下墓地の選別者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）地下墓地の選別者が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7b004f-13b5-4dfd-9f7e-6f27e020e255\', \'multiverseId\': 403633}, \'multiverseid\': 403633}, {\'name\': \'지하무덤 조사꾼\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)지하무덤 조사꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45998f77-a710-4014-a9c1-da560259f811\', \'multiverseId\': 403932}, \'multiverseid\': 403932}, {\'name\': \'Vasculhador das Catacumbas\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Vasculhador das Catacumbas entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".Toda vez que outra criatura que você controla morrer, use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1770a4-bc2d-43a0-989d-4bd8cf618a06\', \'multiverseId\': 404231}, \'multiverseid\': 404231}, {\'name\': \'Очиститель Катакомб\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Очиститель Катакомб выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».Каждый раз, когда другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c92b30b-b935-43a9-97ab-fdc77d01ee8e\', \'multiverseId\': 404530}, \'multiverseid\': 404530}, {\'name\': \'筛坟恶体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当筛坟恶体进战场时，将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5606ca12-64c3-4638-aef6-89472c702251\', \'multiverseId\': 402138}, \'multiverseid\': 402138}, {\'name\': \'篩墳惡體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當篩墳惡體進戰場時，將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」每當另一個由你操控的生物死去時，占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf84b516-0da4-46e1-834c-e182acbb4185\', \'multiverseId\': 402437}, \'multiverseid\': 402437}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kiora, Herrscherin der Tiefen\', \'text\': \'+1: Enttappe bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und bis zu ein Land deiner Wahl.-2: Decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte und/oder eine Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.-8: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du sie gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kämpfen lassen." Bringe dann drei 8/8 blaue Oktopus-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Kiora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402828&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4ccb81-793f-4593-a542-51240e42a242\', \'multiverseId\': 402828}, \'multiverseid\': 402828}, {\'name\': \'Kiora, señora de las profundidades\', \'text\': \'+1: Endereza hasta una criatura objetivo y hasta una tierra objetivo.−2: Muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de criatura y/o de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.−8: Obtienes un emblema con "Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes hacer que luche contra la criatura objetivo". Luego, pon en el campo de batalla tres fichas de criatura Pulpo azules 8/8.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Kiora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8de8e12-4ed8-4803-8f98-85495f75cfb2\', \'multiverseId\': 404921}, \'multiverseid\': 404921}, {\'name\': \'Kiora, maîtresse des profondeurs\', \'text\': "+1: Dégagez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée et jusqu\'à un terrain ciblé.−2 : Révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature et/ou de terrain parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.−8 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle se batte contre une créature ciblée. » Mettez ensuite sur le champ de bataille trois jetons de créature 8/8 bleue Pieuvre.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Kiora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e7041cc-6b42-445d-83c7-7834e4aee048\', \'multiverseId\': 403127}, \'multiverseid\': 403127}, {\'name\': \'Kiora, Signora delle Profondità\', \'text\': \'+1: STAPpa fino a una creatura bersaglio e fino a una terra bersaglio.−2: Rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta creatura e/o una carta terra scelte tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.−8: Ottieni un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi farla lottare con una creatura bersaglio". Poi metti sul campo di battaglia tre pedine creatura Piovra 8/8 blu.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Kiora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9d03c6-4f53-487d-939a-4ef55ee6c8f9\', \'multiverseId\': 403426}, \'multiverseid\': 403426}, {\'name\': \'深海の主、キオーラ\', \'text\': \'＋１：クリーチャーを最大１体と土地を最大１つ対象とし、それらをアンタップする。－２：あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを公開する。あなたは、その中のクリーチャー・カードを最大１枚と土地・カードを最大１枚あなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。－８：あなたは「クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは『その戦場に出たクリーチャーはそれと格闘を行う。』を選んでもよい。」を持つ紋章を得る。その後、青の８/８のタコ・クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — キオーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84265bc9-5069-495e-8c7b-37c677e2c9fe\', \'multiverseId\': 403725}, \'multiverseid\': 403725}, {\'name\': \'심해의 지배자 키오라\', \'text\': \'+1: 최대 한 개까지의 생물과 최대 한 개까지의 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 언탭한다.-2: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 공개한다. 당신은 그 중 생물 카드 한 장 및/또는 대지 카드 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.−8: 당신은 "생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 두 생물이 서로 싸우도록 할 수 있다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다. 그 후 8/8 청색 문어 생물 토큰 세 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 키오라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'933b1223-5706-44f1-b162-f1540f14c164\', \'multiverseId\': 404024}, \'multiverseid\': 404024}, {\'name\': \'Kiora, Mestra das Profundezas\', \'text\': \'+1: Desvire até uma criatura alvo e um terreno alvo.−2: Revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de criatura e/ou terreno dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.−8: Você recebe um emblema com "Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode fazer com que ela lute contra a criatura alvo." Depois, coloque no campo de batalha três fichas de criatura azuis 8/8 do tipo Polvo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Kiora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb462cb-7598-4e2a-b70c-e7ed0357d9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 404323}, \'multiverseid\': 404323}, {\'name\': \'Киора, Владычица Глубин\', \'text\': \'+1: разверните не более одного целевого существа и не более одной целевой земли.−2: покажите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту существа и (или) карту земли в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.−8: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заставить его драться с целевым существом». Затем положите на поле битвы три фишки существа 8/8 синий Спрут.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Киора\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a296fa9c-980a-4603-8c24-dd8b28f4eab0\', \'multiverseId\': 404622}, \'multiverseid\': 404622}, {\'name\': \'深渊宗师奇奥拉\', \'text\': \'+1：重置至多一个目标生物和至多一个目标地。−2：展示你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以将其中一张生物牌和／或一张地牌置于你手上。将其余牌置入你的坟墓场。−8：你获得具有「每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以令它与目标生物互斗」的徽记。然后将三个8/8蓝色章鱼衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～奇奥拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a95c1e4-89fe-4470-8857-c0e2eb74c66c\', \'multiverseId\': 402230}, \'multiverseid\': 402230}, {\'name\': \'深淵宗師奇奧拉\', \'text\': \'+1：重置至多一個目標生物和至多一個目標地。-2：展示你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以將其中一張生物牌和／或一張地牌置於你手上。將其餘牌置入你的墳墓場。-8：你獲得具有「每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以令它與目標生物互鬥」的徽記。然後將三個8/8藍色章魚衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～奇奧拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb9a29c-d7ca-4bb8-b25e-f8f5a9778be1\', \'multiverseId\': 402529}, \'multiverseid\': 402529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenspreißel\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um Knochenspreißel zu wirken.Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Vollkommen in der Unterzahl, mussten sich die Zendikari kreative Mittel und Wege einfallen lassen, die Chancen auszugleichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402725&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f91d92-b35b-4748-b18a-e36ab87d867b\', \'multiverseId\': 402725}, \'multiverseid\': 402725}, {\'name\': \'Astillas óseas\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar las Astillas óseas, sacrifica una criatura.Destruye la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Al verse totalmente superados en número, los zendikari buscaron formas creativas de equilibrar la balanza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d798ad83-7d6d-4b13-933d-5a4ed53f3aea\', \'multiverseId\': 404818}, \'multiverseid\': 404818}, {\'name\': "Fragments d\'os", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer les Fragments d\'os, sacrifiez une créature.Détruisez la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "En nette infériorité numérique, les Zendikari trouvèrent des solutions inventives pour rétablir l\'équilibre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403024&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9946fd59-1613-4c4c-babb-e6e105b29109\', \'multiverseId\': 403024}, \'multiverseid\': 403024}, {\'name\': "Schegge d\'Osso", \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare le Schegge d\'Osso, sacrifica una creatura.Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'In estrema inferiorità numerica, gli abitanti di Zendikar trovarono soluzioni creative per equilibrare lo scontro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a86b215-1911-4314-a343-1df85a8af726\', \'multiverseId\': 403323}, \'multiverseid\': 403323}, {\'name\': \'骨の粉砕\', \'text\': \'骨の粉砕を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'数で勝るゼンディカーの住人たちは、勝ち目を五分にする独創的な手段を見つけた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d768472e-af17-4db0-96cc-cfa5f5398cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 403622}, \'multiverseid\': 403622}, {\'name\': \'쪼개진 뼈 가시\', \'text\': \'쪼개진 뼈 가시를 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물을 희생한다.생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'수적 열세에 처한 젠디카르인들은 이 난국을 타개할 기발한 방법을 찾았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13fc0742-d5cc-4eb7-88f6-4e6d31e6e1ce\', \'multiverseId\': 403921}, \'multiverseid\': 403921}, {\'name\': \'Estacas Ósseas\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Estacas Ósseas, sacrifique uma criatura.Destrua a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Muito inferiores em número, os zendikari encontraram formas criativas de equilibrar as coisas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366406ee-c6e5-4b3f-a73a-154c6424ff7a\', \'multiverseId\': 404220}, \'multiverseid\': 404220}, {\'name\': \'Костные Осколки\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Костных Осколков пожертвуйте существо.Уничтожьте целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Оказавшись в ужасающем меньшинстве, зендикарцы нашли хитроумные способы уравнять шансы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c8f06f-3918-4759-8a90-6775936e766e\', \'multiverseId\': 404519}, \'multiverseid\': 404519}, {\'name\': \'碎骨贯身\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放碎骨贯身的额外费用。消灭目标生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'由于人数远远不敌，赞迪卡人用创意巧思拉平差距。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39a0a1d-4475-4844-90dc-b1160e04d94e\', \'multiverseId\': 402127}, \'multiverseid\': 402127}, {\'name\': \'碎骨貫身\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放碎骨貫身的額外費用。消滅目標生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'由於人數遠遠不敵，贊迪卡人用創意巧思拉平差距。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851c0912-4115-4987-ba64-5b6cb604295c\', \'multiverseId\': 402426}, \'multiverseid\': 402426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kor-Klingenwirblerin\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Kor-Klingenwirblerin oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Soldat, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Das schrille Surren ihres wirbelnden Hakens ist der einzige Kriegsschrei, den sie braucht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3437cc33-599b-4015-a89e-b74967fc0444\', \'multiverseId\': 402830}, \'multiverseid\': 402830}, {\'name\': \'Rotafilos kor\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Rotafilos kor u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado kor aliado\', \'flavor\': \'El zumbido agudo de un gancho que gira es el único grito de batalla que necesita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'464cc56c-034a-43c6-85e4-dbc1a83243d3\', \'multiverseId\': 404923}, \'multiverseid\': 404923}, {\'name\': \'Virelame kor\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que la Virelame kor ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et soldat et allié\', \'flavor\': "Le son strident d\'un crochet qui tournoie est le seul cri de guerre dont elle a besoin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403129&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2b3401b-41a6-469b-9570-b98d912b9bb0\', \'multiverseId\': 403129}, \'multiverseid\': 403129}, {\'name\': \'Lama Vorticante Kor\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta la Lama Vorticante Kor o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Soldato Kor\', \'flavor\': "Il sibilo acuto di un uncino turbinante è l\'unico grido di battaglia di cui ha bisogno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e3c2ef8-0555-4bfc-8dc8-9be5660c69df\', \'multiverseId\': 403428}, \'multiverseid\': 403428}, {\'name\': \'コーの刃振り\', \'text\': \'結集 ― コーの刃振りか他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・兵士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'鉤を素早く振り回す音が彼女の雄叫びだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea80123c-79c1-4de2-8653-5bccbd4a0c53\', \'multiverseId\': 403727}, \'multiverseid\': 403727}, {\'name\': \'코르 선풍검사\', \'text\': \'결집 — 코르 선풍검사나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 병사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'그녀에게 필요한 전투함성은 회전하는 갈고리의 날카로운 소리뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d4d9a5b-749d-47c3-bec2-b89344690afa\', \'multiverseId\': 404026}, \'multiverseid\': 404026}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina-veloz Kor\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Lâmina-veloz Kor ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Soldado Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'O zumbido de um gancho a girar é o único grito de batalha de que ela precisa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56c7499-7223-47d0-8ff8-40923e08a949\', \'multiverseId\': 404325}, \'multiverseid\': 404325}, {\'name\': \'Кор Вихревых Клинков\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Кор Вихревых Клинков или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Солдат Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Пронзительное гудение крюка — вот ее боевой клич.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef42a460-710e-484f-bc39-ec1da28add92\', \'multiverseId\': 404624}, \'multiverseid\': 404624}, {\'name\': \'旋刃寇族\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当旋刃寇族或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'利钩旋转时发出的呼啸声正是她唯一需要的战嚎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3259d14e-3984-4625-b92b-4d51020bb693\', \'multiverseId\': 402232}, \'multiverseid\': 402232}, {\'name\': \'旋刃寇族\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當旋刃寇族或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'利鈎旋轉時發出的呼嘯聲正是她唯一需要的戰嚎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d967dea-9375-4c4c-b160-a0e1c7bdd520\', \'multiverseId\': 402531}, \'multiverseid\': 402531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kor-Verstricker\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Kor-Verstricker oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Soldat, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind zusammen auf diese Welt gekommen. Wir kämpfen zusammen für diese Welt. Wir werden diese Welt zusammen verlassen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402832&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c1ceed-d78c-4476-bcac-ca162dbb4816\', \'multiverseId\': 402832}, \'multiverseid\': 402832}, {\'name\': \'Enmarañadores kor\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que los Enmarañadores kor u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado kor aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Llegamos a este mundo juntos. Luchamos por este mundo juntos. Lo abandonaremos juntos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7886cf3b-2ab1-42fd-b35d-43228a9d5f5d\', \'multiverseId\': 404925}, \'multiverseid\': 404925}, {\'name\': \'Enchevêtreurs kor\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que les Enchevêtreurs kor ou qu\'un autre allié arrivent sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et soldat et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous sommes venus au monde ensemble. Nous combattons pour ce monde ensemble. Nous quitterons ce monde ensemble. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c1797c-6003-4af9-b133-7be0758e1cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 403131}, \'multiverseid\': 403131}, {\'name\': \'Intrappolatori Kor\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta gli Intrappolatori Kor o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Soldato Kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo venuti a questo mondo insieme. Combattiamo per questo mondo insieme. Abbandoneremo questo mondo insieme."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'269bc5ef-bf0e-4c83-a2c8-1498f3fa1ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 403430}, \'multiverseid\': 403430}, {\'name\': \'コーの絡め捕り\', \'text\': \'結集 ― コーの絡め捕りか他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・兵士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「共にこの世に生まれ出で、共にこの世で戦わん。共にこの世を去る日まで。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff6ee77-d28a-4265-b301-e07ad139ab45\', \'multiverseId\': 403729}, \'multiverseid\': 403729}, {\'name\': \'코르 속박꾼\', \'text\': \'결집 — 코르 속박꾼이나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 병사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 함께 이 세상에 태어났다. 우리는 함께 이 세상을 위해 싸운다. 우리는 함께 이 세상을 떠날 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8751cf-52a4-4ffd-9681-2cfec852bcdd\', \'multiverseId\': 404028}, \'multiverseid\': 404028}, {\'name\': \'Enlaçadores Kor\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Enlaçadores Kor ou outro Aliado entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Soldado Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Viemos a este mundo juntos. Lutamos por este mundo juntos. Deixaremos este mundo juntos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99f19f6c-0d4b-4611-a9ce-c68ed99e5588\', \'multiverseId\': 404327}, \'multiverseid\': 404327}, {\'name\': \'Коры-Ловчие\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Коры-Ловчие или другой Союзник выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Солдат Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы пришли в этот мир вместе. Мы сражаемся за этот мир вместе. Мы покинем этот мир вместе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'318e798c-e467-4461-a124-65b87716fd58\', \'multiverseId\': 404626}, \'multiverseid\': 404626}, {\'name\': \'缠绳寇族\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当缠绳寇族或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「同诞于此世，携手卫家园，立誓共离别。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b710ab-0ee1-4374-8e60-48f52f150217\', \'multiverseId\': 402234}, \'multiverseid\': 402234}, {\'name\': \'纏繩寇族\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當纏繩寇族或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，橫置目標由對手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「同誕於此世，攜手衛家園，立誓共離別。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac0083f2-64e9-4954-905c-335a1e6a6a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 402533}, \'multiverseid\': 402533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kor-Züchtiger\', \'text\': \'Der Kor-Züchtiger kann nicht von Eldrazi-Bruten geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Zauberer, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Er meinte, wir sollten uns nicht sorgen, und betrat die Höhle. Die wirbelnde Masse von Eldrazi teilte sich, um ihm Einlass zu gewähren, und schloss sich hinter ihm wieder."—Akiri, Kor-Seilschleuderin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b502a2-5757-4141-a4b4-cf80573b261c\', \'multiverseId\': 402831}, \'multiverseid\': 402831}, {\'name\': \'Castigador kor\', \'text\': \'El Castigador kor no puede ser bloqueado por Vástagos Eldrazi.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero kor aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Dijo que no nos preocupáramos y entró en la caverna. La turbulenta masa de Eldrazi se abrió a su paso... y después se cerró".—Akiri, lanzacuerdas kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c986b547-2f8e-4ae7-aee9-4b83d82a2275\', \'multiverseId\': 404924}, \'multiverseid\': 404924}, {\'name\': \'Châtieur kor\', \'text\': \'Le Châtieur kor ne peut pas être bloqué par les eldrazi et scion.\', \'type\': \'Créature : kor et sorcier et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Il nous a dit de ne pas nous inquiéter et il est entré dans la grotte. La masse grouillante des Eldrazi s\'est écartée pour le laisser entrer, puis elle s\'est refermée sur son passage. »—Akiri, frondeuse de filin kor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c046c02d-3bec-4506-aac2-059e47438a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 403130}, \'multiverseid\': 403130}, {\'name\': \'Punitore Kor\', \'text\': \'Il Punitore Kor non può essere bloccato dai Discendenti Eldrazi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Mago Kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci disse di non preoccuparci e si inoltrò nella caverna. La massa vorticante di Eldrazi si aprì per lasciarlo entrare, poi si chiuse al suo passaggio."—Akiri, lanciafuni kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2e6eac1-894e-459c-a3ec-d27462517883\', \'multiverseId\': 403429}, \'multiverseid\': 403429}, {\'name\': \'コーの懲罰者\', \'text\': \'コーの懲罰者はエルドラージ・末裔によってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・ウィザード・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「あの人は、心配するなと言って洞窟に入って行きました。うごめく無数のエルドラージが、あの人のために道を空け、通り過ぎるとまた塞がりました。」――コーの綱投げのアキリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c8395cc-0465-4008-b760-4eb72d8b94b3\', \'multiverseId\': 403728}, \'multiverseid\': 403728}, {\'name\': \'코르 징벌자\', \'text\': \'코르 징벌자는 엘드라지 자손에게 방어당할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 마법사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"그는 우리에게 걱정하지 말라고 말하며 동굴 안으로 들어갔어. 웅성거리던 엘드라지 무리는 그가 지나가도록 길을 터 주고는, 그가 지나가기 무섭게 길을 닫아버렸어."—코르 밧줄 투척꾼 아키리\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7605ee0f-7991-4490-8e10-44e97ab32a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 404027}, \'multiverseid\': 404027}, {\'name\': \'Castigador Kor\', \'text\': \'Castigador Kor não pode ser bloqueado por Rebentos Eldrazi.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Mago Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele disse para não nos preocuparmos e entrou na caverna. A massa de Eldrazi se abriu para deixá-lo entrar e depois se fechou atrás dele."— Akiri, fundeira de linha kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf991d7-2122-47d6-a864-3d155f8b147b\', \'multiverseId\': 404326}, \'multiverseid\': 404326}, {\'name\': \'Кор-Усмиритель\', \'text\': \'Кор-Усмиритель не может быть заблокирован Эльдрази Отпрысками.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Чародей Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Он сказал нам не беспокоиться и зашел в пещеру. Бурлящее море Эльдрази расступилось, чтобы впустить его, и сомкнулось за его спиной».— Акири, корская метательница канатов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c136b2-9eb4-49e3-b596-28fe6078eba5\', \'multiverseId\': 404625}, \'multiverseid\': 404625}, {\'name\': \'惩恶寇族\', \'text\': \'惩恶寇族不能被同时为奥札奇与孽裔之生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／法术师／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「他要我们无须担心，随后走进了洞穴。大群奥札奇自动分开让他入内，经过之后又聚拢起来。」～寇族掷索人娅绮丽\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e3e5df2-f2ab-4203-927f-6b60d2cdac2b\', \'multiverseId\': 402233}, \'multiverseid\': 402233}, {\'name\': \'懲惡寇族\', \'text\': \'懲惡寇族不能被同時為奧札奇與孽裔之生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／魔法師／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「他要我們無須擔心，隨後走進了洞穴。大群奧札奇自動分開讓他入內，經過之後又聚攏起來。」～寇族擲索人婭奇麗\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54da91e1-2182-4735-8e47-fec4f5c9c34c\', \'multiverseId\': 402532}, \'multiverseid\': 402532}]', '[{\'name\': \'Korallenhelm-Führerin\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Späher, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie kennt die gesamte Küstenlinie, sowohl über als auch unter dem Wasserspiegel, und sie hat überall Verstecke. Sie wird dich ans Ziel bringen."—Jori En, Expeditionsführer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402745&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55ebc38f-b05d-4429-a6b2-ddd88b243615\', \'multiverseId\': 402745}, \'multiverseid\': 402745}, {\'name\': \'Guía de Yelmo de Coral\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador tritón aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ella conoce cada metro de esta costa, por encima y por debajo del mar, y tiene escondites por todo el trayecto. Te llevará a tu destino".—Jori En, líder de expedición\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'045e6a85-ddef-499f-8b15-34f029e7f583\', \'multiverseId\': 404838}, \'multiverseid\': 404838}, {\'name\': \'Guide de Casque de corail\', \'text\': \'{4}{U} : La créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et éclaireur et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Elle connaît chaque centimètre de ce littoral, aussi bien à la surface qu\'en dessous, et sait où trouver des refuges. Elle vous guidera. »—Jori En, chef d\'expédition", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4aa808-f462-4b3a-9fce-18fb51c0668e\', \'multiverseId\': 403044}, \'multiverseid\': 403044}, {\'name\': "Guida dall\'Elmo Corallino", \'text\': \'{4}{U}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Esploratore Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Conosce ogni palmo di questa costa, sia al di sopra che al di sotto della superficie, e ha trovato nascondigli lungo tutto il percorso. Ti farà arrivare a destinazione."—Jori En, capo spedizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40afbf6e-8051-4b81-b01e-4b6ae03278ef\', \'multiverseId\': 403343}, \'multiverseid\': 403343}, {\'name\': \'珊瑚兜の案内人\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・スカウト・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女は海岸地帯を熟知しています。地上も水中も。途中に隠れ場所もあります。彼女が、あなたをお連れします。」――探検隊長、ジョリー・エン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476e05c3-3f36-4d7e-ae60-cf556eeab90c\', \'multiverseId\': 403642}, \'multiverseid\': 403642}, {\'name\': \'산호투구 길잡이\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어당할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 정찰병 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"그녀는 이 해안의 물 위는 물론 물 아래까지 속속들이 다 알고 있어. 게다가 곳곳에 은신처까지 마련해 두었지. 그녀가 그리로 데려다 줄 걸세."—탐험대 대장 조리 엔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1912cea-0913-4279-ae71-21aec5fe8806\', \'multiverseId\': 403941}, \'multiverseid\': 403941}, {\'name\': \'Guia de Elmo de Coral\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Batedor Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ela conhece cada canto dessa costa, tanto acima quanto abaixo da superfície, e tem esconderijos por todo o caminho. Ela vai fazer você chegar lá."— Jori En, líder de expedição\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b84727-3fad-4c38-b38d-0fce0d9ba1ae\', \'multiverseId\': 404240}, \'multiverseid\': 404240}, {\'name\': \'Проводница из Кораллового Шлема\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Разведчик Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Она знает каждую пядь береговой линии — и под водой, и на суше, — и везде у нее есть укрытия. Она доведет вас до места».— Джори-Эн, глава экспедиции\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2629bc89-8896-4d05-8b0e-918e4389a8da\', \'multiverseId\': 404539}, \'multiverseid\': 404539}, {\'name\': \'珊瑚盔向导\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～人鱼／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「她熟知这片海岸的每一步路，无论是在地上或是海下，一路上都有她的藏身之处。她会把你带到的。」～探险队长裘黎恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a30a77c-9c29-49d7-8eac-d416760dc151\', \'multiverseId\': 402147}, \'multiverseid\': 402147}, {\'name\': \'珊瑚盔嚮導\', \'text\': \'{4}{U}：目標生物本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～人魚／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「她熟知這片海岸的每一步路，無論是在地上或是海下，一路上都有她的藏身之處。她會把你帶到的。」～探險隊長裘黎恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b0a399e-bdf7-4d52-b3d0-eaa0020da5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 402446}, \'multiverseid\': 402446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozileks Herold\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Farblose Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Zweck einiger Eldrazi ist klar: Leben aus dem Land saugen und neue Eldrazi gebären. Bei anderen ist es nicht so offensichtlich, und diese machen mich nervös."—Chadir der Navigator\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7083f057-68b8-4947-95f7-52b824804c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 402809}, \'multiverseid\': 402809}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos incoloros.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"El propósito de algunos Eldrazi es evidente: arrebatar la vida a la tierra, engendrar nuevos Eldrazi. Pero el de otros no lo es tanto, y esos son los que me inquietan más".—Chadir el navegante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2676cfb-f2e9-4e02-9a97-5e205825c67f\', \'multiverseId\': 404902}, \'multiverseid\': 404902}, {\'name\': \'Héraut de Kozilek\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Les sorts incolores que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "« L\'objectif de certains Eldrazi est simple : éliminer toute trace de vie, engendrer de nouveaux Eldrazi. Pour d\'autres, c\'est plus difficile à déterminer, et ce sont eux qui m\'inquiètent le plus. »—Chadir le navigateur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291c151a-a776-4a7b-aad0-cf2719749dea\', \'multiverseId\': 403108}, \'multiverseid\': 403108}, {\'name\': \'Araldo di Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Le magie incolori che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo scopo di alcuni Eldrazi è ovvio: estrarre la vita dalla terra e dare alla luce nuovi Eldrazi. Per altri non è così evidente, e sono quelli che mi rendono davvero nervoso."—Chadir il Navigatore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d6d234-deb1-4772-88de-49cb13a9393d\', \'multiverseId\': 403407}, \'multiverseid\': 403407}, {\'name\': \'コジレックの伝令\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）あなたが無色の呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'「ほとんどのエルドラージがやっていることは分かりやすい。大地の生命力を失わせ、エルドラージを生み増やしている。だが、よく分からないヤツもいる。それが気掛かりだ。」――航海士シャーディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'686a2f18-804f-4f64-8184-38827c389f66\', \'multiverseId\': 403706}, \'multiverseid\': 403706}, {\'name\': \'코질렉의 전령\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신이 발동하는 무색 주문들은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'"일부 엘드라지의 목적은 분명해. 대지에서 생명을 빨아 먹고 새로운 엘드라지를 낳는 거지. 반면에 나머지 녀석들의 목적은 분명하지 않은데, 이 점이 나를 불안하게 만들어."—항해사 차디르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ee810d-430e-4535-b9c6-16aa7a70585e\', \'multiverseId\': 404005}, \'multiverseid\': 404005}, {\'name\': \'Arauto de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)As mágicas incolores que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'"O propósito de alguns Eldrazi é óbvio: sugar a vida da terra e gerar novos Eldrazi. Outros não são tão óbvios, e esses são os que me deixam realmente nervoso."— Chadir, o Navegador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8f058a-8882-4dd1-8bed-d60e00759164\', \'multiverseId\': 404304}, \'multiverseid\': 404304}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Козилека\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Разыгрываемые вами бесцветные заклинания стоят на {1} меньше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'«У некоторых Эльдрази предназначение очевидно: вытягивать жизнь из земли, порождать новых Эльдрази. У других же этого не понять. И вот от них мне здорово не по себе».— Чадир-Штурман\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b428578-f8f5-4e45-ac1e-ee93bda3eae3\', \'multiverseId\': 404603}, \'multiverseid\': 404603}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷传令\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）你施放的无色咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'「有些奥札奇的意图很明显：汲取大地的生机，养育新的奥札奇。而有些则不那么明显，它们才真正让我感到紧张。」～领航者洽迪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b24b7a-2262-48c8-ba27-4ed28e84564a\', \'multiverseId\': 402211}, \'multiverseid\': 402211}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷傳令\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）你施放的無色咒語減少{1}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'「有些奧札奇的意圖很明顯：汲取大地的生機，養育新的奧札奇。而有些則不那麼明顯，它們才真正讓我感到緊張。」～領航者洽迪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9540f20-5eb8-4a6f-9bbd-e049ca1e13ac\', \'multiverseId\': 402510}, \'multiverseid\': 402510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozileks Wachposten\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Immer wenn du einen farblosen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält Kozileks Wachposten +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Er bewegt sich so langsam und sicher durch die Tunnel wie das Geröll selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402834&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5b80c0-ee90-4bea-91b7-9d9fc29147f4\', \'multiverseId\': 402834}, \'multiverseid\': 402834}, {\'name\': \'Centinela de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Siempre que lances un hechizo incoloro, el Centinela de Kozilek obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Se mueve por los túneles con la lentitud y seguridad de las rocas que se desplazan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea57ee5a-47b2-4728-85d5-2d9b7fbd9b80\', \'multiverseId\': 404927}, \'multiverseid\': 404927}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle de Kozilek\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort incolore, la Sentinelle de Kozilek gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': \'Elle se déplace dans les tunnels aussi lentement et sûrement que les pierres mouvantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403133&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f275b3-95c5-4a37-8709-eac78da78138\', \'multiverseId\': 403133}, \'multiverseid\': 403133}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella di Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incolore, la Sentinella di Kozilek prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Si muove nelle gallerie lenta e sicura come una faglia rocciosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff46b66-a2bc-4558-b418-b9e460262db8\', \'multiverseId\': 403432}, \'multiverseid\': 403432}, {\'name\': \'コジレックの歩哨\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）あなたが無色の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、コジレックの歩哨は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'変容石のようにゆっくりと、しかし確実にトンネルを進む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7805b0-032d-42c8-a689-ee5a13f1278a\', \'multiverseId\': 403731}, \'multiverseid\': 403731}, {\'name\': \'코질렉의 보초\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신이 무색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 코질렉의 보초는 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'움직이는 바위처럼 천천히 그리고 확실하게 터널을 지나간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e217068f-5285-46e7-84bb-f2634efbbd09\', \'multiverseId\': 404030}, \'multiverseid\': 404030}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica incolor, Sentinela de Kozilek recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se move pelos túneis com a lentidão e a firmeza das pedras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba6bfb5-ef88-49c7-9b57-f48e23897c26\', \'multiverseId\': 404329}, \'multiverseid\': 404329}, {\'name\': \'Страж Козилека\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете бесцветное заклинание, Страж Козилека получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Он движется по тоннелям медленно и неумолимо, словно каменный оползень.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a02dcc-aeaf-4eed-8630-d1d7234f6466\', \'multiverseId\': 404628}, \'multiverseid\': 404628}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷哨兵\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）每当你施放无色咒语时，寇基雷哨兵得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'它在地道中稳步缓行，如同移动的石块。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac1e521-e490-47b2-a292-31e6e4d40290\', \'multiverseId\': 402236}, \'multiverseid\': 402236}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷哨兵\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）每當你施放無色咒語時，寇基雷哨兵得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'它在地道中穩步緩行，如同移動的石塊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'368e2680-6543-41e2-968c-e2a3b165f679\', \'multiverseId\': 402535}, \'multiverseid\': 402535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozileks Wegbereiter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Verborgen in den düstersten Ecken unserer Welt wächst etwas Grauenhaftes heran. Ich fürchte, unsere Feinde sind weit zahlreicher, als wir es uns vorgestellt haben."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f5a9ca-6bbf-4c3c-8d50-ec5250252b42\', \'multiverseId\': 402833}, \'multiverseid\': 402833}, {\'name\': \'Canalizador de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Algo horrible está cobrando forma en los rincones más oscuros de nuestro mundo. Temo que nuestros enemigos sean más numerosos de lo que pensábamos".—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3dd8ec-88ed-4a3a-827f-9279bb8c5355\', \'multiverseId\': 404926}, \'multiverseid\': 404926}, {\'name\': \'Canaliseur de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« Un mal s\'étend dans les endroits les plus sombres de notre monde. Je crains que nos ennemis ne soient plus nombreux que nous ne l\'avions imaginé. »—Nissa Revane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403132&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef36cf9-d5d1-48e3-8db8-e2f612b3e18e\', \'multiverseId\': 403132}, \'multiverseid\': 403132}, {\'name\': \'Incanalatore di Kozilek\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Nei luoghi oscuri del nostro mondo sta crescendo qualcosa di orribile. Temo che i nostri nemici siano più numerosi di quanto avessimo immaginato."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29cc6092-1ca1-4366-a30f-415afbc33b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 403431}, \'multiverseid\': 403431}, {\'name\': \'コジレックの媒介者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界の暗部で何か恐ろしいものが育っている。私が恐れているのは、敵の数が想像を遥かに上回ることよ。」――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c972d2fd-4816-4752-8af6-c9ba2f18491b\', \'multiverseId\': 403730}, \'multiverseid\': 403730}, {\'name\': \'코질렉의 마력 수집자\', \'text\': \'{T}: {2}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'"세계의 어두운 곳에서 끔찍한 것들이 자라고 있어. 우리가 생각한 것보다 적들의 수가 더 많을까 봐 두렵구나."—니사 레베인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a1b938-028a-4235-a301-85568cf6eb59\', \'multiverseId\': 404029}, \'multiverseid\': 404029}, {\'name\': \'Canalizador de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {2} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Nos lugares escuros de nosso mundo algo horrível está crescendo. Receio que nossos inimigos possam ser mais numerosos do que havíamos imaginado."— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546beab6-8e4c-4c0f-a7c3-3c0608ab1a21\', \'multiverseId\': 404328}, \'multiverseid\': 404328}, {\'name\': \'Проводник Козилека\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {2} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«В самых темных уголках нашего мира поднимает голову нечто кошмарное. Боюсь, врагов может быть больше, чем мы предполагали».— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1528d29c-bcbd-45e3-8dd6-e5bbbd04e3f7\', \'multiverseId\': 404627}, \'multiverseid\': 404627}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷通念体\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{2}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「在我们世界的暗处，可怖之物正在孳生蔓延。我担心敌人的数量远超我们想象。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb7e072e-a526-4aae-9fe5-0149e08bd438\', \'multiverseId\': 402235}, \'multiverseid\': 402235}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷通念體\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{2}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「在我們世界的暗處，可怖之物正在孳生蔓延。我擔心敵人的數量遠超我們想像。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f4f153-e65d-466c-8a93-1074f066981c\', \'multiverseId\': 402534}, \'multiverseid\': 402534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabblerhaut\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Die Krabblerhaut kann nicht blocken.{1}{B}: Regeneriere die Krabblerhaut. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine andere farblose Kreatur kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b65b920-14b5-46ac-8b3a-5b27024b982f\', \'multiverseId\': 402934}, \'multiverseid\': 402934}, {\'name\': \'Pellejo escurridizo\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)El Pellejo escurridizo no puede bloquear.{1}{B}: Regenera el Pellejo escurridizo. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas otra criatura incolora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6147e0-addf-44c2-aa28-02805470b2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 405027}, \'multiverseid\': 405027}, {\'name\': \'Sourdrepeau\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Le Sourdrepeau ne peut pas bloquer.{1}{B} : Régénérez le Sourdrepeau. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez une autre créature incolore.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403233&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c319c946-a630-4ca3-973f-e9ac89e97ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 403233}, \'multiverseid\': 403233}, {\'name\': \'Brulicoderma\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Il Brulicoderma non può bloccare.{1}{B}: Rigenera il Brulicoderma. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli un\'altra creatura incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f27ad6-70fb-4fb7-adf6-47474126133b\', \'multiverseId\': 403532}, \'multiverseid\': 403532}, {\'name\': \'ハヤバイ\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）ハヤバイではブロックできない。{1}{B}：ハヤバイを再生する。この能力は、あなたが他の無色のクリーチャーをコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1623ab0-e398-46ee-b14a-6b89673f448b\', \'multiverseId\': 403831}, \'multiverseid\': 403831}, {\'name\': \'질주껍질\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)질주껍질은 방어할 수 없다.{1}{B}: 질주껍질을 재생한다. 이 능력은 당신이 다른 무색 생물을 조종할 때에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593f3284-9d96-48b2-9828-b7dba17cb0c5\', \'multiverseId\': 404130}, \'multiverseid\': 404130}, {\'name\': \'Velocidermo\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Velocidermo não pode bloquear.{1}{B}: Regenere Velocidermo. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar outra criatura incolor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36fd500a-9bac-48d1-ab27-e9934ad789cf\', \'multiverseId\': 404429}, \'multiverseid\': 404429}, {\'name\': \'Дерганый Щелкун\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Дерганый Щелкун не может блокировать.{1}{B}: регенерируйте Дерганого Щелкуна. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете другое бесцветное существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d347c2e-feca-4b0f-9ec7-0af7bbd005e6\', \'multiverseId\': 404728}, \'multiverseid\': 404728}, {\'name\': \'掠皮恶体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）掠皮恶体不能进行阻挡。{1}{B}：重生掠皮恶体。只能于你操控另一个无色生物时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1037c39-4dc8-4ff5-8bc3-ceaee79e2976\', \'multiverseId\': 402336}, \'multiverseid\': 402336}, {\'name\': \'掠皮惡體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）掠皮惡體不能進行阻擋。{1}{B}：重生掠皮惡體。只能於你操控另一個無色生物時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa398ef3-46d4-407d-8d57-edbd6506412b\', \'multiverseId\': 402635}, \'multiverseid\': 402635}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kryptischer Taucher\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.){2}{U}, lege eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Meere sind nicht minder bedroht als das trockene Land. Dieser Kampf ist genauso mein Kampf, wie es dein Kampf ist."—Kiora zu Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402748&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f48ce89-2bbf-4f3f-b23e-c6a2bc94e9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 402748}, \'multiverseid\': 402748}, {\'name\': \'Buceador críptico\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.){2}{U}, poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador es propietario: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"El mar no está menos amenazado que la tierra. Esta lucha es tan mía como tuya".—Kiora, a Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee249da-6ab3-472d-9302-a66ab33c24de\', \'multiverseId\': 404841}, \'multiverseid\': 404841}, {\'name\': \'Croiseur cryptique\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.){2}{U}, mettez une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil : Engagez la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': "« La mer n\'est pas plus épargnée que la terre ferme. Ce combat est le mien autant que le vôtre. »—Kiora, à Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e422b60-7fae-4c72-b0cc-ae47d70b98a6\', \'multiverseId\': 403047}, \'multiverseid\': 403047}, {\'name\': \'Incrociatore Criptico\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.){2}{U}, Metti una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"I mari non sono meno a repentaglio della terraferma. Questa battaglia è mia quanto tua."—Kiora a Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74447c0-a25e-4c66-b0fb-fc75bf409bc6\', \'multiverseId\': 403346}, \'multiverseid\': 403346}, {\'name\': \'謎めいた巡行者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）{2}{U}, 追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置く：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'「陸ばかりじゃない。海も危機に瀕しているの。あなたと同じくらい、これは私の戦いでもあるのよ。」――キオーラからギデオン・ジュラへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593b88e8-00ac-44d3-baca-6e95dfcc09ed\', \'multiverseId\': 403645}, \'multiverseid\': 403645}, {\'name\': \'불가사의한 수중순찰자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.){2}{U}, 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣는다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': \'"깊은 바다는 메마른 대지만큼이나 위험하지. 이 싸움은 당신 것이기도 하지만 내 것이기도 해."—키오라가 기디온 주라에게\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063739d3-6be6-4850-b406-200cc9208fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 403944}, \'multiverseid\': 403944}, {\'name\': \'Cruzador Críptico\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.){2}{U}, Coloque um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele: Vire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': \'"Os oceanos não correm menos perigo que as terras secas. Essa luta é tanto minha quanto de vocês."— Kiora, para Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9004175-b346-46ac-bf42-970422530ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 404243}, \'multiverseid\': 404243}, {\'name\': \'Загадочный Пловец\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.){2}{U}, положите принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока: поверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': \'«Морям грозит не меньшая опасность, чем суше. Это и моя война».— Киора, обращаясь к Гидеону Джуре\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c92e5d03-fb9d-498b-b2bf-fbfaa51862c9\', \'multiverseId\': 404542}, \'multiverseid\': 404542}, {\'name\': \'墓穴巡体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）{2}{U}，将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'「陆地不再安全，海洋亦然。这是你的战斗，同样也是我的。」～奇奥拉告诉基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0683620a-9897-45d5-8c83-aded4bdc9cef\', \'multiverseId\': 402150}, \'multiverseid\': 402150}, {\'name\': \'墓穴巡體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）{2}{U}，將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場：橫置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': \'「陸地不再安全，海洋亦然。這是你的戰鬥，同樣也是我的。」～奇奧拉告訴基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0117e4da-75d7-4e4b-95c9-adf50fd893ae\', \'multiverseId\': 402449}, \'multiverseid\': 402449}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kuriergreif\', \'text\': \'FliegendWenn der Kuriergreif ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'„Seetor ist gefallen. Überlebende sind unterwegs. Werde weiteren Greif senden, wenn wir Unterschlupf finden. Bleibt verborgen. Seid vorsichtig."—Nachricht aus Tars Olan, Geschenk der Kor an die Welt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402746&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09ecb9f-a67a-4815-a350-7c265d3c3a77\', \'multiverseId\': 402746}, \'multiverseid\': 402746}, {\'name\': \'Grifo mensajero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Cuando el Grifo mensajero entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'"Portal Marino ha caído. Los supervivientes huyen. Enviaré otro grifo cuando encontremos refugio. Ocúltense. Cuídense".—Mensaje de Tars Olan, kor entregado al mundo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64410cd6-f4c2-422a-97f3-f9957084a67c\', \'multiverseId\': 404839}, \'multiverseid\': 404839}, {\'name\': \'Griffon messager\', \'text\': \'VolQuand le Griffon messager arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': "« Porte des Mers est tombée. Les survivants sont en route. Un autre griffon suivra lorsque nous aurons trouvé refuge. Restez cachés. Restez à l\'abri. »—Message de Tars Olan, offrande au monde kor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2543d0ac-76db-4d44-a301-4bf5d31c8648\', \'multiverseId\': 403045}, \'multiverseid\': 403045}, {\'name\': \'Grifone Messaggero\', \'text\': \'VolareQuando il Grifone Messaggero entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'"Portale Marino è caduta. I sopravvissuti sono in movimento. Manderemo un altro grifone quando troveremo un rifugio. Rimanete nascosti. Rimanete in salvo."—Messaggio di Tars Olan, dono-al-mondo kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e04e39-d174-48eb-8542-a3b427a6118a\', \'multiverseId\': 403344}, \'multiverseid\': 403344}, {\'name\': \'グリフィンの急使\', \'text\': \'飛行グリフィンの急使が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'「海門は陥落。生存者を移送中。避難所が確保でき次第、別のグリフィンを送る。それまで隠れていろ。死ぬな。」――コーの人身御供、タルズ・オランからの連絡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdcbe8f7-74de-401c-9c1e-0fcbf420a821\', \'multiverseId\': 403643}, \'multiverseid\': 403643}, {\'name\': \'전령 그리핀\', \'text\': \'비행전령 그리핀이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그리핀\', \'flavor\': \'"바다 관문이 무너졌다. 생존자들은 이동 중에 있다. 피난처를 찾으면 다른 그리핀을 보내겠다. 안전하게 숨어 있거라."—코르 인신 공양 타즈 오란의 메시지\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd49d5a1-89b9-45ee-86f4-ef67ef556882\', \'multiverseId\': 403942}, \'multiverseid\': 403942}, {\'name\': \'Grifo Mensageiro\', \'text\': \'VoarQuando Grifo Mensageiro entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'"O Portão Marinho caiu. Os sobreviventes estão em marcha. Mandaremos outro grifo quando encontrarmos refúgio. Continue no esconderijo. Continue em segurança."— Mensagem de Tars Olan, oferenda-ao-mundo kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdcbe396-34d1-413c-9a31-c771a211537f\', \'multiverseId\': 404241}, \'multiverseid\': 404241}, {\'name\': \'Посыльный Грифон\', \'text\': \'ПолетКогда Посыльный Грифон выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Грифон\', \'flavor\': \'«Мореград пал. Выжившие уходят. Мы отправим второго грифона, когда найдем убежище. Оставайтесь в укрытии. Оставайтесь в безопасности».— Письмо Тарса Олана, жертвопринесенного кора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21173b1d-66c5-4dcc-b74c-16add87dcd8f\', \'multiverseId\': 404540}, \'multiverseid\': 404540}, {\'name\': \'讯使狮鹫\', \'text\': \'飞行当讯使狮鹫进战场时，你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'「海户陷落。残部撤离。安身后另派狮鹫。躲好。保重。」～寇族献世子塔斯欧岚的信息\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c600395-986a-4c49-adbd-17782cf5a506\', \'multiverseId\': 402148}, \'multiverseid\': 402148}, {\'name\': \'訊使獅鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行當訊使獅鷲進戰場時，你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～獅鷲\', \'flavor\': \'「海戶陷落。殘部撤離。安身後另派獅鷲。躲好。保重。」～寇族獻世子塔斯歐嵐的訊息\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9409acbe-cbb9-4d97-a746-b86860c50e22\', \'multiverseId\': 402447}, \'multiverseid\': 402447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laichgründe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{6}, {T}, opfere die Laichgründe: Bringe drei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Junge Eldrazi krabbeln aus dem Staub, befehligt von einem höheren Willen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0f0eaf-dc2a-4cc8-9374-b8cc8128c8bd\', \'multiverseId\': 402943}, \'multiverseid\': 402943}, {\'name\': \'Lecho de crianza\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{6}, {T}, sacrificar el Lecho de crianza: Pon en el campo de batalla tres fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los jóvenes Eldrazi surgen reptando del polvo, impulsados por una voluntad más poderosa que ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'699ec314-10d1-44be-ae4b-74d288e2bfa6\', \'multiverseId\': 405036}, \'multiverseid\': 405036}, {\'name\': \'Lieu de prolifération\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{6}, {T}, sacrifiez le Lieu de prolifération : Mettez sur le champ de bataille trois jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les jeunes Eldrazi sortent de la poussière, contraints par une volonté plus puissante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1403bcf-99b7-48db-b6c3-88e873e0ee6f\', \'multiverseId\': 403242}, \'multiverseid\': 403242}, {\'name\': \'Alveo di Procreazione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{6}, {T}, Sacrifica l\\\'Alveo di Procreazione: Metti sul campo di battaglia tre pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I giovani Eldrazi strisciano fuori dalla polvere, governati da una volontà superiore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c2cf3a-5538-453e-b73e-28f70ac02c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 403541}, \'multiverseid\': 403541}, {\'name\': \'繁殖苗床\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{6}, {T}, 繁殖苗床を生け贄に捧げる：無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの幼体は塵から這い出すと巨大な意思に導かれて進んでゆく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8977e4bd-53ae-4dce-967f-9f4942959cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 403840}, \'multiverseid\': 403840}, {\'name\': \'부화지\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{6}, {T}, 부화지를 희생한다: 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 세 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물들은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'새끼 엘드라지가 거대한 의지에 이끌려 먼지 속에서 기어 나온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6bb26fe-f771-4f39-a1d8-0ceefd399148\', \'multiverseId\': 404139}, \'multiverseid\': 404139}, {\'name\': \'Leito de Procriação\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{6}, {T}, Sacrifique Leito de Procriação: Coloque no campo de batalha três fichas de criatura incolores 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Jovens Eldrazi saem rastejando do pó, impelidos por uma vontade maior.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6abf31-b3c8-459b-a75d-6897402755bb\', \'multiverseId\': 404438}, \'multiverseid\': 404438}, {\'name\': \'Ложе Порождения\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{6}, {T}, пожертвуйте Ложе Порождения: положите на поле битвы три фишки существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Они имеют способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Юные Эльдрази выбираются из праха, подчиняясь воле повелителя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d4d3ba6-0885-41d4-a953-ab22a4b59bb2\', \'multiverseId\': 404737}, \'multiverseid\': 404737}, {\'name\': \'孳息温床\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{6}，{T}，牺牲孳息温床：将三个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'幼小的奥札奇在更强大的意志驱使下，自尘土匍匐而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'925b163b-d2ff-423a-96b5-a5b7aa1bc98f\', \'multiverseId\': 402345}, \'multiverseid\': 402345}, {\'name\': \'孳息溫床\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{6}，{T}，犧牲孳息溫床：將三個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它們具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'幼小的奧札奇在更強大的意志驅使下，自塵土匍匐而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17846dc6-9f9b-4e00-b147-213a0c6064d6\', \'multiverseId\': 402644}, \'multiverseid\': 402644}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laternenkundschafterin\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Laternenkundschafterin oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Polyeder-Laternen vertreiben mehr als nur die Dunkelheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141f3f0f-6430-4110-9726-a070973c1021\', \'multiverseId\': 402835}, \'multiverseid\': 402835}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora del farol\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que la Exploradora del farol u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Los faroles de edro ahuyentan algo más que la oscuridad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1449ef49-c28a-437d-b1e7-91a8fb0a3b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 404928}, \'multiverseid\': 404928}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireuse à la lanterne\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que l\'Éclaireuse à la lanterne ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur et allié\', \'flavor\': "Les lanternes d\'hèdron ne repoussent pas que les ombres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403134&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86327dc8-748e-4cf2-afdf-9b1e689beb6b\', \'multiverseId\': 403134}, \'multiverseid\': 403134}, {\'name\': \'Esploratrice della Lanterna\', \'text\': "Radunare — Ogniqualvolta l\'Esploratrice della Lanterna o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le lanterne di edro scacciano ben di più della sola oscurità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa3dd4a-bd32-4bbb-ac23-ce5c23af6cea\', \'multiverseId\': 403433}, \'multiverseid\': 403433}, {\'name\': \'ランタンの斥候\', \'text\': \'結集 ― ランタンの斥候か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'面晶体のランタンが追い払うのは暗闇だけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d866a6-6d8c-48e4-83ff-2dce04f5348a\', \'multiverseId\': 403732}, \'multiverseid\': 403732}, {\'name\': \'등불 정찰병\', \'text\': \'결집 — 등불 정찰병이나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 생명연결을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'다면체 등불은 어둠을 밝히는 일 외에도 여러모로 유용하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd708ce1-d282-4216-8fec-ce93fd72d090\', \'multiverseId\': 404031}, \'multiverseid\': 404031}, {\'name\': \'Batedor de Lanterna\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Batedor de Lanterna ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'As lanternas de edro afastam mais do que apenas a escuridão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad524b2d-0968-455c-9530-629e82b62144\', \'multiverseId\': 404330}, \'multiverseid\': 404330}, {\'name\': \'Разведчица с Фонарем\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Разведчица с Фонарем или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Цепь жизни до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Фонари-эдры разгоняют не только тьму.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce43663b-0309-4401-8d2b-d046261746da\', \'multiverseId\': 404629}, \'multiverseid\': 404629}, {\'name\': \'明灯斥候\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当明灯斥候或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'晶石明灯驱散的不仅仅是黑暗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4082758-33cf-4d9b-b7be-4d6cc3961c18\', \'multiverseId\': 402237}, \'multiverseid\': 402237}, {\'name\': \'明燈斥候\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當明燈斥候或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'晶石明燈驅散的不僅僅是黑暗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278b0ec9-a62f-426c-9af6-333787397ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 402536}, \'multiverseid\': 402536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lautloser Gleiter\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)FliegendImmer wenn der Lautlose Gleiter angreift, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich beobachtete aus der Ferne, wie er vorbeiflog. Als ich wieder zu meinen Gefährten blickte, war Najet tot."—Akiri, Kor-Seilschleuderin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a833620-8e6b-4e8b-8d78-f778204675f1\', \'multiverseId\': 402932}, \'multiverseid\': 402932}, {\'name\': \'Deslizador silencioso\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Vuela.Siempre que el Deslizador silencioso ataque, el jugador defensor pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo vi pasar desde la distancia. Cuando me volví a mirar a mis compañeros, Najet estaba muerta".—Akiri, lanzacuerdas kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd33e2b3-fc4a-4f93-802e-5233a9538140\', \'multiverseId\': 405025}, \'multiverseid\': 405025}, {\'name\': \'Écumeur silencieux\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)VolÀ chaque fois que l\'Écumeur silencieux attaque, le joueur défenseur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "« Je l\'ai regardé passer de loin. Quand je me suis retournée vers mes compagnons, Najet était morte. »—Akiri, frondeuse de filin kor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ead850-8bf7-44f6-856a-d138106e6dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 403231}, \'multiverseid\': 403231}, {\'name\': \'Sorvolatore Silenzioso\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)VolareOgniqualvolta il Sorvolatore Silenzioso attacca, il giocatore in difesa perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo guardai passare lontano. Quando mi voltai verso i miei compagni, Najet era morta."—Akiri, lanciafuni kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'996de89e-0b6f-4d0c-8765-3d8569ca33bd\', \'multiverseId\': 403530}, \'multiverseid\': 403530}, {\'name\': \'音無く飛ぶもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）飛行音無く飛ぶものが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'「それが遠くを飛び過ぎるのが見えました。仲間の方を振り返ると、ナジェトが死んでいました。」――コーの綱投げのアキリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbd6ea3-9440-439e-a073-a18ace408690\', \'multiverseId\': 403829}, \'multiverseid\': 403829}, {\'name\': \'조용한 선별자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)비행조용한 선별자가 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'"그 놈이 지나가는 모습을 멀리서 지켜봤어. 내 동료들을 다시 돌아 보니 나제트가 죽어 있더군."—코르 밧줄 투척꾼 아키리\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f11e5315-46ba-4037-891e-079635b3d728\', \'multiverseId\': 404128}, \'multiverseid\': 404128}, {\'name\': \'Deslizador Silencioso\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)VoarToda vez que Deslizador Silencioso ataca, o jogador defensor perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu o vi passar à distância. Quando olhei novamente para meus companheiros, Najet estava morta."— Akiri, fundeira de linha kor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13d4e3c-5c74-4aa1-82c0-a94cbaafed9c\', \'multiverseId\': 404427}, \'multiverseid\': 404427}, {\'name\': \'Бесшумный Летун\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)ПолетКаждый раз, когда Бесшумный Летун атакует, защищающийся игрок теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'«Я смотрела, как он скользит вдалеке. Когда я обернулась к товарищам, Наджет была мертва».— Акири, корская метательница канатов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc038025-dc24-4dc7-87ec-0192c81cbb73\', \'multiverseId\': 404726}, \'multiverseid\': 404726}, {\'name\': \'寂静飞掠体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）飞行每当寂静飞掠体攻击时，防御牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我远远地见它掠过。当我回头看向同伴时，娜婕已经死去。」～寇族掷索人娅绮丽\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf499b83-029e-4355-998b-41c83f51b3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 402334}, \'multiverseid\': 402334}, {\'name\': \'寂靜飛掠體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）飛行每當寂靜飛掠體攻擊時，防禦玩家失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'「我遠遠地見它掠過。當我回頭看向同伴時，娜婕已經死去。」～寇族擲索人婭奇麗\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25d50f0-db93-4ac6-8fee-3db45a8aab48\', \'multiverseId\': 402633}, \'multiverseid\': 402633}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavatritt-Plünderer\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Der Lavatritt-Plünderer erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins entdeckten als Erste das Potenzial der Polyeder im Kampf gegen die Eldrazi. Schließlich haben diese magischen Steine richtig scharfe Ecken und Kanten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a38694fa-49c0-47a2-a5f0-a64451e06e84\', \'multiverseId\': 402836}, \'multiverseid\': 402836}, {\'name\': \'Incursor pisalava\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: El Incursor pisalava obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos fueron los primeros en ver el potencial de los edros en su lucha contra los Eldrazi: las piedras mágicas ya venían con una punta afilada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ad6c3d6-f499-4fd8-8f74-8a203491c3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 404929}, \'multiverseid\': 404929}, {\'name\': \'Pillard lavemarche\', \'text\': "{2}{R} : Le Pillard lavemarche gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Les gobelins furent les premiers à exploiter le potentiel des hèdrons pour lutter contre les Eldrazi, car ces pierres magiques étaient déjà pointues.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ddeb7d-fea2-4763-a4c5-83e06b60ad23\', \'multiverseId\': 403135}, \'multiverseid\': 403135}, {\'name\': \'Predone Passo di Lava\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Il Predone Passo di Lava prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'I goblin furono i primi a scoprire il potenziale degli edri nella lotta contro gli Eldrazi, poiché le pietre magiche erano già fornite di estremità a punta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5eb3d9d-2fe2-4304-b318-0f70ae1ad81d\', \'multiverseId\': 403434}, \'multiverseid\': 403434}, {\'name\': \'溶岩足の略奪者\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：ターン終了時まで、溶岩足の略奪者は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージとの戦いで最初に面晶体の潜在能力に気付いたのはゴブリンであった。たまたま先が尖っていて便利だったのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a41950c-f246-49c4-b0ff-cfd7832af15b\', \'multiverseId\': 403733}, \'multiverseid\': 403733}, {\'name\': \'용암발자국 약탈자\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: 용암발자국 약탈자는 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지와의 전투에서 다면체의 가능성을 가장 먼저 알아 본 건 고블린들이었다. 이 마법석은 끝이 뾰족하게 되어 있어 전투에 용이했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90cb2447-f49f-4716-b1a9-0fd74606408b\', \'multiverseId\': 404032}, \'multiverseid\': 404032}, {\'name\': \'Salteador Pisalava\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Salteador Pisalava recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os goblins foram os primeiros a ver o potencial dos edros na luta contra os Eldrazi, uma vez que as pedras mágicas são pontudas por natureza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6efbd0a-a5a7-401c-ab0f-25c4f0ecac4d\', \'multiverseId\': 404331}, \'multiverseid\': 404331}, {\'name\': \'Огненог-Налетчик\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Огненог-Налетчик получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Гоблины первыми узнали о том, как эдры действуют на Эльдрази, ведь эти волшебные камни были удачно оснащены острыми концами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b56ead1b-0fdc-489f-8981-3ebbd9e3be83\', \'multiverseId\': 404630}, \'multiverseid\': 404630}, {\'name\': \'熔足突击队\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：熔足突击队得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪最先发现了晶石可以用于对抗奥札奇，因为这些有魔力的石头是现成的尖锐武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc8887d-00ec-4821-bf28-6457af4ec4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 402238}, \'multiverseid\': 402238}, {\'name\': \'熔足突擊隊\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：熔足突擊隊得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪最先發現了晶石可以用於對抗奧札奇，因為這些有魔力的石頭是現成的尖銳武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d0bdec-d560-45f8-8064-82767565a58e\', \'multiverseId\': 402537}, \'multiverseid\': 402537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebensquell-Druidin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Land ist nicht tot, nur krank. Ich werde es wieder gesund pflegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f3cf2f4-7db5-4bb1-8265-7d1fe7756b53\', \'multiverseId\': 402837}, \'multiverseid\': 402837}, {\'name\': \'Druida brotavida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra no está muerta, solo enferma. La cuidaré hasta que mejore".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f78015-7a56-414f-80f2-5bc6beae1927\', \'multiverseId\': 404930}, \'multiverseid\': 404930}, {\'name\': \'Druidesse de la sourcevie\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« La terre n\'est pas morte, elle est simplement malade. Je la soignerai pour qu\'elle aille mieux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd58f36-eb96-4535-9799-f88f7cb21fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 403136}, \'multiverseid\': 403136}, {\'name\': \'Druida della Sorgente Vitale\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La terra non è morta, è solo malata. La riporterò in salute."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336cf47b-0c74-47e9-9072-45c64e573725\', \'multiverseId\': 403435}, \'multiverseid\': 403435}, {\'name\': \'生命湧きのドルイド\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「大地は死んでいない。病んでいるだけよ。回復するよう、私が癒すわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a37d1c5d-104e-45a6-9d21-73109cc22c51\', \'multiverseId\': 403734}, \'multiverseid\': 403734}, {\'name\': \'생명을 일으키는 드루이드\', \'text\': \'{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"대지는 죽은 게 아니라 단지 병든 것뿐이네. 대지를 치료해 건강한 상태로 되돌릴 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ebec919-bd9c-4318-bd85-ea594c59abe1\', \'multiverseId\': 404033}, \'multiverseid\': 404033}, {\'name\': \'Druida da Fonte Vital\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"A terra não está morta, só doente. Eu vou cuidar dela até que ela melhore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0f4b0a-f8e9-48f0-a819-cafc1bb21921\', \'multiverseId\': 404332}, \'multiverseid\': 404332}, {\'name\': \'Друид Источника Жизни\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Земля не погибла. Она просто больна. Моя забота поможет ей исцелиться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'715e4a85-116e-42e6-8ac3-b1e83d790055\', \'multiverseId\': 404631}, \'multiverseid\': 404631}, {\'name\': \'涌生德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「大地未死，只是抱恙。待我调理，让它重返生机。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42d10d41-89bb-4315-85d5-c9ceb9b032e4\', \'multiverseId\': 402239}, \'multiverseid\': 402239}, {\'name\': \'湧生德魯伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「大地未死，只是抱恙。待我調理，讓它重返生機。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e41cbdc-2b38-4069-b44c-614c4204c4af\', \'multiverseId\': 402538}, \'multiverseid\': 402538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leitende Pfeile\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat „{2}, {T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Falls einer farblosen Kreatur auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wird, tappe sie."Ausrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Auch als „Leitende Steine" bezeichnet, können Scherben von Polyedern Eldrazi bei Kontakt lähmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'079ea99e-ea8a-4bd7-8f64-d232abc4732c\', \'multiverseId\': 402880}, \'multiverseid\': 402880}, {\'name\': \'Flechas de la senda\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene "{2}, {T}: Esta criatura hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. Si una criatura incolora recibe daño de esta manera, gírala".Equipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Los fragmentos de edro, también llamados "piedras de la senda", pueden inmovilizar a los Eldrazi al tocarlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'704d64ed-4125-43a9-9271-f7aef2dbb23e\', \'multiverseId\': 404973}, \'multiverseid\': 404973}, {\'name\': \'Flèches de passage\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a « {2}, {T} : Cette créature inflige 1 blessure à la créature ciblée. Si une créature incolore subit des blessures de cette manière, engagez-la. »Équipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Les éclats d\'hèdrons, aussi appelés « pierres de passage », peuvent immobiliser les Eldrazi au contact.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403179&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd3af94d-9310-468c-93ff-da2359a947db\', \'multiverseId\': 403179}, \'multiverseid\': 403179}, {\'name\': \'Frecce del Cammino\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha "{2}, {T}: Questa creatura infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio. Se è stato inflitto danno a una creatura incolore in questo modo, TAPpala".Equipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Chiamati anche "pietre del cammino", i frammenti di edro possono immobilizzare gli Eldrazi al solo contatto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33df1256-82b4-43c1-8c2d-76e2d8eead7d\', \'multiverseId\': 403478}, \'multiverseid\': 403478}, {\'name\': \'突き抜けの矢\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは「{2}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。無色のクリーチャーがこれによりダメージを与えられたなら、それをタップする。」を持つ。装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「突き抜けの石」とも呼ばれる面晶体の断片には、それに接触したエルドラージの動きを止める働きがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d6b834-f5c0-4065-8b39-f6b716191138\', \'multiverseId\': 403777}, \'multiverseid\': 403777}, {\'name\': \'통로 화살\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 "{2}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 무색 생물이 이렇게 피해를 입으면 그 무색 생물을 탭한다."를 가진다.장착 {2}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'"통로 보석"이라고도 부르는 다면체 파편이 엘드라지 몸에 닿으면 엘드라지가 무력화된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfaf681d-225c-4c42-949f-75e57f1b6b16\', \'multiverseId\': 404076}, \'multiverseid\': 404076}, {\'name\': \'Flechas da Trilha\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem "{2}, {T}: Esta criatura causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo. Se uma criatura incolor sofreu dano dessa forma, vire-a."Equipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Também chamados de "pedras das trilhas", os fragmentos de edros conseguem imobilizar os Eldrazi ao contato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89d76cf5-d8f7-48ed-94a1-a95587e1671f\', \'multiverseId\': 404375}, \'multiverseid\': 404375}, {\'name\': \'Путеводные Стрелы\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет способность «{2}, {T}: это существо наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу. Если таким образом наносятся повреждения бесцветному существу, поверните его».Снарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Осколки эдров, которые также называют «путеводными камнями», при касании обездвиживают Эльдрази.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79706ef8-5d81-40d6-82a7-fce357fa1ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 404674}, \'multiverseid\': 404674}, {\'name\': \'开道箭\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有「{2}，{T}：此生物对目标生物造成1点伤害。如果无色生物以此法受到伤害，将它横置。」佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'晶石的碎片亦称「开道石」，它接触到奥札奇后能让其无法动弹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd6fb39-b96e-445f-83db-ee962a3745c5\', \'multiverseId\': 402282}, \'multiverseid\': 402282}, {\'name\': \'開道箭\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有「{2}，{T}：此生物對目標生物造成1點傷害。如果無色生物以此法受到傷害，將它橫置。」佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'晶石的碎片亦稱「開道石」，它接觸到奧札奇後能讓其無法動彈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d8ff8d2-2a90-4bd6-a07a-f0095d2f6928\', \'multiverseId\': 402581}, \'multiverseid\': 402581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lenkdrachenspäher\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Den Wind im Haar, die Sonne im Rücken und die Freude des weiten Himmels … Auch die nächste Generation von Kor soll dieses Gefühl kennenlernen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2001e33c-862e-4c87-a0bd-905f4ffd304a\', \'multiverseId\': 402829}, \'multiverseid\': 402829}, {\'name\': \'Explorador velacometa\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador kor\', \'flavor\': \'"El viento en tus cabellos, el sol en tu espalda, el cielo abierto bajo tus pies... La próxima generación de kor debe conocer esta paz".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edabebcb-45a7-4655-8aa9-b87adaa026c7\', \'multiverseId\': 404922}, \'multiverseid\': 404922}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireur à voile volante\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : kor et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'« Sentir le vent dans ses cheveux, le soleil sur sa peau, le plaisir du grand air... La prochaine génération de kor doit pouvoir connaître cette sensation de paix. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aefc259d-381c-48ca-b8b7-acacf0674fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 403128}, \'multiverseid\': 403128}, {\'name\': \'Esploratore del Velaliante\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Il vento nei capelli, il sole sulla schiena, la gioia dei cieli liberi... La prossima generazione di kor deve conoscere questo tipo di pace."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58552c43-9320-4d83-9e58-5684edc06ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 403427}, \'multiverseid\': 403427}, {\'name\': \'帆凧の斥候\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「風になびく髪。陽光を受ける背中。大空の解放感。次代のコーたちには、こういう平穏を覚えて欲しいものだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f1af0f-11cc-4233-afc3-fd865537cd9e\', \'multiverseId\': 403726}, \'multiverseid\': 403726}, {\'name\': \'연글라이더 정찰병\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'"머리칼을 스치는 바람, 등에 비치는 따스한 햇살, 이것이 바로 하늘을 나는 즐거움 . . . 코르의 후손들에게 이런 평화로움을 물려줘야 해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e0c7c0c-9e36-457f-a773-f9d2ab081e2b\', \'multiverseId\': 404025}, \'multiverseid\': 404025}, {\'name\': \'Batedor Aerovelista\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"O vento no cabelo, o sol nas costas, a alegria do céu aberto... a próxima geração dos kor precisa conhecer esse tipo de paz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cebe66-49a1-40b7-b028-acf036418551\', \'multiverseId\': 404324}, \'multiverseid\': 404324}, {\'name\': \'Кайтсейлер-Разведчик\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'«Ветер в волосах, греющее спину солнце, бескрайний простор небес... Молодые коры должны узнать, что это такое».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13047c89-630c-476b-865b-2db63d74bb4b\', \'multiverseId\': 404623}, \'multiverseid\': 404623}, {\'name\': \'航筝斥候\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「风起发飞扬，旭日晒背膀，长空乐翱翔……必须让寇族的下一代过上这样的和平生活。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8cfb32-7a62-44c2-b167-d7b67bbca388\', \'multiverseId\': 402231}, \'multiverseid\': 402231}, {\'name\': \'航箏斥候\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「風起髮飛揚，旭日曬背膀，長空樂翱翔……必須讓寇族的下一代享有這樣的和平生活。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c394d13b-3aa1-40b2-87fb-eac08740da8c\', \'multiverseId\': 402530}, \'multiverseid\': 402530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Makindi-Murenläufer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht TrampelschadenLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Makindi-Murenläufer +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Nach der Schlacht zerbröselt er das Gestein an den Berghängen, um den nächsten Angriff vorzubereiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00c5d3f-1ca1-445f-8b0d-9e903772eaf3\', \'multiverseId\': 402842}, \'multiverseid\': 402842}, {\'name\': \'Deslizaladeras de Makindi\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Deslizaladeras de Makindi obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Después de una batalla, pulveriza las laderas y las convierte en fragmentos manejables para la próxima vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d1dd82c-68eb-4cd0-88e0-ae354c01d2c3\', \'multiverseId\': 404935}, \'multiverseid\': 404935}, {\'name\': "Coureur d\'avalanche des Makindi", \'text\': "PiétinementToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Coureur d\'avalanche des Makindi gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'Après une bataille, il démolit le flanc des collines pour préparer la prochaine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650a70a0-9e7f-49b0-94b3-d2b97b185f67\', \'multiverseId\': 403141}, \'multiverseid\': 403141}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcafrane di Makindi\', \'text\': \'TravolgereTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Cavalcafrane di Makindi prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo ogni battaglia, rompe i pendii in pezzi più agevoli per prepararsi alla successiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'776afade-40a6-41d0-a4dd-a5972d785d26\', \'multiverseId\': 403440}, \'multiverseid\': 403440}, {\'name\': \'マキンディの滑り駆け\', \'text\': \'トランプル上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、マキンディの滑り駆けは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'戦闘が終わったら、次回に備えて斜面を適当な範囲ごとに分割しておく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a8de78-98c5-4673-b99a-01e41793c966\', \'multiverseId\': 403739}, \'multiverseid\': 403739}, {\'name\': \'마칸디 산사태질주자\', \'text\': \'돌진대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 마칸디 산사태질주자는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'전투가 끝나면 언덕을 적당한 크기로 쪼개서 다음 전투를 대비한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab665826-a398-46e6-89d7-781d07334ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 404038}, \'multiverseid\': 404038}, {\'name\': \'Galopa-avalanche de Makindi\', \'text\': \'AtropelarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Galopa-avalanche de Makindi recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Depois de uma batalha, ele esfrangalha as encostas criando fragmentos menores que serão usados na próxima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ccacb1-4a1c-4853-a2c7-cc21dfd66d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 404337}, \'multiverseid\': 404337}, {\'name\': \'Оползневый Зверь из Макинди\', \'text\': \'Пробивной ударЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Оползневый Зверь из Макинди получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'После окончания схватки он готовится к следующей, на мелкие кусочки разбивая склоны холмов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55fb608-780b-47e1-8432-6193623e54b2\', \'multiverseId\': 404636}, \'multiverseid\': 404636}, {\'name\': \'马钦迪崩袭兽\', \'text\': \'践踏地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，马钦迪崩袭兽得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'战斗过后，它会将山坡碾成碎石，为下一场做准备。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb4eba8-a6e2-4378-934e-0b8c86835ca7\', \'multiverseId\': 402244}, \'multiverseid\': 402244}, {\'name\': \'馬欽迪崩襲獸\', \'text\': \'踐踏地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，馬欽迪崩襲獸得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'戰鬥過後，牠會將山坡碾成碎石，為下一場做準備。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f0f4e0-2b9e-4b14-af12-4f0153650aec\', \'multiverseId\': 402543}, \'multiverseid\': 402543}]', '[{\'name\': \'Makindi-Patrouille\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Makindi-Patrouille oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Zusammen mit seinem edlen Reittier bemerkt er jede Silhouette am Horizont, jeden Geruch in der Luft und jede Erschütterung im Boden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c68118d-63dc-4813-820c-48da3b87e6b4\', \'multiverseId\': 402841}, \'multiverseid\': 402841}, {\'name\': \'Patrulla de Makindi\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que la Patrulla de Makindi u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Sobre su noble montura, percibe cada forma en el horizonte, cada olor en el aire, cada temblor de la tierra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8aa16ce-331c-4023-9356-fe313a3654f0\', \'multiverseId\': 404934}, \'multiverseid\': 404934}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille des Makindi\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que la Patrouille des Makindi ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier et allié\', \'flavor\': "Chevauchant sa noble monture, il remarque la moindre silhouette à l\'horizon, la moindre odeur dans l\'air, le moindre frisson de la terre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dea6375-826d-4d54-bff8-e717d86759e9\', \'multiverseId\': 403140}, \'multiverseid\': 403140}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia di Makindi\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta la Pattuglia di Makindi o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': "Sorveglia in sinergia con la sua nobile cavalcatura, percependo ogni figura all\'orizzonte, ogni odore nell\'aria, ogni tremito della terra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb2eea3-f89b-4475-b780-27d7b23d0cff\', \'multiverseId\': 403439}, \'multiverseid\': 403439}, {\'name\': \'マキンディの巡回兵\', \'text\': \'結集 ― マキンディの巡回兵か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'堂々たる獣に跨り、遥か地平に見える姿、風の匂い、大地の揺れ、そうした一切に気を配る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb97dc9c-188b-40b4-996a-c0b1e12d0b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 403738}, \'multiverseid\': 403738}, {\'name\': \'마칸디 순찰병\', \'text\': \'결집 — 마칸디 순찰병이나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 경계를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'자신의 고귀한 산을 지키며 지평선 위의 모든 형상, 공기 중의 모든 냄새, 땅의 모든 떨림을 하나도 놓치지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3384ded-5207-4123-ab46-a9c9a2e7e94e\', \'multiverseId\': 404037}, \'multiverseid\': 404037}, {\'name\': \'Patrulha de Makindi\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Patrulha de Makindi ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Trabalhando com sua nobre montaria, ele percebe todas as silhuetas no horizonte, todos os aromas no ar, todos os tremores na terra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d5e8d4-1d6a-4b5c-979c-1402d25f7565\', \'multiverseId\': 404336}, \'multiverseid\': 404336}, {\'name\': \'Патрульный из Макинди\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Патрульный из Макинди или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Бдительность до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'На своем благородном скакуне он замечает каждый силуэт на горизонте, каждый запах в воздухе, каждое сотрясение земли.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f75e7c48-9ea9-4d92-a41a-38f46b574903\', \'multiverseId\': 404635}, \'multiverseid\': 404635}, {\'name\': \'马钦迪巡侦员\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当马钦迪巡侦员或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'他与尊贵坐骑一道，警戒着地平线上的熙熙攘攘，空气中的丝丝气息，大地下的阵阵颤动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52a183b-f1a6-415a-ad0d-4c320523fba3\', \'multiverseId\': 402243}, \'multiverseid\': 402243}, {\'name\': \'馬欽迪巡偵員\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當馬欽迪巡偵員或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得警戒異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／騎士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'他與尊貴坐騎一道警戒著地平線上的熙熙攘攘，空氣中的絲絲氣息，大地下的陣陣顫動。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb74cd5-0634-4ee0-930b-6405a8be6bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 402542}, \'multiverseid\': 402542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Malakir-Vertrauter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, TodesberührungImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält der Malakir-Vertraute +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fledermaus\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie sind tödlich und sie sind loyal. Wir können ihnen ein paar Tropfen Blut abgeben."—Harak, Bluthexe aus Malakir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'913aa46d-e736-4bd8-92fa-cbde7a7afff9\', \'multiverseId\': 402843}, \'multiverseid\': 402843}, {\'name\': \'Familiar de Malakir\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal.Siempre que ganes vidas, el Familiar de Malakir obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Murciélago\', \'flavor\': \'"Son letales y fieles. Podemos permitir que nos roben un poco de sangre".—Harak, bruja sangrienta de Malakir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e2b8d6b-d938-4378-b6b7-f06ab13aa64b\', \'multiverseId\': 404936}, \'multiverseid\': 404936}, {\'name\': \'Familier de Malakir\', \'text\': "Vol, contact mortelÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, le Familier de Malakir gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chauve-souris\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils sont meurtriers, et fidèles. Nous pouvons leur réserver un peu de sang. »—Harak, sorcier de sang de Malakir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77455f9c-630b-4bc4-b6a3-6bb26f7680e9\', \'multiverseId\': 403142}, \'multiverseid\': 403142}, {\'name\': \'Famiglio di Malakir\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letaleOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, il Famiglio di Malakir prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pipistrello\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono letali e leali. Possiamo concedere loro un po\\\' di sangue."—Harak, stregone sanguinario di Malakir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf256c9-af5f-45cf-9fab-836e0fb27298\', \'multiverseId\': 403441}, \'multiverseid\': 403441}, {\'name\': \'マラキールの使い魔\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、マラキールの使い魔は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コウモリ\', \'flavor\': \'「とても強くて従順なのよ。血をちょっと残しておいてやればいいの。」――マラキールの血魔女、ハラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b6f189-010d-437b-aa2f-418db37d64e4\', \'multiverseId\': 403740}, \'multiverseid\': 403740}, {\'name\': \'말라키르 소환수\', \'text\': \'비행, 치명타당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 말라키르 소환수는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 박쥐\', \'flavor\': \'"놈들은 치명적인데다가 충성심도 높아. 피 맛 좀 보게 해줘야지."—말라키르 혈마녀 하라크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0888728-e356-437c-82ad-75040f1e340b\', \'multiverseId\': 404039}, \'multiverseid\': 404039}, {\'name\': \'Familiar de Malakir\', \'text\': \'Voar, toque mortífer{T}oda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, Familiar de Malakir recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Morcego\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles são mortíferos e são leais. Podemos dividir um pouco de sangue com eles."— Harak, bruxa sanguinária de Malakir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf1f9845-09da-44eb-b069-ac4401a62abf\', \'multiverseId\': 404338}, \'multiverseid\': 404338}, {\'name\': \'Малакирский Питомец\', \'text\': \'Полет, Смертельное касаниеКаждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, Малакирский Питомец получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Летучая_мышь\', \'flavor\': \'«Они верны нам, и они несут смерть. У нас найдется для них немного крови».— Харак, малакирский колдун крови\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75959658-f4f0-4b6c-ba80-39f96c2939c9\', \'multiverseId\': 404637}, \'multiverseid\': 404637}, {\'name\': \'马拉奇佣兽\', \'text\': \'飞行，死触每当你获得生命时，马拉奇佣兽得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'「它们既致命，又忠诚。我们可以分一点血给它们。」～马拉奇血祭师赫拉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210ed5bf-7ad4-46ff-bd5a-921858d5a6c9\', \'multiverseId\': 402245}, \'multiverseid\': 402245}, {\'name\': \'馬拉奇傭獸\', \'text\': \'飛行，死觸每當你獲得生命時，馬拉奇傭獸得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'「牠們既致命，又忠誠。我們可以分一點血給牠們。」～馬拉奇血祭師赫拉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16984c72-c487-4b92-ac97-44c5e455a870\', \'multiverseId\': 402544}, \'multiverseid\': 402544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Marsch aus der Gruft\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Verbündeter-Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von insgesamt 8 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie kamen aus allen Gesellschaftsschichten, aus allen Ecken Zendikars, und sie kehrten alle vereint aus demselben Grund zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402844&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea610a8-9763-4d02-ae70-fbbbdf9aee93\', \'multiverseId\': 402844}, \'multiverseid\': 402844}, {\'name\': \'Marcha desde la tumba\', \'text\': \'Regresa cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura Aliado objetivo con un coste de maná convertido total de 8 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Vinieron de toda índole, de todos los rincones de Zendikar, y regresaron con una causa que los unificaba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b833bb0-b431-47f6-9858-6f93a3270d61\', \'multiverseId\': 404937}, \'multiverseid\': 404937}, {\'name\': \'Marche sépulcrale\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature Allié ciblées avec un coût converti de mana total inférieur ou égal à 8.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Ils provenaient des quatre coins de Zendikar, de tous milieux, et revenaient servir une cause commune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3825ce75-3346-4f2f-8b26-3162f89063ce\', \'multiverseId\': 403143}, \'multiverseid\': 403143}, {\'name\': \'Marcia dal Sepolcro\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura Alleato bersaglio con costo di mana convertito totale pari o inferiore a 8 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Avevano lasciato vite diverse, in luoghi sparsi per tutto Zendikar, ma tornarono uniti dalla stessa causa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4774d57c-a236-4b56-8f9f-13788097eb20\', \'multiverseId\': 403442}, \'multiverseid\': 403442}, {\'name\': \'墓所からの行進\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地から同盟者・クリーチャー・カードを点数で見たマナ・コストの合計が８以下であるように望む枚数対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカーの至るところから、すべての階層の人々が、１つの共通の大義を掲げ戻ってきた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3e5d1c9-4bdf-42ae-8636-4ef94d391f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 403741}, \'multiverseid\': 403741}, {\'name\': \'무덤으로부터의 행진\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에서 원하는 수의 동맹 생물 카드를 총 전환마나비용이 8 이하가 되도록 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 원하는 수만큼 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'그들은 젠디카르 전역의 각계각층에서 왔으며, 한 가지 대의를 가지고 돌아갔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb391bd-78c3-4454-b9c6-b6665cfbff2f\', \'multiverseId\': 404040}, \'multiverseid\': 404040}, {\'name\': \'Marcha da Tumba\', \'text\': \'Devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha qualquer número de cards de criatura do tipo Aliado alvo com custo de mana convertido total igual ou inferior a 8.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Eles viveram todos os tipos de vida, vieram de todas as partes de Zendikar e voltaram com uma causa a uni-los.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abdce3a4-2637-4f81-84a2-e14a3ed6a0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 404339}, \'multiverseid\': 404339}, {\'name\': \'Марш из Могилы\', \'text\': \'Верните из вашего кладбища на поле битвы любое количество целевых карт существ-Союзников с суммарной конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 8.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Из самых разных слоев общества и из самых разных уголков Зендикара, они вернулись, объединенные одной целью.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6ee319-671a-4167-9368-6de69c7b1724\', \'multiverseId\': 404638}, \'multiverseid\': 404638}, {\'name\': \'墓穴行军\', \'text\': \'将任意数量之目标伙伴生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，且这些牌总法术力费用的总和须等于或小于8。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'他们来自各行各业，出身赞迪卡各地，为了相同的目标归返。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d07bfbc-0885-4af1-b045-3f4da6d1371d\', \'multiverseId\': 402246}, \'multiverseid\': 402246}, {\'name\': \'墓穴行軍\', \'text\': \'將任意數量之目標伙伴生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場，且這些牌總魔法力費用的總和須等於或小於8。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'他們來自各行各業，出身贊迪卡各地，為了相同的目標歸返。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01acd34b-d5e9-4dd9-8106-eebcbea0df04\', \'multiverseId\': 402545}, \'multiverseid\': 402545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meuchler aus Nirkana\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält der Meuchler aus Nirkana Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die er einer Kreatur zufügt, ist ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Assassine, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Meuchler aus Nirkana verwenden ein Gebräu aus Basiliskenmark, Pflanzensaft der Todesweide und Extrakten dutzender anderer Giftpflanzen, gegen das es kein Heilmittel gibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cdbaac6-d981-4724-8c6e-728ecfee158a\', \'multiverseId\': 402865}, \'multiverseid\': 402865}, {\'name\': \'Asesino Nirkana\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, el Asesino Nirkana gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Los asesinos Nirkana crean unos mejunjes letales mezclando médula de basilisco y savia de sauce mortal con los fluidos de una docena de especies venenosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bc08afc-8391-4c11-86e4-403a9a35fd5f\', \'multiverseId\': 404958}, \'multiverseid\': 404958}, {\'name\': \'Assassin des Nirkana\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, l\'Assassin des Nirkana acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Le nombre de blessures qu\'il inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et assassin et allié\', \'flavor\': "Les assassins des Nirkana concoctent des poisons incurables en infusant de la moelle de basilic et de la sève de saule tueur dans les fluides vitaux d\'une dizaine d\'autres espèces venimeuses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02bbe41c-9387-49b3-a305-19e3bdc2d194\', \'multiverseId\': 403164}, \'multiverseid\': 403164}, {\'name\': \'Assassino Nirkana\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, l\'Assassino Nirkana ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno. (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Assassino Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Gli assassini Nirkana creano tinture letali mischiando midollo di basilisco e linfa di salice mortale con i fluidi vitali di una dozzina di altre specie velenose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbf3d264-6999-4ecc-99d2-0036f888adfc\', \'multiverseId\': 403463}, \'multiverseid\': 403463}, {\'name\': \'ニルカーナの暗殺者\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、ニルカーナの暗殺者は接死を得る。（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・暗殺者・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'ニルカーナの暗殺者は、バジリスクの髄液とドクヤナギの樹液に10種類以上の有毒生物から採った致死成分を加え、治癒不能な薬物を調製する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bad5975-84e9-4ede-8d1e-49c597705d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 403762}, \'multiverseid\': 403762}, {\'name\': \'니르카나 암살자\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 니르카나 암살자는 턴종료까지 치명타를 얻는다. (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 암살자 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'니르카나 암살자는 바실리스크 골수와 죽음버드나무 진액을 수십 종의 다른 독성 생물의 체액과 섞어 치명적인 독액을 제조한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a269c75-4a19-4bbc-9176-76474e936a77\', \'multiverseId\': 404061}, \'multiverseid\': 404061}, {\'name\': \'Assassino Nirkana\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, Assassino Nirkana ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno. (Qualquer quantidade de dano que ele cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Assassino Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Os assassinos Nirkana criam misturas incuráveis combinando medula de basilisco e seiva de salgueiro-da-morte com os fluidos vitais de uma dúzia de outras espécies venenosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb9623a-6fd4-450c-9499-1ca74ad4adc7\', \'multiverseId\': 404360}, \'multiverseid\': 404360}, {\'name\': \'Убийца из Рода Ниркана\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, Убийца из Рода Ниркана получает Смертельное касание до конца хода. (Любое количество повреждений, которое он наносит существу, достаточно для того, чтобы его уничтожить.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Убийца Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Убийцы из рода Ниркана делают зелья, от которых нет противоядия. Они смешивают костный мозг василиска и сок ивы смерти с жидкостями, добытыми из десятка других ядовитых существ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fabfdc42-0f93-4b56-9d62-1f7b884214d8\', \'multiverseId\': 404659}, \'multiverseid\': 404659}, {\'name\': \'涅卡那杀手\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，涅卡那杀手获得死触异能直到回合结束。（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／杀手／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'涅卡那杀手将蜥怪骨髓与毒柳树液和其他有毒物种的体液混合，制成了无解的毒药合剂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4082b990-564e-42e2-82f5-adc72799819a\', \'multiverseId\': 402267}, \'multiverseid\': 402267}, {\'name\': \'涅卡那殺手\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，涅卡那殺手獲得死觸異能直到回合結束。（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／殺手／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'涅卡那殺手將蜥怪骨髓與毒柳樹液和其他有毒物種的體液混合，製成了無解的毒藥合劑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'621d9a5d-8c4e-42f5-b164-e179431052a3\', \'multiverseId\': 402566}, \'multiverseid\': 402566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Munda, Guerillaführer\', \'text\': \'EileZusammenkunft — Immer wenn Munda, Guerillaführer, oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek anschauen. Falls du dies tust, zeige eine beliebige Anzahl an Verbündeter-Karten darunter offen vor. Lege dann diese Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Kor, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6575051-f22a-4131-96d3-96f55b9d7143\', \'multiverseId\': 402860}, \'multiverseid\': 402860}, {\'name\': \'Munda, líder de la emboscada\', \'text\': \'Prisa.Alianza — Siempre que Munda, líder de la emboscada u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes mirar las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Si lo haces, muestra cualquier cantidad de cartas de Aliado que se encuentren entre ellas y luego pon esas cartas en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden y el resto en el fondo en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Aliado kor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d53a8e5d-c180-45ff-b2ba-ed253eb8bfa2\', \'multiverseId\': 404953}, \'multiverseid\': 404953}, {\'name\': "Munda, chef d\'embuscade", \'text\': "CéléritéRalliement — À chaque fois que Munda, chef d\'embuscade ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez regarder les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si vous faites ainsi, révélez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'allié parmi elles, puis mettez ces cartes au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix et le reste, au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kor et allié\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780abc17-6231-49e3-9278-15d2d017c808\', \'multiverseId\': 403159}, \'multiverseid\': 403159}, {\'name\': "Munda, Capo dell\'Agguato", \'text\': "RapiditàRadunare — Ogniqualvolta Munda, Capo dell\'Agguato o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi guardare le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Se lo fai, rivela un qualsiasi numero di carte Alleato scelte tra esse, poi metti quelle carte in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Kor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c369d110-e104-4358-8e11-38c22ca2417f\', \'multiverseId\': 403458}, \'multiverseid\': 403458}, {\'name\': \'待ち伏せ隊長、ムンダ\', \'text\': \'速攻結集 ― 待ち伏せ隊長、ムンダか他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを見てもよい。そうしたなら、その中から同盟者・カードを望む枚数公開し、それらのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で、残りを一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — コー・同盟者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b4f306b-3a36-47e0-99cd-9ba5266ec56c\', \'multiverseId\': 403757}, \'multiverseid\': 403757}, {\'name\': \'매복조 대장 문다\', \'text\': \'신속결집 — 매복조 대장 문다나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 볼 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 중에서 동맹 카드를 원하는 수만큼 공개한 다음, 그 카드들을 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서로 놓고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 코르 동맹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa28592-6ce2-4cfc-9032-176b247fc866\', \'multiverseId\': 404056}, \'multiverseid\': 404056}, {\'name\': \'Munda, Líder de Emboscadas\', \'text\': \'Ímpet{R}eunir — Toda vez que Munda, Líder de Emboscadas, ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode olhar os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Se fizer isso, revele qualquer número de cards do tipo Aliado dentre eles e coloque-os no topo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem. Coloque os restantes no fundo em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Kor Aliado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9abf1954-a933-4044-b8f0-87d7bec6ab7a\', \'multiverseId\': 404355}, \'multiverseid\': 404355}, {\'name\': \'Мунда, Командир Засады\', \'text\': \'УскорениеСплочение — Каждый раз, когда Мунда, Командир Засады или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете посмотреть четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Если вы это делаете, покажите любое количество находящихся среди них карт Союзников, затем положите те карты на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке, а остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кор Союзник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f4265a-66a8-4b31-a1d3-e81ac05e30ab\', \'multiverseId\': 404654}, \'multiverseid\': 404654}, {\'name\': \'伏击领袖蒙达\', \'text\': \'敏捷奋扬～每当伏击领袖蒙达或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，你可以检视你牌库顶的四张牌。若你如此作，展示其中任意数量的伙伴牌，然后将这些牌以任意顺序置于你牌库顶，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～寇族／伙伴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21d9f99b-ae49-465b-99fc-b87528d5718e\', \'multiverseId\': 402262}, \'multiverseid\': 402262}, {\'name\': \'伏擊領袖蒙達\', \'text\': \'敏捷奮揚～每當伏擊領袖蒙達或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。若你如此作，展示其中任意數量的伙伴牌，然後將這些牌以任意順序置於你牌庫頂，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～寇族／伙伴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0781c191-cf9f-4f23-8702-2752a344bd96\', \'multiverseId\': 402561}, \'multiverseid\': 402561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Naturverbundenheit\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zendikar wird nicht aufgeben und wir genauso wenig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c6d5fc-d070-4276-97f9-7b857ade0378\', \'multiverseId\': 402863}, \'multiverseid\': 402863}, {\'name\': \'Conexión natural\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar no se rendirá, y nosotros tampoco".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7114fe4f-4797-4035-9d79-6e9661cd8b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 404956}, \'multiverseid\': 404956}, {\'name\': \'Connexion naturelle\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Zendikar ne capitulera pas, et nous non plus. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66192c29-4ee6-4fc8-a11b-478deeb4035d\', \'multiverseId\': 403162}, \'multiverseid\': 403162}, {\'name\': \'Legame Naturale\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar non si arrenderà e nemmeno noi possiamo farlo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d13d7c-ab62-4297-853a-947915fa85a3\', \'multiverseId\': 403461}, \'multiverseid\': 403461}, {\'name\': \'自然の繋がり\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーはあきらめないわ。私たちもよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f51392f-779a-4450-ac7d-0e7903dcc7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 403760}, \'multiverseid\': 403760}, {\'name\': \'자연적 연결\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드를 찾아 그 카드를 전장에 탭된 채로 놓는다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르는 굴복하지 않을 거야. 그건 우리도 마찬가지고."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d04b10-d4d3-468d-b86e-66559e87b934\', \'multiverseId\': 404059}, \'multiverseid\': 404059}, {\'name\': \'Conexão Natural\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar não se renderá. Também não podemos nos render."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f608aed0-17f7-406a-8ea2-0dfc17ad677b\', \'multiverseId\': 404358}, \'multiverseid\': 404358}, {\'name\': \'Природная Связь\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Зендикар не сдается. Не сдадимся и мы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e23d698-5371-4a77-a5a5-6ee5b15ac680\', \'multiverseId\': 404657}, \'multiverseid\': 404657}, {\'name\': \'自然联系\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「赞迪卡绝不投降，我们也不会。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf55f71-e5ec-4da2-a551-aa785899cf4f\', \'multiverseId\': 402265}, \'multiverseid\': 402265}, {\'name\': \'自然聯繫\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「贊迪卡絕不投降，我們也不會。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222f7c73-22bf-4de4-a72f-a8bbbccd7596\', \'multiverseId\': 402564}, \'multiverseid\': 402564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nebel-Eindringling\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)FliegendZehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ödnis breitet sich so schnell aus wie der Wind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79e2cf2a-8982-4d7c-b6af-37855848caf6\', \'multiverseId\': 402847}, \'multiverseid\': 402847}, {\'name\': \'Intruso de la niebla\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Vuela.Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'La desolación se extiende tan rápido como el viento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e939b5d2-902d-494b-8100-edca38693bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 404940}, \'multiverseid\': 404940}, {\'name\': \'Intrus des brumes\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)VolIngestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': \'La ruine se propage aussi vite que le vent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a1a5d1-6c81-4c11-bad5-fba0617ea1c0\', \'multiverseId\': 403146}, \'multiverseid\': 403146}, {\'name\': \'Invasore delle Brume\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)VolareIngerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Le distese desolate si diffondono veloci quanto il vento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad22d938-7141-47a5-8d86-ac61772b120e\', \'multiverseId\': 403445}, \'multiverseid\': 403445}, {\'name\': \'霧の侵入者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）飛行嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'風のごとく瞬く間に荒廃は拡がる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfc5cf0-2f96-45d5-8861-2993eabf36b1\', \'multiverseId\': 403744}, \'multiverseid\': 403744}, {\'name\': \'안개 침입자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)비행섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'황무지는 바람처럼 빨리 퍼져나간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cfebcdf-c334-4d7c-824f-f80f050f91e9\', \'multiverseId\': 404043}, \'multiverseid\': 404043}, {\'name\': \'Intruso da Névoa\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)VoarIngerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'A desolação se espalha rápido como o vento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5322cf76-6a0e-4572-b016-ef356dd1b120\', \'multiverseId\': 404342}, \'multiverseid\': 404342}, {\'name\': \'Туманный Захватчик\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)ПолетЗаглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Опустошение разносится так же быстро, как ветер.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def15eb2-e3b3-4180-af4d-060716a8daa9\', \'multiverseId\': 404641}, \'multiverseid\': 404641}, {\'name\': \'迷雾侵体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）飞行摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'荒芜如疾风般飞速蔓延。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26da0f04-3da0-4761-af22-7b532c98ca2b\', \'multiverseId\': 402249}, \'multiverseid\': 402249}, {\'name\': \'迷霧侵體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）飛行攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'荒漠如疾風般迅速蔓延。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6348bc13-c695-44d1-8a71-2cc3dfe315c6\', \'multiverseId\': 402548}, \'multiverseid\': 402548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nesseldrohne\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.){T}: Die Nesseldrohne fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.Immer wenn du einen farblosen Zauberspruch wirkst, enttappe die Nesseldrohne.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8d2fd9-fbdd-4dca-90de-a7d1aa995b01\', \'multiverseId\': 402864}, \'multiverseid\': 402864}, {\'name\': \'Zángano urticante\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.){T}: El Zángano urticante hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.Siempre que lances un hechizo incoloro, endereza el Zángano urticante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71868bdc-d6a8-41d3-9087-84223ba6deab\', \'multiverseId\': 404957}, \'multiverseid\': 404957}, {\'name\': \'Drone lamier\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.){T} : Le Drone lamier inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort incolore, dégagez le Drone lamier.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31295554-fd4b-4b23-8f4c-bde7317be812\', \'multiverseId\': 403163}, \'multiverseid\': 403163}, {\'name\': \'Parassita dagli Aculei\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.){T}: Il Parassita dagli Aculei infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incolore, STAPpa il Parassita dagli Aculei.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f340d49-ef77-41c6-b006-adea43d0c52c\', \'multiverseId\': 403462}, \'multiverseid\': 403462}, {\'name\': \'棘撃ちドローン\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）{T}：棘撃ちドローンは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。あなたが無色の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、棘撃ちドローンをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab271f9-cab8-444e-966b-f1cd560f538f\', \'multiverseId\': 403761}, \'multiverseid\': 403761}, {\'name\': \'쐐기 드론\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.){T}: 쐐기 드론은 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.당신이 무색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 쐐기 드론을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdec7713-de59-42ab-a402-2e67cf60ebae\', \'multiverseId\': 404060}, \'multiverseid\': 404060}, {\'name\': \'Zangão Espinhoso\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.){T}: Zangão espinhoso causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica incolor, desvire Zangão Espinhoso.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3aa4dc6-1441-4d9e-9f58-381dbd39f71f\', \'multiverseId\': 404359}, \'multiverseid\': 404359}, {\'name\': \'Колкий Дрон\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.){T}: Колкий Дрон наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете бесцветное заклинание, разверните Колкого Дрона.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a71d9c2-793c-413b-ae89-7f712801aa95\', \'multiverseId\': 404658}, \'multiverseid\': 404658}, {\'name\': \'荨麻奴兽\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）{T}：荨麻奴兽向每位对手各造成1点伤害。每当你施放无色咒语时，重置荨麻奴兽。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'012ed012-7d69-4e18-a0e9-6209687d7110\', \'multiverseId\': 402266}, \'multiverseid\': 402266}, {\'name\': \'蕁麻奴獸\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）{T}：蕁麻奴獸向每位對手各造成1點傷害。每當你施放無色咒語時，重置蕁麻奴獸。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d88b8ad-7390-46c2-9ab2-fbc1bcc8b582\', \'multiverseId\': 402565}, \'multiverseid\': 402565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nissas Erneuerung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Du erhältst 7 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem sie wieder mit der Welt verbunden war, spürte Nissa, wie Zendikars Macht sie durchströmte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44929aa1-df02-42c7-ba14-90bcbb761621\', \'multiverseId\': 402866}, \'multiverseid\': 402866}, {\'name\': \'Renovación de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Ganas 7 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una vez restablecida su conexión con el plano, Nissa sintió que el poder de Zendikar vibraba a través de ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3188b31f-9e49-45cf-b88d-1be34276e919\', \'multiverseId\': 404959}, \'multiverseid\': 404959}, {\'name\': \'Renouveau de Nissa\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez votre bibliothèque. Vous gagnez 7 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'De nouveau connectée au plan, Nissa sentit la puissance de Zendikar déferler en elle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89eeaae6-e689-461f-8e5d-20e6feb3582a\', \'multiverseId\': 403165}, \'multiverseid\': 403165}, {\'name\': \'Rinnovamento di Nissa\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Guadagni 7 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo aver recuperato il suo legame con il piano, Nissa sentì il potere di Zendikar crescere dentro di lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a5b2848-4aa2-4785-95e8-69c9f2ce96a3\', \'multiverseId\': 403464}, \'multiverseid\': 403464}, {\'name\': \'ニッサの復興\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを最大３枚探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。あなたは７点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼女と次元の繋がりが回復し、ゼンディカーの活力が自身を通じて湧き出すのをニッサは感じた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f129cccb-c791-4376-883d-cad5c4efff8d\', \'multiverseId\': 403763}, \'multiverseid\': 403763}, {\'name\': \'니사의 회생\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드를 최대 세 장까지 찾아 탭된 채로 전장에 놓은 다음 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 당신은 생명 7점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'차원에 대한 연결이 복원되자 니사는 젠디카르의 힘이 그녀를 통해 솟구치는 걸 느꼈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5dfb88-bf49-473e-8992-0fb927237a42\', \'multiverseId\': 404062}, \'multiverseid\': 404062}, {\'name\': \'Renovação de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Procure até três cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Você ganha 7 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Com sua ligação com o plano restaurada, Nissa sentiu o poder de Zendikar invadi-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c68d73-34d1-4089-a245-9b4869471491\', \'multiverseId\': 404361}, \'multiverseid\': 404361}, {\'name\': \'Обновление Ниссы\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более трех карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы получаете 7 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Нисса чувствовала, как течет через нее сила Зендикара. Ее связь с землей восстановилась.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b11678f-d79c-4c87-81b5-6f1848afd884\', \'multiverseId\': 404660}, \'multiverseid\': 404660}, {\'name\': \'妮莎重光\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。你获得7点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'妮莎恢复与赞迪卡的联系之后，她感受到时空力量在她全身翻腾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'219f50b8-10c1-48b4-a109-4b6986c6d160\', \'multiverseId\': 402268}, \'multiverseid\': 402268}, {\'name\': \'妮莎重光\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多三張基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。你獲得7點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'妮莎恢復與贊迪卡的聯繫之後，她感受到時空力量在她全身翻騰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'588f4e59-d2a3-4986-a45f-e7e67e8f2241\', \'multiverseId\': 402567}, \'multiverseid\': 402567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Noyan Dar, Turbulenzformer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, kannst du drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl legen, das du kontrollierst. Falls du dies tust, wird das Land zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Nach vielen Jahren als Ruhezauberer, in denen Noyan Dar den Zorn Zendikars bändigte, widmet er sich nun der viel einfacheren Aufgabe, diesen Zorn zu schüren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46276c63-7b21-4187-948f-a35f4c4e55cb\', \'multiverseId\': 402867}, \'multiverseid\': 402867}, {\'name\': \'Noyan Dar, agitador de la Turbulencia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, puedes poner tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas. Si lo haces, esa tierra se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa que sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Tritón aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Después de muchos años como mago arrullador, Noyan Dar dejó de intentar apaciguar la furia de Zendikar y se centró en la tarea, mucho más sencilla, de avivarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8804a302-d018-4484-86c9-995b1bd3e62c\', \'multiverseId\': 404960}, \'multiverseid\': 404960}, {\'name\': \'Noyan Dar, forgeur du Roulis\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez mettre trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, ce terrain devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité qui est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et allié\', \'flavor\': \'Après des années à avoir été un ataraxmage cherchant à apaiser la fureur de Zendikar, Noyan Dar consacra son talent au contraire à la provoquer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd54c801-2246-4494-a9b8-5c2b8a00bb9b\', \'multiverseId\': 403166}, \'multiverseid\': 403166}, {\'name\': \'Noyan Dar, Plasmatore del Torbido\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi mettere tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli. Se lo fai, quella terra diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità che è ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo molti anni come mitigatore, Noyan Dar passò a utilizzare i suoi talenti non più per placare la furia di Zendikar, ma per il compito notevolmente più semplice di suscitarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258eb91b-ab6e-4fde-88c9-8aeaa559c51d\', \'multiverseId\': 403465}, \'multiverseid\': 403465}, {\'name\': \'乱動を刻む者、ノヤン・ダール\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタント・呪文１つかソーサリー・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。あなたはそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置いてもよい。そうしたなら、その土地は速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'凪魔道士として長年働いたノヤン・ダールは、ゼンディカーの怒りを鎮めるのではなく喚起するという、ずっと簡単な仕事に転じた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d79ae96-c6f7-4815-836f-f85d41c82c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 403764}, \'multiverseid\': 403764}, {\'name\': \'탁류 변형사 노얀 다르\', \'text\': \'당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 올려놓을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 되며, 여전히 대지이다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인어 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'미풍마도사로 지낸 지 수년 후 노얀 다르는 젠디카르의 분노를 누그러뜨리는 것이 아닌 분노를 불러일으키는 쪽에 그의 능력을 쏟았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'677abbc2-2559-4764-84ff-648327b406f3\', \'multiverseId\': 404063}, \'multiverseid\': 404063}, {\'name\': \'Noyan Dar, Moldador do Turbilhão\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou feitiço, você pode colocar três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla. Se fizer isso, aquele terreno se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto que ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Depois de muitos anos como mago anulador, Noyan Dar redirecionou seus talentos da mitigação da fúria de Zendikar para a tarefa consideravelmente mais fácil de instigá-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea57a8b-3cd5-4a24-930e-4f70095242b8\', \'multiverseId\': 404362}, \'multiverseid\': 404362}, {\'name\': \'Нойен Дар, Маг Великого Вала\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, вы можете положить три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем. Если вы это делаете, та земля становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением, которое при этом остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Мерфолк Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Много лет пробыв магом-баюном, Нойен Дар направил свой талант с усмирения ярости Зендикара на намного более простую задачу ее раззадоривания.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f418635-a34d-49dc-8ad6-a383ca0497cb\', \'multiverseId\': 404661}, \'multiverseid\': 404661}, {\'name\': \'狂搅塑形师诺言达\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，你可以在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物。若你如此作，则该地成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物，且仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人鱼／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'诺言达曾任息法师多年，原本致力于平息赞迪卡怒火的他，如今已转而设法令其激扬～而这要简单得多。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a53401a7-079a-40de-88ca-743a5d9cc3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 402269}, \'multiverseid\': 402269}, {\'name\': \'狂攪塑形師諾言達\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，你可以在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物。若你如此作，則該地成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物，且仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～人魚／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'諾言達曾任息法師多年，原本致力於平息贊迪卡怒火的他，如今已轉而設法令其激揚～而這要簡單得多。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5debe9-5a18-4fe7-bd70-cdf1cf9645ea\', \'multiverseId\': 402568}, \'multiverseid\': 402568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis der Wiederentflammte\', \'text\': \'+1: Du ziehst eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.−3: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.−8: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl erhält ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Spieler eine Karte zieht, verlierst du 2 Lebenspunkte."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23e02bb-6a5f-43b9-879a-2262560aeee4\', \'multiverseId\': 402868}, \'multiverseid\': 402868}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis reavivado\', \'text\': \'+1: Robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.-3: Destruye la criatura objetivo.−8: El oponente objetivo obtiene un emblema con "Siempre que un jugador robe una carta, pierdes 2 vidas".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32caca06-d8dc-453c-81e0-a796c36d2a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 404961}, \'multiverseid\': 404961}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis ravivé\', \'text\': "+1 : Vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.−3 : Détruisez la créature ciblée.−8 : L\'adversaire ciblé gagne un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un joueur pioche une carte, vous perdez 2 points de vie. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb654af-6f1d-4c91-981f-f21d73f72e5d\', \'multiverseId\': 403167}, \'multiverseid\': 403167}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis della Fiamma Rinnovata\', \'text\': \'+1: Pesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.−3: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.−8: Un avversario bersaglio ottiene un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta un giocatore pesca una carta, perdi 2 punti vita".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de3c0f4-0bc0-41f9-b5a3-9bdc311ed76d\', \'multiverseId\': 403466}, \'multiverseid\': 403466}, {\'name\': \'灯の再覚醒、オブ・ニクシリス\', \'text\': \'＋１：あなたはカードを１枚引き、１点のライフを失う。－３：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。－８：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「プレイヤー１人がカードを１枚引くたび、あなたは２点のライフを失う。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — ニクシリス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c07c0a-a287-4fb6-8b49-a46fe96390c5\', \'multiverseId\': 403765}, \'multiverseid\': 403765}, {\'name\': \'다시 각성한 오브 닉실리스\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.-3: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.−8: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 "플레이어가 카드를 뽑을 때마다, 당신은 생명 2점을 잃는다."를 가진 휘장을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 닉실리스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775b52ea-f48c-4e2b-b4b0-c2b77f3cf9de\', \'multiverseId\': 404064}, \'multiverseid\': 404064}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis Reaceso\', \'text\': \'+1: Você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.-3: Destrua a criatura alvo.-8: O oponente alvo recebe um emblema com: "Toda vez que um jogador compra um card, você perde 2 pontos de vida."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ce80b9-5735-4450-849f-1fddcb8523d8\', \'multiverseId\': 404363}, \'multiverseid\': 404363}, {\'name\': \'Об-Никсилис, Вспыхнувший Вновь\', \'text\': \'+1: вы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.−3: уничтожьте целевое существо.−8: целевой оппонент получает эмблему со способностью «Каждый раз, когда игрок берет карту, вы теряете 2 жизни».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Никсилис\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e92043c-ede6-4cff-92ec-e1d68b9e953d\', \'multiverseId\': 404662}, \'multiverseid\': 404662}, {\'name\': \'火花重燃的欧尼希兹\', \'text\': \'+1：你抓一张牌且你失去1点生命。−3：消灭目标生物。−8：目标对手获得具有「每当一位牌手抓一张牌时，你失去2点生命」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～尼希兹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff39a48-94f5-4350-83dd-a49c003df67c\', \'multiverseId\': 402270}, \'multiverseid\': 402270}, {\'name\': \'火花再燃的歐尼希茲\', \'text\': \'+1：你抽一張牌且你失去1點生命。-3：消滅目標生物。-8：目標對手獲得具有「每當一位玩家抽一張牌時，你失去2點生命」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～尼希茲\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb36d8df-5298-441e-9b8c-ace5a32c5331\', \'multiverseId\': 402569}, \'multiverseid\': 402569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Omnath, der Sammelpunkt des Zorns\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 5/5 roten und grünen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.Immer wenn Omnath, der Sammelpunkt des Zorns, oder ein anderes Elementarwesen, das du kontrollierst, stirbt, fügt Omnath einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b1588cc-e07c-4d9c-99cb-709f7d0a8b46\', \'multiverseId\': 402870}, \'multiverseid\': 402870}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, centro de la ira\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Elemental roja y verde 5/5.Siempre que Omnath, centro de la ira u otro Elemental que controlas muera, Omnath hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4d72d0-9477-4652-88f2-ecd1aaa65b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 404963}, \'multiverseid\': 404963}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, Locus de rage\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge et verte Élémental.À chaque fois qu\'Omnath, Locus de rage ou qu\'un autre élémental que vous contrôlez meurt, Omnath inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f4e3c1-7149-43e8-9bf0-8d67926939dc\', \'multiverseId\': 403169}, \'multiverseid\': 403169}, {\'name\': "Omnath, l\'Iralocus", \'text\': "Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Elementale 5/5 rossa e verde.Ogniqualvolta Omnath, l\'Iralocus o un altro Elementale che controlli muoiono, Omnath infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a59d5b6a-f4f4-4c0c-80ea-e095a620968e\', \'multiverseId\': 403468}, \'multiverseid\': 403468}, {\'name\': \'怒りの座、オムナス\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、赤であり緑である５/５のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。怒りの座、オムナスかあなたがコントロールする他のエレメンタルが１体死亡するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。怒りの座、オムナスはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b140b21-69e4-4384-818d-bc079cf106c8\', \'multiverseId\': 403767}, \'multiverseid\': 403767}, {\'name\': \'분노의 원천 옴나스\', \'text\': \'대지력 —대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 적색이며 녹색인 5/5 정령 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.분노의 원천 옴나스 또는 당신이 조종하는 다른 정령이 죽을 때마다, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 옴나스는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cedcdb11-62d9-4f44-ad93-a0f88c73a29a\', \'multiverseId\': 404066}, \'multiverseid\': 404066}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, Locus de Fúria\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura vermelha e verde 5/5 do tipo Elemental.Toda vez que Omnath, Locus de Fúria, ou outro Elemental que você controla morre, Omnath causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfdac2a1-80a7-433d-9c6e-5e7caa7e0e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 404365}, \'multiverseid\': 404365}, {\'name\': \'Омнат, Очаг Ярости\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 5/5 красный и зеленый Элементаль.Каждый раз, когда Омнат, Очаг Ярости или другой Элементаль под вашим контролем умирает, Омнат наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b32887-5b69-4a5a-b29a-344d2e153c87\', \'multiverseId\': 404664}, \'multiverseid\': 404664}, {\'name\': \'怒火核欧那斯\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，将一个5/5红绿双色元素衍生生物放进战场。每当怒火核欧那斯或另一个由你操控的元素死去时，欧那斯对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4a4cb4-5ae3-42d8-999a-5911643e9352\', \'multiverseId\': 402272}, \'multiverseid\': 402272}, {\'name\': \'怒火核歐那斯\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，將一個5/5紅綠雙色元素衍生生物放進戰場。每當怒火核歐那斯或另一個由你操控的元素死去時，歐那斯對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0486dafa-ce3c-41b7-9dfa-dedaaec07d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 402571}, \'multiverseid\': 402571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ondu-Champion\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn der Ondu-Champion oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass einen Minotaurus an der Spitze deiner Armee marschieren und plötzlich verhalten sich alle Soldaten so, als hätten sie Hörner."—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402871&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d600246c-3d5e-4c15-81b6-e147b8283179\', \'multiverseId\': 402871}, \'multiverseid\': 402871}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Campeón de Ondu u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Pon un minotauro al frente de un ejército y, de pronto, todos los soldados actuarán como si tuvieran cuernos".—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d73b8b-17dc-4a84-b83d-c33cd93e538d\', \'multiverseId\': 404964}, \'multiverseid\': 404964}, {\'name\': \'Champion du Ondou\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que le Champion du Ondou ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Placez un minotaure à la tête d\'une armée et tous les soldats agiront soudain comme s\'ils avaient des cornes. »—Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb31715-0a5e-4a46-b0b5-0d5a7406e197\', \'multiverseId\': 403170}, \'multiverseid\': 403170}, {\'name\': \'Campione di Ondu\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta il Campione di Ondu o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Metti un minotauro a capo di un esercito e improvvisamente tutti i soldati si comportano come se avessero le corna."—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00e0c6c-13e5-453a-86cd-7f6298ed97c6\', \'multiverseId\': 403469}, \'multiverseid\': 403469}, {\'name\': \'オンドゥの勇者\', \'text\': \'結集 ― オンドゥの勇者か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「ミノタウルスを部隊の先頭に配置すれば、兵士はみな角があるような働きをする。」――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c144922-4e28-452d-b2d9-7d786b2b528e\', \'multiverseId\': 403768}, \'multiverseid\': 403768}, {\'name\': \'온두 투사\', \'text\': \'결집 — 온두 투사나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"군대의 선두에 미노타우로스를 배치하면 모든 병사의 사기가 급격히 올라간다."—기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ccb3bf-2a1f-43bd-9668-104163d47f95\', \'multiverseId\': 404067}, \'multiverseid\': 404067}, {\'name\': \'Campeão de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Campeão de Ondu ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Basta pôr um minotauro na frente de um exército para que, de repente, todos os soldados ajam como se tivessem chifres."— Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee21ecf8-6d88-474b-8679-84c9c4ab0d57\', \'multiverseId\': 404366}, \'multiverseid\': 404366}, {\'name\': \'Поборник из Онду\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Поборник из Онду или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Поставь минотавра во главе армии, и все солдаты начинают сражаться так, будто у них есть рога».— Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7dbd0e-64f0-4ad4-bac0-eeec6b51dca3\', \'multiverseId\': 404665}, \'multiverseid\': 404665}, {\'name\': \'昂度斗士\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当昂度斗士或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「让牛头怪来指挥军队，你会发现每名战士都像是头上长出了双角。」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5de7ee-f81c-419c-9cc2-47c31d40ddae\', \'multiverseId\': 402273}, \'multiverseid\': 402273}, {\'name\': \'昂度鬥士\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當昂度鬥士或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「讓牛頭怪來指揮軍隊，你會發現每名戰士都像是頭上長出了雙角。」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20875e85-b09c-496f-942a-c3e15e8ad844\', \'multiverseId\': 402572}, \'multiverseid\': 402572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ondu-Großhorn\', \'text\': \'ErstschlagLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält das Ondu-Großhorn +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Mögen deine Hörner ihren Weg in die knochige Fratze eines Eldrazi finden, zänkische Bestie!"—Bruse Tarl, Nomade aus Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcec4192-543f-4dfc-9e3e-b748b302baec\', \'multiverseId\': 402872}, \'multiverseid\': 402872}, {\'name\': \'Grancuerno de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Grancuerno de Ondu obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Ojalá acabes con los cuernos atrapados en el rostro huesudo de un Eldrazi, bestia malhumorada!".—Bruse Tarl, nómada de Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c23c075-35b3-4ba4-abc8-55f197e66c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 404965}, \'multiverseid\': 404965}, {\'name\': \'Grandcorne du Ondou\', \'text\': "InitiativeToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Grandcorne du Ondou gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "« Puisse tes cornes s\'enfoncer dans le visage décharné d\'un Eldrazi, vilaine brute ! »—Bruse Tarl, nomade de Goma Fada", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dea2196-fdb6-405d-8009-cac35648ef04\', \'multiverseId\': 403171}, \'multiverseid\': 403171}, {\'name\': \'Corno Possente di Ondu\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvvis{T}erraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Corno Possente di Ondu prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Possano le tue corna conficcarsi nel muso ossuto di un Eldrazi, bestiaccia irascibile!"—Bruse Tarl, nomade di Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde86de2-7473-4d0c-999f-3a60683c48e8\', \'multiverseId\': 403470}, \'multiverseid\': 403470}, {\'name\': \'オンドゥの大角\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、オンドゥの大角は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「怒れる野獣よ、お前の角がエルドラージの骨ばった顔を打ち倒しますように！」――ゴーマ・ファーダの遊牧民、ブルース・タール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bac66db-710b-4a6f-bb3e-c9ade86d92cb\', \'multiverseId\': 403769}, \'multiverseid\': 403769}, {\'name\': \'온두 큰뿔황소\', \'text\': \'선제공격대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 온두 큰뿔황소는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'"이 성질 고약한 녀석, 네 뿔이 엘드라지의 깡마른 얼굴에 확 박혀 버렸으면!"—고마 파다 유목민 브루스 타를\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd8eb0e-d6ef-4eae-89f8-2ccb9293a2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 404068}, \'multiverseid\': 404068}, {\'name\': \'Megacórneo de Ondu\', \'text\': \'IniciativaAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Megacórneo de Ondu recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Que seus chifres se enterrem na cara ossuda de um Eldrazi, brutamontes turrão!"— Bruse Tarl, nômade de Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e2bd62-d973-42dd-9f09-0f244b5ed754\', \'multiverseId\': 404367}, \'multiverseid\': 404367}, {\'name\': \'Большерог из Онду\', \'text\': \'Первый ударЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Большерог из Онду получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Чтоб твои рога застряли в костяном лице Эльдрази, злобная ты тварь!»— Бруз Тарл, кочевник из Гома-Фада\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf86304b-f9d9-42b5-9fe8-1ea68ab4b2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 404666}, \'multiverseid\': 404666}, {\'name\': \'昂度巨角兽\', \'text\': \'先攻地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，昂度巨角兽得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「坏脾气的野兽啊，愿你巨角就此卡在奥札奇狰狞脸孔之中！」～哥马法达游牧人布斯陶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738ee1bc-6b4f-449b-bb6e-9f90456fb8df\', \'multiverseId\': 402274}, \'multiverseid\': 402274}, {\'name\': \'昂度巨角獸\', \'text\': \'先攻地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，昂度巨角獸得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'「壞脾氣的野獸啊，願你巨角就此卡在奧札奇猙獰臉孔之中！」～哥馬法達遊牧人布斯陶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'405c089c-2397-47f3-bb29-0a05d83a52c9\', \'multiverseId\': 402573}, \'multiverseid\': 402573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oran-Rief-Beschwörerin\', \'text\': \'{8}: Die Oran-Rief-Beschwörerin erhält +5/+5 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt war uns nie feindlich gesinnt. Sie hat uns gar nicht wahrgenommen, wir waren keine Bedrohung."—Die Geschichten der Beschwörer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ebfa9f-d408-46df-a72d-531c067693bb\', \'multiverseId\': 402876}, \'multiverseid\': 402876}, {\'name\': \'Invocadora de Oran-Rief\', \'text\': \'{8}: La Invocadora de Oran-Rief obtiene +5/+5 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No es que el mundo nos tratara mal; simplemente, nos ignoraba, porque no suponíamos ningún peligro".—Cuentos de los invocadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a4080f-bd82-45ec-ab72-052cb938774d\', \'multiverseId\': 404969}, \'multiverseid\': 404969}, {\'name\': "Invocatrice d\'Oran-Rief", \'text\': "{8} : L\'Invocatrice d\'Oran-Rief gagne +5/+5 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Le monde n\'était pas hostile envers nous. Nous lui étions insignifiants et ne représentions aucun danger pour lui. »—Les Contes des Invocateurs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'002eeac1-2834-4d05-94c9-6167b28fe42c\', \'multiverseId\': 403175}, \'multiverseid\': 403175}, {\'name\': \'Evocatrice di Oran-Rief\', \'text\': "{8}: L\'Evocatrice di Oran-Rief prende +5/+5 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo non ci era ostile: non eravamo degni della sua attenzione, né costituivamo alcun pericolo."—Racconti degli Evocatori\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b8c7d45-87ce-49f7-9325-47b3fa9ecbbe\', \'multiverseId\': 403474}, \'multiverseid\': 403474}, {\'name\': \'オラン＝リーフの発動者\', \'text\': \'{8}：ターン終了時まで、オラン＝リーフの発動者は＋５/＋５の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界は我々に敵意など持っていない。我々は取るに足らぬ存在で、脅威でも何でもないのだから。」――発動者伝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf3ed1c-9e05-4698-a68b-11ada3a11052\', \'multiverseId\': 403773}, \'multiverseid\': 403773}, {\'name\': \'오란리프 기원사\', \'text\': \'{8}: 오란리프 기원사는 턴종료까지 +5/+5를 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"세상은 우리에게 적대적이지 않았어. 우리는 안중에도 없었기 때문에 위험에 빠뜨릴 필요조차 없었던 거지."—기원사들의 이야기\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'949e0219-4d9d-4874-8379-d6389e6e1969\', \'multiverseId\': 404072}, \'multiverseid\': 404072}, {\'name\': \'Invocador de Oran-Rief\', \'text\': \'{8}: Invocador de Oran-Rief recebe +5/+5 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"O mundo não era hostil a nós — ele sequer nos notava, e nós não representávamos qualquer perigo."— Os Contos do Invocador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9176f147-ac8f-41e7-a04c-1d01582a169b\', \'multiverseId\': 404371}, \'multiverseid\': 404371}, {\'name\': \'Оран-Рифская Призывательница\', \'text\': \'{8}: Оран-Рифская Призывательница получает +5/+5 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Мир не был к нам враждебен. Мы были слишком незначительны и не представляли опасности».— Сказания призывателей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9d07ac-160d-4916-83f4-4d0e99107b16\', \'multiverseId\': 404670}, \'multiverseid\': 404670}, {\'name\': \'欧兰黎召现师\', \'text\': \'{8}：直到回合结束，欧兰黎召现师得+5/+5且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「这世界对我们没有敌意，我们对它来说不值一顾，且不具危险性。」～《召现师传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b8ac029-925d-4201-aa58-c43bbbf0dc96\', \'multiverseId\': 402278}, \'multiverseid\': 402278}, {\'name\': \'歐蘭黎召現師\', \'text\': \'{8}：直到回合結束，歐蘭黎召現師得+5/+5且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「這世界對我們沒有敵意，我們對它來說不值一顧，且不具危險性。」～《召現師傳說》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dada667d-3c83-4409-9c05-654ca5c6ac90\', \'multiverseId\': 402577}, \'multiverseid\': 402577}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oran-Rief-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Verursacht TrampelschadenLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Oran-Rief-Hydra. Falls das Land ein Wald ist, lege stattdessen zwei +1/+1-Marken auf die Oran-Rief-Hydra.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7310699b-0f9b-4251-8a53-d523ca37eabc\', \'multiverseId\': 402875}, \'multiverseid\': 402875}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Oran-Rief\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hidra de Oran-Rief. Si esa tierra es un bosque, en vez de eso, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la Hidra de Oran-Rief.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9740579c-9681-4edf-ae92-dd859600d35c\', \'multiverseId\': 404968}, \'multiverseid\': 404968}, {\'name\': "Hydre d\'Oran-Rief", \'text\': "PiétinementToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre d\'Oran-Rief. Si ce terrain est une forêt, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre d\'Oran-Rief à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fb5cf81-73f0-4c9a-90c3-f67b49947333\', \'multiverseId\': 403174}, \'multiverseid\': 403174}, {\'name\': \'Idra di Oran-Rief\', \'text\': "TravolgereTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Idra di Oran-Rief. Se quella terra è una Foresta, metti invece due segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Idra di Oran-Rief.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5338a7a0-3ace-44c6-82cf-e54427d35b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 403473}, \'multiverseid\': 403473}, {\'name\': \'オラン＝リーフのハイドラ\', \'text\': \'トランプル上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、オラン＝リーフのハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その土地が森であるなら、代わりにオラン＝リーフのハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffcd2303-92de-4dbd-9aff-6d735d2df32e\', \'multiverseId\': 403772}, \'multiverseid\': 403772}, {\'name\': \'오란리프 히드라\', \'text\': \'돌진대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 오란리프 히드라에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 대지가 숲이라면, 대신에 오란리프 히드라에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 히드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c428744-e862-4ce7-8082-4190c5d3a954\', \'multiverseId\': 404071}, \'multiverseid\': 404071}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Oran-Rief\', \'text\': \'AtropelarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hidra de Oran-Rief. Se o terreno for uma Floresta, em vez disso, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Hidra de Oran-Rief.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2556ea2e-c7ed-4464-be9d-6bc4ba6de6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 404370}, \'multiverseid\': 404370}, {\'name\': \'Оран-Рифская Гидра\', \'text\': \'Пробивной ударЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Оран-Рифскую Гидру. Если та земля является Лесом, вместо этого положите на Оран-Рифскую Гидру два жетона +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'165a3124-f9df-49f5-9b4c-8f6975f70e18\', \'multiverseId\': 404669}, \'multiverseid\': 404669}, {\'name\': \'欧兰黎多头龙\', \'text\': \'践踏地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，在欧兰黎多头龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。若该地是树林，则改为在欧兰黎多头龙上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104176b6-55ab-4bcc-9345-e82b8f5904c4\', \'multiverseId\': 402277}, \'multiverseid\': 402277}, {\'name\': \'歐蘭黎多頭龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，在歐蘭黎多頭龍上放置一個+1/+1指示物。若該地是樹林，則改為在歐蘭黎多頭龍上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a2dd87-8def-46ed-b082-66a975fc5b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 402576}, \'multiverseid\': 402576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pflichtbewusste Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Malakirs Wundheiler versagen, dann übernehmen die Schamanen des Todes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402762&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def96079-8d5e-414a-8cdb-7c88df311b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 402762}, \'multiverseid\': 402762}, {\'name\': \'Retorno solícito\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los cirujanos de Malakir ya no tenían nada que hacer, los chamanes de la muerte continuaron el trabajo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be73f551-d1ed-4ace-a5c8-7d5afa0c03d4\', \'multiverseId\': 404855}, \'multiverseid\': 404855}, {\'name\': \'Retour obéissant\', \'text\': "Renvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Quand les chirurgiens de Malakir ne purent plus rien faire, les shamanes de mort prirent le relai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dda61c4-8a8d-4991-9498-18b4cfbe3987\', \'multiverseId\': 403061}, \'multiverseid\': 403061}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno Diligente\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano fino a due carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Quando i chirurghi di Malakir fallirono, i suoi sciamani della morte li sostituirono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8cf31a9-688e-468d-9ca9-2eec68cc83e9\', \'multiverseId\': 403360}, \'multiverseid\': 403360}, {\'name\': \'従順な復活\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードを最大２枚対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'マラキールの医師が匙を投げたら、死のシャーマンの出番だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f68ec67-c944-49ff-9a35-ad8818d175cc\', \'multiverseId\': 403659}, \'multiverseid\': 403659}, {\'name\': \'의무 귀환\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 최대 두 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'말라키르의 외과의가 치료에 실패하면, 사망주술사가 넘겨 받는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d184fe-72cc-4c08-9f92-8d0470df4ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 403958}, \'multiverseid\': 403958}, {\'name\': \'Retorno Obediente\', \'text\': \'Devolva até dois cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os cirurgiões de Malakir falharam, os xamãs da morte começaram a trabalhar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef618d1-251b-4387-b3ae-afad488a2d37\', \'multiverseId\': 404257}, \'multiverseid\': 404257}, {\'name\': \'Покорное Возвращение\', \'text\': \'Верните не более двух целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда малакирские хирурги потерпели неудачу, их заменили шаманы смерти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa1a1b42-b13a-40fe-95c9-b71283e824ba\', \'multiverseId\': 404556}, \'multiverseid\': 404556}, {\'name\': \'尽责归返\', \'text\': \'将至多两张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'当马拉奇的外科医生回天乏术时，他们的死亡祭师便接手了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'383d367b-209b-43c7-88b8-aa34faa7720b\', \'multiverseId\': 402164}, \'multiverseid\': 402164}, {\'name\': \'盡責歸返\', \'text\': \'將至多兩張目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'當馬拉奇的外科醫生回天乏術時，他們的死亡祭師便接手了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef6da54-7f06-4148-831c-f0f3200aa18c\', \'multiverseId\': 402463}, \'multiverseid\': 402463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polyederarchiv\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}.{2}, {T}, opfere das Polyederarchiv: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Du beginnst, den wahren Zweck der Polyeder zu verstehen", sagte Ugin. „Die Eldrazi können eingesperrt werden."„Wir wissen ja, wie gut es das letzte Mal funktioniert hat …", antwortete Jace trocken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402807&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76aa249d-effd-422e-bac2-bea439c0331d\', \'multiverseId\': 402807}, \'multiverseid\': 402807}, {\'name\': \'Edro de almacenaje\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná.{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro de almacenaje: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Estás comenzando a entender el verdadero propósito de los edros", dijo Ugin. "Los Eldrazi pueden ser encerrados"."¿Y qué tal funcionó el sistema la última vez?", preguntó Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d1a5244-5b3e-4b56-84f4-64d5bab7bb4c\', \'multiverseId\': 404900}, \'multiverseid\': 404900}, {\'name\': \'Archive hèdron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve.{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Archive hèdron : Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Tu commences à comprendre le véritable rôle des hèdrons, dit Ugin. Les Eldrazi peuvent être emprisonnés. »« Et comment cela s\'est-il fini la dernière fois ? » demanda Jace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aecbc079-258c-4377-b582-ca53c42267a2\', \'multiverseId\': 403106}, \'multiverseid\': 403106}, {\'name\': "Archivio nell\'Edro", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana.{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Archivio nell\'Edro: Pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai iniziando a comprendere la vera funzione degli edri," disse Ugin. "Gli Eldrazi possono essere imprigionati.""E l\\\'ultima volta ha funzionato?" chiese Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff208b48-2f42-433d-8834-2cdcd517d920\', \'multiverseId\': 403405}, \'multiverseid\': 403405}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の記録庫\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。{2}, {T}, 面晶体の記録庫を生け贄に捧げる：カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは言った。「おぬしは面晶体の本来の目的を理解し始めておる。エルドラージを封じることができるのだ。」「それで、前回はどうなったのですか？」ジェイスが訊いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce763bb8-3527-4150-af88-b8e938fd3269\', \'multiverseId\': 403704}, \'multiverseid\': 403704}, {\'name\': \'다면체 보관장치\', \'text\': \'{T}: {2}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{2}, {T}, 다면체 보관장치를 희생한다: 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"이제야 다면체의 진정한 목적이 이해되나 보군." 우진이 말했다. "엘드라지를 가둘 수 있다.""그래서 지난 번에는 결과가 어땠지? 제이스가 물었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3555011f-cea0-4b38-b02b-c364f7222278\', \'multiverseId\': 404003}, \'multiverseid\': 404003}, {\'name\': \'Arquivo de Edro\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {2} à sua reserva de mana.{2}, {T}, Sacrifique Arquivo de Edro: Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Você começou a entender o verdadeiro propósito dos edros", disse Ugin. "Os Eldrazi podem ser aprisionados.""E como é que isso acabou da última vez?", perguntou Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7358c747-0281-4950-a7f1-12da774281c0\', \'multiverseId\': 404302}, \'multiverseid\': 404302}, {\'name\': \'Эдр-Архив\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {2} в ваше хранилище маны.{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Эдр-Архив: возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты начинаешь понимать истинное назначение эдров, — сказал Уджин. — Эльдрази можно пленить».«И чем это закончилось в прошлый раз?» — ответил Джейс.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0c6439-9689-47d1-830d-b200bb095221\', \'multiverseId\': 404601}, \'multiverseid\': 404601}, {\'name\': \'晶石档案\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{2}到你的法术力池中。{2}，{T}，牺牲晶石档案：抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你已经开始明白晶石的真正作用了，」乌金说。「我们可以将奥札奇禁锢起来。」「那上一次是怎么做到的？」杰斯问道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d3f3a92-9229-431c-9dbf-5d08ebb8ad5f\', \'multiverseId\': 402209}, \'multiverseid\': 402209}, {\'name\': \'晶石檔案\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{2}到你的魔法力池中。{2}，{T}，犧牲晶石檔案：抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你已經開始明白晶石真正的用途了，」烏金說。「我們可以將奧札奇禁錮起來。」「那上一次是怎麼做到的？」傑斯問道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0080380-aa0c-43b3-8f39-3205770e4f78\', \'multiverseId\': 402508}, \'multiverseid\': 402508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polyederklinge\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur von einer oder mehreren farblosen Kreaturen geblockt wird, erhält sie Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, ist ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)Ausrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402808&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28ca699-39dc-42e7-a284-22781ecf19aa\', \'multiverseId\': 402808}, \'multiverseid\': 402808}, {\'name\': \'Filo de edro\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.Siempre que la criatura equipada sea bloqueada por una o más criaturas incoloras, gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)Equipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14027299-7983-49c6-8e10-a25680ea2721\', \'multiverseId\': 404901}, \'multiverseid\': 404901}, {\'name\': "Lame d\'hèdron", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1.À chaque fois que la créature équipée devient bloquée par au moins une créature incolore, elle acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Le nombre de blessures qu\'elle inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)Équipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0dd34eb-0c9f-4a0d-a901-0a0fec1f51e4\', \'multiverseId\': 403107}, \'multiverseid\': 403107}, {\'name\': "Lama d\'Edro", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata viene bloccata da una o più creature incolori, ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno. (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)Equipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3724d4d9-f0e1-41e2-adc0-c3c604ecc4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 403406}, \'multiverseid\': 403406}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。装備しているクリーチャーが１体以上の無色のクリーチャーによってブロックされるたび、ターン終了時まで、装備しているクリーチャーは接死を得る。（それが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b4946c7-f8fb-44d3-8cde-d6f80ea3de9f\', \'multiverseId\': 403705}, \'multiverseid\': 403705}, {\'name\': \'다면체 검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.장착된 생물이 하나 이상의 무색 생물에게 방어될 때마다, 장착된 생물은 턴종료까지 치명타를 얻는다. (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b945fc4-ec6f-442d-9d24-dd49dcf3b38b\', \'multiverseId\': 404004}, \'multiverseid\': 404004}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Edro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+1.Toda vez que a criatura equipada se torna bloqueada por uma ou mais criaturas incolores, ela ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno. (Qualquer quantidade de dano que ela cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)Equipar {2} ({2}: Anexe à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19abca2-5922-48a6-a65c-d919f7706d67\', \'multiverseId\': 404303}, \'multiverseid\': 404303}, {\'name\': \'Клинок с Эдром\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/+1.Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо становится заблокировано одним или несколькими бесцветными существами, оно получает Смертельное касание до конца хода. (Любое количество повреждений, которое оно наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)Снарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60c4270-3856-4b94-befb-ba08d7f1bf27\', \'multiverseId\': 404602}, \'multiverseid\': 404602}, {\'name\': \'晶石剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1。每当佩带此武具的生物被一个或数个无色生物阻挡时，它获得死触异能直到回合结束。（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）佩带{2}（{2}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f44286c0-eadb-486d-a6c3-6983f58cea3f\', \'multiverseId\': 402210}, \'multiverseid\': 402210}, {\'name\': \'晶石劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+1/+1。每當佩帶此武具的生物被一個或數個無色生物阻擋時，它獲得死觸異能直到回合結束。（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）佩帶{2}（{2}：裝備在目標由你操控的生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a21522e-5239-4935-814f-9054a3062acb\', \'multiverseId\': 402509}, \'multiverseid\': 402509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prismenformation\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Die Prismenformation kommt mit einer Kristallmarke ins Spiel für jede unterschiedliche Farbe von Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um es zu wirken.Entferne eine Kristallmarke von der Prismenformation: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Hellsicht 3. (Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad1f9fd-e34c-4b36-a16b-41f22617b6d0\', \'multiverseId\': 402896}, \'multiverseid\': 402896}, {\'name\': \'Secuencia prismática\', \'text\': \'Converger — La Secuencia prismática entra al campo de batalla con un contador de cristal sobre ella por cada color de maná usado para lanzarla.Remover un contador de cristal de la Secuencia prismática: Gira la criatura objetivo.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Adivina 3. (Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier número de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4d527d-428c-4e87-b749-3cc5616fadd2\', \'multiverseId\': 404989}, \'multiverseid\': 404989}, {\'name\': \'Déploiement prismatique\', \'text\': "Convergence — Le Déploiement prismatique arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un marqueur « cristal » pour chaque couleur de mana dépensé pour le lancer.Retirez un marqueur « cristal » du Déploiement prismatique : Engagez la créature ciblée.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G} : Regard 3. (Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df907306-0282-4abf-803d-9f22edbe2919\', \'multiverseId\': 403195}, \'multiverseid\': 403195}, {\'name\': \'Disposizione Prismatica\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — La Disposizione Prismatica entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino cristallo per ogni colore di mana speso per lanciarla.Rimuovi un segnalino cristallo dalla Disposizione Prismatica: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Profetizza 3. (Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a871730e-98e6-46d8-a6d2-2512f58004dc\', \'multiverseId\': 403494}, \'multiverseid\': 403494}, {\'name\': \'プリズム結界\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― プリズム結界は、これを唱えるために支払われたマナの色１色につき水晶カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。プリズム結界の上から水晶カウンターを１個取り除く：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}：占術３を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caec5128-0319-42a7-8608-88be0d67fca0\', \'multiverseId\': 403793}, \'multiverseid\': 403793}, {\'name\': \'프리즘 배열\', \'text\': \'화합 — 프리즘 배열은 발동 비용으로 지불한 마나의 각 색 종류 수 만큼 수정 카운터를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.프리즘 배열에서 수정 카운터 한 개를 제거한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: 점술 3을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서대로 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7ec381-8691-42be-94ef-cf05d0b38253\', \'multiverseId\': 404092}, \'multiverseid\': 404092}, {\'name\': \'Matriz Prismática\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Matriz Prismática entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de cristal para cada cor de mana gasto para conjurá-la.Remova um marcador de cristal de Matriz Prismática: Vire a criatura alvo.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Vidência 3. (Olhe os três cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc82d168-aeb4-4bfa-a7a0-de2f7619c6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 404391}, \'multiverseid\': 404391}, {\'name\': \'Призменная Сеть\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Призменная Сеть выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном кристалла за каждый цвет маны, потраченной на ее разыгрывание.Удалите один жетон кристалла с Призменной Сети: поверните целевое существо.{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: предскажите 3. (Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них в низ вашей библиотеки, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b62f17-6a0e-45ea-98b2-f7c22554b3be\', \'multiverseId\': 404690}, \'multiverseid\': 404690}, {\'name\': \'棱镜阵列\', \'text\': \'聚辉～棱镜阵列进战场时上面有数个晶体指示物，其数量等同于施放棱镜阵列时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。从棱镜阵列上移去一个晶体指示物：横置目标生物。{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}：占卜3。（检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ea4f150-5f55-46be-aea6-f6abfce79101\', \'multiverseId\': 402298}, \'multiverseid\': 402298}, {\'name\': \'稜鏡陣列\', \'text\': \'聚輝～稜鏡陣列進戰場時上面有數個晶體指示物，其數量等同於施放稜鏡陣列時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。從稜鏡陣列上移去一個晶體指示物：橫置目標生物。{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}：占卜3。（檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將其中任意數量的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫頂。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef481b6c-97a8-45dc-986a-59eb0363530b\', \'multiverseId\': 402597}, \'multiverseid\': 402597}]', "[{'name': 'Präriefluss', 'text': '({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {U}.)Der Präriefluss kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht zwei oder mehr Standardländer kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Ondu ist ein ausgedehntes Plateau, durchzogen von tiefen Furchen und Mäanderströmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402895&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea4c647f-bea9-4524-9bf8-11f484c31fd3', 'multiverseId': 402895}, 'multiverseid': 402895}, {'name': 'Manantial de la pradera', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.)El Manantial de la pradera entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': 'El continente de Ondu es una gran meseta atravesada por profundas zanjas y ríos serpenteantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404988&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '682d0a92-14a5-4889-bf4e-9f3794e7aff2', 'multiverseId': 404988}, 'multiverseid': 404988}, {'name': 'Prairie ruisselante', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U} à votre réserve.)La Prairie ruisselante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': 'Le continent du Ondou est un vaste plateau traversé de fossés profonds et de rivières sinueuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403194&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6807f8d6-e217-4ae8-b881-1da6c56d7e92', 'multiverseId': 403194}, 'multiverseid': 403194}, {'name': 'Ruscello nella Prateria', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.)Il Ruscello nella Prateria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Ondu è un vasto altopiano segnato da profondi fossati e fiumi sinuosi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403493&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14e0ff20-15fd-49d0-950b-6ce0a0d3a10f', 'multiverseId': 403493}, 'multiverseid': 403493}, {'name': '大草原の川', 'text': '（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{U}を加える。）あなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、大草原の川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': 'オンドゥ大陸は広大な平地である。そこを深い溝が縦横に走り、曲がりくねった川が流れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403792&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b04cc8d-c0ab-4a96-b649-62c09af458dd', 'multiverseId': 403792}, 'multiverseid': 403792}, {'name': '초원의 개울', 'text': '({T}: {W} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)초원의 개울은 당신이 다른 기본 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '대지 — 들 섬', 'flavor': '온두 대륙은 광활한 고원으로 깊은 도랑과 굽이굽이 흐리는 강이 가로지르고 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404091&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a9e3a67-715f-4dea-acbb-f4c39836fd2d', 'multiverseId': 404091}, 'multiverseid': 404091}, {'name': 'Riacho da Pradaria', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.)Riacho da Pradaria entra no campo de batalha virado a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': 'O continente de Ondu é um vasto platô atravessado por desfiladeiros profundos e rios sinuosos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404390&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8875891-f46e-49e8-9cfd-90ca131d869e', 'multiverseId': 404390}, 'multiverseid': 404390}, {'name': 'Ручей в Прерии', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {W} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.)Ручей в Прерии выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Равнина Остров', 'flavor': 'Континент Онду — бескрайнее плато, изрезанное глубокими оврагами и извилистыми реками.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404689&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fa4e823-d4b8-4495-8d87-cf68693b099e', 'multiverseId': 404689}, 'multiverseid': 404689}, {'name': '沃原溪流', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的法术力池中。）除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则沃原溪流须横置进战场。', 'type': '地～平原／海岛', 'flavor': '昂度大陆这片广袤高原沟壑纵横，蜿流交错。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402297&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '449b55a4-a14e-49fe-8694-a57981d7150e', 'multiverseId': 402297}, 'multiverseid': 402297}, {'name': '沃原溪流', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。）除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則沃原溪流須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地～平原／海島', 'flavor': '昂度大陸這片廣袤高原溝壑縱橫，蜿流交錯。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402596&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '936bda48-36fb-4e39-bf69-a9e3d3bb7aff', 'multiverseId': 402596}, 'multiverseid': 402596}]", '[{\'name\': \'Präsenz des Titanen\', \'text\': \'Zeige als zusätzliche Kosten, um Präsenz des Titanen zu wirken, eine farblose Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand offen vor.Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil, falls ihre Stärke kleiner oder gleich der Stärke der vorgezeigten Karte ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Alles, was Ulamog zurücklässt, sind Staub und Erinnerungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2573879-a18d-485c-974a-17f4c8dc7796\', \'multiverseId\': 402970}, \'multiverseid\': 402970}, {\'name\': \'Presencia del titán\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar la Presencia del titán, muestra una carta de criatura incolora de tu mano.Exilia la criatura objetivo si su fuerza es menor o igual a la fuerza de la carta mostrada.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Polvo y recuerdos son todo lo que queda al paso de Ulamog.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4524b758-9e42-4e29-a592-71a0baeaf5c8\', \'multiverseId\': 405063}, \'multiverseid\': 405063}, {\'name\': \'Présence du titan\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer la Présence du titan, révélez une carte de créature incolore de votre main.Exilez la créature ciblée si sa force est inférieure ou égale à celle de la carte révélée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Seuls la poussière et les souvenirs subsistent après le passage d\'Ulamog.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403269&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87220e1b-2ab9-480c-b2a8-6f1cdafb6a25\', \'multiverseId\': 403269}, \'multiverseid\': 403269}, {\'name\': \'Presenza del Titano\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare la Presenza del Titano, rivela una carta creatura incolore dalla tua mano.Esilia una creatura bersaglio se la sua forza è pari o inferiore alla forza della carta rivelata.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Polvere e ricordi sono le uniche cose che Ulamog lascia al suo passaggio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4ca6ea-91cc-4272-888c-89f547abd78c\', \'multiverseId\': 403568}, \'multiverseid\': 403568}, {\'name\': \'タイタンの存在\', \'text\': \'タイタンの存在を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの手札から無色のクリーチャー・カードを１枚公開する。クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーが公開したカードのパワー以下なら、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの通った跡に残るのは、塵と思い出だけである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b7d016-e7e8-4505-8bdf-0245eafc075c\', \'multiverseId\': 403867}, \'multiverseid\': 403867}, {\'name\': \'거신의 존재감\', \'text\': \'거신의 존재감을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 당신의 손에서 무색 생물 카드 한 장을 공개한다.생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물의 공격력이 공개한 카드의 공격력 이하라면 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'울라목이 휩쓸고 지나간 자리에는 먼지와 기억만이 남는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f0dbc8-9635-499b-a8a0-3becce8cedb1\', \'multiverseId\': 404166}, \'multiverseid\': 404166}, {\'name\': \'Presença do Titã\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Presença do Titã, revele um card de criatura incolor de sua mão.Exile a criatura alvo se o poder dela for igual ou inferior ao poder do card revelado.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Pó e lembranças são tudo que resta no rastro de Ulamog.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98fa4ce1-7df9-4eec-a312-02a1a2705c83\', \'multiverseId\': 404465}, \'multiverseid\': 404465}, {\'name\': \'Присутствие Титана\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Присутствия Титана покажите карту бесцветного существа из вашей руки.Изгоните целевое существо, если его сила меньше или равна силе показанной карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Там, где прошел Уламог, остаются лишь прах и воспоминания.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4452ec66-db3c-44f4-b14d-0e26ae69855b\', \'multiverseId\': 404764}, \'multiverseid\': 404764}, {\'name\': \'巨物现身\', \'text\': \'从你手上展示一张无色生物牌，以作为施放巨物现身的额外费用。如果目标生物的力量等于或小于所展示之牌的力量，则放逐该生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫沿途只留下了尘土和回忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'453279a6-641c-40c6-a1d7-f36a6f31b9f4\', \'multiverseId\': 402372}, \'multiverseid\': 402372}, {\'name\': \'巨物現身\', \'text\': \'從你手上展示一張無色生物牌，以作為施放巨物現身的額外費用。如果目標生物的力量等於或小於所展示之牌的力量，則放逐該生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫沿途只留下了塵土和回憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbba5af0-cfe8-4428-b595-d3cc60459b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 402671}, \'multiverseid\': 402671}]', '[{\'name\': \'Quarantänefeld\', \'text\': \'Das Quarantänefeld kommt mit X Isolationsmarken ins Spiel.Wenn das Quarantänefeld ins Spiel kommt, schicke für jede Isolationsmarke darauf bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis das Quarantänefeld das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938c6a13-cc4b-4ca0-8f08-db6a3e601db0\', \'multiverseId\': 402898}, \'multiverseid\': 402898}, {\'name\': \'Campo de cuarentena\', \'text\': \'El Campo de cuarentena entra al campo de batalla con X contadores de aislamiento sobre él.Cuando el Campo de cuarentena entre al campo de batalla, por cada contador de aislamiento sobre él, exilia hasta un permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que el Campo de cuarentena deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb76416-4623-4bbd-9afa-d8c0b29c10d6\', \'multiverseId\': 404991}, \'multiverseid\': 404991}, {\'name\': \'Champ de quarantaine\', \'text\': "Le Champ de quarantaine arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs « isolement » sur lui.Quand le Champ de quarantaine arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque marqueur « isolement » sur lui, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que le Champ de quarantaine quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403197&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e1c4bd4-db1c-4b1d-bafd-d5db18613ac0\', \'multiverseId\': 403197}, \'multiverseid\': 403197}, {\'name\': \'Campo di Quarantena\', \'text\': \'Il Campo di Quarantena entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini isolamento.Quando il Campo di Quarantena entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni segnalino isolamento su di esso, esilia fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché il Campo di Quarantena non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'553c7cf7-9040-4975-b00e-56c2af7a99ac\', \'multiverseId\': 403496}, \'multiverseid\': 403496}, {\'name\': \'隔離の場\', \'text\': \'隔離の場は、孤立カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。隔離の場が戦場に出たとき、これの上に置かれている孤立カウンター１個につき、対戦相手がコントロールする土地でないパーマネントを最大１つ対象とし、隔離の場が戦場を離れるまでそれらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f7dd433-f7b7-4789-8877-ed7aec1b8c55\', \'multiverseId\': 403795}, \'multiverseid\': 403795}, {\'name\': \'격리장\', \'text\': \'격리장은 격리 카운터 X개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.격리장이 전장에 들어올 때, 격리장에 놓인 각 격리 카운터 한 개당, 상대가 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물들을 격리장이 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824f6fcd-aebb-4e43-bc5a-6d0d8cf5c488\', \'multiverseId\': 404094}, \'multiverseid\': 404094}, {\'name\': \'Campo de Quarentena\', \'text\': \'Campo de Quarentena entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores de isolamento.Quando Campo de Quarentena entrar no campo de batalha, para cada marcador de isolamento nele, exile até uma permanente alvo que um oponente controle que não seja um terreno até que Campo de Quarentena deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1ca02c-aa8b-4b63-a3cc-d000cbb28a5a\', \'multiverseId\': 404393}, \'multiverseid\': 404393}, {\'name\': \'Карантинное Поле\', \'text\': \'Карантинное Поле выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами изоляции на нем.Когда Карантинное Поле выходит на поле битвы, за каждый жетон изоляции на нем изгоните не более одного целевого не являющегося землей перманента под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Карантинное Поле не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8afc25f-f770-42ea-a2f1-d4f381d6310e\', \'multiverseId\': 404692}, \'multiverseid\': 404692}, {\'name\': \'隔绝力场\', \'text\': \'隔绝力场进战场时上面有X个隔离指示物。当隔绝力场进战场时，选择至多等同于其上隔离指示物数量之目标由对手操控的非地永久物。放逐这些永久物，直到隔绝力场离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27bdddd-ae9f-428f-9aea-993f2f0777e6\', \'multiverseId\': 402300}, \'multiverseid\': 402300}, {\'name\': \'隔絕力場\', \'text\': \'隔絕力場進戰場時上面有X個隔離指示物。當隔絕力場進戰場時，選擇至多等同於其上隔離指示物數量之目標由對手操控的非地永久物。放逐這些永久物，直到隔絕力場離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce5c6fe3-c74a-4d1f-8bc8-4676d52fd648\', \'multiverseId\': 402599}, \'multiverseid\': 402599}]', '[{\'name\': \'Renaturierende Ranken\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt wird ihrer langen Besatzung überdrüssig."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7626aaa-bd0d-44e6-a2b7-ea0af056616a\', \'multiverseId\': 402901}, \'multiverseid\': 402901}, {\'name\': \'Enredaderas recuperadoras\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo ya está harto de su larga ocupación".—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be6e4a7-77ca-4a9d-8fd5-e63b7eb5b44f\', \'multiverseId\': 404994}, \'multiverseid\': 404994}, {\'name\': \'Vignes assainissantes\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, l\'enchantement ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Le monde se lasse de cette longue occupation. »—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0e8bb3-5a75-46b9-8ae6-ae0f47c6460a\', \'multiverseId\': 403200}, \'multiverseid\': 403200}, {\'name\': \'Rampicanti Rivendicatori\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto, un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo è stanco di questa lunga occupazione."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1e233f-c7dc-4326-8390-6cf558173ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 403499}, \'multiverseid\': 403499}, {\'name\': \'回収蔦\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界は長期間占有されてうんざりしているの。」――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c896f6-99e5-40d2-96a5-43172bdb4f12\', \'multiverseId\': 403798}, \'multiverseid\': 403798}, {\'name\': \'탈환하는 덩굴\', \'text\': \'마법물체, 부여마법 또는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이 세상이 오랜 점령에 싫증을 내는군."—니사 레베인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7a8685-8ed7-41b6-841a-1797286b15dd\', \'multiverseId\': 404097}, \'multiverseid\': 404097}, {\'name\': \'Vinhas Reclamantes\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato, encantamento ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo está se cansando da longa ocupação."— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c85f0ac9-6ad2-4df0-9957-7096417698c5\', \'multiverseId\': 404396}, \'multiverseid\': 404396}, {\'name\': \'Жадные Лианы\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт, чары или землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Этот мир устал от захватчиков».— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e415db74-6f34-4391-aeae-85dc08af6bc3\', \'multiverseId\': 404695}, \'multiverseid\': 404695}, {\'name\': \'复碧藤蔓\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器，结界或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这世界已厌倦它长据于此。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f515ec2-bc55-4e85-aad1-4bab5dd73f82\', \'multiverseId\': 402303}, \'multiverseid\': 402303}, {\'name\': \'復碧藤蔓\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器，結界或地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這世界已厭倦它長據於此。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8e5e66-e583-4822-980b-c2e44c36ccf3\', \'multiverseId\': 402602}, \'multiverseid\': 402602}]', '[{\'name\': \'Riesengottesanbeterin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die riesigen Insekten in Tazeem haben mir immer Angst gemacht, bis ich die Eldrazi sah. Nun erfreue ich mich am Anblick von Gottesanbeterinnen, die in Baumkronen sitzen."—Ryza, Oran-Rief-Späher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98e6ecf7-e178-4969-9076-14ef9a15eb8c\', \'multiverseId\': 402793}, \'multiverseid\': 402793}, {\'name\': \'Mantis gigante\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear a criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre me dieron miedo los insectos gigantes de Tazeem... hasta que vi a los Eldrazi. Ahora hasta me tranquiliza ver mantis agazapadas en los árboles".—Ryza, exploradora de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce6d3b1-9d5c-4136-9c3d-8281a1cd83ad\', \'multiverseId\': 404886}, \'multiverseid\': 404886}, {\'name\': \'Mante géante\', \'text\': \'Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai toujours trouvé les insectes de Tazeem particulièrement terrifiants... Jusqu\'à ce que je vois les Eldrazi. Aujourd\'hui j\'apprécie la vue des mantes perchées à la cime des arbres. »—Ryza, éclaireuse d\'Oran-Rief", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d94aa675-0bf3-442d-9510-f84f412c67eb\', \'multiverseId\': 403092}, \'multiverseid\': 403092}, {\'name\': \'Mantide Gigante\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho sempre pensato che i grandi insetti di Tazeem fossero spaventosi, finché non ho visto gli Eldrazi. Ora gioisco alla vista delle mantidi appollaiate in cima agli alberi."—Ryza, esploratrice di Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b41f27b5-9d74-42bf-ab75-35417fe2c498\', \'multiverseId\': 403391}, \'multiverseid\': 403391}, {\'name\': \'大カマキリ\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「私はずっとタジームにいる巨大な昆虫が恐ろしいと感じていた。エルドラージを見るまではね。今では木の上で休んでいるカマキリなんて大歓迎よ。」――オラン＝リーフの斥候、ライザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c694cb7d-7e48-440b-8d64-289630ff246c\', \'multiverseId\': 403690}, \'multiverseid\': 403690}, {\'name\': \'거대한 사마귀\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'"난 항상 타짐의 거대한 곤충들이 가장 무시무시하다고 생각했어. 엘드라지를 보기 전까지는 말이야. 그에 비하면 나무 꼭대기에 자리잡은 사마귀 정도는 귀여운 편이지."—오란리프 정찰병 라이자\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a628de27-6b56-4ab2-b4a4-d9c5cc1cec8a\', \'multiverseId\': 403989}, \'multiverseid\': 403989}, {\'name\': \'Mantídeo Gigante\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sempre pensei que os grandes insetos de Tazeem eram assustadores... até ver os Eldrazi. Agora eu sinto alívio quando vejo mantídeos empoleirados no topo das árvores."— Ryza, batedora de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d08ba010-f888-46c9-8ba0-16cea54c8066\', \'multiverseId\': 404288}, \'multiverseid\': 404288}, {\'name\': \'Гигантский Богомол\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'«Раньше я боялась гигантских насекомых Тазима. Но потом я увидела Эльдрази. Теперь зрелище рассевшихся на ветках богомолов вызывает у меня только радость».— Риза, оран-рифская разведчица\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a826fd-7e98-45ef-bf24-ce42588dbee6\', \'multiverseId\': 404587}, \'multiverseid\': 404587}, {\'name\': \'巨型螳螂\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「我一直觉得塔晋的巨型昆虫非常可怕，直到我看见了奥札奇。现在我倒乐于看见匍匐在树顶枝头的螳螂。」～欧兰黎斥候莱莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a411b63-4bed-457c-88b6-3f129866db4d\', \'multiverseId\': 402195}, \'multiverseid\': 402195}, {\'name\': \'巨型螳螂\', \'text\': \'延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'「我一直覺得塔晉的巨型昆蟲非常可怕，直到我看見了奧札奇。現在我倒樂於看見匍匐在樹頂枝頭的螳螂。」～歐蘭黎斥候萊莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d080b72-9847-4180-87f5-42d718563335\', \'multiverseId\': 402494}, \'multiverseid\': 402494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rollender Donner\', \'text\': \'Der Rollende Donner fügt X Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Zendikar ist immer wütend, jedoch habe ich diese Wut nie zuvor so präzise auf einen Punkt fokussiert erlebt."—Nablus, Pelzjäger aus Nord-Hada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba0e8227-7d97-4fd3-a038-bd3e73f468ef\', \'multiverseId\': 402912}, \'multiverseid\': 402912}, {\'name\': \'Trueno ensordecedor\', \'text\': \'El Trueno ensordecedor hace X puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar siempre está enfadado, aunque nunca he visto su enfado dirigido con tanta precisión".—Nablus, trampero de Hada Norte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a51b8b9-f3ab-4303-900e-ea89a215a147\', \'multiverseId\': 405005}, \'multiverseid\': 405005}, {\'name\': \'Roulement de tonnerre\', \'text\': "Le Roulement de tonnerre inflige X blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Zendikar est toujours en colère, mais je n\'ai jamais vu cette rage canalisée si précisément. »—Nablus, trappeur de Nord-Hada", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e256c4f-5ae2-4cde-a3cf-e8471ecdbe64\', \'multiverseId\': 403211}, \'multiverseid\': 403211}, {\'name\': \'Rombo di Tuono\', \'text\': \'Il Rombo di Tuono infligge X danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar è sempre infuriato, ma non lo avevo mai visto dirigere la sua rabbia con tanta precisione."—Nablus, trappolatore di Hada del Nord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacd1d0a-0163-4492-8377-5cfb074a9851\', \'multiverseId\': 403510}, \'multiverseid\': 403510}, {\'name\': \'とどろく雷鳴\', \'text\': \'望む数のクリーチャーやプレイヤーを対象とする。とどろく雷鳴はそれらに、Ｘ点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーはいつでも怒っている。これだけはっきり誰かに向けた怒りは見たことがなかったがね。」――北ハーダの罠士、ナブルス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9b1f2b2-9a1a-415f-a8a6-aec98430db6d\', \'multiverseId\': 403809}, \'multiverseid\': 403809}, {\'name\': \'노도하는 천둥\', \'text\': \'생물이나 플레이어를 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 노도하는 천둥은 그 목표들에게 피해 X점을 당신이 분배한 대로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르는 언제나 분노로 뒤덮여 있어. 하지만 이번만큼 그 분노의 대상이 확실했던 적은 없었지."—북부 하다 덫사냥꾼 나블러스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82207272-a107-4cf0-9ead-6e9a5fcb3d5d\', \'multiverseId\': 404108}, \'multiverseid\': 404108}, {\'name\': \'Trovoada Ribombante\', \'text\': \'Trovoada Ribombante causa X pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre qualquer número de criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar está sempre furiosa, embora eu nunca tenha visto essa fúria direcionada com tanta precisão."— Nablus, armadilheiro de Hada do Norte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e7263a-05f4-4c2b-b68f-d4e3f0853c53\', \'multiverseId\': 404407}, \'multiverseid\': 404407}, {\'name\': \'Наступление Бури\', \'text\': \'Наступление Бури наносит X повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между любым количеством целевых существ и (или) игроков.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Зендикар всегда отличался гневным нравом, но на этот раз его гнев очень уж точно направлен».— Наблус, капканщик из Северной Хады\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f249dc2-34f7-4e66-9a51-0aaf7a210f3a\', \'multiverseId\': 404706}, \'multiverseid\': 404706}, {\'name\': \'旋雷\', \'text\': \'旋雷对任意数量的目标生物和／或牌手造成共X点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「赞迪卡常年愤怒，但我未曾见过它的愤怒如此有针对性。」～北哈达布陷人那布勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2b9950-bafb-4aee-82ec-53b2b21a3be6\', \'multiverseId\': 402314}, \'multiverseid\': 402314}, {\'name\': \'旋雷\', \'text\': \'旋雷對任意數量的目標生物和／或玩家造成共X點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「贊迪卡常年憤怒，但我未曾見過它的憤怒如此有針對性。」～北哈達佈陷人那布勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9275a02d-fe66-43c7-8cf4-a092f6f473a0\', \'multiverseId\': 402613}, \'multiverseid\': 402613}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle\', \'text\': \'Die Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {U}.{2}{G}{U}: Die Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle werden bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 grünen und blauen Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Fluchsicherheit. Sie sind immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402840&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'154e4a6d-4c0b-40f8-8151-732d5f7cbf6b\', \'multiverseId\': 402840}, \'multiverseid\': 402840}, {\'name\': \'Cascada estruendosa\', \'text\': \'La Cascada estruendosa entra al campo de batalla girada.{T}: Agrega {G} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.{2}{G}{U}: La Cascada estruendosa se convierte en una criatura Elemental verde y azul 3/3 con la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7f8153-5dba-411e-ac04-17cac5efd98b\', \'multiverseId\': 404933}, \'multiverseid\': 404933}, {\'name\': \'Chutes mugissantes\', \'text\': "Les Chutes mugissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U} à votre réserve.{2}{G}{U} : Les Chutes mugissantes deviennent une créature 3/3 verte et bleue Élémental avec la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f0d6d84-be07-45fe-9036-2be23449c63e\', \'multiverseId\': 403139}, \'multiverseid\': 403139}, {\'name\': \'Cascate Roboanti\', \'text\': \'Le Cascate Roboanti entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.{2}{G}{U}: Le Cascate Roboanti diventano una creatura Elementale 3/3 verde e blu con anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e87757-78bc-4e46-9753-cb419a9e5f5d\', \'multiverseId\': 403438}, \'multiverseid\': 403438}, {\'name\': \'伐採地の滝\', \'text\': \'伐採地の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{U}を加える。{2}{G}{U}：ターン終了時まで、伐採地の滝は呪禁を持つ緑であり青である３/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0424f0f9-6784-4361-8419-488b2ee40a93\', \'multiverseId\': 403737}, \'multiverseid\': 403737}, {\'name\': \'굉음을 내는 폭포\', \'text\': \'굉음을 내는 폭포는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.{T}: {G} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{2}{G}{U}: 턴종료까지, 굉음을 내는 폭포는 방호를 가진 녹색이며 청색인 3/3 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b27f27fa-fb85-4d29-b01f-e08f117d6120\', \'multiverseId\': 404036}, \'multiverseid\': 404036}, {\'name\': \'Quedas Estrondosas\', \'text\': \'Quedas Estrondosas entra no campo de batalha virada.{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.{2}{G}{U}: Quedas Estrondosas torna-se uma criatura verde e azul 3/3 do tipo Elemental com resistência a magia até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5cb11c-3bb5-47ad-a759-9f19639b8fab\', \'multiverseId\': 404335}, \'multiverseid\': 404335}, {\'name\': \'Рокочущие Водопады\', \'text\': \'Рокочущие Водопады выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.{T}: добавьте {G} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.{2}{G}{U}: Рокочущие Водопады становятся существом 3/3 зеленый и синий Элементаль с Порчеустойчивостью до конца хода. При этом они остаются землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d63e73b-6562-4a93-91e7-16dcdf690c45\', \'multiverseId\': 404634}, \'multiverseid\': 404634}, {\'name\': \'林木瀑布\', \'text\': \'林木瀑布须横置进战场。{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的法术力池中。{2}{G}{U}：林木瀑布成为3/3绿蓝双色，具辟邪异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a5e9ab-1ac0-4292-8c3a-de6bb523f6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 402242}, \'multiverseid\': 402242}, {\'name\': \'林木瀑布\', \'text\': \'林木瀑布須橫置進戰場。{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。{2}{G}{U}：林木瀑布成為3/3綠藍雙色，具辟邪異能的元素生物直到回合結束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b78de8-c485-4235-b322-339953239743\', \'multiverseId\': 402541}, \'multiverseid\': 402541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Emeria\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —• Bringe einen 1/1 weißen Kor-Verbündeter-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b7b8ed-fd12-44e6-8914-47e665cce3ab\', \'multiverseId\': 402904}, \'multiverseid\': 402904}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Emeria\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:• Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Aliado Kor blanca 1/1.• Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c9c548-7aee-49c9-8d2c-8049a919d94e\', \'multiverseId\': 404997}, \'multiverseid\': 404997}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers Éméria\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —• Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Kor et Allié.• Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb23416-9cfc-4c05-9833-bc0bcfd1ef9b\', \'multiverseId\': 403203}, \'multiverseid\': 403203}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Emeria\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —• Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Alleato Kor 1/1 bianca.• Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1538ef4a-3803-4681-ae3b-1acd22342360\', \'multiverseId\': 403502}, \'multiverseid\': 403502}, {\'name\': \'エメリアへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。• 白の１/１のコー・同盟者・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'184cced3-c1c2-40ff-8a4c-172735b89c35\', \'multiverseId\': 403801}, \'multiverseid\': 403801}, {\'name\': \'에메리아로 후퇴\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 하나를 선택한다 —• 1/1 백색 코르 동맹 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.• 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021588db-1da8-4282-9035-4e1e3e1706e7\', \'multiverseId\': 404100}, \'multiverseid\': 404100}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Emeria\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:• Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Kor Aliado.• As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653a9392-0c13-4a5e-9500-3b605b2d7deb\', \'multiverseId\': 404399}, \'multiverseid\': 404399}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Эмерию\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —• Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Кор Союзник.• Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd7f180-6cf4-4630-9c4a-523bc6d50886\', \'multiverseId\': 404698}, \'multiverseid\': 404698}, {\'name\': \'撤往伊美黎\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～• 将一个1/1白色寇族／伙伴衍生生物放进战场。• 由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def5cc9f-f750-4ebe-bf73-68a4fce50042\', \'multiverseId\': 402306}, \'multiverseid\': 402306}, {\'name\': \'撤往伊美黎\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，選擇一項～• 將一個1/1白色寇族／伙伴衍生生物放進戰場。• 由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bb4f4e7-823b-45e0-a037-e4a8fd608388\', \'multiverseId\': 402605}, \'multiverseid\': 402605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Hagra\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 und Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.• Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dbfd627-62ec-4174-9392-7c7fe7ecab80\', \'multiverseId\': 402905}, \'multiverseid\': 402905}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Hagra\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:• La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.• Cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f67e8ae-f71d-4acc-8a79-2a788adc29cf\', \'multiverseId\': 404998}, \'multiverseid\': 404998}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers Hagra\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —• La créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 et acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.• Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403204&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429a2a75-4dbf-420f-9f19-7ed85439e385\', \'multiverseId\': 403204}, \'multiverseid\': 403204}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Hagra\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —• Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 e ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.• Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d5dc2f-4eb8-4441-abb5-d99e4287e5ac\', \'multiverseId\': 403503}, \'multiverseid\': 403503}, {\'name\': \'ハグラへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに接死を得る。• 各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f1b0f09-750f-4d19-b336-b70f9ae7c11d\', \'multiverseId\': 403802}, \'multiverseid\': 403802}, {\'name\': \'하그라로 후퇴\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 하나를 선택한다 —• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 치명타를 얻는다.• 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2ba20e-63b6-4768-8898-8361d8fc6f5a\', \'multiverseId\': 404101}, \'multiverseid\': 404101}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Hagra\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:• A criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 e ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.• Cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f6d6764-0be1-4679-98b8-05ef4196511a\', \'multiverseId\': 404400}, \'multiverseid\': 404400}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Хагру\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —• Целевое существо получает +1/+0 и Смертельное касание до конца хода.• Каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce5f84ae-4d60-4d07-9f9f-a6a6fb00b6de\', \'multiverseId\': 404699}, \'multiverseid\': 404699}, {\'name\': \'撤往赫嘎\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～• 直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+0且获得死触异能。• 每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc9b740-d0f7-4f7c-a5e8-dccdc8f4c44e\', \'multiverseId\': 402307}, \'multiverseid\': 402307}, {\'name\': \'撤往赫嘎\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，選擇一項～• 直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+0且獲得死觸異能。• 每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3436e7b9-6a36-45d0-b3e3-c867194c4796\', \'multiverseId\': 402606}, \'multiverseid\': 402606}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.• Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402906&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0191c8c0-81b8-4fcb-9463-63f17591a51e\', \'multiverseId\': 402906}, \'multiverseid\': 402906}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.• Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea348150-285d-4d7e-9b6e-487792173f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 404999}, \'multiverseid\': 404999}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers le Kazandou\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.• Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6784b2e-bfaf-4ae3-b80b-0b03564057f4\', \'multiverseId\': 403205}, \'multiverseid\': 403205}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.• Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7234bb6d-57ce-475b-927f-927f64064541\', \'multiverseId\': 403504}, \'multiverseid\': 403504}, {\'name\': \'カザンドゥへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。• クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。• あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90abd2bc-674c-40ce-9fb2-71d5e06729aa\', \'multiverseId\': 403803}, \'multiverseid\': 403803}, {\'name\': \'카잔두로 후퇴\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 하나를 선택한다 —• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.• 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35c8765-6d3b-4e3c-9fce-0516207fba06\', \'multiverseId\': 404102}, \'multiverseid\': 404102}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:• Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.• Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b37ddc9d-ea10-46a4-822b-9df67239e2e0\', \'multiverseId\': 404401}, \'multiverseid\': 404401}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Казанду\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —• Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.• Вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05733723-d9aa-4cd2-99f6-7a42a49d6801\', \'multiverseId\': 404700}, \'multiverseid\': 404700}, {\'name\': \'撤往卡赞度\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～• 在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。• 你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78409c49-fa1f-4a40-b414-52cbf0b5fac3\', \'multiverseId\': 402308}, \'multiverseid\': 402308}, {\'name\': \'撤往卡贊度\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，選擇一項～• 在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。• 你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e21404-45c4-49b9-a598-b4a9c26d36ec\', \'multiverseId\': 402607}, \'multiverseid\': 402607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Korallenhelm\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —• Du kannst eine Kreatur deiner Wahl tappen oder enttappen.• Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef906fc7-3d77-4e85-99cd-ef775dc300cc\', \'multiverseId\': 402903}, \'multiverseid\': 402903}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Yelmo de Coral\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:• Puedes girar o enderezar la criatura objetivo.• Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7290cd5-59ef-4af2-bd60-92a12e257c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 404996}, \'multiverseid\': 404996}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers Casque de corail\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —• Vous pouvez engager ou dégager une créature ciblée.• Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403202&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a149543-394c-4bd7-b16b-7c62251c3a20\', \'multiverseId\': 403202}, \'multiverseid\': 403202}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Elmo Corallino\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —• Puoi TAPpare o STAPpare una creatura bersaglio.• Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1fce3cb-aefd-4911-9c86-c14f18740e39\', \'multiverseId\': 403501}, \'multiverseid\': 403501}, {\'name\': \'珊瑚兜への撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップまたはアンタップしてもよい。• 占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cea5ad1-2f6c-4463-af7e-c3f0b12943aa\', \'multiverseId\': 403800}, \'multiverseid\': 403800}, {\'name\': \'산호투구로 후퇴\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 하나를 선택한다 —• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 탭하거나 언탭할 수 있다.• 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a645be5b-8081-47fa-9361-0e2770c50258\', \'multiverseId\': 404099}, \'multiverseid\': 404099}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Elmo de Coral\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:• Você pode virar ou desvirar a criatura alvo.• Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e8edc6d-6c50-4a2f-bd1b-1b447755757f\', \'multiverseId\': 404398}, \'multiverseid\': 404398}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Коралловый Шлем\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —• Вы можете повернуть или развернуть целевое существо.• Предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d989bb4-30cd-49fe-aa7a-7c173f4fb94a\', \'multiverseId\': 404697}, \'multiverseid\': 404697}, {\'name\': \'撤往珊瑚盔\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～• 你可以横置或重置目标生物。• 占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a008b558-d5cb-4e35-8507-2affc8986290\', \'multiverseId\': 402305}, \'multiverseid\': 402305}, {\'name\': \'撤往珊瑚盔\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，選擇一項～• 你可以橫置或重置目標生物。• 占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81926c56-70bb-4bdb-9191-7b66c38651b3\', \'multiverseId\': 402604}, \'multiverseid\': 402604}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Valakut\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a7eff0-b484-4aaf-9f56-4299aa28af9e\', \'multiverseId\': 402907}, \'multiverseid\': 402907}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Valakut\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:• La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.• La criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6a46ed-818e-475a-8f70-da8710edc61a\', \'multiverseId\': 405000}, \'multiverseid\': 405000}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers Valakut\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —• La créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.• La créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6e930f0-1802-4686-bbb4-3d601a2ddaae\', \'multiverseId\': 403206}, \'multiverseid\': 403206}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Valakut\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —• Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.• Una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'489ab553-48f7-49d1-966d-a5fba6d426d7\', \'multiverseId\': 403505}, \'multiverseid\': 403505}, {\'name\': \'ヴァラクートへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722ea379-09ef-4bde-b5f6-2295c8be7c85\', \'multiverseId\': 403804}, \'multiverseid\': 403804}, {\'name\': \'발라쿠트로 후퇴\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 하나를 선택한다 —• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7199b4-6537-444d-86ad-78c6e63286a9\', \'multiverseId\': 404103}, \'multiverseid\': 404103}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Valakut\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:• A criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.• A criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f494a224-ce78-4163-b890-4df5719ccb7f\', \'multiverseId\': 404402}, \'multiverseid\': 404402}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Валакут\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —• Целевое существо получает +2/+0 до конца хода.• Целевое существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3b87f0-f7f3-4c03-be4f-a799ad890d93\', \'multiverseId\': 404701}, \'multiverseid\': 404701}, {\'name\': \'撤往瓦拉库\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～• 目标生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。• 目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a433b43-cfd9-42dd-a500-165eb6dc23ff\', \'multiverseId\': 402309}, \'multiverseid\': 402309}, {\'name\': \'撤往瓦拉庫\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，選擇一項～• 目標生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。• 目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999db166-a2f1-4279-8483-5ca71391ab64\', \'multiverseId\': 402608}, \'multiverseid\': 402608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sandsteinbrücke\', \'text\': \'Die Sandsteinbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.Wenn die Sandsteinbrücke ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402920&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda3ed41-2153-4051-8235-5383bb2d3abf\', \'multiverseId\': 402920}, \'multiverseid\': 402920}, {\'name\': \'Puente de piedra caliza\', \'text\': \'El Puente de piedra caliza entra al campo de batalla girado.Cuando el Puente de piedra caliza entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.{T}: Agrega {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd21fad-53e7-4abf-b944-fc823aeae060\', \'multiverseId\': 405013}, \'multiverseid\': 405013}, {\'name\': \'Pont de grès\', \'text\': "Le Pont de grès arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.Quand le Pont de grès arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.{T} : Ajoutez {W} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403219&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d4e76f4-28b2-4c31-a5c6-ec32ae1f114b\', \'multiverseId\': 403219}, \'multiverseid\': 403219}, {\'name\': \'Ponte di Arenaria\', \'text\': \'Il Ponte di Arenaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.Quando il Ponte di Arenaria entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.{T}: Aggiungi {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb3bffd8-c006-4280-a8ae-84128c2e42ba\', \'multiverseId\': 403518}, \'multiverseid\': 403518}, {\'name\': \'砂岩の橋\', \'text\': \'砂岩の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。砂岩の橋が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに警戒を得る。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a2b934-d098-4e24-9659-e69b7be98175\', \'multiverseId\': 403817}, \'multiverseid\': 403817}, {\'name\': \'사암 다리\', \'text\': \'사암 다리는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.사암 다리가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 경계를 얻는다.{T}: {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c4e3a7-06dd-4fb9-8042-131fd6360cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 404116}, \'multiverseid\': 404116}, {\'name\': \'Ponte de Arenito\', \'text\': \'Ponte de Arenito entra no campo de batalha virada.Quando Ponte de Arenito entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha vigilância até o final do turno.{T}: Adicione {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d1b869a-5d0b-49ae-8266-f21a7208598e\', \'multiverseId\': 404415}, \'multiverseid\': 404415}, {\'name\': \'Мост из Песчаника\', \'text\': \'Мост из Песчаника выходит на поле битвы повернутым.Когда Мост из Песчаника выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +1/+1 и Бдительность до конца хода.{T}: добавьте {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98003d5c-c3ef-4e7c-a78a-5716f8a2f121\', \'multiverseId\': 404714}, \'multiverseid\': 404714}, {\'name\': \'砂岩桥\', \'text\': \'砂岩桥须横置进战场。当砂岩桥进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+1且获得警戒异能。{T}：加{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc965e6-b3ac-41e9-88af-d668101077d3\', \'multiverseId\': 402322}, \'multiverseid\': 402322}, {\'name\': \'砂岩橋\', \'text\': \'砂岩橋須橫置進戰場。當砂岩橋進戰場時，直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+1且獲得警戒異能。{T}：加{W}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1dee0d-13a9-4dc4-8c4f-1e42b6d45df0\', \'multiverseId\': 402621}, \'multiverseid\': 402621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Scharfschützin aus Hagra\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Schwachstelle zu finden ist nicht einfach, aber die Suche danach bereitet mir großes Vergnügen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e515f4cc-f3cd-4f49-8674-44516b512160\', \'multiverseId\': 402805}, \'multiverseid\': 402805}, {\'name\': \'Tiradora de primera de Hagra\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Es difícil encontrar sus puntos débiles, pero disfruto mucho buscándolos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d05bfc67-9b93-403f-b362-29585efc92f4\', \'multiverseId\': 404898}, \'multiverseid\': 404898}, {\'name\': "Franc-tireuse d\'Hagra", \'text\': "{4}{B} : La créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Trouver leurs points faibles n\'est pas facile, mais la démarche me plaît beaucoup. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f6574a-075c-46e0-a248-b86bc4f96a68\', \'multiverseId\': 403104}, \'multiverseid\': 403104}, {\'name\': \'Tiratrice Scelta di Hagra\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: Una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È difficile trovare i loro punti deboli, ma adoro il processo di scoperta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae70cc1-47f4-419f-ad62-1aa9ce28f274\', \'multiverseId\': 403403}, \'multiverseid\': 403403}, {\'name\': \'ハグラの名射手\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつらの弱点はなかなか見つからない。でも、それを探すことが楽しいのよね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'810bcc71-212a-4720-a4ba-fab2bf222788\', \'multiverseId\': 403702}, \'multiverseid\': 403702}, {\'name\': \'하그라 명사수\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 암살자 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"그들의 약점을 찾기는 매우 어렵지, 하지만 난 찾는 과정을 굉장히 즐기거든."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edbf1a35-55d2-47b4-b1db-cb19fdb65b36\', \'multiverseId\': 404001}, \'multiverseid\': 404001}, {\'name\': \'Atiradora de Elite de Hagra\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: A criatura alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Assassino Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"É difícil encontrar os pontos fracos deles, mas eu gosto muito do processo de descobri-los."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5840a562-dd41-4b92-80cb-5f2c2f49e1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 404300}, \'multiverseid\': 404300}, {\'name\': \'Снайпер из Хагры\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: целевое существо получает -1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Убийца Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Найти их слабые места непросто, но сам поиск доставляет мне массу удовольствия».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e2f3b09-f325-40e1-ac9c-6f1300cc4e86\', \'multiverseId\': 404599}, \'multiverseid\': 404599}, {\'name\': \'赫嘎神射手\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}：目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／杀手／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「找出它们的弱点并非易事，但是我很享受寻找的过程。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44bffb6a-1efb-4c18-afff-df6b24f40635\', \'multiverseId\': 402207}, \'multiverseid\': 402207}, {\'name\': \'赫嘎神射手\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}：目標生物得-1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／殺手／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「找出它們的弱點並非易事，但是我很享受尋找的過程。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57654adc-e7b1-4f50-bad7-536546a32366\', \'multiverseId\': 402506}, \'multiverseid\': 402506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattengleiterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Einige Kor haben in den ausgedehnten Höhlensystemen Zendikars Zuflucht vor den Eldrazi gesucht. Sie verlassen sich auf ihre Fähigkeit, in dieser rauen, vertikalen Landschaft zu überleben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa3987a-4b94-44b5-8b77-0a0d7287a280\', \'multiverseId\': 402927}, \'multiverseid\': 402927}, {\'name\': \'Planeador de las sombras\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado kor\', \'flavor\': \'Unos pocos grupos de kor se refugiaron de los Eldrazi en las vastas redes de túneles de Zendikar, confiando en su habilidad para sobrevivir en duros terrenos verticales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'013531a9-f107-4fc8-8eb9-5ae911991d39\', \'multiverseId\': 405020}, \'multiverseid\': 405020}, {\'name\': "Planeuse de l\'ombre", \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : kor et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Quelques bandes de kor trouvèrent refuge dans l\'immense réseau caverneux de Zendikar, se fiant à leur maîtrise des environnements verticaux pour survivre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eefcfb85-05f6-4d79-9b56-b34bfc803c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 403226}, \'multiverseid\': 403226}, {\'name\': "Aliante dell\'Ombra", \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Kor\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni gruppi di kor cercarono rifugio dagli Eldrazi nei vasti reticoli di caverne di Zendikar, affidandosi alla propria capacità di sopravvivere in ostili ambienti verticali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92480cc2-539b-4621-9441-68d7045d3d75\', \'multiverseId\': 403525}, \'multiverseid\': 403525}, {\'name\': \'影の滑空者\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージから逃れるため、一部のコーは入り組んだゼンディカーの巨大な洞窟に入り、荒れた上下に長い環境での生存に賭けた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f6dd6db-5500-4f30-a465-348bac4e5668\', \'multiverseId\': 403824}, \'multiverseid\': 403824}, {\'name\': \'그림자 활강자\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 병사\', \'flavor\': \'몇 무리의 코르들이 엘드라지를 피해 젠디카르의 광대한 동굴망에서 피난처를 찾고 있다. 이들은 척박한 절벽들 사이에서 생존할 능력을 갖추고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19dd3f06-6113-47ae-b5f6-e7442514d91c\', \'multiverseId\': 404123}, \'multiverseid\': 404123}, {\'name\': \'Planador das Sombras\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns grupos de kor buscaram refúgio dos Eldrazi nas vastas redes de cavernas de Zendikar, contando com a própria habilidade de sobreviver em ambientes verticais hostis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39b5c2c-7b66-43f1-b062-1a571f45995b\', \'multiverseId\': 404422}, \'multiverseid\': 404422}, {\'name\': \'Летяга Теней\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые корские племена спасались от Эльдрази в гигантских пещерах Зендикара, полагаясь на свою способность выживать в опасных вертикальных ландшафтах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1237d51-3638-4643-8c2b-323fdd6191dd\', \'multiverseId\': 404721}, \'multiverseid\': 404721}, {\'name\': \'暗影滑翔翼\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'一部分寇族在赞迪卡相连的深邃洞穴中躲避奥札奇，全凭着他们在严峻的垂直地形中生存的能力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a277fd40-2504-4033-8932-f67eefa5d489\', \'multiverseId\': 402329}, \'multiverseid\': 402329}, {\'name\': \'闇影滑翔翼\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'一部分寇族在贊迪卡相連的深邃洞穴中躲避奧札奇，全憑著他們在嚴峻的垂直地形中生存的能力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727f8bb7-73dc-47fe-bd53-d5e9de10c794\', \'multiverseId\': 402628}, \'multiverseid\': 402628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlammkriecher\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Zehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.){2}: Der Schlammkriecher erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bae25eb2-a5f6-4f9b-bafe-5b61996de068\', \'multiverseId\': 402938}, \'multiverseid\': 402938}, {\'name\': \'Rondador babosa\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.){2}: El Rondador babosa obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bae67da0-49c6-4dba-8426-026824ae5f43\', \'multiverseId\': 405031}, \'multiverseid\': 405031}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur de vase\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Ingestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.){2} : Le Rampeur de vase gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403237&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23e5c5d-3ea1-4070-a62c-a19b45fa731e\', \'multiverseId\': 403237}, \'multiverseid\': 403237}, {\'name\': \'Strisciante della Fanghiglia\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ingerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.){2}: Lo Strisciante della Fanghiglia prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d03fea8-bb0e-4321-9111-fcc52821b2b0\', \'multiverseId\': 403536}, \'multiverseid\': 403536}, {\'name\': \'泥這い\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）{2}：ターン終了時まで、泥這いは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befe34b0-37a4-47ca-80eb-d50ee2c819f8\', \'multiverseId\': 403835}, \'multiverseid\': 403835}, {\'name\': \'침전물 잠복꾼\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.){2}: 침전물 잠복꾼은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b85039d-e306-4c03-a7d8-1bfc77c84903\', \'multiverseId\': 404134}, \'multiverseid\': 404134}, {\'name\': \'Rastejador da Imundície\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Ingerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.){2}: Rastejador da Imundície recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e86197c5-dca6-486a-8d32-5743ec3e3206\', \'multiverseId\': 404433}, \'multiverseid\': 404433}, {\'name\': \'Илистый Ползун\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Заглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.){2}: Илистый Ползун получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b5f34a-b15b-44ae-96a8-13d94550f57e\', \'multiverseId\': 404732}, \'multiverseid\': 404732}, {\'name\': \'泥泞匍体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）{2}：泥泞匍体得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f16e6d-1e84-4eb1-be3b-bb78f00fa03e\', \'multiverseId\': 402340}, \'multiverseid\': 402340}, {\'name\': \'泥濘匍體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）{2}：泥濘匍體得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0ab1ac-acae-4d51-944e-f19ce68cedca\', \'multiverseId\': 402639}, \'multiverseid\': 402639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlinge des Erstarrens\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)Wenn die Schlinge des Erstarrens ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis die Schlinge des Erstarrens das Spiel verlässt. (Diese Kreatur kehrt unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b81a12b-8f5f-407e-88c6-c9d24f6d6de2\', \'multiverseId\': 402945}, \'multiverseid\': 402945}, {\'name\': \'Trampa de estasis\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)Cuando la Trampa de estasis entre al campo de batalla, exilia la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente hasta que la Trampa de estasis deje el campo de batalla. (Esa criatura regresa bajo el control de su propietario.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8fed361-dd55-4e07-a2a3-c6a5228fa36b\', \'multiverseId\': 405038}, \'multiverseid\': 405038}, {\'name\': \'Collet de stase\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)Quand le Collet de stase arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que le Collet de stase quitte le champ de bataille. (Cette créature revient sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403244&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e14aec-449b-494c-966b-4822650b00c7\', \'multiverseId\': 403244}, \'multiverseid\': 403244}, {\'name\': \'Trappola Statica\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)Quando la Trappola Statica entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario finché la Trappola Statica non lascia il campo di battaglia. (Quella creatura torna sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a52fadc-63e5-4354-a148-5f1a0a8ef804\', \'multiverseId\': 403543}, \'multiverseid\': 403543}, {\'name\': \'停滞の罠\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）停滞の罠が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、停滞の罠が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。（そのクリーチャーはオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻る。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b8cdcc8-944d-4a2a-9d36-b2a04a0db1ea\', \'multiverseId\': 403842}, \'multiverseid\': 403842}, {\'name\': \'정체 올가미\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)정체 올가미가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 정체 올가미가 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다. (그 생물은 그 소유자의 조종 하에 전장으로 돌아온다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a874ebc-6807-46c0-9714-bd070c9bc5aa\', \'multiverseId\': 404141}, \'multiverseid\': 404141}, {\'name\': \'Armadilha Estática\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)Quando Armadilha Estática entrar no campo de batalha, exile a criatura alvo que um oponente controla até que Armadilha Estática deixe o campo de batalha. (Aquela criatura retorna sob o controle de seu dono.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb4a251a-99d4-4f2f-ba07-27e81a4ed7a2\', \'multiverseId\': 404440}, \'multiverseid\': 404440}, {\'name\': \'Силки Оцепенения\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)Когда Силки Оцепенения выходят на поле битвы, изгоните целевое существо под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Силки Оцепенения не покинут поле битвы. (То существо возвращается под контролем своего владельца.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7bb86d2-a923-48f3-873c-2bb25097cecd\', \'multiverseId\': 404739}, \'multiverseid\': 404739}, {\'name\': \'静态圈套\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）当静态圈套进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的生物，直到静态圈套离开战场为止。（该生物会在其拥有者的操控下移回。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d675b234-8893-439c-98c9-412c8a77a7ba\', \'multiverseId\': 402347}, \'multiverseid\': 402347}, {\'name\': \'靜態圈套\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）當靜態圈套進戰場時，放逐目標由對手操控的生物，直到靜態圈套離開戰場為止。（該生物會在其擁有者的操控下移回。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61688090-fad0-40d9-ac45-fcd4e810c3f9\', \'multiverseId\': 402646}, \'multiverseid\': 402646}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schluchtführerin\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Schluchtführerin oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Späher, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Einst als entbehrlich verschmäht, gilt sie nun als absolut unentbehrlich — alles was es brauchte, war eine Heldentat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd54990-e8df-41c7-a6d4-3f4ee138862a\', \'multiverseId\': 402737}, \'multiverseid\': 402737}, {\'name\': \'Guía del magma\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que el Guía del magma u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador trasgo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Con un solo acto de valentía, dejó de ser prescindible para volverse indispensable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64e5c429-04c0-4bfd-9683-33e6e60e328d\', \'multiverseId\': 404830}, \'multiverseid\': 404830}, {\'name\': \'Guide des gouffres\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que le Guide des gouffres ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et éclaireur et allié\', \'flavor\': "Il lui suffit d\'un acte de bravoure pour passer d\'accessoire à indispensable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403036&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b753dccc-1276-4d17-86b8-369ba44aa318\', \'multiverseId\': 403036}, \'multiverseid\': 403036}, {\'name\': \'Guida dei Baratri\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta la Guida dei Baratri o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Esploratore Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Con un solo atto di coraggio, da sacrificabile divenne indispensabile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d6e61ea-2792-4780-a4a8-d23933b7e97c\', \'multiverseId\': 403335}, \'multiverseid\': 403335}, {\'name\': \'地割れの案内人\', \'text\': \'結集 ― 地割れの案内人か他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・スカウト・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'一度の勇敢な働きで、彼女の扱いは「その他大勢」から「欠かせない」に変わった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eda9db3-33d1-45f5-9ebc-cdbeeff60f94\', \'multiverseId\': 403634}, \'multiverseid\': 403634}, {\'name\': \'협곡 길잡이\', \'text\': \'결집 — 협곡 길잡이나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 정찰병 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 한 번의 용감한 행동으로 없어서는 안 될 중요한 존재가 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b74421a-d67a-4c19-89ff-3963df83e1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 403933}, \'multiverseid\': 403933}, {\'name\': \'Guia do Abismo\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Guia do Abismo ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Batedor Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Com um único ato de bravura ela passou de descartável a indispensável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d785be23-da74-44a8-afba-bb796d68e0ba\', \'multiverseId\': 404232}, \'multiverseid\': 404232}, {\'name\': \'Проводница по Разломам\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Проводница по Разломам или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Разведчик Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Один отважный поступок превратил ее из пушечного мяса в незаменимую помощницу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'988b0d88-812f-4260-8074-2a4cb8d52ade\', \'multiverseId\': 404531}, \'multiverseid\': 404531}, {\'name\': \'深峡向导\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当深峡向导或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'她的勇猛之举让她从无足轻重变成不可或缺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'436131bf-778d-4ff6-9369-f5321a928150\', \'multiverseId\': 402139}, \'multiverseid\': 402139}, {\'name\': \'深峽嚮導\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當深峽嚮導或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'她的勇猛之舉讓她從無足輕重變成不可或缺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edab1305-37c1-4411-ad6f-3b166b48f74e\', \'multiverseId\': 402438}, \'multiverseid\': 402438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlurfender Schlot\', \'text\': \'Der Schlurfende Schlot kommt getappt ins Spiel.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {B}.{1}{W}{B}: Der Schlurfende Schlot wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/3 weißen und schwarzen Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Lebensverknüpfung. Er ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86fefcb9-b4db-4fd2-b4ab-4cde900901f3\', \'multiverseId\': 402928}, \'multiverseid\': 402928}, {\'name\': \'Fumarolas reptantes\', \'text\': \'Las Fumarolas reptantes entran al campo de batalla giradas.{T}: Agrega {W} o {B} a tu reserva de maná.{1}{W}{B}: Las Fumarolas reptantes se convierten en una criatura Elemental blanca y negra 2/3 con la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno. Siguen siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3bf8dff-161d-47cc-b598-ac0d5d533f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 405021}, \'multiverseid\': 405021}, {\'name\': \'Fumerolles titubantes\', \'text\': "Les Fumerolles titubantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B} à votre réserve.{1}{W}{B} : Les Fumerolles titubantes deviennent une créature 2/3 blanche et noire Élémental avec le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'523be861-717b-4675-ab6d-815413bea522\', \'multiverseId\': 403227}, \'multiverseid\': 403227}, {\'name\': \'Sfiatatoio Barcollante\', \'text\': \'Lo Sfiatatoio Barcollante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B} alla tua riserva di mana.{1}{W}{B}: Lo Sfiatatoio Barcollante diventa una creatura Elementale 2/3 bianca e nera con legame vitale fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbcc7cf-947a-416b-80bd-bc73f8137050\', \'multiverseId\': 403526}, \'multiverseid\': 403526}, {\'name\': \'乱脈な気孔\', \'text\': \'乱脈な気孔はタップ状態で戦場に出る。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{B}を加える。{1}{W}{B}：ターン終了時まで、乱脈な気孔は絆魂を持つ白であり黒である２/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc68ba26-9a13-4d2c-8588-fa5de5d5db29\', \'multiverseId\': 403825}, \'multiverseid\': 403825}, {\'name\': \'어기적거리는 분출구\', \'text\': \'어기적거리는 분출구는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.{T}: {W} 또는 {B}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{1}{W}{B}: 턴종료까지, 어기적거리는 분출구는 생명연결을 가진 백색이며 흑색인 2/3 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee8980ac-1817-43aa-aaed-1ed644e5353a\', \'multiverseId\': 404124}, \'multiverseid\': 404124}, {\'name\': \'Exaustor Trôpego\', \'text\': \'Exaustor Trôpego entra no campo de batalha virado.{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B} à sua reserva de mana.{1}{W}{B}: Exaustor Trôpego torna-se uma criatura branca e preta 2/3 do tipo Elemental com vínculo com a vida até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6871a8b1-ed89-49ad-9313-3488d4fc9225\', \'multiverseId\': 404423}, \'multiverseid\': 404423}, {\'name\': \'Бродячее Жерло\', \'text\': \'Бродячее Жерло выходит на поле битвы повернутым.{T}: добавьте {W} или {B} в ваше хранилище маны.{1}{W}{B}: Бродячее Жерло становится существом 2/3 белый и черный Элементаль с Цепью жизни до конца хода. При этом оно остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abbb25c7-21e3-4aea-8074-52c14208a8b7\', \'multiverseId\': 404722}, \'multiverseid\': 404722}, {\'name\': \'跛行喷发口\', \'text\': \'跛行喷发口须横置进战场。{T}：加{W}或{B}到你的法术力池中。{1}{W}{B}：跛行喷发口成为2/3白黑双色，具系命异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f7a0ee-a3c2-451e-8568-e521a69a64f7\', \'multiverseId\': 402330}, \'multiverseid\': 402330}, {\'name\': \'跛行噴發口\', \'text\': \'跛行噴發口須橫置進戰場。{T}：加{W}或{B}到你的魔法力池中。{1}{W}{B}：跛行噴發口成為2/3白黑雙色，具繫命異能的元素生物直到回合結束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c21f03-7fc8-4e30-9d91-d4e9521ff5f5\', \'multiverseId\': 402629}, \'multiverseid\': 402629}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlängelnder Stachel\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Der Schlängelnde Stachel fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte, einer anderen Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte und einer dritten Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls eine Kreatur, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed20e85-3950-4b97-a32d-27e33bd16a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 402926}, \'multiverseid\': 402926}, {\'name\': \'Perforación serpentina\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)La Perforación serpentina hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo, 3 puntos de daño a otra criatura objetivo y 4 puntos de daño a una tercera criatura objetivo. Si una criatura que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a9e1364-6949-4294-ab4c-1d428eaeb546\', \'multiverseId\': 405019}, \'multiverseid\': 405019}, {\'name\': \'Pointe serpentine\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)La Pointe serpentine inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée, 3 blessures à une autre créature ciblée, et 4 blessures à une troisième créature ciblée. Si une créature ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d832449-3eab-4957-8724-3530865a8e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 403225}, \'multiverseid\': 403225}, {\'name\': \'Picca Serpentina\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)La Picca Serpentina infligge 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio, 3 danni a un\'altra creatura bersaglio e 4 danni a una terza creatura bersaglio. Se una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b245f5-58c1-4a66-a9df-f71821871d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 403524}, \'multiverseid\': 403524}, {\'name\': \'うねる撃ちこみ\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）クリーチャー１体と他のクリーチャー１体とさらに他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。うねる撃ちこみはその第一者に２点のダメージを与え、その第二者に３点のダメージを与え、その第三者に４点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c48e6876-8924-4802-a962-361b4837f5cf\', \'multiverseId\': 403823}, \'multiverseid\': 403823}, {\'name\': \'이무기 가시\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)생물 세 개를 목표로 정한다. 이무기 가시는 첫 번째 목표에게 피해 2점을, 두 번째 목표에게 피해 3점을, 세 번째 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다. 이렇게 피해를 입은 생물이 이번 턴에 죽으려고 하면, 대신에 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0797935-281b-4977-b5da-0a49be567d4e\', \'multiverseId\': 404122}, \'multiverseid\': 404122}, {\'name\': \'Espinho Serpenteante\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Espinho Serpenteante causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo, 3 pontos de dano a outra criatura alvo e 4 pontos de dano a uma terceira criatura alvo. Se uma criatura que sofreu dano dessa maneira morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c62bc5e2-d13d-429c-b042-294074f09a55\', \'multiverseId\': 404421}, \'multiverseid\': 404421}, {\'name\': \'Змеиный Шип\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Змеиный Шип наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу, 3 повреждения другому целевому существу и 4 повреждения третьему целевому существу. Если существо, которому таким образом были нанесены повреждения, должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe6727a-7c75-489e-acaa-994f169f77f7\', \'multiverseId\': 404720}, \'multiverseid\': 404720}, {\'name\': \'盘曲穿刺\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）盘曲穿刺对目标生物造成2点伤害，对另一个目标生物造成3点伤害，对第三个目标生物造成4点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90bf50fd-8035-4a4e-a7fc-b39b21deecde\', \'multiverseId\': 402328}, \'multiverseid\': 402328}, {\'name\': \'盤曲穿刺\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）盤曲穿刺對目標生物造成2點傷害，對另一個目標生物造成3點傷害，對第三個目標生物造成4點傷害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到傷害的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f265d956-f4ef-4df2-bae9-b3dcd2091907\', \'multiverseId\': 402627}, \'multiverseid\': 402627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmelzbrutplatz\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Immer wenn du einen farblosen Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt der Schmelzbrutplatz einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Manche Umwege sind es einfach nicht wert."—Raff Schneckenkauer, Goblin-Abkürzer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc7ab28-92f7-4380-95ea-f2f3ac9480c8\', \'multiverseId\': 402848}, \'multiverseid\': 402848}, {\'name\': \'Vivero de lava\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Siempre que lances un hechizo incoloro, el Vivero de lava hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos atajos no merecen la pena".—Raff Comebabosas, acortacaminos trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e3c8ba-097f-48ed-8ee8-af84c4695720\', \'multiverseId\': 404941}, \'multiverseid\': 404941}, {\'name\': \'Pépinière en fusion\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort incolore, la Pépinière en fusion inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Certains détours sont tout à fait inutiles. »—Raff Gobelimace, accourcisseur gobelin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403147&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11adb5d0-d49f-494f-8729-74dfa55ee1a9\', \'multiverseId\': 403147}, \'multiverseid\': 403147}, {\'name\': \'Vivaio Rovente\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incolore, il Vivaio Rovente infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcune deviazioni non valgono proprio la pena."—Raff Mangialumache, goblin delle scorciatoie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e04591-e54a-4352-b578-c771f0647b00\', \'multiverseId\': 403446}, \'multiverseid\': 403446}, {\'name\': \'溶鉄の生育場\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）あなたが無色の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。溶鉄の生育場はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「回り道なんて無駄無駄。」――ゴブリンの近道抜け、ナメクジ喰いのラフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e323db-9b71-4890-90e0-a307111fd5f1\', \'multiverseId\': 403745}, \'multiverseid\': 403745}, {\'name\': \'용암 사육장\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신이 무색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 용암 사육장은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"돌아가는 것만이 능사는 아니야."—고블린 길잡이, 민달팽이 탐식자 라프\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba56503d-7cc2-47b1-af65-fe6160bafe4f\', \'multiverseId\': 404044}, \'multiverseid\': 404044}, {\'name\': \'Viveiro Fundido\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica incolor, Viveiro Fundido causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Alguns desvios simplesmente não valem a pena."— Raff Papalesma, atalhadeiro goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'624c27cc-6b3a-4df9-9a40-eb17014d211a\', \'multiverseId\': 404343}, \'multiverseid\': 404343}, {\'name\': \'Расплавленный Инкубатор\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете бесцветное заклинание, Расплавленный Инкубатор наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Иногда не стоит идти в обход».— Рафф Слизнеед, срезающий путь гоблин\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1563a27-1005-46e9-a1f3-ab387f15c8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 404642}, \'multiverseid\': 404642}, {\'name\': \'热融滋生\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）每当你施放无色咒语时，热融滋生对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「有些路绕不得。」～抄捷径鬼怪食虫拉夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb08fa6-90a2-42a6-9010-6224b77a6a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 402250}, \'multiverseid\': 402250}, {\'name\': \'熱融滋生\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）每當你施放無色咒語時，熱融滋生對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「有些路繞不得。」〜抄捷徑鬼怪食蟲拉夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f580d181-f3b3-4524-88aa-c215e271f57f\', \'multiverseId\': 402549}, \'multiverseid\': 402549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmerzliche Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um Schmerzliche Wahrheit zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Eldrazi sich ausbreiteten, scheuten Zendikars Verteidiger auf der Suche nach Geheimnissen, die ihnen einen Vorteil bringen könnten, keine Gefahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5961c1a-0968-43d7-8628-69ca015c69c7\', \'multiverseId\': 402878}, \'multiverseid\': 402878}, {\'name\': \'Verdades que duelen\', \'text\': \'Converger — Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar las Verdades que duelen.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que los Eldrazi avanzaban, se dejó de pensar en los riesgos de cualquier secreto que otorgara ventaja a los defensores de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255fc222-27f5-4f23-a11b-35047632047b\', \'multiverseId\': 404971}, \'multiverseid\': 404971}, {\'name\': \'Vérités douloureuses\', \'text\': \'Convergence — Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer les Vérités douloureuses.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Avec la multiplication des Eldrazi, aucun périple n\'était trop dangereux s\'il permettait de dénicher un secret pouvant avantager les défenseurs de Zendikar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33de723d-e93e-4dc1-aa88-3e9b2b3b4c16\', \'multiverseId\': 403177}, \'multiverseid\': 403177}, {\'name\': \'Verità Dolorose\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Pesca X carte e perdi X punti vita, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare le Verità Dolorose.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Con l\'avanzata degli Eldrazi, nessun segreto che potesse offrire un vantaggio ai difensori di Zendikar venne considerato troppo pericoloso da perseguire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a7fe91-e124-45d9-ba07-272e1409d250\', \'multiverseId\': 403476}, \'multiverseid\': 403476}, {\'name\': \'苦い真理\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― あなたはカードをＸ枚引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘは苦い真理を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージが増えるにつれ、ゼンディカー防衛隊を有利にする秘密であれば、探すのに命を惜しむ者は少なくなっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fff7caf-7343-4209-ac6b-f9d90ac24b4d\', \'multiverseId\': 403775}, \'multiverseid\': 403775}, {\'name\': \'고통스러운 진실\', \'text\': \'화합 — 당신은 카드 X장을 뽑고 당신은 생명 X점을 잃는다. X는 고통스러운 진실을 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수이다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지 세력이 점점 커짐에 따라, 젠디카르의 수비태세에 이득이 되는 일이 너무 위험해서 안 되는 것은 없었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be1089c-495e-4656-9ba6-58e992d67e53\', \'multiverseId\': 404074}, \'multiverseid\': 404074}, {\'name\': \'Verdades Dolorosas\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Você compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Verdades Dolorosas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme os Eldrazi se alastraram, nenhum segredo que pudesse dar alguma vantagem aos defensores de Zendikar foi considerado perigoso demais para ser investigado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a0d9fc-4972-444e-9292-c5d60e1815a3\', \'multiverseId\': 404373}, \'multiverseid\': 404373}, {\'name\': \'Болезненная Правда\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Вы берете X карт и теряете X жизней, где Х — число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Болезненной Правды.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази распространялись по Зендикару, и опасности, подстерегавшие на пути к секретам, дающим преимущества в бою с чудовищами, перестали иметь значение для защитников этого мира.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b2b0995-bb30-4ba5-b75f-3998cf8c1529\', \'multiverseId\': 404672}, \'multiverseid\': 404672}, {\'name\': \'痛苦真相\', \'text\': \'聚辉～你抓X张牌且你失去X点生命，X为施放痛苦真相时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'由于奥札奇的扩张，任何能让赞迪卡抵抗者获得优势的秘密都值得冒险一寻。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d86c37d-2941-4c0b-b680-aec7ac324e87\', \'multiverseId\': 402280}, \'multiverseid\': 402280}, {\'name\': \'痛苦真相\', \'text\': \'聚輝～你抽X張牌且你失去X點生命，X為施放痛苦真相時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'由於奧札奇的擴張，任何能讓贊迪卡抵抗者獲得優勢的秘密都值得冒險一尋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2cc6fd4-946f-4e55-9422-87807df862a8\', \'multiverseId\': 402579}, \'multiverseid\': 402579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schnappender Knurrer\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Schnappende Knurrer +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Lebewesen auf Zendikar spüren den Umbruch, der mit den Eldrazi kommt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4a0b4a-9666-4728-b2c9-57643cf45a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 402942}, \'multiverseid\': 402942}, {\'name\': \'Gnárlido mordiente\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Gnárlido mordiente obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los seres de Zendikar perciben la agitación que acompaña a los Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d85144a4-093a-4a29-85bf-bdd6f00c9942\', \'multiverseId\': 405035}, \'multiverseid\': 405035}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlide happeur\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Gnarlide happeur gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'Tous les êtres de Zendikar sentent le bouleversement causé par les Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403241&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a8e2a4-a965-49ba-8ee3-0368e5df1ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 403241}, \'multiverseid\': 403241}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlid Azzannatore\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, lo Gnarlid Azzannatore prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Tutti gli esseri di Zendikar percepiscono il cataclisma che accompagna gli Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'349337e9-1314-44d5-a0df-61eb919c132d\', \'multiverseId\': 403540}, \'multiverseid\': 403540}, {\'name\': \'噛み付きナーリッド\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、噛み付きナーリッドは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカーに生きる物はみな、エルドラージが引き起こした激変を感じている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc21570-fca4-4b2b-8b8e-245c7a09b613\', \'multiverseId\': 403839}, \'multiverseid\': 403839}, {\'name\': \'달려드는 날리드\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 달려드는 날리드는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'젠디카르의 모든 존재는 엘드라지가 동반하는 격변을 감지한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c47712-0f60-4ee8-a927-3c70142b29cf\', \'multiverseId\': 404138}, \'multiverseid\': 404138}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlid Trinchador\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Gnarlid Trinchador recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Todos os seres de Zendikar sentem a convulsão que acompanha os Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a18d89-8387-4297-af4c-e121b2660073\', \'multiverseId\': 404437}, \'multiverseid\': 404437}, {\'name\': \'Кусачий Нарлид\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Кусачий Нарлид получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Все зендикарские создания чувствуют, как дрожит земля, когда приближаются Эльдрази.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3e954c-9aa0-4fe5-bbeb-420d161195ab\', \'multiverseId\': 404736}, \'multiverseid\': 404736}, {\'name\': \'急攫糙节兽\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，急攫糙节兽得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡的所有生灵都感受到了奥札奇带来的剧变。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56d5d26-cd52-4b1d-9ae6-7896c5192a44\', \'multiverseId\': 402344}, \'multiverseid\': 402344}, {\'name\': \'急攫糙節獸\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，急攫糙節獸得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'贊迪卡的所有生靈都感受到了奧札奇帶來的劇變。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f497f441-3925-47e6-a0fa-2d024009de66\', \'multiverseId\': 402643}, \'multiverseid\': 402643}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrein der vergessenen Götter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um farblose Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du sieben oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gottheiten, die dem Meervolk als Ula, Emeria und Cosi bekannt sind, waren nichts weiter als falsche Erinnerungen an die drei monströsen Eldrazi-Titanen Ulamog, Emrakul und Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03a29f9-2727-4122-9581-de553a14d715\', \'multiverseId\': 402931}, \'multiverseid\': 402931}, {\'name\': \'Altar de los dioses olvidados\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos incoloros. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas siete o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los dioses que los tritones conocían como Ula, Emeria y Cosi no eran más que recuerdos falsos de la monstruosa trinidad compuesta por los titanes Eldrazi: Ulamog, Emrakul y Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'348e0cfd-82e3-4dcc-a417-3386a88cccc7\', \'multiverseId\': 405024}, \'multiverseid\': 405024}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire des Dieux abandonnés\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts incolores. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins sept terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les dieux Ula, Éméria et Cosi des ondins n\'étaient en réalité que des souvenirs pervertis de la trinité monstrueuse des titans Eldrazi : Ulamog, Emrakul et Kozilek.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e343457-77cb-429f-b60b-39e0e094bf37\', \'multiverseId\': 403230}, \'multiverseid\': 403230}, {\'name\': \'Santuario degli Dei Rinnegati\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie incolori. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli sette o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Gli dei noti ai tritoni come Ula, Emeria e Cosi non erano altro che falsi ricordi di una mostruosa trinità: i titani Eldrazi Ulamog, Emrakul e Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'251a4c4d-e4a9-4fdb-a6a5-2367a533ec9f\', \'multiverseId\': 403529}, \'multiverseid\': 403529}, {\'name\': \'見捨てられた神々の神殿\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。このマナは、無色の呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。この能力は、あなたが７つ以上の土地をコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'マーフォークがウーラ、エメリア、コーシと呼び崇めていた三神は、実際にはウラモグ、エムラクール、コジレックという三大エルドラージの誤った記憶でしかなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'078fa306-7a8d-4625-a1b0-4cbeca2104e5\', \'multiverseId\': 403828}, \'multiverseid\': 403828}, {\'name\': \'버림받은 신들의 성소\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{T}: {2}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다. 이 마나는 무색 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다. 이 능력은 당신이 대지를 일곱 개 이상 조종할 때에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'인어들에게 신으로 알려진 울라, 에메리아와 코시는 괴기스러운 삼위일체인 엘드라지 거신 울라목, 엠라쿨과 코질렉의 거짓 기억에 불과했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6911df-9629-466c-993a-b5c0c86b2fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 404127}, \'multiverseid\': 404127}, {\'name\': \'Santuário dos Deuses Esquecidos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{T}: Adicione {2} à sua reserva de mana. Gaste este mana apenas para conjurar mágicas incolores. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar sete ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os deuses conhecidos pelos tritões como Ula, Emeria e Cosi não passavam de falsas lembranças de uma trindade monstruosa: os titãs Eldrazi Ulamog, Emrakul e Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e17acd-62b7-4fc0-9730-6c8d1dc52646\', \'multiverseId\': 404426}, \'multiverseid\': 404426}, {\'name\': \'Храм Забытых Богов\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{T}: добавьте {2} в ваше хранилище маны. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание бесцветных заклинаний. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете не менее семи земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Боги, которых мерфолки называли Улой, Эмерией и Коси, были лишь ложными воспоминаниями о чудовищной троице титанов Эльдрази: Уламоге, Эмракул и Козилеке.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb65172-0234-4b0e-b47a-3af57afff7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 404725}, \'multiverseid\': 404725}, {\'name\': \'弃神祭祠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{T}：加{2}到你的法术力池中。此法术力只能用来施放无色咒语。只能于你操控七个或更多地时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人鱼称为钨拉、伊美黎和寇希的神明，不过是对恐怖三体～钨拉莫、伊莫库和寇基雷这三个庞巨奥札奇的错误记忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24ce417-0d4c-4178-982d-70fa1442c001\', \'multiverseId\': 402333}, \'multiverseid\': 402333}, {\'name\': \'棄神祭祠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{T}：加{2}到你的魔法力池中。此魔法力只能用來施放無色咒語。只能於你操控七個或更多地時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人魚稱為鎢拉、伊美黎和寇希的神明，不過是對恐怖三體～鎢拉莫、伊莫庫和寇基雷這三個龐巨奧札奇的錯誤記憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143264ae-9ab0-4d1b-9d7b-d80a49bfc83d\', \'multiverseId\': 402632}, \'multiverseid\': 402632}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarmflut\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Farblose Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten außerdem Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eldrazi fielen als kreischende, bebende Fleischmasse über Zendikar her.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f387e7-a85b-4315-9442-4f46a388c006\', \'multiverseId\': 402960}, \'multiverseid\': 402960}, {\'name\': \'Oleada del enjambre\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno. Las criaturas incoloras que controlas ganan además la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi arrasaron todo Zendikar en una marea de carne siseante y jadeante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'944fbb59-2686-4aef-bfdb-ad69dcebb449\', \'multiverseId\': 405053}, \'multiverseid\': 405053}, {\'name\': "Déferlement de l\'essaim", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Les créatures incolores que vous contrôlez acquièrent aussi l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les Eldrazi ravageaient Zendikar dans une marée de chairs soupirantes et caquetantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403259&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d6ec2f-ac4d-4aae-a85a-84f381b27603\', \'multiverseId\': 403259}, \'multiverseid\': 403259}, {\'name\': \'Impeto dello Sciame\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Le creature incolori che controlli hanno anche attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Eldrazi infuriarono su Zendikar in una marea di carne brulicante e ondeggiante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2236bd95-f6cc-46e1-a8cf-68221ebc4f88\', \'multiverseId\': 403558}, \'multiverseid\': 403558}, {\'name\': \'大群の殺到\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋２/+0の修整を受ける。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールする無色のクリーチャーはさらに先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'甲高い音を立てて肉のうねりが盛り上がり、エルドラージがゼンディカー全土を蹂躙していった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee5ec97-8985-47f4-a30b-7e0a65661b47\', \'multiverseId\': 403857}, \'multiverseid\': 403857}, {\'name\': \'휘몰아치는 무리\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다. 당신이 조종하는 무색 생물들은 턴종료까지 선제공격도 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'엄청난 엘드라지 무리들이 젠디카르 전역에서 날뛰고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d410446e-c512-48a3-bc95-525c66622fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 404156}, \'multiverseid\': 404156}, {\'name\': \'Surto do Enxame\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno. As criaturas incolores que você controla também ganham iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Numa enxurrada de monstruosidades oscilantes e estridentes, os Eldrazi assolaram Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4958af73-cbfc-44f1-8421-c1fadb29ff18\', \'multiverseId\': 404455}, \'multiverseid\': 404455}, {\'name\': \'Прорыв Роя\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+0 до конца хода. Бесцветные существа под вашим контролем также получают Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази растекались по Зендикару стрекочущим морем вспучившейся плоти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c656eadd-631d-483e-909a-45ba96833222\', \'multiverseId\': 404754}, \'multiverseid\': 404754}, {\'name\': \'群涌翻腾\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。由你操控的无色生物再获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇肆行赞迪卡，多如潮浪的肉身嘈杂无比。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e2adeee-3911-4cb4-acbb-d6b739e2e6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 402362}, \'multiverseid\': 402362}, {\'name\': \'群湧翻騰\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。由你操控的無色生物再獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇肆行贊迪卡，多如潮浪的肉身嘈雜無比。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb503a1-33ef-439c-8ea9-f7611c69471c\', \'multiverseId\': 402661}, \'multiverseid\': 402661}]', "[{'name': 'Schwelendes Marschland', 'text': '({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {R}.)Das Schwelende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht zwei oder mehr Standardländer kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Guul Draz ist ein geothermisches Sumpfland, in dem die Luft vor Hitze und fauligem Gestank flimmert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402940&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e186ded3-62b3-4178-ba7d-28ad4a57a761', 'multiverseId': 402940}, 'multiverseid': 402940}, {'name': 'Cenagal ardiente', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.)El Cenagal ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': 'El continente de Guul Draz es una ciénaga geotérmica que respira calor y putrefacción.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405033&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0036d7a4-18fc-4523-b074-9e5e6b94059d', 'multiverseId': 405033}, 'multiverseid': 405033}, {'name': 'Marécage fumant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.)Le Marécage fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne', 'flavor': 'Le continent de Guul Draz est un marais géothermique, puant de chaleur et de décomposition.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403239&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9e1e520-7e03-4347-86af-8eda3f0840e3', 'multiverseId': 403239}, 'multiverseid': 403239}, {'name': 'Palude Rovente', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.)La Palude Rovente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Guul Draz è un terreno geotermico paludoso che puzza di afa e putrefazione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403538&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7372c31f-8f1d-4b69-8b0a-aa1ee65fb36c', 'multiverseId': 403538}, 'multiverseid': 403538}, {'name': '燻る湿地', 'text': '（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。）あなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燻る湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': 'グール・ドラズ大陸は温沼地である。地熱による高温と腐敗で燻っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403837&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a41def1e-e0dd-4dca-8a3a-1b666498bebd', 'multiverseId': 403837}, 'multiverseid': 403837}, {'name': '그을린 습지', 'text': '({T}: {B} 또는 {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)그을린 습지는 당신이 다른 기본 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '대지 — 늪 산', 'flavor': '굴 드라즈 대륙은 열기와 썩은 냄새를 풍기는 지열 늪지대이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404136&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7e5e7ed-0dfc-4083-a34a-bec02a641c82', 'multiverseId': 404136}, 'multiverseid': 404136}, {'name': 'Pântano Ardente', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.)Pântano Ardente entra no campo de batalha virado a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': 'O continente de Guul Draz é um grande pântano geotérmico abafado e decadente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404435&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4277ffc2-b6cf-4e70-9e12-c3e163c5231b', 'multiverseId': 404435}, 'multiverseid': 404435}, {'name': 'Тлеющее Болото', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {B} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.)Тлеющее Болото выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Болото Гора', 'flavor': 'Континент Гуул-Драз — разогретое подземным теплом болото, от которого исходят душные гнилостные пары.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404734&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43ea57c5-08ce-431e-b954-195a517a6579', 'multiverseId': 404734}, 'multiverseid': 404734}, {'name': '闷燃沼地', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。）除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则闷燃沼地须横置进战场。', 'type': '地～沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': '古坠兹大陆这片地热沼泽热气蒸腾，腐臭弥漫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402342&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb327aad-ae3e-40da-98bc-eb1087eb640a', 'multiverseId': 402342}, 'multiverseid': 402342}, {'name': '悶燃沼地', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。）除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則悶燃沼地須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地～沼澤／山脈', 'flavor': '古墜茲大陸這片地熱沼澤熱氣蒸騰，腐臭瀰漫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402641&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96852dd7-b0fc-48bc-93ba-c92d2907789b', 'multiverseId': 402641}, 'multiverseid': 402641}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schädeltrümmer-Rekrut\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Von den Kor vor dem sicheren Tode bewahrt, fühlt er sich ihnen nun durch einen Blutschwur für immer verbunden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86d7f8c8-b08a-46ac-a9a2-eda7ea324ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 402929}, \'multiverseid\': 402929}, {\'name\': \'Recluta de Aplastacráneos\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero gigante aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Los kor lo salvaron de una muerte segura; ahora se considera ligado a ellos por un juramento de sangre indisoluble.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7b37c7-9f87-4b01-8fca-7897a70b1532\', \'multiverseId\': 405022}, \'multiverseid\': 405022}, {\'name\': \'Recrue de Fracassecrâne\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': "Sauvé d\'une mort certaine par les kor, il se considère lié à eux par un pacte de sang inviolable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d055744e-986d-4bee-96d2-8df46fb81798\', \'multiverseId\': 403228}, \'multiverseid\': 403228}, {\'name\': \'Recluta di Frantumateschio\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Salvato da morte certa dai kor, si considera legato a loro da un giuramento di sangue indissolubile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75121d5b-9c07-4051-83ab-9e9bc083992d\', \'multiverseId\': 403527}, \'multiverseid\': 403527}, {\'name\': \'髑髏砕きの補充兵\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'死にかかったところをコーに助けられてから、途切れることのない血の誓いで結びついている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6fe0f2a-31e2-46b5-942e-96f9c606fe76\', \'multiverseId\': 403826}, \'multiverseid\': 403826}, {\'name\': \'해골분쇄 징집병\', \'text\': \'호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'그는 코르가 그를 죽음으로부터 구원해준 후 그들과 자신이 뗄 수 없는 피의 맹세로 묶여 있다고 생각한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2c8e16-a76e-4757-8e30-e8d24c6ed5eb\', \'multiverseId\': 404125}, \'multiverseid\': 404125}, {\'name\': \'Recruta de Quebra-crânio\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Salvo da morte certa pelos kor, ele se considera ligado a eles por um laço de sangue inquebrável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b25a33-4fa4-449a-83ae-f16b86eb0eca\', \'multiverseId\': 404424}, \'multiverseid\': 404424}, {\'name\': \'Рекрут Череполомного Перевала\', \'text\': \'Угроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Коры спасли его от неминуемой смерти, и он считает себя связанным с ними нерушимыми узами клятвы на крови.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c94baff-49ab-4d21-a54b-bec74b03ca61\', \'multiverseId\': 404723}, \'multiverseid\': 404723}, {\'name\': \'碎颅新兵\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'寇族助他死里逃生后，他便自认与他们立下了不破血誓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c847a91-dae2-4935-8b7d-72c586af70b8\', \'multiverseId\': 402331}, \'multiverseid\': 402331}, {\'name\': \'碎顱新兵\', \'text\': \'威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'寇族助他死裡逃生後，他便自認與他們立下了不破血誓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66ccd5f-581c-4c75-9876-304bc6bbefca\', \'multiverseId\': 402630}, \'multiverseid\': 402630}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sensenleopard\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Sensenleopard +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Eldrazi zählen nicht zur bevorzugten Beute der Leoparden, aber sie sind besser als gar keine Beute.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847f3b7d-20fa-4074-a325-3acf92493231\', \'multiverseId\': 402923}, \'multiverseid\': 402923}, {\'name\': \'Leopardo guadaña\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Leopardo guadaña obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi no son la presa favorita del leopardo, pero mejor eso que quedarse con hambre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5f5f71-544c-411c-aed1-07f3ba4a37bd\', \'multiverseId\': 405016}, \'multiverseid\': 405016}, {\'name\': \'Léopard à ergots faucheurs\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Léopard à ergots faucheurs gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': \'Les Eldrazi ne sont pas les proies préférées des léopards, mais mieux vaut ça que de ne rien manger du tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ab2e6b-37a0-4ba2-8589-97f8334ad0da\', \'multiverseId\': 403222}, \'multiverseid\': 403222}, {\'name\': \'Leopardo a Falce\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Leopardo a Falce prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Eldrazi non sono la preda preferita del leopardo, ma sono comunque meglio che morire di fame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570a99b5-818b-4c51-ad24-4419cb02412d\', \'multiverseId\': 403521}, \'multiverseid\': 403521}, {\'name\': \'鎌豹\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、鎌豹は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'豹の好物がエルドラージというわけではないが、何も狩れないよりはずっといい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'393eff3a-f125-4cfd-9170-88d2fed2602e\', \'multiverseId\': 403820}, \'multiverseid\': 403820}, {\'name\': \'낫 표범\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 낫 표범은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지가 표범이 좋아하는 먹잇감은 아니지만, 그래도 먹이가 없는 것보다는 낫다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8540c9c-15ce-43c3-b7ce-11b54d864e38\', \'multiverseId\': 404119}, \'multiverseid\': 404119}, {\'name\': \'Leopardo-de-foice\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Leopardo-de-foice recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Os Eldrazi não são a presa preferida do leopardo, mas são melhor que nenhuma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31659cca-c091-472b-b73b-35cf7637b54c\', \'multiverseId\': 404418}, \'multiverseid\': 404418}, {\'name\': \'Серполапый Леопард\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Серполапый Леопард получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази — не самая любимая добыча леопарда, но лучше они, чем вовсе никакой добычи.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653923aa-9247-454d-8d16-f3a3b71a3099\', \'multiverseId\': 404717}, \'multiverseid\': 404717}, {\'name\': \'镰刃豹\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，镰刃豹得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇并不是豹最喜爱的猎物，但总比没有猎物好。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b1a11b-a92f-4fe7-b107-585f5e5f9188\', \'multiverseId\': 402325}, \'multiverseid\': 402325}, {\'name\': \'鐮刃豹\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，鐮刃豹得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇並不是豹最喜愛的獵物，但總比沒有獵物好。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82be96a3-abb8-4516-aa92-e902a79c320b\', \'multiverseId\': 402624}, \'multiverseid\': 402624}]', "[{'name': 'Sich entfaltende Wildnis', 'text': '{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte und bringe sie getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Die Eldrazi mögen unbarmherzig sein, doch Zendikar ist unnachgiebig.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402769&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb004e7b-863b-4e2c-a60e-ae13823df58f', 'multiverseId': 402769}, 'multiverseid': 402769}, {'name': 'Terrenos expansivos', 'text': '{T}, sacrificar los Terrenos expansivos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Los Eldrazi pueden ser implacables, pero Zendikar es incansable.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404862&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3dadfd54-0fc7-4016-83f0-d2427f3b1e7e', 'multiverseId': 404862}, 'multiverseid': 404862}, {'name': 'Étendues sauvages en évolution', 'text': '{T}, sacrifiez les Étendues sauvages en évolution : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Si les Eldrazi sont impitoyables, Zendikar est quant à lui inexorable.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403068&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d77cec9-e503-453d-a715-ceb9dc08a691', 'multiverseId': 403068}, 'multiverseid': 403068}, {'name': 'Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione', 'text': '{T}, Sacrifica le Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Gli Eldrazi sono spietati, ma Zendikar è instancabile.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403367&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad15789f-63f8-4811-a47f-55617cf02d7f', 'multiverseId': 403367}, 'multiverseid': 403367}, {'name': '進化する未開地', 'text': '{T}, 進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'エルドラージは冷酷だが、ゼンディカーも執拗だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403666&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c8582f1-f9dc-49a0-a5b1-8e593cc67c3e', 'multiverseId': 403666}, 'multiverseid': 403666}, {'name': '진화하는 야생지', 'text': '{T}, 진화하는 야생지를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 탭된 채로 전장에 놓는다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '엘드라지는 무자비할지 모르지만 젠디카르는 가차없다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403965&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92fd4915-7c86-4d12-bbb0-bf11f7aeaf27', 'multiverseId': 403965}, 'multiverseid': 403965}, {'name': 'Terras em Desenvolvimento', 'text': '{T}, Sacrifique Terras em Desenvolvimento: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório e coloque-o no campo de batalha virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Os Eldrazi podem ser impiedosos, mas Zendikar é incansável.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404264&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d90ae95-9c7d-49fa-b476-696b3181638c', 'multiverseId': 404264}, 'multiverseid': 404264}, {'name': 'Перерождающиеся Дебри', 'text': '{T}, пожертвуйте Перерождающиеся Дебри: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли и положите ее на поле битвы повернутой. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Эльдрази беспощадны, но Зендикар непреклонен.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404563&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f81c861c-b65f-472d-81cb-65aa70a8a9bd', 'multiverseId': 404563}, 'multiverseid': 404563}, {'name': '成形野地', 'text': '{T}，牺牲成形野地：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，并将之横置放进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '奥札奇或许无情，但赞迪卡亦很坚韧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402171&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74b84224-6fca-461b-9c49-03636dee4882', 'multiverseId': 402171}, 'multiverseid': 402171}, {'name': '成形野地', 'text': '{T}，犧牲成形野地：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，並將之橫置放進戰場。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '奧札奇或許無情，但贊迪卡亦很堅韌。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402470&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65b093e3-081b-4377-ab27-5da25b0c0e6d', 'multiverseId': 402470}, 'multiverseid': 402470}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sicherer Stoß\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'So manche tollkühne Seele sprang dem Tod von der Schippe, weil sie erst handelte und sich später fürchtete.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01848fb7-b670-4f94-bf13-8f9fd543f034\', \'multiverseId\': 402949}, \'multiverseid\': 402949}, {\'name\': \'Arremetida segura\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A veces, para sobrevivir al fracaso inminente, se necesita un alma inocente que actúe primero y se asuste después.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89ccd312-52fc-4b2d-8b9b-4c2ad99f6e11\', \'multiverseId\': 405042}, \'multiverseid\': 405042}, {\'name\': \'Frappe assurée\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour survivre à une mort imminente, il faut parfois qu\'une âme téméraire agisse avant de succomber à ses peurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb6b3499-3c89-46e8-ac50-8cec61af8f61\', \'multiverseId\': 403248}, \'multiverseid\': 403248}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Sicuro\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Per sopravvivere alla tragedia imminente, a volte serve un\'anima avventata, che prima agisca e poi si spaventi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5814a883-94f0-4e15-980d-239b14fa274a\', \'multiverseId\': 403547}, \'multiverseid\': 403547}, {\'name\': \'確実な一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'死を目前にすると、恐れるより先に無謀な行動をする者がいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b97dc99-afb7-4363-a96b-13e2cd69430a\', \'multiverseId\': 403846}, \'multiverseid\': 403846}, {\'name\': \'확실한 일격\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+0을 받고 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'임박한 파멸에서 살아남으려면 때로는 가장 먼저 행동하고 나중에 두려워하는 무모한 자가 필요하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'448761ae-1a26-4113-8604-acac7c29b3eb\', \'multiverseId\': 404145}, \'multiverseid\': 404145}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Certeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+0 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Às vezes, para sobreviver a um fim iminente, é necessário ter uma alma temerária que aja primeiro e tema depois.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d40515-a077-487c-a147-9f189ff7bee9\', \'multiverseId\': 404444}, \'multiverseid\': 404444}, {\'name\': \'Верный Удар\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+0 и Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы спастись от верной гибели иногда нужен безрассудный боец, который сначала будет действовать, а уже потом — бояться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344d5604-4e2f-43e1-8f61-edf72fbbdcbf\', \'multiverseId\': 404743}, \'multiverseid\': 404743}, {\'name\': \'必中一击\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+0且获得先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在末日来临之时，想要生存，有时需要鲁莽之士的义无反顾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6efa1a0-bc54-4a73-9f89-57fc99121c87\', \'multiverseId\': 402351}, \'multiverseid\': 402351}, {\'name\': \'必中一擊\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+3/+0且獲得先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在末日來臨之時，想要生存，有時需要魯莽之士的義無反顧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c086aee7-aac2-4d6a-9496-145fcb1c41c8\', \'multiverseId\': 402650}, \'multiverseid\': 402650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stauborakel\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.){2}, lege eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'Wonach es auch suchen mag, es wird vor nichts Halt machen, bis es fündig geworden ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75acfb40-8b40-4ac8-bd3c-d1e4efda5f98\', \'multiverseId\': 402874}, \'multiverseid\': 402874}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo del polvo\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.){2}, poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador es propietario: Roba una carta y luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Sea lo que sea lo que busca, nada lo detendrá hasta encontrarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f761de97-8fe5-4375-8675-b72be3852c13\', \'multiverseId\': 404967}, \'multiverseid\': 404967}, {\'name\': \'Oracle de poussière\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.){2}, mettez une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': "Quoi qu\'il cherche, il ne s\'arrête qu\'après l\'avoir trouvé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac51d32c-d380-4a2e-8451-7c29902851b6\', \'multiverseId\': 403173}, \'multiverseid\': 403173}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo della Polvere\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.){2}, Metti una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Qualsiasi cosa stia cercando, non si fermerà davanti a nulla pur di trovarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1afa509-603a-420c-8de4-319fbaf43b8a\', \'multiverseId\': 403472}, \'multiverseid\': 403472}, {\'name\': \'塵の予言者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）{2}, 追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置く：カードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'何を探しているか知らないが、何が起きても探すのを止めないだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6def789-0194-4768-b051-c80bb4e3c657\', \'multiverseId\': 403771}, \'multiverseid\': 403771}, {\'name\': \'먼지의 예언자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.){2}, 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣는다: 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 무엇을 찾든지간에 그것을 찾기 위해서 수단과 방법을 가리지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a074143-75b8-4d53-aea7-5ef706d7c91b\', \'multiverseId\': 404070}, \'multiverseid\': 404070}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo do Pó\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.){2}, Coloque um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': \'O que quer que ele esteja procurando, nada vai detê-lo até que o encontre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a8bac41-bf07-4170-9dd7-583ef9a351dd\', \'multiverseId\': 404369}, \'multiverseid\': 404369}, {\'name\': \'Оракул Праха\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.){2}, положите принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': \'Что бы он ни искал, он не остановится ни перед чем, пока не найдет это.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117221a4-7c67-434e-9ed3-ad1bab09a6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 404668}, \'multiverseid\': 404668}, {\'name\': \'尘土先知\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）{2}，将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'无论它在找什么，找到之前都绝不会停手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30a9e6b-5308-4681-a18f-f49c2269f6c1\', \'multiverseId\': 402276}, \'multiverseid\': 402276}, {\'name\': \'塵土先知\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）{2}，將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': \'無論它在找什麼，找到之前都絕不會停手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754b2441-ca21-425a-b5ec-f4a8e41191ad\', \'multiverseId\': 402575}, \'multiverseid\': 402575}]', '[{\'name\': \'Staubschleicher\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)EileBringe zu Beginn jedes Endsegments, falls du keine anderen farblosen Kreaturen kontrollierst, den Staubschleicher auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Die einzigen Spuren, die er hinterlässt, sind lautlose Böen und unglaubliche Mengen an Trümmern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402761&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac17dee3-e6b5-48e5-becc-fda163bbdcf8\', \'multiverseId\': 402761}, \'multiverseid\': 402761}, {\'name\': \'Acechador del polvo\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Prisa.Al comienzo de cada paso final, si no controlas ninguna otra criatura incolora, regresa el Acechador del polvo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'El único rastro que deja a su paso son ráfagas de viento silenciosas y enormes pilas de restos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a33fc59c-714a-4478-87f0-1fff22eb918f\', \'multiverseId\': 404854}, \'multiverseid\': 404854}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur de poussière\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)CéléritéAu début de chaque étape de fin, si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'autre créature incolore, renvoyez le Pisteur de poussière dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il ne laisse derrière lui que vents silencieux et amoncellements de débris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e5c77d-62e6-4df0-b843-b0a877d39d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 403060}, \'multiverseid\': 403060}, {\'name\': \'Inseguitore Polveroso\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)RapiditàAll\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se non controlli altre creature incolori, fai tornare l\'Inseguitore Polveroso in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Le uniche tracce che lascia dietro di sé sono folate silenziose e quantità sorprendenti di macerie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33fa0192-f080-45d5-8d9c-83d7e49a85f3\', \'multiverseId\': 403359}, \'multiverseid\': 403359}, {\'name\': \'塵の中を忍び寄るもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）速攻各終了ステップの開始時に、あなたが他の無色のクリーチャーをコントロールしていない場合、塵の中を忍び寄るものをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'それが通った後に残るのは、無音の突風と膨大な損壊物のみである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfda016c-1ac5-4bbb-bc25-0447c3ed102c\', \'multiverseId\': 403658}, \'multiverseid\': 403658}, {\'name\': \'먼지 추적자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)신속각 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 다른 무색 생물이 없다면, 먼지 추적자를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'그 놈이 남기는 유일한 흔적은 침묵의 돌풍과 엄청난 양의 잔해다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2593e5d6-4cb2-4a3c-bdfc-bc5b81351cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 403957}, \'multiverseid\': 403957}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador do Pó\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)ÍmpetoNo início de cada etapa final, se você não controlar outra criatura incolor, devolva Espreitador do Pó para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Os únicos vestígios que ele deixa são lufadas silenciosas e quantidades prodigiosas de destroços.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577704a4-1dc0-43a5-9815-0e955a8cbe85\', \'multiverseId\': 404256}, \'multiverseid\': 404256}, {\'name\': \'Охотник из Праха\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Ускорение В начале каждого заключительного шага, если под вашим контролем нет других бесцветных существ, верните Охотника из Праха в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Единственные следы, которые он оставляет, — бесшумные порывы ветра и невероятное количество обломков.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f987202c-fed4-4ff6-8949-c35171c023b3\', \'multiverseId\': 404555}, \'multiverseid\': 404555}, {\'name\': \'尘土潜影\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）敏捷在每个结束步骤开始时，若你未操控其他无色生物，则将尘土潜影移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'它所到之处留下的只有无声狂风和大量残骸。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b06284e-8777-46d1-af4b-a175fa981fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 402163}, \'multiverseid\': 402163}, {\'name\': \'塵土潛影\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）敏捷在每個結束步驟開始時，若你未操控其他無色生物，則將塵土潛影移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'它所到之處留下的只有無聲狂風和大量殘骸。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'686e0ca7-b0f6-407d-a8c0-210088bcf02d\', \'multiverseId\': 402462}, \'multiverseid\': 402462}]', "[{'name': 'Steinzorn', 'text': 'Der Steinzorn fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Länder kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Akoum kann jeden Eindringling klein aussehen lassen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402947&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a3aa42d-c414-47a2-8a1d-13f22fd79c25', 'multiverseId': 402947}, 'multiverseid': 402947}, {'name': 'Furia rocosa', 'text': 'La Furia rocosa hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual a las tierras que controlas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Akoum consigue que cualquier intruso parezca pequeño.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405040&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd2c0e3e-7873-4471-98e8-c73da70d53e4', 'multiverseId': 405040}, 'multiverseid': 405040}, {'name': 'Fureur de pierre', 'text': 'La Fureur de pierre inflige à la créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'En Akoum, les intrus se sentent vraiment petits.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403246&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75790bc7-568a-4f9f-a189-98a4cecaa5e9', 'multiverseId': 403246}, 'multiverseid': 403246}, {'name': 'Furia di Pietra', 'text': 'La Furia di Pietra infligge a una creatura bersaglio danno pari al numero di terre che controlli.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Akoum può far sembrare piccolo qualsiasi intruso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403545&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e42bbe76-d1b5-40d3-a35a-ee653ba0f045', 'multiverseId': 403545}, 'multiverseid': 403545}, {'name': '石の怒り', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。石の怒りはそれに、あなたがコントロールする土地の総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'アクームでは侵入者は小さく見える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403844&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1fdd5ad-776a-40b4-87b3-6b7fa6905ee6', 'multiverseId': 403844}, 'multiverseid': 403844}, {'name': '바위의 분노', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 바위의 분노는 그 생물에게 당신이 조종하는 대지의 개수만큼 피해를 입힌다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '아쿰은 어떤 침입자보다도 훨씬 거대하다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404143&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '434bbf40-1e10-4430-95c5-a5732966607a', 'multiverseId': 404143}, 'multiverseid': 404143}, {'name': 'Litofúria', 'text': 'Litofúria causa à criatura alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de terrenos que você controla.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Akoum consegue fazer qualquer intruso parecer pequeno.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404442&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d063c49-ed26-4ed8-9c2f-05be90515c98', 'multiverseId': 404442}, 'multiverseid': 404442}, {'name': 'Ярость Камня', 'text': 'Ярость Камня наносит целевому существу повреждения, равные количеству земель под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'В горах Акума любой незваный гость будет выглядеть букашкой.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404741&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffd36711-b9df-401d-bc08-c694da997e01', 'multiverseId': 404741}, 'multiverseid': 404741}, {'name': '岩石暴怒', 'text': '岩石暴怒对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的地之数量。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '阿库姆让所有入侵者看起来都微不足道。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402349&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bab167d-20f6-4aa0-83b6-9c543c1c44e4', 'multiverseId': 402349}, 'multiverseid': 402349}, {'name': '岩石暴怒', 'text': '岩石暴怒對目標生物造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的地之數量。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '阿庫姆讓所有入侵者看起來都微不足道。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402648&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f16f546-6694-4a9b-972c-b34b55b2a4f1', 'multiverseId': 402648}, 'multiverseid': 402648}]", '[{\'name\': \'Steinzuflucht-Medikus\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser Tage bleiben Soldaten nie lange genug hier, um richtig zu genesen. Ich soll sie nur zusammenflicken, damit sie wieder aufs Schlachtfeld eilen können."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64dc877-6335-43b6-9bf9-dc7be324b7ba\', \'multiverseId\': 402946}, \'multiverseid\': 402946}, {\'name\': \'Médico de los Refugios Pedregosos\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoy en día los soldados nunca se quedan el tiempo suficiente para curarse. Solo quieren que les cosa rápido para regresar a la batalla cuanto antes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d1623c9-b444-4607-9134-2ecdc571e3a3\', \'multiverseId\': 405039}, \'multiverseid\': 405039}, {\'name\': \'Carabin du Refuge de pierre\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T} : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : kor et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Les soldats ne restent plus assez longtemps pour être soignés correctement. Ils me demandent juste de les rafistoler et se hâtent de retourner sur le champ de bataille. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403245&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d099edf-ff93-4606-a7a7-e66c756c1a46\', \'multiverseId\': 403245}, \'multiverseid\': 403245}, {\'name\': \'Medico dei Rifugi Rocciosi\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Di questi tempi, i soldati non si fermano mai abbastanza per una cura adeguata. Vogliono solo che li ricucia per poter tornare subito a combattere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40414473-5e6b-4e09-874b-57442e9ddded\', \'multiverseId\': 403544}, \'multiverseid\': 403544}, {\'name\': \'岩屋の衛生兵\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「近頃の兵士には十分に療養する余裕がありません。急いで戦いに戻るから今すぐ治してくれ、なんて言うんです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5817702e-8a53-4fce-91ad-a8c0f43512b5\', \'multiverseId\': 403843}, \'multiverseid\': 403843}, {\'name\': \'바위 피난처 위생병\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코르 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"요즘 병사들은 치료가 완전히 끝날 때까지 기다리는 법이 없어. 급한 상처만 대충 치료하고 전장으로 하루빨리 돌아가고 싶어한다니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568edd9d-b8f7-4ebc-a2a2-91191d0f9056\', \'multiverseId\': 404142}, \'multiverseid\': 404142}, {\'name\': \'Médico do Refúgio de Pedra\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoje em dia, os soldados nunca ficam por aqui tempo suficiente para se curar adequadamente. Eles só querem que eu os costure para poderem voltar correndo para a luta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e76e50d5-9894-48f6-96ad-e5a3893446f7\', \'multiverseId\': 404441}, \'multiverseid\': 404441}, {\'name\': \'Лекарь из Каменного Убежища\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«В наши дни солдаты не задерживаются, чтобы вылечиться до конца. Они просят меня наскоро заштопать раны, чтобы поскорее вернуться в бой».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9bf7c2e-dc34-44ae-b3e6-439ec8a9467a\', \'multiverseId\': 404740}, \'multiverseid\': 404740}, {\'name\': \'石庇所医士\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「如今，士兵总等不及康复痊愈。他们只求我能缝合伤口，好让他们赶回战场。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c46363b7-acce-444c-a0f4-c75db8f89b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 402348}, \'multiverseid\': 402348}, {\'name\': \'石庇所醫士\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「如今，士兵總等不及康復痊癒。他們只求我能縫合傷口，好讓他們趕回戰場。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93c4e0f-0fcf-4a42-8c9d-22888c05f398\', \'multiverseId\': 402647}, \'multiverseid\': 402647}]', "[{'name': 'Strahlende Flammen', 'text': 'Konvergenz — Die Strahlenden Flammen fügen jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um die Strahlenden Flammen zu wirken.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Die Feuer von Zendikar sind immer hungrig und es gibt viel, das sie verzehren können.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402899&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd187706f-6e06-4561-a6aa-b5c91653e4a0', 'multiverseId': 402899}, 'multiverseid': 402899}, {'name': 'Llamas radiantes', 'text': 'Converger — Las Llamas radiantes hacen X puntos de daño a cada criatura, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar las Llamas radiantes.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Los fuegos de Zendikar siempre están hambrientos y disponen de abundante alimento.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404992&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1896b09e-3694-4b9d-a4bc-e96485ed290b', 'multiverseId': 404992}, 'multiverseid': 404992}, {'name': 'Flammes radieuses', 'text': 'Convergence — Les Flammes radieuses infligent X blessures à chaque créature, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer les Flammes radieuses.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les feux de Zendikar sont toujours avides, et rien ne manque pour les attiser.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403198&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56c2e0b2-babf-4b3d-ad60-a017af5b60fb', 'multiverseId': 403198}, 'multiverseid': 403198}, {'name': 'Fiamme Raggianti', 'text': 'Convergenza — Le Fiamme Raggianti infliggono X danni a ogni creatura, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare le Fiamme Raggianti.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'I fuochi di Zendikar sono sempre affamati e hanno molto nutrimento a disposizione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403497&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d12d55d-91e1-4b1c-a720-0977721e1aca', 'multiverseId': 403497}, 'multiverseid': 403497}, {'name': '光輝の炎', 'text': '収斂 ― 光輝の炎は各クリーチャーに、それぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは光輝の炎を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数に等しい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ゼンディカーの火は何でも燃やす。燃えるものはいくらでもある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403796&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5fc9d41-f9de-40e1-957b-e4d1bf0b897d', 'multiverseId': 403796}, 'multiverseid': 403796}, {'name': '빛나는 불꽃', 'text': '화합 — 빛나는 불꽃은 각 생물에게 피해 X점을 입힌다. X는 빛나는 불꽃을 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수이다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '젠디카르의 불길은 꺼질 줄을 모른다. 게다가 집어 삼킬 것이 아직 많이 남았다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404095&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dff65747-e131-4b5e-bc2a-094fa75ad9b1', 'multiverseId': 404095}, 'multiverseid': 404095}, {'name': 'Chamas Radiantes', 'text': 'Convergir — Chamas Radiantes causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Chamas Radiantes.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Os fogos de Zendikar estão sempre famintos e não lhes faltam alimentos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404394&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6aa0990e-f330-487a-8171-27b0c9a3b909', 'multiverseId': 404394}, 'multiverseid': 404394}, {'name': 'Лучистое Пламя', 'text': 'Схождение — Лучистое Пламя наносит Х повреждений каждому существу, где Х — число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Лучистого Пламени.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Огни Зендикара всегда голодны, и для них есть разная пища.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404693&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c503f6d-c073-41a5-877d-3597df60b7da', 'multiverseId': 404693}, 'multiverseid': 404693}, {'name': '辉光火焰', 'text': '聚辉～辉光火焰对每个生物各造成X点伤害，X为施放辉光火焰时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '赞迪卡的火焰常年饥渴，而让它们饱餐一顿的机会也很多。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402301&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2fe8930-640c-4669-b1be-102dbc0932f3', 'multiverseId': 402301}, 'multiverseid': 402301}, {'name': '輝光火焰', 'text': '聚輝～輝光火焰對每個生物各造成X點傷害，X為施放輝光火焰時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '贊迪卡的火焰常年飢渴，而讓它們飽餐一頓的機會也很多。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402600&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df3f971f-dfa1-46e5-a589-8e065985d71c', 'multiverseId': 402600}, 'multiverseid': 402600}]", '[{\'name\': \'Strandfund\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten.Erwecken 4 — {5}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{U} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ece68d-1a9f-40a1-9919-e10e55e2e44d\', \'multiverseId\': 402742}, \'multiverseid\': 402742}, {\'name\': \'Descubrimiento costero\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas.Despertar 4—{5}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{U}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ca8b50-b99f-42e8-885d-fe7ad13579b8\', \'multiverseId\': 404835}, \'multiverseid\': 404835}, {\'name\': \'Découverte côtière\', \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes.Éveil 4 — {5}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{U}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403041&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17eec39e-5cd5-4187-bbbe-5a88cd794d24\', \'multiverseId\': 403041}, \'multiverseid\': 403041}, {\'name\': \'Scoperta Costiera\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte.Risveglio 4—{5}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{U}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a35ed6ff-efaf-48c8-b41c-745965e439b3\', \'multiverseId\': 403340}, \'multiverseid\': 403340}, {\'name\': \'沿岸の発見\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引く。覚醒４―{5}{U}（この呪文を{5}{U}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286cec9d-fef2-44e5-8347-2d15e6da3bee\', \'multiverseId\': 403639}, \'multiverseid\': 403639}, {\'name\': \'해안의 발견\', \'text\': \'카드 두 장을 뽑는다.각성 4—{5}{U} ({5}{U}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476d91f3-bd61-473a-bb92-c1c33233bf7a\', \'multiverseId\': 403938}, \'multiverseid\': 403938}, {\'name\': \'Descoberta Costeira\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards.Despertar 4 — {5}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{U}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e1284bf-bc50-43dd-ac60-67c007c30297\', \'multiverseId\': 404237}, \'multiverseid\': 404237}, {\'name\': \'Находка на Берегу\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты.Пробуждение 4 — {5}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{U}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'801cc6e9-296c-408a-b3e9-b54870857a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 404536}, \'multiverseid\': 404536}, {\'name\': \'海岸发现\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。醒转4～{5}{U}（如果你支付{5}{U}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07842c3a-ce56-4901-be13-6458d4d8ce01\', \'multiverseId\': 402144}, \'multiverseid\': 402144}, {\'name\': \'海岸發現\', \'text\': \'抽兩張牌。醒轉4～{5}{U}（如果你支付{5}{U}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c263b185-2e71-403e-94b8-07b127b1ffa1\', \'multiverseId\': 402443}, \'multiverseid\': 402443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturz in den Abgrund\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl.Erwecken 3 — {5}{W} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{W} wirkst, lege außerdem drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2947b7-ac13-4f70-91eb-68a1c70afdbb\', \'multiverseId\': 402930}, \'multiverseid\': 402930}, {\'name\': \'Caída en picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo girada.Despertar 3—{5}{W}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{W}, pon además tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238bf525-3365-44a8-bb51-83a5b40e245a\', \'multiverseId\': 405023}, \'multiverseid\': 405023}, {\'name\': \'Chute à pic\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature engagée ciblée.Éveil 3 — {5}{W} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{W}, mettez aussi trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f51cb2-22f8-413b-9a70-d95b1d877338\', \'multiverseId\': 403229}, \'multiverseid\': 403229}, {\'name\': \'Strapiombo\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura TAPpata bersaglio.Risveglio 3—{5}{W} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{W}, metti anche tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5936e9c-0bb5-4e30-966e-52dcf2eaa2de\', \'multiverseId\': 403528}, \'multiverseid\': 403528}, {\'name\': \'真っ逆さま\', \'text\': \'タップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。覚醒３―{5}{W}（この呪文を{5}{W}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'729beb77-65ba-434b-b414-5ffeea931f52\', \'multiverseId\': 403827}, \'multiverseid\': 403827}, {\'name\': \'수직 낙하\', \'text\': \'탭된 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.각성 3—{5}{W} ({5}{W}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73a4033-d615-4633-b723-932b157d54d4\', \'multiverseId\': 404126}, \'multiverseid\': 404126}, {\'name\': \'Queda Vertiginosa\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo virada.Despertar 3 — {5}{W} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{W}, coloque também três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0578631-4d2c-40f2-bc59-0551c304e956\', \'multiverseId\': 404425}, \'multiverseid\': 404425}, {\'name\': \'Отвесное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое повернутое существо.Пробуждение 3 — {5}{W} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{W}, также положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99d3f234-c569-4d85-9ca4-a17424de32bf\', \'multiverseId\': 404724}, \'multiverseid\': 404724}, {\'name\': \'垂直掉落\', \'text\': \'消灭目标已横置的生物。醒转3～{5}{W}（如果你支付{5}{W}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd6d43a-d10d-4880-b23b-07d65a7fd717\', \'multiverseId\': 402332}, \'multiverseid\': 402332}, {\'name\': \'垂直掉落\', \'text\': \'消滅目標已橫置的生物。醒轉3～{5}{W}（如果你支付{5}{W}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9d56f2-ed6a-43ce-a63c-42e88e7bd8ab\', \'multiverseId\': 402631}, \'multiverseid\': 402631}]', '[{\'name\': \'Säer des Vergessens\', \'text\': \'Wenn du den Säer des Vergessens wirkst, schickt ein Gegner deiner Wahl die obersten vier Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst dann eine beliebige Anzahl an Länderkarten, die dieser Spieler besitzt, aus dem Exil unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eldrazi gieren ohne jedes Maß und verzehren ohne jedes Zögern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875baee5-e494-45db-8a98-d8f01f776d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 402869}, \'multiverseid\': 402869}, {\'name\': \'Sembrador del olvido\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances el Sembrador del olvido, el oponente objetivo exilia las cuatro primeras cartas de su biblioteca. Luego puedes poner en el campo de batalla bajo tu control cualquier cantidad de cartas de tierra del exilio de las que ese jugador sea propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi padecen un hambre sin medida y devoran sin cesar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa67c211-5f42-4d4a-980f-f31c3e317f37\', \'multiverseId\': 404962}, \'multiverseid\': 404962}, {\'name\': "Semeur de l\'oubli", \'text\': "Quand vous lancez le Semeur de l\'oubli, l\'adversaire ciblé exile les quatre cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque, vous pouvez ensuite mettre sur le champ de bataille depuis l\'exil, sous votre contrôle, n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de terrain que ce joueur possède.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Les Eldrazi ont une faim sans limites et dévorent sans répit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56daac05-0221-4614-84be-5b2c8459bf26\', \'multiverseId\': 403168}, \'multiverseid\': 403168}, {\'name\': "Seminatore dell\'Oblio", \'text\': "Quando lanci il Seminatore dell\'Oblio, un avversario bersaglio esilia le prime quattro carte del suo grimorio, poi puoi mettere un qualsiasi numero di carte terra possedute da quel giocatore dall\'esilio sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Eldrazi bramano senza limiti e consumano senza sosta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867ef571-22f4-4482-9ffc-3a420b2f4b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 403467}, \'multiverseid\': 403467}, {\'name\': \'忘却蒔き\', \'text\': \'あなたが忘却蒔きを唱えたとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを追放する。その後、あなたは追放領域からそのプレイヤーがオーナーである土地・カードを、望む枚数あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの飢餓は底なし。矢継ぎ早に食らい尽くす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0a48494-4436-47d1-a469-da23131fc9fd\', \'multiverseId\': 403766}, \'multiverseid\': 403766}, {\'name\': \'망각 살포자\', \'text\': \'망각 살포자를 발동할 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 추방한다. 그 후 당신은 추방 영역에서 그 플레이어가 소유한 대지 카드를 원하는 만큼 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지의 식욕은 끝이 없어서 쉬지 않고 먹어 치운다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48cd0968-2c1d-4ee8-9be6-1f2654090d91\', \'multiverseId\': 404065}, \'multiverseid\': 404065}, {\'name\': \'Semeador do Oblívio\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjura Semeador do Oblívio, o oponente alvo exila os quatro cards do topo do próprio grimório. Depois, você pode colocar qualquer número de cards de terreno exilados daquele jogador no campo de batalha sob o seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Os Eldrazi têm uma fome ilimitada e se alimentam incessantemente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5571569c-2bad-4bee-8eaf-14d5a569b011\', \'multiverseId\': 404364}, \'multiverseid\': 404364}, {\'name\': \'Сеятель Забвения\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете Сеятеля Забвения, целевой оппонент изгоняет четыре верхние карты из своей библиотеки, затем вы можете положить из изгнания на поле битвы под вашим контролем любое количество принадлежащих тому игроку карт земель.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази пожирают, не останавливаясь, но не могут утолить свой ненасытный голод.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0c3d920-7393-4889-9cea-9ff45dc02476\', \'multiverseId\': 404663}, \'multiverseid\': 404663}, {\'name\': \'夺忆恶体\', \'text\': \'当你施放夺忆恶体时，目标对手放逐其牌库顶的四张牌，然后你可以将任意数量由该牌手拥有的地牌从放逐区在你操控下放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇饥渴无度，吞噬不绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48af815a-4275-44d4-80f3-890b1fed5fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 402271}, \'multiverseid\': 402271}, {\'name\': \'奪憶惡體\', \'text\': \'當你施放奪憶惡體時，目標對手放逐其牌庫頂的四張牌，然後你可以將任意數量由該玩家擁有的地牌從放逐區在你操控下放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇飢渴無度，吞噬不絕。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4fc815-27c0-46d9-b220-22ea32558288\', \'multiverseId\': 402570}, \'multiverseid\': 402570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tajuru-Bändigerin\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Tajuru-Bändigerin oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Reittier braucht kein Zaumzeug. Uns eint ein gemeinsames Ziel."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c5aded-321a-4265-a49e-3706713adbfe\', \'multiverseId\': 402963}, \'multiverseid\': 402963}, {\'name\': \'Domadora de Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que la Domadora de Tajuru u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi montura no necesita riendas ni bridas. Las dos compartimos el mismo propósito".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e9979c1-f115-4204-8985-aadc59c73958\', \'multiverseId\': 405056}, \'multiverseid\': 405056}, {\'name\': \'Maîtresse des bêtes de Tajuru\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que la Maîtresse des bêtes de Tajuru ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai nul besoin de rênes ou de bride pour ma monture. Notre objectif est commun. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403262&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e99fdbc9-bb0d-4a57-b417-99708212f880\', \'multiverseId\': 403262}, \'multiverseid\': 403262}, {\'name\': \'Domatrice Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta la Domatrice Tajuru o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia cavalcatura non ha bisogno né di redini né di briglie. Entrambi condividiamo un obiettivo comune."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf02d7b-a44c-45c9-b709-aa1cf7c32d6a\', \'multiverseId\': 403561}, \'multiverseid\': 403561}, {\'name\': \'タジュールの獣使い\', \'text\': \'結集 ― タジュールの獣使いか他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「これには手綱もくつわも不要だ。私たちは同じ目的を持っているのだから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36f7d2af-cdca-4cb2-98be-8681cdd9c106\', \'multiverseId\': 403860}, \'multiverseid\': 403860}, {\'name\': \'타주루 야수조련사\', \'text\': \'결집 — 타주루 야수조련사나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"이 녀석은 고삐와 굴레가 필요 없어. 우리의 목적은 같거든."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cf7c2d-99ee-4ee1-9f5a-7a2322536bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 404159}, \'multiverseid\': 404159}, {\'name\': \'Mestre das Feras Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Mestre das Feras Tajuru ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Minha montaria não precisa de rédea nem de sela. Nós dois temos um propósito em comum."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385d90e1-f0b1-4af9-b93d-b3fbac96d976\', \'multiverseId\': 404458}, \'multiverseid\': 404458}, {\'name\': \'Хозяйка Зверей из Таджуру\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Хозяйка Зверей из Таджуру или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Моему скакуну ни к чему узда и поводья. У нас с ним одна цель».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4901304-56cf-4cad-a679-90e46c9f88b9\', \'multiverseId\': 404757}, \'multiverseid\': 404757}, {\'name\': \'特裘如驯兽师\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当特裘如驯兽师或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我的坐骑无需缰绳也不用辔头。我们有着共同的目标。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcccc350-144c-41ea-b667-3623f04f94b5\', \'multiverseId\': 402365}, \'multiverseid\': 402365}, {\'name\': \'特裘如馴獸師\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當特裘如馴獸師或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我的坐騎無需韁繩也不用轡頭。我們有著共同的目標。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d84cc4-7451-42f6-9c0a-afcee7c9b516\', \'multiverseId\': 402664}, \'multiverseid\': 402664}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tajuru-Getreue\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Die Tajuru-Getreue kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel für jede unterschiedliche Farbe von Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„In seiner Not schreit ganz Zendikar vor Schmerz. Hörst du es nicht?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eda066f-f78b-436a-ad89-1916db5609ed\', \'multiverseId\': 402964}, \'multiverseid\': 402964}, {\'name\': \'Valiente de Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Converger — La Valiente de Tajuru entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella por cada color de maná usado para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"En esta época de desgracias, todo Zendikar grita de dolor. ¿Lo oyes?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456db1ae-32b4-410d-bb69-def8fdba49c2\', \'multiverseId\': 405057}, \'multiverseid\': 405057}, {\'name\': \'Vaillante de Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Convergence — La Vaillante de Tajuru arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque couleur de mana dépensé pour la lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur et allié\', \'flavor\': "« En ces temps difficiles, tout Zendikar crie de douleur. L\'entendez-vous ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403263&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d5fdfb2-24a8-46c3-811b-21c3f4b486cd\', \'multiverseId\': 403263}, \'multiverseid\': 403263}, {\'name\': \'Tajuru Risoluta\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — La Tajuru Risoluta entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni colore di mana speso per lanciarla.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"In questo momento di difficoltà, tutto Zendikar grida di dolore. Lo senti?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b194ac3f-b940-40cc-8a60-ae7cd70e4af1\', \'multiverseId\': 403562}, \'multiverseid\': 403562}, {\'name\': \'タジュールの重鎮\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― タジュールの重鎮は、これを唱えるために支払われたマナの色１色につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「この困難の時代、ゼンディカー全土が苦しみ叫んでいる。あなたにも聞こえる？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aec2d26-e8e5-492f-8aa4-6e67dde991fe\', \'multiverseId\': 403861}, \'multiverseid\': 403861}, {\'name\': \'타주루 숙련병\', \'text\': \'화합 — 타주루 숙련병은 발동 비용으로 지불한 마나의 각 색마다 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 정찰병 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"고난의 시기에 젠디카르 전역이 고통으로 울부짖고 있구나. 저 울음 소리가 들리는가?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87cd2361-4165-482c-80e3-b0d3c876a51d\', \'multiverseId\': 404160}, \'multiverseid\': 404160}, {\'name\': \'Defensor Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Defensor Tajuru entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada cor de mana gasto para conjurá-la.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Batedor Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Em sua hora de dificuldade, toda a Zendikar grita de dor. Você está ouvindo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca9cb84b-683f-46b8-a21b-c6460bb92ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 404459}, \'multiverseid\': 404459}, {\'name\': \'Таджурская Героиня\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Таджурская Героиня выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 за каждый цвет маны, потраченной на ее разыгрывание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Разведчик Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«В эти тяжелые времена весь Зендикар кричит от боли. Ты отзовешься на его крик?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c137f2a3-47b2-453d-94a6-df025b328cae\', \'multiverseId\': 404758}, \'multiverseid\': 404758}, {\'name\': \'特裘如坚兵\', \'text\': \'聚辉～特裘如坚兵进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为施放它时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「在此等艰难时刻，赞迪卡的万物痛苦地呼喊。你听到了吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167eb346-446f-4636-b08c-950927d82b48\', \'multiverseId\': 402366}, \'multiverseid\': 402366}, {\'name\': \'特裘如堅兵\', \'text\': \'聚輝～特裘如堅兵進戰場時上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量為施放它時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／斥候／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「在此等艱難時刻，贊迪卡的萬物痛苦地呼喊。你聽到了嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10031c35-561f-4822-83f1-b1b03c713911\', \'multiverseId\': 402665}, \'multiverseid\': 402665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tajuru-Kriegssängerin\', \'text\': \'Zusammenkunft — Immer wenn die Tajuru-Kriegssängerin oder ein anderer Verbündeter unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Ruf zu den Waffen reicht viel weiter als bis zu den Tajuru-Elfen, und er inspiriert alle, die ihn vernehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40bc6017-654d-4a4b-996e-e7231adc5d80\', \'multiverseId\': 402965}, \'multiverseid\': 402965}, {\'name\': \'Llamaguerra de Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Alianza — Siempre que la Llamaguerra de Tajuru u otro Aliado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Su grito de batalla retumba más allá de los elfos de Tajuru e inspira a todo aquel que lo escucha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64232b58-4cb3-4739-94fe-570d5a5c422f\', \'multiverseId\': 405058}, \'multiverseid\': 405058}, {\'name\': \'Meneuse de guerre de Tajuru\', \'text\': "Ralliement — À chaque fois que la Meneuse de guerre de Tajuru ou qu\'un autre allié arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': "Son cri de ralliement ne parvient pas seulement aux oreilles des elfes de Tajuru ; il inspire tous ceux qui l\'entendent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403264&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44dd0b83-3cd1-4331-affb-726a4549f6af\', \'multiverseId\': 403264}, \'multiverseid\': 403264}, {\'name\': \'Convocatrice di Guerra Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Radunare — Ogniqualvolta la Convocatrice di Guerra Tajuru o un altro Alleato entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo grido di adunata non giunge solo alle orecchie degli elfi di Tajuru, ma ispira chiunque lo ascolti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90555a2-e3da-461d-a78b-8b63c24288cc\', \'multiverseId\': 403563}, \'multiverseid\': 403563}, {\'name\': \'タジュールの戦呼び\', \'text\': \'結集 ― タジュールの戦呼びか他の同盟者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'結集の叫び声はタジュールのエルフたちを越え彼方まで届き、それを聞いた者すべてを勇気づけた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'861efe07-58db-4cb9-a594-e4c7ddbd5fe2\', \'multiverseId\': 403862}, \'multiverseid\': 403862}, {\'name\': \'타주루 전쟁기원사\', \'text\': \'결집 — 타주루 전쟁기원사나 다른 동맹이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'결집의 외침이 타주루 엘프 영역 밖까지 도달해 모든 듣는 이의 전의를 북돋는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb06b6a-0c60-4981-bfef-73d6b7b28282\', \'multiverseId\': 404161}, \'multiverseid\': 404161}, {\'name\': \'Invocador de Guerra Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Reunir — Toda vez que Invocador de Guerra Tajuru ou outro Aliado entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Seu grito de guerra vai muito além dos elfos Tajuru, inspirando todos que o escutam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'852a3b53-da16-4c4c-acf9-9d90f6cd6057\', \'multiverseId\': 404460}, \'multiverseid\': 404460}, {\'name\': \'Зазывала из Таджуру\', \'text\': \'Сплочение — Каждый раз, когда Зазывала из Таджуру или другой Союзник выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Ее созывающий клич разносится далеко за пределы Таджуру, воодушевляя всех, кто его услышит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a91dbfd8-788d-47c6-a995-1c6c21fa4a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 404759}, \'multiverseid\': 404759}, {\'name\': \'特裘如战呼人\', \'text\': \'奋扬～每当特裘如战呼人或另一个伙伴在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'她的奋扬战嚎不止激励了特裘如的妖精，还振奋了所有听闻者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c088d841-38a4-449b-a81b-e7135ac77bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 402367}, \'multiverseid\': 402367}, {\'name\': \'特裘如戰呼人\', \'text\': \'奮揚～每當特裘如戰呼人或另一個伙伴在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'她的奮揚戰嚎不止激勵了特裘如的妖精，還振奮了所有聽聞者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a544c3b-fc3e-4f9d-9d08-461200f9e89f\', \'multiverseId\': 402666}, \'multiverseid\': 402666}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tandemtaktik\', \'text\': \'Bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhalten +1/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'In Zeiten der Verseuchung und des Krieges ist Zendikar denjenigen gewogen, die vereint ihre Klingen schwingen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9837df10-252d-4774-859f-772339188d82\', \'multiverseId\': 402966}, \'multiverseid\': 402966}, {\'name\': \'Tácticas en tándem\', \'text\': \'Hasta dos criaturas objetivo obtienen +1/+2 cada una hasta el final del turno. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En tiempos de invasiones y guerra, Zendikar necesita espadas que golpeen al unísono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7262f251-d5e6-4512-af22-480dcd11706e\', \'multiverseId\': 405059}, \'multiverseid\': 405059}, {\'name\': \'Tactiques en tandem\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +1/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "En ces temps de guerre et d\'infestation, Zendikar favorise les lames qui frappent à l\'unisson.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403265&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5b388f-f9c2-4520-9acc-b71a2b47ee35\', \'multiverseId\': 403265}, \'multiverseid\': 403265}, {\'name\': \'Tattiche di Coppia\', \'text\': \'Fino a due creature bersaglio prendono +1/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "In tempi d\'infestazione e guerra, Zendikar privilegia le lame che colpiscono all\'unisono.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b0cfb87-b4a2-4f0a-a0d5-1597f468459a\', \'multiverseId\': 403564}, \'multiverseid\': 403564}, {\'name\': \'二人戦術\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーを最大２体対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらはそれぞれ＋１/＋２の修整を受ける。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージが蔓延する戦乱の時代、ゼンディカーでは同時に切りつける刃が好まれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2beeb607-a17b-4245-93f1-51d3f604ece7\', \'multiverseId\': 403863}, \'multiverseid\': 403863}, {\'name\': \'2인조 전술\', \'text\': \'생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +1/+2를 받는다. 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'감염과 전쟁으로 혼란한 젠디카르에서는 협동 공격을 하는 편이 유리하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1275e933-9dfe-4a2a-8729-9e2d6c659c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 404162}, \'multiverseid\': 404162}, {\'name\': \'Táticas em Tandem\', \'text\': \'Até duas criaturas alvo recebem +1/+2 cada uma até o final do turno. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Em tempo de infestação e guerra, Zendikar precisa de espadas que golpeiem em uníssono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3749ea1-a8c8-4f9b-aa5b-fef45b98b5c0\', \'multiverseId\': 404461}, \'multiverseid\': 404461}, {\'name\': \'Парная Тактика\', \'text\': \'Не более двух целевых существ получают по +1/+2 до конца хода. Вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Во времена вторжения и войны Зендикар ценит клинки, бьющие в унисон.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2e56e6d-7faf-47e5-9695-041bc10deece\', \'multiverseId\': 404760}, \'multiverseid\': 404760}, {\'name\': \'协力战术\', \'text\': \'至多两个目标生物各得+1/+2直到回合结束。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在受战乱侵袭的时期，赞迪卡会眷顾联手出击的双刃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0da3c7fd-48bf-49a3-b2cd-575dcf985b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 402368}, \'multiverseid\': 402368}, {\'name\': \'協力戰術\', \'text\': \'至多兩個目標生物各得+1/+2直到回合結束。你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在受戰亂侵襲的時期，贊迪卡會眷顧聯手出擊的雙刃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'085ebfaa-7c0b-41a3-8ec6-904447f6970f\', \'multiverseId\': 402667}, \'multiverseid\': 402667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tiefseefresser\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)TodesberührungZehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.){3}{U}{B}: Ziehe eine Karte. Jeder Gegner schickt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac1503fe-b8f0-479e-a1f2-15851dbd22d2\', \'multiverseId\': 402773}, \'multiverseid\': 402773}, {\'name\': \'Comedor de las profundidades\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Toque mortal.Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.){3}{U}{B}: Roba una carta. Cada oponente exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a9dd82-812d-4f81-b973-120fd6aff043\', \'multiverseId\': 404866}, \'multiverseid\': 404866}, {\'name\': \'Charognard des fonds marins\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Contact mortelIngestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.){3}{U}{B}: Piochez une carte. Chaque adversaire exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403072&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba9468e-2dc9-411c-ab2c-40c37c20af90\', \'multiverseId\': 403072}, \'multiverseid\': 403072}, {\'name\': \'Divoratore delle Profondità\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Tocco letaleIngerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.){3}{U}{B}: Pesca una carta. Ogni avversario esilia la prima carta del proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e688a4b-7309-42b0-ba60-718beaa44737\', \'multiverseId\': 403371}, \'multiverseid\': 403371}, {\'name\': \'深水の大喰らい\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）接死嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）{3}{U}{B}：カードを１枚引く。各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344a29b3-fabf-4780-bffd-05ede50bd4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 403670}, \'multiverseid\': 403670}, {\'name\': \'물속의 포식자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)치명타섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.){3}{U}{B}: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다. 각 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6924ad77-051a-4ef2-a1c1-3c0b1b0f5fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 403969}, \'multiverseid\': 403969}, {\'name\': \'Alimentador das Profundezas\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Toque mortíferoIngerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.){3}{U}{B}: Compre um card. Cada oponente exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3b78a0-a27a-4fc0-bf3f-768f7de1d00e\', \'multiverseId\': 404268}, \'multiverseid\': 404268}, {\'name\': \'Пожиратель из Бездны\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Смертельное касаниеЗаглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.){3}{U}{B}: возьмите карту. Каждый оппонент изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f9134c-8020-469c-a3f5-bae7031ed7fe\', \'multiverseId\': 404567}, \'multiverseid\': 404567}, {\'name\': \'深海噬体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）死触摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）{3}{U}{B}：抓一张牌。每位对手各放逐其牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94cfb33c-9e8b-4b2d-a92c-cc6d23564729\', \'multiverseId\': 402175}, \'multiverseid\': 402175}, {\'name\': \'深海噬體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）死觸攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）{3}{U}{B}：抽一張牌。每位對手各放逐其牌庫頂牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de5d726a-dd53-480d-ad90-950b174f2187\', \'multiverseId\': 402474}, \'multiverseid\': 402474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todloser Behemoth\', \'text\': \'WachsamkeitOpfere zwei Eldrazi-Bruten: Bringe den Todlosen Behemoth aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Immer wieder erhob er sich. Und immer wieder fielen Kameraden."—Ganda, Deserteur aus Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402751&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71577b37-4b81-4d53-95c8-fb84ded9f626\', \'multiverseId\': 402751}, \'multiverseid\': 402751}, {\'name\': \'Behemot inmortal\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.Sacrificar dos Vástagos Eldrazi: Regresa el Behemot inmortal de tu cementerio a tu mano. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Una y otra vez, se levantó. Una y otra vez caímos nosotros".—Ganda, desertor de Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c5e307-33de-4708-98b6-f47bdb3bd95b\', \'multiverseId\': 404844}, \'multiverseid\': 404844}, {\'name\': \'Béhémoth impérissable\', \'text\': "VigilanceSacrifiez deux eldrazi et scion : Renvoyez le Béhémoth impérissable depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« Il s\'élevait encore et toujours. Nous tombions encore et toujours. »—Ganda, déserteur de Goma Fada", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23456609-501f-481e-8473-9980bd3f8d39\', \'multiverseId\': 403050}, \'multiverseid\': 403050}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth Imperituro\', \'text\': \'CautelaSacrifica due Discendenti Eldrazi: Riprendi in mano il Behemoth Imperituro dal tuo cimitero. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Di volta in volta continuava a rialzarsi. Di volta in volta continuavamo a cadere."—Ganda, disertore di Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30927af-58a4-4ffe-bfe6-a6a14f6d5655\', \'multiverseId\': 403349}, \'multiverseid\': 403349}, {\'name\': \'不死のビヒモス\', \'text\': \'警戒エルドラージ・末裔を２体生け贄に捧げる：不死のビヒモスをあなたの墓地からあなたの手札に戻す。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「何度も何度もあれは起き上がる。何度も何度もこっちは負ける。」――ゴーマ・ファーダの脱走者、ガンダ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e45b7c-f466-42d3-ab27-8d3112075b82\', \'multiverseId\': 403648}, \'multiverseid\': 403648}, {\'name\': \'죽음을 모르는 거대괴수\', \'text\': \'경계엘드라지 자손 두 개를 희생한다: 죽음을 모르는 거대괴수를 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'"그것은 계속해서 일어났고 우리는 계속해서 쓰러졌다."—고마 파다 탈영병 간다\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df6974d-5193-4210-97b6-56e4ca89ecd6\', \'multiverseId\': 403947}, \'multiverseid\': 403947}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth Imortal\', \'text\': \'VigilânciaSacrifique dois Rebentos Eldrazi: Devolva Behemoth Imortal de seu cemitério para sua mão. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele se erguia cada vez mais. E cada vez mais nós afundávamos."— Ganda, desertor de Goma Fada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e692a7-1776-4c34-bf27-fa484724c27d\', \'multiverseId\': 404246}, \'multiverseid\': 404246}, {\'name\': \'Бессмертный Колосс\', \'text\': \'БдительностьПожертвуйте два Эльдрази Отпрыска: верните Бессмертного Колосса из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«Снова и снова он поднимался. Снова и снова мы умирали».— Ганда, дезертир из Гома-Фада\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3393af24-cb5d-43c7-b41e-c8066017a7da\', \'multiverseId\': 404545}, \'multiverseid\': 404545}, {\'name\': \'不亡贝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'警戒牺牲两个同时为奥札奇与孽裔的永久物：将不亡贝西摩斯从你的坟墓场移回你手上。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「它一再复生。我们一再溃退。」～哥马法达逃亡者甘达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf2537d-d6bf-436b-b8a8-0011cbede5d2\', \'multiverseId\': 402153}, \'multiverseid\': 402153}, {\'name\': \'不亡貝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'警戒犧牲兩個同時為奧札奇與孽裔的永久物：將不亡貝西摩斯從你的墳墓場移回你手上。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「它一再復生。我們一再潰退。」～哥馬法達逃亡者甘達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d8d15e9-1778-4b77-b8ef-c7432d16ad2e\', \'multiverseId\': 402452}, \'multiverseid\': 402452}]', "[{'name': 'Totenschlamm', 'text': 'Der Totenschlamm kommt getappt ins Spiel.Wenn der Totenschlamm ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402849&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35ca5288-85e3-41fb-b2e7-e8cf757c6550', 'multiverseId': 402849}, 'multiverseid': 402849}, {'name': 'Ciénaga mortuoria', 'text': 'La Ciénaga mortuoria entra al campo de batalla girada.Cuando la Ciénaga mortuoria entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.{T}: Agrega {B} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404942&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75ac74d8-3d9c-49c4-a934-7c4cff759f0e', 'multiverseId': 404942}, 'multiverseid': 404942}, {'name': 'Fondrière mortuaire', 'text': 'La Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.Quand la Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.{T} : Ajoutez {B} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403148&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba213f87-d2b0-4a40-96e5-d97702aab53b', 'multiverseId': 403148}, 'multiverseid': 403148}, {'name': 'Pantano Mortuario', 'text': 'Il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.Quando il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.{T}: Aggiungi {B} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403447&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdb9ad4c-7604-4c1c-bbca-b76ddbfe3395', 'multiverseId': 403447}, 'multiverseid': 403447}, {'name': '亡骸のぬかるみ', 'text': '亡骸のぬかるみはタップ状態で戦場に出る。亡骸のぬかるみが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403746&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5014db57-014b-451a-912f-457b26394224', 'multiverseId': 403746}, 'multiverseid': 403746}, {'name': '죽음의 수렁', 'text': '죽음의 수렁은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.죽음의 수렁이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 놓을 수 있다.{T}: 당신의 마나풀에 {B}를 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404045&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7a0b9d8-9689-49ca-b8c0-5bac92ddf1c1', 'multiverseId': 404045}, 'multiverseid': 404045}, {'name': 'Lodaçal Mortuário', 'text': 'Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha virado.Quando Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.{T}: Adicione {B} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404344&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61cce898-ccb2-4813-a976-9c5643d5ad74', 'multiverseId': 404344}, 'multiverseid': 404344}, {'name': 'Трупная Трясина', 'text': 'Трупная Трясина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.Когда Трупная Трясина выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.{T}: добавьте {B} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404643&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a8014e8-d507-41b1-8d90-9b2baa2bd275', 'multiverseId': 404643}, 'multiverseid': 404643}, {'name': '丧葬泥沼', 'text': '丧葬泥沼须横置进战场。当丧葬泥沼进战场时，你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。{T}：加{B}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402251&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d611a04-51af-4a42-8b40-6c88c7557abb', 'multiverseId': 402251}, 'multiverseid': 402251}, {'name': '喪葬泥沼', 'text': '喪葬泥沼須橫置進戰場。當喪葬泥沼進戰場時，你可以將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。{T}：加{B}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402550&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83e3d5c1-a7f9-4de6-97ab-d99c9c4efb15', 'multiverseId': 402550}, 'multiverseid': 402550}]", '[{\'name\': \'Trick des Turbulenzmagiers\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -X/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um Trick des Turbulenzmagiers zu wirken.Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Wetter auf Zendikar lässt sich nicht vorhersagen — es sei denn, man ist derjenige, der es bestimmt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d630725-39d6-419c-a437-3838be31d3e8\', \'multiverseId\': 402911}, \'multiverseid\': 402911}, {\'name\': \'Hechizo de maga de la Turbulencia\', \'text\': \'Converger — Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -X/-0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar el Hechizo de maga de la Turbulencia.Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En Zendikar es imposible predecir cuándo va a llover... a menos que seas tú quien lo dicta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65762fd8-2dc8-4983-960b-fa9e9b3037da\', \'multiverseId\': 405004}, \'multiverseid\': 405004}, {\'name\': \'Ruse du mage du Roulis\', \'text\': "Convergence — Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -X/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer la Ruse du mage du Roulis.Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Sur Zendikar, les intempéries sont imprévisibles... à moins que vous ne soyez celui qui les contrôle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403210&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'133f3b03-614f-4233-b228-236e62bdea73\', \'multiverseId\': 403210}, \'multiverseid\': 403210}, {\'name\': \'Trucco del Mago del Torbido\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -X/-0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare il Trucco del Mago del Torbido.Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il clima su Zendikar è imprevedibile, a meno che non sia tu a dargli ordini.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ddb6fd4-7c57-4812-bacb-716163850cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 403509}, \'multiverseid\': 403509}, {\'name\': \'乱動魔道士の計略\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－０の修整を受ける。Ｘは乱動魔道士の計略を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数に等しい。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカーの気象は予測しがたい。自分で操作しているのでない限り……。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862de618-b4e5-4e02-a429-e08a87332238\', \'multiverseId\': 403808}, \'multiverseid\': 403808}, {\'name\': \'탁류마도사의 계략\', \'text\': \'화합 — 상대가 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 -X/-0을 받는다. X는 탁류마도사의 계략을 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 색 종류 수이다.카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'젠디카르의 날씨는 예측하기 힘들어. 날씨를 조종할 수 있는 게 아니라면 말이야.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af89227-d3d7-45b7-9553-018128582b04\', \'multiverseId\': 404107}, \'multiverseid\': 404107}, {\'name\': \'Truque do Mago do Turbilhão\', \'text\': \'Convergir — As criaturas que seus oponentes controlam recebem -X/-0 até o final do turno, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar Truque do Mago do Turbilhão.Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O clima em Zendikar é imprevisível — a menos que seja você quem lhe diz o que fazer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e01925-f12b-4334-9774-5bb2d5463495\', \'multiverseId\': 404406}, \'multiverseid\': 404406}, {\'name\': \'Хитрость Мага Великого Вала\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Существа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -X/-0 до конца хода, где Х — число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Хитрости Мага Великого Вала.Возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Погоду на Зендикаре невозможно предсказать — если только ты сам ею не управляешь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d6ebc2-1b25-4442-b211-46b2459ec7d8\', \'multiverseId\': 404705}, \'multiverseid\': 404705}, {\'name\': \'狂搅法师的巧计\', \'text\': \'聚辉～由对手操控的生物得-X/-0直到回合结束，X为施放狂搅法师的巧计时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡的天气变幻莫测～除非告诉它要怎么变的是你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baa6ba17-3d17-4375-8ee3-c4d088c4bc71\', \'multiverseId\': 402313}, \'multiverseid\': 402313}, {\'name\': \'狂攪法師的巧計\', \'text\': \'聚輝～由對手操控的生物得-X/-0直到回合結束，X為施放狂攪法師的巧計時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'贊迪卡的天氣變幻莫測～除非告訴它要怎麼變的是你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111e525d-c48e-4666-81ab-9e36c727e307\', \'multiverseId\': 402612}, \'multiverseid\': 402612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trotzender Blutfürst\', \'text\': \'FliegendImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl ebenso viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Trotz ihrer Prahlerei sind die Sterblichen gebrechlich. Wenn Zendikar fortbestehen soll, müssen wir Fürsten es retten."—Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402752&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aed041b9-30c4-4c6e-aac0-06c4f43d005c\', \'multiverseId\': 402752}, \'multiverseid\': 402752}, {\'name\': \'Señor sangriento desafiante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Siempre que ganes vidas, el oponente objetivo pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A pesar de su fanfarronería, los mortales son frágiles. Si queremos que Zendikar sobreviva, deben salvarlo sus gobernantes".—Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c96f117-0104-4242-8fe2-a4289af05625\', \'multiverseId\': 404845}, \'multiverseid\': 404845}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur de sang provocateur\', \'text\': "VolÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, l\'adversaire ciblé perd autant de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': \'« Malgré leurs fanfaronnades, les mortels sont fragiles. Pour que Zendikar survive, ses seigneurs doivent le sauver. »—Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea921c23-d823-4ff0-b804-6c898465628b\', \'multiverseId\': 403051}, \'multiverseid\': 403051}, {\'name\': \'Signore Sanguinario Sprezzante\', \'text\': \'VolareOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, un avversario bersaglio perde altrettanti punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nonostante la loro spavalderia, i mortali sono fragili. Se Zendikar è destinata a perdurare, sarà perché i suoi signori la salveranno."—Drana, capo sanguinario Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4f8afb-2376-40fb-b053-8547f37c832e\', \'multiverseId\': 403350}, \'multiverseid\': 403350}, {\'name\': \'果敢な血王\', \'text\': \'飛行あなたがライフを得るたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「虚勢を張っても定命の者は脆いもの。ゼンディカーは、その王が救わねばなりませぬ。」――カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3ffd5b-0a44-4e3b-b3d4-e44e8b3de1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 403649}, \'multiverseid\': 403649}, {\'name\': \'저항하는 혈군주\', \'text\': \'비행당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 당신이 얻은 생명점만큼의 생명점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"아무리 허세를 부려도 인간은 유약한 존재일 뿐이야. 젠디카르가 살아 남으려면 젠디카르의 군주가 직접 나서야 해."—칼라스트리아의 혈족장 드라나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d71235d-772d-4d37-be23-3b92f66fd789\', \'multiverseId\': 403948}, \'multiverseid\': 403948}, {\'name\': \'Senhor Vampiro Audaz\', \'text\': \'VoarToda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A despeito de sua bravata, os mortais são frágeis. Para que Zendikar resista, seus senhores precisam salvá-la."— Drana, grã-vampira Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7101f586-3963-40df-8d3e-986598a4808e\', \'multiverseId\': 404247}, \'multiverseid\': 404247}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкий Кровавый Лорд\', \'text\': \'ПолетКаждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, целевой оппонент теряет столько же жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Несмотря на всю напускную храбрость смертных, их плоть слаба. Чтобы Зендикар выстоял, его вожди должны встать на его защиту».— Драна, кровавый вождь Каластриев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6414b7-3352-4fee-9c1f-7b6c0431c80f\', \'multiverseId\': 404546}, \'multiverseid\': 404546}, {\'name\': \'无畏血领\', \'text\': \'飞行每当你获得生命时，目标对手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然勇猛，但凡人毕竟脆弱。赞迪卡若要长存，其主人必须出手拯救。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ca4db9-4101-464d-adad-ac31c7993749\', \'multiverseId\': 402154}, \'multiverseid\': 402154}, {\'name\': \'無畏血領\', \'text\': \'飛行每當你獲得生命時，目標對手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「雖然勇猛，但凡人畢竟脆弱。贊迪卡若要長存，其主人必須出手拯救。」～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa6c3a6-4809-4df8-9594-0c06c6fee738\', \'multiverseId\': 402453}, \'multiverseid\': 402453}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trübnisschreiter\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Trübnisschreiter ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers legen. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du ihn sehen kannst, ist es bereits zu spät.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a375918-6a06-4823-828b-0725a3c60bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 402862}, \'multiverseid\': 402862}, {\'name\': \'Zancudo lóbrego\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Zancudo lóbrego entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador sea propietario. Si lo haces, regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Si puedes verlo, ya es demasiado tarde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d683c091-9561-45db-ba9c-0ba69724c450\', \'multiverseId\': 404955}, \'multiverseid\': 404955}, {\'name\': \'Enjambeur des eaux troubles\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand l\'Enjambeur des eaux troubles arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': "Si vous le voyez, c\'est qu\'il est déjà trop tard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e385f5-a85a-4208-9020-5b60015a5fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 403161}, \'multiverseid\': 403161}, {\'name\': "Ramingo dell\'Oscurità", \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando il Ramingo dell\'Oscurità entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore. Se lo fai, fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Se riesci a vederlo, è troppo tardi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14330ccf-81da-45e3-bd46-ab1f0eca7ef1\', \'multiverseId\': 403460}, \'multiverseid\': 403460}, {\'name\': \'霞の徘徊者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）霞の徘徊者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、そのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'それが見えた時は、すでに手遅れだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d6196f-cf78-400c-9406-1fb2ebcef603\', \'multiverseId\': 403759}, \'multiverseid\': 403759}, {\'name\': \'수렁 보행자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)수렁 보행자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': \'그것을 볼 수 있다면, 이미 늦은 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f86de5-b6f9-4c5b-989f-9edeab75fb03\', \'multiverseId\': 404058}, \'multiverseid\': 404058}, {\'name\': \'Andarilho do Lodo\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Andarilho do Lodo entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele. Se fizer isso, devolva a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': \'Se você consegue vê-lo, é tarde demais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc2a699-3cf5-4324-89ee-f893dc29d5d4\', \'multiverseId\': 404357}, \'multiverseid\': 404357}, {\'name\': \'Мракомерка\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Мракомерка выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока. Если вы это делаете, верните целевое существо в руку владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': \'Если вы ее видите, то уже слишком поздно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b36dce-f13b-4728-811b-b7eb750972b2\', \'multiverseId\': 404656}, \'multiverseid\': 404656}, {\'name\': \'暗沼神行体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当暗沼神行体进战场时，你可以将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该玩家的坟墓场。若你如此作，则将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'你能看到它时，就已经太迟了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92beacc-d527-48fc-91f7-9c38a8d39b34\', \'multiverseId\': 402264}, \'multiverseid\': 402264}, {\'name\': \'暗沼神行體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當暗沼神行體進戰場時，你可以將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場。若你如此作，則將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': \'你能看到它時，就已經太遲了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'391dd570-adf3-4761-9b76-3af981064bca\', \'multiverseId\': 402563}, \'multiverseid\': 402563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trümmerverwerter\', \'text\': \'Wenn du den Trümmerverwerter wirkst, kannst du eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers legen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eldrazi schweifen weiter durch die Ödnis und mehren die Zerstörung, die schon vollkommen schien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402914&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f59bfdb0-a7b2-4372-9dd6-ff7552c832a8\', \'multiverseId\': 402914}, \'multiverseid\': 402914}, {\'name\': \'Metabolizador de ruina\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances el Metabolizador de ruina, puedes poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador sea propietario. Si lo haces, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi siguen barriendo los terrenos devastados, perfilando una destrucción que ya parecía absoluta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6843f62-9ed9-41d9-aec9-948ab84eb5c9\', \'multiverseId\': 405007}, \'multiverseid\': 405007}, {\'name\': \'Convertisseur de ruine\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez le Convertisseur de ruine, vous pouvez mettre une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': "Les Eldrazi arpentent inlassablement les landes, détruisant à nouveau des lieux qu\'ils ont déjà anéantis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403213&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e3ee46-3386-4601-abea-8cf5085cd37b\', \'multiverseId\': 403213}, \'multiverseid\': 403213}, {\'name\': \'Metabolizzatore della Rovina\', \'text\': "Quando lanci il Metabolizzatore della Rovina, puoi mettere una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore. Se lo fai, guadagni 5 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Eldrazi continuano a battere le distese desolate, aggravando una distruzione che già sembrava assoluta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9dd4a06-2e47-482f-ba86-16cbd9f26453\', \'multiverseId\': 403512}, \'multiverseid\': 403512}, {\'name\': \'破滅の昇華者\', \'text\': \'あなたが破滅の昇華者を唱えたとき、あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージは相変わらず荒れ地を徘徊している。すでに破壊し尽くされたように見える地をさらに荒らしながら。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aca68c7-f13b-4bec-b814-2c3e2791b2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 403811}, \'multiverseid\': 403811}, {\'name\': \'폐허 처리자\', \'text\': \'폐허 처리자를 발동할 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': \'엘드라지는 이미 파괴할 것이 없어 보이는데도 황무지를 휩쓸고 다니며 끊임 없이 파괴를 자행한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f313d5e-aff2-4f4d-89c6-cfaf54443c9e\', \'multiverseId\': 404110}, \'multiverseid\': 404110}, {\'name\': \'Processador da Ruína\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjura Processador da Ruína, você pode colocar um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele. Se fizer isso, você ganhará 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': \'Os Eldrazi continuam avançando pelos ermos, agravando uma destruição que já parecia absoluta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bfd75fb-7985-42af-844d-476685ff635a\', \'multiverseId\': 404409}, \'multiverseid\': 404409}, {\'name\': \'Переработчик Разрушений\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете Переработчика Разрушений, вы можете положить принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока. Если вы это делаете, вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази прочесывают пустоши, творя разрушения там, где, казалось бы, уже не осталось камня на камне.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53bebf15-4bdb-4a26-bd92-b1219fd742d3\', \'multiverseId\': 404708}, \'multiverseid\': 404708}, {\'name\': \'遗迹噬体\', \'text\': \'当你施放遗迹噬体时，你可以将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场。若你如此作，你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇持续扫荡，将夷为平地的废墟彻底毁灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89a54837-3409-4d2e-b359-800ca588bd8b\', \'multiverseId\': 402316}, \'multiverseid\': 402316}, {\'name\': \'遺跡噬體\', \'text\': \'當你施放遺跡噬體時，你可以將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場。若你如此作，你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇持續掃蕩，將夷為平地的廢墟徹底毀滅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ac1630-105f-4551-874a-2399d4218b96\', \'multiverseId\': 402615}, \'multiverseid\': 402615}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tunnelgräber-Geoped\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt der Tunnelgräber-Geoped jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Während Ulamogs Brut das Erdreich zu Staub verwandelt, brechen die Geopeden aus ihren Tunneln hervor, auf der Suche nach festem Untergrund.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d28c70-a0a8-43b3-9bfb-d2e438f61fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 402973}, \'multiverseid\': 402973}, {\'name\': \'Geópodo excavador\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Geópodo excavador hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras la estirpe de Ulamog reduce la tierra a polvo, los geópodos brotan de los túneles en busca de terrenos más sólidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07d0159-30db-433f-80ef-affd0ef676e0\', \'multiverseId\': 405066}, \'multiverseid\': 405066}, {\'name\': \'Géopède tunnelier\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Géopède tunnelier inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que la progéniture d\'Ulamog réduit la terre en poussière, les géopèdes jaillissent de leurs tunnels en quête d\'un sol solide.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403272&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da0f65a-43d1-4dc4-879b-4167c7133428\', \'multiverseId\': 403272}, \'multiverseid\': 403272}, {\'name\': \'Geopiede Scavatore\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Geopiede Scavatore infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Man mano che la covata di Ulamog riduce la terra in polvere, i geopiedi emergono dai loro tunnel alla ricerca di terreno solido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710be54f-54f5-4dd2-86de-e6ebef89efac\', \'multiverseId\': 403571}, \'multiverseid\': 403571}, {\'name\': \'穴掘り土百足\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、穴掘り土百足は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの血統が大地を塵に変えると、堅い土地を求めて土百足が巣穴から出てくる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21755976-427c-4b03-bce7-a65aa6af5a69\', \'multiverseId\': 403870}, \'multiverseid\': 403870}, {\'name\': \'굴파는 땅지네\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 굴파는 땅지네는 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'울라목의 군락이 대지를 먼지로 만들어 버리자 단단한 땅을 찾기 위해 땅지네가 굴에서 솟구쳐 나왔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7c30ef-1b8a-46fb-8415-1959591285b1\', \'multiverseId\': 404169}, \'multiverseid\': 404169}, {\'name\': \'Geopede Tunelador\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Geopede Tunelador causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'À medida que a linhagem de Ulamog reduz a terra a pó, os geopedes irrompem de seus túneis em busca de chão sólido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ce16533-6077-46b1-a95d-f240376a4124\', \'multiverseId\': 404468}, \'multiverseid\': 404468}, {\'name\': \'Норная Земленожка\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Норная Земленожка наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'Выводок Уламога превращал землю в прах, и земленожкам пришлось покинуть свои тоннели в поисках твердой почвы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698731b1-e04d-4192-91c3-ba45bc113397\', \'multiverseId\': 404767}, \'multiverseid\': 404767}, {\'name\': \'掘隧地蜈蚣\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，掘隧地蜈蚣向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫孳生的巢群把大地碎作尘土，逼得地蜈蚣从地道中涌出寻找坚实的土地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c2a370-9128-4d1a-a6b4-1381e21ab68e\', \'multiverseId\': 402375}, \'multiverseid\': 402375}, {\'name\': \'掘隧地蜈蚣\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，掘隧地蜈蚣向每位對手各造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫孳生的巢群把大地碎作塵土，逼得地蜈蚣從地道中湧出尋找堅實的土地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bc20e7-050c-45a5-b579-accab8cf09be\', \'multiverseId\': 402674}, \'multiverseid\': 402674}]', '[{\'name\': \'Turbulenzfontäne\', \'text\': \'Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.Erwecken 4 — {4}{W}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {4}{W}{U} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7b7319-330c-443b-81cc-61dd76b470fe\', \'multiverseId\': 402909}, \'multiverseid\': 402909}, {\'name\': \'Géiser de la Turbulencia\', \'text\': \'Pon la criatura objetivo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.Despertar 4—{4}{W}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {4}{W}{U}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbddbf4-f29a-4305-8039-e750e5b59e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 405002}, \'multiverseid\': 405002}, {\'name\': \'Jaillissement du Roulis\', \'text\': "Mettez la créature ciblée au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.Éveil 4 — {4}{W}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {4}{W}{U}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1466aa42-fde3-44a8-8bb5-bc29423739c0\', \'multiverseId\': 403208}, \'multiverseid\': 403208}, {\'name\': \'Fiotto del Torbido\', \'text\': \'Metti una creatura bersaglio in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.Risveglio 4—{4}{W}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per {4}{W}{U}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401db28b-d199-4e59-bf3f-530269480a94\', \'multiverseId\': 403507}, \'multiverseid\': 403507}, {\'name\': \'乱動の噴出\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。覚醒４―{4}{W}{U}（この呪文を{4}{W}{U}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd31fb2-b77f-404c-904a-9ffa7ca317a0\', \'multiverseId\': 403806}, \'multiverseid\': 403806}, {\'name\': \'탁류 분출\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 서고 맨 위에 올려놓는다.각성 4—{4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b74bf4c-8ac6-4ddd-9056-b169e46596de\', \'multiverseId\': 404105}, \'multiverseid\': 404105}, {\'name\': \'Jorro do Turbilhão\', \'text\': \'Coloque a criatura alvo no topo do grimório de seu dono.Despertar 4 — {4}{W}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {4}{W}{U}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5f04fa-1f81-4c1e-9058-7d625e4f26d6\', \'multiverseId\': 404404}, \'multiverseid\': 404404}, {\'name\': \'Воронка Великого Вала\', \'text\': \'Положите целевое существо на верх библиотеки его владельца.Пробуждение 4 — {4}{W}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {4}{W}{U}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d67800-e03d-4e05-b02e-4e6696e80c66\', \'multiverseId\': 404703}, \'multiverseid\': 404703}, {\'name\': \'狂搅龙卷\', \'text\': \'将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶。醒转4～{4}{W}{U}（如果你支付{4}{W}{U}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbd72e1-5f5b-4d94-9262-699023a7dcfe\', \'multiverseId\': 402311}, \'multiverseid\': 402311}, {\'name\': \'狂攪龍捲\', \'text\': \'將目標生物置於其擁有者的牌庫頂。醒轉4～{4}{W}{U}（如果你支付{4}{W}{U}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60fc65b6-e470-4c55-a7af-3493703f2f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 402610}, \'multiverseid\': 402610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ugins Heiligtum\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.Immer wenn du einen farblosen Zauberspruch mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 7 oder mehr wirkst, kannst du Ugins Heiligtum opfern. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer farblosen Kreaturenkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbc1dde3-b355-46b1-a21a-a508206ff4e6\', \'multiverseId\': 402919}, \'multiverseid\': 402919}, {\'name\': \'Santuario de Ugin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.Siempre que lances un hechizo incoloro con coste de maná convertido de 7 o más, puedes sacrificar el Santuario de Ugin. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura incolora, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b09402-6398-42f7-9326-e28d14d8ef29\', \'multiverseId\': 405012}, \'multiverseid\': 405012}, {\'name\': "Sanctuaire d\'Ugin", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort incolore avec un coût converti de mana supérieur ou égal à 7, vous pouvez sacrifier le Sanctuaire d\'Ugin. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature incolore, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403218&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10401c69-a6a9-4989-89ad-a69d84161741\', \'multiverseId\': 403218}, \'multiverseid\': 403218}, {\'name\': \'Santuario di Ugin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incolore con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 7, puoi sacrificare il Santuario di Ugin. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura incolore, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d5d78bd-c849-4ff2-9480-8fce59804f8a\', \'multiverseId\': 403517}, \'multiverseid\': 403517}, {\'name\': \'ウギンの聖域\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。あなたが点数で見たマナ・コストが７以上の無色の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたはウギンの聖域を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーから無色のクリーチャー・カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73b6791-3604-41a5-afc3-380c01ba2e35\', \'multiverseId\': 403816}, \'multiverseid\': 403816}, {\'name\': \'우진의 성소\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.당신이 전환마나비용이 7 이상인 무색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 우진의 성소를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고에서 무색 생물 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4b376b-62c1-49c7-8bff-e60e94686b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 404115}, \'multiverseid\': 404115}, {\'name\': \'Santuário de Ugin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica incolor com custo de mana convertido igual ou superior a 7, você pode sacrificar Santuário de Ugin. Se fizer isso, procure em seu grimório um card de criatura incolor, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4010b0-b55d-4a29-be14-3843415d1ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 404414}, \'multiverseid\': 404414}, {\'name\': \'Святилище Уджина\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете бесцветное заклинание с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 7 или больше, вы можете пожертвовать Святилище Уджина. Если вы это делаете, найдите в вашей библиотеке карту бесцветного существа, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57b5e6b-0c68-4061-972a-bd93ea7021cd\', \'multiverseId\': 404713}, \'multiverseid\': 404713}, {\'name\': \'乌金圣所\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。每当你施放总法术力费用等于或大于7的无色咒语时，你可以牺牲乌金圣所。若你如此作，则从你的牌库中搜寻一张无色生物牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad12d9c7-f2c0-40aa-8eeb-e136006f45c5\', \'multiverseId\': 402321}, \'multiverseid\': 402321}, {\'name\': \'烏金聖所\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。每當你施放總魔法力費用大於或等於7的無色咒語時，你可以犧牲烏金聖所。若你如此作，則從你的牌庫中搜尋一張無色生物牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb80310-9b00-42c0-91ed-fe7d78f8f687\', \'multiverseId\': 402620}, \'multiverseid\': 402620}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ulamog, der unermessliche Hunger\', \'text\': \'Wenn du Ulamog, den unermesslichen Hunger, wirkst, schicke zwei bleibende Karten deiner Wahl ins Exil.UnzerstörbarImmer wenn Ulamog angreift, schickt der verteidigende Spieler die obersten zwanzig Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Macht, so unersättlich wie die Zeit selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80416d21-ecef-4305-a04e-8d63ae2f8589\', \'multiverseId\': 402976}, \'multiverseid\': 402976}, {\'name\': \'Ulamog, el Hambre Que No Cesa\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances a Ulamog, el Hambre Que No Cesa, exilia dos permanentes objetivo.Indestructible.Siempre que Ulamog ataque, el jugador defensor exilia las veinte primeras cartas de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Una fuerza tan voraz como el propio tiempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477bd8f0-40ca-4e71-94d7-481ba8f90523\', \'multiverseId\': 405069}, \'multiverseid\': 405069}, {\'name\': \'Ulamog, la Voracité insatiable\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez Ulamog, la Voracité insatiable, exilez deux permanents ciblés.IndestructibleÀ chaque fois qu\'Ulamog attaque, le joueur défenseur exile les vingt cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Une force aussi vorace que le temps.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403275&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c64567d8-8b7f-430d-8698-75a5227e8e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 403275}, \'multiverseid\': 403275}, {\'name\': \'Ulamog, la Fame Incessante\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci Ulamog, la Fame Incessante, esilia due permanenti bersaglio.IndistruttibileOgniqualvolta Ulamog attacca, il giocatore in difesa esilia le prime venti carte del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Una forza vorace come il tempo stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cdf329f-6777-41cb-ae85-295f1f00f85a\', \'multiverseId\': 403574}, \'multiverseid\': 403574}, {\'name\': \'絶え間ない飢餓、ウラモグ\', \'text\': \'あなたが絶え間ない飢餓、ウラモグを唱えたとき、パーマネント２つを対象とし、それらを追放する。破壊不能絶え間ない飢餓、ウラモグが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から20枚のカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'時間そのもののごとく貪欲な力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a163acc-8fa8-4231-9b89-ac0049703e77\', \'multiverseId\': 403873}, \'multiverseid\': 403873}, {\'name\': \'끝을 모르는 굶주림 울라목\', \'text\': \'끝을 모르는 굶주림 울라목을 발동할 때, 지속물 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물들을 추방한다.무적울라목이 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 20장을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'시간만큼이나 탐욕스럽고 강력한 존재.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee411239-229e-4a2f-bc93-c4117e5ea190\', \'multiverseId\': 404172}, \'multiverseid\': 404172}, {\'name\': \'Ulamog, a Fome Interminável\', \'text\': \'Quando conjurar Ulamog, a Fome Interminável, exile duas permanentes alvo.IndestrutívelToda vez que Ulamog ataca, o jogador defensor exila vinte cards do topo do próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Uma força voraz como o próprio tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4260b80e-a5bf-49f1-afa1-c23416c0bfcd\', \'multiverseId\': 404471}, \'multiverseid\': 404471}, {\'name\': \'Уламог, Неутолимый Голод\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете Уламога, Неутолимый Голод, изгоните два целевых перманента.НеразрушимостьКаждый раз, когда Уламог атакует, защищающийся игрок изгоняет двадцать верхних карт своей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Сила, прожорливая, как само время.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8587ef2-d5cd-4a3e-9348-deb3b2570864\', \'multiverseId\': 404770}, \'multiverseid\': 404770}, {\'name\': \'不休饥渴钨拉莫\', \'text\': \'当你施放不休饥渴钨拉莫时，放逐两个目标永久物。不灭每当钨拉莫攻击时，防御牌手放逐其牌库顶的二十张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'如同时间般贪噬的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775074cd-bd64-45b5-8a70-4e86c3c35bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 402378}, \'multiverseid\': 402378}, {\'name\': \'不休飢渴鎢拉莫\', \'text\': \'當你施放不休飢渴鎢拉莫時，放逐兩個目標永久物。不滅每當鎢拉莫攻擊時，防禦玩家放逐其牌庫頂的二十張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'如同時間般貪噬的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff36782-0f8e-4bb8-9674-78a69101e407\', \'multiverseId\': 402677}, \'multiverseid\': 402677}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ulamogs Nullifizierer\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)AufblitzenFliegendWenn Ulamogs Nullifizierer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du zwei Karten, die deine Gegner besitzen, aus dem Exil auf die Friedhöfe ihrer Besitzer legen. Falls du dies tust, neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55622a4-1cb4-473f-8619-50b9647a85fe\', \'multiverseId\': 402978}, \'multiverseid\': 402978}, {\'name\': \'Anulador de Ulamog\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Destello.Vuela.Cuando el Anulador de Ulamog entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en los cementerios de sus propietarios dos cartas del exilio de las que tus oponentes sean propietarios. Si lo haces, contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e63822-96c9-4ecb-bca5-401ee1db409e\', \'multiverseId\': 405071}, \'multiverseid\': 405071}, {\'name\': "Annulateur d\'Ulamog", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)FlashVolQuand l\'Annulateur d\'Ulamog arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre deux cartes que vos adversaires possèdent dans les cimetières de leurs propriétaires depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, contrecarrez le sort ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403277&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e05ac2b-4448-4af7-af79-627f6a586ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 403277}, \'multiverseid\': 403277}, {\'name\': \'Vanificatore di Ulamog\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)LampoVolareQuando il Vanificatore di Ulamog entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere due carte possedute dai tuoi avversari dall\'esilio nei cimiteri dei rispettivi proprietari. Se lo fai, neutralizza una magia bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e02466-28cd-4fca-90d2-f2f3ca16ee95\', \'multiverseId\': 403576}, \'multiverseid\': 403576}, {\'name\': \'ウラモグの失却させるもの\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）瞬速飛行ウラモグの失却させるものが戦場に出たとき、呪文１つを対象とする。あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを２枚、それらのオーナーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebbe01c-e01a-4637-b0b4-75420ced2bd8\', \'multiverseId\': 403875}, \'multiverseid\': 403875}, {\'name\': \'울라목의 무력화꾼\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)섬광비행울라목의 무력화꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 두 장을 소유자의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5809b497-93cb-4909-8847-77ce0ce44a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 404174}, \'multiverseid\': 404174}, {\'name\': \'Nulificador de Ulamog\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)LampejoVoarQuando Nulificador de Ulamog entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar dois cards exilados de seus oponentes nos cemitérios de seus donos. Se fizer isso, anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c195caf3-7f43-40ea-bcf0-6379f85a6b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 404473}, \'multiverseid\': 404473}, {\'name\': \'Изничтожитель Уламога\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)МигПолетКогда Изничтожитель Уламога выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить две принадлежащие вашим оппонентам карты из изгнания на кладбища их владельцев. Если вы это делаете, отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78767c2a-d65e-4b13-916b-7132c9df5c13\', \'multiverseId\': 404772}, \'multiverseid\': 404772}, {\'name\': \'钨拉莫废除体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）闪现飞行当钨拉莫废除体进战场时，你可以将两张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入其拥有者的坟墓场。若你如此作，则反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43768b1-b8c9-407b-8c57-b6f5010d00a5\', \'multiverseId\': 402380}, \'multiverseid\': 402380}, {\'name\': \'鎢拉莫廢除體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）閃現飛行當鎢拉莫廢除體進戰場時，你可以將兩張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入其擁有者的墳墓場。若你如此作，則反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c90699e-86c7-4c9c-ab66-fa091fdf9e04\', \'multiverseId\': 402679}, \'multiverseid\': 402679}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ulamogs Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Sowie Ulamogs Plünderer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du zwei Karten, die deine Gegner besitzen, aus dem Exil auf die Friedhöfe ihrer Besitzer legen. Falls du dies tust, kommt Ulamogs Plünderer mit vier +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd71637b-de1a-4704-b9c0-c800f3d624ac\', \'multiverseId\': 402977}, \'multiverseid\': 402977}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador de Ulamog\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Saqueador de Ulamog entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en los cementerios de sus propietarios dos cartas del exilio de las que tus oponentes sean propietarios. Si lo haces, el Saqueador de Ulamog entra al campo de batalla con cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6cdef88-ee0b-4619-b2f7-cdec59ac0ca7\', \'multiverseId\': 405070}, \'multiverseid\': 405070}, {\'name\': "Spoliateur d\'Ulamog", \'text\': "Au moment où le Spoliateur d\'Ulamog arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre deux cartes que vos adversaires possèdent dans les cimetières de leurs propriétaires depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, le Spoliateur d\'Ulamog arrive sur le champ de bataille avec quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403276&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdd59fb6-4527-4f50-8c0a-007b42ebe8ed\', \'multiverseId\': 403276}, \'multiverseid\': 403276}, {\'name\': \'Depredatore di Ulamog\', \'text\': "Mentre il Depredatore di Ulamog entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere due carte possedute dai tuoi avversari dall\'esilio nei cimiteri dei rispettivi proprietari. Se lo fai, il Depredatore di Ulamog entra nel campo di battaglia con quattro segnalini +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da3640a-6c46-4312-b986-7e080fd4bc26\', \'multiverseId\': 403575}, \'multiverseid\': 403575}, {\'name\': \'ウラモグの強奪者\', \'text\': \'ウラモグの強奪者が戦場に出るに際し、あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを２枚、それらのオーナーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、ウラモグの強奪者は＋１/＋１カウンターが４個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a82e8e0-8a1e-4f11-8898-82757ae42a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 403874}, \'multiverseid\': 403874}, {\'name\': \'울라목의 약탈자\', \'text\': \'울라목의 약탈자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 추방 영역에 있는 상대가 소유한 카드 두 장을 소유자의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 울라목의 약탈자는 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7543c62b-0641-4480-9fc6-af9f295c2edd\', \'multiverseId\': 404173}, \'multiverseid\': 404173}, {\'name\': \'Despojador de Ulamog\', \'text\': \'Conforme Despojador de Ulamog entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar dois cards exilados de seus oponentes nos cemitérios de seus donos. Se fizer isso, Despojador de Ulamog entrará no campo de batalha com quatro marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c26c1f31-949f-4006-8a42-a9c542b2e708\', \'multiverseId\': 404472}, \'multiverseid\': 404472}, {\'name\': \'Грабитель Уламога\', \'text\': \'При выходе Грабителя Уламога на поле битвы вы можете положить две принадлежащие вашим оппонентам карты из изгнания на кладбища их владельцев. Если вы это делаете, Грабитель Уламога выходит на поле битвы с четырьмя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16ba2f69-887f-4194-9ab7-73a111d7d47a\', \'multiverseId\': 404771}, \'multiverseid\': 404771}, {\'name\': \'钨拉莫掠夺体\', \'text\': \'于钨拉莫掠夺体进战场时，你可以将两张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入其拥有者的坟墓场。若你如此作，则钨拉莫掠夺体进场时上面有四个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇 ／噬体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ede82f0-497e-4ed3-b348-c68919d0540f\', \'multiverseId\': 402379}, \'multiverseid\': 402379}, {\'name\': \'鎢拉莫掠奪體\', \'text\': \'於鎢拉莫掠奪體進戰場時，你可以將兩張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入其擁有者的墳墓場。若你如此作，則鎢拉莫掠奪體進戰場時上面有四個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7940af-8df6-4ee4-ba78-bddddbe63db9\', \'multiverseId\': 402678}, \'multiverseid\': 402678}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ulamogs Wiederverwerter\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn Ulamogs Wiederverwerter ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers legen. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexerei-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a542c9a8-5e56-4161-afc3-e524f94c6387\', \'multiverseId\': 402979}, \'multiverseid\': 402979}, {\'name\': \'Recobrador de Ulamog\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Recobrador de Ulamog entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador sea propietario. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04fa4659-7b82-4daa-84f8-fd485e9d73c9\', \'multiverseId\': 405072}, \'multiverseid\': 405072}, {\'name\': "Recouvreur d\'Ulamog", \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand le Recouvreur d\'Ulamog arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403278&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1cd90df-62e4-4351-b859-2534a7b945ee\', \'multiverseId\': 403278}, \'multiverseid\': 403278}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicatore di Ulamog\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando il Rivendicatore di Ulamog entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be299363-6ca0-4e2e-b5f8-9f495861b003\', \'multiverseId\': 403577}, \'multiverseid\': 403577}, {\'name\': \'ウラモグの回収者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）ウラモグの回収者が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、その対象としたカードをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c0a100-e3b2-4900-a20b-77ed727f5b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 403876}, \'multiverseid\': 403876}, {\'name\': \'울라목의 폐품수집가\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)울라목의 폐품수집가가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff8750e-7eb1-4fff-9dbc-a82478a83135\', \'multiverseId\': 404175}, \'multiverseid\': 404175}, {\'name\': \'Reivindicador de Ulamog\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Reivindicador de Ulamog entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele. Se fizer isso, devolva o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27eac92d-5172-4fa7-bb63-300410a0b37a\', \'multiverseId\': 404474}, \'multiverseid\': 404474}, {\'name\': \'Утилизатор Уламога\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Утилизатор Уламога выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока. Если вы это делаете, верните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36f4e2b0-387c-4e6a-a111-521f4ec1a27f\', \'multiverseId\': 404773}, \'multiverseid\': 404773}, {\'name\': \'钨拉莫回收体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当钨拉莫回收体进战场时，你可以将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场。若你如此作，则将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8180bb5c-e1e0-4adf-a317-876f99476d65\', \'multiverseId\': 402381}, \'multiverseid\': 402381}, {\'name\': \'鎢拉莫回收體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當鎢拉莫回收體進戰場時，你可以將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場。若你如此作，則將目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e42bd392-81c1-4f38-ab3d-b28dafaec715\', \'multiverseId\': 402680}, \'multiverseid\': 402680}]', '[{\'name\': \'Umklammerung der Strömung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.Erwecken 3 — {4}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {4}{U} wirkst, lege außerdem drei +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402741&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75abd087-e738-4d0f-80d0-c720ca6a8c78\', \'multiverseId\': 402741}, \'multiverseid\': 402741}, {\'name\': \'Empuje de las corrientes\', \'text\': \'Regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.Despertar 3—{4}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {4}{U}, pon además tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccc91de6-cb23-46a4-ab8c-b177c894e7bb\', \'multiverseId\': 404834}, \'multiverseid\': 404834}, {\'name\': \'Emprise des courants\', \'text\': "Renvoyez la créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.Éveil 3 — {4}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {4}{U}, mettez aussi trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403040&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a024d2-8bd6-4c77-a705-9b99cfa06bac\', \'multiverseId\': 403040}, \'multiverseid\': 403040}, {\'name\': \'Stretta dei Flutti\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.Risveglio 3—{4}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per {4}{U}, metti anche tre segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b5bb9b-4d13-412f-80d8-ea4eabf33b07\', \'multiverseId\': 403339}, \'multiverseid\': 403339}, {\'name\': \'掴み掛かる水流\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。覚醒３―{4}{U}（この呪文を{4}{U}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb29f89-a60a-4b62-8eaa-29dfde0669b9\', \'multiverseId\': 403638}, \'multiverseid\': 403638}, {\'name\': \'물길의 손아귀\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.각성 3—{4}{U} ({4}{U}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f59f56d-b648-4cf8-8ba9-3fe15f03fa68\', \'multiverseId\': 403937}, \'multiverseid\': 403937}, {\'name\': \'Garras das Correntes\', \'text\': \'Devolva a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.Despertar 3 — {4}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {4}{U}, coloque também três marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ac84c0-3583-4844-9fbe-96e8e653612a\', \'multiverseId\': 404236}, \'multiverseid\': 404236}, {\'name\': \'Тиски Течений\', \'text\': \'Верните целевое существо в руку его владельца.Пробуждение 3 — {4}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {4}{U}, также положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd6b2cf-de21-465d-ba6d-e4de65290ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 404535}, \'multiverseid\': 404535}, {\'name\': \'潮流紧攫\', \'text\': \'将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。醒转3～{4}{U}（如果你支付{4}{U}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置三个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b37bc27e-05a2-4f35-a3d6-7cb8d2f8ebc2\', \'multiverseId\': 402143}, \'multiverseid\': 402143}, {\'name\': \'潮流緊攫\', \'text\': \'將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。醒轉3～{4}{U}（如果你支付{4}{U}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置三個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e66044-523c-4ff7-8ad2-efc4005d669b\', \'multiverseId\': 402442}, \'multiverseid\': 402442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheil von Bala Ged\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn das Unheil von Bala Ged angreift, schickt der verteidigende Spieler zwei bleibende Karten, die er kontrolliert, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Von Ulamog abstammende, riesige Eldrazi verheerten den Kontinent Bala Ged. Vom üppigen Dschungel und den reißenden Strömen ist nichts als Staub geblieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402711&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a008683-1d3e-4722-8577-a468f5a41218\', \'multiverseId\': 402711}, \'multiverseid\': 402711}, {\'name\': \'Ruina de Bala Ged\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Ruina de Bala Ged ataque, el jugador defensor exilia dos permanentes que controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'El continente de Bala Ged fue devastado por los colosales Eldrazi del linaje de Ulamog; sus frondosas junglas y turbulentos ríos terminaron reducidos a polvo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'959111e2-6498-41d7-8364-1c6845092345\', \'multiverseId\': 404804}, \'multiverseid\': 404804}, {\'name\': \'Fléau de Bala Ged\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Fléau de Bala Ged attaque, le joueur défenseur exile deux permanents qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "Bala Ged, un continent luxuriant qui regorgeait de rivières tumultueuses fut dévasté par les gigantesques Eldrazi de la lignée d\'Ulamog.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403010&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b88bcf-fe61-4e29-97a1-b012189b240f\', \'multiverseId\': 403010}, \'multiverseid\': 403010}, {\'name\': \'Flagello di Bala Ged\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Flagello di Bala Ged attacca, il giocatore in difesa esilia due permanenti che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il continente di Bala Ged fu devastato da enormi Eldrazi della covata di Ulamog, che ridussero in polvere le sue rigogliose giungle e le cascate dei suoi fiumi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bb4fd76-c48e-4fdd-9522-865bf6254e03\', \'multiverseId\': 403309}, \'multiverseid\': 403309}, {\'name\': \'バーラ・ゲドを滅ぼすもの\', \'text\': \'バーラ・ゲドを滅ぼすものが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは自分がコントロールするパーマネントを２つ追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'バーラ・ゲド大陸の、繁茂していたジャングルも見事な滝となっていた川も、ウラモグの血統の巨大なエルドラージによって、みな塵と化した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9001d540-9d42-4cba-8004-88ac9a07f53d\', \'multiverseId\': 403608}, \'multiverseid\': 403608}, {\'name\': \'발라 게드의 재앙\', \'text\': \'발라 게드의 재앙이 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어는 자신이 조종하는 지속물 두 개를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'발라 게드 대륙이 울라목 혈족의 거대한 엘드라지에 의해 파괴되어 울창한 숲과 폭포처럼 흐르던 강이 먼지로 변하고 말았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d38993-5633-4eb6-8b14-509f76ecaa43\', \'multiverseId\': 403907}, \'multiverseid\': 403907}, {\'name\': \'Ruína de Bala Ged\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Ruína de Bala Ged ataca, o jogador defensor exila duas permanentes que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'O continente de Bala Ged foi devastado por gigantescos Eldrazi da linhagem de Ulamog, que reduziram a pó suas selvas exuberantes e cataratas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d1d4cfb-1bd2-48d2-9592-95118d9f24a2\', \'multiverseId\': 404206}, \'multiverseid\': 404206}, {\'name\': \'Бич Бала-Геда\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Бич Бала-Геда атакует, защищающийся игрок изгоняет два перманента под своим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Когда по континенту Бала-Гед прошли чудовищные Эльдрази из выводка Уламога, его пышные джунгли и бурные реки обратились в прах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567e8e2b-1a10-477e-a55f-11428e254fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 404505}, \'multiverseid\': 404505}, {\'name\': \'巴勒格灾祸\', \'text\': \'每当巴勒格灾祸攻击时，防御牌手放逐两个由他操控的永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫孳生的无数奥札奇在巴勒格大陆肆虐，茂密丛林与蜿蜒河流皆尽化为尘土。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9fb977-629b-4a77-8473-e481ef367fdf\', \'multiverseId\': 402113}, \'multiverseid\': 402113}, {\'name\': \'巴勒格災禍\', \'text\': \'每當巴勒格災禍攻擊時，防禦玩家放逐兩個由他操控的永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫孳生的無數奧札奇在巴勒格大陸肆虐，茂密叢林與蜿蜒河流皆盡化為塵土。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'833879fc-73b9-49a4-8710-107dce2e1a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 402412}, \'multiverseid\': 402412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unnatürliche Aggression\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Falls die Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Dieser Kampf diente auf grauenvolle Weise als Erinnerung daran, was ein endgültiger Sieg der Eldrazi bedeuten würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b56ab3-ed29-488f-8d7a-e9e127a63819\', \'multiverseId\': 402982}, \'multiverseid\': 402982}, {\'name\': \'Agresión antinatural\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Si la criatura que controla un oponente fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La batalla sirvió como recordatorio siniestro de lo que supondría una victoria final de los Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8f163f-e3b1-42d0-9491-d00cdbe48118\', \'multiverseId\': 405075}, \'multiverseid\': 405075}, {\'name\': \'Agressivité surnaturelle\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Si la créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le combat donna un cruel aperçu de ce qu\'impliquerait la victoire totale des Eldrazi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403281&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e03d41-758a-4dbc-a962-4d97ad434a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 403281}, \'multiverseid\': 403281}, {\'name\': \'Aggressione Innaturale\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Se la creatura controllata da un avversario sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Lo scontro servì come lugubre monito di ciò che la vittoria finale degli Eldrazi avrebbe potuto significare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc1af3e6-282e-4f5b-a880-f2a363fe4dc5\', \'multiverseId\': 403580}, \'multiverseid\': 403580}, {\'name\': \'異常な攻撃性\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。このターンにその後者が死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'最終的にエルドラージが勝利すればどうなるか、この戦いは残酷な事実を教えてくれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a6da904-365d-4617-8c86-5a6d8737ff8a\', \'multiverseId\': 403879}, \'multiverseid\': 403879}, {\'name\': \'기괴한 공격성\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)당신이 조종하는 생물과 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다. 상대가 조종하는 그 생물이 이번 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신에 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'전투는 엘드라지에 대한 최후의 승리가 무엇을 의미하는지 암울하게 상기시킨다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0741fbd1-dd3c-4c56-8e14-3378a163d881\', \'multiverseId\': 404178}, \'multiverseid\': 404178}, {\'name\': \'Agressão Antinatural\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)A criatura alvo que você controla luta contra a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Se a criatura que o oponente controla morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A batalha serviu como um lembrete cruel do que uma vitória final dos Eldrazi significaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d43b0dc4-6b2c-4869-9c8e-252b0846651f\', \'multiverseId\': 404477}, \'multiverseid\': 404477}, {\'name\': \'Чужеродная Агрессия\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Целевое существо под вашим контролем дерется с целевым существом под контролем оппонента. Если то существо под контролем оппонента должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Эта битва стала мрачным напоминанием о том, что принесет окончательная победа Эльдрази.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb771506-2d3d-408e-b66e-00f4c351936c\', \'multiverseId\': 404776}, \'multiverseid\': 404776}, {\'name\': \'异常侵略性\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）目标由你操控的生物与目标由对手操控的生物互斗。如果本回合中前述由对手操控的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇最终得胜后会是怎样的惨烈景象，从这场争斗当中便可见一斑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca33948b-312b-4e0d-a9ba-32b6c7c21ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 402384}, \'multiverseid\': 402384}, {\'name\': \'異常侵略性\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）目標由你操控的生物與目標由對手操控的生物互鬥。如果本回合中前述由對手操控的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'奧札奇最終得勝後會是怎樣的慘烈景象，從這場爭鬥當中便可見一斑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0226a5e-f4c0-4788-8e9e-55a64ed037e2\', \'multiverseId\': 402683}, \'multiverseid\': 402683}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterholz-Champion\', \'text\': \'Falls dem Unterholz-Champion Schaden zugefügt würde, während eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihm liegt, verhindere diesen Schaden und entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Unterholz-Champion.Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Unterholz-Champion.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ffc861-4c4c-49ef-9ed0-e691aef75a25\', \'multiverseId\': 402980}, \'multiverseid\': 402980}, {\'name\': \'Campeón del sotobosque\', \'text\': \'Si el Campeón del sotobosque fuera a recibir daño mientras tiene un contador +1/+1 sobre él, prevén ese daño y remueve un contador +1/+1 del Campeón del sotobosque.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Campeón del sotobosque.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d62394fb-a913-4dc1-8f72-be050f093d56\', \'multiverseId\': 405073}, \'multiverseid\': 405073}, {\'name\': \'Champion du sous-bois\', \'text\': "Si des blessures devaient être infligées au Champion du sous-bois pendant qu\'il a un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui, prévenez ces blessures et retirez un marqueur +1/+1 au Champion du sous-bois.Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Champion du sous-bois.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403279&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ae2043f-5e49-48cb-a9c6-3bdf40dad077\', \'multiverseId\': 403279}, \'multiverseid\': 403279}, {\'name\': \'Campione del Sottobosco\', \'text\': \'Se sta per essere inflitto danno al Campione del Sottobosco mentre ha un segnalino +1/+1, previeni quel danno e rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dal Campione del Sottobosco.Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Campione del Sottobosco.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58108cdf-4571-4c5b-b00e-a4b81707f897\', \'multiverseId\': 403578}, \'multiverseid\': 403578}, {\'name\': \'下生えの勇者\', \'text\': \'＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている下生えの勇者にダメージが与えられるなら、そのダメージを軽減し、下生えの勇者の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く。上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、下生えの勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47a1e2a-e595-4338-bc4a-3eb65ad044e8\', \'multiverseId\': 403877}, \'multiverseid\': 403877}, {\'name\': \'덤불 투사\', \'text\': \'덤불 투사가 +1/+1 카운터를 가진 채로 피해를 입으려고 하면, 그 피해를 방지하고 덤불 투사에서 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 제거한다.대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 덤불 투사에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9000b92e-973c-4dc2-8599-8eedfbf9041f\', \'multiverseId\': 404176}, \'multiverseid\': 404176}, {\'name\': \'Campeão da Submata\', \'text\': \'Se algum dano seria causado a Campeão da Submata enquanto ele tem um marcador +1/+1, previna aquele dano e retire um marcador +1/+1 de Campeão da Submata.Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Campeão da Submata.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18cc5ff-10fe-4697-9a8e-00293d0029d7\', \'multiverseId\': 404475}, \'multiverseid\': 404475}, {\'name\': \'Поборник Подлеска\', \'text\': \'Если Поборнику Подлеска должны быть нанесены повреждения, пока на нем есть жетон +1/+1, предотвратите те повреждения и удалите один жетон +1/+1 с Поборника Подлеска.Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Поборника Подлеска.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d724415f-a5dc-474e-804a-7e5fd803413d\', \'multiverseId\': 404774}, \'multiverseid\': 404774}, {\'name\': \'矮丛斗士\', \'text\': \'如果矮丛斗士于其上有+1/+1指示物时将受到伤害，则防止该伤害，并从矮丛斗士上移去一个+1/+1指示物。地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，在矮丛斗士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc468a5-eb21-4800-8db7-4bcfaacd7567\', \'multiverseId\': 402382}, \'multiverseid\': 402382}, {\'name\': \'矮叢鬥士\', \'text\': \'如果矮叢鬥士於其上有+1/+1指示物時將受到傷害，則防止該傷害，並從矮叢鬥士上移去一個+1/+1指示物。地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，在矮叢鬥士上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a27200f8-034c-43ac-8886-be80d231f0dc\', \'multiverseId\': 402681}, \'multiverseid\': 402681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Valakut-Beschwörer\', \'text\': \'{8}: Der Valakut-Beschwörer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„So lange wir schon auf dieser Welt wandeln, kennen wir sie als einen rauen Ort, der nichts verzeiht."—Die Geschichten der Beschwörer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'811471e8-20b1-40f8-8c97-3d2813890bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 402983}, \'multiverseid\': 402983}, {\'name\': \'Invocador de Valakut\', \'text\': \'{8}: El Invocador de Valakut hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Desde que llegamos a este mundo, sabemos que es un lugar cruel e implacable".—Cuentos de los invocadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde3cb7f-a867-4af9-be80-86c44de4ef6c\', \'multiverseId\': 405076}, \'multiverseid\': 405076}, {\'name\': \'Invocateur de Valakut\', \'text\': "{8} : L\'Invocateur de Valakut inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons toujours connu ce monde comme hostile et cruel. »—Les Contes des Invocateurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403282&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d861dcd-f450-4812-9ab8-4087b94761ff\', \'multiverseId\': 403282}, \'multiverseid\': 403282}, {\'name\': \'Evocatore di Valakut\', \'text\': "{8}: L\'Evocatore di Valakut infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Da quando camminiamo su questo mondo sappiamo che è un luogo duro e spietato."—Racconti degli Evocatori\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5762600-e9a0-4ddd-ba1e-c91ccbc26092\', \'multiverseId\': 403581}, \'multiverseid\': 403581}, {\'name\': \'ヴァラクートの発動者\', \'text\': \'{8}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ヴァラクートの発動者はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の知り得た限りでは、この世界は過酷で容赦のない場所である。」――発動者伝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27b45d96-e4d1-443e-a96f-3700e590cffa\', \'multiverseId\': 403880}, \'multiverseid\': 403880}, {\'name\': \'발라쿠트 기원사\', \'text\': \'{8}: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 발라쿠트 기원사는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"이 세상을 걸어서 여행해 보니 이 땅이 얼마나 척박하고 험한 곳인지 알겠더군."—기원사들의 이야기\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5da4fa-6ddc-4339-8068-ef8af0899151\', \'multiverseId\': 404179}, \'multiverseid\': 404179}, {\'name\': \'Invocador de Valakut\', \'text\': \'{8}: Invocador de Valakut causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Desde que andamos por este mundo sabemos que ele é um lugar severo e impiedoso."— Os Contos do Invocador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc49ef00-69d9-4a2b-8a10-24b5da5d0f35\', \'multiverseId\': 404478}, \'multiverseid\': 404478}, {\'name\': \'Валакутский Призыватель\', \'text\': \'{8}: Валакутский Призыватель наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«С самого начала нашего пути в этом мире мы знали, что это суровое место, не прощающее ошибок».— Сказания призывателей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40177da1-a0d8-4aa2-961f-1b701a4c40a8\', \'multiverseId\': 404777}, \'multiverseid\': 404777}, {\'name\': \'瓦拉库召现师\', \'text\': \'{8}：瓦拉库召现师对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们生来便知这个世界的严酷和无情。」～《召现师传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4adcc640-645b-4393-9b56-985567aa567c\', \'multiverseId\': 402385}, \'multiverseid\': 402385}, {\'name\': \'瓦拉庫召現師\', \'text\': \'{8}：瓦拉庫召現師對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「我們生來便知這個世界的嚴酷和無情。」～《召現師傳說》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c008fb9a-d8fa-4691-ad4d-064207524728\', \'multiverseId\': 402684}, \'multiverseid\': 402684}]', '[{\'name\': \'Valakut-Raubtier\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält das Valakut-Raubtier +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Wovon Vulkane auch immer träumen mögen, irgendwie wachen sie immer schlecht gelaunt auf."—Raff Schneckenkauer, Goblin-Abkürzer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'507e04e4-cfb7-4bbc-983e-3bec7cdcc0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 402984}, \'multiverseid\': 402984}, {\'name\': \'Predador de Valakut\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Predador de Valakut obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Sea lo que sea que sueñen los volcanes, siempre se despiertan de mal humor".—Raff Comebabosas, acortacaminos trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ae7c94-222e-43a4-b167-1d82acd1c47f\', \'multiverseId\': 405077}, \'multiverseid\': 405077}, {\'name\': \'Prédateur de Valakut\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Prédateur de Valakut gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne sais de quoi rêvent les volcans, mais ils se réveillent toujours de mauvaise humeur. »—Raff Gobelimace, accourcisseur gobelin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403283&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6ff2d0-c913-4b71-b079-8d7a8f257f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 403283}, \'multiverseid\': 403283}, {\'name\': \'Predatore di Valakut\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Predatore di Valakut prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Non so cosa sognano i vulcani, ma sembra che si sveglino sempre scontrosi."—Raff Mangialumache, goblin delle scorciatoie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72b2e6c9-d6ea-4805-9f0e-dc952dc7900d\', \'multiverseId\': 403582}, \'multiverseid\': 403582}, {\'name\': \'ヴァラクートの捕食者\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、ヴァラクートの捕食者は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「火山がどんな夢を見てるにせよ、目覚めりゃいつもご機嫌ななめさ。」――ゴブリンの近道抜け、ナメクジ喰いのラフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff10285-4eb4-4709-a150-e24c5a1dfda7\', \'multiverseId\': 403881}, \'multiverseid\': 403881}, {\'name\': \'발라쿠트 포식자\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 발라쿠트 포식자는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"화산이 무슨 꿈을 꾸는지는 모르겠지만, 언제나 심술을 부리며 잠에서 깨는 것처럼 보인다구."—고블린 길잡이, 민달팽이 탐식자 라프\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfe028ce-1445-4e45-9fca-ac32d3430685\', \'multiverseId\': 404180}, \'multiverseid\': 404180}, {\'name\': \'Predador de Valakut\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Predador de Valakut recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"O que quer que os vulcões sonhem, eles sempre acordam mal-humorados."— Raff Papalesma, atalhadeiro goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b258c8a-7743-4a77-9dea-5f1379350113\', \'multiverseId\': 404479}, \'multiverseid\': 404479}, {\'name\': \'Валакутский Хищник\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Валакутский Хищник получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Не знаю, что снится вулканам, но просыпаются они всегда ворчливыми».— Рафф Слизнеед, срезающий путь гоблин\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f9d0c3-cf46-459e-b584-3d2459944382\', \'multiverseId\': 404778}, \'multiverseid\': 404778}, {\'name\': \'瓦拉库掠食者\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，瓦拉库掠食者得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「无论火山梦见什么，它醒来时总是怒气冲天。」～抄捷径鬼怪食虫拉夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d58267f-a593-4f1b-aa28-3ec99fdebefd\', \'multiverseId\': 402386}, \'multiverseid\': 402386}, {\'name\': \'瓦拉庫掠食者\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，瓦拉庫掠食者得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「無論火山夢見什麼，它醒來時總是怒氣沖天。」〜抄捷徑鬼怪食蟲拉夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3393ca-3614-4939-a3af-323c94a8b458\', \'multiverseId\': 402685}, \'multiverseid\': 402685}]', "[{'name': 'Vampirische Riten', 'text': '{1}{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Für Vampire ist Blut mehr als bloß Nahrung. Lang verblasste Erinnerungen der Bluthäuptlinge können aus den Venen der von ihnen Geschaffenen zurückgewonnen werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402985&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '160da166-2b41-4179-bd6d-cced875b37a0', 'multiverseId': 402985}, 'multiverseid': 402985}, {'name': 'Ritos vampíricos', 'text': '{1}{B}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Para los vampiros, la sangre supone más que la vida. Los jefes de sangre pueden recuperar recuerdos de las venas de sus siervos que hace mucho que ellos olvidaron.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405078&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd53e4ea2-d8c2-448f-9398-ba16c2f6f99a', 'multiverseId': 405078}, 'multiverseid': 405078}, {'name': 'Sacres vampiriques', 'text': '{1}{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Pour les vampires, le sang représente plus que la vie. Les souvenirs depuis longtemps disparus de la mémoire des chefs de sang peuvent être extraits des veines des membres de leur lignée.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403284&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c5fc449-1a70-49aa-8550-8f1a68caec33', 'multiverseId': 403284}, 'multiverseid': 403284}, {'name': 'Riti Vampirici', 'text': '{1}{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Per i vampiri, il sangue veicola ben più della vita. Ricordi erosi da tempo nelle menti dei capi sanguinari possono essere recuperati dalle vene della loro prole.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403583&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5aabc7d9-c081-4b14-9abf-4e35a4f6bd89', 'multiverseId': 403583}, 'multiverseid': 403583}, {'name': '吸血の儀式', 'text': '{1}{B}, クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得てカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '血が吸血鬼にもたらすのは命だけではない。血の長の精神に脈々と続く記憶が、血管を通して受け継がれるのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403882&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7da71ee-3443-4af5-abe0-3a8cee46985f', 'multiverseId': 403882}, 'multiverseid': 403882}, {'name': '흡혈 의식', 'text': '{1}{B}, 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 당신은 생명 1점을 얻고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': '흡혈귀에게 피는 생명 그 이상의 의미를 가지고 있다. 혈족장의 정신에서 오래 전에 희미해져 버린 기억들은 흡혈귀 혈족의 피에서 되살릴 수 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404181&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7cd9dd9-1d0e-426a-95d7-c773451ba34f', 'multiverseId': 404181}, 'multiverseid': 404181}, {'name': 'Ritos Vampíricos', 'text': '{1}{B}, Sacrifique uma criatura: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida e compra um card.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Para os vampiros, há muito mais no sangue além da vida. Lembranças há muito perdidas nas mentes de grão-vampiros podem ser recuperadas nas veias de suas crias.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404480&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bd94b7f-b026-4069-ae2a-8360468966cc', 'multiverseId': 404480}, 'multiverseid': 404480}, {'name': 'Ритуалы Вампиров', 'text': '{1}{B}, пожертвуйте существо: вы получаете 1 жизнь и берете карту.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Для вампиров кровь — это больше, чем жизнь. Воспоминания, давно стершиеся из памяти кровавых вождей, можно вытянуть из жил их потомков.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404779&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83eeb6ba-3268-4ea1-bbd4-f06cf5891663', 'multiverseId': 404779}, 'multiverseid': 404779}, {'name': '吸血鬼仪式', 'text': '{1}{B}，牺牲一个生物：你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '对于吸血鬼而言，血液承载的远不止生命本身。血侯逝去的记忆可以从其子嗣的血脉中重现。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402387&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5d6778e-cffd-4fbd-9390-7db2f8e41af0', 'multiverseId': 402387}, 'multiverseid': 402387}, {'name': '吸血鬼儀式', 'text': '{1}{B}，犧牲一個生物：你獲得1點生命且抽一張牌。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': '對於吸血鬼而言，血液承載的遠不止生命本身。血侯逝去的記憶可以從其子嗣的血脈中重現。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402686&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dac7843c-df03-4f2a-8a15-6313d5ec6484', 'multiverseId': 402686}, 'multiverseid': 402686}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verbündetenlager\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Verbündeter-Zauberspruch zu wirken.{1}, {T}, opfere das Verbündetenlager: Bringe einen Verbündeten deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661d0b1a-4f91-4bd8-8f9a-51328be69d48\', \'multiverseId\': 402705}, \'multiverseid\': 402705}, {\'name\': \'Campamento aliado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo de Aliado.{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Campamento aliado: Regresa el Aliado objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d564cd9f-ae0e-4f60-8981-7e8a119735ad\', \'multiverseId\': 404798}, \'multiverseid\': 404798}, {\'name\': \'Campement allié\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort d\'allié.{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Campement allié : Renvoyez un allié ciblé que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403004&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59938d7b-bfdc-43fa-bc10-55773c506b00\', \'multiverseId\': 403004}, \'multiverseid\': 403004}, {\'name\': \'Accampamento Alleato\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia Alleato.{1}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Accampamento Alleato: Fai tornare un Alleato bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3122ecff-dc90-4128-8fce-fff279d887f7\', \'multiverseId\': 403303}, \'multiverseid\': 403303}, {\'name\': \'同盟者の宿営地\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、同盟者・呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。{1}, {T}, 同盟者の宿営地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールする同盟者１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9697e06-2b88-4b98-89bf-8f1151b4feed\', \'multiverseId\': 403602}, \'multiverseid\': 403602}, {\'name\': \'동맹 야영지\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다. 이 마나는 동맹 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.{1}, {T}, 동맹 야영지를 희생한다: 당신이 조종하는 동맹을 목표로 정한다. 그 동맹을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1e71fa-06da-4596-a43f-9cc27a63446c\', \'multiverseId\': 403901}, \'multiverseid\': 403901}, {\'name\': \'Acampamento Aliado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana. Gaste este mana apenas para conjurar uma mágica de Aliado.{1}, {T}, Sacrifique Acampamento Aliado: Devolva o Aliado alvo que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4be339ea-18d0-43e1-a6de-a16dcffa4a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 404200}, \'multiverseid\': 404200}, {\'name\': \'Лагерь Союзников\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинания Союзника.{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Лагерь Союзников: верните целевого Союзника под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1105d3e8-acf4-4baf-8016-a91abebc8b68\', \'multiverseId\': 404499}, \'multiverseid\': 404499}, {\'name\': \'伙伴营地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。此法术力只能用来施放伙伴咒语。{1}，{T}，牺牲伙伴营地：将目标由你操控的伙伴移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc0606a-0afe-4952-9d36-fdab064fc118\', \'multiverseId\': 402107}, \'multiverseid\': 402107}, {\'name\': \'伙伴營地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。此魔法力只能用來施放伙伴咒語。{1}，{T}，犧牲伙伴營地：將目標由你操控的伙伴移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9184bb4-cc5e-4b33-a854-8af518a019c7\', \'multiverseId\': 402406}, \'multiverseid\': 402406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verderbte Anhäufung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Die Stärke der Verderbten Anhäufung ist gleich der Anzahl an farblosen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.Verursacht TrampelschadenZehren (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a04f37-e395-4484-a779-474b8b72af71\', \'multiverseId\': 402988}, \'multiverseid\': 402988}, {\'name\': \'Agrupación repugnante\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)La fuerza de la Agrupación repugnante es igual a la cantidad de criaturas incoloras que controlas.Arrolla.Ingerir. (Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d48204-cb11-4062-80c7-58c55a580293\', \'multiverseId\': 405081}, \'multiverseid\': 405081}, {\'name\': \'Agrégat abject\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)La force de l\'Agrégat abject est égale au nombre de créatures incolores que vous contrôlez.PiétinementIngestion (À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403287&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c3322b-93e1-402b-b472-9f32d000f93f\', \'multiverseId\': 403287}, \'multiverseid\': 403287}, {\'name\': \'Agglomerato Ignobile\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)La forza dell\'Agglomerato Ignobile è pari al numero di creature incolori che controlli.TravolgereIngerire (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb2f957b-a1fb-4e11-aee2-190bebca91bc\', \'multiverseId\': 403586}, \'multiverseid\': 403586}, {\'name\': \'不快な集合体\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）不快な集合体のパワーは、あなたがコントロールする無色のクリーチャーの総数に等しい。トランプル嚥下（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9082ab1-a8c5-4ae7-af5c-375a61cefd4a\', \'multiverseId\': 403885}, \'multiverseid\': 403885}, {\'name\': \'사악한 군집체\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)사악한 군집체의 공격력은 당신이 조종하는 무색 생물의 개수와 같다.돌진섭식 (이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50cf63f2-b47d-47a0-ac1f-049354b14dfd\', \'multiverseId\': 404184}, \'multiverseid\': 404184}, {\'name\': \'Agregado Vil\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)O poder de Agregado Vil é igual ao número de criaturas incolores que você controla.AtropelarIngerir (Toda vez que esta criatura causa dano de combate a um jogador, ele exila o card do topo do próprio grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550657e3-8913-40b0-9e3c-8a16f8b964fb\', \'multiverseId\': 404483}, \'multiverseid\': 404483}, {\'name\': \'Кошмарное Скопище\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Сила Кошмарного Скопища равна количеству бесцветных существ под вашим контролем.Пробивной ударЗаглатывание (Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39516568-68c8-45e4-b03f-90233d9b621c\', \'multiverseId\': 404782}, \'multiverseid\': 404782}, {\'name\': \'猛恶聚群体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）猛恶聚群体的力量等同于由你操控的无色生物数量。践踏摄食（每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2e2bb8-6ecf-4307-9fd4-d993ae0d2887\', \'multiverseId\': 402390}, \'multiverseid\': 402390}, {\'name\': \'猛惡聚群體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）猛惡聚群體的力量等同於由你操控的無色生物數量。踐踏攝食（每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0dd056-63f9-413a-bca1-c2c55aad9c12\', \'multiverseId\': 402689}, \'multiverseid\': 402689}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vereinte Front\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Bringe einen 1/1 weißen Kor-Verbündeter-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel für jede unterschiedliche Farbe von Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um Vereinte Front zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kor haben ihr Bedürfnis nach Unabhängigkeit zurückgestellt, für ein starkes Gemeinschaftsgefühl, das ganz Zendikar umspannt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e33daa-9ccd-46fc-98f2-156c887d2a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 402981}, \'multiverseid\': 402981}, {\'name\': \'Frente unificado\', \'text\': \'Converger — Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Aliado Kor blanca 1/1 por cada color de maná usado para lanzar el Frente unificado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El orgullo que sienten los kor por su independencia ha dado lugar a un fuerte sentimiento de unidad que abarca todo Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b4f9ad4-1adc-4676-978b-bff9729cd14c\', \'multiverseId\': 405074}, \'multiverseid\': 405074}, {\'name\': \'Front unifié\', \'text\': \'Convergence — Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Kor et Allié pour chaque couleur de mana dépensé pour lancer le Front unifié.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La fierté des kor pour leur indépendance a cédé la place à un sentiment d\'appartenance à Zendikar tout entier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403280&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6290083e-da3c-4d49-9f9f-850eb43a556b\', \'multiverseId\': 403280}, \'multiverseid\': 403280}, {\'name\': \'Fronte Compatto\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Alleato Kor 1/1 bianca per ogni colore di mana speso per lanciare il Fronte Compatto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'orgoglio dei kor per la propria indipendenza ha ceduto il passo a un forte senso di comunità che abbraccia tutto Zendikar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c3987d-3b1a-48af-a959-b45e544dc5ad\', \'multiverseId\': 403579}, \'multiverseid\': 403579}, {\'name\': \'統一戦線\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― 統一戦線を唱えるために支払われたマナの色１色につき、白の１/１のコー・同盟者・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'コーが重んじてきた独立の気概は、ゼンディカー全体を結びつけた共同体の意識に道を譲った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdb8beed-dab3-4bb7-9fb5-9b2475e70e70\', \'multiverseId\': 403878}, \'multiverseid\': 403878}, {\'name\': \'통합된 전선\', \'text\': \'화합 — 통합된 전선을 발동하는 데 지불한 마나의 각 색마다 1/1 백색 코르 동맹 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'혼자 생활하는 코르의 자부심은 젠디카르를 감싸고 있는 강한 공동체 의식에 조금씩 약해져 갔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d0e8941-f28b-4082-995f-a4f3bd428fff\', \'multiverseId\': 404177}, \'multiverseid\': 404177}, {\'name\': \'Front Unificado\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Kor Aliado para cada cor de mana gasto para conjurar Front Unificado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O orgulho que os kor tinham de sua independência deu lugar a um forte senso de comunidade que compreende a totalidade de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8660b1a7-2ee6-43d7-88d7-cbae3bbe12b1\', \'multiverseId\': 404476}, \'multiverseid\': 404476}, {\'name\': \'Единый Фронт\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Кор Союзник за каждый цвет маны, потраченной на разыгрывание Единого Фронта.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Коры, гордые своей независимостью, вдохновили охваченный чувством единения Зендикар.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb78721e-6def-4388-bd95-9942330addcb\', \'multiverseId\': 404775}, \'multiverseid\': 404775}, {\'name\': \'联合阵线\', \'text\': \'聚辉～施放联合阵线时用来支付费用的法术力中每有一种颜色，便将一个1/1白色寇族／伙伴衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'以独立为傲的寇族也已结成强大的联盟，遍及整个赞迪卡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ce396d-02b2-47f8-bd80-741759f7b3f1\', \'multiverseId\': 402383}, \'multiverseid\': 402383}, {\'name\': \'聯合陣線\', \'text\': \'聚輝～施放聯合陣線時用來支付費用的魔法力中每有一種顏色，便將一個1/1白色寇族／伙伴衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'以獨立為傲的寇族也已結成強大的聯盟，遍及整個贊迪卡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422169da-3597-4b32-b46f-3ed577f194c5\', \'multiverseId\': 402682}, \'multiverseid\': 402682}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vergeltung der Turbulenz\', \'text\': \'Vergeltung der Turbulenz fügt 5 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an angreifenden oder blockenden Kreaturen deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir können ihren Hunger ausnutzen und sie in eine Falle locken. Wenn wir bereits Beute sind, können wir genauso gut Köder sein!"—Yon Basrel, Überlebenskünstler aus dem Oran-Rief-Wald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817fe02f-f161-4d76-b827-f5bdb00526a6\', \'multiverseId\': 402910}, \'multiverseid\': 402910}, {\'name\': \'Venganza de la Turbulencia\', \'text\': \'La Venganza de la Turbulencia hace 5 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas atacantes o bloqueadoras objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Podemos utilizar su hambre para conducirlos a una trampa. Ya somos presa... ¡también podemos ser cebo!".—Yon Basrel, sobreviviente de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d51b81-3be0-4ab3-ad92-126e23302a15\', \'multiverseId\': 405003}, \'multiverseid\': 405003}, {\'name\': \'Châtiment du Roulis\', \'text\': "Le Châtiment du Roulis inflige 5 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre n\'importe quel nombre de créatures attaquantes ou bloqueuses ciblées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Utilisons leur voracité pour les mener à leur perte. Nous sommes déjà des proies, autant servir d\'appât ! »—Yon Basrel, survivaliste d\'Oran-Rief", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c969b2a7-d4cb-4539-ac10-957a1447a71f\', \'multiverseId\': 403209}, \'multiverseid\': 403209}, {\'name\': \'Castigo del Torbido\', \'text\': \'Il Castigo del Torbido infligge 5 danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature attaccanti o bloccanti bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Possiamo usare la loro fame per condurli verso il pericolo. Siamo già una preda, tanto vale fare da esca!"—Yon Basrel, survivalista di Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6b04e6-a563-411e-b905-57dcbf294120\', \'multiverseId\': 403508}, \'multiverseid\': 403508}, {\'name\': \'乱動の報復\', \'text\': \'攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャーを望む数対象とする。乱動の報復はそれらに、５点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつらの飢えを利用して誘い出すんだ。餌食だと思われてるんだから、囮になるんだよ。」――オラン＝リーフの生き残り、ヨン・バスレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28a6fb2d-9c51-4903-bda5-fe30777a4792\', \'multiverseId\': 403807}, \'multiverseid\': 403807}, {\'name\': \'탁류의 보복\', \'text\': \'공격생물이나 방어생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 탁류의 보복은 그 목표들에게 피해 5점을 당신이 원하는 대로 나누어 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"녀석들의 굶주림을 이용해서 놈들을 위험에 빠뜨릴 수 있어. 이미 우리가 녀석들의 먹잇감이라면, 미끼도 될 수 있겠지!"—오란리에프의 생존술사 욘 바스렐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fad76fe-4be8-4cf7-9e1e-790cad15fbce\', \'multiverseId\': 404106}, \'multiverseid\': 404106}, {\'name\': \'Retaliação do Turbilhão\', \'text\': \'Retaliação do Turbilhão causa 5 pontos de dano divididos como você escolher entre qualquer número de criaturas atacantes ou bloqueadoras alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Podemos usar a fome deles para levá-los ao perigo. Se já somos caça, podemos muito bem ser isca!"— Yon Basrel, sobrevivencialista de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4d8a74-13c8-4348-a126-8cfc741140b3\', \'multiverseId\': 404405}, \'multiverseid\': 404405}, {\'name\': \'Воздаяние Великого Вала\', \'text\': \'Воздаяние Великого Вала наносит 5 повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между любым количеством целевых атакующих или блокирующих существ.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Используем их голод, чтобы заманить их в ловушку. Раз уж мы стали добычей, так почему бы не стать приманкой!»— Йон Базрел, оран-рифский выживатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c391632-f8dc-4bdf-867c-4f7a41185d27\', \'multiverseId\': 404704}, \'multiverseid\': 404704}, {\'name\': \'狂搅应报\', \'text\': \'狂搅应报对任意数量目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成共5点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们能利用它们的饥渴将它们诱入险境。我们既然已成猎物，何不充当诱饵？」～欧兰黎求生家阳别瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0137b0-15c7-491c-b9c8-33b5f9c76e59\', \'multiverseId\': 402312}, \'multiverseid\': 402312}, {\'name\': \'狂攪應報\', \'text\': \'狂攪應報對任意數量目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物造成共5點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我們能利用它們的飢渴將它們誘入險境。我們既然已成獵物，何不充當誘餌？」～歐蘭黎求生家陽別瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'389e47e5-9d12-4683-8531-b3db7b0b2cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 402611}, \'multiverseid\': 402611}]', "[{'name': 'Verheerte Schlucht', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{4}{R}, {T}, opfere die Verheerte Schlucht: Die Verheerte Schlucht fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Das Land stirbt, aber es wird sich nicht wehrlos seinem Schicksal ergeben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402719&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8de03ca-d8b2-4924-a7e6-66979eacb214', 'multiverseId': 402719}, 'multiverseid': 402719}, {'name': 'Desfiladero corrompido', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{4}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Desfiladero corrompido: El Desfiladero corrompido hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'La tierra está muriendo, pero no se irá sin luchar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404812&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2f430ce-6047-4276-b5f6-cd3ced6170d2', 'multiverseId': 404812}, 'multiverseid': 404812}, {'name': 'Gorge gangrenée', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{4}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez la Gorge gangrenée : La Gorge gangrenée inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La nature se meurt, mais elle ne succombera pas sans se battre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403018&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7327983-31b4-4da5-9217-11cb2b205f0a', 'multiverseId': 403018}, 'multiverseid': 403018}, {'name': 'Gola Morente', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{4}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica la Gola Morente: La Gola Morente infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La terra sta morendo, ma non se ne andrà placidamente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403317&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21171205-5767-43cf-98c0-450331a0ad4c', 'multiverseId': 403317}, 'multiverseid': 403317}, {'name': '荒廃した山峡', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{4}{R}, {T}, 荒廃した山峡を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。荒廃した山峡はそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '大地は死にかかっている。しかもその死は安らかではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403616&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c197009-8455-4ea5-99e7-b878e5c3203c', 'multiverseId': 403616}, 'multiverseid': 403616}, {'name': '역병에 걸린 협곡', 'text': '{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{4}{R}, {T}, 역병에 걸린 협곡을 희생한다: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 역병에 걸린 협곡은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '대지가 고통스럽게 죽어 가고 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403915&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51e64dab-9cb6-4c1a-9a1b-c3191c1625a9', 'multiverseId': 403915}, 'multiverseid': 403915}, {'name': 'Desfiladeiro Flagelado', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{4}{R}, {T}, Sacrifique Desfiladeiro Flagelado: Desfiladeiro Flagelado causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'A terra está morrendo, mas não sucumbirá de forma pacífica.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404214&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8018f67f-aa11-4774-a5bb-6a1e8a0b8baf', 'multiverseId': 404214}, 'multiverseid': 404214}, {'name': 'Порченая Теснина', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{4}{R}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченую Теснину: Порченая Теснина наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Земля умирает, но она не готова угаснуть мирно.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404513&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ee80b82-5f42-4c7a-9895-d15edba18d14', 'multiverseId': 404513}, 'multiverseid': 404513}, {'name': '枯萎峡谷', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{4}{R}，{T}，牺牲枯萎峡谷：枯萎峡谷对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '大地正在消亡，但它不会平静地离开。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402121&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '421e852b-a301-4312-8dac-1cea2a41e9b3', 'multiverseId': 402121}, 'multiverseid': 402121}, {'name': '枯萎峽谷', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{4}{R}，{T}，犧牲枯萎峽谷：枯萎峽谷對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '大地正在消亡，但它不會平靜地離開。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402420&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f4974d1-58ad-499e-a7fe-549c76cdc65a', 'multiverseId': 402420}, 'multiverseid': 402420}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verheerte Steppe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{3}{W}, {T}, opfere die Verheerte Steppe: Du erhältst für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du an deinen Gliedmaßen Wundbrand entdeckst, trennst du sie ab. Dies ist nichts anderes."—Grünweberin Mina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402720&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaee480b-12cd-4e75-b699-d9ad93bdc35c\', \'multiverseId\': 402720}, \'multiverseid\': 402720}, {\'name\': \'Estepa corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{3}{W}, {T}, sacrificar la Estepa corrompida: Ganas 2 vidas por cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Si un miembro se gangrena, hay que cortarlo. Esto no es diferente".—Mina, tejedora verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b399a11-108b-4ffc-9a49-7abbea6e303a\', \'multiverseId\': 404813}, \'multiverseid\': 404813}, {\'name\': \'Steppes gangrenées\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{3}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez les Steppes gangrenées : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Quand un organe a la gangrène, on le coupe. C\'est le même principe. »—Tisseverdure Mina", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403019&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395e5299-9606-47b4-beee-0deb59b40680\', \'multiverseId\': 403019}, \'multiverseid\': 403019}, {\'name\': \'Steppa Morente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{3}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica la Steppa Morente: Guadagni 2 punti vita per ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando un arto va in cancrena, si amputa. Qui non c\\\'è alcuna differenza."—Mina la tessitrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc5c252-3305-4a24-93d7-4e70e9900299\', \'multiverseId\': 403318}, \'multiverseid\': 403318}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した草原\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{3}{W}, {T}, 荒廃した草原を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「壊疽した足は切り落とすでしょう。これも同じよ。」――緑織りのミーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f9e7a20-c547-4e7d-9860-6eed913847ca\', \'multiverseId\': 403617}, \'multiverseid\': 403617}, {\'name\': \'역병에 걸린 초원\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{3}{W}, {T}, 역병에 걸린 초원을 희생한다: 당신은 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개당 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'"사지가 썩어가고 있다면 잘라내 버려. 그래도 별 차이 없으니깐."— 녹음을 엮는 미나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e05cb8f-5e87-441a-808f-3df9667de5aa\', \'multiverseId\': 403916}, \'multiverseid\': 403916}, {\'name\': \'Estepe Flagelada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{3}{W}, {T}, Sacrifique Estepe Flagelada: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida para cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando um membro gangrena, você decepa. Isso aqui não é diferente."— Mina trança-verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ab5bb3-41b1-4c93-abad-4a4afd1afe8d\', \'multiverseId\': 404215}, \'multiverseid\': 404215}, {\'name\': \'Порченая Степь\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{3}{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченую Степь: вы получаете 2 жизни за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Если в ноге началась гангрена, ее нужно отнять. Здесь то же самое».— Мина из Зеленой Спирали\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae0b9b00-8fd0-4b95-915f-777bf90181be\', \'multiverseId\': 404514}, \'multiverseid\': 404514}, {\'name\': \'枯萎草原\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{3}{W}，{T}，牺牲枯萎草原：你每操控一个生物，便获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「当躯体坏疽时，便要割除。这里也一样。」～织碧弥娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9957a7f-ad54-4291-b413-aea2f142f3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 402122}, \'multiverseid\': 402122}, {\'name\': \'枯萎草原\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{3}{W}，{T}：犧牲枯萎草原：你每操控一個生物，便獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「當軀體壞疽時，便要割除。這裡也一樣。」～織碧彌娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56bc6a38-a9d7-4963-a7db-0cf8976731d5\', \'multiverseId\': 402421}, \'multiverseid\': 402421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheerter Katarakt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{5}{U}, {T}, opfere den Verheerten Katarakt: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Einst stürzten hier Wassermassen in die Tiefe. Nun rieselt nur noch Staub und Asche von den Klippen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64a2e04-0fa5-4f8e-8d49-c7f248117a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 402717}, \'multiverseid\': 402717}, {\'name\': \'Catarata corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{5}{U}, {T}, sacrificar la Catarata corrompida: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Hace tiempo corría agua por aquí. Ahora de los acantilados solo cae polvo y ceniza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'393a33ce-2c65-43fc-a807-196247d72390\', \'multiverseId\': 404810}, \'multiverseid\': 404810}, {\'name\': \'Cataracte gangrenée\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{5}{U}, {T}, sacrifiez la Cataracte gangrenée : Piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "De l\'eau s\'écoulait ici autrefois. Aujourd\'hui, seules la poussière et les cendres se déversent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403016&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2baebfc-53ee-4bcb-a9e4-2fe9fe8cae42\', \'multiverseId\': 403016}, \'multiverseid\': 403016}, {\'name\': \'Cataratta Morente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{5}{U}, {T}, Sacrifica la Cataratta Morente: Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un tempo, qui scorreva acqua. Ora dai dirupi cadono solo polvere e cenere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e41ec1-bc84-45ba-aa5b-4945b17f8cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 403315}, \'multiverseid\': 403315}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した瀑布\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{5}{U}, {T}, 荒廃した瀑布を生け贄に捧げる：カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'かつては水が流れていた。今では塵と灰が滑り落ちるのみである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ff1498-30e9-4788-89f4-25ce25339640\', \'multiverseId\': 403614}, \'multiverseid\': 403614}, {\'name\': \'역병에 걸린 대폭포\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{5}{U}, {T}, 역병에 걸린 대폭포를 희생한다: 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'한 때 여기에는 물이 흘렀다. 하지만 이제는 절벽 위에서 떨어진 먼지와 재만 남았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0493631-f953-450f-a78f-8cc18334f397\', \'multiverseId\': 403913}, \'multiverseid\': 403913}, {\'name\': \'Catarata Flagelada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{5}{U}, {T}, Sacrifique Catarata Flagelada: Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Já correu água aqui. Agora apenas pó e cinzas caem dos penhascos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018e3a05-d3ae-4951-a14f-4290ae36911c\', \'multiverseId\': 404212}, \'multiverseid\': 404212}, {\'name\': \'Порченый Водопад\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{5}{U}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченый Водопад: возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Когда-то здесь шумела вода. Теперь с вершин утесов сыплются лишь прах и пепел.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e813dc-4aed-4d92-a659-dae0326ea09c\', \'multiverseId\': 404511}, \'multiverseid\': 404511}, {\'name\': \'枯萎巨瀑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{5}{U}，{T}，牺牲枯萎巨瀑：抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'此处曾有飞流直下。如今从崖顶落下的只有灰尘与沙土。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34ad12b3-206b-441b-8ac0-99f891f21bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 402119}, \'multiverseid\': 402119}, {\'name\': \'枯萎巨瀑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{5}{U}，{T}，犧牲枯萎巨瀑：抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'此處曾有飛流直下。如今從崖頂落下的只有灰塵與沙土。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9808e612-997b-4195-b75a-ccadd63acdba\', \'multiverseId\': 402418}, \'multiverseid\': 402418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheertes Fenn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{4}{B}, {T}, opfere das Verheerte Fenn: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl opfert eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir kamen an einen Ort, an dem Zendikar die Haut abgezogen wurde und seine Knochen in der Sonne bleichten."—Grünweberin Mina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b59d5cb-1f8f-405e-bc5f-815395333d35\', \'multiverseId\': 402718}, \'multiverseid\': 402718}, {\'name\': \'Marisma corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{4}{B}, {T}, sacrificar la Marisma corrompida: El oponente objetivo sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Llegamos a un lugar donde la piel de Zendikar había sido arrancada y sus huesos relucían desnudos bajo el cielo".—Mina, tejedora verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30f8e768-c6f4-446f-bbf1-916ba87fee38\', \'multiverseId\': 404811}, \'multiverseid\': 404811}, {\'name\': \'Maremme gangrenée\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{4}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez la Maremme gangrenée : L\'adversaire ciblé sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons découvert un lieu où la peau de Zendikar a été arrachée et où ses os sont exposés aux quatre vents. »—Tisseverdure Mina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403017&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce5b878-b3d0-4110-b6f3-ea78c46eeeb4\', \'multiverseId\': 403017}, \'multiverseid\': 403017}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino Morente\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{4}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Acquitrino Morente: Un avversario bersaglio sacrifica una creatura.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo giunti in un luogo dove la pelle di Zendikar è stata scuoiata e le sue ossa giacciono nude sotto il firmamento."—Mina la tessitrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40da5581-12a6-4103-af03-273d77f9f605\', \'multiverseId\': 403316}, \'multiverseid\': 403316}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した湿原\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{4}{B}, {T}, 荒廃した湿原を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちが着いたのは、ゼンディカーの皮膚が剥ぎ取られ骨がむき出しになっている、そんな場所だった。」――緑織りのミーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f11aadcb-0d5b-4e84-8b52-73865776f17b\', \'multiverseId\': 403615}, \'multiverseid\': 403615}, {\'name\': \'역병에 걸린 늪\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{4}{B}, {T}, 역병에 걸린 늪을 희생한다: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 젠디카르의 가죽이 벗겨지고 그 뼈가 하늘에 드러난 곳에 왔다."— 녹음을 엮는 미나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8f856b-7992-457f-acae-9f7f1ceb43d2\', \'multiverseId\': 403914}, \'multiverseid\': 403914}, {\'name\': \'Charco Flagelado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{4}{B}, {T}, Sacrifique Charco Flagelado: O oponente alvo sacrifica uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Chegamos a um lugar onde a pele de Zendikar foi arrancada e seus ossos jazem expostos a céu aberto."— Mina trança-verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b973b752-59ce-42dd-83b8-adac2b2326fc\', \'multiverseId\': 404213}, \'multiverseid\': 404213}, {\'name\': \'Порченая Топь\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{4}{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченую Топь: целевой оппонент жертвует существо.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы добрались до места, где кожа Зендикара была разорвана, и его кости белели под открытым небом».— Мина из Зеленой Спирали\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd2c6ccf-57df-4578-b2ba-5cd5ab3ee3dd\', \'multiverseId\': 404512}, \'multiverseid\': 404512}, {\'name\': \'枯萎泽地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{4}{B}，{T}：牺牲枯萎泽地：目标对手牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我们所处的赞迪卡，像是被剥去了一层外皮，骨骼裸露在蓝天之下。」～织碧弥娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46b4dd8-c4ec-42f3-8c71-8380aa8ccdaf\', \'multiverseId\': 402120}, \'multiverseid\': 402120}, {\'name\': \'枯萎澤地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{4}{B}，{T}，犧牲枯萎澤地：目標對手犧牲一個生物。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我們所處的贊迪卡，像是被剝去了一層外皮，骨骼裸露在藍天之下。」～織碧彌娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe1471c-59a6-4e5b-af0d-5ba593f42962\', \'multiverseId\': 402419}, \'multiverseid\': 402419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheertes Waldland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.{3}{G}, {T}, opfere das Verheerte Waldland: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten und bringe diese getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402721&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558f1755-40c1-4c00-a88d-47eeae646bee\', \'multiverseId\': 402721}, \'multiverseid\': 402721}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.{3}{G}, {T}, sacrificar la Arboleda corrompida: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica y ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da184e9-35c5-41c7-a688-4568c76da9bb\', \'multiverseId\': 404814}, \'multiverseid\': 404814}, {\'name\': \'Sylves gangrenées\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez les Sylves gangrenées : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base et mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403020&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294d3987-09b0-4277-b00f-940655a74de1\', \'multiverseId\': 403020}, \'multiverseid\': 403020}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Morente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Boscaglia Morente: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base e mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a664a3c8-dabf-4a16-b4ce-29a4276203ef\', \'multiverseId\': 403319}, \'multiverseid\': 403319}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した森林\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。{3}{G}, {T}, 荒廃した森林を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを最大２枚探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d113597-bc1e-4f99-9f46-42940677cb8b\', \'multiverseId\': 403618}, \'multiverseid\': 403618}, {\'name\': \'역병에 걸린 삼림지\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}을 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.{3}{G}, {T}, 역병에 걸린 삼림지를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 최대 두 장까지의 기본 대지 카드를 찾아 탭된 채로 전장에 놓는다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e10619-31fa-4d61-bdbf-6700d9293193\', \'multiverseId\': 403917}, \'multiverseid\': 403917}, {\'name\': \'Floresta Flagelada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifique Floresta Flagelada: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico e coloque-os no campo de batalha virados. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac59ea9-e22e-434a-b2d5-c8053e99e954\', \'multiverseId\': 404216}, \'multiverseid\': 404216}, {\'name\': \'Порченый Лес\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.{3}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченый Лес: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель и положите их на поле битвы повернутыми. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58db8c78-b00b-465b-80d0-580099a95873\', \'multiverseId\': 404515}, \'multiverseid\': 404515}, {\'name\': \'枯萎林地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{3}{G}，{T}，牺牲枯萎林地：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，并将它们横置放进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5bc982-0627-41be-aec8-f254bd513f41\', \'multiverseId\': 402123}, \'multiverseid\': 402123}, {\'name\': \'枯萎林地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。{3}{G}，{T}，犧牲枯萎林地：從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，並將它們橫置放進戰場。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8cfe031-f288-4456-aacf-684573e8f137\', \'multiverseId\': 402422}, \'multiverseid\': 402422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verhängnisbringer\', \'text\': \'Wenn du den Verhängnisbringer wirkst, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer farblosen Kreaturenkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 7 oder mehr durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, dann deine Bibliothek mischen und diese Karte oben darauf legen.Der erste Kreaturenzauber, den du in jedem Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a05498-069e-46cc-a61e-f37a2ac0d7bc\', \'multiverseId\': 402744}, \'multiverseid\': 402744}, {\'name\': \'Conducto de ruina\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances el Conducto de ruina, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura incolora con coste de maná convertido de 7 o más y mostrarla. Luego baraja tu biblioteca y pon esa carta en la parte superior.Te cuesta {2} menos el primer hechizo de criatura que lances cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42798cab-690f-4177-a1a9-780449fd8191\', \'multiverseId\': 404837}, \'multiverseid\': 404837}, {\'name\': \'Conduit de ruine\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez le Conduit de ruine, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature incolore avec un coût converti de mana supérieur ou égal à 7, la révéler, mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque et mettre cette carte au-dessus d\'elle.Le premier sort de créature que vous lancez à chaque tour coûte {2} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403043&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc38ccb-d7fa-4fe3-ad4f-81c11f8b9f18\', \'multiverseId\': 403043}, \'multiverseid\': 403043}, {\'name\': \'Latore della Rovina\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci il Latore della Rovina, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura incolore con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 7, rivelarla, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio e mettere quella carta in cima.La prima magia creatura che lanci ogni turno costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f1e04e3-3691-4857-93cc-ff865ad28579\', \'multiverseId\': 403342}, \'multiverseid\': 403342}, {\'name\': \'破滅を導くもの\', \'text\': \'あなたが破滅を導くものを唱えたとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから点数で見たマナ・コストが７以上の無色のクリーチャー・カードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それを公開し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直し、そのカードをライブラリーの一番上に置く。各ターン、あなたが最初に唱えるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd53d667-da39-4377-a58f-374e5731cde7\', \'multiverseId\': 403641}, \'multiverseid\': 403641}, {\'name\': \'파멸의 사자\', \'text\': \'파멸의 사자를 발동할 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 전환마나비용이 7 이상인 무색 생물 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞은 다음 그 카드를 서고 맨 위에 올려놓는다.매 턴마다 당신이 발동하는 첫 번째 생물 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38633cf4-65fe-433a-a289-c12260e53fed\', \'multiverseId\': 403940}, \'multiverseid\': 403940}, {\'name\': \'Condutor da Ruína\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjura Condutor da Ruína, pode procurar em seu grimório um card de criatura incolor com custo de mana convertido igual ou superior a 7 e revelá-lo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório e coloque aquele card no topo.A primeira mágica de criatura que você conjura em cada turno custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e53cbce5-38de-483d-b0ab-6ca9ae82f3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 404239}, \'multiverseid\': 404239}, {\'name\': \'Проводник Разрушений\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете Проводника Разрушений, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту бесцветного существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 7 или выше, показать ее, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку и положить ту карту на верх вашей библиотеки.Первое заклинание существа, которое вы разыгрываете в каждом ходу, стоит на {2} меньше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'820af19b-34ef-4aa0-9f2b-edf6cea09adc\', \'multiverseId\': 404538}, \'multiverseid\': 404538}, {\'name\': \'崩毁恶体\', \'text\': \'当你施放崩毁恶体时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用等于或大于7的无色生物牌，展示该牌，然后将你的牌库洗牌，并将该牌置于其上 。你每回合中第一个施放的生物咒语减少{2}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6c4f9dc-2ca1-4151-a389-ce0620d8961d\', \'multiverseId\': 402146}, \'multiverseid\': 402146}, {\'name\': \'崩毀惡體\', \'text\': \'當你施放崩毀惡體時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張總魔法力費用大於或等於7的無色生物牌，展示該牌，然後將你的牌庫洗牌，並將該牌置於其上。你每回合中第一個施放的生物咒語減少{2}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755aadc4-a5c6-456b-8112-2e850dbee4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 402445}, \'multiverseid\': 402445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verhängnisvoller Pfad\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.Erwecken 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{B}{B} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402916&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c520bf-c8af-412a-bd3a-4c597f3f3fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 402916}, \'multiverseid\': 402916}, {\'name\': \'Camino ruinoso\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.Despertar 4—{5}{B}{B}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{B}{B}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d513d431-1838-4212-ad91-0765e4d75b81\', \'multiverseId\': 405009}, \'multiverseid\': 405009}, {\'name\': \'Chemin désastreux\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature ciblée ou le planeswalker ciblé.Éveil 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{B}{B}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb68bbaf-9bdd-4448-a1f7-ee1a2f76a287\', \'multiverseId\': 403215}, \'multiverseid\': 403215}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero della Sventura\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.Risveglio 4—{5}{B}{B} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{B}{B}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcbef0d1-bc56-4aff-94ca-40bbfae5c33b\', \'multiverseId\': 403514}, \'multiverseid\': 403514}, {\'name\': \'破滅の道\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。覚醒４―{5}{B}{B}（この呪文を{5}{B}{B}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a085501f-3d50-44a1-87d1-678198bf0e17\', \'multiverseId\': 403813}, \'multiverseid\': 403813}, {\'name\': \'손상된 통로\', \'text\': \'생물이나 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.각성 4—{5}{B}{B} ({5}{B}{B}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e9dbf7-c333-438b-8a95-799e8431bde3\', \'multiverseId\': 404112}, \'multiverseid\': 404112}, {\'name\': \'Trilha Ruinosa\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou planeswalker alvo.Despertar 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{B}{B}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522e26f9-013a-4f27-9087-26a7c823858b\', \'multiverseId\': 404411}, \'multiverseid\': 404411}, {\'name\': \'Путь Разрушения\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо или planeswalker-а.Пробуждение 4 — {5}{B}{B} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{B}{B}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89111ad-db21-45d5-8eea-2a98a9cf00e9\', \'multiverseId\': 404710}, \'multiverseid\': 404710}, {\'name\': \'毁坏之径\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物或鹏洛客。醒转4～{5}{B}{B}（如果你支付{5}{B}{B}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d01903-a761-4a63-92a3-17182575a8cf\', \'multiverseId\': 402318}, \'multiverseid\': 402318}, {\'name\': \'毀壞之徑\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物或鵬洛客。醒轉4～{5}{B}{B}（如果你支付{5}{B}{B}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427302c5-058c-4dcc-b600-9baa7c53a922\', \'multiverseId\': 402617}, \'multiverseid\': 402617}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstärkte Palisade\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'Die Verteidigungsanlagen des Refugiums erlauben es neuen Rekruten, die geringeren Eldrazi aus der Nähe zu sehen und so ihre Mägen für das zu stählen, was ihnen noch bevorsteht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2026e14e-83ed-49fd-b64d-1a6b37494611\', \'multiverseId\': 402789}, \'multiverseid\': 402789}, {\'name\': \'Baluarte fortificado\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'Desde la seguridad del refugio, los nuevos reclutas observan a los hambrientos Eldrazi menores acercándose a sus defensas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6bf622-69eb-45d5-9db6-b39e3ce0dcc5\', \'multiverseId\': 404882}, \'multiverseid\': 404882}, {\'name\': \'Rempart fortifié\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\', \'type\': \'Créature : mur\', \'flavor\': "Les défenses du refuge permettent aux nouvelles recrues d\'observer de près les Eldrazi inférieurs et de s\'endurcir en vue de ce qui les attend.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ce5c99-4a80-488b-b485-f5122168e271\', \'multiverseId\': 403088}, \'multiverseid\': 403088}, {\'name\': \'Barricata Fortificata\', \'text\': \'Difensore\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'Le difese del rifugio permettono alle nuove reclute di vedere da vicino Eldrazi minori, preparando così lo stomaco per ciò che affronteranno in futuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb13788a-8662-4b90-889d-14049d80c7f1\', \'multiverseId\': 403387}, \'multiverseid\': 403387}, {\'name\': \'城砦化した塁壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'砦の守りのおかげで新兵は小型のエルドラージを間近に見ることができる。そうして来るべきものに備えるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a464568-464d-4633-be1a-e43b54511c17\', \'multiverseId\': 403686}, \'multiverseid\': 403686}, {\'name\': \'요새화된 성곽\', \'text\': \'수비태세\', \'type\': \'생물 — 벽\', \'flavor\': \'피난처의 견고한 방어 덕분에 접근하는 엘드라지의 수가 줄고 있다. 하지만 무슨 일이 닥칠지 아무도 모른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23ec3b6-9caf-4d49-92a4-dfe819349320\', \'multiverseId\': 403985}, \'multiverseid\': 403985}, {\'name\': \'Antemuro Fortificado\', \'text\': \'Defensor\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barreira\', \'flavor\': \'As defesas do refúgio permitem que os novos recrutas vejam Eldrazi menores de perto, preparando o estômago para o que está por vir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14877188-c8ca-44ba-a75f-62642a224be7\', \'multiverseId\': 404284}, \'multiverseid\': 404284}, {\'name\': \'Укрепленный Бастион\', \'text\': \'Защитник\', \'type\': \'Существо — Стена\', \'flavor\': \'Защитные сооружения позволяют новобранцам вблизи рассмотреть самых маленьких из Эльдрази и подготовиться к тому, что ждет впереди.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bb7e19-7c3a-41fe-b444-f5b0dfd8b624\', \'multiverseId\': 404583}, \'multiverseid\': 404583}, {\'name\': \'筑防壁垒\', \'text\': \'守军\', \'type\': \'生物～墙\', \'flavor\': \'避难所的防御工事让新兵能近距离接触小型奥札奇，这能锻炼他们的意志，为将来做好准备。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84cb5a0-1e11-4796-bd25-a321096d338e\', \'multiverseId\': 402191}, \'multiverseid\': 402191}, {\'name\': \'築防壁壘\', \'text\': \'守軍\', \'type\': \'生物～牆\', \'flavor\': \'避難所的防禦工事讓新兵能近距離接觸小型奧札奇，這能鍛鍊他們的意志，為將來做好準備。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be24259-8b92-41d9-ac3d-da9fd56498ad\', \'multiverseId\': 402490}, \'multiverseid\': 402490}]', "[{'name': 'Versunkener Talkessel', 'text': '({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U} oder {B}.)Der Versunkene Talkessel kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht zwei oder mehr Standardländer kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf', 'flavor': 'Auf dem Kontinent Tazeem stürzen rauschende Ströme enge Schluchten hinab, in nebelverhangene Seen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402948&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2806ff9e-3c37-45da-b807-a2981d5c0c7c', 'multiverseId': 402948}, 'multiverseid': 402948}, {'name': 'Hondonada profunda', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {U} o {B} a tu reserva de maná.)La Hondonada profunda entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla pantano', 'flavor': 'En el continente de Tazeem, los ríos se abren paso a través de estrechos cañones y terminan en lagos sumidos en la niebla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405041&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd39a88a4-7f8a-4332-96b4-25e7c08f35b7', 'multiverseId': 405041}, 'multiverseid': 405041}, {'name': 'Dépression engloutie', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B} à votre réserve.)La Dépression engloutie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : île et marais', 'flavor': 'Sur le continent de Tazeem, les eaux tumultueuses passent dans des gorges étroites et se jettent dans des lacs embrumés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403247&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c0e0fea-f10a-4ade-a17c-4abaa6ed127e', 'multiverseId': 403247}, 'multiverseid': 403247}, {'name': 'Conca Infossata', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B} alla tua riserva di mana.)La Conca Infossata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude', 'flavor': 'Sul continente di Tazeem, acque impetuose si tuffano attraverso strette gole in laghi ammantati di nebbia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403546&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7571858-9476-4d94-9cd3-800719e3d25e', 'multiverseId': 403546}, 'multiverseid': 403546}, {'name': '窪み渓谷', 'text': '（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{B}を加える。）あなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、窪み渓谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼', 'flavor': 'タジーム大陸の急流は、狭い渓谷を抜けると霧に覆われた湖へと流れ込む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403845&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'defffe29-be0e-4caa-8bb2-b079dfbcc856', 'multiverseId': 403845}, 'multiverseid': 403845}, {'name': '침몰된 골짜기', 'text': '({T}: {U} 또는 {B}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)침몰된 골짜기는 당신이 다른 기본 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '대지 — 섬 늪', 'flavor': '타짐 대륙에는 급류가 좁은 협곡을 타고 내려와 안개 덮인 호수에 도달한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404144&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f2bfd7c-d55d-437a-b9c5-b7d3ce12e967', 'multiverseId': 404144}, 'multiverseid': 404144}, {'name': 'Vale Afundado', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {U} ou {B} à sua reserva de mana.)Vale Afundado entra no campo de batalha virado a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Ilha Pântano', 'flavor': 'No continente de Tazeem, corredeiras velozes mergulham por cânions estreitos rumo a lagos ocultos nas brumas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404443&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '938ed3f0-9316-49c2-b79c-df5d8ba8fe80', 'multiverseId': 404443}, 'multiverseid': 404443}, {'name': 'Затопленная Лощина', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {U} или {B} в ваше хранилище маны.)Затопленная Лощина выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Остров Болото', 'flavor': 'На континенте Тазим бурные реки несутся по узким каньонам, впадая в укрытые туманом озера.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404742&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1df4c17b-a2ee-4e5e-914a-6b297d3a0700', 'multiverseId': 404742}, 'multiverseid': 404742}, {'name': '沉落幽谷', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}或{B}到你的法术力池中。）除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则沉落幽谷须横置进战场。', 'type': '地～海岛／沼泽', 'flavor': '塔晋大陆上，湍急河水涌经迫窄峡谷，奔腾激流直入雾漫湖泊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402350&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad2e5581-b118-4f00-be26-b0dc555394c4', 'multiverseId': 402350}, 'multiverseid': 402350}, {'name': '沉落幽谷', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}或{B}到你的魔法力池中。）除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則沉落幽谷須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地～海島／沼澤', 'flavor': '塔晉大陸上，湍急河水湧經迫窄峽谷，奔騰激流直入霧漫湖泊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402649&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab784dcb-ba76-4de3-b40a-b9a64d44ddf8', 'multiverseId': 402649}, 'multiverseid': 402649}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verwegene Kohorte\', \'text\': \'Die Verwegene Kohorte greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen anderen Verbündeten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast eine Familie. Meine starb in Seetor. Gehe du zu deiner, ich gehe zu meiner."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa37416-3dd6-4ec3-aa88-294468f95bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 402900}, \'multiverseid\': 402900}, {\'name\': \'Cohorte temeraria\', \'text\': \'La Cohorte temeraria ataca cada combate si puede a menos que controles otro Aliado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Tú tienes familia, la mía murió en Portal Marino. Vuelve con la tuya y yo me iré con la mía".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50340b19-7e65-4ccf-a5e6-871c70d14218\', \'multiverseId\': 404993}, \'multiverseid\': 404993}, {\'name\': \'Cohorte téméraire\', \'text\': \'La Cohorte téméraire attaque à chaque combat si possible à moins que vous ne contrôliez un autre allié.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu as une famille. La mienne est morte à Porte des Mers. Rejoins ta famille, je rejoindrai la mienne. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403199&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'788e4ae4-67ce-4158-85c7-c8503a18c3b4\', \'multiverseId\': 403199}, \'multiverseid\': 403199}, {\'name\': \'Coorte Temeraria\', \'text\': \'La Coorte Temeraria attacca in ogni combattimento se può farlo, a meno che tu non controlli un altro Alleato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu hai una famiglia. La mia è morta a Portale Marino. Vai dalla tua, io raggiungerò la mia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c2a8af-d08e-4830-9cd7-0ae313343e6e\', \'multiverseId\': 403498}, \'multiverseid\': 403498}, {\'name\': \'命知らずの群勢\', \'text\': \'あなたが他の同盟者をコントロールしていないかぎり、命知らずの群勢は可能なら各戦闘で攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前には家族がいるだろう。俺の家族は海門で死んだ。お前は家族のところに行け。俺も家族のところに行く。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baead8e0-88ff-4fd2-a66a-e602b9377904\', \'multiverseId\': 403797}, \'multiverseid\': 403797}, {\'name\': \'무모한 무리\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 동맹을 조종하지 않는 한, 무모한 무리는 가능하면 매 전투마다 공격한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"당신에게는 가족이 있어. 내 가족은 바다 관문에서 모두 죽어 버렸지. 당신은 당신이 갈 길을 가. 난 내 길을 갈 테니."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5dc3b6-a3fe-4bf2-9d66-97ec867bdb06\', \'multiverseId\': 404096}, \'multiverseid\': 404096}, {\'name\': \'Coorte Temerária\', \'text\': \'Coorte Temerária ataca a cada combate se estiver apta a menos que você controle outro Aliado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Você tem família. A minha morreu no Portão Marinho. Você vai para a sua e eu vou para a minha."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4286d452-f824-4b69-91ba-9102f75d5c37\', \'multiverseId\': 404395}, \'multiverseid\': 404395}, {\'name\': \'Безрассудная Ватага\', \'text\': \'Безрассудная Ватага атакует в каждом бою, если может, если только под вашим контролем нет другого Союзника.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«У тебя есть семья. А моя погибла в Мореграде. Ты вернешься к своей семье, а я — к своей».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90596ce4-dac5-4352-ae5f-9fbb2a8cd33c\', \'multiverseId\': 404694}, \'multiverseid\': 404694}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽助拳人\', \'text\': \'除非你操控另一个伙伴，否则鲁莽助拳人每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「你还有家人。而我的家人已经死在海户。你去找你的吧，我也会去找我的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55cb60bd-524a-4b2a-b899-3e0fd89a057b\', \'multiverseId\': 402302}, \'multiverseid\': 402302}, {\'name\': \'魯莽助拳人\', \'text\': \'除非你操控另一個伙伴，否則魯莽助拳人每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「你還有家人，而我的家人已經死在海戶。你去找你的吧，我也會去找我的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ad24d2-11c0-4be9-844d-cde6d99fa3e8\', \'multiverseId\': 402601}, \'multiverseid\': 402601}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verwerter-Angriff\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Lege als zusätzliche Kosten, um den Verwerter-Angriff zu wirken, eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers.Der Verwerter-Angriff fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ulamogs Verwerter folgen dicht hinter ihm und verwandeln zerstörte Materie in unbändige Energie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc59a658-7f10-46c8-a9be-bdea40d99c07\', \'multiverseId\': 402897}, \'multiverseid\': 402897}, {\'name\': \'Asalto metabolizador\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Como coste adicional para lanzar el Asalto metabolizador, pon en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador sea propietario.El Asalto metabolizador hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los metabolizadores de Ulamog siguen sus pasos y convierten la materia corrompida en energía furiosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51a9b9e7-05f6-49d6-b228-39bff5aef4f2\', \'multiverseId\': 404990}, \'multiverseid\': 404990}, {\'name\': \'Assaut du convertisseur\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer l\'Assaut du convertisseur, mettez une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil.L\'Assaut du convertisseur inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les convertisseurs suivent Ulamog de près, transformant la matière détruite en énergie phénoménale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403196&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91855dfa-8a40-4230-9329-a11f5cbacc63\', \'multiverseId\': 403196}, \'multiverseid\': 403196}, {\'name\': \'Assalto del Metabolizzatore\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Come costo addizionale per lanciare l\'Assalto del Metabolizzatore, metti una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore.L\'Assalto del Metabolizzatore infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I metabolizzatori di Ulamog seguono le sue tracce, convertendo in energia impetuosa la materia in rovina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916707c7-e981-4a89-b596-63a592bf91bd\', \'multiverseId\': 403495}, \'multiverseid\': 403495}, {\'name\': \'昇華者の突撃\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）昇華者の突撃を唱えるための追加コストとして、追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置く。クリーチャー１体を対象とする。昇華者の突撃はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'廃棄物を凄まじいエネルギーに変えながらウラモグの昇華者が獲物に迫る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4182513b-2a65-4ecb-a41c-5a59fc532f63\', \'multiverseId\': 403794}, \'multiverseid\': 403794}, {\'name\': \'처리자 습격\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)처리자 습격을 발동하기 위한 추가 비용으로, 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣는다.생물을 목표로 정한다. 처리자 습격은 그 생물에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'분노에 찬 울라목의 처리자들이 그를 뒤쫓고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9a2ad9-d702-46f3-9a16-9e01e1b6614f\', \'multiverseId\': 404093}, \'multiverseid\': 404093}, {\'name\': \'Assalto do Processador\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Como custo adicional para conjurar Assalto do Processador, coloque um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele.Assalto do Processador causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os processadores de Ulamog seguem atrás dele, convertendo a matéria arruinada em energia furiosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab2b4dbe-c3c3-412b-9665-5476915c7e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 404392}, \'multiverseid\': 404392}, {\'name\': \'Нападение Переработчика\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Нападения Переработчика положите принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока.Нападение Переработчика наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'За Уламогом следуют его переработчики, превращающие разрушенную материю в яростную энергию.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a689067-619d-4329-944e-672cf6969f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 404691}, \'multiverseid\': 404691}, {\'name\': \'噬体突袭\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场，以作为施放噬体突袭的额外费用。噬体突袭对目标生物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫的噬体紧随其后，将破败残余转化成狂暴能量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a15a18e-2885-41e4-a818-f6e427a0e4bb\', \'multiverseId\': 402299}, \'multiverseid\': 402299}, {\'name\': \'噬體突襲\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場，以作為施放噬體突襲的額外費用。噬體突襲對目標生物造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫的噬體緊隨其後，將破敗殘餘轉化成狂暴能量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70595175-5262-4911-b7ef-a9ff54ed9fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 402598}, \'multiverseid\': 402598}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vorbote des Gemetzels\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.){1}: Eine farblose Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'„Während wir zögern, sind sie auf dem Vormarsch. Sie warten nicht, während wir streiten. Mit jedem Moment rückt unser Sieg in weitere Ferne."—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402778&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c18840-654a-414b-b57c-b25a18e8c11c\', \'multiverseId\': 402778}, \'multiverseid\': 402778}, {\'name\': \'Precursor de la masacre\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.){1}: La criatura incolora objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras nosotros nos retrasamos, ellos avanzan. No se detendrán por mucho que discutamos. Estamos perdiendo esta guerra por momentos y el objetivo se nos escapa de las manos".—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'298b6297-4ec7-4db8-bae4-f05d3e8029d7\', \'multiverseId\': 404871}, \'multiverseid\': 404871}, {\'name\': \'Précurseur du massacre\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.){1} : La créature incolore ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "« Pendant que nous gaspillons notre temps, ils avancent. Ils n\'attendront pas que nous réglions nos petites querelles. C\'est nos chances de gagner cette guerre que nous perdons quand nous oublions notre objectif. »—Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403077&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca4e4e1-8aad-4b97-8b65-35d9e732b595\', \'multiverseId\': 403077}, \'multiverseid\': 403077}, {\'name\': \'Precursore del Massacro\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.){1}: Una creatura incolore bersaglio ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre noi indugiamo, loro si muovono. Non aspetteranno che risolviamo i nostri litigi. Stiamo perdendo questa guerra attimo dopo attimo, mentre l\\\'obiettivo scivola fuori dalla nostra portata."—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da9219e4-6830-4e8f-baeb-7d3a76719bff\', \'multiverseId\': 403376}, \'multiverseid\': 403376}, {\'name\': \'殺戮の先陣\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）{1}：無色のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'「もたもたしている間にも奴らは動いている。こちらの覇権争いなど待ってはくれない。目的を定めかねている隙に戦況がますます悪化してしまう。」――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe95fd86-3382-42fd-8334-8a19e0cd5ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 403675}, \'multiverseid\': 403675}, {\'name\': \'살육의 선봉\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.){1}: 무색 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 드론\', \'flavor\': \'"우리가 지체하는 동안 그 놈들은 움직이고 있어. 여기서 입씨름이나 하면서 시간을 낭비해선 안 돼. 목표가 우리 손을 벗어나면 우리는 이 전쟁에서 지고 말 거야."—기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'551bb56a-7ff8-48b9-bc59-0d1012817077\', \'multiverseId\': 403974}, \'multiverseid\': 403974}, {\'name\': \'Pioneiro da Carnificina\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.){1}: A criatura incolor alvo ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto nos atrasamos, eles avançam. Eles não vão esperar nossas discussões. Estamos perdendo essa guerra a cada momento conforme nosso objetivo escapa do nosso alcance."— Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd50111-44b0-43bc-9a54-bf329620cc61\', \'multiverseId\': 404273}, \'multiverseid\': 404273}, {\'name\': \'Предтеча Резни\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.){1}: целевое бесцветное существо получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'«Пока мы медлим, они действуют. Они не будут ждать, пока мы закончим пререкаться. Теряя время, мы проигрываем войну, и наша цель ускользает все дальше».— Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8790869-cf7a-427a-a67e-4940181daba8\', \'multiverseId\': 404572}, \'multiverseid\': 404572}, {\'name\': \'屠杀锋体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）{1}：目标无色生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我们在这耽搁，而它们在行动。它们可不会等我们在这费口舌。战争的局势愈发不妙，目标离我们遥不可及。」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc4ded2-b872-4ff5-b4cd-305ad894cdbb\', \'multiverseId\': 402180}, \'multiverseid\': 402180}, {\'name\': \'屠殺鋒體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）{1}：目標無色生物獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／奴獸\', \'flavor\': \'「我們在這耽擱，而它們在行動。它們可不會等我們在這費口舌。戰爭的局勢愈發不妙，目標離我們遙不可及。」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302cd491-7fa5-4650-8b0a-bad8dd62907e\', \'multiverseId\': 402479}, \'multiverseid\': 402479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vulkanische Verwerfung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wie ein lebender Organismus befreit sich Zendikar von einer Infektion, allerdings geschieht es schlagartig und schonungslos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afac72d1-3956-4043-baba-38a502e1cb94\', \'multiverseId\': 402991}, \'multiverseid\': 402991}, {\'name\': \'Alzamiento volcánico\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Como un organismo vivo, Zendikar se libra de las infecciones de forma abrupta y despiadada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd78c0e-7b0a-4efa-b872-b0a1088a723e\', \'multiverseId\': 405084}, \'multiverseid\': 405084}, {\'name\': \'Bouleversement volcanique\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Tel un organisme vivant, Zendikar élimine les infections, de manière brutale et sans aucune pitié.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23014ce0-7992-402f-8397-2a74425c047f\', \'multiverseId\': 403290}, \'multiverseid\': 403290}, {\'name\': \'Sconvolgimento Vulcanico\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Come un organismo vivente, Zendikar si sbarazza dell\'infezione, bruscamente e senza pietà.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab6a67e0-6bfb-45dd-99aa-88d489727e22\', \'multiverseId\': 403589}, \'multiverseid\': 403589}, {\'name\': \'火山の隆起\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'まるで生物の体のように、ゼンディカーは病原を排泄する。とても荒々しく、そして容赦なく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdacf317-11cb-4385-a8db-9aae8c8377b6\', \'multiverseId\': 403888}, \'multiverseid\': 403888}, {\'name\': \'화산의 격변\', \'text\': \'대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'살아있는 생명체와 마찬가지로 젠디카르도 스스로 감염을 제거하는데, 이는 아주 갑작스럽고 무자비하게 이루어진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a582ba23-7fd6-4216-b3e3-9baa01b0a14c\', \'multiverseId\': 404187}, \'multiverseid\': 404187}, {\'name\': \'Sublevação Vulcânica\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Como um organismo vivo, Zendikar se livra de infecções, e o faz abrupta e impiedosamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4bb838-651f-481c-9fba-4d83ccdb41f7\', \'multiverseId\': 404486}, \'multiverseid\': 404486}, {\'name\': \'Вулканический Сдвиг\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Словно живой организм, Зендикар избавляется от заразы, и делает это грубо и безжалостно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09c3a61-1c2f-4951-8c25-975d8153d68e\', \'multiverseId\': 404785}, \'multiverseid\': 404785}, {\'name\': \'火山动荡\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡就像有机生命体，它会用鲁莽又无情的方式对付身上的感染。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11f0c70c-0d08-488e-888d-a13b2bbf5d96\', \'multiverseId\': 402393}, \'multiverseid\': 402393}, {\'name\': \'火山動盪\', \'text\': \'消滅目標地。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'贊迪卡就像有機生命體，它會用魯莽又無情的方式對付身上的感染。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a2f046-2c3d-410e-89b6-f8581dd6ae8a\', \'multiverseId\': 402692}, \'multiverseid\': 402692}]', '[{\'name\': \'Völlige Geringschätzung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder weniger ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir kehrten zurück und fanden den armen Len, jedes Detail seines schmerzhaften Ablebens perfekt in diesen schrecklichen Staub gezeichnet."—Javad Nasrin, Vorreiter-Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402743&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a26684f-d0cf-4337-bc7d-c70afad6bb23\', \'multiverseId\': 402743}, \'multiverseid\': 402743}, {\'name\': \'Indiferencia absoluta\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Exilia la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 3 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Regresamos al terreno y allá encontramos al pobre Len. Cada instante de su momento final había quedado esculpido en ese horrible polvo".—Javad Nasrin, capitana de batidores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b0e6a66-e032-4a79-845a-5555000379a6\', \'multiverseId\': 404836}, \'multiverseid\': 404836}, {\'name\': \'Mépris absolu\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Exilez la créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons retrouvé le pauvre Len. Tous les détails de ses derniers instants étaient parfaitement moulés dans cette horrible poussière. »—Javad Nasrin, capitaine cavalière\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403042&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e588a45e-148b-4538-903c-ea5b0820923a\', \'multiverseId\': 403042}, \'multiverseid\': 403042}, {\'name\': \'Completo Disinteresse\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Esilia una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tornammo sul campo e trovammo il povero Len, ogni dettaglio dei suoi ultimi istanti impresso chiaramente in quell\\\'orribile polvere."—Javad Nasrin, capitano battipista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c79410-799d-441f-8ef9-731185e36204\', \'multiverseId\': 403341}, \'multiverseid\': 403341}, {\'name\': \'完全無視\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）パワーが３以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「レンを探しに現場に戻った。あいつの最期の瞬間が、細部にいたるまで塵で象られて残っていた。」――先導隊長、ジャヴァド・ナスリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22ea9230-461b-413f-8d35-b143dfc80fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 403640}, \'multiverseid\': 403640}, {\'name\': \'완전한 무시\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)공격력이 3 이하인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 전장으로 돌아와 불쌍한 렌을 발견했네. 그 끔찍한 먼지가 그의 마지막 순간을 완벽하게 보존하고 있었어."—선두 기수 대장 자바드 나스린\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d9a70f-a9f1-452a-8197-4f12916c3d08\', \'multiverseId\': 403939}, \'multiverseid\': 403939}, {\'name\': \'Negligência Completa\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Exile a criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Voltamos para o campo e encontramos o pobre Len, com cada detalhe de seu último momento impresso perfeitamente naquele pó terrível."— Javad Nasrin, capitã vanguardeira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099aefbe-a469-4878-94ea-4052a51f4df2\', \'multiverseId\': 404238}, \'multiverseid\': 404238}, {\'name\': \'Полное Пренебрежение\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Изгоните целевое существо с силой 3 или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы вернулись на поле и нашли беднягу Лена. Его последние мгновения были в деталях запечатлены в этом ужасном прахе».— Джавад Назрин, капитан наездников\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ec224b-b6e9-4c58-829b-747da4679773\', \'multiverseId\': 404537}, \'multiverseid\': 404537}, {\'name\': \'彻底忽视\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）放逐目标力量等于或小于3的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们回到战场，发现了可怜的莱恩，他临终前的动作完美地印刻在那堆可怕的尘土中。」～前导兵队长贾维纳金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7957aa3e-999a-4f3a-ac93-4b878507e945\', \'multiverseId\': 402145}, \'multiverseid\': 402145}, {\'name\': \'徹底忽視\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）放逐目標力量等於或小於3的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我們回到戰場，發現了可憐的萊恩，他臨終前的動作完美地印刻在那堆可怕的塵土中。」～前導兵隊長賈維納金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa9fa58-e1d9-440a-90a2-e7c1479656ca\', \'multiverseId\': 402444}, \'multiverseid\': 402444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wachstumsschub\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nissa ist nicht die Einzige mit einer tiefen Verbindung zu einem von Zendikars Elementen."—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b84473ab-8d32-4b00-b233-d85fa7bd2206\', \'multiverseId\': 402961}, \'multiverseid\': 402961}, {\'name\': \'Ola de crecimiento\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nissa no es la única que está conectada con los elementos más primordiales de Zendikar".—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a2059dc-5b60-4899-bebd-93129c284a32\', \'multiverseId\': 405054}, \'multiverseid\': 405054}, {\'name\': \'Houle de croissance\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nissa n\'est pas la seule à être en communion avec les éléments primordiaux de Zendikar. »—Kiora", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403260&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2bca82-3e37-4d85-9bc8-7c151204420b\', \'multiverseId\': 403260}, \'multiverseid\': 403260}, {\'name\': \'Ondata di Crescita\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nissa non è la sola ad avere un profondo legame con gli elementi primordiali di Zendikar."—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78048de3-b603-4514-9cb0-fa468b425fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 403559}, \'multiverseid\': 403559}, {\'name\': \'成長のうねり\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。あなたは、あなたの手札から土地・カードを１枚戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーの大自然と深く繋がっているのはニッサだけじゃないのよ。」――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df3736d-6477-4ea9-8344-196a5513049d\', \'multiverseId\': 403858}, \'multiverseid\': 403858}, {\'name\': \'밀어닥치는 성장\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 당신은 손에 있는 대지 카드 한 장을 전장에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르의 태고의 정령과 깊은 관계를 맺은 건 니사 혼자만이 아니었다."—키오라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'549d21a4-dc01-44c1-a2ea-ec543b71d225\', \'multiverseId\': 404157}, \'multiverseid\': 404157}, {\'name\': \'Onda de Crescimento\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nissa não é a única com uma conexão profunda com os elementos primais de Zendikar."— Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a2189b-b189-43cc-8011-3ff4984394d5\', \'multiverseId\': 404456}, \'multiverseid\': 404456}, {\'name\': \'Прилив Роста\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода. Вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Нисса — не единственная, у кого есть связь с первобытными стихиями Зендикара».— Киора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d2af46-0741-4292-b082-a2a192a661e4\', \'multiverseId\': 404755}, \'multiverseid\': 404755}, {\'name\': \'壮大成长\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「妮莎可不是唯一与赞迪卡的原初元素有密切联系的人。」～奇奥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21fc48c8-a9e2-4a5c-b733-dbbd56b01df5\', \'multiverseId\': 402363}, \'multiverseid\': 402363}, {\'name\': \'壯大成長\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。你可以將一張地牌從你手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「妮莎可不是唯一與贊迪卡的原初元素有密切聯繫的人。」～奇奧拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54b28bf-4e5d-4749-ace8-e5ff14bae847\', \'multiverseId\': 402662}, \'multiverseid\': 402662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wald-Hellseherei\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Länderkarte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Solange es noch den kleinsten Funken Leben gibt, gibt es auch einen Funken Hoffnung."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5874e2d7-2632-4897-8d87-74be0c4dc0b7\', \'multiverseId\': 402962}, \'multiverseid\': 402962}, {\'name\': \'Adivinación silvana\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras quede un solo hálito de vida, habrá esperanza".—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54d2280-c464-45a9-b0a6-d2b9a0609ad5\', \'multiverseId\': 405055}, \'multiverseid\': 405055}, {\'name\': \'Regard sylvestre\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Tant qu\'il y a une once de vie, il y a de l\'espoir. »—Nissa Revane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403261&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bfeaadf-174f-48f6-9828-bbfbb18c17d2\', \'multiverseId\': 403261}, \'multiverseid\': 403261}, {\'name\': \'Premonizione Silvana\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Finché esiste un singolo brandello di vita, c\\\'è speranza."—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da744209-9d94-4436-99eb-e7e806e538de\', \'multiverseId\': 403560}, \'multiverseid\': 403560}, {\'name\': \'森の占術\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから土地・カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「たとえ一握りでも生命が残っている限り、希望はあるわ。」――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da6327b-19d5-473c-a0c6-ddef6c1d2cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 403859}, \'multiverseid\': 403859}, {\'name\': \'숲의 점술\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"한 조각의 생명이 존재하는 한, 희망은 있다."—니사 레베인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b918c003-54e5-4268-b000-b00a781bee88\', \'multiverseId\': 404158}, \'multiverseid\': 404158}, {\'name\': \'Auspício Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno em seu grimório, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto houver um único fragmento de vida, haverá esperança."— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e969c655-6265-4f8f-a9f0-3dac8eebf891\', \'multiverseId\': 404457}, \'multiverseid\': 404457}, {\'name\': \'Сильванское Гадание\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту земли, покажите ее и положите в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Пока есть хотя бы крупица жизни, есть и надежда».— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d68576-6826-4a06-9a5f-4f5053c5f6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 404756}, \'multiverseid\': 404756}, {\'name\': \'森林占卜\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张地牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「只要有一丝生命存在，就有希望。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fac2fb9-79a5-4593-a1ad-a501ed0f968f\', \'multiverseId\': 402364}, \'multiverseid\': 402364}, {\'name\': \'森林占卜\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張地牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「只要有一絲生命存在，就有希望。」～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb3be5f-5c3f-4b21-9144-dcba03d6a416\', \'multiverseId\': 402663}, \'multiverseid\': 402663}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waldlandwanderer\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, verursacht TrampelschadenKonvergenz — Der Waldlandwanderer kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel für jede unterschiedliche Farbe von Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um ihn zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Elemente verstehen am besten, dass Taten mehr sagen als Worte."—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b483ffdc-2b3d-4f60-b05b-d146039b7b31\', \'multiverseId\': 402996}, \'multiverseid\': 402996}, {\'name\': \'Merodeador del bosque\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, arrolla.Converger — El Merodeador del bosque entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada color de maná usado para lanzarlo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Los elementos comprenden mejor que nadie el refrán: obras son amores y no buenas razones".—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd3d4c3-fe0e-4541-ad55-5a54c9a217b0\', \'multiverseId\': 405089}, \'multiverseid\': 405089}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond des sylves\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, piétinementConvergence — Le Vagabond des sylves arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque couleur de mana dépensé pour le lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'« Les éléments comprennent mieux que quiconque que les actes parlent plus forts que les mots. »—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403295&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5843e906-e00e-4324-97cf-7e642a395d18\', \'multiverseId\': 403295}, \'multiverseid\': 403295}, {\'name\': \'Girovago Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Cautela, travolgereConvergenza — Il Girovago Silvestre entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni colore di mana speso per lanciarlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli elementi capiscono meglio di chiunque altro che le azioni parlano più chiaramente delle parole."—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a01d24-3786-401d-8e63-bf78b8e3dde1\', \'multiverseId\': 403594}, \'multiverseid\': 403594}, {\'name\': \'放浪する森林\', \'text\': \'警戒、トランプル収斂 ― 放浪する森林は、これを唱えるために支払われたマナの色１色につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「行動は言葉よりも雄弁だ。大自然はそれを誰よりも知っている。」――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda6a0f5-0b5c-4387-9a66-5f669442add6\', \'multiverseId\': 403893}, \'multiverseid\': 403893}, {\'name\': \'삼림 방랑자\', \'text\': \'경계, 돌진화합 — 삼림 방랑자는 발동 비용으로 지불한 마나의 각 색마다 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"정령들은 누구보다도 말보다 행동이 중요하다는 것을 잘 이해하지."—기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a4b19b-5498-4d35-9a59-b43a30b08f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 404192}, \'multiverseid\': 404192}, {\'name\': \'Andarilho da Floresta\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, atropelarConvergir — Andarilho da Floresta entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada cor de mana gasto para conjurá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Os elementos entendem melhor que qualquer um que ações falam mais alto que palavras."— Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5f4a3c-7d43-461d-b815-e18179b6bcb9\', \'multiverseId\': 404491}, \'multiverseid\': 404491}, {\'name\': \'Лесной Бродяга\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Пробивной ударСхождение — Лесной Бродяга выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 за каждый цвет маны, потраченной на его разыгрывание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Стихии лучше других понимают, что действия важнее, чем любые слова».— Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59fb117c-8bf3-47fb-9636-e05fa7ce21ea\', \'multiverseId\': 404790}, \'multiverseid\': 404790}, {\'name\': \'林地漫游灵\', \'text\': \'警戒，践踏聚辉～林地漫游灵进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为施放它时用来支付费用的法术力颜色数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「元素比任何生物都清楚，行动胜于言语。」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab9086c3-e139-4e59-9331-cdd5f24db9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 402398}, \'multiverseid\': 402398}, {\'name\': \'林地漫遊靈\', \'text\': \'警戒，踐踏聚輝～林地漫遊靈進戰場時上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量為施放它時用來支付費用的魔法力顏色數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「元素比任何生物都清楚，行動勝於言語。」～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0d1a93-9393-458d-b918-0780c0c76eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 402697}, \'multiverseid\': 402697}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waldläuferin aus Murasa\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {3}{G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf die Waldläuferin aus Murasa.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du nicht auf den Kampf vorbereitet bist, dann sei wenigstens bereit zu sterben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5ad124-c8d1-49b4-a39a-ee9c841f4ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 402861}, \'multiverseid\': 402861}, {\'name\': \'Guardabosque de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {3}{G}. Si lo haces, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Guardabosque de Murasa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si no te preparas para luchar, harás mejor en prepararte para morir".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c767697-f6aa-42c7-b893-4198b5dcb514\', \'multiverseId\': 404954}, \'multiverseid\': 404954}, {\'name\': \'Ranger de Murasa\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {3}{G}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Ranger de Murasa.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous n\'êtes pas prêts à combattre, soyez prêts à mourir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e680c8-d1a9-49de-a70c-9cd66af8817a\', \'multiverseId\': 403160}, \'multiverseid\': 403160}, {\'name\': \'Ranger di Murasa\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {3}{G}. Se lo fai, metti due segnalini +1/+1 sulla Ranger di Murasa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non sei pronto a combattere, meglio che ti prepari a morire."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147749df-3801-4580-bc93-7592c4e375f6\', \'multiverseId\': 403459}, \'multiverseid\': 403459}, {\'name\': \'ムラーサのレインジャー\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{3}{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ムラーサのレインジャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「戦う用意が出来てないなら、死ぬ用意は出来てるんでしょうね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d742b5-26ec-4fd4-b076-56ba80b611a0\', \'multiverseId\': 403758}, \'multiverseid\': 403758}, {\'name\': \'무라사 레인저\', \'text\': \'대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {3}{G}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 무라사 레인저에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"싸울 준비가 되지 않았다면, 죽을 준비를 하는 편이 좋겠군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1acf37d-cdab-41c1-b13f-0a2e0cfd21db\', \'multiverseId\': 404057}, \'multiverseid\': 404057}, {\'name\': \'Patrulheiro de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {3}{G}. Se fizer isso, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Patrulheiro de Murasa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se vocês não estão preparados para lutar, é melhor estarem preparados para morrer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccb5bbc2-689b-4c01-936e-f89e4dd8e78c\', \'multiverseId\': 404356}, \'multiverseid\': 404356}, {\'name\': \'Мурасская Обходчица\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {3}{G}. Если вы это делаете, положите два жетона +1/+1 на Мурасскую Обходчицу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Если ты не готов драться, то лучше сразу приготовься к смерти».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5549c5-c512-4939-9b62-2a3673935317\', \'multiverseId\': 404655}, \'multiverseid\': 404655}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒巡林客\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付 {3}{G}。若你如此作，则在姆拉撒巡林客上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你还没准备好上阵，希望你已经准备好了后事。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af61380d-004c-4267-a402-3da164aa1e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 402263}, \'multiverseid\': 402263}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒巡林客\', \'text\': \'地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{3}{G}。若你如此作，則在姆拉撒巡林客上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你還沒準備好上陣，希望你已經準備好了後事。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d5e08e3-a3de-44be-b0fa-3f2286f7c6fd\', \'multiverseId\': 402562}, \'multiverseid\': 402562}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wellenflug-Elementar\', \'text\': \'FliegendLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält das Wellenflug-Elementar +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Siehst du? Ganz Tazeem ist dabei, aufzubegehren."—Noyan Dar, Turbulenzmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a73fda85-399e-449c-a9d8-7ddaae57bd61\', \'multiverseId\': 402994}, \'multiverseid\': 402994}, {\'name\': \'Elemental ala de marejada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Elemental ala de marejada obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Ves? Todo Tazeem está en tensión".—Noyan Dar, mago de la Turbulencia de Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275eb383-5e3a-4e8a-bf9b-55845fca8428\', \'multiverseId\': 405087}, \'multiverseid\': 405087}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'ailevague", \'text\': "VolToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, l\'Élémental d\'ailevague gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Vous voyez ? C\'est tout Tazeem qui tire sur sa longe. »—Noyan Dar, mage du Roulis de Tazeem", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8f6381b-a27f-4c24-a91d-f148fdf67211\', \'multiverseId\': 403293}, \'multiverseid\': 403293}, {\'name\': \'Elementale delle Onde Alate\', \'text\': "VolareTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, l\'Elementale delle Onde Alate prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedete? Tutta Tazeem sta forzando le proprie catene."—Noyan Dar, mago del Torbido di Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8ebee71-34b2-4c51-b526-5a2916305837\', \'multiverseId\': 403592}, \'multiverseid\': 403592}, {\'name\': \'波翼の精霊\', \'text\': \'飛行上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、波翼の精霊は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「わかるか？ タジーム全土が、もう限界だ。」――タジームの乱動魔道士、ノヤン・ダール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d644baf-d432-4c0d-b9af-c46274752198\', \'multiverseId\': 403891}, \'multiverseid\': 403891}, {\'name\': \'파도날개 정령\', \'text\': \'비행대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 파도날개 정령은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"보이나? 타짐 전체가 속박의 굴레로 고통 받고 있네."—타짐의 탁류마도사 노얀 다르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b40435-4d3b-42fa-8e7d-28adc622bdbb\', \'multiverseId\': 404190}, \'multiverseid\': 404190}, {\'name\': \'Elemental Asa-de-onda\', \'text\': \'VoarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Elemental Asa-de-onda recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Está vendo? Tazeem inteira está no limite."— Noyan Dar, mago do turbilhão de Tazeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210fa5e9-66be-4bc7-a7f7-7b6fd0f566b4\', \'multiverseId\': 404489}, \'multiverseid\': 404489}, {\'name\': \'Волнокрылый Элементаль\', \'text\': \'ПолетЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Волнокрылый Элементаль получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Видишь? Весь Тазим у него на привязи».— Нойен Дар, маг Великого Вала из Тазима\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'540b9583-30ba-4357-9efc-05b49225e35d\', \'multiverseId\': 404788}, \'multiverseid\': 404788}, {\'name\': \'浪翼元素\', \'text\': \'飞行地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，浪翼元素得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「看到了吗？整个塔晋都在拉扯身上的拴链。」～塔晋狂搅法师诺言达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e454a91-4074-4e82-b261-89dce1d06d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 402396}, \'multiverseid\': 402396}, {\'name\': \'浪翼元素\', \'text\': \'飛行地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，浪翼元素得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「看到了嗎？整個塔晉都在拉扯身上的拴鏈。」～塔晉狂攪法師諾言達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c353f77-9fe6-47d6-8271-a935bff8cabb\', \'multiverseId\': 402695}, \'multiverseid\': 402695}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weltenaufstand\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die keine Länder sind.Erwecken 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{W}{W}{W} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcac6e72-4b6a-4a40-a0a8-10003ec7ccc8\', \'multiverseId\': 402892}, \'multiverseid\': 402892}, {\'name\': \'Estallido planar\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no sean tierra.Despertar 4—{5}{W}{W}{W}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{W}{W}{W}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44564a9-0f9b-4dc1-8965-d7336488fb9a\', \'multiverseId\': 404985}, \'multiverseid\': 404985}, {\'name\': \'Surgissement planaire\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures non-terrain.Éveil 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{W}{W}{W}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d9d4a6-2286-4cdf-8328-e237088af172\', \'multiverseId\': 403191}, \'multiverseid\': 403191}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione Planare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature non terra.Risveglio 4—{5}{W}{W}{W} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{W}{W}{W}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f31b5a-45b8-423a-ba42-a6ec1d766c00\', \'multiverseId\': 403490}, \'multiverseid\': 403490}, {\'name\': \'次元の激高\', \'text\': \'すべての土地でないクリーチャーを破壊する。覚醒４―{5}{W}{W}{W}（この呪文を{5}{W}{W}{W}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fafef1b4-b959-4bbb-aec0-b056d93cb6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 403789}, \'multiverseid\': 403789}, {\'name\': \'차원 폭발\', \'text\': \'대지가 아닌 모든 생물을 파괴한다.각성 4—{5}{W}{W}{W} ({5}{W}{W}{W}를 지불하고 이 주문을 발동하면, 추가로 당신이 조종하는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 놓고 그 대지는 신속을 가진 0/0 정령 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a34a0c0-a15b-4295-a395-086ac2600fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 404088}, \'multiverseid\': 404088}, {\'name\': \'Irrupção Planar\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que não sejam terrenos.Despertar 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{W}{W}{W}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7852b35-1946-4748-b363-bbee4ec1f598\', \'multiverseId\': 404387}, \'multiverseid\': 404387}, {\'name\': \'Извержение Мира\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все не являющиеся землями существа.Пробуждение 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{W}{W}{W}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eae19ec-2815-4d49-a484-0f92f656759a\', \'multiverseId\': 404686}, \'multiverseid\': 404686}, {\'name\': \'时空爆发\', \'text\': \'消灭所有非地的生物。醒转4～{5}{W}{W}{W}（如果你支付 {5}{W}{W}{W}来施放此咒语，则另在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff5bc13-d0fe-4625-839c-4c3142d26533\', \'multiverseId\': 402294}, \'multiverseid\': 402294}, {\'name\': \'時空爆發\', \'text\': \'消滅所有非地的生物。醒轉4～{5}{W}{W}{W}（如果你支付{5}{W}{W}{W}來施放此咒語，則另在目標由你操控的地上放置四個+1/+1指示物，且它成為0/0，具敏捷異能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef16b1fa-2106-47d7-8264-59848ed0c7ac\', \'multiverseId\': 402593}, \'multiverseid\': 402593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Widrige Umstände\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Tappe bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Diese Kreaturen enttappen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihrer Beherrscher. Bringe einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402700&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12885884-efe6-4cb0-8197-63ca50c51cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 402700}, \'multiverseid\': 402700}, {\'name\': \'Condiciones adversas\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Gira hasta dos criaturas objetivo. Esas criaturas no se enderezan durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador. Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff3f5c8-2093-49a2-9ff9-83fba761e026\', \'multiverseId\': 404793}, \'multiverseid\': 404793}, {\'name\': \'Conditions défavorables\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Engagez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées. Ces créatures ne se dégagent pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de leur contrôleur. Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402999&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'112b9479-99a3-4c40-ae80-483b4e1bffa6\', \'multiverseId\': 402999}, \'multiverseid\': 402999}, {\'name\': \'Condizioni Avverse\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)TAPpa fino a due creature bersaglio. Quelle creature non STAPpano durante il prossimo STAP del loro controllore. Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7e2392-1b44-4bb1-80e6-ee72f487e045\', \'multiverseId\': 403298}, \'multiverseid\': 403298}, {\'name\': \'逆境\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）クリーチャーを最大２体対象とし、それらをタップする。それらのクリーチャーは、それらのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59deec1c-5723-4e03-815c-dbad2a08447d\', \'multiverseId\': 403597}, \'multiverseid\': 403597}, {\'name\': \'불리한 조건\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 탭한다. 그 생물들은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다. 1/1 무색 엘드라지 자손 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물은 "이 생물을 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 {1}을 담는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210eaa16-eed9-4dba-9b4d-dad64957536e\', \'multiverseId\': 403896}, \'multiverseid\': 403896}, {\'name\': \'Condições Adversas\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Vire até duas criaturas alvo. Aquelas criaturas não são desviradas durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador. Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Rebento Eldrazi. Ela tem "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.".\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdeae49a-13fa-4523-b981-4ac686d0c87f\', \'multiverseId\': 404195}, \'multiverseid\': 404195}, {\'name\': \'Неблагоприятные Условия\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Поверните не более двух целевых существ. Те существа не разворачиваются во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего их игрока. Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Отпрыск. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c997298-f7f8-47ba-8f7f-c881edeeeeaa\', \'multiverseId\': 404494}, \'multiverseid\': 404494}, {\'name\': \'不利情况\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）横置至多两个目标生物。这些生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。将一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物放进战场。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d4bb72-c7a8-4fa0-a658-39aa42ecd050\', \'multiverseId\': 402102}, \'multiverseid\': 402102}, {\'name\': \'不利情況\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）橫置至多兩個目標生物。這些生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。將一個1/1無色奧札奇／孽裔衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此生物：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c5773b-f352-4b55-a456-cb22eaeb188a\', \'multiverseId\': 402401}, \'multiverseid\': 402401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windgleiter-Patrouille\', \'text\': \'FliegendImmer wenn die Windgleiter-Patrouille einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wende Hellsicht 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03455d37-7630-4c86-a188-9253de5b1223\', \'multiverseId\': 402995}, \'multiverseid\': 402995}, {\'name\': \'Patrulla jinete del viento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Siempre que la Patrulla jinete del viento haga daño de combate a un jugador, adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9debee-1850-40d9-991b-21526c57e7ff\', \'multiverseId\': 405088}, \'multiverseid\': 405088}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille des vents\', \'text\': "VolÀ chaque fois que la Patrouille des vents inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'028d67e6-f1a2-42bc-a693-a23d0503bc7e\', \'multiverseId\': 403294}, \'multiverseid\': 403294}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia Solcabrezza\', \'text\': \'VolareOgniqualvolta la Pattuglia Solcabrezza infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, profetizza 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37554bd-f9fd-4a64-9786-f7a248fe7acd\', \'multiverseId\': 403593}, \'multiverseid\': 403593}, {\'name\': \'風乗りの巡回兵\', \'text\': \'飛行風乗りの巡回兵がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、占術２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'553698e2-9786-4b89-8d64-b42a52a429a4\', \'multiverseId\': 403892}, \'multiverseid\': 403892}, {\'name\': \'바람기수 순찰병\', \'text\': \'비행바람기수 순찰병이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 점술 2를 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서대로 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b91bb0-eef1-46fd-8fe2-ed4040a36d65\', \'multiverseId\': 404191}, \'multiverseid\': 404191}, {\'name\': \'Patrulheiro Ginete do Vento\', \'text\': \'VoarToda vez que Patrulheiro Ginete do Vento causar dano de combate a um jogador, use vidência 2. (Olhe os dois cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84aaea0f-57f5-4d35-b6c0-100e09d16fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 404490}, \'multiverseid\': 404490}, {\'name\': \'Патрульная Наездница Ветра\', \'text\': \'ПолетКаждый раз, когда Патрульная Наездница Ветра наносит боевые повреждения игроку, предскажите 2. (Посмотрите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них в низ вашей библиотеки, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f3c264-cb45-4ff8-bcbc-50111436108d\', \'multiverseId\': 404789}, \'multiverseid\': 404789}, {\'name\': \'御风巡卫\', \'text\': \'飞行每当御风巡卫对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8076e559-b72b-41c0-8ed2-6e302d5acbfc\', \'multiverseId\': 402397}, \'multiverseid\': 402397}, {\'name\': \'御風巡衛\', \'text\': \'飛行每當御風巡衛對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，占卜2。（檢視你牌庫頂的兩張牌，然後將其中任意數量的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫頂。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bbc3229-99f4-4c5c-8c8e-5304aa2a2d40\', \'multiverseId\': 402696}, \'multiverseid\': 402696}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wolkenmanta\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fisch\', \'flavor\': \'Als Emerias Anhänger herausfanden, dass der von ihnen angebetete Engel nichts weiter war als eine pervertierte Erinnerung Emrakuls, gaben sie ihre Tempel auf. Die verlassenen Schreine dienen nun den Mantas als Brutplätze.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402c6e38-7882-439d-91ee-4e5984118017\', \'multiverseId\': 402740}, \'multiverseid\': 402740}, {\'name\': \'Manta de las nubes\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pez\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los adoradores de Emeria supieron que no era más que una reminiscencia siniestra de Emrakul, abandonaron los templos a la diosa. Estos altares olvidados sirven ahora de terrenos de cría para las mantas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02fda96-702e-4007-9b28-235bf10b44f3\', \'multiverseId\': 404833}, \'multiverseid\': 404833}, {\'name\': \'Raie manta des nuées\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : poisson\', \'flavor\': "Quand les adorateurs d\'Éméria apprirent qu\'elle n\'était rien de plus qu\'un souvenir perverti d\'Emrakul, ils abandonnèrent leurs temples dédiés à la déesse. Les reliquaires abandonnés servent désormais de zones de reproduction aux raies manta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403039&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e22507a7-4483-4eee-8e1e-850f340993b3\', \'multiverseId\': 403039}, \'multiverseid\': 403039}, {\'name\': \'Manta dei Nembi\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pesce\', \'flavor\': \'Quando i suoi adoratori appresero che Emeria era solo un ricordo distorto di Emrakul, abbandonarono i templi dedicati alla dea. I santuari deserti servono ora da terreno di riproduzione delle mante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8814801a-47ee-417b-8ee8-5e70f09cd5b2\', \'multiverseId\': 403338}, \'multiverseid\': 403338}, {\'name\': \'雲マンタ\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 魚\', \'flavor\': \'エメリアがエムラクールの誤った記憶でしかないと知った崇拝者たちは神の寺院を捨て去った。見捨てられた寺院は、今ではマンタの繁殖地となっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abab7b6-438e-4c0b-8bf0-51d9d210320d\', \'multiverseId\': 403637}, \'multiverseid\': 403637}, {\'name\': \'구름 가오리\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 어류\', \'flavor\': \'에메리아의 숭배자들은 에메리아가 엠라쿨의 뒤틀린 기억에 불과하다는 사실을 알게 되자 신전을 떠나버렸다. 버려진 신전은 이제 가오리들의 번식지가 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0cb3ca4-1148-4d05-8556-69f07ec043f5\', \'multiverseId\': 403936}, \'multiverseid\': 403936}, {\'name\': \'Arraia das Nuvens\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Peixe\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os adoradores de Emeria descobriram que ela não passava de uma lembrança distorcida de Emrakul, abandonaram os templos de sua deusa. Os santuários desertos agora servem como áreas de procriação para as arraias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2478165d-e0f6-444a-b1e0-4409c74c64d6\', \'multiverseId\': 404235}, \'multiverseid\': 404235}, {\'name\': \'Облачная Манта\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Рыба\', \'flavor\': \'Когда последователи Эмерии узнали, что она — не более чем искаженные воспоминания об Эмракул, они бросили храмы своей богини. Теперь в эти пустые святилища прилетают на нерест манты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0edadfea-1f83-46fd-bc3a-a12ff7103730\', \'multiverseId\': 404534}, \'multiverseid\': 404534}, {\'name\': \'云际鳐\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～鱼\', \'flavor\': \'当伊美黎的崇拜者发现她只不过是对伊莫库的扭曲记忆后，他们便抛弃了其神殿。遗弃的祭祠现已成为鳐群的温床。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8eddb65-9ea8-4b0f-887a-716f488b66b7\', \'multiverseId\': 402142}, \'multiverseid\': 402142}, {\'name\': \'雲際鰩\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～魚\', \'flavor\': \'當伊美黎的崇拜者發現她只不過是對伊莫庫的扭曲記憶後，他們便拋棄了其神殿。遺棄的祭祠現已成為鰩群的溫床。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c9c0feb-6f7b-4ec7-b49a-288805d0e08f\', \'multiverseId\': 402441}, \'multiverseid\': 402441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächter von Tazeem\', \'text\': \'FliegendLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Falls das Land eine Insel ist, enttappt diese Kreatur nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402803&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf1ab50-6763-48f4-b29c-ded958133ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 402803}, \'multiverseid\': 402803}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de Tazeem\', \'text\': \'Vuela.Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Si esa tierra es una isla, esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d475432a-882a-4a7f-8f64-8da0d3bd20a6\', \'multiverseId\': 404896}, \'multiverseid\': 404896}, {\'name\': \'Vigile de Tazeem\', \'text\': "VolToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Si ce terrain est une île, cette créature ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4056a4e-c6f3-4735-a554-21c68d945310\', \'multiverseId\': 403102}, \'multiverseid\': 403102}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano di Tazeem\', \'text\': "VolareTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Se quella terra è un\'Isola, quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e8cae32-ce6a-499d-ac05-96afc1e400cb\', \'multiverseId\': 403401}, \'multiverseid\': 403401}, {\'name\': \'タジームの守護者\', \'text\': \'飛行上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。その土地が島であるなら、そのクリーチャーはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d0a9d1-e024-4cef-869f-518e9f83d42f\', \'multiverseId\': 403700}, \'multiverseid\': 403700}, {\'name\': \'타짐의 수호자\', \'text\': \'비행대지력 — 대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 대지가 섬이라면, 그 생물은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 스핑크스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f0ac5e-e555-459f-b2ec-dd89345eeae8\', \'multiverseId\': 403999}, \'multiverseid\': 403999}, {\'name\': \'Guardião de Tazeem\', \'text\': \'VoarAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Se o terreno for uma Ilha, aquela criatura não será desvirada durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37a4905-ab89-4df5-b8fc-e498d6f41e61\', \'multiverseId\': 404298}, \'multiverseid\': 404298}, {\'name\': \'Защитник Тазима\', \'text\': \'ПолетЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента. Если та земля является Островом, то существо не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b768d368-b13c-4827-9731-15f4503ebd8c\', \'multiverseId\': 404597}, \'multiverseid\': 404597}, {\'name\': \'塔晋守护者\', \'text\': \'飞行地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。若该地是海岛，则该生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79c5b959-19c4-4c61-936c-d52c87a6d145\', \'multiverseId\': 402205}, \'multiverseid\': 402205}, {\'name\': \'塔晉守護者\', \'text\': \'飛行地落～每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，橫置目標由對手操控的生物。若該地是海島，則該生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b951ac-c7fc-4703-9e4c-0a6498c2fc16\', \'multiverseId\': 402504}, \'multiverseid\': 402504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zada, Polyederschleiferin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, der bzw. die nur Zada, Polyederschleiferin, als Ziel hat, kopiere diesen Zauberspruch für jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die dieser Zauberspruch als Ziel haben könnte. Jede Kopie hat eine unterschiedliche dieser Kreaturen als Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Polyeder speichert Magie für tausend Jahre … oder weniger, falls nötig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868af6aa-16ba-4d9d-b623-7f9ead76d387\', \'multiverseId\': 402997}, \'multiverseid\': 402997}, {\'name\': \'Zada, trituraedros\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que solo haga objetivo a Zada, trituraedros, copia ese hechizo por cada otra criatura que controlas a la que pudiera hacer objetivo el hechizo. Cada copia hace objetivo a cada una de esas otras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Trasgo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Un edro conserva la magia durante un milenio. O menos, si es necesario".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daa11bb9-cbe8-434b-8719-3a091061ebc0\', \'multiverseId\': 405090}, \'multiverseid\': 405090}, {\'name\': "Zada, broyeuse d\'hèdron", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel qui ne cible que Zada, broyeuse d\'hèdron, copiez ce sort pour chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez que ce sort pourrait cibler. Chaque copie cible une de ces créatures différentes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Un hèdron contient de la magie pendant un millier d\'années, moins si nécessaire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403296&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e65ae66b-4b04-4543-9d42-9186b80dfaaa\', \'multiverseId\': 403296}, \'multiverseid\': 403296}, {\'name\': \'Zada, Macinaedri\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria che bersaglia solo Zada, Macinaedri, copia quella magia per ogni altra creatura che controlli e che la magia potrebbe bersagliare. Ogni copia bersaglia una creatura diversa fra queste.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Un edro conserva la sua magia per un migliaio d\\\'anni... o meno, se necessario."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26c5390b-ddd1-4dd0-b8ef-a7c2bc93d65e\', \'multiverseId\': 403595}, \'multiverseid\': 403595}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の掘削者、ザダ\', \'text\': \'あなたが面晶体の掘削者、ザダのみを対象とするインスタント・呪文かソーサリー・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、その呪文が対象にできるあなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャー１体につき、その呪文を１回コピーする。各コピーは、それらのクリーチャーのうち別々のものを対象とする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「面晶体は魔力を千年保つ。必要ならもっと短くもできる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2992d3e8-5d7d-4229-b6da-c2bda52368d3\', \'multiverseId\': 403894}, \'multiverseid\': 403894}, {\'name\': \'다면체 분쇄자 자다\', \'text\': \'당신이 다면체 분쇄자 자다만을 목표로 정해 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문이 목표로 정할 수 있는 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물마다 그 주문을 복사한다. 각 복사본은 그 생물들 중 각각 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 고블린 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"다면체에는 천 년간 지속될 마법의 힘이 간직되어 있어. 그보다 좀 짧을 수도 있지만."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a21e493a-6ba5-4fce-8de5-00a89ffb6a90\', \'multiverseId\': 404193}, \'multiverseid\': 404193}, {\'name\': \'Zada, Moedora de Edros\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço que tenha apenas Zada, Moedora de Edros, como alvo, copie aquela mágica para cada outra criatura que você controla que a mágica pudesse ter como alvo. Cada cópia tem uma criatura diferente como alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Goblin Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Um edro armazena magia por mil anos — ou menos, se necessário."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8517d40b-94a7-4556-8c14-b3828fdd8e76\', \'multiverseId\': 404492}, \'multiverseid\': 404492}, {\'name\': \'Зада, Измельчительница Эдров\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, целью которого является только Зада, скопируйте то заклинание за каждое другое существо под вашим контролем, которое может стать его целью. Целью каждой копии является одно из тех разных существ.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гоблин Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Эдр удерживает в себе магию тысячи лет... или меньше, если это понадобится».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e06937-a7ef-48bc-8aed-d099a2aa54f8\', \'multiverseId\': 404791}, \'multiverseid\': 404791}, {\'name\': \'晶石磨工查妲\', \'text\': \'每当你施放仅以晶石磨工查妲为目标的瞬间或法术咒语时，该咒语每能以一个由你操控的其他生物为目标，便将该咒语复制一次。每个复制品都要以这些生物之一为目标，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～鬼怪／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「晶石能驻固魔法千年～也可以少几年，如果需要的话。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bed14d-2dc6-4486-8199-53ec21df0ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 402399}, \'multiverseid\': 402399}, {\'name\': \'晶石磨工查妲\', \'text\': \'每當你施放僅以晶石磨工查妲為目標的瞬間或巫術咒語時，該咒語每能以一個由你操控的其他生物為目標，便將該咒語複製一次。每個複製品都要以這些生物之一為目標，且不能重複選擇。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～鬼怪／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「晶石能駐固魔法千年～也可以少幾年，如果需要的話。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9abb9a-ed65-4738-9d59-9397dfa757b8\', \'multiverseId\': 402698}, \'multiverseid\': 402698}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zahlenmäßige Überlegenheit\', \'text\': \'Zahlenmäßige Überlegenheit fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Kreaturen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder, der noch eine Waffe halten konnte, leistete seinen Teil bei der Rückeroberung von Seetor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b91c9d2-62e2-47e2-b959-db6d37f1f7b2\', \'multiverseId\': 402877}, \'multiverseid\': 402877}, {\'name\': \'Superar en número\', \'text\': \'Superar en número hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual a las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Todo aquel que aún podía empuñar un arma participó en la reconquista de Portal Marino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe484a5-9c79-4e35-8030-9d8000072e01\', \'multiverseId\': 404970}, \'multiverseid\': 404970}, {\'name\': \'Surnombre\', \'text\': \'Le Surnombre inflige à la créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Tous ceux qui étaient encore capables de porter une arme jouèrent un rôle dans la reconquête de Porte des Mers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579d00c1-b091-4eb0-8785-74efa1c3533d\', \'multiverseId\': 403176}, \'multiverseid\': 403176}, {\'name\': \'Infierire in Massa\', \'text\': \'Infierire in Massa infligge a una creatura bersaglio danno pari al numero di creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Chiunque riuscisse ancora a sollevare un\'arma contribuì alla riconquista di Portale Marino.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d284f47d-e4ce-46e6-9504-fadc1add446a\', \'multiverseId\': 403475}, \'multiverseid\': 403475}, {\'name\': \'多勢\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。多勢はそれに、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'まだ武器を持ち上げられる者は全員が海門の奪還戦に加わった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e246d2-3819-421f-92eb-1f6b647c053d\', \'multiverseId\': 403774}, \'multiverseid\': 403774}, {\'name\': \'수적 우세\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 수적 우세는 그 생물에게 당신이 조종하는 생물들의 개수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'무기를 잡을 수 있는 사람이라면 모두가 바다 관문을 탈환하기 위해 나섰다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bde69fff-d228-4a83-9774-27d619eecad5\', \'multiverseId\': 404073}, \'multiverseid\': 404073}, {\'name\': \'Suplantar em Número\', \'text\': \'Suplantar em Número causa à criatura alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Todos ainda capazes de erguer uma arma tiveram seu papel na retomada do Portão Marinho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22620be3-6c4e-464a-a47b-1a68b00ba61d\', \'multiverseId\': 404372}, \'multiverseid\': 404372}, {\'name\': \'Задавить Числом\', \'text\': \'Задавить Числом наносит целевому существу повреждения, равные количеству существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'В битве за возвращение Мореграда приняли участие все, кто мог хоть как-то держать оружие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1008a4bb-b1ce-4d18-955d-26a814dca6cc\', \'multiverseId\': 404671}, \'multiverseid\': 404671}, {\'name\': \'以量取胜\', \'text\': \'以量取胜对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'能举起武器者，都加入了重夺海户的战斗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'599fa937-eb05-4f93-a122-64689e022c69\', \'multiverseId\': 402279}, \'multiverseid\': 402279}, {\'name\': \'以量取勝\', \'text\': \'以量取勝對目標生物造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的生物數量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'能舉起武器者，都加入了重奪海戶的戰鬥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3795053b-5445-452f-aa60-d33df15ddaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 402578}, \'multiverseid\': 402578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberschwund\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, falls sein Beherrscher nicht {4} bezahlt. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ddbb0e4-6c55-4d7b-b50d-ab562045678e\', \'multiverseId\': 402944}, \'multiverseid\': 402944}, {\'name\': \'Marchitahechizos\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {4}. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d59645a-e951-4fda-9109-fd8643f8f5d0\', \'multiverseId\': 405037}, \'multiverseid\': 405037}, {\'name\': \'Dessiccation de sort\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {4}. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fa7a007-a742-4cc9-b7c3-a65eb79b23a6\', \'multiverseId\': 403243}, \'multiverseid\': 403243}, {\'name\': \'Avvizzimento Magico\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {4}. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5393413d-8d6b-4f15-8839-d2c7989e593a\', \'multiverseId\': 403542}, \'multiverseid\': 403542}, {\'name\': \'呪文萎れ\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）呪文１つを対象とする。そのコントローラーが{4}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。その呪文がこれにより打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb44dd0e-6d13-490e-bd56-c4ece15e4ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 403841}, \'multiverseid\': 403841}, {\'name\': \'주문 위축\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {4}를 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다. 이렇게 그 주문이 무효화되면 그 카드를 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4309a8-9103-45e7-81fd-4e65a36ac4dd\', \'multiverseId\': 404140}, \'multiverseid\': 404140}, {\'name\': \'Murchar Mágica\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {4}. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f0ba50f-9992-4614-9581-23b47c4ae9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 404439}, \'multiverseid\': 404439}, {\'name\': \'Иссушение Заклинания\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Отмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {4}. Если то заклинание отменяется таким образом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6f3625-2172-414f-b6d3-b07a6044a735\', \'multiverseId\': 404738}, \'multiverseid\': 404738}, {\'name\': \'咒语灰灭\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）除非目标咒语的操控者支付{4}，否则反击之。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8358d205-cb35-43bb-bdcc-f3bb8feaf74e\', \'multiverseId\': 402346}, \'multiverseid\': 402346}, {\'name\': \'咒語灰滅\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）除非目標咒語的操控者支付{4}，否則反擊之。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'718ac698-4b35-467c-8ef9-d3ca309993d5\', \'multiverseId\': 402645}, \'multiverseid\': 402645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeuger des Stillstands\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Immer wenn ein Land unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, schickt dieser Spieler die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil und du ziehst zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Als die riesige Plage vorbeizog, erschauderte Zendikar und lag anschließend still da.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c1385c-244a-4a21-b9d6-e6552295aa67\', \'multiverseId\': 402933}, \'multiverseid\': 402933}, {\'name\': \'Progenitor de la parálisis\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, ese jugador exilia las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca y tú robas dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el gran azote pasó, Zendikar entero se estremeció y luego quedó en silencio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34bc3fc2-75fa-4d9d-94b9-08d4dfaeb795\', \'multiverseId\': 405026}, \'multiverseid\': 405026}, {\'name\': \'Père de la stagnation\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, ce joueur exile les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque et vous piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Au passage du grand fléau, Zendikar trembla, puis se tut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403232&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5080153-055b-4d1e-99a5-152c40867396\', \'multiverseId\': 403232}, \'multiverseid\': 403232}, {\'name\': \'Progenitore del Ristagno\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, quel giocatore esilia le prime due carte del suo grimorio e tu peschi due carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Al passaggio del grande flagello, Zendikar rabbrividì, poi giacque in silenzio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6f92d9-9eb3-405b-8504-f74ef723898c\', \'multiverseId\': 403531}, \'multiverseid\': 403531}, {\'name\': \'淀みの種父\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）土地が１つ対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを追放する。あなたはカードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'大災害が襲うと、ゼンディカーは揺動し、そして静まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48bb42c0-68b6-41eb-a9c0-a9711014406b\', \'multiverseId\': 403830}, \'multiverseid\': 403830}, {\'name\': \'침체의 종마\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)대지가 상대의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 추방하고 당신은 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'엄청난 재앙이 지나칠 때, 젠디카르는 두려움에 떨었다가 이내 침묵에 잠겼다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5abc876-aa6d-4c1d-b4e1-b59144c6f721\', \'multiverseId\': 404129}, \'multiverseid\': 404129}, {\'name\': \'Gerador da Estagnação\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente, aquele jogador exila os dois cards do topo do próprio grimório e você compra dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme o grande flagelo passava, Zendikar estremecia... e depois silenciava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516ce7b2-7533-4cb7-9b8a-4d161c8d9ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 404428}, \'multiverseid\': 404428}, {\'name\': \'Породитель Застоя\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под контролем оппонента, тот игрок изгоняет две верхние карты своей библиотеки, а вы берете две карты.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'Великий бич прошелся по Зендикару, и мир содрогнулся, а затем замер в безмолвии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b8355b2-f846-416f-ae35-83cb45de65c8\', \'multiverseId\': 404727}, \'multiverseid\': 404727}, {\'name\': \'阻滞君父\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）每当一个地在对手的操控下进战场时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶的两张牌且你抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'巨型祸害行过，赞迪卡颤抖，随后陷入寂静。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f8b508e-9fe9-4541-981a-6e753580fdd7\', \'multiverseId\': 402335}, \'multiverseid\': 402335}, {\'name\': \'阻滯君父\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）每當一個地在對手的操控下進戰場時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂的兩張牌且你抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'巨型禍害行過，贊迪卡顫抖，隨後陷入寂靜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5498871c-3a27-4234-8908-883e11789d56\', \'multiverseId\': 402634}, \'multiverseid\': 402634}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu Staub zerbröckeln\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Schicke ein Nichtstandardland deiner Wahl ins Exil. Durchsuche den Friedhof, die Hand und die Bibliothek seines Beherrschers nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Karten mit demselben Namen wie jenes Land und schicke sie ins Exil. Dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402747&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7097c68-a636-4135-bd97-6dadb7b532bd\', \'multiverseId\': 402747}, \'multiverseid\': 402747}, {\'name\': \'Reducir a polvo\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Exilia la tierra no básica objetivo. Busca en el cementerio, mano y biblioteca de su controlador cualquier cantidad de cartas con el mismo nombre que esa tierra y exílialas. Luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99f7b3f3-14cb-4ea8-a8e9-087a54c5f80d\', \'multiverseId\': 404840}, \'multiverseid\': 404840}, {\'name\': \'Tomber en poussière\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Exilez le terrain non-base ciblé. Cherchez dans le cimetière, la main et la bibliothèque de son contrôleur n\'importe quel nombre de cartes ayant le même nom que ce terrain et exilez-les. Ce joueur mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0249a58-e909-4aa6-b56d-a6d221d127c2\', \'multiverseId\': 403046}, \'multiverseid\': 403046}, {\'name\': \'Sgretolarsi in Polvere\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Esilia una terra non base bersaglio. Passa in rassegna il cimitero, la mano e il grimorio del suo controllore per un qualsiasi numero di carte con lo stesso nome di quella terra ed esiliale. Poi quel giocatore rimescola il suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d9d0b8-4468-4d1e-9d3c-6c067eb6dd1b\', \'multiverseId\': 403345}, \'multiverseid\': 403345}, {\'name\': \'塵への崩壊\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）基本でない土地１つを対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーの墓地と手札とライブラリーから、その土地と同じ名前を持つカードを望む枚数探し、それらを追放する。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7075f6fd-8c8b-4da9-a401-fb404f8dd14b\', \'multiverseId\': 403644}, \'multiverseid\': 403644}, {\'name\': \'먼지로 부스러지다\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)기본 대지가 아닌 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 추방한다. 그 대지의 조종자의 무덤과 손, 서고에서 그 대지와 같은 이름을 가진 카드를 원하는 수만큼 찾아서 추방한다. 그 후 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef88fdfd-1b9c-47d1-ad3c-06f2d35b10b8\', \'multiverseId\': 403943}, \'multiverseid\': 403943}, {\'name\': \'Ruir em Pó\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Exile o terreno alvo não básico. Procure um número qualquer de cards com o mesmo nome daquele terreno no cemitério, na mão e no grimório de seu controlador e exile-os. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha o próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a445b3ba-f7ab-4a07-bd77-0dfb96faea9c\', \'multiverseId\': 404242}, \'multiverseid\': 404242}, {\'name\': \'Рассыпаться в Прах\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Изгоните целевую небазовую землю. Найдите на кладбище, в руке и в библиотеке контролирующего ту землю игрока любое количество карт с таким же именем, как у нее, и изгоните их. Затем тот игрок тасует свою библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'198d21c2-0236-42ee-9191-3714bbb74dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 404541}, \'multiverseid\': 404541}, {\'name\': \'溃碎化尘\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）放逐目标非基本地。从其操控者的坟墓场，手牌及牌库中搜寻任意数量与该地同名的牌，并将它们放逐。然后该牌手将其牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a08236-d228-4489-89f6-a9d9366754a9\', \'multiverseId\': 402149}, \'multiverseid\': 402149}, {\'name\': \'潰碎化塵\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）放逐目標非基本地。從其操控者的墳墓場、手牌及牌庫中搜尋任意數量與該地同名的牌，並將它們放逐。然後該玩家將其牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa3d21d-21e3-411f-8f21-5faddd99f78d\', \'multiverseId\': 402448}, \'multiverseid\': 402448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zugriff des Dämons\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-5 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schöpfe Trost aus der Gewissheit, dass du Zendikars Untergang nicht miterleben wirst."—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402753&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb096d3-f7ee-455e-afd5-4a81e6189eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 402753}, \'multiverseid\': 402753}, {\'name\': \'Opresión demoníaca\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-5 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Quizás te reconforte saber que no estarás aquí para presenciar la caída de Zendikar".—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c64e5a-ad0b-428b-819d-bbe18ba55d56\', \'multiverseId\': 404846}, \'multiverseid\': 404846}, {\'name\': \'Emprise du démon\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -5/-5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Si cela peut te consoler, sache que tu n\'assisteras pas à la chute de Zendikar. »—Ob Nixilis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403052&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df2814d3-3dfe-42eb-abc1-da50e2bf1eff\', \'multiverseId\': 403052}, \'multiverseid\': 403052}, {\'name\': \'Presa del Demone\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-5 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Trova perlomeno conforto nella consapevolezza che non assisterai alla rovina di Zendikar."—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d91079-44f5-49ef-9aac-fd526b61e1be\', \'multiverseId\': 403351}, \'multiverseid\': 403351}, {\'name\': \'悪魔のわしづかみ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－５/－５の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーが終焉を迎えるとき、お前はもうこの世にいない。それをせめてもの慰めとするがいい。」――オブ・ニクシリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a50960-1a72-48ce-bd0c-3c80de29685f\', \'multiverseId\': 403650}, \'multiverseid\': 403650}, {\'name\': \'악마의 움켜쥠\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -5/-5를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"젠디카르가 멸망하는 모습을 살아서 보지 못하는 걸 위안으로 삼거라."—오브 닉실리스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7761b9-348d-493c-9303-2e75e0b32b07\', \'multiverseId\': 403949}, \'multiverseid\': 403949}, {\'name\': \'Garras do Demônio\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -5/-5 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Console-se com a ideia de que você não vai estar aqui para testemunhar o fim de Zendikar."— Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3840a3-8513-4659-89cd-ec6ef42ec420\', \'multiverseId\': 404248}, \'multiverseid\': 404248}, {\'name\': \'Хватка Демона\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -5/-5 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Можешь утешаться тем, что тебе не придется наблюдать за гибелью Зендикара».— Об-Никсилис\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c0b1f9-96d5-4433-9d65-7b500da8ff84\', \'multiverseId\': 404547}, \'multiverseid\': 404547}, {\'name\': \'恶魔之攫\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-5/-5直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你应该感到欣慰，因为你活不到见证赞迪卡灭亡的那天了。」～欧尼希兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c62b899-af13-4787-b2ed-17d51c7206c6\', \'multiverseId\': 402155}, \'multiverseid\': 402155}, {\'name\': \'惡魔之攫\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-5/-5直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你應該感到欣慰，因為你活不到見證贊迪卡滅亡的那天了。」～歐尼希茲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc1d5f5-7d64-4f43-affa-2622916a76e5\', \'multiverseId\': 402454}, \'multiverseid\': 402454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zulaport-Mordgeselle\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Zulaport-Mordgeselle oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Eldrazi? Ha! Versuch mal, nachts mit vollen Taschen durch Zulaport zu laufen. Das ist gefährlich!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6394a929-9f4a-4477-b358-e6a373033580\', \'multiverseId\': 402998}, \'multiverseid\': 402998}, {\'name\': \'Degollador de Zulaport\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Degollador de Zulaport u otra criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Eldrazi? ¡Ja! Prueba a caminar por Zulaport de noche con los bolsillos llenos. Eso sí es peligroso".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88565a3-6bd7-48c4-b044-a7e20bbce5bf\', \'multiverseId\': 405091}, \'multiverseid\': 405091}, {\'name\': \'Surineur de Zulaport\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Surineur de Zulaport ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Les Eldrazi ? Quelle blague ! Essayez donc de traverser Zulaport de nuit avec les poches pleines. Ça c\'est dangereux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403297&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bd44584-f050-4676-839b-789cb5b8f097\', \'multiverseId\': 403297}, \'multiverseid\': 403297}, {\'name\': \'Tagliagole di Zulaport\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Tagliagole di Zulaport o un\'altra creatura che controlli muoiono, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Eldrazi? Ah! Prova a camminare di notte per Zulaport con le tasche piene. Ecco, quello è pericoloso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c342e99-eb8b-4c55-a7c9-c145703c0996\', \'multiverseId\': 403596}, \'multiverseid\': 403596}, {\'name\': \'ズーラポートの殺し屋\', \'text\': \'ズーラポートの殺し屋かあなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「エルドラージ？どうってことねぇな。ポケット膨らまして夜中のズーラポートを歩いてみな。それが身の危険さ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ccc4472-48ac-4b96-be5a-a9d443af2c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 403895}, \'multiverseid\': 403895}, {\'name\': \'줄라포트 살인귀\', \'text\': \'줄라포트 살인귀나 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적 동맹\', \'flavor\': \'"엘드라지? 웃기는군! 지갑을 두둑이 채우고 한밤중에 줄라포트를 지나가 보라구. 그런 게 위험한 거지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'890b5549-e2b5-470b-8c96-776fbc52ba2e\', \'multiverseId\': 404194}, \'multiverseid\': 404194}, {\'name\': \'Degolador de Zulaport\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Degolador de Zulaport ou outra criatura que você controla morre, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eldrazi? Que nada! Tente andar por Zulaport à noite com os bolsos cheios. Isso sim é perigoso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5873c0-90f4-47f0-bd67-3b35d049e86d\', \'multiverseId\': 404493}, \'multiverseid\': 404493}, {\'name\': \'Головорез из Зулапорта\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Головорез из Зулапорта или другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Эльдрази? Ха! Попробуй прогуляться вечером по Зулапорту с полными карманами. Вот это — настоящая опасность».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba8c3432-8980-41b6-8a74-e6c9784206e3\', \'multiverseId\': 404792}, \'multiverseid\': 404792}, {\'name\': \'筑拉波割喉客\', \'text\': \'每当筑拉波割喉客或另一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「奥札奇？呵呵！不妨腰缠万贯时在夜晚来筑拉波走一遭。这才叫危险。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f98b2ff-4f18-46bf-9aa8-16cbb49eb96d\', \'multiverseId\': 402400}, \'multiverseid\': 402400}, {\'name\': \'筑拉波割喉客\', \'text\': \'每當筑拉波割喉客或另一個由你操控的生物死去時，每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「奧札奇？呵呵！不妨腰纏萬貫時在夜晚來筑拉波走一遭。這才叫危險。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73c273c-22b8-48a8-a30f-ccd0a907aa54\', \'multiverseId\': 402699}, \'multiverseid\': 402699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zunderwald-Lichtung\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R} oder {G}.)Die Zunderwald-Lichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht zwei oder mehr Standardländer kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land — Gebirge, Wald\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem vulkanischen Kontinent Akoum ragen bizarre Gewächse, Gasschlote und zerklüftete Berggipfel hoch in die Lüfte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402738&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a1f6c8-8b3c-4f78-80fd-70264262b015\', \'multiverseId\': 402738}, \'multiverseid\': 402738}, {\'name\': \'Claro de ceniza\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {R} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.)El Claro de ceniza entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Montaña bosque\', \'flavor\': \'En el continente volcánico de Akoum hay fumarolas con extrañas parcelas de hierba en torno a ellas, y las cumbres escarpadas de las montañas se alzan muy alto en el cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04b400d-123a-4308-95a4-d5f8f40c30cd\', \'multiverseId\': 404831}, \'multiverseid\': 404831}, {\'name\': \'Clairière de scories\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G} à votre réserve.)La Clairière de scories arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : montagne et forêt\', \'flavor\': "Sur le continent volcanique d\'Akoum, d\'étranges végétaux s\'amassent autour des fissures de gaz et les pics irréguliers de la montagne se dressent haut dans le ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403037&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf2a348-c432-46e4-999b-de4666db0db2\', \'multiverseId\': 403037}, \'multiverseid\': 403037}, {\'name\': \'Radura delle Braci\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.)La Radura delle Braci entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Montagna Foresta\', \'flavor\': "Nel continente vulcanico di Akoum, la bizzarra vegetazione si ammassa attorno agli sfiatatoi di gas, mentre frastagliati picchi montuosi s\'innalzano verso il cielo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c373f9b1-d01e-4ead-b760-7d20c76fbb58\', \'multiverseId\': 403336}, \'multiverseid\': 403336}, {\'name\': \'燃えがらの林間地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}を加える。）あなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燃えがらの林間地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 山・森\', \'flavor\': \'火山の大陸アクームでは、噴気孔の周囲に奇妙な植生が見られる。空高くギザギザの山頂もそびえている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d10de1d-f3cb-4a58-b8e7-cc6cefc763b0\', \'multiverseId\': 403635}, \'multiverseid\': 403635}, {\'name\': \'잿더미 숲\', \'text\': \'({T}: {R} 또는 {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)잿더미 숲은 당신이 다른 기본 대지를 두 개 이상 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 산 숲\', \'flavor\': \'화산 대륙 아쿰에는 기이한 수풀이 가스 분출구 주변에 떼지어 있고, 삐죽삐죽한 산 봉우리가 하늘 높이 치솟아 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e48bfb9-8105-411a-b638-a08a3e1b4795\', \'multiverseId\': 403934}, \'multiverseid\': 403934}, {\'name\': \'Clareira das Cinzas\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {R} ou {G} à sua reserva de mana.)Clareira das Cinzas entra no campo de batalha virada a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Montanha Floresta\', \'flavor\': \'No continente vulcânico de Akoum, uma vegetação bizarra se aglomera em torno de fissuras gasosas, enquanto os picos escarpados das monhtanhas flutuam nos céus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98e04ebe-914d-4f2b-a5bb-f9937a53aa70\', \'multiverseId\': 404233}, \'multiverseid\': 404233}, {\'name\': \'Тлеющая Поляна\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {R} или {G} в ваше хранилище маны.)Тлеющая Поляна выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Гора Лес\', \'flavor\': \'На вулканическом континенте Акум причудливые растения окружают газовые гейзеры, а изломанные горные пики поднимаются высоко в небо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b8e4679-33ef-4e57-9c12-a172dd8c3ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 404532}, \'multiverseid\': 404532}, {\'name\': \'烬火林地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{R}或{G}到你的法术力池中。）除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则烬火林地须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地～山脉／树林\', \'flavor\': \'阿库姆火山大陆上，奇异草木簇生喷气裂口，嶙峋尖峰直伸天际云霄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e493f44-869d-42db-ab01-bf4ddc124bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 402140}, \'multiverseid\': 402140}, {\'name\': \'燼火林地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{R}或{G}到你的魔法力池中。）除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則燼火林地須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'地～山脈／樹林\', \'flavor\': \'阿庫姆火山大陸上，奇異草木簇生噴氣裂口，嶙峋尖峰直伸天際雲霄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96d1c8c-4a89-44c5-a05e-e320bf8417f7\', \'multiverseId\': 402439}, \'multiverseid\': 402439}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwilling der Verwüstung\', \'text\': \'Wenn du den Zwilling der Verwüstung wirkst, bringe einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit präziser Koordination und unter hohen Verlusten kann man einen vertreiben, vielleicht sogar zu Fall bringen. Aber zwei … Der Blutzoll wäre unermesslich."—Munda, Guerillaführer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402754&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c67349-ac29-4be8-a5c8-de4e13dbe3ab\', \'multiverseId\': 402754}, \'multiverseid\': 402754}, {\'name\': \'Gemelo de la desolación\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances el Gemelo de la desolación, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolora 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Con una coordinación precisa y la suficiente sangre derramada, es posible rechazar a un enemigo o incluso abatirlo. Pero a dos... Eso es mucha sangre".—Munda, líder de la emboscada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa85b184-9318-4117-bd8b-d22b5cc32867\', \'multiverseId\': 404847}, \'multiverseid\': 404847}, {\'name\': \'Jumeau de désolation\', \'text\': \'Quand vous lancez le Jumeau de désolation, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« Coordination et sacrifice permettent d\'en chasser un, peut-être même de le tuer. Mais deux... c\'est un lourd sacrifice. »—Munda, chef d\'embuscade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403053&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093eef6e-407a-46c1-a8a4-ce39dfd53c33\', \'multiverseId\': 403053}, \'multiverseid\': 403053}, {\'name\': \'Gemello della Desolazione\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci il Gemello della Desolazione, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Eldrazi 10/10 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Con precisa coordinazione e un adeguato dispendio di sangue, uno può essere respinto, forse anche abbattuto. Ma per due... occorre molto sangue."—Munda, capo dell\\\'agguato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f455e6-47fb-40d6-9ae3-d8f7ca12e92f\', \'multiverseId\': 403352}, \'multiverseid\': 403352}, {\'name\': \'荒廃の双子\', \'text\': \'あなたが荒廃の双子を唱えたとき、無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「巧みに連係し、ある程度の犠牲を覚悟すれば、エルドラージを撃退し、場合によっては１体を討ち破ることもできる。だがそれが２体同時となると……甚大な犠牲が出るだろう。」――待ち伏せ隊長、ムンダ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca3b99af-9c26-4409-9843-15ab0485a68c\', \'multiverseId\': 403651}, \'multiverseid\': 403651}, {\'name\': \'황폐한 쌍둥이\', \'text\': \'황폐한 쌍둥이를 발동할 때, 10/10 무색 엘드라지 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지\', \'flavor\': \'"정확한 협동과 충분한 목숨만 있다면, 한 놈은 쫓아 낼 수 있어. 어쩌면 쓰러뜨릴 수 있을 지도 몰라. 하지만 두 놈이라면 . . . 훨씬 더 많은 피가 흐를 거야."—매복조 대장 문다\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f57cd77-4189-43a8-88c6-34099d5b9fba\', \'multiverseId\': 403950}, \'multiverseid\': 403950}, {\'name\': \'Gêmeo da Desolação\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjurar Gêmeo da Desolação, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura incolor 10/10 do tipo Eldrazi.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Com uma coordenação precisa e sangue suficiente derramado, é possível rechaçar ou até derrubar um. Mas dois... é muito sangue."— Munda, líder de emboscadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1127fd7-40bc-4051-8368-a83e279fd9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 404249}, \'multiverseid\': 404249}, {\'name\': \'Близнец-Разоритель\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете Близнеца-Разорителя, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 10/10 бесцветный Эльдрази.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«Действуя точно и пролив немало крови, одного такого можно отогнать или даже убить. Но двоих... крови будет много».— Мунда, командир засады\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e667a2f-442f-4764-aaa8-0dc1b0542928\', \'multiverseId\': 404548}, \'multiverseid\': 404548}, {\'name\': \'荒芜双身\', \'text\': \'当你施放荒芜双身时，将一个10/10无色奥札奇衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「只要配合默契、不惜流血，我们就能击退，甚至击倒一个。但是两个的话……那得流不少血了。」～伏击领袖蒙达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a5e00d-7fef-4cc9-a0f3-5704a0b35009\', \'multiverseId\': 402156}, \'multiverseid\': 402156}, {\'name\': \'荒蕪雙身\', \'text\': \'當你施放荒蕪雙身時，將一個10/10無色奧札奇衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「只要配合默契、不惜流血，我們就能擊退，甚至擊倒一個。但是兩個的話……那得流不少血了。」～伏擊領袖蒙達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8cbc792-04ac-4967-9a4a-8052babf485f\', \'multiverseId\': 402455}, \'multiverseid\': 402455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ödnis-Würger\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)Wenn der Ödnis-Würger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers legen. Falls du dies tust, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e57418ae-325c-495b-bb49-b4b42db3ecfa\', \'multiverseId\': 402993}, \'multiverseid\': 402993}, {\'name\': \'Estrangulador del yermo\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)Cuando el Estrangulador del yermo entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el cementerio de un oponente una carta del exilio de la que ese jugador sea propietario. Si lo haces, la criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=405086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f969dd-8425-4824-a303-618afdecc568\', \'multiverseId\': 405086}, \'multiverseid\': 405086}, {\'name\': \'Étrangleur des terres dévastées\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)Quand l\'Étrangleur des terres dévastées arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil. Si vous faites ainsi, une créature ciblée gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403292&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd78799-35fd-4ff5-9656-7be01925a330\', \'multiverseId\': 403292}, \'multiverseid\': 403292}, {\'name\': \'Strangolatore delle Lande Desolate\', \'text\': "Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)Quando lo Strangolatore delle Lande Desolate entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta posseduta da un avversario dall\'esilio nel cimitero di quel giocatore. Se lo fai, una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Metabolizzatore Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80aa1ef5-b4da-4751-b8a6-b032424aa93e\', \'multiverseId\': 403591}, \'multiverseid\': 403591}, {\'name\': \'不毛の地の絞殺者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）不毛の地の絞殺者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーであるカードを１枚そのプレイヤーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=403890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7640c276-e347-4cfa-a94f-947725f6f908\', \'multiverseId\': 403890}, \'multiverseid\': 403890}, {\'name\': \'황무지 교살자\', \'text\': \'결여 (이 카드는 무색이다.)황무지 교살자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 추방 영역에서 상대가 소유한 카드 한 장을 그 플레이어의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -3/-3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘드라지 처리자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c0b35c-22db-427e-a5e6-285686d4fb7b\', \'multiverseId\': 404189}, \'multiverseid\': 404189}, {\'name\': \'Estrangulador dos Ermos\', \'text\': \'Desprovido (Este card não tem cor.)Quando Estrangulador dos Ermos entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card exilado de um oponente no cemitério dele. Se fizer isso, a criatura alvo receberá -3/-3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi Processador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252db082-d946-4a90-9e74-c593d14bdb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 404488}, \'multiverseid\': 404488}, {\'name\': \'Удавитель из Пустошей\', \'text\': \'Лишение (У этой карты нет цвета.)Когда Удавитель из Пустошей выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить принадлежащую оппоненту карту из изгнания на кладбище того игрока. Если вы это делаете, целевое существо получает -3/-3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Переработчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=404787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b32fc0-bbf1-4453-bd4c-53adb69fd58d\', \'multiverseId\': 404787}, \'multiverseid\': 404787}, {\'name\': \'荒原绞杀体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）当荒原绞杀体进战场时，你可以将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场。若你如此作，则目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ef6afc-230e-4339-ba77-63bf3ff592c3\', \'multiverseId\': 402395}, \'multiverseid\': 402395}, {\'name\': \'荒原絞殺體\', \'text\': \'虛色（此牌沒有顏色。）當荒原絞殺體進戰場時，你可以將一張由對手擁有的牌從放逐區置入該玩家的墳墓場。若你如此作，則目標生物得-3/-3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～奧札奇／噬體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=402694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0c7242-c396-4784-aa33-a90809a3bdb0\', \'multiverseId\': 402694}, \'multiverseid\': 402694}]']
